INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(14, '[ARUN KUMAR] Food is very Good. location is residential and good. Nearer to all locations like gyms, metro, but stop, restaurants etc... I have been staying here for the last 8 months u0026 I truly enjoyed staying in this M R PG for gents.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.854416', 5, 13, 4),
(15, '[Cod Player] The ground floor is awesome if you love sleeping with giant rats running around your room.nnThe parking area frequently becomes overcrowded, making it difficult to find a spot.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.857543', 2, 13, 4),
(16, U&'[Aman Tiwari] I have been there for more than 6months in bangalore and PG. The Owner Mr. Manoj is Amazing and a gentle person I ever met. Second the food quality is excellent and maintains Hygiene. Posh environment, Quality peoples. Over all if you are looking for PG in Indranagar So no other option is going to be better than  M R gents PG. \2665\fe0f Thankyou so much Mr. Manoj for your valuable services.\+01f490\+01f490', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.85986', 5, 13, 4),
(17, '[Kaushik m s] The best or one of the best PG accommodation for gents in and around indiranagar. I''ve stayed there for around 5 months , the food is good as far as PG accommodation food goes , and they clean your room atleast one time a week . PG owner is also a nice guy , he listens to the problem in pg and fixed it as soon as possible.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.864112', 5, 13, 4),
(18, '[VAISHNAV ASHOK] Stayed here recently, from September 22 to october 31st. The pg was very excellent , good food. Main attraction was the cleanliness while cooking they  literally wont wear footwears. One drawback for me was there is no lunch, available only on Saturday and Sunday. It works on working days but if there is holiday in between the working days, food was not available.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.866742', 5, 13, 4),
(19, '[Abhijith (Ab)] An average working men''s PG near to Indiranagar metro. Comparing to other PGs in this area, food is not bad at all.nWhoever looking near Indiranagar,I''m recommending this as it''s a decent one with necessary amenities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.867879', 4, 13, 4),
(20, U&'[Laxmikant Pai] Very nice PG. Tasty home made food, neat and clean room with hot water, TV, WiFi, Washing machine and housekeeping services. MR PG is near to Indiranagar Metro station. Price also reasonable u0026 value for money. Owner Mr Manoj Reddy is very nice, friendly person u0026 his staff also cool \+01f60e people. Surely all we are comfortable here in this PG, compare to anywhere nearby others. Good time..with good people..\+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.868817', 5, 13, 4),
(21, '[Hari Hara Sudhan] Best PG to stay in Indiranagar. PG owner Manoj anna is very professional and helpful. Maintenance of the property is good. Food is the best here. Highly recommended. 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 sharing available.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.869658', 5, 13, 4),
(22, '[Surfarase Ahamed] Stayed here for a year, and had a really wonderful time. Met some amazing people and made few friends as well. Caretaker maintains the PG very hygienic with regular cleaning and decent food compared to other PGs. They are responsive with queries. Definitely not a luxury PG, but worth staying here. A great find in Indiranagar locality.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.889109', 5, 14, 4),
(23, '[Dev Singh] I came for one month in Bangalore and stayed for one month. Here is my honest review for the Bhavna pg.nnExcellent PG with hygienic rooms, tasty food, proper cleanliness, and good security. The location is convenient, and the management is polite and responsive. One of the best PGs in the area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.889707', 5, 14, 4),
(24, '[Vignesh Ravichandran] Stayed here for a decent amount of time. Rooms are clean, food is consistent, and basic facilities work as promised. Owner/manager is responsive and issues get resolved without drama. Not luxury, but reliable and peaceful. Worth the rent.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.890794', 5, 14, 4),
(25, '[Devindramma Nachawar] New pg friendly owner nice food owner will see like he''s own person food will be north and sorth', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.892066', 5, 14, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(26, '[Amresh Gulbarga] Good pg owner will be friendly room will be good food will be good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.89281', 5, 14, 4),
(27, '[Pratham Bhat] Good pg. Regularly cleaned. Good food. Polite owner', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.89385', 5, 14, 4),
(28, '[Kartikeya Verma] Worst pg in the worst pg and bad food.nThere are better options available', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.894815', 1, 14, 4),
(29, '[Sriharan V S (Shree)] Very good place to stay and food to too good compare with other pgs', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.895415', 5, 14, 4),
(30, '[Balu teja Parisigani] Good accommodation with clean rooms, good food, and supportive management. Had a pleasant stay. Recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.918162', 5, 15, 4),
(31, '[Doppalapudi Sai Pavan] Very good pg near Indiranagar to stay .nI am happy to stay there and sharing this review.nRooms Good ,and food feels like Good ,Tasty, and delicious, Break Fast, Lunch Box(Extra charge (30rupies)), and dinner.nMain thing subesh anna soo friendly, Thanks anna.nReasonable price.nnDon''t compare this PG tonother pg''s and the other owners.nother PG''s are not suitable to compare this PG.nnnote: if u feel any inconvenience u must and should inform owner, with out informing if u blame him, that is not good character. first u need to change u r mind set.nnthis is not fack review. this is genuine.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.91886', 5, 15, 4),
(32, '[Vinay a hadimani] Pg is good well maintained, the food here is excellent. All facilities like WiFi, washing machine hot water and water purifier is installed, Cleaning is also done alternate days. Its 250 mts from metro station and bus stop is also nearby. Owner is very helping and friendly. I would definitely recommend this pg who is looking/ planning to stay in Indiranagar.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.919324', 5, 15, 4),
(33, '[Prithivi Raj G] Very good pg to stay in Indranagar. Rooms and foods feels like home. Main thing subesh anna soo friendly, most of pg owners won''t be this much open type and friendly. PG foods are like home food both south and north available. Rooms will be clean and amenities of wifi, washing machine, etc available.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.919736', 5, 15, 4),
(34, '[Omar Noor] Very affordable. Great location. Great connectivity. Good food. Very good pg owner. Good ambience. Will recommend this PG to anyone wanting to live in Indiranagar.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.920538', 5, 15, 4),
(35, U&'[moosa sajid] The best PG i have ever been in Bangalore. Good food, good service, good rooms, good management and goes on. Sudhesh chetan Is very helpful, cooperative, and very humble. The best\+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.92136', 5, 15, 4),
(36, '[Anurag Gaurav] Very nice experience as I have been there for 6 months ...very good food with north and south indian style ..as owner sudesh sir is very friendly and listen to everyone problem ...must stay there ...', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.922096', 5, 15, 4),
(37, '[Eishan Mishra] Amazing food, great rooms and extremely affordable. And the caretaker is a gem of a guy.nn10/10, will recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.922722', 5, 15, 4),
(38, '[AchieverCoach Media] Clean and well-maintained place with rooms that get plenty of natural sunlight, making the environment bright and refreshing. The beds are comfortable, and the building being new adds to the overall neat and fresh feel.nnThe staff is friendly, helpful, and ensures rooms are cleaned every alternate day. Fast Wi-Fi and spacious rooms with hall areas are major highlights, nothing feels cramped or cave-like as in many other PGs.nnThe residents are professional and create a positive vibe, and the food is noticeably better compared to other PG options.nnOverall, a highly recommended experience!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.951075', 5, 16, 4),
(39, '[Manoj Pokhriyal] One of the best place to live. Feels like staying at home. Neat and clean living room with shared accomodation and individual rooms too. Clean wash rooms with hot and cold water facilities. Best breakfast followed with dinner. Newly ultra modern gym on sixth floor with lift facilities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.951844', 5, 16, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(40, '[Santosh Dhami] Good pg near indiranagar surroundings .....well maintenance ....good food', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.952372', 5, 16, 4),
(41, '[Joilin SM] Its a great PG for bachelor. The manager and the staffs are polite and the food is good. The maintenance is top notch.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.952864', 5, 16, 4),
(42, U&'[Vishal Surya] The PG is clean, comfortable, and well-maintained. The staff is helpful, the environment is peaceful, and all basic facilities like Wi-Fi and housekeeping are reliable. It\2019s a good place for working men and students looking for a safe and convenient stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.953359', 5, 16, 4),
(43, '[Avronil Basu] Well maintained pg near Domluru ...it''s near To EGL ...Food was good ...nearby Grocery shop available and one minute from main road distance...cleaning also good neat and clean ...recommended for professionals', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.953802', 5, 16, 4),
(44, '[Marc Spectre] The manager asks tenants to post 5 star rating after moving into the PG and keeps bugging them until they do.nSubstandard PG with overpriced rent. Barely eatable food and cleaning done once a week. Also they''ll keep your entire deposit amount and harass you when you leave. Save yourself the trouble and find a better place to live', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.954273', 1, 16, 4),
(45, '[Madhav Choudhary] Nice a good environment pg here near metro . Hygiene cleanliness maintainance. Supporting staffs . Must check out.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.954778', 5, 16, 4),
(46, '[bavisetti pavan kalyan] Staying here has been a great experience! It''s an affordable PG in a perfect location near the metro station. The owner is very supportive and available 24/7 to help with any concerns.nHighly recommended for anyone looking for a budget-friendly and convenient stay and healthy food.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.977867', 4, 17, 4),
(47, '[MANIKANDAN B] Stayed here for 4 months. I regret for that. Dont waste your time here. Worst PG ever. People are money minded. You will get to know about the behaviour of the owner in the reply of this review itself. Perspective of looking at you will change after you join here. So disgusting. Everywhere in the PG will look like the pictures shared. It is a small sample, even worser than this also there. Also nearby people never respects you. They throw your clothes when you dry in the terrace. Disciplinary issues with everyone. Avoid this place completely.nNo proper response. Once food is over, no one will care about you. Unhealthy rooms with enormous amount of dust and extremely suffocating. You will die in choking. Better go with other good options. There are other good PGs available in the same area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.978432', 1, 17, 4),
(48, '[anil reddy] Excellent PG with clean rooms, good maintenance, and a safe environment. The owner is friendly and responsive. Highly recommended for students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.978978', 5, 17, 4),
(49, '[basavaraj sajjan] Good pg for men''s.. good food.. friendly owner...near to metro station', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.979492', 5, 17, 4),
(50, U&'[Ram Mohan] Andhra-style food is good. The owners give us the freedom to cook by ourselves. The rooms are also good. The food menu is very good.\201d \+01f35b\+01f3e0\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.980119', 5, 17, 4),
(51, '[vasu dhevan] Near the metro station, very convenient location.nNice food with good ambiance, feels comfortable like home.nThe owner is a very kind and helpful person', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.980693', 5, 17, 4),
(52, '[HEART OF OCEAN] Good experience with this pg.....Home feel ....I recommend to all come and visit once.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.981224', 5, 17, 4),
(53, U&'[SHARU KHAN] The stay is comfortable, clean, and peaceful.nHappy with the room and servicenGood maintenance, friendly staff, and safe environment.nnThank you \2665\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:04.982031', 5, 17, 4),
(54, '[Goutham Choppari] Average PG. Worst food taste. Owner is money minded. No proper maintenance. Monday to Friday no lunch. Won''t recommend this hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.000738', 2, 18, 4);     
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(55, '[Dad Devil] One of the worst existing PGs in Indira nagar.nNot worth it''s money.nNo maintenance, No proper action if there is some issue.nRude behaviour towards tenants.nBad food. Experimenting on people who stays. Uneventful raise of rents.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.001343', 1, 18, 4),
(56, '[Vadiraj Revankar] Good place to stay, good pg , good maintenance and quality it''s very near to metro station', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.001819', 4, 18, 4),
(57, '[Rahul Sharma] Good Place to stay and taste of the food is decent. Near by Indiranagar Metro Station', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.002355', 4, 18, 4),
(58, '[New yutub] Very bad pg to stay.nAnd the nasty owners who don''t even bother about any issues within.nThe food is ultimately the worst where u can''t even feed animals.nNo return of advance amount.nNot clean. No proper maintenance.nRaise in rent whenever they wished for.nNo beds are worth to sleep.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.002739', 1, 18, 4),
(59, U&'[Gaurav] All of pg is well maintained\2026 and owner is very good in nature', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.003124', 5, 18, 4),
(60, '[Supritha Murugesh] Near indiranagar best pg ,I mostly recommend to all ,homely food,', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.003623', 5, 18, 4),
(61, '[Madhu Sudhan] Nice pg nice food', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.004019', 5, 18, 4),
(62, '[Sumanta Sen] Excellent PG with clean and well-maintained rooms. The food quality is good, and the staff is friendly and helpful. The location is convenient with easy access to transportation, markets, and essential services. Security is well managed, and the overall environment is peaceful and comfortable. A great place for working professionals. Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.048456', 5, 20, 4),
(63, U&'[Konda Manoj] Very good PG!nI stayed here for almost a year \2014 the experience was excellent. The owner is very friendly and always helpful. The rooms are well-maintained, and the food feels just like home. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.048954', 5, 20, 4),
(64, '[suresh reddy ch] I had a very good experience staying in this PG. The rooms were clean, well-maintained, and comfortable. Facilities like water, electricity, and WiFi were reliable, and the overall environment felt safe and peaceful.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.049472', 5, 20, 4),
(65, '[Manas Phadol] Affordable and commute friendly pg. Decent food and good facilities. Pg owner( Mahendra) is also co-operative and chill.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.050071', 5, 20, 4),
(66, '[rohan sharma] When we ask about it, the PG owner behaves very rudely instead of solving the issue. It feels unfair because we are paying full rent, but proper food is not provided on time.nnCould you look into this matter? PG owners should ensure that food is available for everyone within the scheduled time and treat residents respectfully.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.051251', 1, 20, 4),
(67, U&'[G\00e4\00f1\00easH Konidena] MLN PG for Gents is not only well-maintained but also ideally located. It\2019s conveniently close to both the metro station and bus stop, making daily commutes incredibly easy and hassle-free. The proximity to public transport adds great value for working professionals and students. Along with excellent food, cleanliness, and safety, the location is another big reason I highly recommend MLN PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.051987', 5, 20, 4),
(68, '[anjaneyulu peram] I had a positive experience and would recommend MLN PG FOR GENTS, especially professionals or students looking for a well-located, safe, and relatively hassle-free accommodation. The food served here is decent food variety and more attention to housekeeping would make it a perfect option.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.05264', 5, 20, 4),
(69, U&'[Manideep Nalamala121] From the day I''m joined this hostel I''m not missing my home weather it''s a nice place to leave and the food is very much close when  compare to the home food , it is very tasty and absolute Great to eat . Coming to the room maintaince our rooms are very clean, regular sweeping the floors and cleaning them with hygienic liquids no issues on cleanliness here . Also we have WiFi available here and washing machine to clean our clothes neatly, We''re gaining high list of facilities here it''s happy to live here thank you. \+01fac2\2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.053089', 5, 20, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(70, U&'[Samaresh Bagchi] It''s a good pg for gent''s. Morning break fast and evening dinner is available Sunday Lunch is also available. They take monthly subscription \20b99500/-. Nearer to IndiraNagar metro station. Calm and quite atmosphere. Good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.07281', 4, 21, 4),
(71, '[Shankar K] Best food compared to other PG around MG road, domluru, indranagar..nRegular cleaning... #Newbuilding ...optimum price....', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.073222', 5, 21, 4),
(72, U&'[Anshu Kumar] Not So Good, Better find some other PG,nVery problematic, TV was not in my room and when I asked for it owner said extra 500 in my rent. Greedy and also one thing I came to know that all this 1 Star \2b50 review reveals all the truth of this PG, like I have also faced the same problem which is mentioned by all this people''s, Main reason is that there is no PG nearby only this. Due to which they don''t have competition that''s why they don''t bother about there guests there problems, Better to search some other PG, and also he will argue and defend himself by replying on all bad reviews,thinks himself is the right and we are wrong, close this pg when you are not able to digest your truth', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.073589', 1, 21, 4),
(73, '[Arya Pathak] Very cramped, not at all hygienic. Overall area is very deep inside and feels unsafe. Rooms have almost no space at all. Washrooms were also often clogged and disgusting to use. Deposit amount previously agreed upon wasn''t refunded. Food is unhygienic and plates. Often come across dead rats and pigeons in the locality. Clothes came out from the washing machine with dust and dirt stuck on them, and no place to dry them. Overall very very uncomfortable experience, would not recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.074044', 1, 21, 4),
(74, U&'[PR\00d8F\0112SS\00d8R] Worst PG, Owner and his wife will interfere in your room everytime without any reason they will knock your and room no privacy, Food gets over very fast less amount of food cooked , No lift ,In rainy season water will come inside your room, no parking, Owner does no any language other than telgu,I found very hard to communicate with owner and complaint against the things, Entire PG has only one washing machine, Basic amenities like RO is fitted on ground floor, If you are living on 3-4th floor you will be exhausted in filling water, I stayed there for 6 Month, Conjusted PG, I went there by seeing images on Google map, don''t follow the same mistake. Better search another PG, Also he didn''t return my Security.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.074474', 1, 21, 4),
(75, '[Midhlaj] The owners behavior is very bad you can see him telling that he had paid the deposit in the review comment. But I haven''t received any Paid 3k and I told I month prior even though he told you didn''t informed and kick me out with zero deposit. And he''s telling the fake thing about my freinds number and receipt. Of the payment the only number I gave him was mine only mine. Very bad behavior. Beware guy''s.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.074938', 1, 21, 4),
(76, '[Mayur Suryawanshi] Do not lie point number one.. I surveyed the area that you have mentioned it was a dead end i checked all the guys who are living there and there is a cloud kitchen and not a pg.. Second of all why there is a number mentioned on your business listing and not the number that you have given now. Third of all why have you not updated your number on your listing. You have already deleted my comments but not have an audacity to do a proper conversation.. Without me giving up my details.. I will not do so.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.075334', 1, 21, 4),
(77, '[Adesh P.] PG owner especially Mr. Dinesh is extremely commercial guy. The service that they give is not the Worth of what we pay. I could have wrote everything in detail here but it''s so much to write. I just don''t recommend this pg!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.075668', 2, 21, 4),
(78, '[praveen n] 100% fraud and cheating!! The warden didn''t return my advance amount even after 20 days i left the pg. I trusted his words, vacated my room and came back to native. He promised me he will pay but didn''t.nI paid 2 months rent + 3k advance, also informed 15 days before that i am leaving. Don''t cheat the customers like this.nNever ever go to this hell..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.106739', 1, 23, 4);  
