(86, '[balmukund pandey] I''m really happy with my stay at this PG. The food is tasty and well-prepared, everything is kept completely clean, and the environment is peaceful with no disturbances. All the services that were promised have been provided without any issues. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a comfortable and hassle-free stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.12167', 5, 24, 4),
(87, '[Pokuri Nagaraju] I am staing nearly 2 months in this pg homely atmosphere , food also very good it''s new building', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.122006', 5, 24, 4),
(88, '[vasudevareddy donthireddy] Very nice maintenance food is goodnNew building I am staying 3 month''s', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.122372', 5, 24, 4),
(89, U&'[Vaishnav p k] I\2019ve been staying here for a while, and my experience has been excellent. If you\2019re looking for a peaceful, hygienic, and homely environment, this place is definitely worth considering.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.1227', 5, 24, 4),
