(92, '[Anil Kumar] Finest PG in the Indiranagar area, offering excellent food along with the best conduct from the PG owner.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.123891', 5, 24, 4),
(93, '[Prudhvi Krishna Reddy] Food is good maintenance and homely atmosphere Owen is Fridays time', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.124235', 5, 24, 4),
(94, U&'[Shreya Bhuvanesh] PG is well maintained, clean rooms, homely food, and owners are very cooperative. One of the safest PG I\2019ve stayed in and there is proper security with CCTV. Perfect for someone looking for quite and clean place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.175059', 5, 27, 4),
(95, '[sandhya varma] Very nice place and friendly nature and owners also will be near to us only if any emergency happen as per the food is very tasty and higenic.all at this points it''s a nice pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.17555', 5, 27, 4),
(96, '[Abhi Sathvika Reddy Kambham] Everything was great,One of the best PG I''ve ever stayed at. Immaculately clean and very comfortable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.175868', 5, 27, 4),
(97, '[Yakulla Sushma] Cleanliness,higenic environment,good security', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.176244', 5, 27, 4),
(98, '[sowjanya korada] Well maintained', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.176692', 5, 27, 4),
(99, '[Eduru. Usha Usha] Good pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.177125', 5, 27, 4),
