INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(118, '[Gagan Dodia] Good affordable pg, nice and comfortable stay. Location nice - near to the metro. Owner good and understanding', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.240877', 5, 30, 4),
(119, '[Sai krishna] Cozy pg nice and hygienic food near to metro overall everything is super', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.241755', 4, 30, 4),
(120, '[Bharatlal Bairwa] Very very nice service food is good.every day clean that room also', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.244018', 5, 30, 4),
(121, '[Sudharshan Lucky] For the past eight months, I''ve experienced consistently pleasant stays here.nnThe food is excellent, the place is well-maintained, prices are reasonable, and the owner is genuinely friendly. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.244843', 5, 30, 4),
(122, '[Manikanth Bca] One of best pg In this location', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.245427', 5, 30, 4),
(123, '[Praveen Badiger] Dear all, im Praveen Badiger from I came to blor for training session and I have stayed In Maruti PG. It''s like my home they have treatet me like brother in comes to the it''s very and digest like home food, and even washroom very clean. Thank you', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.245908', 5, 30, 4),
(124, U&'[duggireddychaitu] Food is good, I\2019m staying from 2 yearsnThere is a safety with fingerprint machine, owner is good,', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.246368', 5, 30, 4),
(125, '[Ashish Hegde] Best pg to stay. Good food. Best owner behavior', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.247439', 5, 30, 4),
(126, U&'[shreyas parab] I came to Bangalore for an internship and was looking for a PG when I found this place \2014 and honestly, it exceeded my expectations. The PG owner is one of the kindest and most caring people I\2019ve come across. They genuinely care about the well-being of the residents, regularly checking if everyone has eaten and if there are any issues. It''s rare to find such dedication and warmth, especially in a city like Bangalore where most PGs are just about business.nnThe food here is consistently good, the amenities are all well-maintained, and the environment feels safe and homely. I had heard stories of bad PG experiences in Bangalore, but this place proved that there are still people who care about creating a good living experience. Truly grateful to have found this PG \2014 it made my stay during the internship so much smoother and stress-free.nnDev :)', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.263365', 5, 31, 4),
(127, '[Amit Kulkarni] Very good PG. Owners are very friendly and helpful. Rooms are big. Especially single rooms. All facilities are provided by owners. Food is also good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.264005', 5, 31, 4),
(128, U&'[Chandra Chandramani.k] I never saw this kind of gents  pg in Bangalore. I feel like a home (\+01f3e1)nVallam anna (PG owner) is treated like a brother. \+01fac2nComing to the room is so good, clean, elegant and just looking like a wow. \270c\fe0f\2728nComing to the food is too good and testy \+01f60b\2764\fe0f\200d\+01fa79\+01f4af', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.264878', 5, 31, 4),
(129, '[Suresh Gore] It''s my first experience staying in pg at bangalore. It was an amazing atmosphere, but my 1 roommate was a disaster . Overall, all good .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.26812', 5, 31, 4),
(130, '[Darshan Naik R] Food is good here. Owner is so friendly and good in nature. They treat us as a family. Nice pg for boys in Bangalore', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.268901', 5, 31, 4),
(131, '[Sushanth M] One of the best stay . The food was prepared by the family ,Food is andhra style ,The food is tasty and quality items ,The maintanence was extrem , friendly owner.the rooms were neat and room cleaning will be there.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.269998', 5, 31, 4),
(132, '[Vallam penchalaiah Vallam penchalaiah] Very nice pg in idiranagar owner was very friendly food very. verytesty', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.270774', 5, 31, 4),
(133, '[Kiran Kumar] Nice environment and peace full place', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.271971', 5, 31, 4),
(134, '[Dileep Kumar Irla] I have been living here since 1 year and it''s very good PG with clean rooms and a peaceful environment. The owner is friendly and helpful. Food quality is good and hygiene is well maintained. Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.308049', 5, 32, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(135, U&'[karthik irla] One of the best PG I\2019ve stayed in. Clean rooms, good food quality, peaceful environment, and very supportive management. Wi-Fi, and security are excellent. Highly recommended for students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.308421', 5, 32, 4),
(136, '[Giri Bathula] Good pg to stay for mens.nFriendly prices and Nice foodnGood amenities which is near to indiranagar metro station.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.308746', 5, 32, 4),
(137, '[Kalyan Devandla] Very good PG for all mens. Food quality is good, rooms are neat, and security is also fine. Actually, the owner listens to our problems and resolves them quickly', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.309052', 5, 32, 4),
(138, '[Kishore Vemula] Excellent stay! Rooms were clean, food was great, and the Wi-Fi never drops. Management is super helpful, feels like home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.309359', 5, 32, 4),
(139, U&'[Naveen Prabha] I stayed here for a few months and honestly had a very good experience. Water, power backup, Wi-Fi \2013 everything is well maintained. So yeah, totally worth the money', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.309721', 5, 32, 4),
(140, '[Srinu Upputholla] Nice place to stay for both students and working people. Actually, food tastes like home and rooms are spacious. Overall, very satisfied', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.310282', 5, 32, 4),
(141, '[Balakrishna Orchu] Initially I was doubtful, but after joining I felt relaxed. So basically, management is good, maintenance is regular, and the surroundings are calm. Strongly recommended', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.310674', 5, 32, 4),
(142, U&'[BodyPrime Fitness] Total Lack of Safety \2013 Do Not Stay Here !nn\200bWarning to all students and professionals: Shyam PG for Gents is highly insecure. A close friend of mine has been staying here and the management has been incredibly negligent.n\200bThe facility is a hub for theft. Inside the rooms, cupboards aren''t provided with locks for months. In the parking area, fuel is regularly stolen from vehicles at night, and management refuses to take any strict action or improve security.n\200bMost shockingly, they are currently holding my friend''s property (worth \20b950k) hostage while my friend is away for their mother''s funeral, all over a minor rent delay. No empathy, no security, and no ethics. Look for a PG where your property and your dignity are respected.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.327857', 1, 33, 4),
(143, U&'[Light Yagami] I\2019ve had a really great experience staying at this PG. The food is surprisingly good, and the okra fry here is honestly the best I\2019ve ever had! The place is kept very clean with daily cleaning, which makes it feel fresh and comfortable every day. The owner is super friendly and approachable, always ready to help out with anything. Another big plus is the open kitchen, which gives a homely touch and transparency in cooking. Overall, it\2019s been a pleasant and satisfying stay\2014I\2019d definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a clean, friendly, and comfortable place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.328235', 5, 33, 4),
(144, U&'[Tirtha Raj Deori] Warning: Illegal Property Detention u0026 Security Issuesnn\200bI had a nightmare experience at Shyam PG for Gents. I have been staying here since July 19, and for five months, the management failed to provide a basic lock for my cupboard despite multiple requests. This negligence led to several of my items being stolen.n\200bRecently, I had to travel to my hometown due to my mother\2019s sudden passing. While I am grieving, the management is showing zero humanity. They are currently illegally withholding my personal belongings worth \20b950,000 over a single month''s rent of \20b98,000, which I assured them would be paid.n\200bThey are refusing to let me move my things to my sister''s house for safety, effectively holding my property hostage. This management is unprofessional, lacks basic empathy, and does not provide the security you pay for. Avoid this place at all costs if you value your belongings and peace of mind.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.328491', 1, 33, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(145, '[Sharuk Ahamed] I''ve been here for a year and it''s good place to stay and food is good when compare to other pgs with this price point!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.328898', 5, 33, 4),
(146, '[sukumar] I had a good experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean and well-maintained. Food is tasty and served on time. Wi-Fi, water, and electricity are available without any issues. The environment is peaceful and safe, and the owner is friendly and helpful. Overall, it''s a good place for students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.329144', 5, 33, 4),
(147, '[Berry Berry] Overall best pg in kornangla, well maintaince, top notch food, daily cleaning. Friendly owner.nHighly recommend this pg in kormangla.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.329377', 5, 33, 4),
(148, '[Yalamati Abhinav] Good pg food his very good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.329602', 5, 33, 4),
(149, '[Guna selvaraj] I''ve been staying on this PG for almost 6 months and I have to say, it was a great and the food was absolutely delicious and the owner was incredibly kind and welcoming.nnOverall, I highly recommend this PG. The food is fantastic and the owner is a gem. It''s the perfect place for anyone looking for a comfortable and welcoming home away from home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.329819', 5, 33, 4),
(150, U&'[vineeth reddy katkuri] It been more than an year i am staying in this PG and this is the only pg in Kormangala where I felt it provides clean and tidy environment with good food. I feel like home \+01f3e0nnOwner is very friendly and helpful.nnI would definitely recommend everyone who is looking for short  or long stay this place would be perfect.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.346247', 5, 34, 4),
(151, '[RIDHIMA SRIVASTAVA 22BCE11648] Worst experience. If there would be minus rating, i would rate that for the experience of the receptionist. Speaking to a customer like that is a till now worst experience for a pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.346841', 1, 34, 4),
(152, '[Adarsh ap] Good PG to stay .nThe owner is very kind towards the people and Room is neat.nThey clean the floor daily.nHe provided GYM , vending machines , play areas for games etc.(Next door co living space)nImprovement needed in mess Food.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.347519', 4, 34, 4),
(153, '[Hemanth Jamili] I am currently staying in this PG from last 8 months and till now i never face any issues. Rooms are well maintained by daily cleaning to ensure proper hygiene. Food is also good which has both south and north mix items. The owner is quick in resolving any issues and i am completely satisfied with the service. I definitely recommend you visit the PG, experience it and decide.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.348435', 5, 34, 4),
(154, '[pravesh vijayakumar] I have been staying in this PG for about 9 months now. And my experience so far is good, the building I''m in is well maintained. Only issue is the ventilation in the room isn''t enough but it''s not a deal breaker. The owner Indra Anna is a good person and he takes suggestions and complaints seriously so I have not faced any issues. There''s parking space in the buildings and a common kitchen (where guests from all 3 buildings dine). The WiFi connection used to be very good but nowadays it''s not that reliable to do wfh calls and so on, hope that gets fixed soon.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.348852', 4, 34, 4),
(155, '[Sahil Jamwal] Its a great place to stay and is very well maintained by the owner Indra and his team. Food is good, and other facilities provided be it daily room service, room hygiene and other daily accommodation related stuff are up to the mark. Owner is open for feedbacks and really revolves your issues at the earliest. Staying for more than 6 months now and no complaints hence, would recommend anyone who is looking for single/double/triple sharing rooms near sony signal at affordable rates for quality accommodation services.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.349772', 5, 34, 4),
(156, '[bharat jagtap] One of the best PG in Koramangla.nThe owner always treat us like his brother, never ignore our issues. He personally handles u0026 solves every issues.nSoft spoken and nice person.nRooms are also clean, daily house-keeping person cleans the rooms.nFood is also good veg, non-veg, sweet etc.nnThe main thing is environment of the PG is nice and all secured by cctv.nnGreat experience. Thanks Indra.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.350537', 5, 34, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(157, '[Harsha A K] I stayed in the new building. The building on the right. Single rooms are expensive. Food is manageable. Pretty clean and tidy. The proprietor seems to be decent. If you have any issues, he''ll deal with it soon. The area is a little dirty and bike parking is not easily available. There are many more PGs on the same road and this one seemed to be the cleanest. Only the new building rooms are good. The ones to the left are dirty and dingy.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.350917', 4, 34, 4),
(158, '[Sathish Yadav] I had a fantastic experience staying at a PG in Koramangala for 8 months. The rooms were exceptionally clean, and the surrounding premises were also well-maintained and hygienic. The food quality was excellent, and I had no issues during my entire stay. I highly recommend it for its cleanliness, hygiene, and top-notch food taste.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.379137', 5, 35, 4),
(159, '[Ace] Daily stay option is available. Owner is very friendly and accommodating. Room and bathroom are very clean. Overall, I highly recommend!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.379633', 5, 35, 4),
(160, '[Mohamed Rafique] Very nice and neat PG in the area. People are very nice u0026 responsive, the food is really good. Hygiene was maintained throughout my stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.380034', 5, 35, 4),
(161, '[Chitranshu Wagh] I went to lot of different pgs in bangalore but didn''t got such a budget friendly pg with great quality of food and environment.nThis is surely the go to place and one stop solution for all people who are new to  Bengaluru and are looking for a nice place to live.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.381231', 5, 35, 4),
(162, '[Abhinav Raj Jha] Food is good, Rooms are well maintained stay experience was good, I stayed there for a year.nnYou have generator support, Wifi is fine,nA follow up''s req for washing machine maintenance, but is done promptly.nnThe PG owner Srikant sir is welcoming and good hearted man.nnThe PG Manager Vinay he is a cartoon u0026 lazy guy!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.383197', 5, 35, 4),
(163, '[Gaurav Pavan] I stayed here for 1 month.nnI did enquiry and booking through online. It was a simple online process and then good to go.nnWhen I reached there early morning, it was very easy check in for me.nnRegarding food and room, food was very good homely food and we get 3 times food. I had taken single sharingnroom which was very good, spacious, clean and had attached bathroom and computer table and chair.nnCheckout was as dimple as check-innnAlso the owner is good and communicate in English too', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.385914', 5, 35, 4),
(164, '[Swapnil Pawar] Dreadful Gent''s PG!nMy stay at this Gent''s PG has been a complete nightmare. It''s hard to find anything positive to say about this place. The rooms are cramped and dingy, and the overall cleanliness is a joke. The promised amenities are either non-existent or in such a state of disrepair that they might as well not be there.nThe landlord is utterly unprofessional and indifferent to the concerns of the residents. The food served is unappetizing at best, and I''ve even had concerns about its hygiene. The noise levels are beyond bearable, with no effort from the management to enforce any kind of quiet hours.nTo top it all off, the rent is exorbitant for the dismal quality of living you get in return. I would strongly advise anyone looking for a Gent''s PG to steer clear of this one. It''s a regrettable choice I won''t soon forget.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.386532', 1, 35, 4),
(165, '[Rishabh Mishra] This place have decent rooms to stay plus the food is really awesome. It has really nice hygiene and plus they are making playing arena with an entertainment room in a very affordable price.nThe owner is nice.nThe only thing I don''t like about this place is that we are only getting single table per room and that is very tough to manage things.nRatings 4.5/5', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.386797', 4, 35, 4),
(166, '[Sukash Shankar] I had a great experience staying at this PG. The rooms were clean, well-maintained, and comfortable. The management was friendly, helpful, and always responded quickly whenever any issue came up. The food was good, and the overall environment was safe, peaceful, and suitable for both students and working professionals.nnI''m vacating only because of my personal reasons, but I truly enjoyed my stay here. I would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable, affordable, and well-managed place to stay. Thank you to the management for making my stay a pleasant one!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.402598', 5, 36, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(167, '[Raunaq Sen Gupta] My stay at the PG owned by Mr. Ganesh was truly a very pleasant and comfortable experience. I recently had to leave due to a job change, but I am genuinely grateful for the time I spent there.nnMr. Ganesh is an extremely kind, understanding, and helpful owner. He always ensured that all residents felt safe, comfortable, and well taken care of. Any small issue was addressed promptly, and he maintained a very supportive and friendly environment throughout.nnThe PG itself was clean, well-maintained, and peaceful, making it a very homely place to stay. The food provided was really good, hygienic, and satisfying, which made daily life much easier and more comfortable.nnOverall, it was a very positive experience, and I sincerely appreciate Mr. Ganesh for his hospitality and care. I would highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a safe, clean, and pleasant place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.402916', 5, 36, 4),
(168, '[Abhishek undru] Great and affordable pg to live in Koramangala. Rooms were neat and get cleaned everyday by the staff. Food was very homely. Even though there was lpg shortage pg owner made sure that we did have food on time. Pg owner Ganesh is very friendly and lovely guy. Overall my experience was great if i ever visit Bangalore again id definitely relive my 8 months here. Thanks for having me anugraha pg!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.403223', 5, 36, 4),
(169, U&'[Suresh Suresh] I have 4 years of experience living in Bengaluru, but I have never seen a PG like this. The rooms are clean, the facilities are good, and the management is very supportive. It feels safe and comfortable to stay here. I highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a good place to stay in Bengaluru.\+01f60d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.403668', 5, 36, 4),
(170, U&'[Anup Nandedkar] I had a really great experience staying at this PG. The services provided are excellent\2014clean rooms, proper maintenance, and a comfortable living environment. Everything is well-managed and issues are resolved quickly.nThe owner truly stands out. He is very kind, supportive, and respectful, and always treats everyone like family. His behavior is polite and professional, which makes staying here completely stress-free.nOverall, this PG feels safe, peaceful, and homely. I would definitely recommend it to anyone looking for a place with good facilities and a genuinely good owner.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.404278', 5, 36, 4),
(171, '[Jai kumar] One of the best PGs in Koramangala! The rooms are clean, spacious, and well-maintained. The food is fresh, tasty, and feels like home-cooked meals. The staff and management are very supportive and responsive. Great location with all essentials nearby. Highly recommended for students and working professionals looking for a comfortable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.404774', 5, 36, 4),
(172, U&'[Jagath M Johnson] I\2019ve had a really good experience staying at Anugraha PG for Gents. The housekeeping is consistent and keeps the rooms clean and well-maintained, which makes a big difference in day-to-day comfort.nnThe food is also quite good\2014fresh, hygienic, and served on time. It\2019s clear that they put effort into maintaining quality.nnOther amenities are well-managed, and overall the place feels safe, comfortable, and hassle-free. Definitely a great option for anyone looking for a reliable PG stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.405253', 5, 36, 4),
(173, '[Badrish Vasu] The best PG I''ve been in Bangalore, lived here for almost a year. The owner is a very kind-hearted person, always ready to help. Food was good (South+North). I''d recommend this place in a heartbeat if you''re looking for a good accomodation that''s owned by a wonderful person.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.405695', 5, 36, 4),
(174, U&'[Shyerunlo Semp] Topnotch quality very setsify with the product hoping to visit the store very soon \+01f525', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.425482', 5, 37, 4),
(175, '[Anish Agrawal] Very bad maintenance.nLift not working.nBad internet.nElectricity outage.nVery bad and uncomfortable mattressnBroken lock not repairing for days.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.426102', 1, 37, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(176, U&'[Chinmay Kamat] DRUNK HOUSEKEEPER DAMAGED MY 2-WHEELER!!nThis is the worst PG I have come across. A few days ago the housekeeper of Zolo Hazel, damaged my motorcycle purposely. Fortunately, it was captured in the CCTV. When I asked him the reason of his actions he said that he was drunk and just did it.nnI have attached the video footage of this incident.nnI wrote several mails to the Grievance department of Zolo, but haven\2019t gotten a reply yet.nShameful and utter shameless!nI wouldn\2019t recommend Zolo to anyone.nHigher prices, low quality! The staff is arrogant and the area manager Josh Joy is utter useless\2026 takes weeks to resolve simple matters and doesn\2019t respond to calls or texts. Any local PG is far far better than this place. WORST EXPERIENCE!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.426647', 1, 37, 4),
(177, '[Tushar views] The most pathetic pg you can live in.nThere are mouse in the pg.... They live in this pg happily eat your stuff like food clothes and the owner doesn''t even care to take the calln1week plus I have been facing this problem and still no solution.nThe soln the care taker gave me is that he changed my room. Gave me a room which is more pathetic than the older one.nThough Laundry service timings(days) are fixed. They come according to his own mood to pick up and drop of clothes whenever they want.nThey charge wooping 18 rupees per unit of electricity. It''s the highest amount amoung allother pg.nThey charge you water bills separately taking your whole month rent to a new highnRun away from this pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.427231', 1, 37, 4),
(178, '[Shubham Vats] I had a fantastic experience at this hotel. The staff were incredibly welcoming and attentive, the room was spotless and comfortable, and the amenities exceeded my expectations. The location was perfect, and everything ran smoothly from check-in to check-out. I would definitely stay here again and highly recommend it to others!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.427541', 5, 37, 4),
(179, '[Amit Mittal] Worst pg. No cleaning on time. Lift is not working last 1.5 months.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.427745', 1, 37, 4),
(180, '[Divyansh Sharma] Worst experience with ZOLO. I tried booking here and gave them thousand rupees as a pre booking fees which was refundable. But after I came and did not wanted to stay and cancelled my booking, they said we won''t give you back your money. For what? I didn''t stayed even a single day and you are just eating my thousand of rupees from my pre booking fees which was refundable! Pathetic ZOLO.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.42799', 1, 37, 4),
(181, U&'[Pushparaj] This one star is also no need but I don''t find 0 star option otherwise I would have given 0 star. Worst experience \+01f62anThe zolo app creates lot of technical issue and it purposely increase rent and makes us to pay fine. I literally fought with the team to rectify it. Local  pgs are far far better than these corporate pigs. The housekeeper don''t maintain water level most of the time the motor gets repaired and no water comes especially during morning bath time. It was the worst experience. No smoking control, the teetotaller will face bad situation by exposed to those smoke around the floor. Don''t get into this corporate pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.428712', 1, 37, 4),
(182, '[Arun Rakesh R] Had a really good experience here. The place is well-maintained, clean, and the overall atmosphere is welcoming. The staff are polite, responsive, and make sure everything is handled smoothly. What stood out most was the attention to detail and the effort put into customer satisfaction.nnThe location is convenient, and the quality of service exceeded my expectations. Whether you''re visiting for the first time or are a regular customer, you can expect a comfortable and hassle-free experience. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.446466', 5, 38, 4),
(183, U&'[Nitesh Jha] I highly recommend this PG, especially if you are moving to the city for the first time. The safety and security here are top-notch. What surprised me the most was the food\2014it honestly tastes like home-cooked meals and is highly hygienic. The owners treat everyone like family. It truly felt like a home away from home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.446821', 5, 38, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(184, '[THIRUMALAI SUBASH C] The owner was very friendly and welcoming. The property is well-maintained, with clean rooms . The food was excellent, offering both  North and South Indian cuisine. High-speed Wi-Fi is available, and overall it offers great value for money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.447135', 4, 38, 4),
(185, '[Jene] Had a very nice experience here. Everything was well managed, and the overall environment felt comfortable and welcoming. The staff were polite, helpful, and made sure things were handled properly. I genuinely liked the service and the attention to detail. Overall, it was a smooth and satisfying experience. Would definitely recommend this place and visit again.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.447386', 5, 38, 4),
(186, '[Arun Rakesh] Excellent experience overall. The service was professional, the environment was clean and comfortable, and the staff were friendly and helpful. Everything was well organized, making the visit smooth and pleasant. Definitely recommend this place!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.4477', 5, 38, 4),
(187, '[Arun kumar officials] Visited this place recently and had a genuinely good experience. The service was good, the staff were respectful, and everything was organized nicely. The atmosphere felt comfortable, and I appreciated how smoothly everything was handled. Overall, I left with a positive impression and would definitely suggest this place to others looking for a good experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.448009', 5, 38, 4),
(188, '[Sudha Sudha] Best pg in KoramangalanGood food and clearly cooked.nVery good maintenance. I had been stayed here for 1 year.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.448304', 5, 38, 4),
(189, U&'[Nihal soni] Whenever we look for a PG, food comes first \2014 and that\2019s exactly why Sai Ram PG works for me. The food is home-style and consistent. The place is clean, well-maintained, and has biometric gate entry for added security. Overall, a comfortable place to stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.448627', 4, 38, 4),
(190, U&'[Dan Nathan] Somebody should report this place to the police for the extortion they do. Similar to other comments, they don\2019t say any hidden charges and extort a lot of money from deposit. Didn\2019t even had fan for my non AC room for three days and electricity bill is 1500 for a month.nProperty manager only pick calls to take our money and make us join. After that, hours and hours on support and still not useful.nI wish from my heart Zolo goes out of business. I realise I am not going to get my money back and please, no one else should suffer this', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.466364', 1, 39, 4),
(191, '[Ajsal Abdulla] Extremely poor and unprofessional experience. I was forced to vacate on 1st April despite my app clearly showing a tentative exit date of 4th April. I shared proof, but the property manager refused to verify and insisted I leave immediately. The tone was rude, dismissive, and completely unacceptable.nnInstead of resolving what appeared to be an app glitch, I was pressured to vacate while I was out of town. When I asked for his name, the response was uncooperative. This reflects very poorly on customer handling and staff professionalism.nnCustomers should not be harassed due to internal system issues. I have raised a complaint and expect strict action. Strongly disappointed with this experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.466654', 1, 39, 4),
(192, '[Md] They are scaming people. They don''t refund your deposit amount instead add it to their wallet. Which u can''t withdraw. If u call support they won''t answer your call. They will also not respond to your emails. There are rats all over the property. Drinking water is not clean. The lift won''t work for most of the days. They charged me the electricity bill of 900rupees for one month. Don''t get scamed.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.466869', 1, 39, 4),
(193, U&'[Satyender] Stayed here recently and had a very disappointing experience.nnThe property lacked basic amenities that were advertised \2014 no proper WiFi, unreliable water supply, and frequent electricity issues, which made the stay very uncomfortable.nnWe were in contact with a management representative named Manish Kumar Singh regarding these issues, but there was no proper resolution and communication stopped afterwards.nnOverall, not recommended if you expect basic facilities and responsive management.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.467182', 1, 39, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(194, '[Raunak] Very disappointing stay.nnThe property failed to provide even basic amenities, WiFi barely worked, water supply was inconsistent, and there were repeated electricity issues throughout the stay.nnWe were in touch with a management representative, Manish Kumar Singh, about these problems, but nothing was resolved and communication eventually stopped.nnOverall, a frustrating experience and not worth the money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.467775', 1, 39, 4),
(195, '[Ajeem Makandar Vlogs] Worst pg in Koramangala, no staff from zolo addressing the electricity issue water issues. Already paid the rent on first of the month but they are still sending me emails of eviction if I don''t pay the rent by today. No one from management is responding.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.468014', 1, 39, 4),
(196, '[Pradeep Sharma] The room was very clean , good place to stay , good facilites  and most important very cooperative care taker Thank you Mr subash Giri , we will definitely reffer my colleague.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.468248', 5, 39, 4),
(197, '[Sanjay Kerketa] The PG is well-maintained, clean, and provides a comfortable stay. The manager is professional, responsive, and addresses issues promptly. Overall, a good place to stay with supportive management', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.468465', 5, 39, 4),
(198, U&'[Joel] Excellent PG experience at NextDoor!nThe rooms are clean, spacious, and well-maintained, with good ventilation and modern amenities like Wi-Fi and hot water.nFood is home-style and tasty, served on time, and the Management is super helpful and approachable. Great for working professionals\2014feels like home away from home. Highly recommend!!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.48693', 5, 40, 4),
(199, '[Shubham Kalburgi] One of the best pgs that you can find in Bangalore.nYou get almost all the amenities that anyone needs. Food is awesome, staff is friendly. Everything is just right or rather better than other pgs. I had stayed here for more than one and half year and had to leave only to move to a flat', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.487315', 5, 40, 4),
(200, '[santhosha S Santhu] NEXTDOOR LIVINN GENTS PG is the best! The amenities are top-notch, from the gym to the gaming room, and the food is amazing with both veg and non-veg options. The rooms are spacious, clean, and comfortable. Highly recommend for anyone looking for a premium stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.487584', 5, 40, 4),
(201, U&'[Nanda Kumar Munaganti] Everything is good about the PG and the community based living style. You can collaborate, make friends, I like almost everything, the food is also decent. The rooms are okayish (I mean no offense, but the structure of the room feels a tiny bit congested), but you won''t feel about that, if you do other activities that you can do in this PG. There are lot of things that you can do in this PG, instead of sitting inside your room, it''s just that, I am not getting any time to do anything interesting.nnLot of amenities, including 24*7 Power Backups. Play areas with TT, Snooker, Foosball, PS5 Theatre and Movie theatre (both being different areas is a plus, but you wouldn''t get chance to play, thats a different thing \+01f605\+01f923), Cricket Turf, Basket ball turf, Gym, Party area, etc. So, it''s good. Now you might feel why I gave only 4 stars instead of 5, the only reason being the area, the road, for a PG like this which looks so modern and fresh and clean. The road of this area feels a little bad, it should have been on a different area where the place and road also feels great.nnIf you can just adjust with that this is easily 10/10 for me personally.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.487878', 4, 40, 4),
(202, '[MyAimIs Rustyu0026Bad] This is a Good PG with Good amenities, but the only drawback is that, in one of the 4 properties, that is in MEGATRON, there is no connection of hot water for shower, but it is available through tap only. Also about wifi per room, it''s not true, as 3-4 rooms share single wifi, but that''s doable as its common jn most PG, but this pg''s wifi is comparatively good and fast. Also, this PG is a good place to build connection and friendship, as it has many engaging areas, like Table tennis,  carrom, cricket turf,  2-3 Gyms, billiards, PS 5 and many other areas. Also the managementis good, like room cleaning happens everyday, also if you have some issues, the manager fixes it, not immediatelybut sooner. Also security is good good each floor have 2-3 camers, and power backup is good, rarely electricity goes. But out of 4 main properties, PLAY doesnt have lift, and MEGATRON lift is kind of faulty, it majorily used to get stuck mid way. So overall, if not 5(due to shower), i would give it 4.5.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.488171', 5, 40, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(203, '[Rahul Alda] I came from Delhi had a great stay for 9 months prime location amazing amenities and good food. Must go to stay for people just joining office in Bangalore first timers.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.488429', 5, 40, 4),
(204, '[SidIsUr Always] Owner (Indra Reddy) is too rude and don''t have a manners to talk with guest. Food also is not good and if somebody compliment to owner he directly says leave the room. Don''t complain about food. They offers daily room service but in actually theydo it only twice in a week. There is no sufficient space for parking.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.488639', 1, 40, 4),
(205, U&'[Hetal Bafna] The pg is very spacious u0026 premium with great facilities. My son stayed there and he had a very comfortable staynThe location is also great with lovely restaurants and accessibility would definitely recommend it to anyone looking for good stay in Koramangala \+01f44d\+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.488851', 5, 40, 4),
(206, '[divya sonu] I always feel safe here because There is 24/7 security with CCTV surveillance and a warden available at all times, ensuring the safety of  Residents. Regular housekeeping services keep the PG clean and hygienic. Laundry services are provided, which is a great convenience for the residents.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.503974', 5, 41, 4),
(207, '[keerthana prakash] PG is superb, clean and well made. The decor is super cute and space is very centrally located, this space is manage well and has all amenities needed. My cousins have stayed her for long durations and loved it! Highly recommend this space', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.504185', 5, 41, 4),
(208, '[sushmitha gowda] Staying at Victoria PG has been a pleasant experience. The combination of good facilities, safety, and a convenient location makes it a great choice for women looking for accommodation in Koramangala.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.504391', 5, 41, 4),
(209, '[Chaithali Gowda R] The atmosphere in the PG is friendly and supportive. It''s a good place for students and working women to stay. The management is approachable and responsive to any issues or concerns.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.504569', 5, 41, 4),
(210, U&'[Anaswara Prasannan] Had it not been for Victoria Ladies PG in Koramangala, I wouldn\2019t have been this comfortable in a place that isn\2019t my home. This PG makes me feel at home. Love the vibe of this place. And, to top it all it\2019s in a prime location like Koramanagala.nAll the facilities are available including wifi, security, laundry and house keeping.nGreat place to stay \2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.504955', 5, 41, 4),
(211, U&'[Shabana Ashfaak] I would say, Fantabulous stay. PG is very comfortable and hygienic. The service is amazing. Not just by words. I am saying as I am currently staying here. \+01f929\+01f49c\+01f4aa\+01f3fc Like a decent 3 star hotel stay. Take as an single occupancy and enjoy the days .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.505203', 5, 41, 4),
(212, U&'[sowmiya angel] It\2019s not even deserve one star. Looks may deceive us. The owner is very rude. And the workers are pathetic. If you really care about your peace of mind, don\2019t stay here. The girls are very unapproachable and fights for no reason.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.505405', 1, 41, 4),
(213, '[Kavana Gowda] Well-maintained hygienic living space and Secure premises with proper security CCTVs. Quiet and conducive for studying or working, especially good for students and professionals. Highly recommended..!!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.505622', 5, 41, 4),
(214, '[sagar goel] I have lived in this PG for about 18 months and it has been a great experience for me.nnRent is very affordable and the services are great according to the rent. Cleaning is done everyday and automatic washing machine is available for the tenants.nnThe owner is a very friendly person and entertains requests for fixing things very promptly.nnFood is given 3 times a day and is made with cleanliness. There is a mix of north and south Indian dishes in the menu. Taste is also very good.nnThe PG has proximity to many places such as gyms, restaurants, supermarkets, malls etc. so its very convenient for any need one might have. Electricity is an issue in the area sometimes, so wfh can be an issue on certain days, especially since wifi and fan is not covered by the inverter.nnOverall, I would highly recommend people to consider taking a room in this PG if you''re looking for accommodation in nearby area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.523868', 5, 42, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(215, '[O Ashok Kumar 931] Vegetable spring roll is reasonably priced and very delicious food served . Hygiene well maintained.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.524239', 5, 42, 4),
(216, U&'[NEVETHAN S] rent was low, good environment and food was good when compared to nearby localities and they clean our room daily\+01f601nnnearby there is lot entertainment places and places to chill out.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.524423', 5, 42, 4),
(217, '[jithin kv] Pathetic experience,  Maintenance is good but food quality is patheticnOwner is very rude, they treat you like animal, they buy 3rd quality or rotten vegetable to reduce  expenses,   food quality is below average every afternoon you will get yellow water which they call it as Dal or lentil,', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.524719', 1, 42, 4),
(218, '[Birendar Yadav] Very good pg in Koramangala very good food And nice rooms staff very friendly Owner also helpful person', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.525078', 5, 42, 4),
(219, '[Baba Arhan] Very good PG and nice food big size rooms', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.52531', 5, 42, 4),
(220, '[Dayanand Gouda] Very good food daily cleaning nice room s', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.525568', 5, 42, 4),
(221, '[Shaik Irfan] Pg is having a good atmosphere you have all facilities like geyser wifi and 3 time food it is a very reasonable pg in the Koramangala 8th block locality', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.525753', 4, 42, 4),
(222, '[Anshul Borkar] Highly Recommended!!nnI have stayed here for over an year, my experience has been very good. All amenities are well functional and maintained. Food is good, cleaning happens daily, owner is very friendly. Even if you face any issue it will get resolved quickly. Don''t give a second thought, just move in.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.543573', 5, 43, 4),
(223, U&'[Lokesh Naik B S] I\2019ve been staying in this PG for over a year now, and I\2019d like to share my honest experience. This is actually my 13th PG in the past 3 years \+01f92d, and it\2019s the one staying in the longest \+01f642nnThat itself says a lot about this place!nnWhat I like the most here is the food \+01f60b, the friends I\2019ve made \+01f601, and the friendly, approachable nature of the owner \+01f607nnI\2019m not sure who posted that negative comment under the name \201cRed it\201d \2014 it seems like a fake account.nnFrom my genuine experience, this PG truly feels like home, with good food, comfortable, and a supportive owner \+01f642nnWhenever there\2019s any issue, the owner resolves it quickly to ensure everyone staying here is comfortable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.543829', 5, 43, 4),
(224, U&'[Red It] What started off as a decent PG slowly turned into a masterclass in how to ruin basic living standards. The \201cowner,\201d Amarnath, seems to have discovered that being rude and money-minded is easier than actually maintaining the place.nCleanliness? Optional, apparently. Cockroaches have basically taken over as co-tenants, and no one seems interested in evicting them. Maybe they\2019re part of the amenities now.nIf you enjoy parking your bike in the open so chickens can sit on it like it\2019s their personal throne and decorate it with their droppings, you\2019ll love it here. Truly a unique feature.nAnd if you were hoping to catch up on sleep over the weekend, think again. Early morning construction noise will make sure you stay productive against your will.nOverall, if your standards include basic hygiene, respectful management, and a livable environment, do yourself a favor and look elsewhere. This place clearly isn\2019t aiming for any of those.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.544064', 1, 43, 4),
(225, '[Ganesh Aher] I had a really good experience staying at this PG. The food quality is consistently good, and what I appreciate the most is that they actually listen to feedback and make improvements.nnThe place is clean, hygienic, and regularly well-maintained. Facilities like washing machines, basic gym equipment, and shared kitchen appliances (air fryer, oven, gas, and a fridge on each floor) add to the convenience.nnThe owner, Amaranth, is very helpful and friendly, creating a welcoming environment. The large LED TV with OTT subscriptions is a nice bonus for relaxation. Overall, a comfortable and well-managed place to stay.nnI have stayed here for 1.3 years, and my experience has been very positive.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.54514', 5, 43, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(226, '[Kota Aswini] The PG is clean and well-maintained by the owner, and they serve home-style meals. For safety, they use biometric entrance locks and have CCTV cameras on every floor. Additionally, the PG is couple-friendly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.547659', 5, 43, 4),
(227, U&'[ganesh sapireddy] I\2019ve been staying in this PG for the past one year. I recently saw the review posted by an account named \2018Red it,\2019 and it feels completely inconsistent with the actual situation. Neither I nor other tenants here have ever faced the issues mentioned.nnIf there were genuine concerns, they could have been discussed directly with the owner and resolved. Posting such claims without clear details or proper identification makes the review seem questionable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.548407', 5, 43, 4),
(228, U&'[Shahrukh Iqbal] I stayed at Lakshya Coliving PG for a month and had a great experience. The rooms are spacious and clean, with comfortable mattresses and pillows. Wi\2011Fi is excellent, and there\2019s a working lift, parking and washing machines for laundry. Homemade food is served three times a day, and if you like cooking, there\2019s a microwave, stove and all the necessary cutlery.nnThe PG is secure with biometric entry and it\2019s easy to invite guests over. There are no hidden costs and getting your deposit back is hassle-free. The owners are super friendly, polite, and welcoming. They really make you feel at home. Highly recommend!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.549171', 5, 43, 4),
(229, '[Gaurav Kumar] I have gone through many Pg, hostel across India , since 2015. Lakshya Pg stands for the best , the family themselves cook the food running a whole scheduled Mess, you can expect Taste and quality both same time . Talking about facility Pg is very new, not even more than 6 months , so expect unwrapping your window glass cover if lucky , 5 floors with 6 room each shared,with full ventilation, 2 rooms on terrace.nIts furnished and very well maintained.nWhile Dinning you will feel like home ,sitting ,relaxing ,enjoying any show.nTerrace perfect.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.549417', 5, 43, 4),
(230, '[Tarush Gupta] I stayed in NextDoor Bumble for 3 months. I was given the room on 7th floor. I didn''t know this room would be right next to the open theater. People would keep playing loud music late into the night, which affected my sleep. Even after asking the manager to stop people from playing loud music after 11pm, no action was taken. I requested for a room change to another floor, but that also did not happen. I got really fed up with the management and had to leave the PG immediately without getting my deposit back. Even simple requests like fixing the shower cap took 2 weeks here.nnThese guys will then reply to your google review saying that they didn''t find record of your stay, and they will ask you to stop posting negative reviews on Google. The management is horrible for employing such tactics, and thus I would advice not to take this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.566291', 1, 44, 4),
(231, '[Smruti Ranjan Sethy] I have had a horrible experience with this pg. The rooms (I was staying in double sharing)are not spacious and full of bugs. Service is pretty substandard. The rooms are dirty. Food is somewhat ok. The room, in which I was staying, was full of bugs and I was so tired of them. Hence I left this pg without taking my deposit. I made a big mistake of choosing to stay in this pathetic pg by going through the positive reviews but in reality this place is a dump. In my room, the wall paint came off. Bathroom taps, jet spray, were not working properly. This is the condition of almost all rooms here. Other day, I heard a guy was complaining about rats in his room. Even if you are considering to stay, please double check each and everything inside the room. If you are not getting rooms anywhere, consider it as last option. I hope my review helps someone taking the right decision.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.566489', 1, 44, 4),
(232, U&'[Debolin Sarkar] One of the best PGs in namma bengaluru, quality breakfast is served, cleaning done on time, prime location, affordable rent. Love the owner personally want to thank him \+01f64f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.566728', 5, 44, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(233, '[vineet kadam] I have visited this place, it has a beautiful ambience and very comfortable rooms to stay, it is a place which gives you an experience more than a luxury house. We have gym, home theater  , delicious food, and rooms are not just like zhe PG it is amazing like a luxury deluxe room in the heart of the city our koramangala which is close to all the IT hubs, restaurants and pubs. It is located at a safe and beautiful place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.566904', 5, 44, 4),
(234, '[Mankesh dj mankesh dj] Very very good pg good mentans andnHome type food', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.56709', 5, 44, 4),
(235, U&'[ram challagundla] Great Place to Stay, Well maintained environment cleanness, 24/Security, Homely food.nHygenic Place, Kitchen, Daily Cleaning.nMainly Centralized Hot water facility, RO water, game zone, Gym, and other amenities are extraordinary.nnManagement is very cool.nnHighly recommended to choose for your stay\+01f44c', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.571468', 5, 44, 4),
(236, '[Sohan kumar] The  food tastes good 3 Times  clean and neat rooms best p.g next door  Bumble p.g', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.572746', 5, 44, 4),
(237, '[Kolle Harish] Boys PGnThe food tastes good 3 times ( Unlimited)nClean and neat rooms and maintenance is goodnEach floor has a separate needs (Fridge and Sofa... etc)nAll basic facilities are availablenSecurity availablenLift availablenNearby DTDC courier officenPrices are up to the Koramangala areanCompared to other areas the cost will be more', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.573637', 4, 44, 4),
(238, '[BackMan Drive] Stayed here for a night, no sheet on the bed. Lot of bed bugs perhaps, state of my arm the next morning once I got back home from bangalore is added. Must''ve been a 1000 mosquitoes too. The bathroom was a different story. Cost effective but you are not tough skinned, don''t go.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.595129', 1, 45, 4),
(239, '[Manoj kumar] Owners are nice. Food is great like home meals. Price is comparatively less.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.595351', 5, 45, 4),
(240, '[J Rajendran] I couldn''t give negative stars.This is not a PG old mansion with rusty bathrooms. Rooms with spitted walls and drainage smell is all they have.Money minded they will not return your deposit also. Their photos and reviews are old and fake no one can stay here for one day.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.595544', 1, 45, 4),
(241, '[Dhanush PG] Food u0026 Rooms are good, daily cleaning and well maintainance.PG owner is very friendly and Approachable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.595722', 5, 45, 4),
(242, U&'[Bathala bhanuprakash] This place(sri Vinayaka pg) is very nice to stay and very comfortable,the food is nice and good to eat finally I would say this pg is awesome to stay...\+01f60d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.595911', 5, 45, 4),
(243, '[Pradeep B] Good PG, nice food  and owner is cool person and mainted well with affordable prices', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.59612', 5, 45, 4),
(244, '[naga rathna] Good food and great hospitality,nLess price and more comfortable', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.596613', 5, 45, 4),
(245, '[Kintada Bramhaji] Good pg for south indians and food also good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.596806', 5, 45, 4),
(246, '[Punith Punith] Obviously good pg no need of any second thoughtnLove the food very much homely taste', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.617814', 5, 46, 4),
(247, '[Umesh Kumar] One of my best experience in this pg. Owner is very good ,responsivenGood facilities and very good food of managing both north and south indian varieties', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.618021', 5, 46, 4),
(248, '[Nshahhala] Very good pg food is very goodnDaily cleaning drinking water facility on each floornComfortable and peaceful stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.618235', 5, 46, 4),
(249, '[Kalluru Guru maheswar] worst behaviour of TeamnFirst Mr. Shyam will tell he will repay money and later je dont.nnworst pg owner and wasting of time to join there only conjus people wont pay money back to tenats. They are only money minded guys they loot you easily with nice words by there Team.nnNo parking, worst Management.nnsuggestion better pgs are there near by pls have look there.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.618467', 1, 46, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(250, U&'[Naveen Prabhu] This pg is very good no need to thinknBest thing is owner is always availablenGood maintenance \+01f44d\+01f44d\+01f44d\+01f44d\+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.618652', 5, 46, 4),
(251, '[SUBHAJIT DAS] This pg is good... cleaning and ventilation is good...pg owner is also friendly and helpful', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.618845', 5, 46, 4),
(252, '[Bhargava Karnam] Good for the price range. Clean and hygiene rooms. Food is better compared to other PG''s.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.619025', 5, 46, 4),
(253, '[Barkath Ulla] Good maintenance food is very much good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.619288', 5, 46, 4),
(254, '[Akash Kumar Ray] I have recently relocated to this paying guest accommodation, and I must commend the owner and staff for their exceptional kindness. I truly feel at home here, and I appreciate the diverse selection of healthy and delicious food options. Furthermore, the room is quite spacious and designed in a flat-like configuration.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.638492', 5, 47, 4),
(255, '[Souvagyo Banerjee] The best Pg in Sg Palya for boys.nFrom cleanliness to quality food everything is on point.nI lived here for 3 years of my college life.nHighly recommended', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.639046', 5, 47, 4),
(256, U&'[Rey Heaven] One of the better budget PGs around. Basic, but functional. You get what you pay for\2014neat rooms, decent food, and a straightforward vibe. Good for students or freshers in the city. Not too fancy, but gets the job done without drama.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.639348', 5, 47, 4),
(257, '[Konda Raja Mohan Reddy] I had a great experience staying at this PG! The maintenance is top-notch, and everything is kept clean and in good condition. The food is delicious, with a variety of tasty options. The rent is very reasonable, making it an excellent value for the amenities provided. The owner is friendly and approachable, making it feel like a home away from home. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a comfortable and affordable PG!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.63991', 5, 47, 4),
(258, '[Smriddh] It was really a best decision to take this accomodation! I had a real good time at the pg ! Sanjeev bhaiya is also really nice with the people staying over their helps everyone whenever someone need!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.640359', 5, 47, 4),
(259, '[sabyasachi bhattacharya] Best PG in SG Palya. Sanjeev the owner is more like a brother and keeps his property well maintained. Reasons to go for this PG -n1. Prime location(Nexus Mall is walkable)n2. Rooms are cleaned daily along with Washroomsn3. Homely Food (Mix of South and North)n4. Personal Fridge in each room along with Shared Toaster, Induction, washing machine and Microwaven5. Parking space inside building(Safer)', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.640607', 5, 47, 4),
(260, '[Vishal Junak Das] For an excellent and affordable PG in SG Palya, look no further. The food is top-notch, the rooms are well-ventilated, and cleanliness and hygiene are diligently maintained. There is ample study space, and the ambiance is ideal for students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.640795', 5, 47, 4),
(261, U&'[Subhradip Mukhopadhyay] The Best PG in Bangalore I can say. Area is developed and all the facilities are available near the PG. The PG Owner is very cool and understanding and supportive. The building is new and have so many important facilities which is important to stay in a PG. They have provided bed and cupboard in room, and have Hall Room, Kitchen , Fridge and working tables-chairs for each person. And the another main attraction is food. Awasome food I can say. For North Indian people, will love the food. Everything is awesome and well organised.nJust Go and Check for availability. \2b50 \2b50 \2b50 \2b50 \2b50', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.640963', 5, 47, 4),
(262, U&'[Baskar A] Posting on behalf of my sister who has been staying at Universe. From location to living standards, we\2019re very satisfied. The PG is conveniently located with easy access to transport and shops. Food quality is excellent \2014 hygienic, home-style meals served on time. Security is a top priority here (gated entry, CCTV and a vigilant warden), which gives our family peace of mind. Lastly, the rent is fair and includes useful services like laundry and Wi-Fi, so overall it\2019s great value. Highly recommended for working women and students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.662896', 5, 48, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(263, '[Asfiya] I recently stayed at this PG and had a good experience The place was neat and peaceful The room was well maintained and comfortable The PG has a nice environment and is suitable for a pleasant stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.663289', 5, 48, 4),
(264, '[Sameeksha Dwivedi] I had a good experience in the pg. The owner is very good. Listens and take care of any issues. The food is also good. Room are spacious and well ventilated. All necessary amenities are provided.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.663762', 5, 48, 4),
(265, '[Jeevan Kumar] My sister had stayed here for few months and felt comfortable from the beginning. The place is quiet and well maintained.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.664292', 5, 48, 4),
(266, '[Chinmayi S C] I stayed here and had a really good experience The PG is clean comfortable and has a very homely feel The food is nice and the staff are helpful I always felt safe and relaxed staying here I would surely recommend it to other girls looking for a good PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.664561', 5, 48, 4),
(267, '[SG DHANYA] Staying here felt easy and stress free from day one The place is neat calm and has a warm homely feel Rooms are comfortable and the food is simple and satisfying The staff are polite and always ready to help I felt secure the whole time and would surely recommend it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.664934', 5, 48, 4),
(268, '[Harshitha HS] I had a really pleasant stay here The PG is clean well maintained and feels very homely My room was comfortable and the food tasted like home The staff are kind and the environment feels safe and peaceful Highly recommended for girls looking for a good place to stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.665552', 5, 48, 4),
(269, '[parvez khan] My sister stayed at this ladies PG for a considerable period and overall had a very positive experience. The rooms are clean, spacious, and well-maintained with proper ventilation and basic facilities. The environment is peaceful, disciplined, and safe, which is very important for girls, especially students and working professionals. The management is cooperative, approachable, and responsive to any concerns or requirements. The staff is polite and supportive, and the cleanliness of common areas is regularly maintained. The location is convenient with easy access to transport and nearby amenities. My sister felt comfortable and secure throughout her stay, and I would definitely recommend this ladies PG to others looking for a safe, hygienic, and comfortable place to live.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.665766', 5, 48, 4),
(270, U&'[Khaja Moinuddin] My experience with Zolo was extremely disappointing.nnI paid an advance amount of \20b915,600 while booking my stay. Due to an unexpected job loss, I had to vacate the property earlier than planned. Before leaving, both the property manager Rahul and another manager Vivek assured me that if I sent an email explaining my situation, they would help me with the refund.nnBased on that assurance, I vacated the property and immediately submitted my request. However, despite repeated follow-ups and waiting for more than 10 days, I received no meaningful response. Eventually, I was informed that my \20b915,600 would be forfeited under their policy.nnWhat disappointed me the most was not only the financial loss but also the lack of communication and the assurances that were never fulfilled. If a refund was not possible under company policy, this should have been communicated clearly at the time instead of giving false hope.nnI request prospective customers to carefully read every policy, ask for written confirmation of any commitments, and ensure they understand the refund terms before making any advance payment.nI suggest not to choose zolo property again in the future with this kind of negative responses from themnnI hope Zolo improves its transparency, customer communication, and handling of genuine hardship cases.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.682423', 1, 49, 4),
(271, '[Arnab Kumar Chand] Zolo Harmony is highly recommended. I''ve stayed here for 4 months and had to leave because of Covid. The caretaker is a very helpful guy. They take their services very seriously. Food is amazing here. Rooms are spacious and is worth every single penny. They are also following all the Covid rules very strictly. Kudos to the Zolo team. Would love to stay again.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.682704', 5, 49, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(272, '[Revanth] Good place to stay.nStaff are friendly, but few of the service requests will take time.nFood is mostly north indian, taste is good when compared with other accommodations in this area.nCleaning happens twice in a week.nEjipura bus stop is very near which can help us to catch buses easily.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.68289', 4, 49, 4),
(273, '[Vigneshwaran Venkatesan] Food is worse. You get cold food which has to be reheated before eating. Recently, they are not sticking to the menu provided.. When you complaint to care taker/ property manager to improve the quality of food, they just say it''s not in their hands.nnNo security. Biometric is just lying useless.nnThey are just keen on increasing rent every 6-10 months despite improving the services they provide.nnDespite this, they want people to rate them in their app with max rating.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.683086', 1, 49, 4),
(274, '[Sourabh Chasta] Very nice PG. Bed mattress is spacious and room is quite good for 2 person. Services are also up to the mark. just a bit expensive and mess food is like what we expect from it. Importantly, zolo maintain the clean and hygienic environment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.683266', 4, 49, 4),
(275, '[Anand rai] Fine place to stay for bachlors on a reasonable price.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.68343', 5, 49, 4),
(276, '[Rupam Thapa] Good pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.68408', 5, 49, 4),
(277, '[Celine Kunjukunju] Good  ppg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.684429', 5, 49, 4),
(278, U&'[Md muntazim Md muntazim] My plans were constantly facing delays, and it had started affecting my confidence. Consulting the astrologer helped me see everything clearly. He explained my chart in such a simple way that I could understand exactly where the problem was. His remedies worked wonders \2014 within weeks, things started moving forward naturally. It truly felt like a blessing.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.701939', 5, 50, 4),
(279, U&'[Shreyas Ratnaparkhi] Loved this place. Awesome locality, market, restaurants, clinics, clubs, parks everything is nearby. Very much caring and kind owners.nnEnjoyed my time at Emerald pg \+01f4af', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.702248', 5, 50, 4),
(280, '[Rameshwar Jaiswal] Better than most of the PGs in Kormangala. Affordable and hassle free.nP.s : They have windows in their rooms which you will hardly find in any other pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.702478', 5, 50, 4),
(281, '[Varinder Sharma] One of the best places to live. The owner is really helpful and location is good. You can definitely consider it for longer stays.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.703048', 5, 50, 4),
(282, '[Yadhu Krishnan] One of the best pg in koramangala..peaceful environment and friendly management.Really loved the stay here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.703353', 5, 50, 4),
(283, '[anshul saxena] Very nice place.. Full of Positivity.. Had a great time there', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.703656', 5, 50, 4),
(284, '[Jatin Patel] Nice place No noise pollution surrounded with Garden Good Service by management', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.703856', 5, 50, 4),
(285, '[Vipul Singh] The contact number is switch off is the PG operating?', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.704416', 4, 50, 4),
(286, U&'[Phani Ram Gopal] I stayed at this PG recently, and unfortunately, my experience was far from pleasant. While the basic facilities were just about manageable, the surroundings are in a very poor state. The area is littered with garbage, giving it an unhygienic and neglected feel. Honestly, it reminded me of slum-like conditions, similar to Dharavi, with cramped spaces and no proper waste management. I wouldn\2019t recommend this place unless cleanliness and surroundings aren\2019t a priority for you.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.737726', 1, 52, 4),
(287, '[Black Strikerz] I booked a room but i forgotly changed date and there is also option is there date to change ,but taking time it can alloting, i requested  refund, they saying refund, very bad experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.740544', 1, 52, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(288, '[Sanu limbu Sanu limbu] I have stayed here 2 months overall experience was good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.740876', 5, 52, 4),
(289, '[Vaishnav Chandran] Please do not choose zolonPoor service and idiotic policiesnYou will not receive your depositnThey will find some excuse to keep that money', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.741159', 1, 52, 4),
(290, '[N H Nazrul Haque] Area is not that much good. But near by bus stop i selected this place', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.742176', 5, 52, 4),
(291, U&'[Adit] Stay away from this place lol. Horrible area, you\2019ll be paying 1.5k electricity charges, 250 water bill on top of some other bs hidden charges. Absolutely not worth it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.742487', 1, 52, 4),
(292, '[Govardhan Nayak] Good property. Property manager Rahul is very polite and friendly. Clean rooms and toilets.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.742656', 5, 52, 4),
(293, U&'[Gautam Gulati] Stay here only if you\2019re left with no other options. I stayed there for 3 months.n1. Zolo charges GST even on exit charges and when asked for a tax invoice of the same, no response.n2. They promised some offers but did not provide that during notice period. When asked for the clause where it is mentioned that offer won\2019t be provided during notice period, no response.n3. Food is pathetic (most of the time you\2019ll order online)n4. Local people from nearby area sits in the parking at night to drink.n5. Locality is not good and it\2019s too much noisy in case you have work from home.n6. Building is too old that requires serious maintenance.n7. No lift in the premises.n8. Too much noise of kids in the premise from morning till evening.nnSome pros.n1. Single room is of decent size.n2. Cleaning is fine and takes place every alternate day.n3. Caretaker is helpful.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.742924', 2, 52, 4),
(294, U&'[Sanket Salankimatt] I stayed at Royal Icon PG for Gents for 6 months, and my experience was excellent throughout. The rooms are spacious, clean, and well-maintained. Housekeeping is done regularly, so the place always feels neat and hygienic. One of the best parts of staying here was the food\2014it was fresh, tasty, and of good quality every day.nnThe management and staff are helpful, making the stay comfortable and hassle-free. If you''re looking for a PG with spacious rooms, good cleanliness, and delicious food, I would definitely recommend Royal Icon PG for Gents.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.760569', 5, 53, 4),
(295, '[vallarasu anand] Nice PG, clean and well maintained. Friendly workers. U can''t find a PG with big parking space in Bangalore unless it''s Royal icon pg gents.nMain thing the Food is good and hygiene. Will suggest everyone to look into it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.760764', 5, 53, 4),
(296, U&'[shawn dsouza] I stayed in this PG for 4 years, and it truly felt like a second home. The environment was comfortable, safe, and welcoming throughout my stay. The management was supportive, and the facilities were well-maintained. I\2019ve made great memories here, and I\2019d definitely recommend it to anyone looking for a reliable and pleasant place to stay long-term.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.760899', 5, 53, 4),
(297, U&'[Kamalaiah N] I\2019ve stayed here for nearly 4 years, and it\2019s been a really comfortable and happy place for me.nThe owner is kind and easy to talk to, and the people here made my stay even better.nI\2019ll always remember this place positively', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.761062', 5, 53, 4),
(298, '[Yuvraj Singh] Stayed for almost 2 years great stay and good food with parking facility available within gated society and great views.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.761225', 5, 53, 4),
(299, '[Nithin Mohan] One of the best PGs found in the region. It''s prime location itself is the main attraction here. It''s situated in a quality area with a calm atmosphere.nnThe building itself is a class one, with all the necessary amenities available with dedicated parking space. The premises and rooms are found very clean, and also observed that they''re maintaining very well.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.761527', 5, 53, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(300, U&'[Himanshu Sharma] Really good place to stay. The connectivity is excellent, and the food served here is also quite tasty. All the required appliances work properly, and the cleaning is done on time. Overall, it\2019s a comfortable and well-maintained place to live.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.761685', 5, 53, 4),
(301, U&'[varun ganapathy] The best PG in the neighbourhood, hands down. I stayed in this PG for 3 years made lot of memories.nnAll staffs are supportive. Would highly recommended. if you\2019re looking for well maintained, safe PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.761868', 5, 53, 4),
(302, '[Namrata Sharma] Only reason this place deserve any star is the staff that work here really sweet bunch of people. Other wise the zolo company policy works, they do not deserve any.n1. The price I was told on call (i have screenshot too) and on app are different.(Although the difference is 200rs only).n2. Even after asking repeatedly we were not disclosed all the hidden charges like exit charge and deposit.n3.And the discount which we got while booking did not apply as soon as we mentioned notice period while everything was discussed with the support team.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.781492', 3, 54, 4),
(303, '[Pranav Nair] The rent keeps on increasing like stock market. Even if we opt for lock in period of 1 year, they still increase the rent every month in the name of electricity bill. They building is still fully occupied, yet they keep on increasing. I complained a lot to the customer service, there is no reaponse. Initially it was 8000 including electricity bill. Now in this month i have to pay 9300. Only to run a fan, tv, lights and a common fridge and induction stove, how can they charge 1300 to an individual. They just do fake talks at beginning, then they show true colors. Not at all fair. I am putting notice. God knows how much they are going to deduct from my deposit. PLEASE DONT JOIN ZOLO.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.781652', 1, 54, 4),
(304, '[Venkat Kumar] Very good PG with clean rooms and a comfortable environment. Wi-Fi and housekeeping are good, and the location is convenient. Overall a nice place to stay in Bangalore.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.782019', 5, 54, 4),
(305, '[arjun k] Very bad maintenance. Water issue most of the times. No response even if complaints are raised.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.782174', 1, 54, 4),
(306, '[Rohith M B] Good stay. Ideal for working professionals or individuals looking for short stays.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.782316', 5, 54, 4),
(307, '[Anu Varghese] The area is a bit interior. There are no shops here one has to depend on zomato Swiggy or Blinkit. The manager Rajan is very good for his hospitality.The only improvement can be if food is provided.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.782442', 5, 54, 4),
(308, '[Wanderwithlens] Located in quiet and peaceful environment. Pg is okay and the pricing comparatively zolo is better for co living or individual', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.782676', 4, 54, 4),
(309, '[SHRADDHA SINGH] One of the good PGs that i have stayed in. Initially, I came to stay for a couple of days but ended up staying for 2 months and its still going. Love the space, decor and woodwork of the rooms. The rooftop is a good as well you can see the city skyline and a good night sky from there. The staff is helpful.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.782803', 5, 54, 4),
(310, '[Ilayaraja Maruthamuthu] I have been staying in this PG for more than one year, and my experience has been very good. The food quality is excellent, with many varieties, and it is very tasty. The owners are very responsible and always ready to help whenever there is any issue.nnThe availability of self-cooking facilities is a big plus. The TV in my room is very entertaining, and the overall facilities are well maintained. There is uninterrupted water supply and power backup, which makes the stay comfortable and hassle-free.nnOverall, it is a very good PG with a friendly and supportive management. I highly recommend it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.802289', 5, 55, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(311, '[MD Junaid Meeran] I had a wonderful experience staying at Radhai Luxuy Boys PG in Whitefield Prashant layout. I have been staying in this PG for more than two year. The management is friendly, polite, and always responsive to any queries or maintenance requests. The rooms are well-maintained, well-ventilated, and cleaned regularly. Worth for money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.802526', 5, 55, 4),
(312, '[Pinak Parate] Good PG to stay. Very near Kadugodi Tree Park Metro Station. Good food. And all amenities, altho washing machines are a bit slow. Overall 7/10', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.802686', 4, 55, 4),
(313, '[Sharath Kumar K] Nice PG for men. Clean PG and good food is provided 3 times a day everyday. Cloth washing facility, self- cooking facility is also provided.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.802839', 5, 55, 4),
(314, U&'[Vijay .s] I stayed in this PG , and my overall experience was very good. The PG owner is a really kind and helpful person. Whenever there was any small issue in the room, it was fixed immediately without delay. Earlier, there was a slight issue with the food taste, but after a new chef joined, the food quality has improved a lot. Now everything is well managed, and it\2019s a comfortable place to stay. I would definitely recommend this PG for anyone looking for a good and well-maintained accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.803015', 4, 55, 4),
(315, '[Mohan] I have stayed in this pg for 2 years. The pg is neat and clean , also food and other facilities are good. The food here feels like home food and it''s very hygienic. Water facilities like hot water and power facilities like powerbackup available for 24 hrs. The owners are very friendly and good in nature , they can be able to resolve your issues in the pg ASAP. Overall, it''s very clean , neat, hygienic and most importantly it is affordable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.803203', 5, 55, 4),
(316, U&'[Gowtham Bobby] This PG feels more like a home than just a place to stay. The owner is kind, supportive, and always cares about the well-being of all PG mates. The atmosphere is positive, and everyone is treated with respect. I\2019m really happy with my stay here \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.803343', 5, 55, 4),
(317, U&'[Vincelin Vincelin] I\2019ve been staying at this PG for six months and it\2019s been a great experience. The rooms are spacious, regularly cleaned, and have good ventilation. The Wi-Fi speed is decent, and the food is homely with variety every day. The owner is approachable and resolves issues quickly. The area is peaceful with nearby shops, bus stops, and restaurants. Perfect for students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.803518', 5, 55, 4),
(318, '[Bhimanagouda SPatil] Its a good pg, and food is also nice and tasty, I stayed here for 3 yr.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.820871', 5, 56, 4),
(319, '[Dhruba Singha] Very good hygienic. Food quality is good too.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.821013', 5, 56, 4),
(320, '[Success First] Pg is hygiene, quality of food and service is good. Spacious rooms and we''ll maintained. 3 meals per day. Owner and staff are friendly and we''ll mannered. Reasonable prices for 1,2,3 and 4 sharing. 24/7 is open for employees.Happy to stay for longer period.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.821154', 5, 56, 4),
(321, '[angshuman neogi] As I stayed here for almost 10 months, I think I am suitable for a review.nPros:n1) Owner''s behavior is good mostly.n2) Location is bit useful. (though it doesn''t matter much if you live you''ll know).nnCons:n1) Quality of food is bad. Most often the food gets over very quickly. Mostly they serve potato and chutney only as sabji.n2) Rooms are small. Coridors are too small ( two persons cannot go simultaneosly), small lift, narrow stairs.n3) Old building and beds are very small. Wifi is not consistent.n4) The workers are very arrogant and witty. They will not talk good with you. I don''t know if they maintain food hygine. One day one worker barged into my room (they have keys of your room) without knocking at 2am. Just to check if my tap was off/on.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.821289', 2, 56, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(322, U&'[Adhiban Bharathi Babu] Nice pg . The rate is really low . The place is clean . They gave a nice service and people were polite. I saw laundry machines and it also has lift. Those are well maintained. It is near ITPL gate 2 . They also provide food but I didn\2019t try that as i left early. They also give stay for hours , day or months . Each has different packages. Contact them for other details . There are many hotel and stores near it .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.821566', 5, 56, 4),
(323, '[Sudhakar Reddy] I Stayed here for Five Months...The PG is Excellent....I saw over 10 to 15 pg''s but was not satisfied with Hygiene and maintenance of rooms. But when I got this from searching in google...I went there...The rooms Were same as showed in Website...Cleaning of rooms was done daily...Food was also Good. Who  maintaining the PG Ramesh is nice person , very polite and co-operative.nOverall I can say that it is Excellent.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.821727', 5, 56, 4),
(324, '[ADHITHYA SHANKAR B S 1CD20CS004] Very good PG with all the basic amenities available like TV per room, a fridge and a water filter per floor with a beautiful architecture inside the rooms. Worth for the price which is affordable. Food is also good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.821855', 5, 56, 4),
(325, '[Yaswanth Gadamsetti] Krishna Gents PG ITPL is without a doubt the best pG I''ve ever been in. I suppose i may say it is the one of the best in Bangalore for sure.The facilities are amazing and top notch. It has near by pharmaceutical, super markets, hardware stores and many other fancy stores so if you need something you don''t need to worry about getting it. The rooms are cleaned regularly(daily). The owners and the staff that work there are very kind and polite. If you are searching for a good PG in Bangalore, i will probably tell you to go to this PG (krishna Gents PG ITPL)', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.821983', 5, 56, 4),
(326, '[pavan kumar] I had a great stay at this PG. The rooms are neat and regularly cleaned, and all basic facilities like Wi-Fi, water, and electricity are reliable. The food quality is good and hygienic. The location is convenient with easy access to transport and shops. The management is cooperative and helpful. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.839028', 5, 57, 4),
(327, U&'[Aiswarya P] Worst PG experience ever. The room and facilities might look good, but the way they treat you during vacating is absolutely pathetic. Zero cooperation, endless excuses, and shameless attempts to cut your caution deposit for no valid reason.nThey especially try to take advantage of people who are not locals. I literally had to file a written complaint at the police station just to get my own money back\2014and even then, they deducted some amount. That\2019s how greedy and unprofessional they are.nIf you\2019re even thinking of choosing this PG, be very careful. Keep proof of every single payment. Record calls, save messages\2014because they will change their words whenever it suits them and completely ignore your calls and texts.nHonestly, one of the worst experiences. Don\2019t fall into the same trap.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.839156', 1, 57, 4),
(328, '[Shivaani Srinivasan] Worst PG in my experience. Very bad management. They don''t understand if there is medical emergency. Barely stayed for a month. I only had their food for 3-4 days and its very bad. Yet they reduced 2000 for maintenance. Didn''t even give little bit of advance back. And it''s too expensive. 13k for two sharing room.nWater is very dirty. They proclaim gym facilities. But nothing is there. Equipments are broken down. They have 5 washing machines. None of them work properly. Clothes somehow became more dirty!  Don''t know what maintenance they did.nI do not recommend this pg at all. These people will rob you blind.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.839315', 1, 57, 4),
(329, U&'[ashish shinde] To be honest, the PG for Men is very old. 1.The bathroom looks very old and dull and the doors of the bathroom is rotting.n2.The locking mechanism for the entrance door is not working properly because its too old.n3.Even the furniture they provided is too old and rusty.n4. No mirrors provided in the room.n5. The elevator is very old and sometimes its not working at all.n6. They don''t have water dispenser on every floor (very disappointing).n7. Electricity cut-off at least 2-3 times during the day.n8. The gym equipments are all damaged and rusty.n9. The washing machines are all old, rusty and some damaged.n10. The dinning hall looks very dull and is unhygienic.n11. The food quality is not that good. Any ways you will end up ordering outside food.n12. The Rent cost is too high as compared to the facilities they provide.nThey will charge you 13,000 for 2 sharing  and 6,000 for deposit. Out of the 6,000 they will recover the maintenance fees of 2,000 and return you 4,000.n13. They don''t even maintain the rooms and building, so why charge the tenants 2,000 for maintenance. Very unprofessional behavior and low mindset.n14. For your satisfaction you can verify the above mentioned points.nThank you!!\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.83943', 1, 57, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(330, '[Shashank Shovit] The rent is way too high as compared to the services provided and the sanity maintained. But it is located at a good place and good for who work in ITPL. It has a good market around and a canara bank atm beside. Staff is nice and trustworthy.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.839603', 3, 57, 4),
(331, '[SAIKRISHNA CHALAPADI] Best PG and I have been here since 2025. Food is very delicious and hygienic.nVery clean and daily maintenance.nreliability of Wi-Fi, power backup, and water supply. Even though they were very supportive and quick responding while getting any issues. Staff also very friendly and cooperative.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.839769', 5, 57, 4),
(332, '[Harsha dokula] The location of the PG might look a bit odd but I would say it is the option available at this location. I know the price is a little steep at 11,000 rupees for two share room but with included personal balcony, a gym, three time food, walkable distance to most offices in Whitefield, good view from the terrace and availability of malls like fourm and phonenix nearby would make this price totally worth it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.839884', 5, 57, 4),
(333, '[ujwala sri Ghanta] Security cannot be found in any other pg as well... But this pg is spacious and maintenance is good.. Food is the best here..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.83999', 5, 57, 4),
(334, '[Azad Akhtar] I had a great experience.once u will finish locking period and prior 1 month notice period .they will refund within 2 days of your room key take over', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.856113', 5, 58, 4),
(335, '[Jani Jani] Really homely food daily cleaning Wi-Fi 500 MBPS unlimited ITPL nearby best Pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.856294', 5, 58, 4),
(336, '[Ramjani Ali] Excellent rooms with all services. Our cook is a bojpuri guy and he has got all the swag. Owner is such a nice person he will solve the problems with in minutes simply he is an alrounder. Value for money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.856492', 5, 58, 4),
(337, '[Sehraj Gamer] Best PG in Bangalore and ITPL daily cleaning Wi-Fi speed is good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.856621', 5, 58, 4),
(338, '[Nikhil Nair] Very Good PG for bachelors, couple and college students. Good Hygiene, shops available nearby and other amenities as mentioned. Do check out as this PG will never disappoint you.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.85676', 5, 58, 4),
(339, U&'[Kothapalli Ram] Akshay pg Quite good \+01f60a for Mens . Overall Environment and Rooms cleaning daily as regular. Food is also quite good compared to other pgs. I Recommend this to everyone.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.856898', 5, 58, 4),
(340, '[Aravind] There bed full bed bugs only incase you take this PG you forget your sleep because every night that bed bugs come and bathroom all pipes also so damaged', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.857039', 1, 58, 4),
(341, U&'[Gajulapalli babureddy] Actually I came to this PG few months back  based on reviews and ratings that''s true because here food is too good \+01f4af and tasty both north and south indian foods. Rooms are very clean and Except Sunday rooms and bathroom will be cleaned by maid. Owner too polite and you can check with related to rooms and for two sharing 8.5k and three sharing', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.857178', 5, 58, 4),
(342, '[Tanisha Goyal] I had a very good experience in this pg. I was living in here from last 2 years. Rohit bhaiya is caretaker of this pg and very cooperative. Food is also good. There is north indian and south indian food options available. But Water quality needs to be improved otherwise other facilities are good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.873435', 4, 59, 4),
(343, '[Adi Abraham] I had a great experience staying at Gravity COMFORTS PG for nearly an year. The location is highly convenient and close to ITPL. The rooms are spacious, clean and well-maintained. All amenities like high-speed Wi-Fi, RO drinking water, hot water, and power backup work reliably. Caretaker Rohit is always reachable and really helpful.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.873589', 5, 59, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(344, '[Nithin Mohan] This is one of the best co-living PG studio rooms available in this region. We had a really great experience staying here.nnAll the necessary amenities are available right within the facility, and the rooms are quite spacious. There are also plenty of shops nearby for day-to-day needs.nnThe atmosphere and surroundings are very peaceful, also the location is in a prime spot. The owner and their family are incredibly helpful and attentive.nnRecommending to others.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.873769', 5, 59, 4),
(345, '[Ashik Radhakrishnan] I stayed at this PG for 1.5 years, and my experience was excellent throughout. The rooms are spacious, well-ventilated, and come with balconies, making the stay very comfortable. There is Daily cleaning, and the Wi-Fi is reliable and fast.nnThe food quality is good and consistent, which makes long-term stay convenient. Most importantly, the administration is very supportive and responsive to any concerns.nnOverall, this is one of the best PG accommodations in Whitefield, and I would highly recommend it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.873903', 5, 59, 4),
(346, '[Avitab Ayan Sarmah] I have been staying in this PG since 2 years. The reason I haven''t changed to another PG because the rooms are very clean, you can choose different size of rooms according to your use. Rohit is very cooperative.The food is good, the cook makes the food and eats the same.Breakfast is good, better than other PGs. I will definitely recommend this PG if you are single working person or couple, this is a nice place to stay. And one last thing, the rooms and P.G stairs, floors are cleaned daily. So, you do not have to worry anything about the cleanliness.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.874043', 5, 59, 4),
(347, '[Ayush Raj] One of the best pg in the area.nEveryone is really supportive over here.nFood is to good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.874189', 5, 59, 4),
(348, '[AK] Stayed here for 5 months. One of the best pg in this locality, super clean rooms and ample amenities. Daily cleaning and supportive staff. You will get tasty North Indian food except weekend afternoons. Owner is also very supportive in all forms. Go for it, especially VTI people who are here for training.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.874319', 5, 59, 4),
(349, U&'[Karthik Krishna] Best PG in whitefield.nnThey have spacious and well maintained room.nCosts around 10,500 to 13,000nn\2022 Have basement parkingn\2022 Good food.n\2022 unlimited fast Internet.n\2022 Balcony.n\2022 Big beds.n\2022 Cleans dailyn\2022 Neatn\2022 Common fridge in all floorsn\2022 24 hour hot water', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.874461', 4, 59, 4),
(350, U&'[Safan Safan] Such a good PG! The owner is also very friendly, and the food is amazing. I\2019ve been staying in this PG for almost one year, and I really like it\2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.895046', 5, 60, 4),
(351, '[Faiz Alam] Food is ok ok like other pg...24*7 only hot water.very tough for bathing time ,multiple tym everyone complain but issue is still there...in food either they give curry or daal..for same facility other pg charge 6 k... here they are charging 7 k....', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.895191', 2, 60, 4),
(352, '[Nithin Morkonda] Good service and homely food', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.895315', 5, 60, 4),
(353, '[Kumar yadav] Super pg u0026 rooms very nice . Food, service and pg incharge person very good and kind', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.895441', 5, 60, 4),
(354, '[Arunkumar C] Great  facilities with reasonable price, food taste feel like homely,neat and clean rooms and pantry.located area which is connecting all main areas of banglore city', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.895728', 5, 60, 4),
(355, '[Subramanyam] Good hospitality feeling like staying in home prefer to stay here compared with other pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.895845', 5, 60, 4),
(356, U&'[thirupathi murali] Good room servicing u0026Room atmosphere is exllent\+01f44c ,Food is too good \+01f44d and I would like to live more day''s \+01f4af', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.896247', 5, 60, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(357, '[BHASKAR KODURU] One of the best pg in Bangalore,, well maintanence and good taste homely food and also reasonable fee ,,,, my suggestion is good and best PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.896437', 5, 60, 4),
(358, U&'[Sahil Ansari] I\2019ve been staying here presently and it has been an absolutely great experience. The accommodation is comfortable, well-maintained, and feels like a second home. The food is excellent with great quality and taste \2014 no doubts about that at all. Overall, a very good PG with a friendly environment and good facilities. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a reliable and comfortable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.913164', 5, 61, 4),
(359, '[Rahul Gautam] I had a really pleasant stay at anvitha luxury PG.nnIt''s pretty close to Kadugodi Tree Park metro station and it''s a new building with all necessary facilities. The rooms are neat and spacious and are cleaned everyday. They provide high quality food 3 times a day and the management is very friendly, quickly addressing any needs that we may have.nnI highly recommend this PG for anyone looking for a comfortable stay at an affordable price in this locality.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.913357', 5, 61, 4),
(360, '[Naveen Kumar] This is best PG in this Area, Rooms are very clean, Food quality is also very good,  everyday different menu for Breakfast, Lunch and dinner. Also Geyser, Automated Washing Machine and WiFi service are add-on services provided. PG owner and staff are very polite and supportive. I can say, it is very good PG in affordable rent.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.9135', 5, 61, 4),
(361, '[Anil h Harijan] I am staying in this PG and it is really good and the food is tasty and the non veg avilable  and the management is very friendly in nature and very helpful person  and i say this is best pg in all those pg,s and anyone can come and adjust very early here!..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.913646', 5, 61, 4),
(362, '[ROW Vlog] I spent an incredible months at this PG, and I can''t rave enough about it! The atmosphere was immaculate, with a focus on hygiene that made my stay feel so comfortable. And the food? Absolutely delicious! Every meal was a delight. Plus, the owners were so cooperative and welcoming, making it feel like a second home. What a fantastic experience!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.913873', 5, 61, 4),
(363, '[Chotu Kumar Sinha] Wonderful and very friendly environment here we can get different sharings and good maintenance facilities and locker service also good available..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.914006', 5, 61, 4),
(364, '[B LAC MORTAL] I had a great experience staying at this PG. The staff were  friendly and always ready to help, making me feel at home from day one. Everything was well-maintained and prompt. The food was delicious and hygienic. The rooms were clean, comfortable, and perfect for a peaceful stay. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a safe, clean, and homely PG experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.914163', 5, 61, 4),
(365, '[Duggaiah P] Spacious and well maintained rooms. The food is good and comfortable for staying her. The management is highly professional and ensure a hassle-free living experience.nThe facilities provided are top-notch, including high-speed WiFi, laundry services, and regular housekeeping. The atmosphere is peaceful, making it a great place to relax after a long day. Highly recommended for those looking for a safe and convenient stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.914294', 5, 61, 4),
(366, '[Sowmya R R] Very Nice PG. Management is very friendly and help with any issues. Clean and spacious rooms. Great location too.nDefiently recommend this one.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.932889', 5, 62, 4),
(367, '[Nikhila P] Amazing PG for ladies. Safe and secure with all the amenities. Management is good and responsible. Highly recommend this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.933182', 4, 62, 4),
(368, '[shivam vikram singh] Very good PG. Nice, decent and spacious rooms. Rooms are cleaned every day. Good washrooms and are cleaned regularly. There are 2 malls nearby and bus stops at walking distance. You''ll enjoy your stay here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.93342', 5, 62, 4);     
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(369, '[Dean Winchester] Better than all the PG''s in that area. Rooms are quite big and friendly Management.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.933555', 5, 62, 4),
(370, '[Rajaraman K] Good food and new pg with washing machine and fridge. Rent is fine considering proximity to ITPL', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.933689', 5, 62, 4),
(371, '[Balbir Kumarchand] Food is better than other pg near ITPL gate number 3', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.933812', 4, 62, 4),
(372, '[akash patel] Food and rooms are too good. If you are living in whitefield and looking for pg then this is the best choice.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.93392', 5, 62, 4),
(373, '[avinash godvin] Very well maintained PG , rent is nominal after seeing the arrangements.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.934048', 5, 62, 4),
(374, U&'[Rahul Dey] I had a fantastic experience staying at this PG. The rooms are well-maintained, cleaned regularly, and the management is always friendly. A huge plus is that they have power backup specifically for the Wi-Fi, so you never lose connection during power cuts\2014making it perfect for anyone working from home or studying. Highly recommended for a comfortable and hassle-free stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.953729', 5, 63, 4),
(375, '[Shankar Rao] I have been stayed 2+ Year and it is my ExperiencennManagement: The owner is very polite, professional, and accommodating.nAmenities: Rooms are well-maintained with excellent cleanliness and an uninterrupted 24/7 power supply.nFood: The meals provided 3time a day and of good quality.nnOverall, it has been a comfortable and hassle-free experience. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.95393', 5, 63, 4),
(376, U&'[karthik Guddanahalli Sheshagiri] I have been living in this pg for 4 months and the experience here is very good All the basic facilities are well maintained. The food provided is good as well.nnThe owner is one of the best parts of this place \2014 very kind, approachable, and always supportive. Daily cleaning keeps the PG neat and hygienic, creating a comfortablenenvironment to live in.nnOverall its a very nice and comfortable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.954063', 5, 63, 4),
(377, '[LEYON T J] I stayed in this PG for about 4 months, and overall my experience was good.nnPros:nnThe room size is average, similar to most PG accommodations.nThe rooms have a TV, which is quite rare in many PGs.nCleaning is done on alternate days.nThe excellent feature i loved is there wifi,in each floor 2-3 routers the have.so its like 100MBPS more and we can switch any time .nThere is decent bike parking available on the ground floor.nThe dining area is on the ground floor, and a stove with basic kitchen utensils is available if you want to do small cooking.nThe food quantity is not too many in numbers, but whatever they serve is hygienic and tasty ones. They also provide chicken and egg on specific days of the week.nCommon water filter and fridge are available on the ground floor.nThere is a lift, which is very convenient.nFor safety, the gate is locked at night with face and fingerprint access.nnCons:nnThere are only two washing machines, so sometimes it feels like a competition to use them.nnFinal Words:nIn my opinion, this is one of the better PGs you can find in this area.nThe owners are friendly and helpful, and the environment feels quite homely.nIf you get good roommates, it can feel like heaven!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.954225', 5, 63, 4),
(378, '[Aravind Anand] Good infrastructure and environment. Very good place to stay. Food and bed are good. Rooms are very hygienic and clean. The owner is also very comfortable and friendly, with good behavior.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.954384', 5, 63, 4),
(379, '[Bellala Sai Nataraj] Excellent PG and affordable price and good culture and friendly behaviour with PG residents . Good security and hygiene maintenance. Food was followed according to the menu. Best place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.954543', 5, 63, 4),
(380, '[sahith kumar] It''s an excellent pg with nice ambience and higenic food. Owners here are very polite and the rooms are clean and neat. If you are looking for a pg in Whitefield, this is the best.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.954679', 5, 63, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(381, '[Prabhu Swamy.R] It''s a very good luxury pg with single sharing, 2-sharing, 3-sharing,4-sharing rooms with tv and attached bathroom in each rooms, WiFi in each floor, gym and 3-times food including non-veg. Owners are young and friendly and take immediate actions for any complaints', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.9548', 5, 63, 4),
(382, '[Anand Neeralakatti] Hi Guys..Intially I came to this pg based on +ve Google reviews. So, I am sharing my true experience. I had stayed here for past 2.5 years. I felt really good to stay here...it''s feel like home for me rather than pg....Owner is very good hearted person..he will resolve for any kind of issues. Food quality is good...Floors are clean and neatly maintained. Ample open space and ventilation...Good bike parking space. Best gent''s Pg in Whitefield, near by areas of ITPL, Vydehi and Divyasree techno park.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.990563', 5, 65, 4),
(383, '[Rakshith Nayak] I stayed here during 2020. Best pg found till date near Whitefield location.nYou get double, triple and single sharing rooms for affordable prices.nFood is awesome and hygienic. There is no limit to the food. As they are Telugu people you get really awesome Telugu foods. I recommend tasting chicken gravy, Big puri sagu, Idli chutney and vegetable sambhar. It''s yumm.nnAnother reason to stay here is you get Gym and Super market just in front of the pg so you don''t have to go to market.nnThe owner is friendly and he takes care of all the issues in the room. He is a nice man. I had a really good time herennRating :nnFood : 4/5nRooms : 4.5/5nCleanliness: 4/5', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.990749', 5, 65, 4),
(384, '[Pranav Pavithran] This PG is an average PG for gents and family.Food is provided by them twice a day. That is you will get breakfast and supper from here.Lunch is not provided.You will get single,3 sharing,4 sharing and many kind of rooms with 300rs per day and minimum 4800rs per month.You must give a security amount of 3000 rs when you are joining the PG for a month and more in which you will get 2000 rs when you vacate the room.wifi, TV and washing machine is available.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.991162', 4, 65, 4),
(385, '[Rohit Golabhavi] Very spacious.nGood ambiance.nOwner is very friendly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.991383', 5, 65, 4),
(386, U&'[RAVICHANDRAN RAMESH] I\2019ve been staying here for over 3 years, and honestly, this is one of the most in-demand PGs near Sathya Sai Hospital and ITPL.nnOwner: Super friendly, with a homely vibe.nnFood: Simple, tasty, and genuinely feels like home.nnParking: Space for 50+ bikes in the basement (with the dining area right there too).nnBuilding: 4 floors of spacious rooms at prices you won\2019t find anywhere else in Whitefield, Bangalore.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.991613', 5, 65, 4),
(387, '[Abhilash Guru] The entire PG premise was very neat and clean. I stayed there for a very short period of time i.e. for a week. The owner is very humble and helpful in nature. I had a single sharing room for me and the rooms were very spacious. The food was also hygienic especially the breakfast it was really good. Only con is there are no bus stops near the PG and we have to walk for around 2 km to get to a nearby bus stop.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.991765', 5, 65, 4),
(388, '[Santhosh Gampa] You will never find any problem with the owner. Well maintained. Clean. Just need to have mutual understanding with other tenants to keep the doors open for ventilation. People who are rating low should mention reasons which will be helpful for others. Without proper reason for low rating is useless. Food is good. You will find many people coming to this pg again even if they left the pg due to their work related commitments.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.991867', 5, 65, 4),
(389, '[SHANTHAVEER PATIL] Food is very good.nclean and well maintained.nBike parking available.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:05.991973', 5, 65, 4),
(390, '[Shrirang Joshi] From somedays water is not working i am resident residing here. Whenever we raise the ticket nothing happens no maintainace and nothing works. They will raise water charges to 900 but still don''t get water. Lots of problem here whenever we try to reachout someone no one response. Neither they have fixed my electricity no water issue. I would recommend never to register here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.014582', 1, 66, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(391, U&'[Abhinanda Manikandan] Unfortunately, this place is not worth the price being charged. Residents are asked to pay for multiple utilities separately, including drinking water, but there are frequent issues with water availability. Many days there is little to no drinking water available, and the water filters are often empty. Even for non-drinking water, there seem to be constant maintenance issues and disruptions.nnFood availability is also unreliable at times, with residents occasionally finding that there isn\2019t enough food provided. For the amount being charged, basic necessities should be consistently available.nnWhat was most concerning was recently finding mosquito larvae in the water from the drinking water filter. This was extremely disappointing and raised serious concerns about the quality of the service being provided.nnOverall, the experience has been frustrating, and the facilities and services do not justify the cost.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.014775', 1, 66, 4),
(392, '[Jockey TR] I am very happy because I feel at home in Monza House. The food is good, and the management is excellent. Any issues are resolved immediately. I am very happy.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.015178', 5, 66, 4),
(393, U&'[Malavika] Very very bad experience.currently we\2019re stucked here our contract ends by October.Daily we\2019re facing water problem and no food.For WiFi we have to pay extra also full complaints in room .Please don\2019t choose stanza', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.015374', 1, 66, 4),
(394, '[B S Ramanuj] Went for enquiry. The enterance lane to this PG is fully occupied with garbage. Even near the side of building is garbage. The rooms are ok. Not much facilities in the room. Power bill, Water bill extra, limited internet, even washing clothes is limited to 5kg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.01553', 1, 66, 4),
(395, '[Prathmesh Nishane] Great experience, better than a 1bhk in Bangalore, great service by the RC Bhawani.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.015649', 4, 66, 4),
(396, '[Sahil Kushwaha] Wifi stays stable most of the time and cleaning happens as scheduled. The app system for tickets saves a lot of trouble with staff coordination.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.015859', 5, 66, 4),
(397, U&'[Mohidh K M] Worst PG experience ever in my life.nWhen I moved to Bangalore for the first time, I chose this PG to stay in, but the experience was horrible. The so-called \201cday-to-day\201d room cleaning is a joke. Even if you request it, it won\2019t be done on time.nnYou have to pay the electricity (EB) and water bills separately, but the EB charges are not transparent at all. They will charge you more than \20b91,200 without providing any bill or meter reading. If you ask for details, the resident captain will simply say he doesn\2019t know anything and that it\2019s handled by the backend team.nnThe food quality was also bad on many occasions.nnThe worst part is the deposit refund. For various reasons, if you decide to leave the PG, don\2019t expect to get your deposit back on time. I vacated in the first week of April, and despite sending multiple emails and raising support tickets, I only got my refund after 4.5 months \2014 even though they are supposed to refund it within 45 days.nnSuch a terrible experience. I hope my review helps others make an informed decision before choosing this PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.016026', 1, 66, 4),
(398, U&'[Sudhakar Reddy] KR Elite PG is one of the best PGs in Whitefield, with all necessary facilities. The food is hygienic and tasty, and the management is very supportive with quick service whenever needed. It also provides 24/7 water, Wi-Fi, and a gym.nnMost importantly, it\2019s budget-friendly and choice for anyone looking for a PG in Whitefield. Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.037652', 5, 67, 4),
(399, '[Kevin Joe Harris S] I have been staying her in this PG for a couple of months and i would say it is one of good experience staying here. The food here is really good with 2 days non veg and 1 day egg. The rooms are compact and great. Every room has a seperate TV and every floor has separate 5G wifi. It has small parking facility for bikes. The rooms are cleaned 3 days once and service is also great. Each floor also has separate fridge where we can store our things. It''s great for price.nnCons are Idly they are cooking using plastic sheet which is not healthy. Sometimes we mmget water issue but that''s common the whole prashanth layout.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.037826', 4, 67, 4);        
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(400, '[Riyan Sharma] Best PG in Whitefield are with best facilities like hygiene food, ambience, washing machine, fridge, GYM and other. Most important thing is friendly management gives u quick response. You get it all at low price.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.03795', 5, 67, 4),
(401, '[Prasad M] KG Elite PG offers decent accommodations with good food options and regular cleaning. Overall, it''s a comfortable place to stay with satisfactory hygiene standards. The fees are reasonable for the facilities provided, making it a good value for money, especially for students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.03823', 5, 67, 4),
(402, U&'[Mohit Ldg] I\2019ve been staying at KR Elite PG for about a year, and my overall experience has been excellent. The PG is clean, well-organized, and provides all the necessary facilities for a comfortable stay.nnThe food is tasty and hygienic, water is available 24/7 (both hot and cold), and there\2019s also high-speed Wi-Fi and a proper gym for fitness. What I really appreciate is the management\2019s quick response and supportive attitude, which makes life here hassle-free.nnIf you are searching for a safe, reliable, and convenient PG in Whitefield, I would definitely recommend KR Elite PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.038396', 5, 67, 4),
(403, '[murali ani] I have been a resident at KR Elite PG for the past year, and my stay has been nothing short of wonderful. It truly stands out as one of the finest PGs in this locality.nnThe food served here is always clean, fresh, and delicious. They offer excellent facilities such as round-the-clock hot and cold water supply, reliable Wi-Fi, and a well-maintained gym. The management team is very supportive and always responds quickly', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.038585', 5, 67, 4),
(404, '[Kalurawal Rawal] KR Elite PG is one of the top choices in Whitefield. The food is clean and tasty, rooms are well-maintained, and facilities like 24/7 water, Wi-Fi, and gym make the stay very comfortable. The management is also very responsive. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.038705', 5, 67, 4),
(405, '[Kandlagunta Venkateswarlu] KR Elite PG in Whitefield is clean, budget-friendly, and well-managed. The food is hygienic, facilities like Wi-Fi, 24/7 water, and gym are excellent, and the management provides quick support. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.038821', 5, 67, 4),
(406, U&'[Madhu Sudhan] Nice pg ..\+01f642nFeels like home stay ..\+01f3e0nIt is good for who are staying near to Whitefield..nFood quality is superb as more than you expected...\+01f374\+01f35dnI strongly suggest to everyone ...\+01f44d\+01f44dnComing to cost compared other here it is low cost..\+01faab\+01faab', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.081301', 5, 69, 4),
(407, '[KALAPPA HEBBAL] Rent is affordable price, Homely food,  owner is nice person, Best PG in white field, it''s near to Hopeform metro station and Bus stand ( walkable distance from Hope form signal, strongly recommended for Gents accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.08151', 5, 69, 4),
(408, '[Iam Siddu] Very good pg...with low price and high quality food and accommodation', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.081631', 5, 69, 4),
(409, U&'[Artatatrana Pradhan] Looking for a Good Boys'' PG in Whitefield, BangalorennIf you''re new to Bangalore and searching for a comfortable and affordable place to stay, in Whitefield is a great option! It offers:nnClean, spacious rooms with all basic amenitiesnnTasty and hygienic food (North u0026 South Indian options)nnBudget-friendly prices \2013 perfect for students and working professionalsnnSafe and friendly environment', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.081744', 5, 69, 4),
(410, '[Divyansh Singh] Good foodnGood placenGood vibenGood ownern0 complaints', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.081888', 5, 69, 4),
(411, '[K Sivaiah] Its near to hope farm signal walkable distansce, Homely food,   Owner Devarajulu  Naidu Uncle is  A Humble u0026 Gentle Person , Always Take Care Each and every Person . Iam A Retired Soldier From Tirupati Presently Staying Here On Bussiness Purpose, washing machine, wifi, silar water heater facilities available, well maintianing rooms. I strongly recmanded for Gents.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.081995', 5, 69, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(412, U&'[Revanth Chowdary] I am staying this \+01f6ccPG food is very good and tasty \+01f35blow cost  living and good facilities simply excellent reasonable price.and Ankul response u0026 Respect is very very good \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.082211', 5, 69, 4),
(413, '[Avinash Prince] Good pg and food quality is good  room cleaning any time', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.082328', 5, 69, 4),
(414, '[lakshmi durga] It''s good for all languages people better than other PG s', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.102286', 4, 70, 4),
(415, U&'[Gautam Gariya] Very Disappointed with This PG and Its CaretakernnI am extremely disappointed with the condition of this PG and the overall experience here. The food quality is terrible \2014 they often serve old food, and on several occasions, I\2019ve found insects and dirt in it. It''s really unhygienic and unsafe to eat.nnWhat makes things worse is the attitude of the caretaker. Instead of listening to the residents'' complaints, especially regarding the food, he gets aggressive and starts fighting with those who raise concerns. This kind of behavior is unacceptable and makes staying here very uncomfortable.nnI would not recommend this PG to anyone looking for a decent and hygienic place to stay. There are much better options available', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.102413', 1, 70, 4),
(416, '[Toulik Chakraborty] The food is terrible and inedible. In fact, it is damaging the reputation of South Indian cuisine. In this PG, people from South India have started complaining about the quality of the food.People from North India can''t stay even a single day due to the poor food quality. Additionally, this PG lacks a backup power supply. Today, there was a power cut for almost three hours, and this happens every day. Think twice before joining this PG!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.102584', 1, 70, 4),
(417, '[Bhaktvatsal Thakur] Good and Spacious PG. Bathroom is good and big as compared to the other PG''s I have looked.nThey give decent response to the problems if any faced by us and take quick action. Owner is quite respectful and well mannered. Just food is the issue otherwise it''s great', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.102691', 5, 70, 4),
(418, U&'[Ravan Maharaj] Disappointing Experience \2013 Not Worth the PricennI had a really unpleasant experience staying at this PG. The rooms were not as clean as advertised, with dust and cobwebs in the corners. The washrooms were poorly maintained, and hot water was often unavailable. Basic amenities like Wi-Fi were unreliable, and the common areas were not properly cleaned.nnThe management was unresponsive to complaints and didn''t seem interested in resolving issues. Despite paying a premium rent, the facilities and services were subpar. The food quality was also disappointing \2013 often cold and lacking variety.nnOverall, I would not recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable and hassle-free stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.103008', 1, 70, 4),
(419, '[Cinephile''s Corner] Bad food and PG caretaker is just a big fraud. This kind of food we are giving to our dogs, stones are there in the food and insects swimming in the curry and water. Mixing soda in rice and providing bad facilities to the customers , I am very disappointed with this PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.103167', 1, 70, 4),
(420, '[Sue 3002] Bathroom is spacious compared to most PGs. Room is big but the food is not good. My roomate got food poisoning twice in 1 month. The management has fast responses in assisting with any problems.nnWater problems every day. Hot water is a rare occurrence.nnFridge is not maintained. Common fridge for 5 floors with stinky rotting smell.nnMaintenance also is not done properly. They will come clean the room in like 3 minutes and leave.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.103282', 2, 70, 4),
(421, '[NG ANUWAR FF] Well maintained pg rooms are very spacious good parking food also very descent pg taker also good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.10366', 5, 70, 4),
(422, '[Kalakoti Sai] I joined last week it''s a like home pg for  and for gents it''s a awesome pg and  also available especially cafeteria superb and come to food section and food menu good weekly two times non veg and weekly two times you will get over all nice pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.12375', 5, 71, 4);     
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(423, U&'[Siddheshwara E Doddahatti] Poor quality food u0026 no hygienicnBut after the ownership everything became the worst. There is no respect for tenants at all. The new owners are very rude, money-minded, and talk in a disrespectful way.nThey don\2019t care about safety or comfort, only about collecting rent.nEven if you inform them about vacating,time advance nt giving they threaten and speak badly instead of understanding.nThey show favoritism and make you feel uncomfortable staying here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.123861', 1, 71, 4),
(424, '[Sandeep Barnwal] Affordable rooms available with better n hygiene foods. Total of 3 times food is there. Having availability of common TV n freezer at the open kitchen. And, open kitchen is available for all guests, anyone can prepare their own food facility is there.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.12406', 5, 71, 4),
(425, '[Anil Kumar] I am staying here since last 1 year you will get completely friendly environment and home atmosphere completely satisfied here food and maintenance very good in this pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.12418', 5, 71, 4),
(426, '[karthik reddy] Here I am staying last 6 months food and maintenance very good in this compared to other pgs this was awesome rooms are big completely satisfied in this pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.12428', 5, 71, 4),
(427, U&'[HariSh N] Nice PG with clean rooms and good maintenance. Owne responsive idare. Safe and comfortable stay \+01f44d\201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.124376', 5, 71, 4),
(428, '[V Madhan] In this especially food and maintenance very good in this pg rooms are big rooms here for all sharing this is good pg with reasonable price i recommended this pg who ever looking Whitefield', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.124479', 5, 71, 4),
(429, U&'[akshay achari] My Honest Review of Charan PGnnThe overall experience has been good so far.nThe Wi-Fi is decent and works well most of the time, which is helpful for both work and entertainment.nFood is better than what I expected from a PG\2014it''s simple, homemade-style, and usually served on time.nThe facilities like regular cleaning,  and basic maintenance are taken care of properly.nEach person gets a locker, so there''s no worry about keeping valuables safe.nHot water is available, which is definitely a must, especially in the mornings.nIn my opinion, it\2019s a nice place to stay\2014nothing too fancy, but definitely comfortable and reliable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.124603', 4, 71, 4),
(430, U&'[Nimesh Jaiswal] \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50nHad a great experience at Medan House, Bangalore. The rooms are clean and well-maintained, housekeeping is regular, and the staff is polite and supportive. The food is good, amenities are well managed, and any issues are resolved quickly. Overall, it''s a safe, comfortable, and well-organized place for students and working professionals. Highly recommended! \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.14454', 5, 72, 4),
(431, '[Joshi vishal] These people will keep charging money. While exit there was random charge of 650 and they return deposit almost 2 months after exit. I am still not able to find why 650 was deducted.nnEvery thing is managed by app and you will not see any person to talk on case of issues.nnFor 3 months there was no RC. And they don''t have any back up. All directed me to some one called Jyoti and this guy jyoti never responded.nnHot water may work on 2-3 days a week.nThey will keep deducting money for random electricity charges, they charge 1200 for lpg hike without any justification on back up for charges.nnOverall look for other options this is not the good one.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.144673', 1, 72, 4),
(432, '[Dhanya Samani] I am staying here since past one year initially things were good but from last one year things are getting worse no proper power back up, no hot water no biometric system in the pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.144775', 1, 72, 4),
(433, U&'[Akash Reang] I\2019ve been staying at Stanza Living Medan for a few months now, and my experience has been really good. The rooms are clean and well-maintained, and the staff is friendly and always ready to help. The food quality is decent, with a good variety in the menu. What I like most is their quick response whenever we raise any issue or request. It really feels safe and comfortable here \2014 perfect for students or working professionals looking for a homely environment with all facilities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.144882', 5, 72, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(434, U&'[Nitiesh Kumar Adigarla] Stanzas are good colives in Bangalore, but the food is mostly north Indian, me as pure south indian, I skips some of the meals when I don''t want to wet my tongue with that dishes, all stanzas are similar mostly, good common spaces for work from home people are available too \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.145026', 3, 72, 4),
(435, '[BlurryMind] Good staff interaction. The staff and RCs are always approachable and professional. Overall, happy with the management here. Shrikant is proactive and makes sure issues are resolved quickly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.14536', 5, 72, 4),
(436, U&'[Yash Agrawal] Worst experience ever. Rooms are tiny, dirty, and poorly ventilated, with no TV, or proper cupboard. Hygiene is pathetic\2014cockroaches, no daily cleaning, costly laundry, and frequent geyser problems. Food is always short, often stale, served late, or brought chilled from far away. Electricity bills are manipulated, internet is unreliable, and there\2019s no vehicle parking or security. Doors can\2019t even be locked properly from inside.nnThe so-called Resident Captain is useless\2014always in his room, stops replying once their sales pitch is done, and provides no support. For the high charges they demand, this place is a scam and a nightmare to live in. Stay far away', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.145546', 1, 72, 4),
(437, '[Chandan M] Just a bunch of time killing people. especially tushar. the backend team of stanzaliving says one price 8000 rent + 5000 deposit, on call tushar said one price 9000 rent. Agreeing for that I come to the location, another price 10200 by manager. on top of that water 800 and electricity 200. Time killing people. Useless fellows, U keeps what every the price, I am least bothered. Its left to the people to accept. But DON''T make people roam here and there saying different price. So that we can decide whether to visit or not to save our time. BE GENUINE ON CALL ITSELF.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.145697', 1, 72, 4),
(438, '[Avinash Kacham] Good PG, Rooms are spacious and food quality is good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.189847', 5, 74, 4),
(439, U&'[Chenchu Reddy] I am staying in this PG in Bangalore and I really like it. The place is well maintained with good cleaning, the rooms are spacious and comfortable, and the food is also good. A great option for anyone looking for a nice stay  \+01f607', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.189982', 5, 74, 4),
(440, U&'[Pradeep] Writing this review after staying in this PG for 5 months. The PG is okay but not exceptional as mentioned by other older reviews present here.nnThe PG is basically an apartment with 2 BHK flats. In each flat, there is 1 triple sharing room, 1 double sharing room and 1 single sharing room (kitchen is converted to a room) and 1 person is allocated the hall. The rent is \20b97k for 3 sharing, \20b99k for 2 sharing, \20b98k for 1 sharing, \20b96k for staying in the hall. Advance amount is \20b93k and \20b92k will be returned if we inform 2-3 weeks before leaving.nnI will list the pros and cons regarding each aspect. Hope this review helps someone in the future.nnThe owner''s family lives in the PG itself and friendly, but there''s no quick resolution of issues. I asked them to clean the water filter in each floor several times but no action till now. There are bed bugs literally everywhere, on the bed, in the sofa, on the clothes hanging. Asked the owner to do something about it, but no action till now. Everyone in the PG has bed bugs issue. So, beware before coming here.nnWashroom:n\274c The common washroom in the hall is shared by 5 persons which is highly inconvenient. I don''t know why the common hall is given to another person. I felt inconvenient, unable to use the common halln\2705 The 2 sharing room has an attached washroom which is good and only 2 persons use itnnSofa in Hall:n\274c There''s a sofa in the hall which is full of sand and dust, making it dirty to use. There are also bed bugs in the sofannFood:n\2705 Breakfast is good. Has dosa, idli, poha, chapathi, upma, uthappam etc. But the chutney is always watery.n\274c There is only dal and rice for lunch, which is not all nutricious and boring to eat everydayn\2705 Dinner is okay. Chicken is served on Sundays. The taste is good.nnLift:n\274c Lift is slow and can only carry 4 persons maximum.n\274c The lift is switched off at around 10:15 PM, so, one should climb 4 floors of steps if they are late. I used to live in another PG at BTM. The lift was operational 24/7. So, I don''t understand why one has switch off the lift at nightnnWifi:n\2705 The internet is good and little to no issues with itn\274c If I close the door of my room, my mobile can''t connect to the Wifi, because the router is not powerful enough. Also, it''s not dual band router. It''s only 2.4 Ghz routernnMobile network:n\2705 Jio u0026 BSNL is good. Airtel has poor network here. Don''t know about VinnGeyser:n\2705 There''s a geyser in every bathroom. So, hot water is not a problemnnPower backup:n\2705 Power back is okaynnCleaning:n\2705 Cleaning is done everyday. So, it''s not a problemnnOther points:n\274c There''s a big empty land filled with trash, plastic bags, dirty sewer water (from this PG and other buildings I guess) etc. Sometimes stinks and the stink reaches the dining area at the ground floor, which makes it uncomfortable to eat there. So, have to bring the food up in a plate and eat in the roomnn\274c There is no proper wet and dry waste segregation implemented in the PG strictly. The people living in the PG throw dry waste in the food bin. Saw cooks in the PG throwing waste into the empty land behind the PG. The owner doesn''t care about the waste segregation at allnn\274c No fans in the dining area at the ground floornnOverall, the amenities can be improved for the amount they are charging is what I felt', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.190188', 3, 74, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(441, '[Phanindra G] Reasonably priced in the locality. Corridors are spacious unlike other PGs. Total 4 floors and 2bhk flats 6 on each floor. Fridge and drinking water available on almost each floor. Enough parking place inside and outside building. Surprisingly Lift, Washing machines and Geysers work all time. Rooms are well maintained. Private balcony for single stay. Near to main road but away from traffic noise. Basic food is provided. Self cooking facility available. Eateries and breweries are near by. Waste water can be managed better with water pits rather leaving in open behind the building. Owners Ravi and family talk reasonably most of the times. Leo, the black dog is an additional attraction. Totally worth the money.nAs on Aug,2022.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.190339', 4, 74, 4),
(442, '[ARSHAD BAIG] Nice PG and PG owner Ravi bro is really good and friendly guy. They provide good and hygienic food three days everyday and power backup facility is also available. Only drawback is backside of this PG stinks because of all the garbage and filthy water and power cuts are frequent.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.190462', 4, 74, 4),
(443, U&'[Adhish] Honestly the best PG in Sarjapur road. It''s very cheap and the facilities you get here are top notch from the rooms to all the aminities they offer, it feels like home. The PG manager is very friendly and caring. And even the tenants here are wholesome.nFood is okish, It reminds me of college hostel days \+01f602, but they have given a place where you can cook yourself whenever you want.nMajor pros: They''ve turned an apartment building into a PG. Unlike other PGs where it''s like hotel rooms and no space to walk, here you have a complete home with hall and balcony, the view from the terrace is also \+01f525. The price is also very cheap, literally the best in the area. For all the facilities they offer, they could charge more but they actually charge very less than those room type PGs.nnAdded surprise, they have a cute pet dog named Leo, he''s very wholesome and cute \+01f970.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.190607', 5, 74, 4),
(444, '[Sampreet Gupta] Nice PG, 3 times food. Neat and clean. Fridge, Washing machine, geyser, TV, Lift, internet available.nEach flat has a common area with sofa set and TV. Liked my stay here. Value for money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.190733', 4, 74, 4),
(445, '[Madesh Manthesh] This is the worst PG I have never seen, food is very very bad and owner is very impolite person. I been there for 1.5 years it was a very very worst situation. Please don''t refer the other reviews. They expect more money but dont provide any facilities and rooms are very congested and less maintenance. If you ask anything they will reply that no one asks you are only one person asking.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.190853', 1, 74, 4),
(446, '[praveen kumar] This is one of the best PG i lived in and let me share my genuine experience.nPG owner(Ramesh) is very humble and polite and ready to support all the time. Charges are economical. Food is good and especially they won''t compromise on hygiene.nRooms are well ventilated, neat and tidy.n24 hrs internet and water supply with soft water and RO facility.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.213339', 5, 75, 4),
(447, '[Mani Sankar] The rooms are conjusted. Actually for  2 people it is the best. Near the amrita University it''s the best price for pg. I took the top room of pg which have terrace and it''s the best room overall. Good sunlight. The food is awesome. Provides chicken for 2 times in a week. Sometimes I had  to adjust. For 7k don''t expect more.nBest tiffin : puri', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.213671', 4, 75, 4),
(448, '[Imthiyaz Imthu] Best pg ,owner is humble person and also food is very good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.213898', 5, 75, 4),
(449, '[Teenpatti apps] One of the worst pg i have ever seen , the food is like garbage its better to eat garbage that having food from here , and no power backup , it will be like for hours and hours no power back up at all , and room is like chicken shed , he will stuff 3 or 4 people in one small room horrible and my 1 apple mac book air went missing from this pg , guys stay away from this looters', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.21402', 1, 75, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(450, '[Raja Rao] One of the worse pg around the area , in one small room he will stuff around 3 people , believe me its suffocating inside room , no power back up, it will work for 2 mins then no backup, and food is   horrible horrible horrible , stay away.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.214307', 1, 75, 4),
(451, '[Nagesh Panchal] Crazy gomes pg food is good and testy all ok', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.214425', 5, 75, 4),
(452, U&'[lighter debbarma] Bohot atsha hai rom and food very goodnExcellent \+01f44c\+01f44c\+01f44c\+01f44c\+01f44c crazy pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.214551', 5, 75, 4),
(453, '[MN Karpaswamy] Nice rooms nice food roomer very clean and neat', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.214684', 5, 75, 4),
(454, '[Kisna Sarma] I have been staying at Zolo for the past month, and my experience has been mostly positive. The rooms are clean and furnished, making it easy to move in without much hassle. The staff has been cooperative and responsive whenever I''ve needed assistance.nnThe location is convenient, and the overall environment feels safe and comfortable. The maintenance is generally good, though there is still room for improvement in areas like housekeeping consistency and response time for minor issues.nnOverall, Zolo is a good option for students and working professionals looking for a hassle-free, ready-to-move-in accommodation. My first month has been a pleasant experience, and I would recommend it to others while hoping they continue improving their services.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.236249', 5, 76, 4),
(455, '[ananthan calamur] My experience at Zolo High Street, Electronic City was very disappointing. The property is not maintained well, and cleanliness is a major concern. Basic facilities like washing machines and hot water often don''t work properly. Complaints receive little attention, making it frustrating for residents. The rooms are cramped, food quality is average, and the rent is much higher than what the facilities justify. Overall, not worth the money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.236482', 1, 76, 4),
(456, '[Anjan gorai] Don''t go to zolo if you aren''t planning for atleast 1 year. Huge list of internal unnecessary charges . Good thing was they informed me all kinds of charges before hand. Overall rooms are decent. But you will find better options!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.23662', 3, 76, 4),
(457, '[Kanxi Mo] I stayed at Zolo PG for a week and had a great experience. The rooms were clean and well-maintained, the facilities were good, and the staff was helpful and friendly. The food was decent, and the overall environment felt safe and comfortable. The location was convenient, and any issues were resolved quickly. I would definitely recommend Zolo PG to students and working professionals looking for a comfortable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.236724', 5, 76, 4),
(458, '[Saurabh Sinha] Zolo High StreetnNice PG. Staff is good and cooperative.nFood is average little spicy in canteen. I prefer less spice may be due to that.nMost of delivery app works here for food delivery.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.236838', 4, 76, 4),
(459, '[vikram kumar] The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and comfortable. The staff is polite and always ready to help. Highly recommended for students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.236938', 5, 76, 4),
(460, '[Brajesh Kumar Singh] I am staying from a week or 2. It''s good as of now. Specially the staffs are good and kind. Rooms are little compact and small. But it''s ok to manage.nnFoods, laundary, cleaning included.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.237033', 4, 76, 4),
(461, '[Hitendra Singh] Great place to live in banglore as it is very cost effective and great surrounding and environment with lots of amenities nearby. Only have one thing the food can be better rest it is perfect for living in banglore.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.237143', 4, 76, 4),
(462, U&'[Shashwat Pandey] This is honestly one of the best PGs you\2019ll find in Bangalore. I haven\2019t come across anything else at this price point that offers this kind of space and comfort.nThe manager is friendly and helpful, and the stay itself is very comfortable. At just \20b98,000 for double sharing, it\2019s quite affordable\2014especially considering how spacious the rooms are. Unlike many other PGs where rooms feel cramped and suffocating, this place feels open and livable.nThe surroundings are peaceful and serene\2014you\2019ll often hear birds and even peacocks, which adds to the overall vibe.nFood is decent, nothing exceptional, but the good part is that you have the option to cook your own meals.nThe only downside is that you\2019ll need to walk about 1 km for basic necessities. However, this isn\2019t a major issue if you have a vehicle.nOverall, I\2019d strongly recommend this place. Spacious rooms at this price are extremely rare in Bangalore\2014you won\2019t easily find something comparable. I''ve added pictures of the road that leads to the pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.25902', 5, 77, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(463, U&'[Aromal P] I stayed at Green Garden Co-Live PG, and my experience was extremely disappointing. The manager\2019s behavior was very rude and unprofessional, which made the stay uncomfortable.nnThe food quality was very poor, far below what was shown or promised. The pictures online were completely misleading \2014 the actual place looked nothing like them. The surroundings felt badly maintained, with overgrown areas that made the place look like a forest.nnThe most worrying part was the lack of hygiene and safety. The water was muddy and not suitable for daily use. On top of that, the environment felt unsafe, and I even saw snakes in the surroundings, which was very frightening.nnOverall, this PG needs major improvement in management, cleanliness, water quality, and safety. I would not recommend this place to anyone.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.25918', 1, 77, 4),
(464, '[Revansidh Ningdalli] Extremely bad experience staying at this PG. The hygiene standards are unacceptable. I found insects in my food twice and even cockroaches in my food on two occasions. This is a serious health concern.nDespite showing the issue to the manager, no proper action was taken, and the problem repeated again.nRooms and washrooms are not cleaned properly. The washroom walls have green fungus, and the overall maintenance is very poor. Even the washroom door is damaged, with broken pieces sticking out, which is unsafe.nI have photographic evidence of all these issues. This clearly shows negligence from the management.nI strongly request the management to take strict and immediate action to fix hygiene, cleanliness, and maintenance issues. Until then, I would not recommend this PG to anyone.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.259317', 1, 77, 4),
(465, '[Pavan Kumar] Great stay! The rooms are clean, WiFi speed is good and the food tastes like home. The management team is responsive and the environment feels safe. Highly recommend this co-living PG for working professionals and students', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.259434', 5, 77, 4),
(466, '[Mahesh Varadhi] Very reasonable prices for double and triple sharings.The building was an old and renovated. The rooms are very spacious with attached separate bathroom,toilet and wash basin.(we have found some cockroaches inside of it.Personal Wifi router will be provided to each room. CC camera surveillance.No lift. Only steps you have to choose for any floor.nFood is Fabulous, Awesome and excellent but it''s only 2 days in  weekdays 3 times in weekends and holidays. Hot water is available don''t know when wil stop. No fridge is available. Some youngs used to make dinning hall dirty always they wil open and remain  the lids on rice and curries.No power backup. One day night suffocated with mosquitos.Old infrastructure at room''s.nFriendly Owner and polite staff will listening all your uncomforts.nDaily room cleaning is available.3 Washing Machines available but there is no proper place to dry our clothes.nBadminton court along with rockets and cocks available , a small gym instruments like treadmill, dumbels,rods, plates and  bench instrument and tabel tennis. Due to health issues we left from here.nLocation is surrounded with greenery atmosphere but if it  rains  you can''t even put your leg outside of pg. The road will be blocked with the water no Ola,Ubercabs,online food deliver wil be come. You can find the attached image at the main gate opening.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.259587', 3, 77, 4),
(467, '[Reetu Kamboj] I was living here from  almost 2 years and its the best time of my life . I love nature and this place is literally feels like a resort from outside . Such a lovely and soothing place . Food is good and environment is so peaceful and lovely all the time. Best part the room are so big that you can make it  one RK very easily. Spacious area in room, parking, all over pg .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.259771', 5, 77, 4),
(468, '[Gursewak singh] Homely experience, manager is good and cooperative. Feels natural', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.259885', 5, 77, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(469, '[Amal B Paramban] The setting is fantastic, and the space is large. There is still plenty of room in the room if three people are sharing it. In terms of eating, everything depends on personal preference. It works for me. I won''t say excellent. But it''s important to mention the manager''s and other employees'' assistance.nI can summarize the PG as a reasonably priced, roomy residence.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.259998', 4, 77, 4),
(470, U&'[JAI] I moved into this PG looking for a simple, clean place to stay, and it turned out to be just that neat rooms, a good location, and a peaceful environment. What makes it truly special is the owner, Mr. Hafeez Khan. He is kind, approachable, and treats everyone like family, which is rare in this business. With his support and the well-maintained setup, living here feels safe and comfortable.if  you\2019re looking for a reliable PG in this area, this is the right place. You can opt for it without second thoughts.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.281779', 5, 78, 4),
(471, '[Varun Varu] I had a very good experience staying in this PG. The facilities are excellent and well maintained. The rooms are clean, hygienic, and comfortable, which makes it a great place to stay. Cleanliness is given top priority, and the overall environment is peaceful and safe.nA special mention to Owner Hafizulla Khan Sir, who is very supportive, respectful, and always ready to help. He ensures that everything runs smoothly and takes good care of the residents.nI highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a clean, hygienic, and well-managed place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.28192', 5, 78, 4),
(472, U&'[Arka Nath Roy] Mr. Hafeezulla Khan, the PG owner, is such a kind-hearted \+01f64f\+01f3fc and welcoming person!nHe regularly monitors the well-being of his tenants while maintaining the hygiene of the PG \2728 and the security \+01f6e1\fe0f of their belongings.nThe rooms \+01f3e0 are spacious and well-maintained.nThere are several tenants who have lived here for over a year, which truly reflects the great culture that Mr. Hafeezulla maintains \+01f31f \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.282048', 5, 78, 4),
(473, U&'[Guru Murugan] I got a job in Bengaluru. As I am new here, I don\2019t know anyone. After joining the office, I met my colleague Murali and asked him to help me find a place to stay. He checked for vacancy in his PG, but unfortunately there was no vacancy in the central PG for men.nThen he spoke to the owner, Mr. Hafeez Khan. Mr. Hafeez Khan kindly arranged a place for me in Murali\2019s room, as one person had gone to his hometown for 10 days. He allowed me to stay on the same bed for 10 days free of cost.nMr. Hafeez Khan is extremely kind and helpful. I have never seen such a helpful person before. I am very grateful and thankful to you, Mr. Hafeez Khan sir.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.282304', 5, 78, 4),
(474, U&'[Ahmed Khan] Central PG in Shanti Nagar is honestly one of the best PGs I\2019ve ever stayed in. The place is completely peaceful and truly feels like home.nnThe owner\2019s behaviour is unimaginable \+01f60a\+01f60a\2014 he\2019s an awesome person with a great personality. He helped me a lot when I shifted to Bangalore and even guided me on how to live and manage things here.nnIf you\2019re looking for a comfortable, safe, and homely PG, I strongly suggest choosing Central PG, Shanti Nagar, Bangalore. You won\2019t regret it! \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.282429', 5, 78, 4),
(475, '[Mohammed Sameer] Iam staying in this pg which is in the centre of city in Bengaluru.nThe owner of the pg ( Mr Hafeez khan) is very helpful and kind to each and every member living in the pg. He is very humble and makes u as a friend and he makes sure that there arises no problems for anyone living in the pg. He even took me for lunch on the first day i arrived.nThe pg is well maintained with daily cleaning is done. It feels like a home.nThe pg owner doesn''t take any deposits which is very helpful for most people unlike all the remaining all the PG''s which are in Bengaluru.nThere is no food option in this pg but food is accessible just below as there are hotels just below the pg and around the area too there are many hotels.nGo for this pg without any doubt It''s safe and comfortable one', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.282555', 5, 78, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(476, '[Sathish Kumar] I had a very good experience staying at this PG. The rooms are well-maintained, daily clean, and comfortable with all the necessary facilities. The environment is safe, the pg is have without food , but you have cooking option.nn24*7 public bus service available,nnWhat I appreciate most is the professionalism of the owner , the standard of service here is equally excellent. It shows that the owner truly values quality, comfort, just his like your friend, personally you need any supporting comfort ask to them.nnOverall, highly recommended for anyone looking for a reliable and comfortable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.282675', 5, 78, 4),
(477, '[Harikrishnan. D ckhss] One of the best pg among bangalore The owner is very friendly, cooperative, and always ready to help whenever needed. Their supportive nature makes the place feel more like home rather than just a rental.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.282792', 5, 78, 4),
(478, '[Saju Jose] I, Saju Jose, Placement Head at Krupanidhi College, I am currently staying at New Kairali PG, Carmelaram, near RGA Tech Park. I am happy to share that this is a very well-managed PG run by Malayali members, offering tasty and homely Malayali food.nnThe PG has neat and comfortable rooms at affordable prices and treats every resident like family. Facilities include Wi-Fi, washing machine, hot water, TV, and excellent hospitality. Single and double rooms are available on monthly and daily rent basis, with special packages for students.nnThe location is calm and peaceful, with easy bus connectivity. Temples and churches are very close by. Overall, the rent is reasonable and the stay is highly comfortable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.309447', 5, 79, 4),
(479, U&'[Amrithesh T S] Had a really good experience. The rooms are neat and comfortable, the food is tasty and homely, and the overall atmosphere is peaceful. A good place for students and working professionals looking for a comfortable stay in Bangalore. Highly recommended! \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.309646', 5, 79, 4),
(480, '[Appu Jithin] Super. Food.  Good owner.  Very good.  Staff support.   Super. Fish. Curry.  Sambar.  Morning. Evening.  Live. Food.  Super.  Super. Food.  Daily. Papad.  Salad.  Rasam.  Thoran.  Daal. Curry.  Thalassery.  Style.   Chicken curry.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.309797', 5, 79, 4),
(481, '[Aswin G Nair] One of the best PGs I have stayed so far. Both the staffs and tenants are very friendly, decent and timely food with proper amenities. Good choice for Keralites and Tamilians.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.309908', 5, 79, 4),
(482, '[S R Sheety Shafeera] Bangalore Paying Guests is one of the best paying guest Karali PG because food and hygiene is excellent  in Sarjapur Road near Kodathi Gate, those who are looking for paying guest near Sarjapur and Bellandur should try it, the owners are very excellent in support, help and money problems also, here paying guests are not taken care of, here self are treated like family members of the house really try it, I am a retired CRPF soldier like to share my experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.310185', 5, 79, 4),
(483, '[Mohamed Ameerkhan K] The PG situated backside to RGA tech park, walkable distance to Carmelaram bus stand, DMart Carmelaram and Carmelaram Railway stationnnManoj Chettan and his family maintaining the PG neat and cleannnKerala food 3 times with superb tastennI would highly recommend the PG for staying', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.310302', 5, 79, 4),
(484, '[SUJITH vk] Kairali PG is an excellent place to stay! The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and comfortable, providing a homely environment that makes long-term stays easy. The management is friendly, responsive, and always willing to help with any concerns.nnThe food is tasty and hygienic, with a variety that feels just like home-cooked meals. The PG is located in a convenient area, making daily commute simple and hassle-free. Facilities like Wi-Fi, Hot water  ensuring  pleasant stay.nnOverall, Kairali PG offers great value for money and a peaceful living experience. Highly recommended for malayali  students and working professionals!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.310402', 5, 79, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(485, '[Nandu] One   of the   best  pg   in   sarjapur  road   very   good owner   staff   support   too much   good   three times   very   hot   food    homely   feeling   only . good tenants and roommates', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.310545', 5, 79, 4),
(486, U&'[Yuvraj Singh Amyore] Goodwill Coliving PG is one of the best budget-friendly accommodations in the area. The rooms are spacious, clean, and well-maintained, offering a very comfortable stay for students and working professionals alike. The PG also has a gym and a dedicated playing area, which makes it a great place to relax and stay active after a long day.nnA special mention goes to Mr. Vishal, the manager \2014 he\2019s truly exceptional. Vishal ensures that every resident feels at home. He\2019s always helpful, approachable, and quick to resolve any issue. His friendly nature and professional attitude make a huge difference in creating a positive living experience.nnIf you\2019re looking for an affordable, well-managed, and comfortable PG near Narayana E Techno School, Goodwill Coliving is the perfect choice!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.361022', 5, 81, 4),
(487, '[sumanth reddy] Rooms are neat with good facilities but Food quality is very bad and no hygiene is maintained in the dining area and kitchen.nAlso, owner is rude and doesn''t have basic sense in dealing with people.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.361167', 2, 81, 4),
(488, '[Harsha Reddy] Food is Okay.Washing machines are having always trouble.Spacious rooms.cleaning maintenance is good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.361296', 3, 81, 4),
(489, '[Just] worst food taste , total dirty mess, irresponsible mess ownerndirty and slow drinking waternwifi network issue every daynwashing machine do not work properlynlift does not work. it malfunction every 3 days', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.361442', 1, 81, 4),
(490, U&'[Archishman Das] I had a good experience staying at this PG. The food is of good quality, the stay is comfortable, and all essential amenities are well taken care of \2014 including an attached bathroom with a geyser and even a fridge in the room. If you ever need any assistance, Mahesh and Sunil are the go-to person \2014 they are always helpful and responsive. Overall, it\2019s a good option for anyone looking for a peaceful and convenient stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.361562', 4, 81, 4),
(491, '[SAMEER AKHTAR] To the owner of Good will Stop putting your wet waste backside of pg, it smelling so bad for mathura Sapthagiri Apartment residents', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.361683', 1, 81, 4),
(492, U&'[Sahil Mohurale] \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50nI had a great experience staying at this PG! The rooms were clean, well-maintained, and ventilated. The staff was friendly and always ready to help. The food quality was better than expected, with hygienic, home-style meals served on time.nnWi-Fi, RO water, regular housekeeping, and laundry services were provided without hassle.nnI highly recommend this PG to students and working professionals looking for a clean, safe, and peaceful place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.361805', 5, 81, 4),
(493, U&'[Jaya M] This PG is terrible. The food quality is poor, and the hygiene standards are unacceptable. The owner behaves horribly\2014especially toward girls and has even threatened physical violence. He frequently argues with tenants and abruptly tells them to vacate without reason. Additionally, basic amenities like electricity, Wi-Fi, and hot water are extremely unreliable. Worst PG experience ever\2014avoid at all costs', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.362019', 1, 81, 4),
(494, '[Dobariya Dobariya] It was a very bad experience staying here. Cleaning was not done properly, and hygiene standards were poor. Cockroaches and honeybees were frequently entering the room, which is unacceptable. Water frequently runs out and is not available in the bathroom, especially in the mornings. Bedsheets and pillow covers were not changed regularly. The food quality and taste were extremely poor. Overall, the stay did not meet basic living and hygiene standards.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.387856', 1, 82, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(495, U&'[Nidhi Parmar] My experience living here was extremely disturbing and unsafe. During my stay, I was physically molested by a worker associated with the property. I reported the incident to the management team expecting support and immediate action.nnUnfortunately, my complaint was not handled with the seriousness it deserved. The property manager, Rajamani, was dismissive and did not provide any meaningful help after the incident.Neither they did nor they even let me take legal actionsnnResident safety should be the top priority in any property, but based on my experience, I cannot recommend this place\2014especially for women or anyone concerned about safety.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.387989', 1, 82, 4),
(496, '[Aarushi Nand] Rooms are nice and well maintained. Issues with the bathroom but got resolved within 5 days. Watch out for extra charges while entering and exiting.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.388122', 3, 82, 4),
(497, '[Ashish] It''s not well maintained, bathroom is very dirty, no light in the corridor or in terrace from evening,the certain and the bedsheets are too dirty , overall dirty experience, I''ll not recommended this .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.38833', 1, 82, 4),
(498, '[Hn beauty Beauty] My stay at Zolo Marquis was very good. The property was clean and comfortable. The property manager, Jainal, was very helpful and polite. He solved any issues quickly and made the stay easy. I am happy with the service and would recommend it to others.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.388453', 5, 82, 4),
(499, '[Monika Chetry] Good property very calm area..supporty staffs spacious rooms service is also good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.388573', 5, 82, 4),
(500, '[Bryan Mascarenhas] This PG is excellent. Very well maintained, clean, good u0026 prompt service u0026 friendly staff. All requirements are nicely automated through their app.nnReasonable price. In good u0026 peaceful residential location. Independent u0026 no any restrictionsnnFree facilities such as WiFi, laundry service, gym, games, entertainment etc are available which are goodnnVegetarian breakfast u0026 dinner are provided daily. It is reasonably ok considering what we are payingnnThanks', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.38869', 5, 82, 4),
(501, '[Munna Official] Comfortable Stay at Zolo Marquis,I stay here for one month unfortunately I have to move out because I have to moved from bangalore to a new city.nPros-  Nice Property maintain well by the ground staff.nCleaning will be done in every alternative days.nFriendly and responsive staff.nCons -Food quality and quantity is not that good.nOverall I definitely recommend Zolo Marquis for it''s comfort and value.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.388808', 5, 82, 4),
(502, U&'[Hagemaru] Worst PG experience in Bellandur. They will take 2 months\2019 advance and when you will leave the PG, they will not return one month\2019s advance amount. Completely unprofessional and disappointing.nnAnother thing I noticed is that whenever someone posts a genuine negative review, the PG replies saying that person never stayed there. That is completely false and misleading.nnThe manager, Tuntun Singh, was extremely rude, unprofessional, and never listened to tenants\2019 concerns properly. His behaviour towards residents was very disrespectful. I seriously request the owner to change the manager if they want to improve this place.nnOverall, worst PG in the Bellandur area. Not recommended at all.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.464518', 1, 85, 4),
(503, '[Urmila Devi] Pros:n- Having Chair, table and spaciousn- Food is on time and oknCons:n- No sitting in food arean- Care taker (Property manager) takes too much time to resolve issues. I see multiple people arguing. Asking people to review 5 star to increase rating.n- Having only one fridge for 5 floors which having no space.nRest you can come and see.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.464651', 2, 85, 4),
(504, '[shivansh pandey] Although my stay was very brief I.e. one month. PG  experience is good. On daily basis room will gonna be clean. Food is also included in the rent and it includes breakfast lunch and dinner. WiFi is also there with good speed of connectivity. One will also have access to common washing machine to wash their clothes. Lift services and parking facility is also there.nnLocation wise this pg is also good. It is near to bus stand also places like embassy tech village and ecospace.nnMaintenance staff and owner are easily reachable if any problem related to pg arises. It will be quickly resolved.nnOverall 5 star in terms of services and staff wise.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.464775', 5, 85, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(505, '[Nilanjan Deb (Nil)] Very Good PG for staying in Bellandur. Closest to the Bellandur Central Bus stop.n1.  24*7  Internet.n2.  Very nice furniture. well suited for hybrid workn3. The Washing Machines are there.n4. You can get access to the terrace.n5. The owner is very good and helpful.nnI was staying for 3.5 Months here June 2023 to September 2023.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.464893', 5, 85, 4),
(506, '[Tanvi Sharma] Best pg in Bellandur, doesn''t feel like living in a match box. The rooms are very spacious, the manager and other staff as well is very kind and helpful. This pg is surrounded by everything, from bus stops, to mall to many tech parks.nnThe food is also good, they cook a lot of North Indian food, which is a plus point when you stay away from home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.465036', 5, 85, 4),
(507, '[Arsha Aj] It''s mens hostel good convenient food is available three times a daynRest of facilities are goodnMostly IT people of Bellandur stays here', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.465182', 5, 85, 4),
(508, '[SriHari Kosuru] I stayed here for almost 1 year. One of the best PGs in bellandur, bangalore. Rooms are spacious. Good food and pure veg. Has good transport connectivity for most of the tech parks in bellandur and marathalli. I would definitely recommend this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.465297', 5, 85, 4),
(509, '[Ayush Jain] Hello Ganesh,nnHope you are doing well!!nnI just now call the manager and requested him to provide some affordable price. I also saidthat Ganesh knows me very well. If needed I can have a word with you as well. It''s been more then a year I have been staying.nBut the MANAGER rudely said to me that talk to manager and ended the call. Sorry to say this is so disappointing. Posting here, as couldn''t get your number.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.465413', 3, 85, 4),
(510, '[Santosh Selvasundar] One liner of this: please find a better placennI say this after staying for almost six monthsnLet me add the issues below:nn1. WATER: both drinking water and common use water runs out before you wake up in the morning and won''t be refilled till mid night. This is not a one day problem. It has been persistent for the last month atleast. Literally the expectation is to buy on your own. Nobody will help you fixnn2. CHEAT: The sales didn''t talk about the infrastructure fees, common area charges and other charges. This will be added directly to your invoice on your first month bill. As well, they removed afternoon meals which they promised initially. They also increased the rent within three months. This isn''t a collective raise for all people here. It''s selectively raised for people who have stayed for a whilenn3. BED BUGS: not just need bed bugs, cockroaches and even rats will be evidently running here and there acrossnn4. ZERO HELP: With all these problems you won''t have a single person to contact and get it fixed. The property managers are too lathargic. Even if you say that you have not drunk any water for hours due to water shortage, they would ask us to wait for another couple of hoursnnGiven all these, I''m here not to degrade anybody''s business. Fix me the problems, I would like to remove the comment following that. Or if it''s fine for you have comment +1 of all the bad reviews you already have, it''s your choice. I''ll be proceeding with posting in other social media too on this', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.487364', 1, 86, 4),
(511, '[Rutvik Patel] Worst PG ever.. they will showed you something and provide you something else I have a proof of that. You will get defected cot. Don''t come here worst aur sab se faltu pg hai .. property manager is also worst men all of the good review is written by this fraud people only', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.48749', 1, 86, 4),
(512, '[Varun Bhardwaj] Worst PG to stay in. The property manager talks rudely and never responds to calls. The services and amenities mentioned are not provided by them. In my washroom, jet spray was not working , it was never cleaned by the cleaning staff and the discharge pipes were clogged. The food was horrible and I''m sharing the pictures of how terrific the room and the kitchen was. One day, rainwater flowed inside my room flooding it completely. My laptop is not working because I had kept it on the ground and laptop soaked in water. I needed a chair and called the property manager 5 times, and he never responded. The door lock was horrible, it took us atleast 10 mins to close and open the door. All I can say is never book this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.487592', 1, 86, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(513, '[Keshab Bhatt] Gd pg helpful manager and gd hk staf made my staying experience so good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.487694', 5, 86, 4),
(514, '[Jitendra. Kharwar] Really amazing stay I had in this pg happy to share the feedback', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.487913', 5, 86, 4),
(515, '[Dev Kumar] One 2 washing machines for count of 200 people here.nnAll clothes even new clothes will die after washing here.nnFood 0 out of 5nnRooms 0 out of 5nnThey say 14k per single share they charge 18+knnFood even unused there is no option to pay without food expenses', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.488018', 1, 86, 4),
(516, '[Jayant Nagori OFFIcIAL] Total a fraud PG , Forget Hot water u won''t even have water in your bathroom, Services are worst no one there to listen to you , For everything raise ticket and that will also be marked as solved without even solving', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.488178', 1, 86, 4),
(517, '[D S] Comfortable roomsnGood foodnNice placenSafety', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.488275', 5, 86, 4),
(518, U&'[Bhanu Prasad] I stayed at Rainbow Gents PG for more than 3 years, and honestly, it felt like a second home in Bangalore. One thing I truly appreciated was the cleanliness \2014 rooms and common areas were cleaned and mopped every day except Sundays, which made the stay very comfortable and hygienic.nThe food is one of the best parts of this PG. Morning tiffins, afternoon meals, and night dinner were consistently tasty and satisfying. The ventilation is excellent, rooms are spacious, and the environment feels fresh and peaceful.nFor anyone new to Bangalore, especially those working in Electronic City, I would strongly recommend Rainbow Gents PG. It\2019s one of the best places to stay with comfort, good food, and a homely atmosphere', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.511449', 5, 87, 4),
(519, '[anoop shetty] Honest opinion- Rooms are decent, depends on your luck what room you get. Food is better from what is provided in the nearby PGs. Just 2 washing machine for the entire building, could add one more.nnAll in all, if you are looking for a PG with decent rooms and good food. This is it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.511574', 4, 87, 4),
(520, '[Sankalp Mohan K K] Best PG near Infosys Gate6. All facilities available at reasonable rent. Food was really good. The owners are really responsive for any maintenance works. Drinking water, 3 times food, daily room cleaning, geaser, wifi, power backup, washing machine, self cooking, security.. etc are the major facilities.nnThank you for the wonderful stay...', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.511735', 5, 87, 4),
(521, '[subhash subbu] This pg is too overrated and the food was worse. If you plan to eat daily outside and pay rent uselessly.. You can join this pg.nnThe rooms are good but the food was very bad. Don''t join this pg if you want to have good food', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.511986', 1, 87, 4),
(522, '[Venkateswara Reddy] Rainbow PG for Gents is seen as a comfortable and well-managed, best suited for working professionals seeking convenience and homely meals. Cleanliness, food quality is good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.512203', 5, 87, 4),
(523, '[subhamoy raj] Nice PG , food is best compared to any other pg in this area of Konappana Agrahara', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.512309', 5, 87, 4),
(524, '[Sridaran Danassou] Good pg to stay. Spacious rooms,daily cleaning, food also good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.512417', 5, 87, 4),
(525, '[Gokulesh Murugesan] Very nice pg i would recommend for all the age group. I m a fresher and i had very good experience in this pg. I love the way they treat the people in the pg and also there are enough facilities to be here. Food is ultimate. Also at last one of the best pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.512514', 5, 87, 4),
(526, '[Sayan Kumar Muhuri] I have lived in this PG for almost a year.nServices offered by them during my stay (1 July 2024 to 30 July 2025 ):n1. Rent : Three Sharing - 7k, Two Sharing - 9k and not sure about single one.n2. Food :na. Monday : Breakfast - Dosa, Chutney. Lunch - Dal ( with some random veggies inside it ), Rice and Pickle (its always sitting on the table ). Dinner - Veg Sabzi, Dal, Roti, Rice.nb. Tuesday : Breakfast - Chapati, White Peas Curry/Dal.  Lunch - Dal, Rice and Pickle. Dinner - Veg Sabzi, Dal, Roti, Rice.nc. Wednesday : Breakfast - Idli, Chutney, Sambhar. Lunch - Dal, Rice and Pickle. Dinner - ( Egg / Veg Fried Rice ) or ( Veg Curry, Roti and one boiled egg) or ( Rarely White Peas Curry and Bhatura and one boiled egg).nd. Thursday : Breakfast - Masala Vermicelli ( Sewaiyan ) or (Rarely Aloo Paratha ). Lunch - ( Dal, Rice or Lemon Rice ). Dinner - Dinner - Veg Sabzi, Dal, Roti, Rice.ne. Friday : Breakfast - Uttapam, Chutney. Lunch - Dal, Rice and Pickle. Dinner - Veg Sabzi, Dal, Roti, Rice.nf. Saturday : Breakfast - Noodles with few veggies. Lunch - Dal, Rice, Pickle and Fryums. Dinner - Veg Pulao and Raita.ng. Sunday : Breakfast - Poori and White Peas Curry or Channa. Lunch - Dal, Rice and Pickle. Dinner - ( Paneer / Chicken Biryani )or  ( Paneer / Chicken Curry with Rice.)n3. Wifi - Speed is around 30 mbps.n4. Electricity - Included in the rent.n5. Power Backup - Yesn6. Lift - Yes ( Only last 6th floor is accessible through stairs )n7. Water - Pressure is less on the top floor and more on the bottom.n8. Bed - Average Size. Not good for a tall person.n9. Ventilation - Very Bad ( Except the 6th floor )n10. Cleanliness - For Bed room ( almost everyday ), For Washroom ( Two Times a week ). Dustbin - Cleared when its filled up.n11. Cooking - Separate Gas Stove is given.n12. Washing Machine - Two Available.n13. Roof Access - Yes.n14. Guest Allowed - For Stay they will charge money, but if its a simple meet up then its allowed for free.n15. Drinking or Smoking - I have seen some people doing it but won''t recommend ( already ventilation is really bad, you will suffocate yourself + long term health issues )n16. Iron - You have to use your own iron.n17. Drinking Water - RO water dispenser on the ground floor.nnIssues or Improvement :n1. Personally I had a good relationship with owner and workers. They are good people but they really need to bring up their quality of services. Bad Reviews given by people are real and meant to be taken serious.n2. Food is average, breakfast is somewhat better than lunch and dinner combined.n3. Pieces of Chicken (3 small Pieces) or Paneer (5 or 6 Small Pieces ) you get is very less and not adequate for your daily protein needs. I would recommend buy one cooker and cook yourself atleast once a week.n4. Sometimes there are water issue. Either worker forgot to turn on the motor or somewhere there was water leaking.n5. Power Backup is there but they will turn it off if there are less people in the PG to save some money.n6. In most of the room, wifi is connected to a non - power backup socket. So whenever there is a power cut off, your wifi also goes away. I would recommend take wifi password of adjacent PG ( if any friend lives there )n7. Room is good for two people not big enough for three.nnTipnIf you are not sure how good a pg is. Live there for single day or two ( except Sunday). This way you will get to know what is the average quality of food is.nNever make haste decision, take your time even if it means losing a good deal.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.538523', 4, 88, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(527, '[M S] There''s no option to give negative stars. Else I would have given negative stars.nGood thing : Pg cleanlinessnnBad thing : Everything  Other than  CleanlinessnnFood : These are from AP still AP people can''t eat . They make 1 curry and that too they prepare like worst to Hell.nnOwner: She doesn''t know how to behave with the people who stays in. She always rude with the people.nnIf you are new to this place just stay here by paying  for 1 day and you will get to know everything.nnI think people should give complaint to food safety officer then they will levy fines from 5Lakhs to 10Lakhs. This is the only solution to get rid of these things from pg owners else here people go to office and come back in the evening during this process get pressure besides  eating less nutritional values and vitamins even worse the health condition.nn###GOOD FOOD IS ALWAYS GOOD HEALTH AND GOOD MOOD###n### DON''T Believe those 5 stars in ratings, those are from Owners ###', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.538663', 1, 88, 4),
(528, U&'[Harshvardhan Sharma] SCROLL FOR UPDATED REVIEW - Overall a good experience nothing that made me uncomfortable so far. The few things that can be worked upon are connecting wifi with back up as well to ensure connectivity without any interruptions.nnApart from this I have no complaint other than that the owners should increase the frequency of the number of times chapati is made in a week.nnNEW REVIEW- So I have moved out of this PG. the pg owner is a cheat and unfair and the service is straight up bullshit now.nnIssues explained in detail \2b07\fe0fnnHave had little to no water pressure in bathroom. I\2019ve asked the helper for more that 1.5 months and all he keeps saying is (will do it tomorrow) I gave up and stopped asking him. Note - She takes 2k maintenance for this.nnWhen it rains the entire roof floods and the water gets inside your rooms if you\2019re in any of 6th floor rooms.nNote - She takes 2k maintenance for thisnnWi-Fi goes out whenever there\2019s power outage knowing every other pg in the area has wifi back up as well.nNote - she takes 2k maintenance for this.nnShe\2019ll make her cooks make only rice not even with any sort of gravy more times in lunch. So if you\2019re thinking of coming back to Pg for lunch don\2019t you\2019ll get tired of eating dry rice (lemon rice, tamari rice etc)nnMost disgusting thing is that she\2019ll beg for rent from day one but she\2019ll hold her cooks salaries for 10-15 days. (Absolute cheat)nnI referred 3 people this PG and she told us that she\2019ll give us discount. Spoiler alert - she did not.nnI told her one of my friend will live in Pg for 2 days and as per her calculations he spent 3 days in the Pg. (He left before 48 hours).nnWe then also referred father daughter duo and 1 day fee was 900 we gave her 1000 rupees and she never gave back 100 rupees back.nnHer excuse - She offers wifi, 3 time food, water etc as if no one else in this business offers the same.nnMy almost appreciation for the cooks in PG don\2019t know how they deal with her.nnIf y\2019all still don\2019t believe then join the Pg and you\2019ll know all the issues.nnTo the PG owner if you\2019re reading this - it\2019s high time you start being humble and appreciative of others.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.53879', 1, 88, 4),
(529, '[Rachael Green] I have been in pg for around 6 months , Have gone through alot in the pg. The behaviour of owner is worst. I have been in many arguments over nothing with lady owner of the pg. The food quality in starting was ok ok but later they have deteriorated the condition like hell. I was living in single sharing and paying alot but they can''t guarantee your security or your belongings security at all. They won''t start generator when there is no power, they won''t let you cook if you have cooked even once in 2 months. They criticize you alot when you are not a south-indian. They don''t have any understanding at all creating alot of mess for any single person living alone in city. If you say anything they''ll start something in Tamil and shout a lot. I have many good friends who are tamil , kannada or Telugu but never saw person who can do anything for money. God is watching and Karma will definitely hit you back and definitely even harder.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.538917', 1, 88, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(530, '[Aditya Dixit] I stayed in the PG for a whole year, so i asked for my deposit back so they denied to give it back because I told them 15 days before even after staying there for such a long time. Sometimes, there is water shortage and there room cleaning person will keep on changing so be ready to get frustrated if your room is not cleaned for straight 10 days. The uncle and aunt there will start asking rent before the rent cycle end and shouts on anybody who ask for an improvement for water shortage and you cant bring your food to the room as they will start shouting so think before if you have hybrid job and have a meeting in the meals time.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.539137', 1, 88, 4),
(531, '[Nandeeswar Reddy CHINTHA (nandeeswar)] I have been staying in this pg for more than a month and The food which is available in this pg is very hygienic and has good taste compared to most of the pgs in which I have stayed previously, and the owners are always available at any time, and they are the best of all. This pg is one of the best places to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.539268', 5, 88, 4),
(532, U&'[Hari Om Prem] Honest Review:nthe worst pg in this area Maruthi Garden, Near Aishwarya mart.n\2022 food quality : 0/5n\2022 owners behaviour: 0/5 (negative)n\2022 facilities: 0/5n\2022 maintenance: 0/5nIf you are asking your friend to come and visit, they won''t allow.nIf you are planning to reside here, without any second thought, just cancel, there are many good options in this area. If you''re going to ask any question, they will start fighting and shouting so that u won''t be speak even a single word.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.539386', 1, 88, 4),
(533, '[Shivam Kumar] I am staying in this PG since last 8-9months, then only giving this review - don''t believe on the first behaviour of the owners, they are very cheap especially the lady owner, once you pay the rent they only they will show their real face, they won''t allow any friends to visit the PG, if they are coming they will behave very rude and use to ask to return back from the gate only, food quality is the worst, no proper water management, cook use to behave cheaply, the worst thing is that whenever you are going to ask for any issues, they will start shouting like anything, you won''t be able to understand why they are barking.nI am stuck here bcz I have paid the rent, and now days they are behaving like the worst.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.539517', 1, 88, 4),
(534, U&'[Shubham Thorwat] I\2019ve been staying at Cozy Coliv Luxury PG for the past 10 months, and honestly, it\2019s been a really comfortable experience.nnThe food quality is consistently good, which is a big plus when you\2019re staying long-term. The environment is clean, well-maintained, and feels safe, making it easy to focus on work and relax at the same time.nnRooms are well-managed with proper housekeeping, and the overall hygiene standards are maintained regularly. The management is responsive and cooperative whenever any issue comes up, which makes a big difference in day-to-day living.nnAnother thing I appreciate is the peaceful and friendly atmosphere\2014no unnecessary disturbances, and a good crowd of residents. Basic amenities like Wi-Fi, water supply, and electricity are reliable, which is exactly what you need without hassle.nnOverall, Cozy Coliv Luxury PG is a great place to stay if you''re looking for comfort, cleanliness, and a hassle-free living experience. Definitely recommended \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.56409', 5, 89, 4),
(535, '[Mahalakshmi Rajeev] I had one of the best experiences living here. The hosts were extremely kind and the whole place had an overall great hygiene. Would recommend everyone this pg. Loved my stay !!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.564389', 5, 89, 4),
(536, '[shiva reddy] Very nice place to stay, peaceful environment good food overall very nice pg and very reasonable', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.564512', 5, 89, 4),
(537, '[Praveen Singh] Very nice pg, living here from last 1 year, PG is very clean, comfortable, and well-maintained. The owners are supportive, and the environment feels safe. Facilities like Wi-Fi, housekeeping, and food are consistently good. Overall, a great place to stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.564693', 5, 89, 4);      
