(538, '[Sara Pavan Kumar Goud] I am staying in this pg from past 2.  Years the people here are very kind and the owners are very helpful and listen to everything the food is extremely good worth the price', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.564799', 5, 89, 4),
