(540, '[Madhu M] Been here for more than a year and still here while writing this, and it never felt like a PG to me. Its more like my personal room in my home. Like there''s nothing to complain or point out.nFood''s great, facilities are top notch and area is very nicely located. Quick access to everything. Definitely worth staying with no second thoughts.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.565004', 5, 89, 4),
(541, U&'[Reha Sharieff] SS Coliving u0026 Stays in Bengaluru space offering a vibrant, comfortable, and community\2011focused experience. The PG has beautifully designed rooms with modern amenities, and a welcoming atmosphere that feels like home, and the location gives easy access to (tech hubs) Every corner exudes warmth and style, making it perfect for students and professionals seeking a cozy, affordable home. I highly recommend SS Coliving u0026 Stays for its excellent services and friendly environment that feels like a second family.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.565113', 5, 89, 4),
(542, '[Brijesh Parmar] I live here currently and this is my third time coming back to the same placennI can easily afford any place in Bangalore. But this place is something I am unable to find anywhere else.nIt maybe called a PG but the experience is truly far from it.nnThere is alternative day room service. There is a pool. There is gym. Gated Society.nSpacious house with full furnishing.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.595734', 5, 90, 4),
(543, '[Arun Murugesan] I stayed in Zolo for an year. Rent is on a higher side. 15k for two sharing.nPros:nCleaning done on alternate days.nGym and swimming pool.nFridge, Microwave, Washing machine. Parking. WiFi. Sofa. TV (old model), Gated societynnCons:nKitchen has cockroaches. Even if you complain multiple times they don''t care.nRent is really high.nZolo''s policies are strict. For example if you leave within an year you have to pay 1950 as penalty. Stupid.nCart is not good. It doesn''t have cushion. I got a back pain sometimes.nDealing with customer care people is painful.nnOverall choose Zolo only of you don''t get a good 1BHK.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.595879', 3, 90, 4),
(544, '[Soumadeep Das (SD)] I must say that it is one of the most well maintained and niche properties in India. Cherry on the cake, the zolo property manager Mr. Nirmal is a super cooperative, humble and very sincere man. Thanks zolo essenza.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.596002', 5, 90, 4),
(545, '[KARTIK RAJUWAR] I am staying in zolo essenza Awesome, awesome rooms and services.nRooftop openair is the highlight.nWestern vibe.nYou can spend your lifetime over there if you want.nThe caretaker is also a nice guy and will address your needs on time.nProper game area too.nI would have permanently stayed,', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.596145', 5, 90, 4),
