(561, U&'[Such \201cIn\201d] 1 star is more than to this stupid place and even if there is any options give 0 I will give big 0  I don''t like to give 1 also it''s worst place who ever want to stay they better to stay Pg and wardens is rude behaviour and here they will give food it''s very bad food I stayed only 3 months paid 30 k to simply I wasted money and here they ask to come one stupid function it will happen every year in adichinchangiri  and so much distabence and who want to stay don''t join am seriously telling don''t join and food it''s worst same type of food they will give same there is no change in food every week  same food order wise and marning 7 clock breakfast after they don''t give and evening 8 clock and with one prayer if you don''t been in  before 8 clock that warden will start to speak samskrutha don''t join  don''t join am telling don''t join and there is no hot water and cleaning is ok room are very dirty  nam basheli elbek Andre edu. Mejastic bus stand esto better e place nalli iroke mejastic bus stand esto better it 30 k charge and July to July if you join. June also you have to pay 30k', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.690525', 1, 93, 4),
