(570, '[GIRIJAPATHI SWAMY] Super place a good place to learn and best frinds will always with u Supportingly thank you for giving  beautiful memories in Bangalore', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.783991', 5, 96, 4),
(571, U&'[Sharath Kumar] good affordable. please improve the food \+01f64f\+01f3fb', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.784265', 4, 96, 4),
(572, U&'[Sarang CS] I stayed here for 2 years and had a wonderful experience. The owner, Shamseer ikka, was always friendly, responsive, and quick to resolve any issues. Special thanks to Pramod Chettan and Chechi for the delicious Kerala-style food that truly felt like home. Even during the LPG crisis, they ensured we were served fresh meals every day, including chicken curry and rice (on all days\+01f60e). Overall, a comfortable stay with great food and caring management. Highly recommended!nnChoose this PG to make your SG Palya days better\+01f60c', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.817109', 5, 97, 4),
(573, '[Abhishek Pandey] Its a great PG specially near Christ University with affordable rent and good rooms, the staffs are nice and understanding. Spent 2 years here and I''d recommend it to anyone who prefers hassle free living as Gym and Supermarket are literally on same building.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.817278', 5, 97, 4),
(574, '[Vimal''S Voyage] Good place and lot of restaurants near by, Gym u0026 supermarket is available in same building. Room is kind of service apartment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.817404', 5, 97, 4),
(575, '[Mohammed Owais Sheikh] Malabar Plaza PG is an excellent place to stay with a clean and comfortable environment. The food is delicious, hygienic, and feels like home. The management is responsive, and the atmosphere is peaceful and well-maintained. Highly recommended for students and professionals looking for a hassle-free stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.817584', 5, 97, 4),
(576, '[Shan Marbaniang] I lived here for a whole year and it was fantastic! I never had any issues with my accommodation; everything was always clean and well-maintained. But the real highlight was the food! Delicious and home-cooked, with the open kitchen being a great place to socialize with other residents.  If you''re looking for a comfortable and hassle-free place to stay in Bangalore, I highly recommend this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.817704', 5, 97, 4),
(577, '[bored potato] Best place to stay near Christ University, 5 minutes from the Back Gate. The management is polite and the food is great if you''re looking for a Keralite menu. Rent is reasonable as well.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.818095', 5, 97, 4);              
