(578, '[Akshat Gogna] One of the best pgs in the whole area with good ventilated rooms and cheap price. Best pg to give kerala food.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.818588', 5, 97, 4),
(579, '[Shabeer N A] I stayed at Malabar plaza PG in SG Palya for around 2 years, and I must say that it was an excellent experience. The management was very supportive, and they took good care of the guests. The food served was of high quality and delicious, and the lift facility was a great convenience. The periodic cleaning of rooms and washrooms ensured a clean and hygienic environment for the guests, and the presence of CCTV cameras provided added security.nnBut what really stood out for me was the spacious and well-maintained rooms. They were comfortable and contributed to a hassle-free stay. Overall, I highly recommend Malabar  PG for anyone looking for a comfortable and pleasant stay in SG Palya. It''s a great place to stay with excellent service and amenities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.818757', 5, 97, 4),
(580, '[vineela nagendera Kalluri] One of the best and better pg for boys in the bangalore. Owners too good and maintenance is very perfect and professional. If any body searching for pg in this area, visit and know about the words , what is mentioned . Price and food and all facilities is perfect and good maintenance.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.852673', 5, 98, 4),
(581, '[S Kaleem Saheb] Friendly nature persons and food is so Delicious and rooms also to good. All necessary are also available nearly if you want.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.852835', 5, 98, 4),
