(596, '[Haripraveen Chenna] The place is always neat and clean.nThe owner is very friendly and supportive.nThe food is good as well.nnI stayed here for 3 months and never faced any inconvenience.nnIf you want to stay in Banashankari or near Jayanagar, this is definitely one of the best PGs in terms of cleanliness.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.925154', 5, 100, 4),
(597, U&'[Declan R] I had an exceptional stay at The Beehive Hostel Luxury! \2728 The atmosphere was incredibly welcoming, and the owner and caretaker were all so friendly and helpful. \+01f31f My room was spotless and very comfortable. I highly recommend it for a fantastic experience! \+01f60a\+01f3e1', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.925422', 5, 100, 4),
(598, '[Vivek Chauhan] The experience at Beehive Men''s PG was Great. The room cleanliness was daily and proper. The wifi works properly and clean water and electricity is available all the time. It was smooth staying here', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.925771', 5, 100, 4),
(599, '[Aman Sunny] Extremely neat and hygienic pg for Men, they provide proper healthy food, nice spacious rooms, time to time cleaning is available, heater is available, fast wifi was also available overall i had a great experience staying here', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.925901', 5, 100, 4),
(600, '[Sounojit Sen] Nice place to live peacefully. Room and all are good , washroom are clean only things is little expensive but fully worth it. Some days food can be better but maximum days foods are good. You can have a good experience here', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.926021', 4, 100, 4),
(601, '[PRAJWAL S POURAKUTSA] Clean rooms and washrooms. Food is good. I got safe space to park my cycle. Friendly staff.nOverall good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.926149', 5, 100, 4),
(602, '[Adithya Shettigar] May I know the price of different varient room and facilities provided if you had you phone number here it could have been great', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.926278', 5, 100, 4),
(603, '[Arnab Das] Nice PG , rooms are very clean and in good condition. Breakfast and Dinner is available. Both the meals are too good and tasty. Loved the place. PG owner uncle is very humble and helpful. Value for money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:06.926397', 5, 100, 4),
(604, U&'[Joyal Baby] Firstly there isn''t any water 24\00d77 and the water will starts at 7 and close at 10 pmnBut most of the time there won''t be any water at allnIf you want Chinese foods with animals in it this hostel is the best suited hostel for younWide variety of insects and rats are served with food 3 timesnIf you get inside the hostel and join then you can''t leave the hostel without paying package for 4 year for hostel fee even if you just stayed there for few months.nThe toilets are arranged in a way that 50 students have 4 functional toilets.nChoice is yours\+01f639\+01f91d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.006913', 1, 102, 4),
(605, U&'[Ravi Ranjan] Don''t allot hostel if u wanna admission to this clg nothing is good ,no extra  sport curriculum, Playground illa , only name is Oxfraud clg \+01f601\+01f601\+01f921\+01f921\+01f921', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.007515', 1, 102, 4),
