(617, '[Dhanush .R] It''s very clean . And hygienically maintained', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.045075', 5, 103, 4),
(618, '[Sandeep H N] Nice place for college students to stay there', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.045231', 5, 103, 4),
(619, U&'[SK OFFICIAL] Good Hostel and Fecility is also \+01d53e\+01d546\+01d546\+01d53b', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.045358', 5, 103, 4),
(620, U&'[Tanish Jain] Extremely disappointing experience. My security deposit was supposed to be refunded within 60 days of checkout, but even after the promised timeline has passed, I have still not received my money.nnWhat is frustrating is that other residents reportedly received their refunds much faster, while my case has been left unresolved without any proper explanation. To make matters worse, my account was blocked, leaving me with no clear way to follow up on the issue.nnA deposit refund is not a favor from management\2014it\2019s money that rightfully belongs to the resident. The lack of transparency, poor communication, and failure to honor the committed refund timeline reflect very poorly on the management.nnI would strongly advise prospective residents to think twice and get everything in writing before trusting any refund commitments.nnAfter almost 10 days of unnecessary delay, they finally issued a cheque but arbitrarily deducted \20b91,000 as \201cmaintenance charges\201d without any prior notice or explanation, even though \20b95,000 had already been collected separately for maintenance. Such hidden deductions are completely unfair and lack transparency.nnTo make matters worse, the contact number they provided for assistance doesn\2019t even exist, making it impossible to reach them when issues arise.nnThis PG management is highly unprofessional, non-transparent, and irresponsible when it comes to handling tenants\2019 money.If professionalism, transparency, and timely refunds matter to you, this PG is not a place I would recommend', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.075696', 1, 104, 4),
(621, '[Mitesh Baidya] 0 STARnExtremely disappointing experience. I checked out on June 7, 2025, and as of July 24, 2026, I still have not received my refund. At the time of checkout, I was clearly told that the refund would be processed within 60 days, but that promise has been completely ignored.nnTrying to contact customer care has been a waste of time. Every time I call, they promise a callback that never happens. They also fail to provide any proper explanation for the delay or any concrete timeline for resolving the issue.nnHolding a customer''s money for over a year after promising a 60-day refund is completely unacceptable. I would strongly advise others to think 100 times before staying here unless you''re prepared to deal with poor customer service and unresolved refund issues.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.075898', 1, 104, 4),
(622, '[Jai Desai] I am the resident of this pg from past 2 months during joining the pg Mr Khan the care taker of Koramangala branch. Gave a good and positive promise in regards to security deposit returning , this I didn''t give rent cause from past two months I  didn''t get  my contract everytime I approach they use to give me some random excuses and post lpg issue the use to keep aloo in everything see the point is not about its all cooking perfectly it shouldn''t be under cooked so they didn''t work on that also, and yesterday they give me warning to pay rent or else they  will Remove the bed so I have  cleared communicated them earlier telling to do settlement in security deposit as the deposit is equal to my pg rent so they told rules and all so I negotiated telling them I am ready to pay once you give contract.so till now it''s done from there end I personally feel pg is good but the quality is.not upto the mark or Standards of the brand name and they are torturing and misbehaving too rude to me. Names to be consider - Mr Rakesh ( cluster manager) , Mr Jeevan ( yours space boys Koramangala branch owner)  Mr Khan ( care taker of yours space boys pg Koramangala) and last  month they lost ur rooms master key andnNow demanding to pay the fine tell why should I pay for there irresponsible behaviour', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.076074', 1, 104, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(623, U&'[Prateesh Gupta] Yaar, my experience in this PG for the last 3 months has been really disappointingnAlmost every week the Wi-Fi stops working and somehow it always happens from Friday to Monday, which is very irritating. Food is also not too good and same repeated items every week and the chapatis are of very poor quality. Complaints don\2019t seem to lead to any real improvement. I\2019m still staying here only because I haven\2019t found another PG yet; otherwise, I would have already left.nGuys it would be great to suggest good PGnWhich don\2019t have these issues', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.076301', 1, 104, 4),
(624, '[Prakhar Pandey] This is a franchise of Your Space start up. The have hostels in multiple cities. Reaching this venue is easy. It''s very close to Forum Mall. The place is mostly for students'' stay but working professionals can also stay here. They do have a year-long contract for everyone. There are two categories of rooms one @15k and the other  @17.5k ( as on May 31st 2022). The place is clean and the service is also good. Advice students to take room above the 2nd floor (if available) as the window will open fully in that case.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.076484', 5, 104, 4),
(625, U&'[Devansh nayak35] If you\2019re considering staying at Your Space, don\2019t. My experience was awful. The food was terrible\2014not only was it regularly infested with cockroaches, but it was also delayed by almost an hour every single day. Hygiene standards were appalling, and the property was filthy. The managers were unhelpful, and customer service was basically non-existent\2014they never responded to complaints. To make matters worse, their security deposit refund policy is a complete scam. They promise a refund within 60 days, but I\2019m still waiting months later. Avoid this place at all costs!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.076676', 1, 104, 4),
(626, '[Muskaan Arora] The experience here was fine. However, it has been six months since I left the property but I haven''t received my security deposit back which was promised to be paid in 60 days after the checkout date. We were then told that the refund will be received in October, which didn''t happen. This fact overpowers the services available. I would never recommend this pg to anyone else. It shows utter irresponsiblilty and carelessness from the company''s side. This pg is not worth any penny spent.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.076935', 1, 104, 4),
(627, U&'[Manasi G] Very Unhygienic and also contains cockroaches in food and warms in the water purifier and also room service isn\2019t provided daily.They will take huge amounts of deposit like 45,000 and never return back.They neither pickup calls or provide support.Never get into this pg.Waste of money', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.07738', 1, 104, 4),
(628, '[L N Sai Tejhas] Great and affordable place to live. The owner is very friendly and helpful. Food quality is good and all the basic amenities are good as well.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.139719', 5, 106, 4),
(629, '[Prasad Sawant] I lived here 1.5 yrs ago, stayed this much long because I had single room , which was good with good ventilation room 405, food is also good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.139854', 4, 106, 4),
(630, '[Subhasish Bhattacharya] I have been staying for 2 years and I must say it is one of the most peaceful PGs in Sarjapur Rd.Owner Chandra is a real gentleman and very helpful. I feel like my home. Breakfast is great.Only thing which I feel is veg/non veg food options and quantity should have been better for dinner', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.14004', 4, 106, 4),
(631, '[Nagaraj subramanian] Owner''s hospitality is good and food, cleaning is good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.140547', 5, 106, 4),
(632, '[gopi reddy] This PG is better option, If you want it is reasonable rent and Delicious Food.. Neat and clean pg. Owner behavior  is nice and Friendly . An awesome  experience overall.Wifi available and rooms are awesome.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.140766', 5, 106, 4);           
