(635, '[Deewakar Mishra] One of the best PG i ever Lived in. I was staying in a Single sharing it was one of the best experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.141203', 5, 106, 4),
(636, '[Sachin Karabari] Great PG with clean rooms and a comfortable stay. The owner is very friendly, helpful, and always approachable. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.169622', 4, 107, 4),
(637, '[Vignesh] Good 2-sharing room. Clean, comfortable, and well-maintained. The staff are friendly, and it''s a nice place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.169881', 5, 107, 4),
(638, '[SREEDEV G NAIR] I experienced a great stay in this pg. The rooms were well maintained and owner was helping with all the necessary needs', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.170057', 5, 107, 4),
(639, U&'[s\00fb\00f1\00eel Tej\00e2] Nice rooms and good facility. Room size also good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.170261', 5, 107, 4),
(640, U&'[SHREEDHAR SUTAGUNDI] The maintenance of this property has been unsatisfactory, and the owner has not adequately addressed our concerns. Rooms are only cleaned every 15 days, and we encounter daily issues with the water supply. The drinking water filtration system is dirty, and there is no space to dry clothes. Additionally, the washing machine is not functioning. While we understand the importance of paying rent on time, this situation is becoming increasingly frustrating. The owner seems to be taking our phones and giving himself five-star ratings on Google Maps\+01f602', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.170391', 1, 107, 4),
(641, '[Shivang Gowda] I had a fantastic stay at Best PG in Mathikere The rooms were clean and well-maintained, the food was delicious with a good variety of options, and the staff were incredibly friendly and helpful. The communal areas were always tidy, and the location was perfect for commuting to work. Overall, a great experience for anyone looking for a comfortable and social PG environment', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.170554', 5, 107, 4),
(642, U&'[Jishnu RS] u003e \201cBest PG for men \2014 In my opinion, Best PG for Men truly lives up to its name. The rooms are well-ventilated, spacious, and come with a large wardrobe, which made my stay very comfortable. I\2019m sure you\2019ll love it!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.171075', 5, 107, 4),
(643, '[Dhruv Tharun Krishna] Decent accommodation for the price range. The building is well maintained, with the cleaning being done weekly or bi-weekly. There is a biometric based access gateage for security and thus, there are no timing restrictions. The location offers an easy commute to the nearby IISc and is close to the Yeshwantpur railway and metro stations. The owner and the caretaker are very helpful and are always available to sort out any issues. The major con would be the small-sized bathroom with no wash basin.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.17129', 4, 107, 4),
(644, '[Harish Ganjigatti] I Highly recommend this PG! I stayed here for 2 years,the stay was very comfortable.nThe owner was very cooperative and he solve the issue very quickly and Food was good, and the cleaning/maintenance was superb-always very clean. Wi-Fi was excellent and worked without fail. Facilities like the fridge and lift made daily life very easy. A great place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.199758', 5, 108, 4),
(645, '[Sreevinayak P V] This  pg is very good. I have been saying for 2 years . Owner is very friendly u0026 good person. If we have any problem facing he will solve immediately. Bed is good, this pg has wifi,hot water,water purifier,fridge,washing machine. Lift is also availalble. Food is average sometimes good and sometimes bad. Self cooking also allowed. Easy to access to park,bus stop u0026 supermarket, Metro is near by. Averall this is pg is very good compared to my previous pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.199892', 4, 108, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(646, '[Anirudh Chitneedi] The PG is clean and well-maintained. Rooms are spacious with good ventilation. Food quality is decent and hygienic. The management is cooperative and responds quickly to issues. Wi-Fi and water facilities are available without major problems. Overall, it''s a good and comfortable place to stay for working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.200011', 5, 108, 4),
(647, U&'[Nikhil Dcunha] I had a good experience staying here. Even during difficult times, the PG environment responded quickly and helped well.nnThe food is good and the environment is comfortable. The presence of the owner\2019s family makes it feel more like home.nThe special celebrations during festivals are something I will really miss.nnI would definitely recommend this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.20014', 5, 108, 4),
(648, U&'[mallikarjun baragur44] The rooms are very comfortable u0026 neat.nfood\2014it is super delicious, hygienic, and honestly the best PG food I''ve had. Definitely feels like a home', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.200263', 5, 108, 4),
(649, '[HEMANTH REDDY] Nice PG with clean rooms and peaceful environment. Food is good and served on time. Facilities like Wi-Fi and water supply are reliable. Management is supportive. Had a great stay here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.200383', 5, 108, 4),
(650, U&'[Shanmuka Mudidana] I have stayed in this PG for one year. I really appreciate the cleanliness and neat maintenance of the property. The management is very prompt in responding to any issues, which made my stay comfortable and hassle-free. I would definitely recommend this place.\201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.200511', 5, 108, 4),
(651, '[Nandeesh Maddina] Stayed here for one year while completing my course at Emertxe. Good maintenance, good food also, and the owners are very understanding and supportive. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.20079', 5, 108, 4),
(652, U&'[NANDA KISHORE] It''s Good and decent well maintained here. But only thing is regular food menu dissapoint here, and the oil they use is  gold rich palm oil in every food they prepare which is too dangerous for health.. I suggest the management to look in to the issue and resolve it as soon as possible  Thank you \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.229096', 3, 109, 4),
(653, '[Aravindan Sivakumar] I am staying at Srivari Mens PG for one week, and my experience so far has been very good. Compared to many other PGs, the food here is really good in terms of taste, quality, and hygiene, which is a big plus for anyone staying away from home. The rent is also very reasonable and worth it considering the room facilities and the food provided.nnThe rooms are maintained well, and the overall environment is comfortable and peaceful. One thing I really appreciated is the support from the manager, Raju. He is a very humble, polite, and approachable person who helped me from the initial stage itself in finding a suitable room and made the whole process smooth and stress-free.nnOverall, I am satisfied with my stay here and would definitely recommend Srivari Mens PG to anyone looking for a good PG with decent food, reasonable rent, and supportive management.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.229239', 5, 109, 4),
(654, '[Jacob Sebastian] I have stayed in this pg for almost 2 years. The rooms are always very well maintained with daily cleaning. Whenever we face an issue with the amenities provided, the pg manager always resolves it quickly. The only problem that I had was that after staying for 2 years the food became very repetitive, however that is not an issue exclusive to this pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.229359', 5, 109, 4),
(655, '[satyasai p] Very neatly  maintained PG. Food is Good. Very reasonable price. Helpful staff. Worth every penny.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.229475', 5, 109, 4),
(656, '[Sumit kumar] Good PG for new Folks, Bit costly for double sharing 13k, 3 times food but not useful for working professional, Overall Experience was good stayed. Caretakers are okayish. If Facing any issues directly contact owner he is sensible person.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.229807', 4, 109, 4);     
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(657, U&'[Lito Riba] This  place is good for student and working too because as I am staying here so i experience my self it''s a best one and i recommended to you all tonTHEY PROVIDEn1.TVn2. Attached bathroomn3.daily cleaning by staffn4.food is good, and cleann5.free wifin6.owner is goodn7.washing machinesn8.freedgen9.parking placenNow it''s you to choose here harry up\+01f607', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.230043', 5, 109, 4),
(658, '[Rishabh Singh] PG IS GOOD, food is also good, best for bachelors', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.230194', 5, 109, 4),
(659, '[Venkatesh K] This pg is good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.230318', 4, 109, 4),
(660, U&'[Bipin Soni] I''ve been happily staying at K S Comforts PG for Men for the past five years, and my experience has been consistently excellent throughout. From day one, the management has been supportive, the environment has been clean, safe, and well-maintained, and the facilities have always met my expectations.nnThe rooms are comfortable, the common areas are kept neat, and the overall atmosphere is friendly and welcoming, making it feel like a second home. Any issues are addressed promptly, and the staff are always approachable and helpful. The location is also convenient, with easy access to public transport, restaurants, supermarkets, and other essential services.nnWhat I appreciate most is the peaceful environment and the sense of comfort and security the PG provides. After staying here for five years, I can confidently say that K S Comforts PG for Men is one of the best places to stay. I would highly recommend it to anyone looking for a clean, comfortable, and well-managed PG with excellent facilities and a homely atmosphere. \+01f60a\+01f44d\+01f3e1\2728', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.25915', 5, 110, 4),
(661, '[Mohamed Thaha] I have had a wonderful experience staying at this PG. The rooms are spacious, neat, and always kept well-maintained, making it a very comfortable place to live. The management team is supportive and quick to address any issues or concerns, which adds to the overall positive experience. The food served is consistently delicious and has a homely taste that makes it even better. The environment is friendly and welcoming, and the security arrangements make me feel safe and secure. I would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable, well-managed, and convenient place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.259292', 5, 110, 4),
(662, '[Adithya MU] Stayed here for 2.5 years wonderful PG, responsive owner, Regularly maintained, Good food, Wonderful and friendly staff, It is a almost perfect residence for a student.nWonderful roommates in my final year.nTuesday and Friday breakfast was my fav.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.259495', 5, 110, 4),
(663, '[hari krishna.] Everything is goodnVentilation, food,nBut it''s comparative Bangalore all pg this is defrant maintenan owner including charges allso.nIf you want Cook there is a separate area for kichen area .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.25962', 5, 110, 4),
(664, '[Anitha krithika] This was one of the best pg .I have stayed here for so long.The rooms are clean and well maintained.Food quality is good and hygiene .Facilities like wi-fi, housekeeping are good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.259741', 5, 110, 4),
(665, U&'[Arul] The pg is really nice and comfortable. The staffs are speaking nicely. Mostly the food is really hygiene and taste as well. I''m recommended this pg \+01f4af', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.259861', 5, 110, 4),
(666, '[Kiran Kewa] One of the best pg near to St Joseph''s University with good food the staff is so good and friendly and helpful compare to other pgs I would highly recommend this pg .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.259981', 5, 110, 4),
(667, '[Raghu lucky] One of the best pg i have ever visitednGenuinely reccomended for stay.nGood food and worth for your moneynFriendly owner and understandable', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.260103', 5, 110, 4),
(668, '[Kaviyarasan D] Bet PG in this location. The food tastes good. PG staff''s behaviour is super. The room and interior are also good. Perfect within your budget. You won''t get this taste of food in any other PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.288312', 5, 111, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(669, '[Priyanshu Banka] A perfect PG in this location..nManagement''s behaviour is to good, they listen to each and every thing and must try to resolve it..nFood is also too good..nThree times food facility available and the taste of the food is amazing..nCleaning is also good..nThey also provide study table in each room..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.288459', 5, 111, 4),
(670, '[Omkar Mokashi] Homely made delicious food.nBehaviour of owner is good.nHighly recommend for boys pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.28859', 4, 111, 4),
(671, '[Gyan Prakash Yadav] Good pg good wonar nice pg cleaning nice security food very testy', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.288711', 5, 111, 4),
(672, '[Sunny Bontha] Beds is comfortable and homely food and and security is so good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.288833', 5, 111, 4),
(673, '[Reddykumar Kayala] The owner is very friendly and the ambience are good__Esapecially food is excellent', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.288953', 5, 111, 4),
(674, '[Ayush Banka] Homely made delicious food.nBehaviour of owner is good.nHighly recommend for boys pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.28922', 5, 111, 4),
(675, '[ShakthiGanesh M] Food night Wi-Fi rocket cleaning ok', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.289352', 5, 111, 4),
(676, '[Rohan R Achar] Very well maintained PG. Near by main road. Good and healthy homely food prepared every single day. No compromise in food whatsover. 10/10 PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.314834', 5, 112, 4),
(677, U&'[Sakthi Prasanna] Had a really great experience staying at this PG! \+01f60a It was my first PG stay and honestly, I felt totally at home here. The place is super clean \2013 thanks to the daily cleaning and mopping. Water and WiFi connections are solid too, never had an issue. But the real highlight is the food \2013 it''s homely, tasty, and freshly prepared right here, which makes a huge difference. Also, shoutout to Shiva bro, the owner \2013 very approachable, helpful, and friendly. Made some good memories during my stay. Highly recommend if you\2019re looking for a peaceful and homely PG! \+01f44c\2728', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.314967', 5, 112, 4),
(678, U&'[Karthikeyan Loganathan] I had a great experience staying at this PG. The accommodation is clean, well-maintained, and offers all the basic amenities including Wi-Fi, hot water, and regular housekeeping.nnOne of the standout features is the food. They provide freshly cooked, homely meals three times a day, and the menu is well-balanced and tasty. It\2019s a huge relief not having to worry about food quality or hygiene.nnWhat truly sets this PG apart is the owner. He is extremely helpful, approachable, and always available to assist with any concerns or special requests. Whether it''s a maintenance issue or a personal request, they handle things quickly and with a friendly attitude.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.315078', 5, 112, 4),
(679, U&'[Hari haran] I have been staying at this PG for the past 7 months, and it has been a very good experience. For the rent I\2019m paying, the facilities and services provided are really good. The owner is very friendly and always available to assist with any accommodation related needs.nnThe food is homely and served three times a day, which is a rare find in most PGs in Bangalore.  My room and the toilet are cleaned daily, except on Sundays.nnThe standout aspects of this PG is the freedom given to tenants something you won\2019t find in any PGs anywhere.nnHighly recommended for anyone looking for a comfortable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.315199', 5, 112, 4),
(680, '[Vignesh Aravindhan] It is one of the best stays near Lalbagh! The rooms are clean, hygienic, and well-maintained, giving a very comfortable and homely feel. The food is healthy and feels just like home-cooked meals. The owner is extremely friendly, helpful, and always approachable. You can genuinely feel a sense of care and comfort here, which is rare to find in many PGs. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a peaceful, well-managed, and safe place to stay in Bangalore!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.315306', 5, 112, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(681, U&'[Phanendhar Reddy] Simply the Best PG!nFeels like home in every way\2014clean rooms, amazing food, and a super safe environment. You won\2019t have to worry about a thing. 10/10 stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.315412', 5, 112, 4),
(682, U&'[Baby Swift Sai] This pg is good and cleaning and food good ... \+01f44d  to comfortable to move on this pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.315515', 1, 112, 4),
(683, U&'[A. Ajurul Aswath] Awesome of this pg food I many pg I stay but this one is i like it owner friendly character is a such a nice guy\2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.315615', 5, 112, 4),
(684, U&'[ARYA KANNAN] Worst experience,nnPlease guys don''t stay here..there only aim is to pluck out the money from us. First they said like they''ll provide food service and when we reached there Property manager said like no food. After that we have made an deposit 9600 which again mentioned by him like 2600 will be of maintenance charge it will be deducted and remaining 7k will be refunded..now the refund amount is 5.7k.nnThe manager is Shekhar babu and he doesn''t even know English and always rushed us with the rent payment even if we have 3 days left to pay, he is an fraud person.nnPlease don''t choose this PG there are better ones near this AGR pg and on the tech Mahindra side there are lot of them which is cheap and affordable ones...here the total amount deducted is 20K for one month without food.nnShekhar babu(\+01f438) is such a fraud.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.339469', 1, 113, 4),
(685, '[DineshK] It''s located at less than 1 km from highway. I reached at 1030pm u0026 still managed to get into my room within 5 minutes. It''s very well maintained and best among all Zolo properties i  visited earlier. Surely suggest anyone requiring basic facility at reasonable price to consider Zolo Pragma. 4 wheeler parking can be challenge but road is wide enough to park for an overnight if you check out around 7am.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.33958', 5, 113, 4),
(686, U&'[Pooja Singh] I stayed at Zolo Pragma for 3 months. Room wall was dirty windows was broken and had 100 years of dirt on it. Bathroom looks like public toilet. I raised multiple tickets to get everything clean but it was aged dirt so didn\2019t get clean after 2-3 wash. Overall worst experience no cleanliness.nWhen I was doing all the formalities for taking room on rent they charged different different amounts from me and said it will get refund later and even during servicing notice person they charged additional amount bu saying it will get refund once you vacate the room. Additionally they took security deposit as well so in total I paid around 12k and while it came to refund they refunded me 6200 only. They didn\2019t refund my whole amount I paid instead they deduct almost half amount on name of exit fees, and for rest amount which I paid apart from security deposit they didn\2019t refunded to me. I reached out to support team several times but they even didn\2019t bother to respond.nIn short property is not good and they ask for extra money and never return it to you and even deduct amount from security deposit. I won\2019t recommend anyone here. Guys save your money and find another PG. Else you\2019ll end up with loosing your money and you will have worse experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.339683', 1, 113, 4),
(687, U&'[Joshua Anil] This place is an absolute mess. The rooms are extremely cramped, the beds are broken, there are pests, the bathrooms are unclean, and the sinks are tiny and poorly maintained. Even the couch provided in my room was old, worn out, and in terrible condition. The photos shown on the app are completely misleading and do not resemble the actual property at all.nnWhat made the experience even worse was the management. The manager was extremely rude and unprofessional. Instead of helping me when I wanted to check out, he shouted at me and refused to address my concerns respectfully.nnI paid nearly \20b924,000 just for a month\2019s stay. I was initially promised that food would be included, but at the last minute they went back on their word and denied it. I was also asked to pay an advance of \20b99,600, out of which around \20b93,000 was deducted as a maintenance fee. When I checked out, they demanded even more money for electricity and water charges, which had never been clearly communicated to me beforehand.nnTo make matters worse, I couldn\2019t even initiate the checkout process without first raising a ticket through their app. However, the app would not allow me to raise the checkout ticket unless I first paid the rent for the following month. I was effectively forced to pay an additional month\2019s rent just to begin the checkout process, which was extremely frustrating and unfair.nnWhen I tried to raise these concerns, I was met with rude behavior and insults instead of any genuine attempt to resolve my grievances. I felt like I was being charged at every step through hidden costs and poor communication. Overall, this has been by far the worst accommodation experience I\2019ve had in Bengaluru. I would never recommend this place to anyone, not even to my worst enemy. Don\2019t be misled by the photos or the promises; the reality is completely different.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.33979', 1, 113, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(688, '[Chinni Dinesh] Clean and well-maintained PG with reliable basic amenities and a convenient location.nManagement is generally supportive,nOverall, a comfortable and affordable option for quick stays and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.339891', 5, 113, 4),
(689, '[teja thota] Budget friendly hotel.nNear to major places', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.339994', 5, 113, 4),
(690, '[David Chaudhary] Place is unlivable. Full of pests. Poor bathrooms. Full of cockroaches. Sink so small, can''t even brush teeth properly. The drain of sink opens on your feet. If you want feeling of living in a slum, this is your place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.340092', 2, 113, 4),
(691, '[Ruthless Star] A very convenient and comfortable place to stay. I use it whenever I have office visits, and all the facilities provided are of good quality.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.340188', 5, 113, 4),
(692, U&'[pbc daniel] As a Teenager, One of the best PG I''ve stayed in. My co-worker and I stayed here for two weeks for work, and it truly felt like a home away from home.nnThe staff were incredibly friendly and helpful. We requested a room change before leaving for work, and when we returned, they had carefully moved all our belongings\2014including our clothes, slippers, and shoes\2014with great care. That thoughtful gesture meant a lot to us.nnThe room was also cleaned every day and kept spotless. Thank you to the entire team for your kindness and wonderful hospitality. Highly recommended !!\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.392247', 5, 115, 4),
(693, U&'[Priyanshu Pal Dutta] Worst pg i  have ever staying zolo is worst in bengaluru electronic city specially .3rd class service 3rd class managers are there in zolo . They didn\2019t help u in anyways only while u went to see pg they talk and behave good and make some fake promises after once u opt in they dis appear and after exit u dont even ask they didnt even pick your calls i had a horrible experience at zolo for god sake no body please take zolo here in electronic city anyways all zolos are going to close at the rate they are giving services . Only pro of zolo is u get good looking rooms beside this the food is worst the cleaning is worst even 3-4 mice  running over the kitchen in zolo they are like pet . Pest control is 0 . Customer care is -10', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.392372', 1, 115, 4),
(694, '[Silverster Paul] Good place to stay. Everything you need are available within 3km. A good budget PG in electronic City. Oly drawback is no food available in this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.392481', 4, 115, 4),
(695, U&'[Chal Godava] Great stay...!!! No inconveniences not so ever...!!! Easy access and affordable...\+01f44d\+01f3fc\+01f44d\+01f3fc\+01f44d\+01f3fc', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.392585', 5, 115, 4),
(696, '[Dinesh Varma] Clean and convenient. Easy check in and good maintenance..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.392689', 5, 115, 4),
(697, '[Ariva Love] Neat and clean and staff behaviour good. Afford and comfortable price.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.392794', 5, 115, 4),
(698, '[Ashish Singh] Clean and comfortable room with awesome amenities at least having a peaceful stay after searching 4-5 month', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.393071', 5, 115, 4),
(699, '[Vinayprasad B] Value for my money. Where they are providing the quality and spacious room along with clean and maintained washrooms. With high quality WiFi facility along with unlimited data. Incl of your two times food and weekend thrice. With parking, Dth, housekeeping, linen changes, powerbackup, Common kitchen with induction, micro oven, and refrigerator.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.393186', 5, 115, 4),
(700, '[Vijaya Ramireddy] My sister is staying in this hostel, and our experience has been very good. The hostel is clean, well-maintained, and provides a safe and comfortable environment for girls. The food quality is excellent, with hygienic and tasty meals served regularly. The rooms and common areas are cleaned properly, and the management is very supportive and responsive.nI highly recommend this hostel to anyone looking for a safe, clean, and well-managed place to stay. Keep up the great work!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.422873', 5, 116, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(701, U&'[Ashifa Ibrahim] I had a very disappointing experience at this PG. The management manipulates residents by withholding advance payments until they receive positive Google reviews. The food quality is poor, and the surroundings are overcrowded with stray dogs, making it difficult to walk, especially during the rainy season. The rooms have no proper ventilation, and even if there\2019s a window, it\2019s blocked by another room, causing heat and congestion. Hot showers only worsen the situation. Cleaning standards are subpar, and despite promises, the place is not maintained well.nnOverall, I would not recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable and reliable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.423009', 1, 116, 4),
(702, '[Saumya Jain] Living in this pg was one of the best experience. Cleanliness is first class, environment is lively and people are very good over here. The manager and workers are very helpful. They will listen to your problems and make sure it get resolved soon. Security is great and no fear of anything.nFood is good, sometimes it may get bore having same vegetable but its same in every pg.nnOverall it''s superb to stay in this pg.One of the best and affordable pg in Bangalore.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.423148', 5, 116, 4),
(703, U&'[anvita bangera] SV home is the best place to stay for girls in Electronic city.They provide veg food and it\2019s tasty. If I ever get a chance to come back to Electronic city, I would love to come back again as the environment and area near the PG is too safe. Highly recommended for girls as the PG is well maintained with good food.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.42343', 5, 116, 4),
(704, '[Madhu Harshni] Enjoyed my stay. Very hygienic and friendly pg. Best pg you can find in entire electronic City', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.423552', 5, 116, 4),
(705, '[Nikitha Anna Philip] Really nice experience staying in this PG.nGood Food, Very neat and clean.nGood facilities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.423672', 5, 116, 4),
(706, '[sushma priya] I have been here for 2 years , best place for professional workers and safe for girls especially.nI would definitely recommend all of my peers to stay in this pg .nBest aminities and mess is good here .nFor all the females , this place is safe and convenient for all the near places .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.423917', 5, 116, 4),
(707, '[Aishwarya sathyanarayana] SV homes luxury ladies PG is well maintained, hygienic and home like environment. All the basic amenities one requires (washing machine, wifi, water heater, lift) are well managed and provided 24/7. Fully secured with CCTV camera and bio-metric entry. Super-friendly owner. Highly recommend this PG for anyone looking for a safe,friendly and clean environment!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.424036', 5, 116, 4),
(708, U&'[Varun Pai] Highly recommend this luxury PG in Electronic City! It\2019s exceptionally clean, well-maintained, and offers top-notch amenities for a comfortable stay. Perfect location and hassle-free living!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.457034', 5, 117, 4),
(709, '[Umasankar Reddy] Cleaning is good , power back up is there which was recently useful . Food I am satisfied . Overall I am happy with money and facilities . I would recommend for others with out doubt and comparison', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.457224', 5, 117, 4),
(710, '[women fashion] very bad , owner is very arrogent , dirty place and no electricity and lift also stops working', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.457342', 1, 117, 4),
(711, '[anjaneyulu y] To bad to worst accomodation pg.no electricity,no hot water,no cleaning,rude behaviour and no response if any problem occurs.do not come to this pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.45755', 1, 117, 4),
(712, '[Aryan Raghavendra] Amazing experience with clean and sanitized rooms, which had abundant space and luxury.  Would surely recommend everyone to book and experience the stay here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.457707', 5, 117, 4),
(713, '[Best Saree buy] worst accommodation pg . no electricity, no hot water, no cleaning, rude behaviour and no response', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.457832', 1, 117, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(714, U&'[Dhivyesh Raj] It\2019s a good place to stay and people are humble.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.457952', 5, 117, 4),
(715, '[Laddu Kumar] Good to stay in this pg good place also', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.458073', 5, 117, 4),
(716, '[jatin kukreja] This place was good, I was living here for almost 2 years as it is spacious, clean and well made. But now they have increased the price like anything, you need to pay 12k for 2 sharing(Rent +GST+Electricity) and in return no one listens to you.nLately the higher management has gone from bad to worse, we have drainage issues for a month where the entrance of PG stinks and gets overflowed during rain. We have a theft issue where our fruits, vegetables, shoes and other items are getting stolen regularly and they are just saying they will install Biometric doors for 2 months.nLastly you keep raising tickets and they will not reply to you, our property and cluster manager both got frustrated and left zolo in the same month. Now we have no one to check status of tickets as nobody replies.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.487769', 1, 118, 4),
(717, '[saumya singh] Worst stay, property rent increases continuously, facilities are degrading day by day(drinking water, cleanliness, lift maintenance, wifi etc etc) earlier it was good and customer friendly but now it is totally opposite.. i will never ever recommend zolo to anyone.. writing this for a better cause so that no one else get into this zolo trap...nNot at all value for money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.487912', 1, 118, 4),
(718, '[Lankesh Mandal] Zolo dream is nice place to stay in and fantastic atmosphere over there also friendly staff. Affordable price for flats new building.nSo it''s beautiful flats. Thanks.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.488044', 5, 118, 4),
(719, '[Minto John] Very nice place to stay. Fully furnished homes. Good privacy. Very nice hospitality.  They have very good offers running. I reccomend this place to all', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.48818', 5, 118, 4),
(720, '[kunal biswas] Very nice place with rooms well maintained and cleaned. The staff members are good and well behaved. Price for rooms its quite high.Thanks', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.488299', 5, 118, 4),
(721, '[Himal Chand] Zolo dream house is very nice place to stay and it''s hygiene standards also nice staff so happy to stay in zolo dream house. I recommend this building is most likely to stay.nThanks.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.488417', 5, 118, 4),
(722, '[Renu India] Nice pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.488576', 5, 118, 4),
(723, '[N.K.A Khan] The services are brilliant... If the rate of every location are good as this then it will help a lot of student and freshers which come in .zolo will knows for the freshers ... I m really to get in worth zolo, never saw a better service and properties than this', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.488694', 5, 118, 4),
(724, U&'[Mahesh N] I have been staying here for the past one month in a single room, and this is the worst experience I\2019ve ever had. The bathroom is absolutely filthy \2013 they promised cleaning on alternate days but in reality, it happens only once a week. The drainage system is disgusting; if you flush, dirty water literally comes back out of the drainage filter.nnThe geyser has not worked from day one. I\2019ve raised multiple tickets, but every single time I get a fake email within 30 minutes saying \201cyour ticket has been resolved,\201d while nothing is actually fixed. This is nothing but cheating and false promises.nnThis property is a complete scam. Management doesn\2019t care, facilities don\2019t work, and hygiene is non-existent. Save yourself the torture \2013 DO NOT stay at Zolo Renaissance PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.52223', 1, 119, 4),
(725, '[Unnati] Loved the stay here. Such a positive ambience here. I feel very happy here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.522376', 5, 119, 4),
(726, '[Aditya kumar] I visited 3 other zolo''s and this one is realy clean and  cleaning was happening in every day and also fresh filtered water was keeped in the drinking container in each floor,  apart from this warden behavior was pretty decent compared to other''s zolo''s i visited in last couples of month.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.522547', 5, 119, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(727, '[Aravind sankar] Worst experience I ever had. While booking the room, they gave eye catching offers/promises, after getting into property, they will change the rules and force you to pay rent without offers. Customer care will act like they will assist you, but they won''t.nFood is not hygiene- cockroaches will be roaming.nTiny room with no proper ventilation.nnWill never recommend this hostel to anyone.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.52267', 1, 119, 4),
(728, '[Aditya Bandagi] Never trust on Zolo, worst pg experience. Many hidden charges, aren''t worth the PG price. Find some local pg at a better price. Over hyped', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.522792', 1, 119, 4),
(729, '[yuri xnox (eve)] One of the good pg in electronic city, comfortable stay and all needs are provided.nWill surely recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.522933', 5, 119, 4),
(730, '[Sushant Sundaran] Really good PG with high cleanliness standards. Spacious roomnUtilities - TV, Water heater, table, power backup, wifi, washing machines, elevator, Daily PG sanitization, Alternate days room cleaning, cctv camera security, parking space for bikes and other basic facilities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.523132', 4, 119, 4),
(731, '[Sourav Srivastava] I have been residing in zolo renaissance since 2 years and it''s been a fabalous journey. Staff and care-taker has always been polite and helpful.nFood is also good compared to other pg.nMust recommend for anyone to stay at electronic city.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.523265', 5, 119, 4),
(732, '[Manju Manju] Worst Pg I''ve seen. Please don''t join this pg, They will charge more and provide worst services. Before joining they will say different charges and on the day of joining different classes and after joining EXTRA CHARGES too. FOOD is very bad morning they will not provide fresh food, only night can eat.nn- Unrealised Extra chargesn- No fresh foodn- No Hygienen- No proper electricitynnEspecially this pg is a nightmare for me .nI''ve been in Bangalore for 2 years. I joined this pg because I''ve no time to cook . Signed contract for one year and paid advance and onboarding charges and stamp charges. For one month it costed me 23k , inbetween because of food and no hygiene I got food poisoning multiple times. In a month i returned my home by leaving my job. All credits goes to this pg and Staff .nnIt looks attractive from outside but instead will be a worst maintenance. The Staff will do scam also, they will allow ppl who stays temporary and take money unofficially. So theirs water usage cost should be paid by who stays officially.nnPlease don''t even think to join this pg.nIt''s a request, if you want person experience you can gladly join.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.556359', 1, 120, 4),
(733, '[anamika gowda] Worst Experience. Don''t join this pg. If google provides negative rating i would have gave that. Every now and then there are issues like water , electricity , lift. Also they take onboarding charges and they give you a room with cupboard which has cockroaches. There is no hygiene. The washroom smells like rotten place. There is no helpline. The app where you raise a ticket is worthless they don''t acknowledge.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.556571', 1, 120, 4),
(734, '[Gwen] I had an incredible experience at stanza living tour in house the accommodation is stop not clean safe and totally designed. The stuff a really supportive and the amenities make everyday living comfortable', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.556812', 5, 120, 4),
(735, '[Kishan Chetry] The onboarding process was incredibly smooth and left me feeling supported from day one. The handover of the room was on time, and the space was clean and ready. App-based steps for joining were efficient and quick. Communication was clear, with each update provided at the right time. Friendly faces and welcoming smiles put me at ease as soon as I entered. From booking online to walking into my room, the whole process was seamless. Assistance was available whenever I needed it, both before and after check-in. Everything was so well-coordinated that there were no hiccups at all.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.55694', 5, 120, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(736, '[Gwen P] The on boarding process was incredibly smooth and the lift me feelings about it from day one, the staff are very supportive and very helpful,..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.557195', 5, 120, 4),
(737, '[Ram Marley] The study desk provided by Turin House is wide enough to accommodate my dual monitor setup comfortably.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.557335', 5, 120, 4),
(738, U&'[Manoj Hanamshetty] Worst Experience at Stanza Living Turin House \2013 Big ScamnnI stayed here for 3 months and every single day was a nightmare. There are constant water and electricity issues, sometimes taking more than 6+ hours to resolve. The water supplied is extremely dirty and unhygienic.nnBut the biggest scam is the SECURITY DEPOSIT. At the time of joining, they promised it would be refunded within 45 working days after checkout. It\2019s been 90+ working days and they kept giving lame excuses like \201ctechnical issues.\201d Clearly, there are no technical issues \2013 it\2019s just a scam to hold your money.nnThere is ZERO support \2013 no proper contact number, no helpdesk. When I contacted the manager Hemanth, he shamelessly said \201cthe money was given to Stanza, go ask them not me.\201d This shows their unprofessional and irresponsible behavior.nnFinally, I had to call the police, and guess what? Within 5 minutes my money was refunded. That itself proves how they fool people until legal action is taken.nnPlease avoid this PG at any cost.nDo not fall for their fake promises.nYou will lose your peace of mind, health, and your money.nnStanza Living Turin House is a total fraud \2013 Never ever recommend this to anyone!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.557792', 1, 120, 4),
(739, '[Raghavendra K P] I didn''t like staying in this PG ,the agent took 1000 Indian rupees from me and said they had to paint the room and they have to pay for the people to clean the room isn''t it there work to check for this ? which had been alloted to us. When we were staying there they painted the whole pg and didn''t charge penny from other residents as per my knowledge. there are so many hidden charges they''ll deduct like platform fee,exit fee and they had  put fine of 150 for damages such that there were no damages when we left and the food wasnt good when we stayed there on top of that cleaners didn''t used to clean the room properly and if anytime water is not available it will take a lot of time to get refilled and you have to pay for your own electricity and water bill.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.557994', 1, 120, 4),
(740, '[Mandeep] Good pg, owner is good, food hygiene can be improved, rate also affordable... Overall good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.588926', 4, 121, 4),
(741, '[Sandeep Reddy] One of the best PG accommodations in the area. The property is clean, secure, and well-managed. The staff is cooperative, and the amenities provided are worth the cost. The peaceful atmosphere makes it suitable for both students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.589067', 5, 121, 4),
(742, U&'[Mohammad Buran] \200bA fantastic stay! The room was very nice\2014clean, spacious, and extremely comfortable. Everything I needed was right there, and the service was excellent. I had a great night''s sleep and would definitely recommend this ph', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.589205', 5, 121, 4),
(743, '[Ustaj Bc] Best pg in neeladri  sml pg for colivenBig rooms   testy food and frindly owner', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.589343', 4, 121, 4),
(744, '[Dinesh Sahu] Sml pg for co live is good Rooms is good testy food is in an excellently maintained pg affordable prices  rooms daily cleaning', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.589464', 5, 121, 4),
(745, '[Rakesh Barman] Good rooms homely food good location and friendly owner', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.589592', 4, 121, 4),
(746, '[Srikanth Reddy] SML PG is an excellent place to stay with a very homely atmosphere.The PG is extremely neat and well maintained, making it very comfortable for daily living.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.589715', 5, 121, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(747, '[Y.Gangadri Gangadri] Good location biggest rooms low price', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.589836', 5, 121, 4),
(748, U&'[Dare Devil] The overall stay experience is good in terms of maintenance, cleanliness, and the owner''s responsiveness.nHowever, the food quality has declined over time. It was good initially, but for nearly one year now it has not been satisfactory. Because of this, I often have to eat outside despite paying for the meals here.nI hope the management takes this feedback seriously and works toward improving the TASTE and QUALITY of the food.nn-----------------REPLY----------------------nnThank you for your response. As suggested, here are my detailed observations regarding the food:nnOverall you can have a little menu change or get a new chef.nnTiffin : -n\2022Tuesday- upma often gets salty.n\2022Friday- Poha is miserable ..n(my opinion is you can change both the dishes with another items)nnLUNCH :-n\2022Every Curry has too much masala..(adding masala or salt is not equal to taste)n\2022Liked the chutney (saviour)n\2022Rice quality and papads are super no doubtnnDINNER:-n\2022Roti are sometimes becoming papad or getting foul smell (they never are proper)n\2022Again every Curry has too much masala..(adding too much masala or salt is not equal to taste)n\2022Wednesday - keep the rice simple don''t experiment on us with colours of green and orange ....egg and chicken gravys are having triple masala (please have some mercy on our stomach)n\2022Saturday - gobi rice (it''s okay okay but sometimes make us cry)nnThank you. We look forward to positive improvements.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.627913', 2, 122, 4),
(749, U&'[Abhishek Prasad] I have been living here for 3 years.nI have never faced any problems.nThe PG owner\2019s behavior is very good and polite.nThe room rent was also reasonable.nThe food was also good.nRoom service was also good.nThe room was also good and had proper ventilation.nNever had any issues\+01f642\+01f642\+01f642\+01f642', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.628052', 5, 122, 4),
(750, '[veera saiteja] This PG is a very nice place to stay. The owner is a very good human being, friendly and always ready to help. The rooms and facilities are clean and well maintained. I feel comfortable and safe staying here. Thank you for the great accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.628177', 5, 122, 4),
(751, '[Vaibhav Kumar] I have been staying at this PG for the last 10 months, and my experience has been great. The facilities and services provided are excellent, making it a comfortable place to stay. Here are some key highlights of my experience:nn1.The food quality is awesome.n2.There is 24/7 water supply.n3.Never faced any problems related to electricity.n4.Room service is also good.n5.WiFi service is also good.n6.Last but not least, the PG owner is a true gentleman.nnOverall, I highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a hassle-free and comfortable stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.628297', 5, 122, 4),
(752, '[Swayam Swastik] If you are looking for a good pg, then this is place. The owner is very professional, the caretakers are very active. The food is good, hygiene and clean. It''s been 8 months scene I came here, to be honest there no solid point to leave this place.nIt''s very difficult to find such pg and good owner.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.628417', 5, 122, 4),
(753, '[deepak tejappa] Rooms are good ventilated, never got issue with water, current and wifi, they have backup generator, good wifi connectivity, there are 3 washing machines and ample of space for parking for both 2 and 4 wheelers till you stay it''s good. But the incharge who runs the place is not professional doesn''t know how to response for issue and temper minded i had issue with my matress he never replaced till I vacate, he made me to vacate when I was not at the property on 29th itself and i lost some of the items in the room while vacating the property. Had very bad issue with him while vacating the room if anyone staying and planning to vacate do it 2 or 3 days in advance.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.628537', 2, 122, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(754, '[Nani GVY] Friendly ownernGood foodnOld building but budget friendlynCo living, daily or weekly stays availablenHigh security thumb accessnParking space for bikesnLiftnWiFi', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.628657', 2, 122, 4),
(755, '[Dora Babu Yadav] I have been staying here from.past 6 months.nFood u0026 Maintenance was good. The owner is too friendly', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.628844', 5, 122, 4),
(756, '[Mohammad Ovais Durrani] Stayed here for 10 months and the experience was great.nExcellent locationnGood maintenancenBetter food than othersnRegular cleaningnHuge parking spacenDecent play area and washing areanMr Naga Reddy and family is cooperative and understanding, they consider the complain and try to resolve it as soon as possible.nI will Recommend it to students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.661867', 5, 123, 4),
(757, U&'[Guru Guru] Pg  room are good option if you are looking for affordable and convenient accommodation, especially in cities like Bangalore. It usually includes basic facilities like a bed, food, WiFi, and housekeeping, which makes it suitable for students and working professionals. However, the quality of PGs varies a lot\2014some are clean, safe, and well-managed, while others may have issues like poor hygiene, bad food, overcrowding, or hidden charges. So, a PG room is good only if you choose carefully by visiting the place, checking facilities, and talking to current tenants before finalizing.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.662007', 5, 123, 4),
(758, '[Vinayak Buchke] Pretty good pg with all the necessary basic amenities ( Wifi , Washing machine , induction stove , Gym , badminton   court ) . Both north and south food present . The rent is slightly on higher side compared to other pgs but worth it to be honest .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.662143', 5, 123, 4),
(759, U&'[Muni Tarak] \201cThe PG is well-maintained with good hygiene standards. The food is also tasty and satisfactory. Overall, a good place to stay.\201dnnMore polished:', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.66226', 5, 123, 4),
(760, '[atkuri ajay kumar] Good pg , 2 times food , washing machines, gym and every facilities are available.nRent cycle begins starting of every month.nGood pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.662453', 5, 123, 4),
(761, '[Ayush Patel] Good rooms, proper cleaning and polite staff, here''s some of the pictures of the food options they have :', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.662571', 5, 123, 4),
(762, '[Anuj Saini] Rooms are good... Ventilation is proper.... Direct sunlight enter to the room... Common areas are well maintained... Enough space for laundry and to dry the clothes... food is good too but you can never get home like food...', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.662683', 5, 123, 4),
(763, '[Nishanth Mungara] One of the bad PGs in Electronic City.Water stops midnight at around 11 pm.The owners are money minded, don''t come here.I have been here for 2 years and don''t recommend it at all.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.662794', 1, 123, 4),
(764, U&'[Mounika Ks] I\2019m really happy staying here. The PG is super clean, well organized, and the food is fresh every day. The owner is kind and always helps with any issues quickly. Highly recommend this place!\+01f60d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.696234', 5, 124, 4),
(765, '[Vidya Vedamoorthi] The pg is well maintained and owner Sandhya akka is very understanding and helpful. They accept feedback and issues are resolved when raised. It''s safe to stay as the family also resides in the pg. Over experience is good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.696388', 5, 124, 4),
(766, U&'[Manisha kakarla] The PG is clean and well-maintained. Rooms are comfortable and spacious. Food is homely and fresh most of the time. The owner is polite and responsive. Overall, it\2019s a good place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.696509', 5, 124, 4),
(767, U&'[Pavan Reddy] Title: Worst Experience \2013 Unprofessional and Unethical BehaviornnI had a terrible experience with this PG, as shared by my friend. The owner enters rooms without permission, invades tenants'' privacy, and constantly questions them about personal matters. He also shouts at female residents, taking advantage of the fact that they may not speak up.nnThe mental harassment faced by the tenants is unacceptable. Moreover, there is clear favoritism based on language and regional background, leading to discrimination against those from different states. This kind of biased and disrespectful treatment makes staying here a nightmare.nnI strongly advise against choosing this PG. It lacks professionalism, respect, and a safe environment for residents. Avoid it at all costs!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.696631', 1, 124, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(768, U&'[Meghana K] I am staying in this pg from 3 months it''s very good atmosphere, healthy food, cleanliness is maintained very perfectly. Pg moto is that customer always should feel like their home. Even management will treat everyone like thier own family. I am happy with these pg facilities.nnPG have TV in every room, 24hrs hot/cold water, every floor there is fridge, iron box and table,water purifier.nnSpacious terrace, on terrace there are washing machines, gym they are making to arrange in very short period.nnIn kitchen there is micro oven, 24hrs double water purifier with hot and cold water, gas stove with utensils to cook ourselves, spacious and neat dining hall.nnI recommend people to join here\2764\fe0f\+01f970', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.696759', 5, 124, 4),
(769, '[Sreekar Tammana] Friendly owners. Joined my sister in their pg and now we became familynBest pg with all facilities and gold food', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.696888', 5, 124, 4),
(770, '[Thambali Bhoyar] Excellent food, it''s like having the home made food. Owner''s are providing really good service taking care of small small things going extra mile, doing everything and very friendly. Nice clean rooms privacy is there located in a very good area. IT''s like a home you won''t feel like PG. I recommend this PG from my experience please do visit it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.697204', 5, 124, 4),
(771, '[Sneha Vijayakumar] One of the best pg in the whole place... I stayed here for more than a year and never felt like leaving this pg. It has a homely atmosphere.nThe rooms are very neat and tidy. The food is also good. It is a very secured place for women to stay. I strongly suggest this pg for its facilities. Thanks to the owner Sandeep Anna.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.697332', 5, 124, 4),
(772, U&'[Aishwarya] Had to vacate just after 7 months because I changed my job but if I ever get a job in Electronic City, I will definitely return to this PG only, (if possible the same room)\+01f605nnFrom food to cleanliness, everything is maintained. Warden, cook everyone behaves well.nnOne of the best PG/Hostel I ever stayed. P.S. I am staying in hostels since 2014, different cities, different PGs', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.729543', 5, 125, 4),
(773, '[anu radha] I stayed in this PG for over two years and really enjoyed my time here. The owners are kind and approachable, the environment is positive, and the security is reliable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.729708', 5, 125, 4),
(774, '[Monisha Krishnamoorthy] This is my first time ever staying away from home, checked so many pgs and choose this one because i felt belonged here, food is good , hotwater 24/7, cleaning, washing machine and shed to dry out clothes which many pgs don''t have. And the incharge person is really welcoming and helpful.nThank you', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.729833', 5, 125, 4),
(775, '[Anitha ani26] U can feel home atmosphere , good food and facilities when compared with the other pgs in that area.nU can reachout the owners whenever ur r facing any emergency and they will help u if they can . They are very supportive and welcoming people .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.729954', 5, 125, 4),
(776, '[Dhanalakshmi S] I am staying here of almost couple of yearsnRooms will be very spacious and rent also very reasonable compared to other PG in electronic city.nFood will be good we can say kind of home food, if at all we are bit late and food is not there also they will arrange something whichever is possible. It kind of feels like a home for me. overall its a secured, good and financially friendly PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.730073', 5, 125, 4),
(777, '[Prasad Guru] One of the best ladies pg in Neeladrinagar it''s like home atmosphere pg.   owner behaviour is feel like  her family''s member guest', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.730199', 5, 125, 4),
(778, '[PALLA Jyothy] Looking too good and food also so tasty it feal look like a home', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.730316', 5, 125, 4),
(779, '[Sadananda Sadananda gs] My sister was staying in pg from last 6 months, Food was nice and rooms are very clean vist once', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.73043', 5, 125, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(780, '[Dhanajayan K] Consistently Excellent Stay at Chronicle!nnCheck-In/Out: Seamless, lightning-fast, and completely professional.nnAmbiance: Great, peaceful atmosphere that is perfect for a relaxing night.nnStaff Hospitality: The hotel manager and caretaker provide stellar customer service and take great care of the guests.nnI visit this place frequently and it never disappoints. Affordable too and Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.765294', 5, 126, 4),
(781, U&'[Senthil Kumar] Me and my father-in-law booked the room looking at the rating. The room was just okay. But, the staff are unprofessionals including the property manager and the cluster manager except the contact person who handles the online booking. They were supposed to switch on the hot water supply system in the morning. But, it was not done at all until we left the property at 7:30AM. The care taker didn\2019t act upon our request for hot water but directed us to call the property manager and the cluster manager and went back to sleep. But, both of them neither attended the calls nor called back. Ms. Kosila Chetri the person in-charge tried her best to help us but it all went in vain. Finally we had to take bath in cold water as we had to leave early to go to the hospital. The property too is located in a filthy area. Please don\2019t book in any of the Zolo properties.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.765464', 2, 126, 4),
(782, '[Abdul Quadir Munaf] Excellent place to stay for business or long stay as well. Clean and nice rooms and well supportive staff.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.76559', 5, 126, 4),
(783, U&'[Reshma Binukumar] This was one of the worst hotel experiences I\2019ve ever had.nnThe staff behavior is completely unacceptable and highly disrespectful. One of the cleaning staff spoke to us as if we were staying there for free, which is extremely insulting and unprofessional.nnOn top of that, the same staff kept coming every single day asking whether we would extend our stay or not. I understand that this is part of his job, but there is a proper way to speak to customers. His approach was rude and inappropriate. I have been staying here for more than 25 days, and the cleaning staff has behaved like this every day.nnThis is very irritating and makes guests feel uncomfortable instead of welcome.nnHousekeeping service is terrible. The room was not cleaned properly, and basic things like changing blankets were completely ignored.nnThe staff clearly have no idea how to treat customers in the hospitality industry. This kind of behavior is shocking and unacceptable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.765707', 1, 126, 4),
(784, '[Mukund Kunde] Very disappointed. Third class service. Very expensive. Taking monthly rent on time but no lift service cleaning service even after raising complaint it always remain unsolved. Very poor service third class support. Poor network wifi. I strongly suggests do not come to this PG. Pure wastage of money and efforts', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.765825', 1, 126, 4),
(785, '[babita Porwal] Very dirty and Unhygienic PG...no maintainance and even no one to respond our concern...whenever care taker Mr Vishnu is conveyed to problem he seems reluctant to solve it....some latest photos that shows Unhygienicness of PG..like very dirty Ceiling fan, dirty towels, dirty bucket and mug....we suggest never stay here...', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.765942', 1, 126, 4),
(786, '[lasagna] Very unclean place, even the bedsheets arent clean and fan is so dirty u cant see also. Super small room. It looks nowhere liie the picture', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.766158', 1, 126, 4),
(787, '[Manoj Kamble] Highly expensive PG for no reason. Multiple PGs are available that are as good as Zolo. No food served at the PG  and they will arrange food from outside.  Not recommended if you are looking for a budget PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.766417', 3, 126, 4),
(788, U&'[Bharani] I stayed here for nearly 7 years, and it truly felt like a second home. The safety, daily cleaning, and overall maintenance were consistently well managed throughout my stay. Whenever we raised any issue, the team responded promptly and ensured it was resolved quickly. I would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a well-maintained, safe, and comfortable place to stay. Thank you for all the support and care over the years. I\2019m leaving with many wonderful memories and hope you continue the same excellent service while growing even better in the years ahead. \+01f60a\+01f49c', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.802491', 5, 127, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(789, U&'[Nasa Janu] \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50nnI had a very good experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean, spacious, and well maintained. The food is tasty and hygienic, and the housekeeping team keeps the premises clean every day.nnThe management is supportive and responds quickly to maintenance requests. Facilities like Wi-Fi, hot water, washing machines, and security are well maintained. The environment is safe, peaceful, and comfortable, making it a great place to stay.nnI highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a clean, secure, and well-managed accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.802626', 5, 127, 4),
(790, '[Sai Sandeep Reddy G] My sister is studying B.Tech in Computer Science and Engineering (Quantum Computing u0026 Information Science) under AU-QUASAR at Alliance University.nnVSR Stay in Ladies PG is very close to the university and offers comfortable rooms at reasonable prices compared with the college hostel. The PG provides Wi-Fi, three meals a day, a gym, power backup, and a dedicated study area. These facilities are a big advantage for students.nnI definitely recommend VSR Stay in  Ladies PG for female students studying at Alliance University-Electronic City.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.80284', 5, 127, 4),
(791, '[sulthan sony] Excellent place for girls looking for accommodation near PES University and Alliance University Quantam AI school Friendly management, clean rooms, and all essential amenities are available. And near by companies and metro very convenient', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.802967', 5, 127, 4),
(792, U&'[MOUNIKA KARNA] VSR STAY IN LADIES PG is very extraordinary PG.nnPG Room gives a homely feeling with well furnished environment.nnMaintenance is very good. In my entire PG Life one of the best PG I really loved\+01f60d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.803095', 5, 127, 4),
(793, '[Bhawna Singh Sangwan] Perfect place to live at. I never found a pg this good ever. Food is very good for a PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.80322', 5, 127, 4),
(794, '[SWETA MOHANTY] Spending 1 year in this PG has been a memorable experience. The environment was comfortable, safe, and welcoming. I appreciate the cleanliness, facilities, and the support from the staff/owner whenever any issue came up. This place gave me many memories and truly felt like home away from home. Thank you for everythingnHighly recommended', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.803345', 5, 127, 4),
(795, '[Deepak Bohara] Good Ladies PGnI have been staying in this PG for the past 8 months. The rooms are clean and well maintained. Safety is very good, with day and night security available. Biometric access is provided for each resident. The PG rules are good and are followed very strictly by the owner. I feel this is one of the best ladies PGs near the Infosys Electronic City campus.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.803469', 5, 127, 4),
(796, U&'[Kartika D] Stayed here for 2 months and would not recommend this PG. The biggest issue is security - multiple tenants, including my roommate and myself, had belongings go missing from our cupboards. The locking system is extremely poor, with keys reportedly opening multiple cupboards, yet no action was taken despite repeated complaints.nnThe rooms are small, cleanliness is not maintained properly, and overall maintenance is below expectations. The management is more interested in defending themselves than addressing genuine concerns. When I raised these issues while vacating, the manager brought up giving me a Dolo tablet during a fever and literally told me that \201c i should have not taken care by getting tablets, we wont take care of any tenants here, but since we speak same language and from same state i took care but you\2019re asking so many questions \201c .( he literally asked the housekeeper to give me dolo tablet that any pg or humans would do )instead of answering questions about security and maintenance. Such an unprofessional person he is. But, the lady owner is good but this person twists things according to his convenience.nnFood is average at best. Breakfast is often disappointing, and chapati is rarely served, with \201cgas shortage\201d being the repeated explanation throughout my stay.nnOverall, poor security, poor maintenance, and unprofessional handling of tenant concerns. Please think twice before choosing this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.841279', 2, 128, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(797, U&'[Rajamma Pudota] My niece  is staying in AVS P.G for girls. Really it is very good and tidy. Food is taken care and hygiene is remarkable. Every tiny thing is taken care. owners are very polite and reasonable. Security is \+01f4af. Biometric is there. Manager is always at your service. \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.841438', 5, 128, 4),
(798, U&'[Tharinya Sreenivasan] Manager and Owner are very polite and gentle towards the guests,\263a\fe0f Very good hospitality and a peaceful place to stay.nnIrrespective of language and all diversities we stay as a family and celebrate all the occasions together.\+01f60dnn24/7 hot water \+01fad6and Wifi \+01f4f6are available. Power backup is also there.nnLocated near restaurants and hospital,\+01f3e9 easy to navigate out and roam around.\+01f698nnFood \+01f37dis very good and also self cooking facility is also available.nnEveryday rooms are used to be cleaned and wiped on alternative days.nnVery friendly environment and people you have to get connected and enjoy the days\2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.841568', 5, 128, 4),
(799, '[Bhuvana Bhuvi] Had a good experience here. Advance was returned on time. Staff are very friendly and helpful. Food quality is good, wifi is stable and rooms are cleaned every day. Would recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.841707', 5, 128, 4),
(800, '[Chinnu Umarji] I stayed here for nearly two and half years.nDecent pg, they clean the rooms and bathroom everyday, food is also decent.nWe even have a option to cook ourselves.nProblems I faced:nLift and washing machine would get damaged often.nMany of my parcels even food parcels for that matter got stolen.nThings in kitchen like plate and cooking pan were stolen.nHad a good experience until I needed to vacate the pg.nI had informed orally in the beginning of the month that I will vacate at the end of the month. The owner however did not ask me to write the vacate notice in the notice book they maintained.nOn the day I was vacating, they claimed that I have not informed them about vacating and did not refund my advance.nI didn''t argue much and left the advance amount.nI had too much luggage so I decided to shift it in two batches, once I took my first batch of luggage and stepped out of the pg, the manager and cleaning staff cleaned the room I stayed ( which had few of my belongings). While I came back for shifting the second batch of my luggage after an hour or so ..many of my belongings were missing including a pillow, my soft toys and a bag worth 3K.nThey could have called me seeing those things I left there which were in a good condition and asked me why I had kept them there with my other luggage. Instead they chose to throw them in trash.nI suffered such a huge loss, no advance refund plus loss of my expensive bag and other small belongings.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.841829', 2, 128, 4),
(801, '[Divi] Best PG in Bengaluru. After stayed and seen lot of pg''s I''m taking this time to appreciate the AVS pg for the good management, best food, good staff and security. PG is located in a very decent area. They have maintained pg very systematically, providing weekly 2 times chicken and one time eggs. They have professional cook and for the first time I liked pg food. Thank you.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.841962', 5, 128, 4),
(802, '[Dharani jinna] The food is good and rooms are maintained well with regular cleaning. Feels safe and the overall atmosphere is peaceful. Good value for money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.842237', 5, 128, 4),
(803, '[deepika N] Truly a great PG. The rooms are clean, the amenities are well-maintained, and the management is incredibly supportive. It is a safe and comfortable place to live', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.84237', 5, 128, 4),
(804, U&'[Ditiksha S (DEEPA)] This PG is good as everyone is said in the past reviews here. But until I experienced a bad roommate in double sharing \+01f937\+01f3fb\200d\2640\fe0f I had left the PG in 3 days because of her \+01f644nI''m a working girl with a mid day shift timings. For the office visit i choosed this PG and paid very high priced per day \+01f44d\+01f3fbnWhoever it is when comes to sharing the room means they should have the basic common sense that a other person is coming back from the work at mid night and they need a little light for dress up and fresh up, but other girl was started troubling me not to switch on light or make any sound once I reached the room \+01f937\+01f3fb\200d\2640\fe0f\+01f644 how it''s possible! Is that makes sense,,,,nThe bed was really in bad condition and that springs in the bed was making lots of noise i could not able to sleep well at all on top of it other girl use to on the fan 24hrs with high speed level \+01f937\+01f3fb\200d\2640\fe0f\+01f644 can you imagine how was my situation was in the 3 days with her in that tiny room.nIf anyone is referring my review at present make sure not to choose the room number 601 at 6th floor. Please take this advice \+01f64f\+01f3fb bcz I don''t want anyone to feel/experience the same situation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.908427', 3, 130, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(805, U&'[Saad Valki] Was looking for best clean Pg for my friend after going around many pgs in kormangala and Madiwala finally was happy with newly build Friends Girl hostel. Best part is hygiene and cleanliness 5 stars for that . It\2019s  better then most of the hotels around Madiwala', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.908567', 5, 130, 4),
(806, '[Akshada Praveen] The rooms are well maintained. They have good amenities like wifi, laundry, self cook equipments, and geyser. The rooms are cleaned daily.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.908691', 5, 130, 4),
(807, '[Pranavthi Natraj] I stayed for 2 months here and really liked all the  amenities. The food is really good compared to all other places in this price range.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.909235', 5, 130, 4),
(808, U&'[Anisha Usman] I had a truly pleasant experience during my stay at this PG. The rooms were clean, well-ventilated, and furnished with all the necessary amenities like a comfortable bed, dressing table, and storage space. The management was incredibly responsive and ensured any issues were addressed promptly. Bathroom wear very clean \+01f607.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.909504', 5, 130, 4),
(809, '[Riya Joseph Kaithavanathara] The rooms are good , opt for single stay it''s peaceful. Food is homely and edible. Pg owner is nice, he always ensures to get our feedback. My overall stay was nice and undisturbed!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.909653', 4, 130, 4),
(810, '[Naseeba w] Highly recommended for students and working women.  Responsible and friendly management caters all the need for a comfortable and secure stay for girls. Complimentary home cooked tasty food is served 3 times a day. Clean environment, friendly staff and smiling inmates have created positive vibes all over the hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.909785', 5, 130, 4),
(811, '[No One] The stay was very comfortable, I was actually skeptical of too many positive reviews lol but I''m glad I trusted this place for my stay. It was a blissful stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.909908', 5, 130, 4),
(812, '[Manjunatha B] Very good hostel for girls which is located in the peaceful place.nReally the best hostel for girls.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.942491', 5, 131, 4),
(813, '[Asif Mandeval] Exllent', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.942745', 5, 131, 4),
(814, '[Somanath Nathe] Good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.943251', 5, 131, 4),
(815, '[Mallikarjuna Kg] Nice', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.943429', 2, 131, 4),
(816, '[Istalin Bhagyakar] this is sefety  for all womans', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.943574', 3, 131, 4),
(817, '[Lakshmikantharaju N] Clean and nice hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.943699', 5, 131, 4),
(818, '[USHARANI] Nice and good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.94383', 5, 131, 4),
(819, '[Anjana Anju] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.944036', 5, 131, 4),
(820, U&'[Aineri Poojitha Yadav] @Nest Premium PG ,has been a wonderful place to stay. The rooms are comfortable and well-maintained, the hygiene standards are excellent, and the overall environment is safe and pleasant. The food is one of the biggest highlights\2014tasty, hygienic, and prepared with great care, making it feel just like home. \+01faf6\+01f3fbnnA heartfelt thank you to the owners for their constant support, care, and efforts in ensuring that residents are comfortable. Special appreciation to the cooking staff for their hard work and dedication in serving delicious meals every day. \2764\fe0fnnWhat makes this PG even more special is the way birthdays, festivals, and special occasions are celebrated. Whether it''s a resident''s birthday, Holi, Vinayaka Chaturthi, or other festive events, the celebrations create a warm family-like atmosphere. The special dishes prepared on these occasions make every celebration memorable and bring everyone together. \+01f338\2728nnFor me, Nest Premium PG is more than just a place to stay\2014it''s my second home. I am truly grateful for all the wonderful memories here and would highly recommend this PG to any student at Christ University looking for a comfortable, caring, and homely environment. \+01f496', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.976178', 5, 132, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(821, '[SIMRAN MOTWANI 2427656] I had a really great experience staying here. The food quality is excellent, with a good variety available every day. Cleanliness and safety are well maintained, which made me feel comfortable throughout my stay. The owners are also very kind and supportive. Overall, everything was very well managed.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.976322', 5, 132, 4),
(822, '[ANUSHKA SINGH SOLANKI 2428006] It is a nice place to stay for students and also safe for girls. Food is homely and healthy here. I had a nice experience here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.976452', 5, 132, 4),
(823, '[Varshitha] A trustworthy place and reliable management. Had a very positive experience for 2 years.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.976576', 5, 132, 4),
(824, '[Punya Shravan] This is by far the best girls PG in the area!(Good Lands PG for Ladies - Christ University) It offers the perfect combination of comfort, safety, and affordability. The rooms are clean and well-maintained, with all necessary amenities like Wi-Fi, power backup, and proper ventilation. The staff is friendly and responsive, and the environment feels just like home. Compared to other PGs nearby, this one offers the best value for money without compromising on quality or security. Highly recommended for students and working professionals looking for a hassle-free stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.9767', 5, 132, 4),
(825, '[aj_z] 10/10 must visit (for me) because of a particular bengali girl and because it''s suitably located for hern1/10 for causing her discomfort by having thin walls, broken tv smaller than laptop screen, poor quality food, 10:30 o clock curfew that prevents her from staying at the library till late.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.976822', 3, 132, 4),
(826, '[Informed Citizen] Everything is good except the room size.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.976943', 4, 132, 4),
(827, U&'[Gowsika Ravikumar] Best two years of my life.\263a\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:07.977076', 5, 132, 4),
(828, U&'[ghun assudani] This hostel became my second home over the past year. It\2019s an ideal place for girls seeking comfortable and reliable accommodation. As a vegetarian and someone who enjoys North Indian cuisine, I\2019ve truly felt at ease here.nnThe rooms are cozy, and the owner is incredibly friendly and approachable. Safety is clearly a priority, with a well-enforced curfew system that ensures parents are informed in case of any delays.nnThe location is also a major plus, situated right on the main road of Suddagunte Palya, making it easily accessible.nnOverall, it\2019s a great place to stay. To all the North Indians living in Bangalore and looking for a homely environment\2014this place is definitely worth considering.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.044673', 4, 134, 4),
(829, '[Ryan D''Almeida] The rooms are clean and comfortable. The staff is incredibly friendly and helpful. The hostel has a great location close to Christ University and the atmosphere is welcoming and supportive. I highly recommend this place to anyone looking for a safe, clean, and comfortable place to live.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.044815', 5, 134, 4),
(830, U&'[Prasath] \2022 GST extra \2705 - GST bill \274cnn\2022 Staircase \2705 - Lift \274cnn\2022 Maintenance extra \2705 - Proper maintenance \274cnn\2022 Bad food \2705 - Good food \274cnn\2022 Rent \2705 - Consideration \274cnn\2022 Vehicle noise 24/7 \2705 - Good sleep \274cnn\2022 Study table \2705 - Chair \274cnn\2022 Curfu timing \2705 - Night out or stay \274cnn\2022 Everyday afternoon dhal \2705 - Sunday night food \274cnn\2022 Wifi \2705 - Recharge \274cnnPlease choose a better PG if you wanna a peaceful days.nnAfter my reviewn\2022 Fake reviews \2705 - Genuine reviews \274c', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.044953', 1, 134, 4),
(831, '[Gaanapriya] Loved it. Food is homemade and includes both north indian and south indian. Balanced and nutritious food. Rooms are spacious with small kitchen and attached bathroomnDaily cleaning is available. Each floor has fridge and microwave. There are 2 washing machines. Back up power supply. Free wifi.nAny concerns if raised, will most likely be addressedn2 mins walk from Christ Uni. Overall satisfying experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.045085', 5, 134, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(832, U&'[Benny D''almeda] I loved this Hostel to be precise!nFirst thing''s first, Although the hostel is newly bought up,but the facilities provided are just incredible!nWith clean and overwhelming rooms as per demand,CCTV camera''s for a girl''s safety purpose.nAnd the hostel being near to Christ college is an icing on the cake!nToo happy for a stay here\270c\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.045247', 5, 134, 4),
(833, '[Nishmita D''Almeida] Great place, absolutely recommended! It is close to Christ college which is very helpful for students like us who are from a different city. The place is clean and tidy and is at an affordable price. We get good food which is served on time and is well maintained.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.045374', 5, 134, 4),
(834, '[Vyshakh Chandra Prabhu] Good. My friend from Delhi needed a good PG near college.. We were searching online and this popped up. And when we enquired and saw the rooms the PG is good and neat when compared to other PG''s. And the price is reasonable though it''s recently opened. As it''s near a good locality there''s no problem with the girls safety.nSo far good. Cheers! Keep up.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.045637', 5, 134, 4),
(835, '[Sushruth Harsha] This is a wonderful place, my sister had just moved to Banglore and we were looking for a place that was close to her workplace and was safe. The hostel was a perfect fit for us. It is safe place and rates are good too. She is very happy staying here!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.04576', 5, 134, 4),
(836, U&'[Pragati Kedia] I have been staying at Symphony Hostel for Girls for the past 2.5 years, and my experience has truly been wonderful. What stands out the most is the warmth and care of the owner. They create such a homely environment that you never feel like you\2019re away from home. Whether it\2019s help with something as small as finding a mobile repair shop or a medical store in a new city, they are always there to guide and support us, often even before we ask.nnTheir kindness goes beyond basic facilities, from occasionally taking us out for small treats like ice cream to simply being there like a parent or a friend, their efforts are something that can\2019t really be put into words.nnThe food here is also very good, and what I appreciate the most is how open they are to feedback. They are always ready to make changes to the menu based on our preferences and even adjust it according to the season.nnCleanliness, safety, and overall management are excellent. From the wardens to the security staff, everything is well taken care of, which gives a great sense of comfort and security.nnBeyond all of this, this place has given me some truly special people, friends who will stay with me for life. I feel incredibly grateful for the stay, the food, the people, and the overall experience.nnI genuinely wish every student could find a PG like this, and every parent could feel completely at ease knowing their child is staying in such a safe and caring environment.nnWe are truly grateful, Pintu sir and Ritu ma\2019am, thank you so much \2665\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.083637', 5, 135, 4),
(837, U&'[Yuvika Rathi] My sister was here for 3 yrs  and I am continuing for next year .During gas shortage problem food is freshly prepared, homely, and offers a good variety, making it feel just like home.nThe rooms are spacious, well-ventilated, and cleaned daily, including the bathrooms.nWhat truly sets this place apart is the warmth of the owners and staff  they are incredibly welcoming, understanding, and always go the extra mile to ensure comfort. It\2019s not just a PG, it\2019s a place where you feel cared for.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.083777', 5, 135, 4),
(838, U&'[Hepzi Dorathy] Symphony Hostel has been the best place to stay! The rooms are spacious, cleaned daily, and always well-maintained. The food is amazing with a new menu every week. The management is super kind and always ready to help. It\2019s peaceful, comfortable, and truly feels like home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.083904', 5, 135, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(839, '[ankita bajoria] I have lived in this hostel for 3 years and never once thought of changing my pg. The owners, the warden and the staff are really sweet and welcoming and make us feel like home. The food is pretty good compared to the other pgs in the area. Overall, a reallyy nice experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.084026', 5, 135, 4),
(840, '[Deepthi Suraj] I am from Kerala.  The stay here was an amazing experience. I enjoyed every moment  there..The room was spacious,airy and sunny.The view from the room overlooking the temple was really soothing. I find the place brimming with positive energy.. Ritu ma''am who owns the hostel is a very gentle and genuine person. She took care of the needs very well. .It is a safe place which I recommend to anyone who is looking for a nice PG..I am sure that I will miss those days of my stay and Hulimavu area as well', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.084162', 5, 135, 4),
(841, U&'[Sneha Saxena] Living in this hostel has been one of the most comforting and heartwarming experiences of my life. From the day I arrived, I\2019ve felt a strong sense of belonging and care. The staff is incredibly kind, especially  the owner Ritu Ma\2019am she helped a lot, the environment is safe and peaceful, and the friendships I\2019ve made here are truly special. Every day feels like being part of a big, caring family whether it\2019s sharing meals, late-night talks, or simply looking out for one another.I\2019m still staying here, and I genuinely look forward to continuing this beautiful journey. This hostel isn\2019t just a place to stay\2014it\2019s home.thankyou for making my hostel life  so meaningful\+01faf6\+01f3fb\+01f979\+01fac2 also at last want to mention THE OG FOOD over here is so delicious and homely!  Must try!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.084281', 5, 135, 4),
(842, U&'[Tanushka Rathi] Hands down the best PG accommodation in Bangalore! I stayed here for 3 years and even recommended it to my sister \2014 that\2019s how much I loved it. The rooms are spacious, well-ventilated, and cleaned daily, including the bathrooms. The food is freshly prepared, homely, and offers a good variety, making it feel just like home.nnWhat truly sets this place apart is the warmth of the owners and staff \2014 they are incredibly welcoming, understanding, and always go the extra mile to ensure comfort. It\2019s not just a PG, it\2019s a place where you feel cared for.n100/10 would recommend. Easily the best PG in Bangalore!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.084407', 5, 135, 4),
(843, U&'[Vaishnavi Kalal] It''s been two years I m staying. It''s very comfortable and it food tastes delicious too.. \+01f60b Everyone are friendly and it''s safe. They take care when health issue happens. The rooms are spacious and maintain hygiene by cleaning the rooms everyday.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.08458', 5, 135, 4),
(844, U&'[Divya K] A nice PG with good food and all the necessary facilities. Highly recommended! \+01faf6\+01f3fb', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.122948', 5, 136, 4),
(845, '[Navyashree] I have stayed here for 1 year, it felt like a home, PG owner is very responsive and very humble. Food is a very good. Totally a very good experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.123132', 5, 136, 4),
(846, '[Kalaivani Thillai] My daughter ahalyaa stayed in this pg for one and half years. Am so happy to say that really this pg is trust worthy and well maintained with delicious food. Am thankful to Mr.Muthalib who is the incharge for this pg is really kind hearted and well-wisher. My daughter had home feel and we are thankful to everyone including cook. Blindly you can believe, also maintenance of the room, coridor and bathroom was top-notch. Whenever we ask for any queries they do with much care, many times I asked help to get medicines etc. they always lend their supportive hands. Once again we are thankful. Whenever we visit banglore, we feel that we have this pg is like our home in future.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.123264', 5, 136, 4),
(847, U&'[Ahalyaa K] Those who wants to feel like home can stay here and you\2019ll feel home and PG owner is very kind and responsive and supportive and he has become our one of your best person found in bangalore. My parents were not allowing me to bangalore as I was a single child but trusting my safety they managed to identify this PG and made me stay here. I even got emotionally attached to this room and people. Out of all, I had my best moments at this PG.nnFood is the top notch choice here. 10/10. This pg should be awarded.nnFeel safe, comfortable, get homely food.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.123477', 5, 136, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(848, U&'[Shubha shetty] I have been here for more than 4 years, and I really like the hygiene and the food. Muthu is always available if you need any assistance\2014he is a kind person. The place also feels very safe, and it truly feels like a second home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.123601', 5, 136, 4),
(849, U&'[Yashika Gm] I stayed in this pg for more than a year and food was good and hygenic \2026and pg owner was very kind ..i felt so safe and comfortable in this pg. Room environment was too good . From my side the rating will be 100 out of 10\2728\2728', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.123733', 5, 136, 4),
(850, '[Madhu Kumari] I stayed here for 4 years. It was a great experience, and the PG manager, Muthu, was very helpful.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.123857', 5, 136, 4),
(851, U&'[Aishwarya Nagarajan] This is the most decent PG I have seen in this area. Has spacious rooms and clean bathrooms. Rooms are also ventilated well. You get food and tea on time. Nothing much to complain about the taste. Lift and hot water service is available 24*7. Has parking space for two-wheelers. Issues/Repairs are immediately sorted out on priority. Safety and security is well maintained. CCTVs are installed at various places. Recently fingerprint access has been installed too. Overall well managed by the Manager. \+01f44d\+01f3fc', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.123975', 5, 136, 4),
(852, U&'[Pooja] I had come to Bangalore to look for a PG near Christ College for my daughter. We stayed there for two days to finalize a suitable option. I visited 5\20136 PGs during that time, but this one stood out as the best. I was honestly shocked to see how some PGs charge such high rent yet offer such cramped and poorly maintained spaces\2014with barely any room to breathe. The ones that seemed a bit better had sky-high rents.nnBut this PG gave us a sense of comfort. The rooms have sliding windows and proper ventilation. The rooms themselves are decent, and the toilets are clean. There''s a kitchen on the top floor with seating arrangements where one can sit and eat comfortably. The food is decent, but what really surprised us was the warmth of the kitchen staff. They serve food with so much care and kindness\2014it was totally unexpected.nnIf you\2019re planning to keep your daughter here, I truly believe this PG is fully secure and safe for girls.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.159829', 5, 137, 4),
(853, '[Vanshika Goyal] One of the Good pgs in sg palya. The rooms are nicely ventilated but spacious cupboard and bed side table. The food is great. Any problem is solved quickly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.160061', 5, 137, 4),
(854, '[Ananta Kumar Acharya] Very nice arrangement and secured place. The rooms are spacious with all new furniture. The food is good. You will feel very much comfortable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.160287', 5, 137, 4),
(855, '[Chaithanya Yadav] New hostel for ladies which is located at  200m distance from Christ University Central campus back gate with comfortable walkable from this hostel.Which is having spacious Semifurnished Rooms with all facilities too.I highly recommended this pg for ladies to stay here with safe .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.160411', 5, 137, 4),
(856, '[Srujan Wudaru] Rooms are so nice and big...  Location is convenient too..  Management helps you with anything', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.160532', 5, 137, 4),
(857, '[Harsha Puli] Nice rooms, good maintanence', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.160658', 5, 137, 4),
(858, '[Guntha Madhu Reddy] New pg, Full ventilation Rooms', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.160776', 5, 137, 4),
(859, '[Ayudh Mukherjee] My girl lives there she likes it my girl and me are now at 5 months yay and she still likes it', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.160944', 5, 137, 4),
(860, '[sri nidhi] Cleaness of rooms, washrooms, cloth washing area, corridor, is too good no doubt about it......... Water facility is also good,, nd when its comes to food breakfast (not so  good), lunch (good) dinner (good), its not a free hostel,,  fee is  per year , nd u won''t find such a cleanliness hostel nearby anywhere,,, cupboard are available... 6 per room will be alloted', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.196738', 3, 138, 4);         
