(873, U&'[masila mani] Very nice \+01f44c\+01f44c\+01f44c\+01f44c\+01f44c', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.240767', 5, 139, 4),
(874, '[Deepika Hegde] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.241028', 5, 139, 4),
(875, '[Hari Rao] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.241262', 5, 139, 4),
(876, U&'[Lipika Digga] I have stayed here for over a year, and it\2019s safe to say this is one of the best girls\2019 PGs. From safety and security to the amenities, helpers, and owner; everyone is extremely supportive and helpful. Not even once will you feel away from home. The food is genuinely good, the rooms are spacious and hygienic, and overall it offers great value for money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.286865', 5, 140, 4),
(877, '[Rutuja Zalte] I had a pleasant stay at Prashitaa Girls Hostel. The hostel is clean, safe, and provides a comfortable environment for girls. The rooms are well maintained, and the facilities are good. The food is decent, and the overall atmosphere is friendly and peaceful. I would recommend it to anyone looking for a comfortable and secure place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.287011', 5, 140, 4),
(878, U&'[Diya Shroff] Stayed here for 10 months and it was a good experience. The owner is very helpful and the caretaker is very sweet and homely. No issues related to food, water and cleanliness and the facilities provided are also pretty good. It\2019s a pure veg PG.nWould recommend staying here for sure', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.287139', 5, 140, 4),
(879, '[Jannvi Pandey] The PG is a definite option to consider. You will not encounter any issues related to water availability, food and cleanliness. Moreover, the people managing the PG are very helpful and caring.nMake sure to check it out!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.287262', 5, 140, 4),
(880, '[Samhita drona] It''s a very wholesome space and the staff is reallyyy nice! The food, cleaning, security and everything is amazing! Absolutely love this place. Would 100% recommend!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.28738', 5, 140, 4),
(881, '[DEVANSH AGARWAL] Very good PG for girls with home like food and better rooms than most other PGs in Bangalore.nAfter interacting with a few girls who stay in this PG, I got to know how much they respect the owner, Mr. Jindal. He''s a great mannWhen I was there in the PG as a visitor, one set of parents were here with their daughter looking for a place, not only did he show around the whole hostel to the parents and me, he even offered us lunch there. The rooms are as per single and double accommodation. The single room comes with a personal mini-fridge, which is brilliant and the washing machines are on the terrace for the comfort of the girls staying there. They not only provide pick up and drop facility to the girls till the near bus stop, they also deliver their lunch to respective colleges too. Another plus point is that they serve four meals here, breakfast, lunch, dinner and yes, snacks! Here in bangalore, extremely few PGs do this. None of the other private PGs I visited had this facility. Only Prashitaa shines out as the bright star here. If I ever had to suggest a girls pg to anyone in bangalore...its gonna be, yes you guessed it right, Prashitaa!nnP.S. : I''ve attached a few pics along with my review.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.287496', 5, 140, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(882, U&'[Komal sharma Sharma] The PG is really good and well-maintained. The food is hygienic and tasty, and the entire place is always kept clean. The family environment here makes it feel very comfortable and safe. All the staff members are polite, helpful, and easy to talk to. Overall, I\2019ve had a very good experience staying here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.287658', 5, 140, 4),
(883, '[navya agarwal] The owner and the manager of the PG are very warm and homely. It made us feel like we were at home while being away from it and i would highly recommend this to people', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.287778', 5, 140, 4),
(884, '[Shreyoshi Biswas] I lived here for 2 years.It was a comfortable stay. I had a few issues with the cleaning lady but it was taken care of. Food is homely and the gym is the best part. Can recommend for a peaceful stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.323267', 5, 141, 4),
(885, U&'[Pranaya Bitra] Had a really good experience staying here! The rooms are clean and well-maintained, food is tasty and feels like home. Loved the amenities like gym and games area. The environment is safe and peaceful. Overall, a very comfortable and pleasant stay\2014highly recommend!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.323426', 5, 141, 4),
(886, '[Jannet joy] I stayed at this PG for about a week and was very impressed with the facilities provided. The rooms were clean, and the washrooms were well-maintained. The food felt homely and was prepared with care. The owner was extremely accommodating, helpful, and always willing to assist whenever needed. Overall, it was a comfortable and pleasant stay, and I would highly recommend this place to anyone looking for a hassle-free accommodation experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.323638', 5, 141, 4),
(887, U&'[Bebe Shannu] Lhive PG is a women''s paying guest accommodation run by a kind family.  They provide necessary amenities such as 24/7 hot water, daily room cleaning, and even a fully functional gym.  The security here is tight, with cameras installed throughout. The rooms are clean and spacious, and the nighttime view from the terrace is particularly beautiful. The food is excellent; the family shares the meals they prepare for themselves and their children, including non-vegetarian options twice a week and a special treat on Sundays.  On holidays, aunty prepares special meals and even sweets. The owners are very kind and welcoming, knowing each resident by name.  The residents are also friendly, and I''ve made many some really good friends here  \263a\fe0f\+01faf6', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.323761', 5, 141, 4),
(888, '[Nikhitha] Stayed here for 4 months and had a wonderful experience. Clean rooms, good food, and excellent management. No other PG can compete with the comfort and care provided here. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.323992', 5, 141, 4),
(889, U&'[Diksha Sikdar] I had a very pleasant stay at this PG. The rooms were clean and well maintained, and the overall environment felt safe and comfortable. The management was supportive and responsive whenever needed, which made my stay stress-free. Food quality was good, and housekeeping was done regularly. I\2019m grateful for the smooth experience and would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.324231', 5, 141, 4),
(890, '[Danika Aggarwal] It was an average experience overall as the PG was quite away from the main road and the road in front of it wasn''t a proper one. The rooms were like any average PG room in that locality. Cleaning was done on a daily basis but it wasn''t up to the mark. The food was decent as it was freshly homemade, however, the items were repeated way too often. The terrace was great. The PG owners are also sweet.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.324395', 3, 141, 4),
(891, U&'[Vennela .G] I had great stay for 6 months. I never saw a lizard here and pg is pretty new. Food is very homely. Gym and games are also there. It\2019s one of the best pgs. Thanks to aunties who made the stay very pleasant and comfortable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.324524', 5, 141, 4);        
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(892, '[Meghna Choudhary] Has mostly what a student needs. Like that all problems are heard actively and mostly they resolve it. Rooms are spacious, the view is spectacular from top, you get sunshine, wind as it''s open.nnOne suggestion I would give us gym should have more equipments.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.361761', 4, 142, 4),
(893, U&'[Himanshu Gupta] NGH (Exactly the same architecture as NBH), is undoubtedly the best hostels not just in IISc but in entire India.nnThe build quality, per person space, ventilation \+01f44c, balcony, washrooms, facilities, maintenance and cleanliness are unmatchable.nnPer room space is approximately 14x14 feet, in addition to a spacious balcony. You''ll get a cupboard big enough, a desk attached with a rack, also a small sized metal almirah, chair and a metal bed (painted quality one). Along with unlimited WiFi - one router shared with 4 rooms.nThere''s also a master switch just outside your room to control electricity supply inside.nThere are 7 floors and 4 lifts available.nRO water with hot, cold and normal water supply.nnThe washroom in general are shared (3 toilets+3 washrooms) among 8-10 people. Kudos to the cleanliness team they maintain it nice.nYou''ll also get a cleaning staff to clean your room upon request during office hours all 7 days.nnAmazon/flipkart/Swiggy/zomato will deliver the orders till the hostel ground floor entrance. However items via India posts will come to your respective room.nnCons: There are no washing machine. People usually buy one in contribution and use it during their tenure. Or you can just become a part of an already existing washing machine by paying some amount.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.36195', 5, 142, 4),
(894, '[preety verma] It is a wonderful place. My visit here is one of the best visits here. This place is just mesmerizing. The weather is just so soothing and beautiful. The food provided in the mess is really healthy and full of variety. I am really happy being here. IISC is world''s best experience.I would prefer to visit again.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.362079', 5, 142, 4),
(895, '[Anant Prakash] I have witnessed the entire campus of iisc , it is lush green and very vibrant place for higher studies and scientific research.This is the reason this institute ranked top of the Indian list.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.362206', 5, 142, 4),
(896, '[Anshika Ranjan] Rooms are spacious with an attached balcony, identical to New Boys Hostel. The condition of the washroom is good. Wifi is bad. On some floors the water unit has three modes: normal , cold, hot which is quite good. Has locker facilities for online orders and parcels. No dining facility and vending machine is available. Boys are not allowed. Recently the gym is also open for female students of IISc. The hostel is near the C and D mess.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.362403', 3, 142, 4),
(897, U&'[\099b\09be\09a4\09bf\09ae \09ab\09c1\09b2] The rooms are spacious.nView from the balcony is wonderful.nThe cleaning staffs are super-efficient in their work . Lifts; WIFI are there .nBut there are seepage problems in some of the washrooms; balconies and rooms.nnDirty things from the pipe of the above floors drops in the toilet ; in the basin.nnOnce ; the admin tried to resolve the matter ; but the same problem still exists!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.362542', 3, 142, 4),
(898, '[gayatri mohanan] Very good, spacious rooms. It is more than enough for 1 person. All the rooms are single occupancy rooms with balconies. The hostel has beautiful verandas and is surrounded by greenery. There are 7 floors and each floor has three sets of washrooms. Cleaning and maintenance is average. Some rooms have pigeon menace but that can be easily taken care of. All in all, a good hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.362849', 4, 142, 4),
(899, '[Pradeepthi Vemula] Is this a private pg hostel or under the management?', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.362994', 5, 142, 4),
(900, U&'[Vishnu Prakasan] I need a secure place and a \+01f4bb and an android phone so that we could have the phone in case I have any problems with my computer and the computer and then we could have it on our phones \+01f4f1 give me computer not guns i have my guns always loaded with me #SwamiSaranamnSaniya Iyyappaaann will come for me', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.421522', 5, 143, 4);              
