(903, '[Ramu Rathna] Good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.422243', 5, 143, 4),
(904, '[XEV 9e] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.422405', 5, 143, 4),
(905, '[Birender Rana] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.422642', 5, 143, 4),
(906, '[Ponnuthurai P] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.422842', 5, 143, 4),
(907, '[Ramesh Kumar paswan] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.423067', 5, 143, 4),
(908, '[Dante Da''vince] Worst experience till date!!! I''ve booked a deluxe room for 3 nights thinking it has well amenities like gym, housekeeping, fridge microwave oven u0026 water purifier only microwave and fridge were usable the rest of the stuff or either broken/ unhygienicnNo housekeeping has done from day 1 no shower gels were provided even after complaining multiple times the property manager was acting like a moron and rude he was behaving like he was doing us a favor by letting us stay i have faced so many problems during stay hot water not being properly working broken cold water tap getting mixed with hot watee making ir luke warm for bathing and the hygiene is really bad.nFinal verdictnDon''t book and stay just because google photos are nice all of the shown facilities are shown are outdated now no maintenance and eating dust the gym and terrace floor also. Mr. Aman Kumar if you''re reading this please try to leaen some manners how to speak with guest and do your job promptly instead of ghosting and ignoring guest request and sounding like we you for doing your basic job', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.464578', 1, 144, 4),
(909, '[rajeethkumar dharmaraj] Had a great stay at this PG. The rooms were clean and well-maintained, the food was good, and the overall environment was comfortable and peaceful. The staff were friendly and responsive, making the stay hassle-free. A good option for anyone looking for a safe and convenient place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.46476', 5, 144, 4),
(910, U&'[Pradheep Saravanan] I am currently staying at Zolo (Zolo Belair B, Bangalore), and this has been one of the most frustrating experiences I\2019ve had as a customer.nInitially, my laundry bag went missing. The ground staff asked me to wait for 3 days, assuming someone might have taken it by mistake. I cooperated and waited. After that, they said they would conduct a proper search, which took another week\2014only to conclude that the bag was indeed missing.nEven after this confirmation, I had to follow up repeatedly with customer support. After almost a month of continuous calls and follow-ups, I was finally told that my compensation request was rejected because I \201cdid not raise a ticket early.\201dnThis is completely unacceptable. I followed every instruction given by the Zolo team from the beginning, trusted their process, and waited as advised\2014only for it to be used against me later. Instead of taking responsibility for their mistake, the management is shifting blame onto the customer.nThere is a clear lack of accountability. When it comes to payments and policies, tenants are expected to strictly comply. But when the company causes a loss, there is no ownership or fair resolution.nThis incident has caused me a significant loss, and the way it has been handled is extremely disappointing. Zolo has shown that customer concerns are not a priority, and that is a serious issue for anyone considering staying here.nI hope the management takes this seriously and resolves it properly. Until then, I cannot recommend this place to anyone.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.464892', 1, 144, 4),
(911, '[Amit Kumar] First of all its a PG not a hotel. You will be sharing a 2 BHK where if you are lucky like me will get a shared bathroom which will be shared by another user occupying the other bedroom. I was lucky to keep my foot in the bathroom mat which slipped and i fell such badly that my hand was severely cut. They had no medicines instead the attender came with iodex to apply on cuts. I booked for 2 days but left after 1 day still they didnt refund one day amount. Book at your own risk.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.465032', 1, 144, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(912, '[Shahzeb Sadaf] It''s a good flat plus the ambience is superb really love it', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.465162', 5, 144, 4),
(913, '[Aishwarya Deo] Zolo A is good. Clean rooms and airy. It is a bit inside, but the staff is good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.465288', 4, 144, 4),
(914, '[Shyam sundar] Amazing Property Near Wipro Sarjapura,nNice  ambiance, very helpful staff.nThe best part is this property is very near to the Sarjapura main road!!nMust stay here for amazing living experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.465418', 5, 144, 4),
(915, '[limithlal k] Wonderful experience in Zolobelair Au0026B.nVery nice management good stay. I always prefer This PG for stay safe for all.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.465538', 5, 144, 4),
(916, U&'[S_Nandhini_ 4841] I had stayed here from nov 2022 to may 2026nInitial years things were good but towards the end very disappointingnInfested with bed bugs, cockroaches (found them even in drinking water) but their attitude towards them when we had to leave was worsenI hadn\2019t thought much about leaving the pg irrespective of them increasing the rent without increasing the quality of servicenCleaning frequency of room went down to 3 times a week from daily.nWhen the sink in our room fell offnFor almost 2 weeks they did nothing about it no matter how many times we raised itnI decided not to pay the rent as well until the fixed it , basics are important esp when you pay 12-13.5k for 2 sharing roomnThat\2019s when i decided to leave as wellnWe had decided to leave the pg by June 17 so when he asked if he should book the room for June 17 i agreed.nThen we were expected to leave the room by June 16 evening itself ( which i stressed that if i m paying rent for 16th he cannot ask me to leave until the end of the day)nWe shifted on that eveningnEven if it was late night they didn\2019t care they just wanted us to leave asapnOnly next day afternoon when i visited the pg to pick up something i had left i realised the room wasn\2019t actually booked by anyonenThey hadn\2019t even still cleaned by thennHe just wanted us to leavenHave been staying here for years now have always been prompt in paying rentnNever caused any chaos or fights but the way they treated us towards the end was very disappointing. I guess they will treat you well if you are their customer or people they like, i have seen my other friends being asked to leave as well if they didn\2019t like their roommates behavior but have seen them accept complaints for few other people as well.nMy roommate paid the rent but they keep on calling her to send the screenshot instead of just checking their transaction historynThey are ready to blame that we didn\2019t pay rent and to make 100 calls but not even once they put any effort to check the transaction history i guessnDidn\2019t wanted to leave the place on such a bad note but it happened.. but it wasn\2019t all bad food is good on some days power back up is goodnWifi is pretty bad cannot rely if you are doing work from homenGood place for a temporary stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.509099', 1, 145, 4),
(917, U&'[Lady Whiskerdown] Here''s a genuine review for all those who decide to stay in arcade stays.nn\+01d5d9\+01d5ee\+01d5f0\+01d5f6\+01d5f9\+01d5f6\+01d601\+01d5f6\+01d5f2\+01d600 \+01d5fd\+01d5ff\+01d5fc\+01d603\+01d5f6\+01d5f1\+01d5f2\+01d5f1: 3 meals, drinking water (hot, cold and normal) available at two floors, lift facility, hot water for bath, microwave, fridge, washing machine, lift, cleaning, wifi, cctv on all floors and a key board.nn\+01d5df\+01d5fc\+01d5f0\+01d5ee\+01d601\+01d5f6\+01d5fc\+01d5fb: It is the prime spot. Two steps and you have Gillys, 5 minutes to the right, we have bus stand, Kemp fort Mall, local market. Every lane you get into is a big market with medical shop, meat shop, vegetables/ fruit stalls, tea stalls and shops, grocery stores, stationaries, Xerox shop, food hotels, resturants and temples.nOpposite to the road is ATMs and banks.nTo the left side is baskin Robbins, More, Pizza Hut, a hospital, wind tunnel bus stand.nOnce it is evening, the entire road is full with street food.nn\+01d5e3\+01d5f4 \+01d5f3\+01d5fc\+01d5fc\+01d5f1: It ain''t like other pgs. I have loved their food. The cooks are polite, and cute. I appreciate the effort they make to feed us. It is better that the food isn''t wasted. Although i have seen people waste the food.nn\+01d5e3\+01d5f4 \+01d5f0\+01d5f9\+01d5f2\+01d5ee\+01d5fb\+01d5f9\+01d5f6\+01d5fb\+01d5f2\+01d600\+01d600 : To an extent the pg is clean. A lady and her daughter come to do the cleaning. Brooming the floor along with washroom cleaning.nnCleanliness should not only be done by pg members, but also girls who live in the pg.nn\+01d5e3\+01d5f4 \+01d5f0\+01d5ee\+01d5ff\+01d5f2\+01d601\+01d5ee\+01d5f8\+01d5f2\+01d5ff : He is kind, polite and helpful. In fact, all the people working in this pg are good. In some reviews, you may see, people reviewing them as bad... Well, if you argue with someone, no one will stay quiet. He was quick in refunding the deposit as well.nnIf i can adjust in the room, and washroom, i bet anyone can survive.nI also never had problem with hanging clothes on railing.nI washed my clothes myself, n put them on railing. They dried up properly without stinking. Yes, during rainy days, it becomes a problem.nnIgnoring few other cons, I definitely recommend ARCADE STAYS PG as it is worth the penny you pay here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.509373', 4, 145, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(918, '[Ankita Shinde] Would definitely recommend this PG. The rooms are clean, there is daily cleaning done by staff. The kitchen is good, they have 3 times food facility which I feel is very affordable in this price. The entire staff working here is very polite. I stayed here for 2 months and had no issues as such in a 3 sharing room. The location is very good, there is Kemp fort mall, Domino''s, Pizza Hut, More super market and other eateries at walking distance from this pg. Murugeshpalya bus stop is also 2 mins walking and the pg is located in a very quiet and residential lane which is safe for girls. There are no time restrictions in this pg which makes it a favourable choice for girls working late night shifts. There is clean water, self cooking kitchen, washing machine, drying area, dining area and 24/7 hot water available.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.509546', 5, 145, 4),
(919, U&'[Hindu Sree] Provided Good Security u0026 Updated the Biometric Fingerprint its very nice idea .it\2019s really Awesome Luxury PG for Girls. Food is nice . Rooms are very clean and I didn\2019t face any issues in the room. There is a Good ventilation in corner rooms. I was staying here approx from 2years and I had a good experience in this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.50969', 4, 145, 4),
(920, U&'[p br] I stayed more than a year in this pg.. loved the friendly staff and management. Good food as well.. but morning times they can improve I feel. Otherwise everything is good. It is also in a peaceful area/road. If I get a chance again .. I would select same pg again \+01f604', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.509818', 5, 145, 4),
(921, '[susmita sarkar] Good place to stay. The food is decent and just one month of deposit. Good hot water and the property is pretty new.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.509937', 4, 145, 4),
(922, U&'[meera k] I\2019m staying here almost 4 years now , Pg maintained persons they are well supported.nIn this Pg Food they provided 3 times and they maintained quality and cleanliness.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.510141', 5, 145, 4),
(923, '[mariyam khan] The PG is exceptionally good, food offered here is always hygienic, tasty u0026 healthy, unlike other PGs serving u rubbish after changing bucks !!nThe cooks are lovely people, they serve you with variety of food,nThey also allow you to cook sometimes, if needed.nThe owner is very polite u0026 helpful,nThe rooms are nice, space is little less but not an issue as they are airy !!nThe cleaning lady comes to clean the rooms, washing machines for laundry are also available.nThe area is residential, u0026 all the facilities are easily accessible from here.nOverall nice experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.510269', 5, 145, 4),
(924, U&'[Valanka Melicia Fernandes] Moved to Nest Stay Home PG in Basavanagudi and had a wonderful stay her, the sevice was good and owner was helpful too.nnAnd services I requested were resolved at the earliest.nnDefinitely recommended \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.547976', 5, 146, 4),
(925, '[shine] Good rooms and facilities. Puran - wardan takes care of the safety very well. Any complaints are sorted with 2 days.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.548127', 5, 146, 4),
(926, '[anjali SH] Overall experience in the stay was good. Rooms are nice and are cleaned daily. The food is also very good and the staff is very friendly. Location of the pg is very peaceful and is close by to all necessities. Maybe the price is a bit high but other than that it''s really a good pg. I would definitely recommend this.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.548252', 4, 146, 4),
(927, '[Ini Chidambara] Trust me, this is one of the best pgs u can find, not super luxurious but u don''t have strict rules or any such thing! Food is not half bad and the care taker puran bhaiya is really the nicest', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.548378', 5, 146, 4),
(928, '[suganthi giri] Nest Stay Home Girls PG is the best girls''s hostel in Basavanagudi. It has everything that a girl needs for a pleasant and hassle-free stay. The rooms are neat and equipped with all modern amenities. The food is tasty and nutritious. The staff is courteous and cooperative. The location is prime and secure. It is very near to BMS College and other landmarks. I am very satisfied with Nest Stay Home Girls PG and I would suggest it to anyone who is searching for a quality girls hostel in Basavanagudi', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.548564', 5, 146, 4);          
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(929, '[Anjali Sharma] am staying in this pg from past 2 years and from my personal experiencenI can say that it''s damn good,nI can refer my friends Nest stay home I feel like it my home and very peaceful environment.nRooms are nice and cleaned dailynLocality is nice..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.548869', 5, 146, 4),
(930, '[Monika Singh] I am staying here. Rooms are really clean, they do provide food also which is good in taste. There is common room also where fridge is also available. Overall nice pg for outsiders.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.549357', 5, 146, 4),
(931, '[Ekta Nayak] The PG is quite good if u compare to the ones around. The rooms are spacious and clean. The housekeeping lady comes to clean every day. The locality is nice and safe.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:00:08.549579', 5, 146, 4),
(932, '[md riyaz] Good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.606274', 5, 147, 4),
(933, '[Sanjog Minj] I had an excellent experience at 3P Residency. The rooms were clean, spacious, and well-maintained, creating a comfortable stay. The staff was courteous, friendly, and always ready to help with any request.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.61411', 5, 148, 4),
(934, '[PRATIK PATIL] The PG is great place to stay at affordable price with great basic amenities required.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.615245', 5, 148, 4),
(935, '[Xtension] The pg is very good and close to many near by locations', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.615419', 5, 148, 4),
(936, '[Om Nevage] It''s great pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.615569', 5, 148, 4),
(937, '[Aniket Supekar] The PG is excellent and the management is great .They solve all the problems quickly and would recommend to professional and college people.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.615715', 5, 148, 4),
(938, '[Lokesh Patil] The PG is excellent. It has all the amenities which are essential.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.615973', 5, 148, 4),
(939, '[Jhanvi] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.616128', 5, 148, 4),
(940, '[Chinmay Gaikwad] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.616262', 5, 148, 4),
(941, '[Trusting Grace] It was the July 2006 train blasts attacks in Mumbai and we couldn''t get home. So we stayed here for just one night during that emergency. The place was clean, with required amenities, and the people were kind to us.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.623308', 5, 149, 4),
(942, '[akshita sharma] Worst hostel ever warden is so greedy every time she talk about money. If you have any problem related to service she will say pay money and do what ever you want. No geyser in the hostel. You parents can not come with you to see hostel room.nNo charging points available in the rooms. You can use iron only from 6-9 in the morning. Study room is a mess. Beds are of poor quality. Very bad place to live. No cold water facility.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.62753', 1, 149, 4),
(943, '[mary fonseca] Manuel Gonsalves Women''s Hostel is located in Bandra West, Mumbai. The location is just great. Bandra West is the only place in India that is ranked among the 100 best neighborhoods in the world.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.62786', 5, 149, 4),
(944, '[sangeeta bordoloi] Many of things spoken here are true, but yes she was very friendly and nice to me. She never ask me every time for money. Yes she is strict, and should be when you take responsibility to look after other people''s children.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.628068', 5, 149, 4),
(945, '[Astrid Cornel] Centrally located. Lots of restaurants and shopping boutiques close by. A good place to stay in.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.62825', 5, 149, 4),
(946, '[Jiya Chulet] Very bad infrastructure and warden is a monster... she is very greedy... she will ask you every alternative day about when are you getting married.. only go for accomodation if you are left with no other option other wise just ignore it the way you ignore youtube ad', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.628432', 1, 149, 4),
(947, '[zubin khan] My sister stayed here its really not a place to live ,  no charging slots in room,  no hot water nothing worst hostel  don''t even think to stay here!!!!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.629009', 1, 149, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(948, '[Vishakha Nerkar] No switches, no safety, horrible food, worst water facility, no light and fans available during day, 20 bucks for each laptop charging,nDon''t even dare to go there.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.629264', 1, 149, 4),
(949, U&'[RAVI KIRAN] I am forced to review for this pathetic hostel.nIt was the worst hostel I have spent my night in my entire 15 day Mumbai tour. It''s not even worth 0 star. The bed was full of bed bugs. There is nothing good about this place. The behaviour of staff was so rude, they shout loudly in the morning to wake you up and ask you to leave or pay for extra day, If you book online they won\2019t take your booking, and say that they don\2019t have any beds available and ask you to pay extra for different beds and suggest they own other hotel nearby. I strongly advise fellow travelers to avoid this hostel at all costs.nnThe bed bugs won\2019t let you sleep all night, you will just keep scratching here and there. The bed bugs suck your blood and left you with itching which last over 2 days.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.648648', 1, 151, 4),
(950, '[Arman warsi] One of the best hotels near Bandra Ghas Bazar. Location is excellent and very convenient for shopping and local travel. Rooms were clean, comfortable, and well maintained.nnThe staff were very good, polite, and cooperative. They helped us whenever needed and made the stay smooth and pleasant. Check-in process was easy and hassle-free.nnOverall, a very good experience and value for money. Highly recommended for anyone looking to stay near Bandra area. Would definitely stay here again.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.648811', 5, 151, 4),
(951, '[Shivrajsinh Zala] Dormitory Double Bunk Beds priced at Rs. 600/- per bed per night are good for the travellers looking for a one night stay. Bathrooms and Toilet are compact in size and hygiene level is not very good but Satisfactory (in terms of budget stays).', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.648987', 3, 151, 4),
(952, U&'[Ankita] Had a comfortable stay at BKC Corporate Hostel and Stay. The location is excellent and very convenient for professionals.nDastagir and Ahmed are very good in hospitality and take great care of the guests\2019 comfort. The property is well-maintained with all necessary amenities.nHighly recommended for corporate stays in BKC. Would stay again!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.649129', 5, 151, 4),
(953, U&'[ravishingtouch Ravish Orun] I would highly recommend this place to visit.nI was to make a video there, but couldn''t make that for my timing situations.nBut yes, do visit without any explanation. As compare to other hostels/dormitories, they are best with their services. \+01f970\+01f44c\+01f3fcnnPlease keep your windows open in day time, so that suffocation smell doesn''t disturb people/visitors. \+01fae0', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.649261', 5, 151, 4),
(954, '[Rajiv Dash] It is a really good place for staying. They clean the rooms on a regular basis and they maintain the hygiene. In bandra this staying can be a budget friendly one.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.649402', 5, 151, 4),
(955, '[Slv Aashraya] Nice place clean sharing accommodation Very close to Bandra local railway station 500meters you get nice idly wala for breakfast. Front office Mr.Ahmed was very supportive guided me well to the Hotel..Received me downstairs carried my luggage to 2nd floor gave me a comfortable bed ..Hare Krishna  all in the Name of Krishna..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.649556', 5, 151, 4),
(956, '[pg vino] I stayed in dormitory for 2 days it was well maintained in cleaning ,hygiene ,proper communication......big thanks to Mr Azad khan - Receptionist....taken care well and maintained the good professional communication....', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.64976', 5, 151, 4),
(957, '[Shashank Shukla] It is a Boys hostel in Bandra East government colony near Bank of India it is only for students and not working men it''s a huge hostel it had two wings more than 100 boys are living here and it is very very cheap only 23600 for 6 months also where it''s located it has everything near by KFC burger king Mac Donald dominoes local market grocery store everything it has 2,3 room beds and it has a big parking ground where boys play cricket and they also celebrate independence Day and republic daynOther that all this they have a common TV room and a study room for boys it has CCTV cameras everywherenRoom are good enough BT there is no AC and hot water facility also there is no mess in hostel BT there are lot of place to eat in near by localities it is a really nice place to live for a student if he wants to study n wants to achieve something in life', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.66062', 5, 152, 4);          
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(958, '[Shifa] Girls going there poses as a huge issue. No waiting area for fellow visitors (females), judgemental staff. Although, a great place for discipline seekers, has an excellent library, proper rooms, very very reasonable rates.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.660826', 4, 152, 4),
(959, '[Rakshit Khilnani] They portray themselves as disciplinarian but it''s regressive in nature to expect legal adults to follow out-of-date rules. I understand that Mumbai has a housing issue and every place with accommodation will be sought after, but that does not mean you impose regressive ideologies and restrictive rules (these rules would be illegal in any developed country) on desperate students. The students will find like minded peers but they''re students - if you can''t provide food then don''t expect them to come back in by 11pm if they''re working, studying or enjoying during class vacations. The horrendous management are unresponsive but also have no boundaries and clearly flout individual privacy for nosy ''checks'' and curfews - having experienced hostels in other countries as well while studying with totally responsible cultures, RSM has a suffocating culture with no respect for freedom, boundaries and artistic expression. The facilities are cramped, barely adequate furnishing, no kitchen to cook healthy food as a student and have below average hygiene levels with minimal maintenance. If you care for your/ your child''s mental health I suggest you look elsewhere. I know people (like me) who were kicked out on to the streets within the day for trivial reasons to stroke the management''s ego and power complex and you''re risking your accommodation, in a crucial academic time, to the whims and fancies and a rigid megalomania of the crazy family run intrusive management.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.660964', 1, 152, 4),
(960, '[prashantmalukani] Pros:nBest part of the hostel is connectivity.nSpacious roomsnClean bathrooms.nnCons:nNo geyser (not required in Mumbai)nNeed to clean rooms on our ownnnThere is no mess although other good options are available.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.661109', 4, 152, 4),
(961, '[Ankur Purohit] This hostel is absolutely superb, the staff are friendly, helpful, full of local knowledge and go the extra mile. The facilities are cleaned daily, rooms are spacious, , large lockers for the bigger backpacks, free wireless internet in the lounge with some computers also connected to the internet, with a large screen TV (which was popular most evenings)nnNo any Food facility in HostelnnThe hostel is closed off everyday  11pm and open  6am. Cleaning your room every second day, just inform them first if you need to get some stuff done, but anyway at that time you should be exploring the wonderful city of Mumbai.nnIt''s location is in the heart of Mumbai and it''s an easy walk to get anywhere but it''s on a side street, right opposite the Duomo, grab a free map from the tourist information office or a cheap one from a newsagent as you may miss it when following the directions to get there.nnAt night and weekends, they''res secured doors at the entrance, it just gives any traveller the feeling of more security, I only had to wait a couple of seconds for the door to be buzzed.nnI stayed in a 3 bed mixednwhatsoever - of course reviews like this and the ones below makes this a popular place to stay, I don''t think there was one day when this place wasn''t fully booked - book early.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.66125', 5, 152, 4),
(962, '[Sarvesh Jigjinni] i have lived here so i can tell its good its located in bandra so the surrounding are good for food there is no canteen so you may have to visit nearby hotels and other places the rules here are strict so parents can leave their children without any issues', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.661544', 5, 152, 4),
(963, '[Reema Ahuja] It''s a hostel only for post graduate students. It''s not for boys who are 14 and above. When can we find a good Govt hostel for Boys over 15 years old in Mumbai. Staff  is well-spoken and helpful. They need to clear their MTNL landline as there is a lot of disturbance.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.661684', 4, 152, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(964, U&'[AKASH KIRVE] I was there for about 8 months... The experience was good... All the staff have helping nature.... Cleaning and other things were too good... I will surely recommend this hostel if you are searching for stay... \+01f604', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.661812', 4, 152, 4),
(965, '[Pravin Kava] worst hostel ever!.....They have lots of rules and regulations which are at a point unrealistic or without any sense of flexibility.......we cannot use phone after 11pm or we cannot bring iron..... no entry after 9pm (so where should we go if we have late corporates office hours??).....the staff is so rude.....contact numbers not working.....not welcoming vibes.......please take this as a recommendation or advice and moreover atleast one year stay in such a place', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.771282', 1, 154, 4),
(966, '[Joseph Dcosta] Went to buy books with good service. Also met sister who was very helpful as I toured printing press and office on 2nd floor. Well maintained premises with well maintained old furniture and old doors', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.771433', 5, 154, 4),
(967, '[HMS] Their receptionist is a devil in disguise (jokes apart, she is rude)', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.77156', 1, 154, 4),
(968, '[Lavina Rodrigues] It:s a peaceful place to stay. The hostel is in the prime location therefore commuting to close by places was easy and less time consuming. Thanks Sr Stella.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.771681', 5, 154, 4),
(969, '[Raplangki Laloo] The worst.nWhy do they have to be so rude all the time?', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.771804', 1, 154, 4),
(970, '[Vijay Suryawanshi] I am trying to contact but no response on phone pls call or share you contact detaila', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.771949', 3, 154, 4),
(971, '[Morris Pineiro] Basically a Spartan room for rest. No frills.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.772123', 3, 154, 4),
(972, '[Joeyanna D''Souza] Management personnel are welcoming and hospitable softspoken', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.772249', 5, 154, 4),
(973, '[DEEPTHY K R] Those who are planning to book rooms, Gentle reminder , this hostel is closed. Don''t trust everything posted on social media.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.779822', 1, 155, 4),
(974, '[calan D''souza] I recently stayed at a hostel in Bandra and had a fantastic experience! The hostel was clean, comfortable, and conveniently located. The staff were friendly and helpful, and the atmosphere was lively and social.nnThe rooms were well-maintained and had all the necessary amenities. The common areas were spacious and perfect for meeting fellow travelers.nnBandra is a great location, with plenty of restaurants, cafes, and shops nearby. The hostel is also close to public transportation, making it easy to get around the city.nnOverall, I would highly recommend this hostel to anyone looking for a comfortable and affordable place to stay in Bandra. Great value for money!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.779982', 5, 155, 4),
(975, '[Udita Jangid] Over all the experience was really good, It was my first time in the hostel in mumbai. It genuinely felt like home. It came with basic facilities from free breakfast to cooking yourself. The safety is ensured at the dorms for female travellers. I met many people from different parts of the country at the hostel and made a few friends as well. Friendly and safe environment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.780121', 5, 155, 4),
(976, U&'[VANSHITA DEV] I recently stayed at this hostel for 3 weeks and had an incredible experience. The staff were exceptionally friendly and went out of their way to make sure my stay was comfortable. The rooms were clean, cozy, and well-maintained, with all the amenities you would need for a pleasant stay.nAlso, The location was perfect, close to major attractions and public transport, making it easy to explore the area. The common areas were vibrant and welcoming, creating a great atmosphere to meet fellow travelers.nI would highly recommend this hostel to anyone looking for a place that feels like home away from home. I\2019ll definitely be returning on my next visit!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.780255', 5, 155, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(977, U&'[Chandan Ahuja] Great value for money option with amazing location. The host is very helpful and friendly. They provide complimentary breakfast too. Rooms are good and they have few rules to maintain less noise in the rooms for sleeping. The washroom was very clean. Good Wifi speed. At a price point of less than \20b91000/Night at location, it''s unbeatable. Would definitely recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.78045', 5, 155, 4),
(978, U&'[Farhat Khan] I had an incredible experience during my stay at this hostel. The rooms were clean, comfortable, and well-maintained, offering everything I needed to relax. The common area was vibrant and well-designed, making it easy to meet other travelers. The location is perfect, with easy access to public transport and popular spots in the city. Whether you\2019re looking to explore or just unwind, this hostel is an ideal choice.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.780579', 5, 155, 4),
(979, U&'[kasturi zade] Hospitality at its best, vibes so good that you don\2019t wanna leave. Very clean and hygienic. The staff is very warm. Located at a prestige area of Mumbai. Very safe for women. It\2019s a must visit if you plan to stay in town.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.780707', 5, 155, 4),
(980, '[Lucas] We only stayed for one night, because we didn''t get much sleep there.nnThere are no signs at the entry gate and also no signs on the door on the 1st floor.nnThe aircondition and ventilators in our room were extremely load and running the entire night because otherwise it would have been to warm.nThe sound level was louder than in an airplane.nnThe hostel consists of a small flat only with 3 rooms, a commong room + kitchen. Therefore we felt a bit constricted inside, air quality was also very bad in the common area.nnThere were mostly Indian people who live there long term for working. Only few other western tourists.nnThe Hostel owner was very friendly though. Breakfast was also fine and complementory.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.780838', 3, 155, 4),
(981, U&'[hismmmhd] Had a great stay at Solo Backpackers Hostel, Bandra! The location is extremely convenient, with easy access to public transport, caf\00e9s, and some of the best spots in Mumbai. The hostel has a friendly and welcoming atmosphere, making it easy to meet fellow travelers from different places.nnThe dorms were comfortable, the common areas were well-maintained, and the staff were helpful and accommodating throughout my stay. I especially appreciated the social vibe of the hostel\2014it felt like a community rather than just a place to sleep.nnIf you\2019re a solo traveler looking for an affordable, well-connected, and friendly place to stay in Mumbai, I would definitely recommend Solo Backpackers Hostel. Looking forward to staying here again!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.98088', 5, 158, 4),
(982, '[Siddharth Bhawsar] I had a very bad experience staying at this hostel. The hygiene standards were poor and the overall cleanliness was disappointing. The beds were extremely uncomfortable, which made it difficult to rest properly. The location was also not mentioned clearly, the hostel is on the 7th floor, and to make things worse, the lift was often not working, which was very inconvenient. The washroom area was not maintained well, and even the mirror was dirty. Overall, my experience was very disappointing and I would not recommend this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.981031', 2, 158, 4),
(983, U&'[Shree Ambatwar] WORST EXPERIENCE. ZERO PROFESSIONALISM.nnThe staff doesn\2019t even have basic common sense.nFor women, this place is not safe at all. The cleaners/housekeeping enter the women\2019s rooms without knocking or asking for permission, which is completely unacceptable.nnThe entire hostel roof leaks \2014 beds get wet, rooms stink, and there is no proper maintenance.nStaff is rude, unresponsive, and does not respect customers.nnAbsolutely no proper housekeeping.nWould NOT recommend this place to anyone.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.981738', 1, 158, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(984, '[Wilson K] Worst Place To Be On Earth... Humble Request To Not Go Here..nI Got Pneumonia After Staying There For Only 1 Hour. Doesn''t Even Deserve 1 Star.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.981895', 1, 158, 4),
(985, '[TUSHYA PATEL] Very pathetic service and cleanliness. Also the rooms were not as shown in the photos and are really small.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.982029', 1, 158, 4),
(986, '[Likith Vijay] Super friendly host and staff , walkable to Bandra station, best pick for solo travelers', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.982168', 5, 158, 4),
(987, '[Manasi Sarate] Should not get even 1 star photo are very misleading everything shown in photo is exactly same but in worst condition. The building is in construction, and no lift till 7th floor. They have only 1 toilet for females which is worst as well. I reached around 3 in the morning and was very tired and the guy who checked me in was kinda rude and very slow, I was standing there for almost 30 mins with my bags. People staying there are kinda shady. One girl started cussing me and other girl for no reason. Waste of money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.982319', 1, 158, 4),
(988, '[Manasvi] Literally the worst hostel to stay. Location is very bad, all the walls are torned out. No hygine. Mix bathrooms. Do not go to that place, very traumatic just by seeing. Dont trust the pictures, you will regret paying every penny. Kahi bhi chale jana but not here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:01.982461', 1, 158, 4),
(989, '[Dilmohan Naik] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.10647', 5, 160, 4),
(990, '[Niraj Ved] My niece stayed here during her internship and the best part about this place is SAFETY FOR WOMEN. Even the staff and management is very courteous and helpful.nThe location is also apt for ppl who are from out of Mumbai. Very centrally located', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.118665', 5, 161, 4),
(991, '[Rahul Pandey] My cousin stayed here. Nice place and centrally located hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.118811', 5, 161, 4),
(992, '[Amit Kumar] So pretty and amazing hostel of bandra', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.119164', 4, 161, 4),
(993, '[dhaval kothari] Excellent hostel for students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.119739', 5, 161, 4),
(994, '[Rajput Rajendra] Whats the rent for 2sharing?', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.120602', 3, 161, 4),
(995, '[Murugan Ayyasamy] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.120805', 2, 161, 4),
(996, '[Aditya Gupta] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.12096', 5, 161, 4),
(997, '[Dhaval kothari] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.121107', 5, 161, 4),
(998, U&'[Nimesh Jaiswal] \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50nBenin House is a great place to stay. The rooms are clean, comfortable, and well-maintained. The staff is friendly, cooperative, and always ready to help. The property is neat, secure, and provides a peaceful living environment. Overall, it offers a pleasant stay with good facilities and timely support. Highly recommended', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.129733', 5, 162, 4),
(999, '[Rajshree Baru] The beds have privacy curtains and personal reading lights which makes the dorm feel like your own mini room. The bathroom and shower were spotless. And the in-house cafe serves great coffee and affordable meals', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.129935', 5, 162, 4),
(1000, '[Deepak Kumar] Well-maintained facilities and timely support make living here comfortable and stress-free. Definitely recommended.nGreat place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.130086', 5, 162, 4),
(1001, U&'[Md Gausul] Every thing is ok no issue else so very perfect and cool society and good place , food and room , bed evrything is fine no doubt \+01f970', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.13028', 5, 162, 4),
(1002, '[Abhi Chorat] Everything is looking like a good food and cleaning. Staff is very humble', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.130491', 1, 162, 4),
(1003, '[Tejaswini Bramhane] I haven''t received my deposit yet though I have followed all the formalities and instructions given by Resident Captain(RC). Paid rent on time. Still I am struggling with my deposit refund. Worst Resident Captain(RC) - doesn''t know about their app and system. Constantly misguided by RC !nTerrible management and maintenance, fake promises were made. Worst quality services. Bugs were found in water, unclean water.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.130659', 1, 162, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1004, '[Satyam Ydv] Comfortable stay with good amenities. Cleanliness and hygiene are well taken care of.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.130803', 5, 162, 4),
(1005, '[anshika singh] The place is unhygienic and overcrowded, making it unsuitable for students. The washing machine was broken, and facilities were dirty, which could lead to health issues. Bathrooms were particularly unhygienic, and the rooms have limited storage, students have to keep belongings on the floor or bed. The tiny cupboards and beds don''t match the high cost, it''s just not worth it', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.130939', 1, 162, 4),
(1006, '[Pranay Sahoo] Room is clean, spacious enough, and worth the money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.141315', 4, 163, 4),
(1007, '[Bandra DIAMONDE JEWELS] Great placenAlso the owner Anand Soni ... very informative and friendly!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.141639', 5, 163, 4),
(1008, U&'[Sagi Deekshith] Worst place to live, please don\2019t go here if you wanna save yourself from rats menace', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.141799', 1, 163, 4),
(1009, '[Om Yadav] Best pg ever been to with amazing experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.141937', 5, 163, 4),
(1010, '[Md Farhan] Number??', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.14207', 5, 163, 4),
(1011, '[Nishvi Shah] Nice experience!! abundant facilities', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.142208', 5, 163, 4),
(1012, '[Kajal Jhaveri] Best paying guest ever visted', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.142333', 5, 163, 4),
(1013, '[Vijay Marketing] Good pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.142462', 5, 163, 4),
(1014, '[CHOCOPAI GAMING] Overall good PG and no food provided with the PG but can take the tiffin service available there by asking the locals or roommates abt it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.175359', 4, 166, 4),
(1015, '[Iulian D] I stayed in one of their pg and had a very bad experience. There were problem with the apartment all throughout the 6 months I stayed like leaks, jet spray, geyser or washing machine not working. They sorted stuff out but after a long time and only after insisting many times. Not to say that it took them 3 months to install an AC when I was told they''ll put it in 2 days after I moved. I also had to fight with them to get my deposit back. Definitely don''t recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.175508', 1, 166, 4),
(1016, '[shlok mittal] Really really nice PG!! But book it on BedR India, the price I got on that was much better', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.175639', 5, 166, 4),
(1017, '[Shivangi chauhan] Been with this pg in Andheri. Even during lock time these guys helped us out a lot. A very safe and secure pg in Mumbai.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.17577', 5, 166, 4),
(1018, '[Kaushal] Its wonderful place to stay as pg area is more populous and theres slum nearby but its mumbai you cant escape slums', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.175896', 4, 166, 4),
(1019, '[Music Charts] PG for working professional in andheri.nHave been with this pg for a long time now.nNo brokrage.nAnd good services.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.176025', 5, 166, 4),
(1020, '[saurabh yedke] Best PG to stay at I''m Mumbai.nSave. Secure. For working or students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.176154', 5, 166, 4),
(1021, '[Kanchi Maheshwari] Best pg accomadation in mumbai. Have been with them for a while now.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.176298', 5, 166, 4),
(1022, U&'[Prem Gupta] The PG is very comfortable and has a welcoming atmosphere for everyone.nRooms are neat, well-kept, and come with all the essential facilities.nIt\2019s a safe and convenient option for both students and working professionals.nThe staff are friendly and always ready to help with any issues.nOverall, it\2019s a cozy, well-managed, and affordable place to stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.186628', 5, 167, 4),
(1023, '[Vicky Zanzotad] Best price in Andheri west', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.186776', 5, 167, 4),
(1024, '[Kunal Vadher] Clean room budget friendly do visit', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.186906', 5, 167, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1025, '[Kishan dulgach] Very clean cctv facility', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.187034', 5, 167, 4),
(1026, '[Rajkumar Karjatkar] Clean and best place to stay in Mumbai', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.187362', 5, 167, 4),
