(1028, '[bhagwan sonawane] clean pg in Andheri west mumbai', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.18762', 5, 167, 4),
(1029, '[Awadhesh Chaurasia] Best pg in Andheri West mumbai', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.187742', 5, 167, 4),
(1030, '[Jackie Sheq] I also lived here before they have all facilities but they don''t have the proper paper work related to rent and all other deposit, so it will create problem at the time of leaving', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.197153', 1, 168, 4),
(1031, U&'[Aastha Gupta] Worst PG ever. Don\2019t even think of going there. They take your money, but nobody actually cares about your problems. There are constant electricity issues, and ultimately, you will be left responsible even after paying a huge amount for maintenance and other charges. Strongly recommended: do not go.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.197294', 1, 168, 4),
(1032, '[Sudiptoratul Chakraborty] I have been staying here since last four years and it''s one of the best. All the necessary services are provided instantly like daily room cleaning, maintenance , canteen services. The owners are very cooperative and the charges are very very reasonable compared to its locational advantages and facilities of this society. I did never think of shifting to elsewhere during last so many years.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.197439', 5, 168, 4),
(1033, U&'[chandrahas Hosmane] I have been staying in this PG since one year and my experience so far has been very positive. The room is very spacious , properly ventilated and has cupboard to keep your luggage and things safe. Room and washrooms are cleaned daily and the best part of the PG is its location it\2019s very near to andheri station it takes just 10 min walk from the pg so you need not to worry about getting late to your work or for collage and you will find ample of stores around your PG to buy your things. Owner and the office members will be there for you at every moment to help you out in solving any issues you encounter in your stay at the pg. Trust me you will have the best pg experience of your years of stay here in Mumbai \270c\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.197633', 5, 168, 4),
(1034, '[Sanket Bhatiya] It''s a good pg in Andheri West. They are serving good bed , good room, wifi, paid gas facility, paid Electricity. But it''s nominal. So you can afford. The only thing that I didn''t like is they are Charing maintenance fee as the room rent. Which is high because I am here for the shorter time. Other than everything is fine. Room charges would get higher as you choose for privacy. Sagar city is slum area. So for 1 km you would feel like ordinary city. But from one side you would get ''Andheri local train station '' and the other side same 1 km away there is Metro station from the PG room. So it''s good place to live and struggle your bachelor life. Thank you.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.197763', 4, 168, 4),
(1035, '[Mahendra Ramesh Shiradkar] They will never provide services on time. Most difficult task is to get your deposit back. I am still struggling to get it back', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.197894', 1, 168, 4),
(1036, '[Shlok Mittal] HinnI love this property, but find it on BedR India! I got a crazy discount when I booked through them', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.198017', 5, 168, 4),
(1037, '[Misba Mkk] Absolutely disgusting pg, the person who handles the pg named Adnan is unprofessional and enters girls pg every now and then without any notice, upon confronting he started yelling. He says he is the owner of the pg but he is not, he has rented the place. The entire pg is a scam.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.198153', 1, 168, 4),
(1038, '[Ajay V] First of all he''s not any PG owner and he don''t have any PG....nnHe''s lier and cheater who''s cheating girls and boys from different different cities...he has one formula while communication he will share rooms pics with bed and fridge but it''s totally fake....guys don''t trust him and don''t pay him any amountnnHe''s unqualified bhaiya type people and don''t have sense how to talk with girl while first interaction he wil talk like sister and after once we paid he will use rude and abuse language....he sat in MP location might be and cheating and threaten from people...nnHe will tell he has PG and we need to pay 6500 again security amount and after all this he will correct figures that he told not 6500,he told 6530 without this receipt will not generate....guys his religion is cheating and he''s doing the samennDONT PAY ANY AMOUNT TO HIM UNTIL UNLESS NO ONE CAN HELP YOU GUYS....nnHES CYBER FRAUD', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.219294', 1, 170, 4);           
