(1042, '[Gordhan Gordhan bhunwal] Ok', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.219832', 5, 170, 4),
(1043, '[Sameer Ahmad] Good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.219951', 5, 170, 4),
(1044, '[Sumit Gupta] Online booking', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.220154', 5, 170, 4),
(1045, '[Praveen Kumar] Ok', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.220289', 5, 170, 4),
(1046, '[Avishek Debnath] I stayed for 7 Months in their Lower parel pg. In the beginning everything was decent. But the real struggle gonna start when you gonna left the PG. You literally have to beg for your hard earned money which you paid as a security deposit. Even after sharing the break-up by Sharad that whatever money they will deduct from your deposit, you have to keep following up with them for your hard earned deposited money. They neither bother nor care about their tenents. They didn''t pick up call nor gonna reply to you over messages. Also be careful and keep all the payments proofs to you as they it will surely help you when they provide the breakups. Good luck', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.23332', 1, 171, 4),
(1047, '[Padmanabh Khoptikar] The PG manager is extremely rude and abuses you in DMs if you dislike their service. PGs are laden with bedbugs. If there''s a decent PG available, she''ll charge you brokerage. They don''t pick up your calls and are redundant on showing you the place. Wasted my time visiting this place. If you''re planning on visiting and coming from far to visit, keep it in mind.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.233458', 1, 171, 4),
(1048, U&'[Kamya Satdev] Stayed here for about 3 years.nThe facilities are great for the price point and location. It\2019s well connected to both the local and metro stations, making travel super convenient.nThe owner is very understanding, cooperative and helpful when it comes to getting anything done in the house. Overall, a decent and comfortable stay! \2728', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.233601', 5, 171, 4),
(1049, '[Chandrav Jyoti Medhi] It was a great experience for us. Sharad ji was very cooperative and helped us throughout our stay for 2 months.nnWould definitely recommend to working professionals and students!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.234013', 4, 171, 4),
(1050, '[Pratik Borkar] I had a very good experience staying at Sharad PG. All the amenities were available and well maintained, which made my stay comfortable and hassle free. The biggest plus point is its prime location, very close to the office, which saved a lot of travel time. Overall, a great place to stay and I would definitely recommend it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.234191', 5, 171, 4),
(1051, '[MEGHA] I stayed for 1 year in this pg. I had a good experience staying here and made some beautiful memories with my roommates in this pg. Thank you.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.234332', 5, 171, 4),
(1052, '[Anjali Valage] The stay was pretty good and worth it.nSafe environment for girls.  Everything accessible within walking distance.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.234462', 5, 171, 4),
(1053, '[Amal Shukla SEC-A 2022] Property is in great location and flats condition is great. Prabha devi station is in 200 meters. Sharad Sir, looks after all the necessities whenever required.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.234591', 5, 171, 4),
(1054, '[vikas Sahu] One of the best pg in Andheri West budget friendly', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.246079', 5, 172, 4),
(1055, '[Rajesh Lohat] Best and clean g in andheri west with all clean facilities', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.246302', 5, 172, 4),
(1056, '[RB Budget] They have a simple but tasty menu that changes regularly, so I never got bored. Plus, it was really convenient having meals included in my stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.246434', 5, 172, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1057, '[Sonu Maurya] Best pg in Andheri West with all facilities', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.246582', 5, 172, 4),
(1058, '[Awadhesh Chaurasia] Best pg in Andheri West clean room budget friendly', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.247452', 5, 172, 4),
(1059, '[kohinoor guesthouse] The cleanliness of the place was impressive too. I always found the common areas tidy, and my room was well-maintained.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.247623', 5, 172, 4),
(1060, '[Vicky Zanzotad] Very clean facilities in Andheri west area', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.247749', 5, 172, 4),
(1061, '[Mohsin Surya] One of the best pg in andheri west', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.247866', 5, 172, 4),
(1062, '[Mohit Baranwal] Decent PG with basic facilities. Clean rooms and supportive owner. Suitable for students and working professionals', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.27982', 5, 174, 4),
(1063, '[Pulkit Sadhu] I have not stayed here, but their response was very nice and they suggest me another number and details for PG stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.279967', 4, 174, 4),
(1064, '[Darshan Suryawanshi] The PG is clean and well-maintained. Each room is furnished with a bed, table, and chair, which makes it convenient for studying or working. There are three washrooms available, which helps avoid waiting during busy hours. Overall, a decent and comfortable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.280182', 5, 174, 4),
(1065, '[Daranish T] I did not live here but uncle was very kind when calling and gave me alternate places and number to checkout', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.280307', 5, 174, 4),
(1066, '[Yatharth Nagda] A good and affordable PG located close to Sion station. The rooms are spacious, and flatmates are great. Rajendra uncle, who is the owner is helpful and supportive.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.280541', 5, 174, 4),
(1067, '[Aditya Shinde] One the best place in Mumbai, uncle is very helpful, always Ready to help. It was best experience for me.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.280757', 5, 174, 4),
(1068, U&'[Abhishek Anand] Terrible PG. Avoid at all costs. The owner is extremely rude and refuses to return your deposit. There are no proper facilities, just tap water, and the rooms are not secure, as the owner enters at any time. If you want to waste your money, then go ahead. Most of the reviews here are fake, likely posted by the owner''s family. For an honest opinion, ask the current tenants when you visit.nnIt''s too expensive. It''s illegal to live there as no rent receipt is provided by owner. When you ask for receipt he will tell you to live immediately and even he is taking all the money in cash.nnReply - I did not steal anything from you. On the contrary, you\2019ve wrongfully withheld my deposit and are now making false accusations. You haven\2019t even paid the maid, despite your claims. Please stop spreading lies. And to others reading this \2014 don\2019t be misled by his responses; he replies with the same dismissive comments to anyone who speaks the truth.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.280902', 1, 174, 4),
(1069, '[Aadil Anode] Honest Review: The PG is alright like a normal PG. The owner/landlord is flexible for the most part. One thing is I didn''t like is the huge cockroach infestation which was really annoying.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.281045', 3, 174, 4),
(1070, U&'[Srushti Joshi] I stayed here for like 8 months. People are cooperative and so the landlord. They actually understand your problems and try to resolve it. Location is quite good and rooms are spacious. One must try this place if you are new in the city. Loved Archana Ji\2019s nature, she is actually aware how to tackle girls\+01f61c.nnHad a good experience\2026', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.291706', 5, 175, 4),
(1071, '[NILAM DALVI] I had a very pleasant stay at this Paying Guest house. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and comfortable. The environment is calm, safe, and peaceful, making it ideal for working professionals and students. Archana ji is very kind, cooperative, and always ready to help, which makes the stay even more comfortable. The PG is conveniently located near the metro station and railway station, with the market nearby, making daily needs easily accessible. Wi-Fi facility is available, and the presence of a security guard adds an extra sense of safety. Cleanliness is maintained regularly. Overall, it truly feels like a home away from home. Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.291852', 5, 175, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1072, U&'[Shraddha Hegde] I had a good time living in Archana\2019s PG. She is a responsive and helpful host.nThe room is well lit and spacious.nIt was a comfortable stay :)nI lived in Aum Heights.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.292051', 5, 175, 4),
(1073, U&'[Aakanksha Jaind] Very good service and comfortable, budget-friendly stays, also very safe with complete security.nAmazing location with good amenities, helpful owner(Archana didi).nWill definitely suggest about these PG with my friends and colleagues.\+01f60a\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.292198', 5, 175, 4),
(1074, U&'[Cavita Dsouza] I had a wonderful stay at this PG! The rooms are spacious, clean, and fully furnished, making it very comfortable. The location is perfect with the metro, park, Dmart, and malls all just a few minutes\2019 walk away.nnI was a newbie in the city when I first reached out to Archana Di, and she instantly made me feel comfortable and safe. She is one of the most bold, supportive, and caring persons I\2019ve met. She\2019s always there for you and truly makes the place feel like home.nnI\2019d highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a safe, homely, and convenient stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.292334', 5, 175, 4),
(1075, '[Dancer Raki] Truly appreciate the cleanliness and maintenance, homely food and timely management.. definitely suggested for someone who''s looking for a classic stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.292481', 5, 175, 4),
(1076, U&'[Shaily Jain] I had a wonderful stay in this flat. It\2019s bright, cozy, and exactly as described. The owner was always quick to respond and made the whole experience easy and pleasant. I\2019d happily stay again! Thankyou so much for making my stay in mumbai special\+01fa77\2728', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.292607', 5, 175, 4),
(1077, '[ashwini] Rooms are clean, well-ventilated, and maintained. Security measures are in place (CCTV, guard, entry restrictions).Location is safe and has good connectivity (bus, metro, market nearby).Wi-Fi, laundry, and housekeeping services are reliable.and also the owner that is archana di is so sweet who always there to solve are problems 24/7', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.292735', 5, 175, 4),
(1078, U&'[shubham vishwakarma] I have been staying at PGKing Paying Guest in Bhandup West, Mumbai for the last 6 months, and my experience has been excellent. The rooms are clean, spacious, and well-maintained. The staff is friendly, supportive, and always ready to help.nnThe environment is safe and peaceful, making it a great place for both working professionals and students. One of the biggest advantages is its convenient location\2014it''s close to Bhandup Railway Station, making daily commuting very easy. Nearby markets and essential services are also easily accessible.nnI highly recommend PGKing to anyone looking for a clean, comfortable, and reliable PG in Bhandup West. It has been a wonderful place to stay, and I am very satisfied with my experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.303968', 5, 176, 4),
(1079, '[Pawan Kumar] I had a great experience staying at PgKing Paying Guest for the last 6 months. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and the overall environment is safe and peaceful. The management is very supportive and responds quickly to any issues. The location is convenient with easy access to public transport and nearby markets. It''s an excellent choice for working professionals and students. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.304217', 5, 176, 4),
(1080, '[Ritesh gupta] Very nice and well furnished home stay in Mumbai with very affordable price ..owner tanmay is very cooperative and polite..spent really great time.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.316787', 5, 177, 4),
(1081, U&'[Abhiraj Bag] I had an excellent stay at this hostel in Santacruz! It\2019s truly a value-for-money option that exceeded my expectations. The staff is incredibly kind and helpful, always ready to assist with a smile. The service was top-notch, with clean rooms and well-maintained common areas. The location is convenient, making it easy to explore nearby attractions. It\2019s a great choice for budget travelers who don\2019t want to compromise on comfort and hospitality. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.316936', 5, 177, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1082, U&'[Sattwa Travel] We were really surprised that the staff wanted to take picture of every single document of identity we had (passport, polish ID card and driver\2019s license) and felt pretty uncomfortable with that. More than that we got charged extra for wanting to change the bed with a charging space (which was included in booking). There is different pricing for each level of bunkbeds, but it\2019s not distinguished on booking, so be prepared to pay a little extra if you want a little more comfortable space. We also had an unpleasant situation with some other guest, who was drunk/drugged and started a fight with other guest (it got pretty physical). The aggressive guest didn\2019t got thrown out at the moment (he should have been according to the rules we read), but the morning after and staying in one room with that person for the night made us feel pretty unsafe. The neighbourhood is good though, with some amazing food and the Juhu Beach is nearby. The hotel was clean in general, but there were bedbugs.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.317482', 3, 177, 4),
(1083, U&'[Mahendroid] Not ''very'' good! But does the job.nn\20b9200 for upper birthn250 for middle birthn300 for lower birthnnAffordable but bathroom and washroom cleanliness must be maintained! There needs exhaust in bathrooms! They smell aswell!nnUpdate: They have increased the price by 100 each', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.320801', 3, 177, 4),
(1084, '[Soham Adelkar] Bad place to staynOwner was not goodnStaf also not good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.321054', 1, 177, 4),
(1085, '[MAULIK JIKAR Fire Volunteer (MJ)] This is 3rd class management If I went to tie, they were hitting chemicals and in bed Mosquito mite was in the bed Very bad condition, they took my money first I have been sitting for an hour so I have come from far away But no responsennI came yesterday after traveling for 16 hours but the room was not ready! The area was very poor!, we lived in the beds, bed bugs Everything was coming! Annoyed me for an hour And took the money first and also filled the form Then say that you will need bed time All these worthless people harass others for money and for their own needs The area is completely flooded and no one is leaving', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.321186', 1, 177, 4),
(1086, U&'[Kalpesh Meshram] Everything is ohk,... But there are too many \0916\091f\092e\0932, ( \0922\0947\0915\0941\0928), cockroaches inside the all beds. You can''t sleep even for an hour. I have experienced and whole night I was only sitting on bed and that dangerous cockroaches was going here and there very fast... Some of which I found, I break them on the spot, u can see in the pictures.... Don''t take a risk, that''s very dangerous. Believe me guys, I was very scared, no one cares about our health in this pg.   Worst experience \+01f44e .... 0 start from my sidennThey should use only iron beds that not any such type of dangerous animals will come... \+01f44e\+01f44e\+01f622\+01f622', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.321301', 1, 177, 4),
(1087, '[Khushi Raykundaliya] Very glad to stay there.all the staff is very nice and cooperative. Very safe for girls as there rules are very strict. Special thanks to Tanuj bhaiya who drives the Bapuji paying guest house. He make us feel like family members not like guest.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.321415', 5, 177, 4),
(1088, '[shubham] PG Is genuine butnThe owner haven''t listed it onlinenDon''t fall for scam visit place and talk to owner directlynA lot of online listings host will contact you and tell token money for visiting card first they will ask you for 2000 and after the payment they will payment haven''t received properly make another 3k payment and both the amount will refund you once you reach locationnThe scammer name is Sanjay SinghnI got his number from housing.comnI lost my 9k in this scam please be avair guysnAgain don''t fall for any such scamnPG is genuine do directly to location owner is one maharashtrian lady talk to her directly for PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.334686', 1, 178, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1089, '[Nadim Sekh] Don''t go there they are fraud...if you contact they are always asking for money 2k for visiting card...I thought this would be true.. but when sended to my 2 friends they are telling it''s a fraud....Plz don''t go there... They are too much fraud....', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.334958', 1, 178, 4),
(1090, U&'[Shalini Saraf] Pathetic hospitality and he asked for 2000 for Visiting card, then he never picked my call and all the photos are fake so don''t trust it.\+01f621', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.335247', 1, 178, 4),
(1091, '[Payal Agrawal] They ask for 2000 to make online visiting card and continue to ask for more money for unnecessary excuse like first time visiting 6000 and so on and so forth.nAvoid them and report them on broker apps to whoever reading this review.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.335415', 1, 178, 4),
(1092, '[Reia Menezes] I and my friends needed a place to stay for our internship, close to our workplace. Recommended by my seniors we contacted Mr. Rajesh, who was really helpful. He showed us a really affordable and clean residence. It had all the amenities that we wished for. Wi-Fi was an added bonus.nI would recommend Mr. Rajesh, very helpful and trustworthy.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.335543', 5, 178, 4),
(1093, U&'[Fl\00e1via D.] They cheated me of Rs 2000 to get an online visiting card made.  Once money was transferred they asked for one month advance rent.  That''s wen I realised it was a scam', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.335666', 1, 178, 4),
(1094, '[Vijay Gidwani] Mumbai people are very helpful if one is not knowing about Mumbai no need to worry here people are so cooperative that whatever is ur stay budget u will definitely find a good place for rent', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.335853', 5, 178, 4),
(1095, '[HRUSHIKESH JAGDALE] They don''t pick up call and also don''t respond to WhatsApp Messages', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.336063', 3, 178, 4),
(1096, '[akshay kumar] I stayed at Mantri Serene under Royal Accommodation for almost 3 and a half months, and my overall experience was very good. The services were always prompt and well-managed. Whenever there was any issue or requirement, it was addressed quickly without delay.nnThey provide free WiFi, gas facility, and maid services for cleaning utensils and maintaining the home, which made daily life very convenient and comfortable during my stay.nnA special thanks to Deepali, the accountant at Royal Accommodation, who was very helpful and supportive throughout my stay. She was always approachable and ensured smooth coordination whenever needed.nnOverall, I had a comfortable and hassle-free experience and would definitely recommend Royal Accommodation to others looking for a reliable place to stay in Goregoan.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.347769', 5, 179, 4),
(1097, U&'[Mazhar Hussain] I had a great experience staying at Avant Hillway PG. The accommodation was well-maintained, comfortable, and met all my expectations.nnA special mention to the Royal PG Accommodation team\2014they were extremely friendly, supportive, and always ready to help. They promptly assisted me with all my queries, and whenever I needed to change rooms, they made the relocation process smooth and hassle-free.nnOverall, I truly appreciate their service and would highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a reliable and comfortable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.34791', 5, 179, 4),
(1098, U&'[Neha Prashar] I stayed with Royal for around 3 years and it was all good throughout. You don\2019t need to take any headache of anything be it repairs, maintenance, deep cleaning, maid etc. Every service is provided by them. They are co-operative and listen to your concerns and try to resolve it at their best. You don\2019t need to worry they\2019ll return your deposit also on time. Overall good experience!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.348045', 5, 179, 4),
(1099, U&'[rohan chandel] Had a great experience staying at Royal Accommodation PG. The rooms are well-maintained, clean, and comfortable. The services are really good, and everything is managed properly. What stood out the most is the staff\2014they are very helpful, polite, and always ready to assist. Overall, a very pleasant and hassle-free stay. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.348192', 5, 179, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1100, '[Zafrah Kutty] I had a good experience with Royal Accomodation. The entire process was smooth and transparent. The management is supportive and always ready to help for any concern. Special thanks to @Sweety for being helpful and responsive throughout. Highly recommended for someone looking for a secure and peaceful stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.348323', 5, 179, 4),
(1101, U&'[Sourabh yadav] I had a very good experience with Royal Accommodation. The service was prompt, the staff was cooperative, and everything was handled professionally. They ensured a smooth and hassle-free process. Highly recommended!nn\2014 Kalpesh Vishwakarma', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.348451', 5, 179, 4),
(1102, '[Anuva Sharma] Had a great experience finding a place to live through Royal Accommodation. The problems are resolved asap. Shoutout to Sweety. I will always remember and cherish the time. Thanks a lot.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.348576', 4, 179, 4),
(1103, U&'[sanyam phophalia] Good PG with supportive management. The deposit was refunded on time, which is something you don''t see everywhere.nI would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a trustworthy place to stay.nThanks to Swalin Sir \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.3487', 5, 179, 4),
(1104, U&'[Ashish Mudra] CAUTION: This listing is most probably made by some fraudster.nWhen I called he asked me to make online payment for just visiting to check out the facility.nnTHREE REASONS WHY I THINK SO:nn1. Who the hell in this world asks for  money if you first want to visit and check out the facilities?nn2. The number mentioned on one of the owner''s replies shows a SPAM status in true caller.nn3. There''s not a CALL button available on the google listing.nnBe careful. Be vigilant \+01f44d\+01f3fc', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.371629', 1, 181, 4),
(1105, U&'[Naveen Bhatnagar] Very proximate to borivali railway station. Awesome  place to reside in. Very interesting feature, which usually most of the hotels don''t provide ie.nFlexible in and out timings which has helped me a lot.nOwners are very co-operative.nRent affordable.nnWhat''s more expected from Mumbai.. Congratulations\+01f389\+01f973\+01f44f\+01f44f\+01f389', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.371742', 4, 181, 4),
(1106, '[Arun Singh] Hey Guys, this is my personal experience , this is fraud, they ask for 2000 deposit and then 2500 for GST and while you ask for cancellation they will ask for 1999 cancellation fee, they also tried to hack my gmail account, they are trained fraud people, they have several groups of people to do this all, be ware guys. It''s a serious problem', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.371861', 1, 181, 4),
