(1144, U&'[Rohit Tamhankar] My best friend has been staying in this PG, and her experience has been really good. The place is safe, clean, and well-maintained, which is very important for girls. The location is excellent\2014just a short distance from Thane Station, making daily travel across Mumbai very convenient. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.474983', 5, 186, 4),
(1145, '[Parnavi Patil] I had a really good experience staying at this PG. The room were clean, well-maintained, and comfortable. The staff and owner were friendly, helpful, and always available whenever needed. The overall environment felt safe and peaceful. It''s a great place for students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.475126', 5, 186, 4),
(1146, '[Ruchika Deshmukh] I had a great experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and comfortable. The environment is safe and peaceful, and all the basic facilities are available. The owner and staff are friendly, supportive, and always ready to help. Any issues are resolved quickly. Overall, it''s an excellent place to stay, and I would definitely recommend it to others.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.475279', 5, 186, 4),
(1147, '[Divya KEDAR] This is one of the best girls'' PGs in Thane. It is clean, safe, and well maintained. The warden is very helpful and caring. I highly recommend this PG to any girl looking for a safe and comfortable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.475409', 5, 186, 4),
(1148, U&'[Harshada patil] I am staying at Nest PG in Thane and my experience has been good so far. The rooms are clean and well-maintained. The staff is supportive and helpful. The location is convenient and safe. Food quality is decent and facilities like WiFi and water supply are properly managed. Overall, it\2019s a good place for students and working girls. I would recommend it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.475544', 5, 186, 4),
(1149, U&'[Sanket Shinde] My sister stay there is safe to their pg it''s great experience \263a\fe0f 8 like most beautiful PG it''s most safe', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.475668', 5, 186, 4),
(1150, '[Rupali Kore] Clean, safe, and well-maintained PG. The staff is friendly, and the overall experience has been smooth and comfortable. A great place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.475791', 5, 186, 4),
(1151, U&'[Neha Singh] I would highly not recommend anyone to come to their pg named as Osis Girls Pg in Pawar Nagar, You will face the whole night light cuts 50-100 times, and they didn\2019t provide any facilities and If you would complain regarding your concerns , they will not listen to you. so better that do not come here, even I am also planning to leave as soon as I will get some other PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.475916', 1, 186, 4),
(1152, '[Sanjay Bhanushali] I''ve been staying at Shree Balaji Dormitory for the last three months and have absolutely loved it! The owner is incredibly friendly and welcoming, the staff is helpful and courteous, and all of my issues have been resolved really quickly. Plus, I don''t have to pay a deposit - which makes things so much easier. If you''re looking for a great place to stay on a budget, I highly recommend Shree Balaji Dormitory!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.493884', 5, 187, 4);   
