(1160, '[Sahil Subhash Jarag] Very nice and well-maintained PG. The rooms and common areas are always clean and hygienic. The owner and staff are polite, helpful, and respond quickly to any issues. The environment is peaceful, safe, and comfortable for both students and working professionals. Good facilities, regular housekeeping, and overall excellent management make it a great place to stay. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a clean, comfortable, and affordable PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.511466', 5, 188, 4),
