(1169, '[Vandana Arora] I had a wonderful experience staying at this PG. The rooms were clean, well-maintained, and comfortable, making it feel like a home away from home. The staff was extremely courteous and always ready to help, ensuring a smooth and hassle-free stay. The service provided was excellent', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.528979', 5, 189, 4),
