(1184, '[Ashfaq Husain] I truly enjoyed my stay at King''s Dormitory. The housekeeping team maintains excellent hygiene, and all the facilities are kept in good condition. The staff is respectful, cooperative, and always willing to help. I felt safe and comfortable throughout my stay. Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.559803', 5, 191, 4),
(1185, '[Dr. Aman Jaiswal] Not as in photos, also many people are like living in the dormitory, also many people are selling drugs inside.  AC is also turned on only at night. There were many drunkards living inside fron 2-3 months.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.559943', 1, 191, 4),
(1186, '[sangram jagtap] Its not decent at all, continuous bad smell and improper lighting, bad beds and too much crowded for the price they charge.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.560261', 1, 191, 4),
(1187, '[fadu shayari] Good pg for boys cneet and clean pg and budget friendly', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.560399', 5, 191, 4),
(1188, '[Tilak Shetty] Best Dormitory In thane West. Best Service u0026 Humble Staff.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.560529', 5, 191, 4),
(1189, U&'[Amit Kumar] I had a terrible experience here. Despite paying and entering the premises, I was immediately hit by an unbearable foul smell. The dormitory was extremely congested, with beds placed too close to each other, making it feel suffocating and unhygienic. The overall condition of the place was old, poorly maintained, and far from what was expected. I requested a refund because I couldn''t stay under such conditions, but the staff refused. I strongly advise others to avoid this place\2014it\2019s not worth your time or money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.560657', 1, 191, 4),
(1190, '[Nitin Tiwari] Good for young boys.. clean pg nice and polite staff.. faizan night staff good..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.560784', 5, 191, 4),
(1191, '[Manoj Devarakonda] dormitory is good with affordable prices it''s near to railway station. There is a place given to store your luggage but no lock provided you have to carry your own lock. The staff is also friendly, you got heat water facility and washing machine is also provided', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.560897', 5, 191, 4),
