(1198, '[Sadam Khan] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.600876', 1, 193, 4),
(1199, U&'[Jyoti Sahu] One of the best PGs I have stayed in. Rooms are clean, hygienic and well maintaine. The environment is safe, peaceful and comfortable. Special thanks to the warden ( noor ) \2014 very polite, caring, supportive and always available for help. Feels like home. Highly recommended for students and working girls.\201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.620064', 5, 194, 4),
(1200, '[Aastha Vishwakarma] I had a really good experience staying at this PG. The location is excellent and very easily accessible, which makes it convenient specially for working girls.nThe warden is very supportive and she ensures that cleanliness and hygiene is properly maintained all the time. Most importantly, the place feels safe to be at. Overall, I would definitely recommend it to anyone looking for a reliable and well-managed PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.620249', 5, 194, 4);     
