(1201, '[Chinmayee Thore] I had a very comfortable and pleasant experience staying at this PG. The rooms were clean and well-maintained, and the overall environment was peaceful and safe. The facilities provided were good, and everything was properly managed. The staff was cooperative and helpful whenever needed.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.620489', 5, 194, 4),
(1202, U&'[vaidehi sonone] My stay at this PG has been very comfortable. The premises are clean and well-maintained, and the caretaker (noor) is courteous and attentive. The facilities provided \2014 including Wi-Fi, air conditioning, a comfortable bed, fan, and kitchen \2014 ensure a pleasant and convenient living experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.620688', 4, 194, 4),
(1203, U&'[Girija Chogale] Staying at Second Home PG in Thane has been a wonderful experience. It truly feels just like home. Noor, the caretaker, is very friendly, understanding, and ensures the PG is always clean and well-maintained. The amenities provided \2014 including AC, fridge, induction cooktops, washing machine, Wi-Fi, and comfortable beds \2014 make living here convenient and hassle-free. I highly recommend this PG for students and working women looking for a safe and homely environment. Thank you second home PG staff for making us comfortable stay. \+01f47c\+01f496\+01f496\+01f496', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.620829', 5, 194, 4),
(1204, '[Tanuja Nikam] I had a very good experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean, spacious, and well-maintained. Basic facilities like water supply, electricity, Wi-Fi, and security are provided properly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.620974', 5, 194, 4),
(1205, '[Juhidilshad] I liked it very much, there is a peaceful environment here, we are very peaceful too, the best thing I liked was Noor, who understands everyone, it is very good for the heart.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.62111', 5, 194, 4),
(1206, U&'[Anushree] Perfect for girls! Best suited for students and working women. The place is super clean and well organized,makes living here really comfortable and breathable. Its location, exactly opposite Thane east station, is a huge plus for frequent travelers. The warden is the sweetest, and the people here are genuinely nice. Honestly, it feels just like a second home. \+01f496', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.621238', 5, 194, 4),
(1207, '[Anushka Tikhe] Nalini di is very kind, helpful and friendly.nAlways supportive and understanding.nThe PG is well-managed, clean, and safe. I really appreciate the care and discipline maintained here.nThe environment feels like home. Very happy staying here...', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.641516', 5, 195, 4),
(1208, '[Zahra Narayan] It was a great place to stay. Friendly they are...all helpful. Even the warden Ms. Kajal was too friendly helpful ....next time I come here I would definitely again stay here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.641668', 5, 195, 4),
(1209, '[Janhvi Kore] I had a very good experience staying at this hostel. The rooms are clean, spacious, and well-maintained. The hostel staff is polite, supportive, and always ready to help.. Kajal felt very comfortable during her stay in the hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.644708', 5, 195, 4),
(1210, U&'[Anjali Kumari] This pg somewhat does what it promises but good for the 1-2 day stay only.n1. They promise that they will wash your clothes but you have to do it on your own without washing machine and electricity going out of service time to time.nn2.They have a cat roaming around which can question hygiene issues , even with multiple complaints they refuse to keep away the cat.nn3. They do not tell you whatever offers they are having regarding one day two day 10 day 15 day program, owner is very money minded to the core that he is not going to spare you a single penny if by chance you have to relocate before the check out date.nn4. Hygiene issues there are like 25 women living there on average but only one washroom and two running bathrooms to use in which geyser goes on and off again and again .nn5. If you complaint on any service like kitchen, they go we will simply close the kitchen meaning you shut up and adjust .nn6. Your stuff including clothes, footwear, money , devices gets stolen every now and then. Now owner is not responsible but its fellow pgmates so you have to be responsible for your own stuff.nn7. If you go somewhere for 1-2 days even they do not hesitate to sell your bed to other temporary customer without any notice or asking about your whereabouts.nYour bed is not yours, it\2019s everybody\2019s in your absence so no space or privacy respected.nnOverall living standards below average in this pg. I lost 4k in this pg cause owner refuses to show any kind of basic humanity on how if I paid for an entire month but vacating in 10 days he should refund the remaining amount.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.645041', 1, 195, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1211, U&'[Ashwini Ghodeswar] Great place. The owner is outstanding and she\2019s always ready to meet any requirements. She is one of the sweetest person you can meet and is always ready for a quick chat or call. The rooms are spacious and has everything one would need. An ac, geyser, wifi, aqua RO everything is available. The rooms are so clean and tidy and its a great place to stay. Highly recommend!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.647248', 5, 195, 4),
(1212, '[Vaishnavi Chaudhari] Our warden is really good. She always keeps the hostel clean and takes great care of everyone. Because of her, the hostel feels just like home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.647422', 5, 195, 4),
(1213, U&'[Mandeep kaur Mahal] Nice and comfortable stay. Overall experience was very good \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.647553', 5, 195, 4),
(1214, '[Rutu Chavan] This pg is very nice and clean... Nalini didi is very Good person her behaviour is to much polite she is a really very good person...', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.647677', 5, 195, 4),
(1215, '[2732 Purnima Ahuja] My experience staying here was really good. The rooms were spotless, comfortable, and maintained very well, with regular cleaning services provided. The management was cooperative, friendly, and responded quickly whenever assistance was needed. Overall, it felt secure and welcoming, making it a great place for anyone wanting a peaceful and convenient stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.676848', 5, 196, 4),
(1216, '[Anshul Rai] I have lived in Dev Ashoka Thane West for around 4 years. Got very good experience. Society has good amenities staff is very cooperative cleaning done daily. Location is best. Aman ji is very cooperative person. Overall my experience is good. No complaint at all.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.677021', 5, 196, 4),
(1217, U&'[Pooja Jagtap] I stayed at Saikunj Thane PG at their Gautam Terrace location for about 3 months, and overall my experience was quite good.nnThe place felt safe and comfortable for girls, which was my main priority while choosing a PG in Thane West. The room was clean and well-maintained when I moved in, and housekeeping was done regularly. Basic facilities like water supply and electricity were reliable, which made daily life hassle-free.nnThe surroundings of Gautam Terrace are peaceful, and it\2019s well-connected to nearby areas, making commuting easier. The management was cooperative and responsive whenever I had any queries or small issues during my stay. They made sure things were sorted without unnecessary delays.nnWhat I appreciated the most was the calm environment and the sense of security. It felt homely enough for a short-term stay, especially for working women or students who want a decent and safe PG option.nnOverall, my stay at Saikunj Thane PG was satisfactory, and I would recommend it to girls looking for a comfortable PG in Thane West for a short or medium duration.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.677181', 5, 196, 4),
(1218, '[yogesh kothawade] The best PG around Thane, they provide really great facilities, always attend to any concern on priority, the most important thing is PG is the cleanliness and most hygienist I have seen around. House keeping comes every day!nPG facility manged by aman u0026 jyoti ma''am has very good service.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.677799', 5, 196, 4),
(1219, '[Pushpendra Mishra] After spending 2.5 months I realise that Saikunj PG is the safest and affordable in thane and also thank to aman (Owner) he is very helpful and kind person.nIn last 2 month if I face some problem I just texted aman that we are facing this issue and he always solve that issue by next day.nSo If you are coming to thane and looking for PG just give a chance to Saikunj.nThanks', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.677971', 5, 196, 4),
(1220, '[Mahesh] After spending two years at Saikunj Thane PG at Kolshet Road, I can confidently say it''s one of the best paying guest accommodations available. What stands out most is the impeccable service and responsiveness. Aman Ji manages the PG with professionalism and a personal touch. They made sure that [the Kitchen, Wi-Fi, house keeping on daily basis, the repairs were always quick]. Furthermore, I appreciated that the advance amount was returned promptly and on time, exactly as discussed. Living here was hassle-free, which is rare for a long-term PG stay. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a well-managed and comfortable place. Thank you, Aman Ji! I wish you all the best for the future.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.678112', 5, 196, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1221, U&'[Rajmohan chaturvedi] I had a really comfortable stay here. The rooms were clean and well-maintained, and the housekeeping was regular. The owner/management was approachable and responsive whenever there was an issue. Overall, it felt safe and homely\2014definitely a good option for anyone looking for a hassle-free stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.678241', 5, 196, 4),
(1222, '[SK SHREDDED] Don''t know who was on call a women she said I''ll share you correct location but i was standing for hour in runwal park but no reply by any no. In WhatsApp thank god i didn''t took auto to visit this place and came walking instead waste of time it was sunday so i came here and they said on call no it isn''t for students i said I''ll get job but after 2 months since i am in degree over phase so after that i am thinking to move out of my parents house so they said ok reply on the no. We are going to message by so i said ok and wait a hour but no reply by anyone and came back home they didn''t even told me the exact address on call even when i stated that i am in runwal park while on call , location is good no dout but their behavior makes me feel it''s some kind of scam or fraud cause why didn''t they shared exact location on call is pg rooms condition so bad that visiting before paying rent is restricted so people won''t negotiate or save their money and the deposit ?', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.678378', 1, 196, 4),
(1223, '[Reena Choudhary] I have been staying here for a few months and my experience has been very good. The rooms are clean, the atmosphere is safe, and the location near Thane Station is very convenient.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.697893', 5, 197, 4),
(1224, '[Nupur Rahate] Very hygienic and safe environment. Great location.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.735732', 4, 199, 4),
(1225, '[Niyati Patil] The facilities are outstanding..and the security is also amazing..it''s fabulous for girls', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.735974', 5, 199, 4),
(1226, '[Neha Kardile] Very nice experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.736129', 5, 199, 4),
(1227, '[Sneha Yadav] Good location, nicee facility', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.73627', 5, 199, 4),
(1228, '[Bhaskar Kulal] The pg is good for staying', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.736449', 5, 199, 4),
