(1241, '[Adithian Karuvannur] A great place to stay for working professionals. All basic amenities are there for reasonable rate, peaceful surroundings, and what I liked a lot was the view of hills from window (as I stayed on 2nd floor). I had a very good experience here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.77455', 5, 201, 4),
(1242, '[Amrit Sohi] The services provided by them are very satisfying. I recommend to everyone, please give them a chance to serve you.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.774705', 5, 201, 4),
