INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1244, '[Ansh Singh Shekhawat] Good pg for working professionals. Tends towards the expensive side but Chirag Bhai does provide support and amenities that are unmatched as well.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.775027', 5, 201, 4),
(1245, '[Satvik Jain] A great place to live. Most amenities are available close by. The owner is also nice and cooperating. Would recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.775195', 5, 201, 4),
(1246, '[Palak Bakshi] Very supportive staff, very clean pg. Love their service', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.775373', 5, 201, 4),
(1247, '[Aalok Mishra] Clean and hygienic rooms... supportive staff', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.775538', 5, 201, 4),
(1248, '[Sultan Sayyed] Hii is there a bed avilable for me what is minimum cost to stay , I am from Muslim comunity', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.792963', 4, 202, 4),
(1249, '[Raj Karan] How to contact you I want 4 bed', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.793097', 5, 202, 4),
(1250, '[Piyush Mohapatra] It is a community hostel only for the Kutchi people. As soon as you enter the hostel, you will be asked about your caste before giving you any kind of details.nIf you are not a Kutchi, you will be denied admission straightaway', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.793518', 3, 202, 4),
(1251, '[Raj Solanki] Anyone share the current phone number of hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.793642', 4, 202, 4),
(1252, '[yash dedhiya] It''s awesome hostel for boys and not a so complicated rules', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.793762', 5, 202, 4),
(1253, '[Imran Kazi] Ok', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.793877', 3, 202, 4),
(1254, '[Abhay Bhagwan Ingle] It''s a hospital not hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.794179', 1, 202, 4),
(1255, U&'[Ramkrishna Ghuge] Nice \+01f44d\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.794936', 5, 202, 4),
(1256, U&'[Alan K M] \2b50 5 Stars of Disgrace \2013 Seva NiketannnThis is by far the worst place I have ever stayed. The staff openly smoke, drink, and use weed in areas where they know there are no cameras. Rooms are never cleaned \2014 they\2019re filthy, unhygienic, and the beds are infested with bed bugs.nnThe lady at the front desk seems more interested in picking fights than helping guests. They allow cops and GST officers to walk in at any hour, but paying guests are locked out if they return late. Even after taking your money, they won\2019t open the gate or show basic courtesy.nnThe bathrooms are always clogged and dirty, and the canteen is outright disgusting \2014 you can see rats running around the kitchen. It\2019s shocking that a place run under Christian management treats guests with such disrespect and neglect.nnTo make things worse, they refuse to provide any proper proof of payment \2014 no bills, no receipts, nothing.nnA completely mismanaged, unhygienic, and unsafe place. Stay away.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.812187', 1, 203, 4),
(1257, '[Siddharth] A well managed budget hostel, which is clean and perfect for short stays. The rooms are big. Only Individual rooms are available with charging points. Clean R.O water in each floor. An upgraded canteen with humble staff. Overall a good experience. Washrooms are shared, but cleaned very well.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.812322', 4, 203, 4),
(1258, '[Alwin Augustine] I stayed for 25 days... U need to extend after 15 days of stay... There are no charging points in the rooms but enough points are there in ground floor... The canteen facility is more cheaper than outside... Clean and neat place...  The front office services need to be improvised in behavior and their attitude...', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.812431', 4, 203, 4),
(1259, '[GOUTHAM V A] During my Mumbai visit, I stayed here with my two other friends. 900/day for three bed room. Also available single, two, three, five bed rooms. Great environment. Thank you seva niketan for the stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.812538', 5, 203, 4),
(1260, U&'[BubbleAisle] I usually don\2019t leave reviews, but I feel compelled to share my disappointing experience. First off, the customer service was incredibly lacking. The staff seemed uninterested and unhelpful, which made the entire experience feel very uncomfortable. I waited much longer than expected for my order, and when it finally arrived, it was cold and not at all what I had asked for.nnThe ambiance was nothing to write home about either. The place was poorly lit, and the decor felt outdated and drab. To make matters worse, the bathroom was dirty, and the overall cleanliness of the restaurant was far below acceptable standards.nnI also found the pricing to be absurd for the quality of food and service I received. It\2019s clear that this place is not focused on its customers, and I won\2019t be returning. Definitely not worth the hype.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.812667', 1, 203, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1261, '[Shrey Saraf] Best hostel for working men and boys in South Mumbai.nSpecially for law intern and merchant navy people.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.812784', 5, 203, 4),
(1262, '[Vedic Yadav] A really good hostel with availablility of all the facilities , all you get is quality and great service, You get a great view every evening !', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.812975', 5, 203, 4),
(1263, '[anandha padmanaban] Cheap and best place to live in mumbai..good room maintenance.nice food.safest place. Only demerit is no charging socket in room. Charging is done only in the reception', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.813096', 4, 203, 4),
(1264, '[SHARON GOODWIN] Best place. Can''t describe it by words.  I have lots of memories here . Amazing facilities and accommodation. Actual home away from home', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.834389', 5, 204, 4),
(1265, '[Jerin Joy] Boys hostel with all basic facilities. Located on the main road besides Girgaon Chowpatty, opposite Wilson college.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.834523', 4, 204, 4),
(1266, '[Jubin Varughese] This building have  guest rooms, Party hall room and boys hostel with mess.  Heritage Building , but in terms of cleanliness, it''s not up to the mark', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.834646', 4, 204, 4),
(1267, '[Shweta Gupta] I hosted my daughter 8th birthday party here.nWhile the place is beautiful but toilets are non usable. Please be aware of belownAbhishekh and Bunty apparently the coordinators are highly non responsivenI kept calling them and asking for details, which were left untold up until the payment timenThere were hidden charges in final bill, which were never informed or spoken about Parking and cleaningnFurther they had agreed to arrange chairs and table for me with the rate shared. In the finall bill there was another 1200 rs charged for clothes and tempo, which again was never informednOverall complete lack of professionalism.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.834846', 1, 204, 4),
(1268, '[Srinath Shenoy] Ideal place to arrange small to medium scale wedding.. Public Parking available behind the hall. Toilets need a good housekeeping. Toilets are dirty and not well maintained.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.834974', 3, 204, 4),
(1269, '[Vish Beeput] I stayed in this monumental type building in 1979- 1981.nI am from Durban, South Africa and my stay in this hostel has been such a pleasure and the experience was one to behold. Chowpatty beach made me feel at home and the marine parade was indeed scenic.nThe boys were very friendly and we got along well all the time.What a great experience.nWhen I visit Mumbai, a drive to the hostel is a must.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.835103', 5, 204, 4),
(1270, '[Corn Jacknife] Poor service, no reverence for the inmates, bad quality food, not so nicely managed. Value for money but no peace of mind. Toilets not well maintained. Be here only if you have no options.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.835224', 1, 204, 4),
(1271, '[MR.PARMAR] Great old structure from British era. available for wedding, birthday parties or any sort of event with full catering, decoration, and good lightings.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.835349', 5, 204, 4),
(1272, '[Dr.Ghanshyam Deshmukh] Kindly request to warden and samajkalyan ministry plz update the hostel facility .Be perfect best quality food , warden is most important for betterment of students.nStop illegal stay to studentsnKeep maintain hygeine cleanliness.Best quality food important .nStudy atmosphere also needed.hostel in such big city like mumbai play very very important role in the life of poor students education.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.854548', 5, 205, 4),
(1273, '[Sameer Dhotre] I am new here date of admission:- 04-04-22 and i got no cot now just a place in a room which has 2 students more with me total 3 students in a room. Food is good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.854684', 3, 205, 4),
(1274, '[Arun Siral patil] What is criteria for selection for hostel I am sebc category students', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.854896', 4, 205, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1275, U&'[Ravi Mohan Rokade] Located in the middle (South-west) region of Mumbai. As I stay in BDD only.. this is one of oldest buildings in Mumbai which will get \+01f4af years complete in 2024. This building''s are made by British citizen''s as Jail in 1923/24. But still they are in very good condition to stay because Britishers made this building as knowing the jail to catch and detain the people.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.855019', 5, 205, 4),
(1276, '[Saddam Mansuri] One of my friends stays there. Very good rooms with all facilities, those who are coming from outside to Mumbai, and belong to category, then don''t worry apply for this hostel. It is at very prime location. Worli sea face just 10 min walking.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.85516', 5, 205, 4),
(1277, U&'[Kabir Thakare] Illegal students are staying in this hostel u0026 still no one is taking any action.nI guess there''s some corruption that''s why the warden is not taking any action...nu0026 There''s a rule of 3 students in 1 single room but here in my room there are 7 students...nu0026 Also if we compare to BDD 116 govt hostel there''s not cleanliness here in 118... I''m really disappointed \+01f614', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.855279', 1, 205, 4),
(1278, '[VaruN AnanD] BDD Chawl is built by britishers in late 1900..My friend stays here..  the chawl is so strong that you won''t be able to dig a screw by hammer.. you will have tonuse drill machine..nIt is now planned under redevelopment and the owners will get 2 bhk flat in return.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.855416', 3, 205, 4),
(1279, U&'[Manali Tambe] No way of talking to people no matters if the person need some help no one to hear bad quality of people very over smart. Not at all respect for people who came for addmission my experience with my frnd was to toooo bad \+01f44e', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.855535', 1, 205, 4),
(1280, U&'[Ashish Modi] Great PG accommodation at Kalbadevi, Mumbai! \+01f60a The place is clean, comfortable, and well-maintained. The location is super convenient, with plenty of shops and eateries nearby. The owner is really helpful and responsive too! \+01f44d Highly recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.873443', 5, 206, 4),
(1281, '[Aadesh Unde] Very well maintained PG for boys. Cleaning staff, washing machine, water filter for drinking water, 24x7 water supply, AC in each room and many other facilities are provided. Polite and helpful staff, had a great experience staying here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.873668', 5, 206, 4),
(1282, '[konduru Ashish] Yeah it is very good and lot amenities over there including washing machine also along with refrigerator too and be spacious so everyone will be comfortable over there the people are very understanding about our needs', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.873892', 5, 206, 4),
(1283, U&'[Shubham Soni] I had a great experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean, well-ventilated, and furnished with all the basic amenities like a bed, wardrobe, study table, and attached bathroom. The staff is polite and helpful, and the management is responsive to any issues. Food quality is good and hygienic, with both vegetarian and non-vegetarian options available. The environment is peaceful and secure, with CCTV surveillance and regular housekeeping. It\2019s also conveniently located near markets and public transport. Highly recommended for students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.874017', 5, 206, 4),
(1284, U&'[Abhishek joshi] It\2019s a great place to live.nCleanest PG that I have seen in the area.nOwner is also chill and cooperative.nOverall a must try if you are looking for a permanent/temporary accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.874557', 5, 206, 4),
(1285, '[Shubh] The rooms are spacious and clean, along with housekeeping and other useful amenities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.874764', 5, 206, 4),
(1286, '[Digvijay Patil] Great PG if you are looking for a comfortable stay in south bombay. Great for college students and professionals. Owner is chill and gives freedom.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.874957', 5, 206, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1287, '[Sohil] One of the best places to live if you study near Xavier''s. Spacious, mid premium and with full facilities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.87513', 5, 206, 4),
(1288, '[Pranjal Chaudhary] Had a great 3 month stay at this PG. The management is very honest and professional security deposit was refunded on time, and even the rent for 2 extra days was returned when I left early. The food is tasty and homely. Bhai Vikas (manager), Chandan mishra(manager) ,nBharat (cook and caretaker) and his family take care of everyone like their own. Truly a comfortable and trustworthy place to stay. Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.894978', 5, 207, 4),
(1289, '[Harshawardhan Dixit] I am searching for a PG/Flat on rent. In South Mumbai. ready to move Immediately before 8 June.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.895121', 5, 207, 4),
(1290, '[Benet Raj] Myself Benet Rajadurai, I have stayed in this dormitory for 6 months. This is the beautiful place to stay at an affordable price including breakfast. Management is Really good and they rectify all our needs immediately without fail. Sincere thanks to Chanda Madam and Goldie Sir ji. Another Important renowned person is Mr Bharat, a good care taker. I will give 100% surety for this dormitory which is highly safe u0026 Secure.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.895255', 5, 207, 4),
(1291, '[Shantanu Patle] How to contact you sir i want to stay here frm 23 to 26 march', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.895384', 5, 207, 4),
(1292, '[RANOK DEY] What''s the monthly rent in the one in fort area?', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.89553', 5, 207, 4),
(1293, '[Dhruv Singh sikarwar] Due to misinformation from their part got scammed of 3k.nWhich conveniently so is a non refundable amount (check your brochures before replying, no one ASSUMED nothing)', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.895658', 1, 207, 4),
(1294, '[Tammy Khan] The place is good to stay, but the manager did not give bed even after having it. Reason known to him, extremist, racist. I don''t know. Bad experience for me.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.895785', 1, 207, 4),
(1295, '[Tokupu Ayemi] Im looking for PG and i wanna know ur price.nnMy budget is 5k', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.895921', 5, 207, 4),
(1296, U&'[Gaurav Yadav] I had a great experience staying at this boys\2019 PG. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and very comfortable. The food quality is also really good and hygienic. The management is friendly and always helpful whenever anything is needed. The environment is peaceful and perfectnfor students or working professionals. Overall, it\2019s an excellent place to stay and I would highly recommend it to anyone looking for a good boys\2019 PG accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.915355', 4, 208, 4),
(1297, U&'[Kabir] pretty good hostel dude. nice and clean rooms, with a lounging area on every floor with a tv too. the location is close to my college and the people I\2019ve met are very cool.nyo I think you should check it out it\2019s worth the price', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.915504', 5, 208, 4),
(1298, '[Tejas Parakh] The rooms are comfortable and up to the mark. The facility is generally well managed and the people I''ve met here are great. Overall, good hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.91564', 4, 208, 4),
(1299, U&'[Falak] Great experience staying here! The rooms are clean, the staff is very helpful, and the atmosphere is friendly. Perfect for students \2014 good study areas and reliable Wi-Fi. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.915773', 5, 208, 4),
(1300, '[Vaibhav shah] The amenities here are crazy good. The gym equipment are well maintained. The beds are very comfy and the services are well maintained too and also up to the date.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.915905', 5, 208, 4),
(1301, '[Aarush Mandoth] Good common areas and prime location. Good amenities for entertainment and I have enjoyed my time here', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.916032', 4, 208, 4),
(1302, U&'[Om Kankaria] Nice hostel good staynThe food is nice and rooms are also spacious. Overall good \+01f44d\+01f3fb', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.916161', 5, 208, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1303, '[Rajveer Singh] nice hostel with spacious rooms. good ambiance and kind staff', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.916358', 5, 208, 4),
(1304, '[romir wani] Good location and food. Very affordable and nice. The staff here is also very nice', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.934084', 5, 209, 4),
(1305, '[Nihar] Anand by Student Housing is a great place for students in Juhu. The rooms are comfortable and well maintained, and having a gym inside the hostel makes it really convenient. The dining facility is a big plus, meals are good quality.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.934222', 5, 209, 4),
(1306, U&'[Tanishq Baid] It\2019s very close to the iskon temple, which is very convenient. It has an overall homely feel to it which mass of easier to live in a new city. The crowd is good, made many friends here. nice hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.934352', 5, 209, 4),
(1307, '[Mr u0026 Mrs Sane] There''s Dakshinayan, a restaurant that has a great menu Ghee Idly, in this building.nThis is bang Opposite to the ISKCON TEMPLE at Juhu.nMust visit asap.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.934528', 5, 209, 4),
(1308, '[Abaan Safeer] This Pg is at a great location , close to good places n staff is responsive but only problem is the food sometimes, but still manageable . 2 km from nmims / mithibai college and close to Juhu circle', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.934655', 4, 209, 4),
(1309, '[Raghav Jain] Good good and nice location. Close to iskon and the beach. I would recommend this hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.934781', 5, 209, 4),
(1310, '[Akshay Jadhav] Houses students of NMIMS Deemed-to-be-University as well as travelling devotees of Iskcon temple. Situated at a walking distance from Juhu beach, but is 2.5 kms from actual University. One can get rooms on a double, triple, quadruple sharing basis. Attached bathrooms available for all rooms. Common washing machine and drinking water cooler on all floors. The terrace has an open-air dining area and a quaint gym with full body workout equipment and weights, but no treadmill. Gym charges extra.nRooms are cozy, tightly spaced with suitable beds and roomy cupboards. However, there''s no individual desk area for studying.nOverall, worth it if you dream of staying close to the beach like Juhu''s elite.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.934901', 4, 209, 4),
(1311, '[Jeevan Pradhan] The place is OK basic amminities like towels and drinking water is not available, even if drinking water is available they refill the water bottle with not so clean water. Bathroom and toilet is very dirty. Rooms are small but cosy but yet not price efficient', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.935028', 3, 209, 4),
(1312, '[Kushal Sarda] One of the best boys hostel in mumbai, perfect location, good staff, Wi-Fi facility, library, great in cleanliness. If you are getting admission to this hostel do not i repeat do not leave this opportunity. This all facilities are provided in an affordable price.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.956092', 5, 210, 4),
(1313, '[Plan My Study] The best place in Dadar as Hostel. My son is experiencing the net and cleanliness. Very affordable in aplace like Dadar, Mumbai , well maintained place, food is also nice , management taking good care of boys , they also provide scholarships according to scores of students but very limited seats, getting admissions is challenging here', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.956399', 5, 210, 4),
(1314, '[Bharat] Can anyone share me contact details of mvbs boys hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.956726', 4, 210, 4),
(1315, '[Utpak Pankhania] Perfect place for non-local students coming to Mumbai for studynManagement - Huge scope for improvement by involving students in the operations processnHighly discplined place,  all necessary facilties available', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.956881', 3, 210, 4),
(1316, '[Shail Chavda] Amazing facilities! The staff is cooperative and helps us. The food served here is amazing and the hygiene and cleanliness is maintained. Indoor sports and wifi facilities are also available here!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.957028', 5, 210, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1317, '[Jagrit Acharya] One of the best hostel of Bombay with dam good facilities,great location, friendly and cooperative staff members..... simple amazing place', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.95726', 5, 210, 4),
(1318, '[Rahul Kumar Sha] What is the per year fees for a student who is outside from Maharashtra in 2025 ?', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.957883', 3, 210, 4),
(1319, '[MVBSDadar Boarding School] THIS IS A BOYS HOSTEL FOR 18 TO 25 YEARS OF BOYS RESIDING OUTSIDE MUMBAI BUT WHO CAME FOR STUDIES IN MUMBAI. KINDLY DONT CALL FOR BOARDING SCHOOL ENQUIRIES. - STAFF', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.958037', 5, 210, 4),
(1320, U&'[Harsh Tanna] Very disappoin experience at Town Hostel Santacruz, Mumbai.nnI checked in after booking 3 beds for 2 days, and the hostel did not meet even basic cleanliness and safety standards.nnThe luggage storage area is extremely dirty and looks like it hasn\2019t been cleaned for a long time. They don\2019t provide locks, and one of the storage drawers doesn\2019t even have a hook to attach your own lock, making it impossible to secure your belongings. Despite booking 3 beds, we were given only 2 storage drawers, which is very inconvenient.nnThe reception area was also unhygienic\2014I even saw mice roaming around, which was shocking and raised serious concerns about the hostel\2019s cleanliness.nnThe dormitory itself is not well maintained, and many guests leave the common area messy. While that may not be entirely the hostel\2019s fault, the staff should ensure the shared spaces are cleaned regularly.nnThe biggest issue was the bed. When I returned at night to sleep, I found that the bedsheets were dirty and appeared not to have been properly washed. I also found bed bugs on my bed. I informed the staff, and they offered me another bed, but I found bed bugs there as well.nnBecause of this, I was unable to sleep the entire night. This was one of the worst hostel experiences I\2019ve had. Cleanliness, hygiene, and guest safety should be the top priority, but unfortunately that was not my experience here.nnI would not recommend staying here unless these issues are properly addressed.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.977971', 1, 211, 4),
(1321, '[Tejeshswar Taning] This is the best and most affordable hostel for working men. The staff is very honest and welcoming. The beds are clean and homely.nRecently I moved to Mumbai after getting job. I paid full 1 month amount for stay. Unfortunately my job appointment got cancelled. I requested for the refund as I was leaving. The management returned my total amount. I thank xavier sir for helping me out. I thank xavier sir and the hostel management for prompt response.nI recommend people to choose Town hostel for staying. It is trustworthy and reliable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.978161', 5, 211, 4),
(1322, '[Odyssey816129] The hotel was really nice one due to the very good service from the staff who are very good and professional. The front desk staff are good and take care to see that you will not have any inconvenience. Also food is goid', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.978291', 0, 211, 4),
(1323, '[GOVIND PREM] I am disappointed to report that I was unable to sleep due to a severe bed bug issue in my room. Although the housekeeping team keeps the premises visibly neat and clean, pest management is a critical standard that was missed. I informed the room attendant, who promised to escalate the issue. I hope this is addressed immediately, but I regretfully will not be booking a stay here again.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.978418', 1, 211, 4),
(1324, '[Simran Preet Singh Jawa] I am amazed by the kind of rooms and the service the hotel provides for the money they charge. I booked a deluxe room for 2 and it costed me around 2k rupees. The rooms and bathrooms  were clean, the staff was responsive, the hotel is located at a nice place, close to the airport. Great for short stays', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.979055', 5, 211, 4),
(1325, '[Girish Kumbhar] Four of us stayed here ,very happy with a clean n neat dormitory, staff is very co operative as we had forgotten our steel  lunch box which was returned to us today thank you town hostel for a great service .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.979324', 5, 211, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1326, '[Amir Segal (Bajol)] Very nice hostel. Great sitting area in the lobby. Good aircondition in rooms, and great owner.nnAlthough A toilet paper could be nice to have.nAnd, better rooftop area. (Although they do have some chairs)', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.979453', 5, 211, 4),
(1327, '[Shiva Teli] Very nice well maintained place , economical pricing , filtered drinking water facility, good clean washrooms , two of us enjoyed our stay thank you town hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:02.979591', 5, 211, 4),
(1328, U&'[RAJESH MURUGAN] Worst experience ever regarding the security deposit refund. It has been almost a year, and they still have not refunded my amount of around \20b940,000. Despite multiple follow-ups, they are now asking me to pay extra, which is unacceptable. They have completely failed to refund the security deposit. To students joining NMIMS, I would not recommend this based on my experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.004988', 1, 212, 4),
(1329, '[Amitabh Sinha] Terrible management. It opened in Dec 2021 and my son stayed till June 2022 and most of the facilities were not properly available like WiFi and pantry in floors. They are also a big cheat - they never paid back security deposit in spite of filling refund forms and numerous email reminders. Should not trust this company.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.005367', 1, 212, 4),
(1330, '[Queen Khan] The staff ensures that the washrooms are very hygienic at all times which is a massive plus point.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.005596', 5, 212, 4),
(1331, '[Climax studio] The staff properly cleans the hostel on a very regular basis.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.005795', 5, 212, 4),
(1332, '[Rohit] The staff properly cleans the hostel on a very regular basis.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.006006', 5, 212, 4),
(1333, '[Ailip Doshi] As per the Hotel Management the Boy''s Hostel has shut down... It''s converted back to Hotel space...', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.006169', 3, 212, 4),
(1334, '[RAVI SINGH] Very good location and nice property.very good service and cleaning..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.006319', 5, 212, 4),
(1335, '[Akansha Dixit] The staff properly cleans the hostel on a very regular basis.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.006448', 5, 212, 4),
(1336, '[Gaurav Sathe] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.026975', 5, 213, 4),
(1337, '[Subhash Labana] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.048342', 5, 214, 4),
(1338, '[Daksh Jiya] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.048797', 4, 214, 4),
(1339, '[Md Alam] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.049243', 5, 214, 4),
(1340, '[Radesh Shyam] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.049487', 5, 214, 4),
(1341, '[Bharti Nikam] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.04962', 5, 214, 4),
(1342, '[Pranjal Bobade] The hostel is like Hell.nHostel Management does not return your deposit money.nThey will tell you a bloody reasons and keep your money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.073677', 1, 215, 4),
(1343, '[Shubham Mansing Chavhan] Best boys hotel in bandra east, hostel faculty is like family,nHostel student get Special Concession for Gym u0026 Mess.nBest in Bandra East', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.07401', 5, 215, 4),
(1344, '[Rahul] 4 people in one room very consistentnRent is very highnDirty place lost of  mosquito.nManagement is rude and careless.nCan''t study worst place for students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.074293', 1, 215, 4),
(1345, '[DELTACOM D] good kind of hostel staff,cooprative onwer,and ready to help others.just join them.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.074442', 4, 215, 4),
(1346, '[Kuldip Khairnar] Boys hostel... Rate is okk.. good ventilation...', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.074719', 4, 215, 4),
(1347, '[Mayrya Patil] Not bad', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.074869', 3, 215, 4),
(1348, '[Shubham Yadav] The hostel is best in this price.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.075003', 3, 215, 4),
(1349, '[MADHAV DHAKAL] Good place for both students and employees.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.075142', 5, 215, 4),
(1350, U&'[Ashwath Katla] I\2019m beyond frustrated with the way Your Space has handled my security deposit. It\2019s been [insert time duration] since I vacated the property, and there\2019s been ZERO action or transparency about my \20b945,000 refund. Endless follow-ups, empty promises, and absolutely no accountability.nnThis is nothing short of unprofessional and borderline unethical. You\2019re quick to take the money but disappear when it\2019s time to return it. Is this how you treat your tenants?nnIf you don\2019t want your money held hostage, avoid this place at all costs. I\2019m escalating this legally and making sure others don\2019t fall into the same trap. Enough is enough.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.0996', 1, 216, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1351, U&'[Shrey Patel] Worst hostel ever!!! Please don\2019t stay here,I am not even exaggerating at this point. I stayed just for 3 months and saw the reality. First of all it has been 6 months since I left it for a much better place and they still haven\2019t refunded my security deposit. Do they guys even know the meaning of security deposit, it has to be refunded once the contract is over. Absolute worst experience, my washroom\2019s basin sink fell in the middle of night and marble was all over the floor, it took them 10 days to fix it. My whole floor was flooded with a water leakage and my charger got damaged, the lights of the room are controlled from other room and only one wall plug was working for 2 people. I have called customer care multiple times but the complaint department does not answer and booking department answers the phone and assures callback but never does. The managers of the property have stopped picking up my calls and the wifi service that they are proud of is absolute garbage , it takes years to load something and connection is poor.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.099753', 1, 216, 4),
(1352, U&'[Daksh Jain] My experience at this facility has been extremely disappointing. The quality of the food is unacceptable and almost inedible. Despite paying \20b960,000, the promised facilities are not provided. The rooms are poorly equipped and lack even basic necessities such as a study table. Furthermore, the staff remains unresponsive, showing no initiative to address repeated complaints. It appears that the management is only interested in collecting fees while neglecting the well-being and concerns of the residents.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.099917', 1, 216, 4),
(1353, '[KUNAL PUNJABI] Yourspace doesn''t refund security deposit. It has been more than 4 months and I haven''t received my deposit. Everytime I follow up, I am asked to wait for 15 days. It is highly frustrating asking for refund of the money.nIf you don''t want your money to get stuck and beg for it later, please avoid this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.100064', 1, 216, 4),
(1354, '[swarup sonaknaware] I see a lot of negative reviews, and unsatisfactory reviews about this pg, but believe me they are 100% transparent about everything.nI stayed here for almost an year, and I am grateful for every single individual, I met at this amazing place.nThe Property Manager, Mr. Sameer Khedekar, is an honest, accountable and a gem of a person.nMr. Nilesh Purbiya is genuinely the most cool man, I''ve ever met. They have consistently resolved every maintenance issue, query, or problem.nThe housekeeping staff is very understanding and hardworking.nFirst year in this city, and couldn''t have asked for better people. I am forever indebted to you.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.100221', 5, 216, 4),
(1355, '[Anita Bangar] Pathetic, big time liersnDon''t fall into their sweet promises. Kids will not be in safe hands for sure.nnMy son was in this hostel for 11 months in 2023... They haven''t returned our deposit amount yet.nThey never serve quality food.. sometimes they serve food with fungus!!!!!.. my kids jacket, shoes and many items got stolen from his locked room/ cupboard!!!... Not at all a safe place. I want to give them negative marking but no option available hence gave 1 star ...nDO NOT PUT YOUR KID HERE', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.10035', 1, 216, 4),
(1356, U&'[Dushyant Bafna] FAKE REVIEWS- DONT FALL FOR THEIR SWEET TRAPnnThey are BIG TIME liars. ALMOST ALL of these positive reviews are FAKE REVIEWS. Some of these reviews are directly from their staff and interns. And they are making students post fake reviews in exchange for wifi password.nnWe are from UP. and my nephew used to live in Your Space\2019s Juhu Property. After 2 months, WITHOUT ANY NOTICE, they abruptly closed the property and REFUSED any refund. They shifted everyone to YOUR SPACE JVPD ANUGRAHA PG. during kids mid term exams without any notice.nnTHEY DONT EVEN GIVE KEYS TO THE ROOMS!!nThis is the only pg i have seen where you arent given key to the door.nMy nephew had to go to college without locking his door.nnTheir 2-sharing room is actually 4-sharing. (And even then the wall is fake with a gap near the curtains, so technically 8 people).nnThe food is pathetic.. HORRIBLE. Many people fell sick.nnPLEASE PLEASE DONT GO FOR THIS PG IF YOU DONT WANT TO REGRET.nDONT VISIT THIS PG, ITS WASTE OF TIME.nn(Update: For refund, they ask u to contact their customer care number, which they never answer, or veryyy rarely answer)', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.100476', 1, 216, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1357, U&'[Madhav Vakharia] I am post graduate student. I would recommend not to come YourSpace. Throughout my journey of 2 years, I have faced multiple problems and here the pros and cons:nnPros:nThe property is comparatively new, hence the infrastructure and furniture inside is good which makes it a good and comfortable to stay.nnCons:n1. The food services have been disgusting. We have been found fungus on breads, ants in rice. There are way too much hygiene issues. There are high possibility of your child being ill. The sales team will give you false expectations. Please don\2019t fall in there trap.n2. The infrastructure of room is in such a way that every 4 students have to share a single washroom which makes it difficult to stay, freshers have same timings so.n3. They will take security deposit, which they will promise to return at the end of your contract but, the reality is that you will never get the exact amount. They have hidden charges which they wont convey at the start. You will the get the deposit after 60 working days of your last day.nnThe struggle is real. My stay have been completed unsatisfactory. And I wish my juniors don\2019t stuggle with these issues, hence I am taking efforts to provide you a genuine issue.nnWish you a good luck!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.100616', 1, 216, 4),
(1358, '[Eddy Lrda] Very bad exp.i had  i called them before leaving Goa and they told me bed is available..so after climbing the stairs with my heavy bag the guy in the reception is telling me that he got no bed...i mean u should have informed properly about your property and its a vefy unprofessional manner by your receptionist and please teached him hoe to speak nicely...won''t come back again...seems like you guys are action u have the only hotel,dorms in the area....', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.126322', 1, 217, 4),
(1359, '[GS24 Interio] Very dirty place.  Never visit.  You are coming here for relaxing and what you get the bed bugs..... If any one needs the bedbugs place then you can visit here it''s fully loaded with bed bugs. Your hole night will be spent with hunting the bedbugs.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.126475', 1, 217, 4),
(1360, '[shardul17] we had to stay overnight in colaba, so we searched for dormitaries in mumbai. we found this hostel. its good for stay overnight at very cheap rate.. air condition facility is available frm 10pm to 5 am.   comparatively clean toilets and bathroom. clean linen and beddings,   no smell so reasonable stay.|only thing is receptiin guy dont run water pressure motor in night so very loow pressure water in washrooms so problem with flush. if you face this problem you hv to ask him twice thrice to start d motor pump.. then water runs with force..||cons: hostel is at 4th floor with no lift and height of stories is equal to 6 .||but same owner has good place called regal plaza in same building 1st floor.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.126597', 0, 217, 4),
(1361, '[Aniket Pawar] My stay here was very pleasant and i had great memories here along with that i made many new friends. And all the staff is really cooperative and helpful. They made great quality and tasty food and serve with a smile which makes this stay beyond expectations.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.126731', 5, 217, 4),
(1362, '[Prasad Tulaskar] Bed bugs!!!!!! Like you will lost count of them... It''s that bad.nnWorst hostel ever ... I can write everything about it which was wrong. Starting from the care taker to the sheets full of bed bugs. And also it''s on the fourth floor without any lift.nnI tried informing about it to the caretaker but he didn''t care to even give me a different bedsheet.nnIt''s full of cockroaches,bedbugs and unhygienic.nI''m still recovering from rashes all over my body.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.126861', 1, 217, 4),
(1363, '[Rohit] They cancelled my online booking of single room u0026 then offered single bed in dormitory which I had to take bcoz of paucity of time.nPros-n1) cheapest raten2) nice locality (gateway of India u0026 hotel Taj  within 5 min walking distance)nCons-n1) on 4th floor. NO ELEVATOR. You will curse your decision to book here every time while climbing those stairs.n2) water shortage after 10 am. Out of 3 available only 1 decent bathroom.n3) NO AC DURING DAY. AC time- 10 pm- 6 am. You just can''t stay there during day.n4)they can u0026 they will cancel your online booking if they have customer infront of them paying in cash.nnBook only if you are looking for cheap single night stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.126998', 2, 217, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1364, '[Syed Shajan Ahamed] It''s located at 4th floornFor Dormitory 400 rupees per daynSingle private room 800 rupees per daynCommon toilet', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.127123', 3, 217, 4),
(1365, '[Mc Gines] Very small and crowded dormitory. Seeing that it did not met our expectations, my friends and I tried to cancel our booking, but the receptionist refused point blank to give us or passport back (I guess he was trying to retain us). Ultimately (5-10min of heated discussion + call to a manager that was not helpful at all) he gave our passports back.nI do not recommend this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.12732', 1, 217, 4),
(1366, '[Mithilesh Kore] My security deposit has not been returned it has been more than three months till now no response from your side . While collecting money, your team had no hesitation in repeatedly and aggressively following up. However, when it comes to refunding the deposit, calls are ignored and communication is blocked despite multiple attempts to contact you. This conduct is unacceptable, and the quality of service provided was also sub-standard.nnKindly return my deposit immediately, failing which I will be compelled to initiate legal action.n@yourspace', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.148299', 1, 218, 4),
(1367, '[Samarth Sharma] Deposit hasnt been returned since 3 months. When they want money they cross all lines of dignity and beg for it aggressively but when they have to pay the deposit back they block and ignore you despite calling multiple times. sadakchap business to loot people and even the service is sub par. RETURN MY DEPOSIT ASAP OR I WILL BE PURSUING LEGAL ACTION @yourspace.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.148451', 1, 218, 4),
(1368, '[Event Today] Good and safe place to stay at Lamington Road. Supportive staff, clean rooms, and a friendly environment. Overall, a comfortable and reliable hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.148581', 4, 218, 4),
(1369, '[Souparna Sarkhel] It''s a real scam. They have not processed refund even after 2 years. Please avoid', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.148709', 1, 218, 4),
(1370, '[Sabari Manikandan] How do I contact you for room booking ?nNo is answering the call', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.148846', 5, 218, 4),
(1371, '[Soham Kasturi] They pick up the call and then no one answers', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.148969', 1, 218, 4),
(1372, '[sunilgowda11] No response', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.149243', 1, 218, 4),
(1373, '[Nivesh Khabia] If we call they pickup and the cut the call worst service', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.14937', 1, 218, 4),
(1374, '[harshit patwary] Owner Ayush is very rude. They resolve issues after 10 days of constant requesting and fix it for 2 days then things are back to normal. Cockroaches roam around everywhere and they give you are hard time while returning security deposit and now are demanding 10 cheques of instalments before hand while u still have to pay through UPI. Our manager was changed 4 times and there was no manager for 1.5 months this place is a big mess', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.173795', 1, 219, 4),
(1375, U&'[Aryan Khandelwal] This one star is only because the food was good and warden was cooperative.nOtherwise,nThere was no high speed wifi. The maximum speed it gave was upto 20-30mbps and that too only during day. At night wifi doesn\2019t work.nGym doesn\2019t deserve to be called a gym as there was only one equipment.nGame room had a mini table tennis table and a small pool table for a 10 year old kid, where most of the time the workers slept.nInstead of wall there was POP sheets which had cracks and was coming out.nThere was no proper drain cover in the washroom, it was open from insects came.nThe coffee machine was not properly cleaned, there were insects from it.nThe laundry service ruined my clothes and wrote room number on every T-shirt with permanent marker.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.173943', 1, 219, 4),
(1376, U&'[Neev Advani] Great facilities and amazing food. They\2019ve even got friendly staff who help you out in every situation. They even have a comfortable mattress and the rooms are very clean\+01f60d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.174076', 5, 219, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1377, '[Prathamesh Deshpande] Very lively experience. Food is good. Better than the most. The staff is friendly. Staff is friendly and I had no issues with anyone whatsoever. Hygeine is also maintained. A big thumbs up from my side', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.174214', 5, 219, 4),
(1378, '[shitij mittal] Comfortable place with twin and three sharing AC equipped rooms available. All meals provided, free laundry, gym, playroom, terrace, lift. Just quite pricey but for all these facilities in mumbai its ok.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.174464', 5, 219, 4),
(1379, '[Tirthesh Patil] Nice place to stay with good facilities. No complaints in terms of hygiene or food quality and taste. Friendly staff.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.174659', 5, 219, 4),
(1380, '[Tanishk Sharma] property''s ambience is very good.....food is genuinely very good...no compromise on qualitynThe staff is very helpful and cooperative.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.174789', 5, 219, 4),
(1381, '[Dhruv Kataria] It is not what it looks like in the photosnFood is very disgusting. No hygiene.nVery bad service. All the 5 star reviews are fake.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.174908', 1, 219, 4),
(1382, '[Dorothy Gomes] One of the best girls'' hostels in Mumbai. The rooms are spacious, clean and well-maintained and the entire place is very well organised. From meals and housekeeping to security and daily essentials, everything is taken care of, making it easy to settle in and focus on studies. Highly recommended for students and working women looking for a safe and comfortable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.249595', 5, 222, 4),
(1383, U&'[Tiger] The sushi-making workshop at our hostel was such an incredible experience! \+01f363 From learning the art of rolling sushi to sharing laughs over our creative (and sometimes funny) attempts, it was an evening full of fun, flavor, and bonding. Events like these truly make hostel life so much more lively and memorable \2014 bringing everyone together, breaking the routine, and creating moments we\2019ll always cherish. Each workshop adds something new to our days \2014 whether it\2019s food, creativity, or just good vibes. Huge thanks to the organizers for making hostel life feel like a community full of joy, learning, and connection! \+01f338\2728', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.249842', 5, 222, 4),
(1384, '[Prachi Jain] One of the best accommodation for girls and working women..something which Mumbai has been missing till date. State of the art facility. Awesome place for students. The vibe is just awesome..Just recommend to every girl who is looking for hostel in Mumbai.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.249974', 5, 222, 4),
(1385, U&'[Rithya jain] This place feels like homenIt has changed my perceptions of hostelsnAfter a long exhausting day, the feeling of coming to this place have their amazing food and all their amenities, the stress free feeling and the assurance of safety which they give to you and your family is just impeccable \+01f497nA thousand percent recommendable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.25011', 5, 222, 4),
(1386, U&'[Dilshad Hajiyani] Very beautiful place an safe an hygiene..staff is also very caring an kind main thing food was very tasty\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.250241', 5, 222, 4),
(1387, U&'[Siddanth Satish] Unprofessional\2026. Ac doesnt work bombay heat cant survive. Struggling after paying lakhs, unprofessional admin and staff', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.250383', 1, 222, 4),
(1388, U&'[Jinalee singhai] On 24th August, I paid \20b991,000 to Witty Hostel\2014\20b950,000 as a refundable security deposit and \20b941,000 as 20% of the 6-month accommodation fee (\20b92,05,000).n*Witty* As a renowned institution among the Jain community and strong JITO Influence we were expecting some reasonable response but it is a matter of great sorrow even after informing we could get  highly unprofessional behaviour by the administrative staff during our visit on 26th August, I chose to cancel the booking immediately.As given feedback and several Mail and telephone calls with office  and long discussion and given some  feedback  with Ms. Preksha, \20b941,000 was refunded, but the \20b950,000 refundable security deposit remains unpaid.nnAs my daughter never checked in or used any services, and the payment was for accommodation, not hostel fees, the hostel\2019s cancellation policy does not applicable on it as I understand.They are highly unprofessional and money minded group.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.250504', 1, 222, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1389, U&'[ANURAG SINGHAI] Worst Hostel Experience \2013 Would Never RecommendnnMy experience with this hostel has been extremely disappointing and distressing. The unethical, unprofessional, and inhumane behavior of the female administrative staff during a pre-booking visit with my mother compelled me to cancel my stay, despite having initially booked the hostel for six months.nnI had paid 20% of the accommodation charges along with a \20b950,000 refundable security deposit. However, upon requesting a refund after canceling my booking due to the unpleasant and unacceptable conduct of the staff, I was shocked to find that they had arbitrarily forfeited the \20b950,000 deposit\2014falsely claiming it to be part of the hostel fees.nnThe invoice clearly indicates that the amount paid was towards accommodation charges, which explicitly included a refundable security deposit. Yet, I was refunded only \20b941,000 after so many calls u0026 mails, without any proper explanation or transparency .nnThe management appears to be indifferent to the mistreatment faced by potential residents and blindly adheres to rigid policies instead of addressing legitimate concerns or upholding basic decency and fairness.nnI would strongly advise others to think twice before considering this hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.250623', 1, 222, 4),
(1390, U&'[Sugantha Malar] I enjoyed my stay at this hostel. The rooms were clean, housekeeping was done daily, and washroom was allotted for each room. The hostel felt very safe with thumbprint access, and the staff were always quick to resolve any issues. Wi-Fi, 24/7 water and electricity, washing machines, and a common kitchen with a fridge made the stay very comfortable. Food and parcel deliveries are also allowed\2014you can easily collect them from the reception once they arrive. Daily attendance is taken at night, and if you''re going to be late, you simply need to inform the management in advance. It is right near the govandi railway station, if you''re someone who travel by train everyday. I would definitely recommend this place to anyone looking for a safe and comfortable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.273198', 5, 223, 4),
(1391, U&'[Rucha Palwe] A Comfortable and Homely Stay \2014 1 Year at Nidhaan Nest, GovandinnHaving stayed at Nidhaan Nest in Govandi for a full year, I can confidently say it has been a pleasant and comfortable experience overall. The property offers a well-maintained living space that genuinely feels like a home away from home.nnAccommodation u0026 Cleanliness: The rooms are spacious enough for daily living, kept clean, and well-ventilated. The management ensures the common areas are tidy and hygienic on a regular basis.nnLocation: Govandi is a practical locality with decent connectivity to other parts of Mumbai. Daily essentials \2014 grocery stores, medical shops, eateries \2014 are easily accessible within the vicinity.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.273341', 5, 223, 4),
(1392, '[Dr Sujatha Krishnamurthy] Nidhaan Nest hostel for girls is a good hostel for vegetarians with neat, clean, well kept and well maintained ambience. The most convenient hostel for my daughter. It is a facility where one can straight away move in. It provides all facilities like AC, Washing machine, Fridge, Wi-fi, kitchen with Water purifier. Rooms look so elegant with very well planned storage spaces. The three stage electronic security system ensures safety to inmates and solace to the parents. In and around TISS, Chembur, Govandi, Deonar area we found Nidhaan a very good hostel option for strict vegetarian girls.nAlso, if there are any issues or problems with regard to any fecilities, Management u0026 staff attend to it immediately u0026 resolve the issues at the earliest.nFurther, the money transactions like payment of rent, refundable deposit is very transparent u0026 clear.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.273486', 5, 223, 4),
(1393, U&'[Shrilaxmi mkattimani] I stayed at Nidhaan Nest for 3 months during my project in Mumbai, and it was a wonderful experience. The hostel provided a safe, clean, and comfortable environment throughout my stay. The staff was supportive, and the facilities were well maintained. Being away from home can be challenging, but Nidhaan Nest truly felt like a home away from home. Thank you for making my stay pleasant and memorable. Highly recommended for students and working women! \+01f917\2728', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.27361', 5, 223, 4);          
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1394, U&'[Echinocrypt Solutions] I wanted to leave the hostel and then leave a review. I\2019ve left a positive review on their post it because I wanted a smooth exit process without any drama.nnThe warden of this hostel comments on girl\2019s clothes. She tells grown adult women that they shouldn\2019t wear shorts. I\2019ve also heard that she makes the guards take pictures of girls, even if outside the PG. She has taken pictures of girls outside the PG and has threatened to send them to their parents. She has also asked guards to follow the girls outside the PG if a male friend has visited them. What grown adult women do, especially outside the PG is none of your business. this is such cheap behaviour. your job is to make sure rules are followed within the PG. Stop infantilising adult women. My living experience in Mumbai had been single handedly ruined by this hostel. they also barge into your room without any notice. they take attendance at night at 10 30, 10 45. they constantly provide an unsafe environment and repeatedly say \201cwe do this for your safety\201d - while it\2019s just a mechanism of body surveillance and moral policing. they have separate rules for college going women and working women even if they are the same age, which is illogical. they wanted grown adult women doing their master\2019s to send an email from their parent\2019s account if they were going out after a certain time. and this is because they think they are accountable if something happens to us. i hate to break it to them but dangerous things happen to women even in broad daylight. Adult women are mature enough to go out responsibly. over time they began treating this hostel more like an institution than an accomadation. which is not how they make it appear at the time of admission. even college hostels don\2019t have such ridiculous rules.nnThey had fungus growing in their walls and their fix was to \201cpaint\201d the walls - which does not make it better.nnIf you are a parent who loves their child or someone who is considering this place for accommodation, I strongly advice you not to. Further, if you\2019re someone who is already struggling with mental health issues please stay away from the premises of this hostel because it will only deteriorate it as they\2019ll give you new problems everyday. they\2019ll suddenly stop butter in the cafeteria, change the menu from veg to jain, make ID cards, change rent rules and what not.work/college is already stressful but this place makes it worse for you.nnA year ago when I wanted to see the warden they told me i could meet them in the 1st floor, and when i arrived at their office, i saw a room full of random people (both men and women) working. who were these people? what were they doing in a girls hostel?nnEven the security guards can be very intrusive. They cannot ask questions like \201cwhere are you going\201d.nnI know they might reply to this review by giving an elaborate AI generated rationalisation - which I don\2019t care about. these actions are unjustifiable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.273739', 1, 223, 4),
(1395, U&'[Dr. Ritwika Gupta] Wonderful stay at Nidhaan nest Chembur , during my one month stay I had no prob At all . For working professionals like me this place is a beautiful boon in Mumbai ! You don\2019t need to worry for meals , cleaning , security etcnThank you for the experience!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.273867', 5, 223, 4),
(1396, U&'[Janaki A S] Nidhaan is the best place to stay that I found near the Chembur\2013Govandi side. It is very comfortable and convenient, especially for students and working women. The PG feels safe and secure, and the staff are really helpful. The management is genuine and responds quickly whenever we need any support. They provide good facilities, and the rooms are spacious, clean and well maintained.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.273985', 5, 223, 4),
(1397, '[Shruti Chandalia] I had a really pleasant stay at this hostel. The rooms were clean, well-maintained, and comfortable, making it easy to relax after a long day. The staff was friendly, helpful, and always ready to assist with any queries or needs. The common areas had a great vibe.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.274158', 5, 223, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1398, '[Upwork Ninja] My daughter stayed at this PG for two years, and it was an exceptionally safe and secure experience. Having an all-female management team and staff provided immense comfort and peace of mind while being away from my child. Everything was incredibly well-managed, and the staff was always friendly.nSpecial thanks to Aarti Ji and Shailee for their amazing support!.nHighly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.296206', 5, 224, 4),
(1399, U&'[Vivek Goyal] Heartfelt appreciation to the entire team of Meenakshi Building under the name Wish Hostel for providing such a wonderful hostel environment to my daughter Tanisha Goyal during her 3 years stay in Mumbai.nnAs parents, nothing is more important than safety, care, good atmosphere, and proper food for our daughter living away from home \2014 and we truly experienced all of this here.nnA special thanks to Madam Aarti and Shalley for their personal care, warmth, guidance, and support throughout her journey. They always treated the girls like family, which gave us great peace of mind.nnReally grateful for the love, discipline, comfort, and positive environment provided to all the girls.nWishing all of you continued success and happiness ahead. \+01f64fnnVivek Goyal F / o Tanisha goyal', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.296331', 5, 224, 4),
(1400, U&'[shruti sharma] Staying at WiSH has honestly been one of the best decisions during my college journey. Moving away from home was scary at first, but WiSH never made me feel alone. The environment here is very safe, positive, and homely, which makes it so comfortable for students.nnThe rooms are well-maintained, hygiene is properly taken care of, and the food genuinely feels homemade. It\2019s very rare to find a place where you feel both comfortable and cared for at the same time.nnA special thank you to Shailee di and Aarti Ji for always supporting me throughout my journey at WiSH. Whether it was during difficult days, studies, health issues, or just emotional support, they were always there with understanding and care. Their warmth and guidance made this place feel more like family than just a hostel.nnWhat I love most about WiSH is that every student is treated with genuine care and attention. It truly feels like a second home, and I will always be grateful for the memories, comfort, and support I received here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.296568', 5, 224, 4),
(1401, '[s r] Very safe and homely pgs. It was so comfortable I stayed here in the same room for all 3 years of my graduation. Also recommended to a few friends everyone loved it as well. They help you with all your little problems and the staff here is the best!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.296717', 5, 224, 4),
(1402, U&'[Pooja Gada] Wish Students Accommodation has been a truly wonderful place to stay. The environment is safe, clean, and very comfortable for students, making it feel like a home away from home. The rooms are well-maintained, and the overall atmosphere is peaceful and positive.nnA special mention to Saroj Di and Bharti Di for their constant support and care. Their contribution goes beyond just managing the accommodation \2014 they genuinely look after everyone with motherly warmth. Whether it\2019s checking in on students, helping during difficult days, or simply being there to listen, they make everyone feel cared for and comfortable. Their presence creates a very homely and secure environment for all of us.nnThe friendly atmosphere, supportive management, and well-organized facilities make it easy to adjust and focus on studies while also enjoying hostel life. From small celebrations to everyday conversations, this place helps create beautiful memories.nnHighly recommend Wish Students Accommodation to any student looking for a safe, caring, and comfortable place to stay. Thank you Saroj Di and Bharti Di for your unconditional support and for making this place feel like family. \+01f49b', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.29684', 5, 224, 4),
(1403, '[Tanisha Goyal] Amazing place to stay .Had the best three years here. Great food, excellent facilities, and everything was always up to the mark. It truly felt like a home away from home. Grateful for all the memories made here', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.296974', 5, 224, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1404, U&'[Manju Pitty] The hostel facilities are great. They treat the children like their own too and the food tastes amazing and very yummy. The rooms are also really comfortable and spacious. Over all I''d like to say that the hostel feels a lot like home and my daughter loves her stay. Thank you so much Aarti Didi and Shailee Didi for always supporting my daughter and I.\2764\fe0f\+01f64f\+01f3fb', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.297096', 5, 224, 4),
(1405, '[Savita Raut] Very nice hostel, my daughter stayed here for 3 years and safety was never an issue. They take care of everything, just like home', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.297321', 5, 224, 4),
(1406, U&'[Tanisha Gurubaxani] Very very bad pg for girl the owner there is very bad and rude and the vibe there are very bad n no cleanliness rude behaviour of staff n owner don\2019t even think of going there i only stayed 1month very terrible experience girls don\2019t stay here you will be so upset \+01f92e\+01f92e', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.320488', 1, 225, 4),
(1407, '[husaina barudwala] I have visited this place just a few days back. The place looks exactly how it is in the picture. It has a good vibe. The rooms are neat and clean. They have an accommodation for about 50 girls, it has security cameras and the bus stop is at a walking distance so commuting becomes easier for the girls. But my concern about this place was that the cupboard are on the top floor and the size of it is also very small.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.320624', 4, 225, 4),
(1408, '[Snehal Jadhav] This place is most safe place for girls. The owners take lat of care about safety. I will recommend this place to every girl. The age group is less than 22 and parents are needed for admission. Only femals are allowed to enter to see hostel facilities. Hostel gate is 24 hours locked and managed by security. Female matrons are there to take attendance at night as well as to handle medical problems if any.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.32075', 5, 225, 4),
(1409, '[Janki Shah] I have stayed in this hostel for one year. The owner Sangeeta Aunty and Sanjay Uncle are abit strict but cooperative.nnFirstly, the location is very commutable. They have a bus stop right next to the main hostel gate. It is located on a busy road and auto is also available easily.nnSecondly, the hostel is not that spacious but its clean and safe. They have installed cameras all over the place and security is also maintained at the entry gate. Every room has storage space, bunk beds, a TV and table chairs. The washrooms and bathroom are kept very clean and hygienic. They have a microwave, fridge and washing machine in common on all floors.nnThirdly, the rent. It is expensive as compared to other places but the amenities and location justifies its rent.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.320872', 4, 225, 4),
(1410, '[Nikita Taneja] Horrible experience. The owner Mr Sanjay is very disrespectful and will not solve any issue that female staying there are facing and just reply by saying ''get out of my hostel if you have issues''.nJust money oriented. Water issues specially hot water issues are major.nThey have very compact cabinet like rooms with no place to keep stuff and walk. There is lot of disturbance so no quality sleep for working women wanting to come back from work and get quality sleep.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.32136', 1, 225, 4),
(1411, '[Kalpesh Vasava] This place has the best security. The main gate is managed by guards for 24x7. If inmate wants to go out or enter she has to ask security to unlock the main gate of bungalow. Twenty four hours air conditioning , twenty four hours hot and cold water. Food provided. Strictly vegetarian. Only students are taken.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.321555', 5, 225, 4),
(1412, '[Jignesh Nagodra] Safety standards are high. Discipline is high. All modern amenities including AC. Caring though strict owner. Cost is very justified.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.321996', 5, 225, 4),
(1413, '[Ritik Gupta] Very safe, costs are affordable,security guards, ladies staff, veg only allowed ,washing machine , wi fi , cctv camera , security persons,hot and cold water', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.322138', 5, 225, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1414, U&'[Shruti Agarwal] Horrible people working here. The people who manage this place - they are useless, won\2019t help you in any issues plus one of them is so rude that you can\2019t even talk to her straight. They mismanage everything or rather don\2019t manage anything at all. Till the time you pay money, they\2019ll be very sweet but once you\2019ve paid - don\2019t bother talking to them.nnAnd about the hostel - pathetic and unhygienic to the extent that there are ceilings falling, rats roming around, lift not working, kitchen is not accessible, rooms don\2019t get cleaned despite repeated requests, washrooms are in terrible condition, they\2019re not cleaned when a new person comes in. I think these are enough reasons for anyone to take a decision to not stay with them.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.344729', 1, 226, 4),
(1415, '[Baiju Rajan] Security Deposit is never returned. You will be able to see a quick response below giving a contact number. But the number will never work.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.344861', 1, 226, 4),
(1416, U&'[Riya Dube] Extremely disappointing experience with YourSpace!nI would strongly advise against signing up with them. They have still not refunded my security deposit despite multiple follow-ups. Every time I try to reach out, there\2019s either no response or I get blocked by the concerned person. The service is nothing like what was promised  absolutely unprofessional and unreliable. It feels like a scam, and they show zero accountability once you\2019ve moved out. Please think twice before choosing YourSpace!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.344979', 1, 226, 4),
(1417, '[Aarhi Bora] They scam people. They didn''t give the security deposit back which was around 37K and its not funny. Not only me, But no one has received it. They will fool people saying that once you move out, you will get within 6 months. Its been 1.5years and i have still not got it. Please never trust them and get into this PG please! Also they will give a number where you can call but will never pick up. Hahah lol', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.345414', 1, 226, 4),
(1418, '[Dattatray Hire] Very nice and comfortable stay. Rooms were spacious and clean. Thanks.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.345678', 5, 226, 4),
(1419, '[Shreya Saboo] Pathetic property management. There are rats running all around the hostel, the food is bad, facilities often not functioning. The lift was non-operational for a month and no action was taken despite concerns raised by both residents and their parents. Nobody cares about your issues here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.345822', 1, 226, 4),
(1420, '[D B] Pathetic management and service. They charge all amount in advance from parents but do not pay rent to property owners from whom they have rented the space, + electricity bills are unpaid. Both parents and kids face the trauma of threats from the landlord who threatens to lock you out of the property. Unsafe for Girls, a few months back, a male entered the hostel and beaten a resident female in the presence of warden and guard. No actions were taken. Both the Founders and management team don''t respond to calls and messages once they have taken all amount in advance. Choose a better place for your kids. Similar feedback can be verified from all parents who had opted for this provider as a PG for their kids last year.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.34595', 1, 226, 4),
(1421, U&'[Ishita Agrawal] \203c\fe0f\203c\fe0f  WARNING: YOUR-SPACE IS A SCAMnI vacated Your-Space over 8 months ago, and they STILL haven\2019t refunded my security deposit. Despite endless emails, calls, and follow-ups, all I get are empty promises, copy-pasted excuses, and complete silence.nnThey told me my refund would be processed by August, then delayed it month after month. Every time I contact them, they give a new fake deadline and then IGNORE ME COMPLETELY. Their customer care number is always switched off, and their management refuses to take any responsibility.nnAt this point, this is outright fraud. They are illegally withholding money, ignoring customers, and running a shameless scam. If you are thinking of staying at Your-Space, DO NOT TRUST THEM.nnI am now filing an official consumer complaint and taking legal action against them. If you are also facing this issue, do not let them get away with it\2014REPORT THEM.nnThis company needs to be held accountable for their disgusting and unprofessional behavior. STAY AWAY FROM YOUR-SPACE.nnTalking about their service, it wasn''t good either. The food wasn''t good (all of them mostly tasted same), their used to be cockroaches in the cooking utensils etc. I won''t recommend this hostel to anyone. Also i think the positive comments written about this hostel are fake.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.346072', 1, 226, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1422, U&'[Prakash Boda] Their facilities are good but management is pathetic. They only care about money and not customer relationships. Once advance is paid and in case you need to cancel then their response will be totally opposite. They will talk very nicely while booking but not at all helpful if situation is opposite.nnAs they are claiming they have not returned money in 1 month. I have followed up almost 7 months like anything and their manager doesn\2019t even care to pickup my phone. After 7 months also they just return half of my money only. This kind of behaviour is not expected from student facing business. Please pay your advance with all consideration. NMIMS might return your fees in case you get admission somewhere else but these people won\2019t.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.371121', 1, 227, 4),
(1423, U&'[raju] Unfortunately, the staying experience at this hostel has been far from satisfactory.nnThe food quality is below average, and the hostel uses sub-standard dairy products and ingredients for the students. However, when the owner\2019s family\2019s food is prepared, they use branded and high-quality products. What feels even more unfair is that the owner often takes food from the hostel kitchen for his own home and even sends it to his friends, while we, the paying students, are left with inferior meals.nnThe hygiene in the hostel is another major issue. The place is not well-maintained, and the rooms are sometimes not  mopped. As a result, cockroaches and lizards are common in the rooms. Many students fall sick frequently, but the owner shows little to no concern about this.nnAdditionally, the staff aunts and night warden are often rude and unprofessional. They shout frequently, creating a stressful environment for the students. Only Sunita Aunty is kind and nice to students.nnOverall, I feel that the hostel management prioritises their own needs over the well-being of the students. I sincerely hope the owner takes feedback seriously and makes the necessary improvements for the health and comfort of everyone staying here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.371259', 1, 227, 4),
(1424, '[Laxman Sharma] Best hostel in vile parle west, and the only trust worthy option. This hostel has been the best experience for my child, she has stayed here for 5 years her complete 5 year integrated course she was here. The management and house keeling is perfect.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.37138', 5, 227, 4),
(1425, U&'[Aishwarya Pakhde] Great location, really pleasant and clean rooms, but the thing that makes this such a good place to stay are the staff and the owners. This is to offer safe, secure, comfortable and homely accommodation for girls student. My sister was staying in this hostel for a few years and got all the facilities. Thanks for offering top notch facilities \+01f601', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.371497', 5, 227, 4),
(1426, U&'[Pankti Trivedi] I\2019ve lived here for a year and am continuing this year as well . The management is super understanding and makes us feel at home . 10/10 would recommend', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.371615', 5, 227, 4),
(1427, '[Tarun Chugh] Very nice girl''s hostel, neat and clean will many facilities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.371735', 5, 227, 4),
(1428, '[Ailip Doshi] It''s a PG and hostel for Girls and Boys who come to study in Mumbai. It basically serves students studying in Juhu and Andheri area. It has various locations in Juhu and Andheri. Very well managed by the owners. Students staying there have to follow a strict code and rules of stay. One of the best hostels in Juhu.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.371848', 4, 227, 4),
(1429, '[Nandita R] The hostel overall is a nice place to live except for few days of uncomforts. The staff however is rude at times but Matta uncle is quite understanding and cooperative.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.371962', 4, 227, 4),
(1430, U&'[Nitika Vohra] What fond memories from year 2005 to 2008 my college days in Mumbai Maharashtra City such great memorable memories meeting different souls women youths gratitude staff is so good ,food clean hygiene would recommended worth staying and have an amazing comfort experience enjoying your work lifeforce state or studies thank u \+01f60a\+01f917 \+01f64b\+01f3fb\200d\2640\fe0f\+01f9e1 so much for giving me that gestures \+01f64f\+01f339\+01fac2\270c\fe0f\+01f495\+01f60e', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.397137', 5, 228, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1431, '[Anisha] Fondest of memories of Amrapali hostel. Since I love discipline this hostel had the closing time of 11 p.m. no entry post that. Food used to be amazing during my stay from 2017 to Feb 2020. Hot water 24*7, amazing breakfast and dinner, clean rooms and washrooms. the location is the highlight with safety environment and proximity to so many shops and railway stations. Amazing hostel life spent. Wish I get to stay here again.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.397265', 5, 228, 4),
(1432, '[Aasavari Ghotikar] It is very affordable,friendly, hygienic place for Students and working women in the city premises.nRun by a women organisation,no wonder they are also conscious about the safety.They also have a guest room facility where a woman can stay  upto 2 days by paying minimal charges.nDifficult to find such a good facility in Mumbai.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.397375', 5, 228, 4),
(1433, U&'[Yashriii Desai] The food at the female hostel is surprisingly good and feels homely. Meals are fresh, lightly seasoned, and served on time. There\2019s a nice balance of healthy options and comfort food. The staff is polite, hygienic, and responsive. Overall, a comforting experience for anyone staying away from home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.397481', 5, 228, 4),
(1434, '[VINODKUMAR R] This hostel is located within walking distance of LTT Terminal Chembur and Tilak Nagar Railway Station.  There is a long waiting list for rooms. Rooms are allotted after an interview. To obtain a room, an Aadhaar card, health certificate, character certificate attested by a gazetted officer, a Bombay resident as a local guardian, and their Aadhaar card are required. All documents must be submitted with the application form; they will then call for an interview. The rooms are adequate.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.397587', 3, 228, 4),
(1435, '[Ranjna Pethkar] Food is worst, warden is not arrogent not co- operative, after 10:30 pm at night they won''t open get for girls, which is late from the office, always take penalty from girls from every small things, ex. Coming hostel after 10:30 pm at night, don''t serve nasta when girl come in to mess only 2 min late, most of times in the meal lunch or dinner foun hairs, after every 6 to 8 month they rises charges of hostel, only 1 benift is that The area is nice ane Staion is near', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.397694', 1, 228, 4),
(1436, '[asit panigrahy] Arrogant women in the reception. their ego is more than what the hostel has in the name of hygiene, safety and good food. better prefer some nearby hostel like aditya birla working women''s hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.3978', 1, 228, 4),
(1437, U&'[Dr. Akansha Sinha] The location is the selling point herenIt\2019s in the middle of a myriad of shopsnWhere almost everything can be accessiblenFrom local groceries to a beauty parlournA ladies tailor and also a dry cleaner is just across the roadnnI guess the hostel can do better when it comes to serving better breakfastnIn terms of both quality and quantitynBut still it\2019s do-ablennThe dinner provided is a balanced meal and I thoroughly enjoy it after a laborious day\2019s worknProteins, fibre and carbs all balancednnFeels like home \+01f3e1 \+01f601nThe rooms in the new building are well spaced and organised wellnn5 common washrooms for like 20 girls is a good numbernIt\2019s maintained well in terms of hygiene and basic needs are tended tonEspecially like the 24 hours hot water supplynnInterestingly their terms of stay are malleablenAnd that also for a reasonable ratenI find it a steal especially when the food is included and the place gives a homely vibenn\+01f607\+01f601\2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.398124', 3, 228, 4),
(1438, '[VINODKUMAR R] This hostel is good for lower salaried women in Mumbai.If your salary is greater than 50000 , you will not get room here. Rooms are okay, but wash rooms are limited.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.420527', 3, 229, 4),
(1439, '[Raju Kshirsagar] Awesome staff . Very disciplined!nBest for Working hardworking ladies as the climate, security is strong and perfectly organised !nI was here for some work. Secured location with CCTV cameras and in and out fingerprint entries .nRecommended for women who are  from the region . Safe place !!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.420663', 5, 229, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1440, '[RISHABH] This place is an outcome and vision of philanthropy and public spiritedness of old school business and something which we don''t see nowadays. A hostel built on the ideals of women empowerment and social upliftment, this infrastructure allows a safe and secure residential accommodation in Mumbai for working women. The locality is not that great and safe to be precise and needs overhaul and immediate consideration by the local authorities. Although the locality of the hostel is a middle income area but the approach road and the adjacent place of the hostel is not safe for females because drunk local play cards and drink alcohol just outside the hostel although they are not an active threat, yet potential danger looms if your office working hours are late. The hostel is gated and manned by hostel staff and generally safe. The hostel has basic creature comfort and needs improvement, but are yet to get a filtered RO water purifier for the residents. Food served is not healthy at all and its nutritional value is poor the reason often given is the low price charged but the hostel is anyways a not for profit organisation and serving poor quality and quantity food in 2023 in a developing economy by a charitable institution run by one of India''s largest corporate puts question on the overall management. Summarising the entire review, for potential residents they have a good place in Mumbai and it gives you a family safe place to grow financially in India''s most expensive city at the same time the management needs to improve the infrastructure and use its CSR funds to overhaul and upgrade the hostel and make the residents feel like home, empowered and not that they are  at the mercy of some corporate magnate as it would be anthesis to the real value, philosophy and objectives of the Birla and ideals of Rajashreeji Birla.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.420784', 3, 229, 4),
(1441, '[chirag gaur] The location of the hostel is very poor, seems like it is in between the slums. But amenities wise it''s value for money. Getting a shared room including food and water in less than 6000 RS a month is too good in Mumbai.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.420909', 3, 229, 4),
(1442, '[eva bara] It is a safe and affordable place for outstation working women in Mumbai. I have stayed  here but vacated in Nov 2020 since I am working  from home due to coron lock down. There are room available as 2 seaters, 3 seaters u0026 4 seater. Room is allotted based on salary. No attached toilets bathrooms - it is common. You get hot water for bathing, drinking. Toilets bathrooms are cleaned everyday. Food is clean too and good. compared to other hostels it is pretty cheap at the price you get it. No non- veg though for  non-vegies, you  get good, healthy vegetarian food. Time deadline 10pm. In case you want to stay out any particular day give prior information or in case of an emergency inform the Superintendent. Everybody is helpful  and nice if you are nice, responsible and mindful of others to. Don''t cause troubles for others, follow common rules, be respectful, n you will be fine here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.421137', 5, 229, 4),
(1443, '[Hemant Jain] Professionally managed and highest level of safety and hygiene.  The Management lead by Shri Suresh Khadke is providing a home away from home for working women who come from all over India to work in Mumbai', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.421269', 5, 229, 4),
(1444, '[Zin Sumedha] Very poor facilities in hostel, food quality is so bad you will find cockroach in food something,nbehaviour of staff and all the employees in side is so uncomfortable, arrogent, and disrespectful, no one will listen to your problems they will shout on you and tell you if you have problems leave the hostel that the only solution that they have for.nFloor bathroom and room cleaning is good, the one star js for that only.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.421446', 1, 229, 4),
(1445, '[Swati Sadul] Behavior of warden  is so uncomfortable, arrogant, and disrespectful. She was not even concern about giving details of  the hostel when i visited the place to check on accommodation availability . Its not always that women need accommodation, the hostel too needs business  The management should actually look into such unprofessional people.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.42157', 1, 229, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1446, '[nirmiti khandelwal] Best hostel in mumbai.  Lived here for almost 5 years. Everyone is very supportive. Very clean and safest place. Celebrate all festival. Feels like home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.444721', 5, 230, 4),
(1447, '[Siya Patidar] Even if this is the last place to stay in mumbai don''t stay here. The broker of this hostel took my money and they promised us to provide 2 sharing and ended up giving 8 sharing said you HAVE TO ADJUST and the amount they were asking for was 32000 WORST EVER HOSTEL. I left the hostel on the same day and the broker is not refunding my money it has been many days. Never ever stay at this place worst place ever. Chawl is better than this. Fake promises and nothing else', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.444855', 1, 230, 4),
(1448, '[Akshay Jaiswar] It''s a pretty decent hostel in Bandra with a good interior and services for women.nIt''s just somewhat costly I have heard from the girls whom I know who stay there. Personally I don''t work there so can''t tell much about it.nThe locality is good as I live there, not high class but you have connections to the railway station, metro, and bus stand. Moreover it''s at a low distance from BKC the important business centre in Mumbai.nYou will get access to shops, markets, clubs, bars, hotels, colleges, Mumbai University etc they are nearby.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.444985', 4, 230, 4),
(1449, U&'[VINODKUMAR R] One of the best working women''s hostels in Mumbai! Very safe, clean, and well-managed with excellent vegetarian food. It''s extremely hard to get a room\2014even 3 months'' advance booking may not be enough, and a local guardian (Mumbai resident) is required. Rooms are assigned (not selectable) and come in single (A type) or shared (B u0026 C types), all with attached bathrooms. Rent is based on your salary and much cheaper than PGs. Located just 400 meters from Bandra Colony Metro (Aqua Line 3), it\2019s only 15 mins to BKC. Staff are very cordial. You need documents like Aadhaar, PAN, job offer letter, character and health certificates, and your local guardian\2019s ID. If you get a room here, consider yourself lucky!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.445193', 5, 230, 4),
(1450, U&'[Invigilator Thorough] The lady on desk who is consulting for the very first time is so rude and doesn\2019t have knowledge how to deal with new individuals. I went there for inquiry and she was treating everyone like she has her own house we r just servant to her she has much more rude way. Also the way she talks it hard to stay for a single minute only. We did ask for waiting list and she did behave like doesnt care go away that was so rude and worse if you behave nice then only people will trust you or else you dont deserve that place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.445318', 1, 230, 4),
(1451, '[Rupashri beauty] Shram sadhna hostel is really well manage guest pg it''s really safe for girls and women two time meal including was really testy food  staff is really kind helpful towards guest and tanets', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.44544', 5, 230, 4),
(1452, U&'[Deepika Ajmera] During my early professional years of 2014-2016, I had the most comfortable accommodation\00a0in twin sharing rooms at this place.\00a0 I stayed somewhere for two and a half years in this working women''s hostel.Clean and equipped with all necessary amenities. The twin sharing rooms were quite spacious for us. The Western Express Highway is immediately accessible, and most ac buses stop there at Cardinal Gracias School / Teachers Colony bus stop,( which is 2 min walkable). It''s also close to Bandra East station. The only concern would be that I received the accommodation after a 10-month wait period\00a0because there was a long waiting list...', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.445557', 5, 230, 4),
(1453, '[Mohna Rebecca] Very good place for working women as well as students in Mumbai. Food is good, Complains about furniture and electricity dueley get sorted out. The infrastructure is excellent. There is a small and sweet Garden Area where people can take walks and play badminton. The staffs are also kind and helpful. Safe for young woman and girls. Overall a nice hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.445672', 5, 230, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1454, U&'[Chanchal Mantri] Stayed here for almost 2 years and somehow ended up making some of the best memories of my life. To be fair, most of that credit goes to my friends and our collective ability to find entertainment despite the chaotic circumstances.nnThe location is crazy. You are in Churchgate, one of Mumbai''s most premium areas. Marine Drive is practically your backyard, Wankhede Stadium is about 5 minutes away, and my college was so close that I could wake up late and still make it to class.nThe hostel fees are surprisingly affordable because it''s a government hostel. Getting in, however, feels like clearing an exam. Your admission depends on income criteria, distance from home, merit, college quota, and also planets and their mahadasha.nnNow for the hostel rules, calling it a hostel is technically correct, but prison might be more accurate. As a girls'' hostel, the curfew rules are stricter than some international borders. You can''t leave the hostel post 8 pm and can''t return after 9 pm. Afterall it is for YOUR SAFETY \+01f970nSundays are more liberal, though. You get an extra 30 minutes of freedom.nnThe mess food deserves special recognition for consistently reminding residents not to take home-cooked food for granted. Every meal is barely edible.nnFacilities-wise, they''ve recently added decent gym equipment, which is great because you''ll need something to channel your frustration into. The rooms accommodate two people each, there are common washrooms, paid washing machine services are available, but apparently no refrigerators.nConstruction work and random drilling noises are so common that after a while you stop noticing them and begin to question if they are missing.nOverall, if you''re lucky enough to get admission, you''ll probably complain about it every day while living here and miss it every day after leaving. The rules may test your patience, the food may test your digestive system, but the friendships and memories you will make here are absolutely worth it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.469133', 4, 231, 4),
(1455, '[Yashkumar Jain] The mobile number provided on website is fraud. The person who speaks is a scam. I came with my sister (working professional) to visit the hostel and to finalize, but when I asked the the same person to come out and show as the hostel. He said to first pay the deposit.nnThe security guard told us that all these are fraud and they do not have any male staff. Plus the hostel is only for government college girls.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.469274', 1, 231, 4),
(1456, '[Vanshika Ninawe] I want to know about 2026 merit list', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.469449', 5, 231, 4),
(1457, '[Deepadnya Walanj] The Hostel has sharing rooms comprising of two girls per room with facilities such as Tables, shelves, light, fan, etc. There is a mess as well as a canteen with specific timings. The hostel curfew is around 10:00 pm.nIt is well maintained and very clean. The food is also good. There is not much unnecessary interference of staff. Also it is 3mins walking from Churchgate station so it makes easy to travel.Over all its a good experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.469577', 4, 231, 4),
(1458, '[Shailendra Chavan] Good Hostel for Government College Girls', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.4697', 5, 231, 4),
(1459, '[Tunjeena Momin] Nice hostel but staff is too rude and arrogant', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.469828', 4, 231, 4),
(1460, '[Manish Singh] This is very beautiful girls hostlenNear Marine drive Sea', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.469952', 5, 231, 4),
(1461, '[Purva Patil] This is just awsome place bcoz this is near sea...just love this place', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.470068', 5, 231, 4),
(1462, '[Mital Bavadiya] I stayed here for 3 months during my training at tata memorial hospital and had a really good experience. The campus is clean and the facilities are well-maintained.nnWhat made it special was the viben- I made good friends and the weekends were always jolly and peaceful. Felt safe and comfortable throughout.nnDefinitely recommend for students and working girls looking for a peaceful place to stay in Mumbai.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.493469', 5, 232, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1463, '[Ajay Kumar Nag] Since my daughter lived there for 2 years , I can give a fair idea to how the hostel actually is as of date. So it is overpriced excluding food, earlier food used to be included and they used to charge 15000 for 4 sharing bunk beds , after excluding food they charge 13000??!nAnother thing is extremely small 4 sharing rooms like matchbox and they have bunk beds, at summer or afternoon , it is impossible to stay in the room. There is a centralized AC which they don''t turn on when it''s needed during afternoon.nNow the toilets are unhygienic, the warden Is rude and unmannered. There is a different rule for bathing time for a group of people and others. And they can bathe for entire day but the same if anyone else does it, they would target you. They will call you out, like they are paying more rent ??nYou can get a better hostel at this price like shraddhanand which is close to flower market.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.493677', 1, 232, 4),
(1464, U&'[Rutuja Patil] I would like to give feedback regarding the hostel facilities and management. My experience in this hostel has been very disappointing.nFirstly, the behavior of the hostel warden is very rude and unprofessional. Students are not treated properly, which creates an uncomfortable environment.nSecondly, the hostel hygiene is extremely poor. There are many big rats inside the hostel premises, even in the kitchen area, which is very unhygienic and unsafe for students.nAnother major issue is the government washroom located near the hostel. It smells very bad all the time, making it difficult to stay comfortably in the hostel surroundings.nAdditionally, the hostel is very congested. Proper air and ventilation are not available, and fresh air or wind hardly comes inside the rooms. This makes the living conditions unhealthy and uncomfortable.nI request the management to take immediate action to improve cleanliness, hygiene, ventilation, and student treatment in the hostel.nVery very very bad experience in this hostel\2639\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.493806', 1, 232, 4),
(1465, '[bps student] I am telling you from my personal experience the hostel is very over rated they provide very less space as compared to price they charge...even the services they provide is not proper...no proper ventilation facility available...this cause lots of suffocation in the room... very less space rooms like a matchstick box which is occupied by 8-16 people with bunker beds also very less space provided by them for luggage and even from 8 only around 4 washrooms can be used which create lot of chaos. And if something get damaged it will take lot of time to get repaired.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.494064', 1, 232, 4),
(1466, U&'[Khushi Singh] This hostel is a nightmare! Staff is extremely rude and unhelpful they don\2019t care about students at all. Facilities are terrible, nothing works properly, and you have to arrange your own food. Making friends here is almost impossible because of the toxic environment. To make things worse, there are bed bugs in the beds, mice running around, and crows everywhere. The washrooms are filthy, unhygienic, and smell bad. Overall, it\2019s unsafe, dirty, and a complete waste of money. I faced endless problems during my stay and would strongly warn anyone against joining this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.494384', 1, 232, 4),
(1467, U&'[Samiksha Jalkotkar] \200bI am so grateful for the positive experience I''ve had living here in this hostel. The true strength of this hostel is its amazing staff, security and the environment we live.n\200bShital Yadav Ma''am (Manager) is a rockstar ,always professional, highly organized, and ensures everything runs smoothly. Her door was always open, and she handled every issue with fairness and great efficiency.n\200bPriyanka Kamble Ma''am (Warden) is the heart of the hostel. Her sweet, yet firm, guidance created a supportive and disciplined atmosphere. She genuinely cares about the well-being of every resident.n\200bThank you both for setting such a high standard. I leave with wonderful memories!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.494569', 5, 232, 4);        
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1468, U&'[shahista khan] All staff are also  good humble and friendly Its almost two years i am here and honestly there were priority for me l. First,safely concern and second easily commute and I found both the things this hostel is great choice...\+01f642', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.494918', 5, 232, 4),
(1469, U&'[Pancham Pancham] Location is good and out side area are safe Budget are also good and security proper My daughter staying in this hostel since 1 years they are very good and helpful staff special (shital maam)\+01f60a\+01f60a\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.495051', 5, 232, 4),
(1470, '[Eshwar Natarajan] I am extremely disappointed with my experience dealing with Hive Hostels.nnAfter raising my concerns and giving the management ample time to respond including a formal 48-hour notice, I have received no response whatsoever. The complete lack of communication and customer support has been both frustrating and unprofessional.nnThis experience genuinely makes me wonder what level of support residents can expect after paying the full subscription amount, especially if concerns raised before the payment are met with complete silence.nnGood accommodation is not just about the facilities; it is also about accountability, transparency, and how prospective residents are treated after paying the advance when genuine issues arise. Based on my experience, Hive Hostels has fallen short on all three.nnI hope the management takes customer concerns more seriously in the future and establishes a responsive grievance redressal process. Until then, I would advise prospective residents to carefully consider how the hostel handles disputes before making a commitment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.520486', 1, 233, 4),
(1471, '[Bulesh Sharma] My Daughter stayed there for last session, They have quite a greedy system and greedier team.nWe paid 10000 in the beginning in the name of Maintenance.nAt the time of checkout they again asked for money for the paint (And i feel that paint is a part of Maintenance)nThey say that the security deposit will be refunded in 45 days but even after the 2 months the security deposit has not been refunded.nTheir food is Average not at all near the home style food.nThe food is not cooked in the hostel instead it comes from some other place and then servednThey just try to attract students through the aesthetics but not with service quality.nThey have rude staff, Special mention Ms Kavita, She doesn''t know how to deal with people.nnNOT RECOMMENDED AT ALL', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.520643', 1, 233, 4),
(1472, U&'[sabir khan] A Hostel That Redefines the Entire ExperiencennHive Hostel didn''t just meet my expectations it shattered them completely. From the second I stepped inside, I felt it: this place has a soul.nnAmbience: The energy here is magnetic. There''s a rare alchemy between vibrant social buzz and genuine comfort that most hostels never manage to find. Every corner from the common spaces to the rooftop feels intentionally crafted to spark connections, create memories, and make you want to linger just a little longer.nFood: Fresh, flavorful, and honestly impressive for a hostel. The food here doesn''t feel like an afterthought it feels curated. Every bite was satisfying, well-priced, and exactly what a traveler needs to power through an adventure-packed day.nnService: Flawless from start to finish. Check-in was smooth, every request was handled with speed and grace, and not once did I feel like a burden. The level of attentiveness here rivals hotels three times the price.nnStaff: If Hive Hostel has a secret weapon, it''s the people who run it. Exceptionally warm, knowledgeable, and genuinely invested in your experience they don''t just assist you, they make you feel seen. They remember your name, anticipate your needs, and treat every guest like family.nnManagement: World-class. The seamless operation of this hostel speaks to leadership that truly cares about cleanliness, consistency, and creating an environment where guests thrive. This level of excellence doesn''t happen by accident. It''s built, day by day, by a team that takes real pride in what they do.nnOverall: Hive Hostel isn''t just accommodation it''s an experience you carry with you long after checkout. Whether you''re a solo wanderer or traveling with a crew, this place will exceed your every expectation.nnI didn''t just enjoy my stay I didn''t want it to end. Without question, I''ll be back.nnHive Hostel where every guest becomes a returning guest. \+01f41d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.520782', 5, 233, 4);          
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1473, '[Saloni Jain] I would literally rate a negative for Hive Hostel. I will not ever recommend it to anyone. Very poor management, the staff is extremely rude. They do not care about consumer satisfaction. Do not book a room on the basis of any video they give. Cleaniliness is a big issue and I have seen better management, this is not professional behaviour, expecially Ms Kavita. My number is blocked from customer services, they won''t even consider my complaints. They take your money and that'' s it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.52091', 1, 233, 4),
(1474, '[Ishita Bandagale] Really good staying here from past 2 years they offer top notch services would surely recommend', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.52115', 5, 233, 4),
(1475, '[Sakhi] Had a great stay  and the property manager was very helpful and polite. Would definitely recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.521286', 5, 233, 4),
(1476, U&'[Anukul Kainya] there is no one to help students staying in \2026nnif air conditioner is not working how can these people ask students to bear expense of repairs although its not the fault of students staying in ..(sharing what is happening with my child)', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.521406', 2, 233, 4),
(1477, U&'[Aman Agrawal] I had high expectations based on the photos and description, but my experience at Hive Hostels in Mumbai was disappointing.nnThe cleanliness was below standard \2014 the rooms and bathrooms were not well-maintained, and basic hygiene seemed to be neglected. The staff was either unresponsive or not helpful when issues were raised, which made the stay even more frustrating.nnAdditionally, the facilities advertised (Wi-Fi, air conditioning, laundry, etc.) were either not working properly or poorly managed. For the price charged, the value just wasn\2019t there.nnI expected a more comfortable and professional experience. a very poor hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.521527', 1, 233, 4),
(1478, U&'[Zoya Sameer] I moved out of YourSpace\2019s hostel at the end of April 2025, with a clear understanding that my security deposit would be refunded within 60 working days. That deadline has long passed, and despite multiple follow-ups, I have yet to receive my refund. After initially waiting patiently, I was asked to wait an additional 30 working days \2014 which I agreed to, even though I was already frustrated. It is now mid-October 2025, nearly six months since I left, and there is still no sign of my security deposit.nThe delay is unacceptable, especially given the numerous issues I faced during my stay and move-out process. The hostel staff unreasonably withheld my exit until I provided an electricity bill, which was delayed due to server problems beyond my control, causing me to miss my flight. Despite this inconvenience, I chose not to hold YourSpace accountable for that loss.nDuring my stay, maintenance was poor, rooms were inadequately cleaned, and staff often ignored requests for help. One staff member in particular was rude and disrespectful. On top of all this, I found a rat in the dining area, which raises serious concerns about hygiene and safety.nDespite enduring all these issues, I have waited a long time for my security deposit to be refunded. The continued delay and lack of clear communication from YourSpace feel like deliberate neglect and deception.nI am publicly demanding an immediate refund of my security deposit. I sincerely hope YourSpace addresses these concerns promptly, so no other tenant has to endure such disrespect and unprofessionalism.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.547907', 1, 234, 4),
(1479, '[Khushi Vasdhani] dont even think about staying in this pg, i have been living here for 2 years and it is the worst, the prices are unnecessarily high, they don''t provide anything you have to do your laundry on your own, the food is the worst part, there''s hair in the food every alternate day and some instances have been there where there was plastic found in the food, students in this pg don''t eat the food at all, even the water is bad, they don''t get the water dispenser cleaned and algae collects on it. oh and the best part, when you complain about it , NO ONE LISTENS TO YOU, their chain of command is so big that the problem won''t be solved until u involve your parents, proper authorities, etc . they say that they are bery luxurious, ALL A LIE. last year while renewal they mentioned about so many services like dessert everyday for dinner, milk will be there 24*7, and they couldn''t even commit to s single one. DONT STAY IN THIS HOSTEL, ITS THE WORST AND IT KEEPS GETTING WORSE EVERY YEAR.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.548127', 1, 234, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1480, U&'[Anshita Jain] This is the worst space anyone could live at. The food provided is stale at times, we face issues with water flow. I was assured that the pg was pure vegetarian but they\2019ve started serving non veg. There are no enough washing machines provided since there are 40 students and only 4 washing machines out of which 2 are damaged. The issues we face are never resolved. Just waiting to leave the space as soon as I can, this feels like a harassment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.548285', 1, 234, 4),
(1481, U&'[Amitabh Sinha] Your Space is a terrible company with terrible management. They have a hostel in Juhu Sea Side where my son stayed last session. All commitments made by Mr Dhiraj was false and facilities lacking including basic WiFi and floor set up for pantry missing. Worst of all, they don\2019t refund security deposit. So please be careful in calculating monthly rent as SD amount should be considered by you as part of your rent as it never will get refunded. They will not even respond to you.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.548417', 1, 234, 4),
(1482, U&'[Pooja Bindal] Parents ,nPlease bhool Kar bhi apne bacche ko is hostel me nat karwana . No proper cleaning . Food is so bad . No wifi .There is always hair in d food .Washing machines are not working properly. My daughter has reduced 5 kgs of weight after joining the hostel . Also , she has to eat the food from outside daily . Pathetic.Its my humble request plz dnt get ur child admitted in YOURSPACE  \+01f64f\+01f64f\+01f64f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.548542', 1, 234, 4),
(1483, '[Latasha Agrawal] I appreciate the fact that Your Space provides healthy options. It''s important to maintain a balanced diet as a student.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.548663', 5, 234, 4),
(1484, U&'[Ishita Suneja] Pathetic customer services, no updates on my security refund status.nThey used to kick people out of the property when their payments were delayed even by a day.nIt\2019s been months and there is no update on my security refund.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.548785', 1, 234, 4),
(1485, '[Nisha Sippy] The security measures at Yourspace are top-notch, providing a safe and secure living environment for students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.548904', 5, 234, 4),
(1486, '[Yashashvi Chauhan] Current management so bad that after MULTIPLE complaints of mental harassment against my roommate, they did not take any action. She hit the door on my face, cursed me multiple times, have been violent and this was apparently not enough for the hostel management to kick her out. I was not the only one to lodge a complaint, there were multiple complaints against her.nnThe place or the warden did not make me feel safe to live here. I had to move out.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.574862', 2, 235, 4),
(1487, '[Scrati] Booked a room at the exceptional YWCA-Lady willingdon hostel for my wife. She, being a lawyer had to visit mumbai for a day.nAs per her the stay was amazing. Getting a room with a beautiful view at this part of the city felt great.nThey served her breakfast and dinner buffets which had enough spreads and both were filling. The place is secure which adds to their reputation.nRecommended', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.575015', 5, 235, 4),
(1488, '[Sadhana Powar] Best for girls n working women', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.575146', 5, 235, 4),
(1489, '[Ashwanth G] Extremely unsafe for staying here . Guys u don''t know when you things will get lost there is robbery gang within the pg itself . It''s an asylum my gf suffered lot.i don''t recommend staying here with valuable things', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.575273', 1, 235, 4),
(1490, '[Pushkar Adhapure] Arrogant lady at the Counter! Called for an enquiry u0026 was received by arrogant lady at the Desk, who I feel doesn''t have the proficiency to talk to people. Also heard similar incidents with other people as well when researched. Would suggest to skip this place if possible. Rating this 1 star for the horrible experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.575399', 1, 235, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1491, '[Devi Priyadarshini] Good food, clean rooms, bit old property but very well located and kind of a heritage building in the proximity of National modern art gallery. It''s a very good place to stay in south Mumbai. Close to Marine drive and not very costly compared to other posh locations.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.575565', 4, 235, 4),
(1492, '[Bhavana Ravikumar] I can say I have travelled quite a bit and this is the 1st place ever where each and every person without any exceptions does his or her best to make the stay as comfortable as possible. TRULY A HOME AWAY FROM HOME. All of them are polite and treat guests with utmost care. I had checked in around 8.30 pm and the set top box in the room was not working which was noticed by the assistant and next morning around 8 am there was someone at the door with a replacement. I had informed that the study lamp and the fan were not working properly and both were repaired by the time I reached in the evening.nnThe place old but clean and neat, maintained very well. No frills and nothing fancy. A warm no-nonsense kind of place to stay.nnLocation is also huge plus point. Being within walking distance to Colaba causeway offers many options to spend evening, explore different cuisines and good amount of street shopping at Colaba causeway, fashion street and with Crawford market etc., within 3 km distance. It is about a km to Marine drive so if nothing one can enjoy the sea view till late night.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.575978', 5, 235, 4),
(1493, '[Sagar Potalkar] I Visited YWCA To Attend A Seminar, The Entrance Gate u0026 Spare Space Is Covered With Beautiful Plants u0026 Saplings. In Morning I Had Super Tasty Breakfast Which Was Served In BIO-DEGRADABLE Plates u0026 Cups, Which I Liked The Most. Working Staffs Were Polite u0026 Helpful. The Conference Hall Was Clean u0026 Tidy. Lunch Was Delicious. The Location Is Very Close To Gate Way Of India. Had A Great Time!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.576172', 5, 235, 4),
(1494, U&'[Lavanya Dhawan] After 3 months of checking out, me and all other people who lived there still haven\2019t received the security deposit back.nThey don\2019t take accountability or respond properly.nFirst the stay was average at best and now this.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.607329', 1, 236, 4),
(1495, U&'[jaanvi lalwani] Worst experience my daughter stayed here after 2 months of check out they hav not refunded security deposit the staff at the reception is very rude n iresponsive they don\2019t reply after calling n txting several times All make interns eat food in the same canteen aa there is no privacy as girls hostel needed. N u hav to wait in long que for food also.staff behaviour with patents is also  very rude u keep asking they don\2019t reply n when to visit hostel they hardly ask for water other hostel such as student housing n aurus respect parents even offer food n complimentary stays too', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.607472', 1, 236, 4),
(1496, U&'[Kanan Jain] The location is great, from cafes to the beach, everything is nearby. The place also had a really welcoming and friendly vibe and was definitely a \201cvalue for money\201d choice as compared to other properties at juhu. Would definitely recommend to everyone!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.607591', 5, 236, 4),
(1497, '[Nishra Jain] It''s such an amazing Hostel. It has very good environment and it''s lavish. The rooms are very good with good facilities provided overall and the food is also good. Would recommend it to people for sure.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.607698', 5, 236, 4),
(1498, '[Nimisha Bhrasdiya] Ideal place for students or solo traveller on budget. A very comfortable and hassle-free stay experience. Decent amenities for the price point', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.607861', 5, 236, 4),
(1499, '[Snehal Agrawal] Very good infrastructure and space, staff is as helpful as they can be, cleanliness is always maintainednI never faced any problems during my stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.607967', 5, 236, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1500, '[Arsh Mathur] Amazing place went to see for my sister she loved it as well as my family. Staff is absolutely amazing. The sanatation in the place is very nice', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.608072', 5, 236, 4),
(1501, U&'[Ayush Kumbhare] Very nice commodity. It''s very clean, had a nice environment people gotta a nice vibe over all its very \+01f44d\+01f3fb keep it up\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.60818', 5, 236, 4),
(1502, '[Nitin Jagtap] Great opportunity to stay for my daughternMy daughter was living in this pg for 6 monthnGood place and homely atmospherenNice accomodationnThank you', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.686438', 5, 239, 4),
(1503, '[Durga Jagtap] I stayed at this Pg for few monthsnAnd had a really good experience the environment felt safe and homelynThe owner was always helpful', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.686573', 5, 239, 4),
(1504, '[Rushali Jagtap] Great experiencenI am working womennMy friend was suggested this accomodation and it was good homely environment I have received', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.686697', 5, 239, 4),
(1505, '[Ketaki Kakade] Good for girls and working womennGreat service in prime location Prabhadevi and parel', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.68682', 5, 239, 4),
(1506, U&'[Rajesh Salvi] Very good servicenWow experience \+01f600nnOne of the best Accommodations to get at this price. The location of the flat where I stayed was prime and the flat itself was clean u0026 clinging was a complimentary and well-maintained.nNO BROKERAGE MONEYnNO WIFI CHARGESnNO MENTENENC CHARGESnNO Immunity CHARGES', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.688048', 5, 239, 4),
(1507, '[Rupali Jagtap] It''s one of the best place to live in pgnThe price are affordablenGreat experiencenThankyou', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.688315', 5, 239, 4),
(1508, '[Diksha Sallam] Absolutely dreadful experience. The owner is incredibly rude and lacks basic communication skills. Everything about this PG was the worst - from the facilities to the overall atmosphere. Save yourself the headache and steer clear of this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.688442', 1, 239, 4),
(1509, '[Shital Awhad] Very nice Accomodation', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.688558', 5, 239, 4),
(1510, '[Manya] My stay at this hostel was truly memorable. The environment was clean, safe, and well-maintained making it feel like a home away from home. The staff was always supportive, approachable, and ready to help whenever needed.nWhat made this place special was the positive atmosphere and the wonderful people I met here. I learned a lot, made great memories, and enjoyed every moment of my stay. Thank you to everyone for making this experience so comfortable and enjoyable. I would definitely recommend this hostel to anyone looking for a welcoming place to stay in Mumbai.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.716504', 5, 240, 4),
(1511, '[Jet30309684799] Hostel Mantra as having a homely vibe. The staff, , receive frequent praise for their friendliness and helpfulness. The hostel''s dog, Tra to the welcoming cozy common area and rooftop terrace, ideal for socializing, reading, or enjoying a coffee. The shared kitchen and laundry facilites.the hostel to be a budget-friendly option in Mumbai, offering good amenities and a community atmosphere.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.716843', 0, 240, 4),
(1512, '[Trip.com Member] Friendly staff, nice location, busy streets', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.717069', 0, 240, 4),
(1513, '[The Awakened Me] Stayed at Mantra and had a really pleasant experience. The property has a calm vibe, clean rooms, and a beautiful atmosphere perfect for relaxing. The staff was polite and helpful throughout the stay, and the service was smooth. The food and amenities were also good, making the overall experience comfortable and enjoyable. A great place for a short gateway with friends or family. Would definitely recommend it for anyone looking for a peaceful and budget-friendly stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.717218', 5, 240, 4),
(1514, U&'[Gollapalli Sumanth] Had an amazing stay here, even though it was a short one. From the moment we arrived, we felt welcomed and comfortable.nnA special thanks to Sudeep and Preeti for being such wonderful hosts. Their warmth, friendliness, and genuine hospitality made the experience even more memorable. It\2019s always the people who make a place special, and they certainly did.nnThe atmosphere was great, the stay was comfortable, and everything was well taken care of. We left with good memories and wished we had stayed a little longer.nnHighly recommended for anyone looking for a friendly and welcoming place to stay. Looking forward to visiting again whenever I\2019m back in Mumbai!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.717345', 5, 240, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1515, '[ankita shirodkar] This is best Hostel location wise. Overall service is also good. There are things that can be improved. Better ventilation in dorms, more cleanliness of the common areas and kitchen. The dorm rooms were very clean with clean bathrooms. The experience was good with the staff being very helpful. Prompt response of whatsapp for any queries is what I really liked.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.717465', 4, 240, 4),
(1516, U&'[teja srinivas] I stayed at Hostel Mantra for two days, and it was a wonderful experience. The place was clean, comfortable, and had a welcoming atmosphere. What stood out the most was the hospitality and the prompt responses from the caretakers\2014they were always helpful and made the stay feel effortless. Looking forward to visiting again soon!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.717584', 5, 240, 4),
(1517, '[Brijesh Chavda] The rooms were good, but 4-6 people in a hostel room makes it difficult to share the washroom at the same time. Also, the fact that, when someone is getting ready in morning, and imagine them using perfume and all people in the room are affected by that. There''s a bit crunch on the personal space and minor disturbances while you try to catch the sleep due to movements on the top bed/lower bed, your sleep may get affected. Also, it needs regular service and cleaning of pillows and bedsheets to avoid unwanted smells. The overall co-living apace was good enough, pretty decent facilities. Wifi, Free morning breakfast (Bread, butter, jam, Banana, eggs, milk, corn flakes), Kitchen is quite good. Also, you have a wonderful company of Tra, the perfect company to hoomans! Calm, silent, distinguished, won''t bother you, just make your time better! The Wifi was good. Parking for 4-wheeler was available at walkable 2 min distance, which seemed safe, considering so many cars being parked there. Also, the storage deck provided needs a lock, which we need to get it. Going away with keeping your valuables on bed may not be the wisest choice but still overall it was safe.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.717704', 3, 240, 4),
(1518, '[Pijush Paul] Recommended. Ample space for routine activities, well-ventilated, and comfortable for long stays. It''s ideal for office workers, offering a great environment for productivity. A good PG to live in.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.77654', 5, 242, 4),
(1519, '[Sanjay Chandaliya] Clean rooms good vibes', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.77669', 5, 242, 4),
(1520, '[Kunal Vadher] Best pg in Andheri area they have many flats to provide best facilities', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.776821', 5, 242, 4),
(1521, '[rahul dubariya] very good pg in mumbai one of the best facilities', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.776948', 5, 242, 4),
(1522, '[Kunal Vishwakarma] All roommate are very good clean rooms cctv camera is also there', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.777144', 5, 242, 4),
(1523, '[Somnath vishwakarma] Best pg in Andheri West very clean with all facilities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.777303', 5, 242, 4),
(1524, '[bheema solanki] Best pg in Andheri clean rooms budget friendly', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.777439', 5, 242, 4),
(1525, U&'[kshitij kove] It''s good pg for boy''s ... A good place for students who are here for study ... \+01f607', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.77756', 5, 242, 4),
(1526, '[Gufran Shaikh] Had a great 2-month stay here! The place is clean, the food is actually good, and the management is super chilled and helpful. Definitely a solid choice if you''re looking for a hassle-free stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.80584', 5, 243, 4),
(1527, '[Ishika Fatnani] I stayed at this place for around 2 months. The place was pretty cool and chill. There are no obligations as such. Obviously, there are certain rules of the pg which are yo be complied. But overall the owners and the brokers are cooperative for any help needed.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.80596', 3, 243, 4),
(1528, U&'[Hitesh Sharma] Awesome hospitality services. Very humble staff. Neat and clean PG.nBest thing was the transparency in all paper work, nothing was hidden.nGreat support from Farhan Bhai, Hamid Bhai u0026 Zaheer.nI had a pleasent 13 months stay in your facility.nThank you guys. Stay Safe u0026 Keep rocking.\270c\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.806066', 5, 243, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1529, '[Shagun Joshi] Have been staying for almost 2 yr now.nAmazing experience.nThe owner Farhan is amazing. Treats everyone like a family. Very cooperative. If I ever coming back to live at Andheri. I am opting for PG Andheri West.nnThank you for the great support.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.806181', 5, 243, 4),
(1530, '[farhaan khan] I have been staying here for almost 1 yearnIt was really nice PG for staying good staff and good owner nice place', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.806351', 5, 243, 4),
(1531, '[Dark Money] Outstanding jordar like home full security full peacefull full service i stay here from 7 months hamid bhai like younger brother full supportive', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.806459', 5, 243, 4),
(1532, '[Raj Vasave] I have been staying in this PG for past two and a half years. Being at the walking distance from my institute was convenient for me. Least disturbance from surroundings, hence I was able to concentrate on my studies. Staff is always supportive and helpful. Overall satisfactory experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.806573', 5, 243, 4),
(1533, '[Soumyadev Dhauria] I was in a double sharing bedroom with a good window view to the in-campus park in front of it. So, it was pleasant. However, a bit mosquito presence is there, which is ignorable if you use a good-night coil or something like that.nOverall, it was a good stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.806676', 4, 243, 4),
(1534, '[Hrishita Ingale] Worst experience ever. I stayed here for 4 months and each and every day was frustrating. There''s always some issue with the devices, equipments, especially the roommate. I don''t understand how people don''t have basic manners. Every month we''ve to pay extra for either geyser, washing machine, flush, lights etc.. something is always wrong here. Mumbai us anyways expensive and with that paying the rent for sharing the place with these many people that too just for the bed, every other amenity we''ve to pay ourselves. And if we take the concerns to the concerned office, they neglect it and don''t care about it. Take my advice, you don''t have to stay in such a dirty place, you''ll get far better options in Andheri than this.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.836037', 1, 244, 4),
(1535, '[Gopal Jha] Excellent service and maintenance, good location , very clean ..i have never faced any problem in stay and received lot of support and cooperation', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.836213', 4, 244, 4),
(1536, '[Minal Pathak] Returned my deposit amount partially saying that the amount was deducted due to my luggage kept in the house during lockdown. This was not informed earlier and came as a surprise to me. The maintenance amount was taken from us saying this was for the maintenance towards the electronic appliances which is a very old Fridge and Washing machine. These 2 appliances do not work properly and is always leaking. The maid is also not regular. They don''t pay the maid regularly due to which no maid wants to stay. Swimming pool and gym is only in photos. The PG members are not allowed to use them. It is only to attract people.nnNot happy!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.836372', 1, 244, 4),
(1537, '[Sudiptoratul Chakraborty] Excellent service and prompt maintenance, good strategic location  , very clean ..i have never faced any problem in past four years and received lot of support and cooperation during COVID period.nnI am still residing and shall continue to do.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:03.836623', 5, 244, 4),
