(1581, '[Prajapati Ansh] PG saaf-suthra aur comfortable hai. Rooms aur washrooms ki safai regular hoti hai. Security aur facilities achhi hain. Location bhi convenient hai. Jo log food bahar se arrange kar sakte hain. unke liye yeh PG ek accha option hai.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.039743', 5, 249, 4),
(1582, U&'[Usha Solanki] By far the Best PG I\2019ve stayed in! GetSetHome in Oshiwara offers clean, spacious rooms with all the amenities you need. The vibe is super welcoming, and the staff is always ready to help. Plus, the location is perfect with easy access to everything. If you\2019re looking for a comfortable, hassle-free stay, this is definitely the place to be!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.183159', 5, 253, 4),
(1583, U&'[Leysan Karimova] WORST PLACE EVER! No respect, no any manners. Cancelling agreement last moment , left person in the street, foreigner who just arrived to India left without stay, because those greedy people last moment started to charge for some extra documents, last moment telling about form c and not letting in without it, adding extra charges just before check in , changing all the conditions, using our weak position as guests in India and manipulate us! THIS IS HOW YOU TREAT YOUR GUESTS ?? Thank ho we don\2019t treat Indian people like this in our countries! We are we welcoming. HOSPITALITY IS ZERO! DONT TAKE THIS PLACE IF YOU DONT WANT END UP ON STREETS.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.18334', 1, 253, 4),
(1584, '[Mr Jigar] Given the prime location and the quality of accommodation and amenities, I found GetSetHome PG in Oshiwara to be reasonably priced. It offers value for money, especially for the convenience and quality of life it provides.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.184097', 5, 253, 4),
(1585, '[Smith Parmar] i was staying with Getsethome for the past 2 years and getsethome made my stay very very comfortable, their service ticket feature is the best which makes any kind of service related to the property hassle-free, their pg is affordable, and he platform is user-friendly, the staff is very very supportive overall great experience with Getsethome would recommend if any one is looking for Pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.184266', 5, 253, 4),
(1586, '[Rahul P] Worst Place. Please beware. Team has zero humanity and helpfulness. Apartments are shitty and there service.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.184427', 1, 253, 4),
