(1589, '[Mr Ajazz] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.184909', 5, 253, 4),
(1590, U&'[jimit wagh] Staying at Pinaki Share Live in Andheri has been a really positive and comforting experience for me. Moving to a new city is never easy, but this place quickly started feeling like a home away from home.nnThe rooms are clean, well-organized, and comfortable, which makes it easy to relax after a long day of work. The peaceful environment and friendly atmosphere helped me settle in quickly. What I appreciated the most was the supportive and understanding management \2014 they genuinely care about the residents and are always ready to help whenever needed.nnThe location is another big advantage, as everything from transport to daily essentials is easily accessible. Living here made my routine much smoother and stress-free.nnOverall, this PG gave me not just accommodation but a sense of comfort and security. I would sincerely recommend it to anyone looking for a safe, welcoming, and well-managed place to stay in Andheri.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.347502', 5, 255, 4),
(1591, '[Joy Ghosh] Warning against Pinaki PG !!!nnPlease be extremely careful before taking accommodation at Pinaki PG. They demanded a full one-month security deposit even for a short two-month stay and, despite repeated follow-ups and bank deposit evidence, did not return even a single rupee of the deposit.nnBased on my personal experience, I strongly advise everyone to be very cautious before considering accommodation in this PG .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.347639', 1, 255, 4);            
