(1593, '[Aarushi Gangan] Had a wonderful stay at Pinaki SharedLive Rooms! The place was clean, comfortable, and thoughtfully designed. The staff was super friendly and made sure everything was well taken care of. The location was convenient and perfect for both work and relaxation. Definitely recommend it for anyone looking for a cozy and well-managed stay!  best PG in Andheri', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.347879', 5, 255, 4),
