(1604, '[Allen Jose] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.478992', 5, 258, 4),
(1605, '[This Is Ranit] I had a great experience staying at Pink Homes PG in Powai. The accommodation is comfortable, well-maintained, and provides a pleasant environment for working professionals and students. The rooms are clean, and whenever any maintenance issue comes up, it is addressed promptly, which makes living here hassle-free.nnA special mention goes to Pramod, the broker, who has been extremely helpful and supportive throughout my stay. He is polite, approachable, and always available whenever we need assistance. Whether it was getting the AC repaired, fixing a bathroom tap, or resolving any other maintenance issue, Pramod ensured everything was taken care of quickly without unnecessary delays. His responsiveness and positive attitude make a big difference and show that he genuinely cares about the residents.nnOverall, I highly recommend Pink Homes PG to anyone looking for a reliable and comfortable place to stay in Powai. The excellent service, timely maintenance, and the outstanding support from Pramod make this PG a great choice. Thank you to the entire Pink Homes team for providing such a good living experience!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.529058', 5, 259, 4),
(1606, '[Akshansh Prajapati] I had a great experience staying at Pink Homes in GHP Trinity, Powai. The service was excellent, and Pramod was always prompt in responding to any queries or requests. He was very helpful throughout my stay and ensured everything was taken care of.nnThe PG was well-maintained, clean, and hygienic. They also carried out deep cleaning regularly, which made the stay even more comfortable. Overall, I had a pleasant experience and would definitely recommend Pink Homes to anyone looking for a clean and well-managed PG in Powai.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.5293', 5, 259, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1607, '[RUPAL SONTAKEY] Had a great experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean, facilities are well maintained, and the environment is comfortable and safe. The management is very supportive and responsive whenever needed.nSpecial thanks to Rajesh Dubey Ji (broker) for helping us find such a good place. He was very professional, helpful, and made the whole process smooth and hassle-free. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.529431', 5, 259, 4),
(1608, '[Ved Pandey] I had a great experience with Pink Home. They provided me with a comfortable PG accommodation with excellent facilities. The rooms were neat, clean, and well-maintained. I sincerely thank the Pink Home team for their support and hospitality.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.52956', 5, 259, 4),
(1609, '[Bhagyashree Khandkar] Services are good. Shows affordable in Mumbai understanding the needs. I am staying since 2019 and still continue. Rajesh bhaiya is always there to help us on single call to arrange the requirement. Flats are safe and clean', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.529683', 5, 259, 4),
(1610, U&'[chaitanya sutar] I had a horrendous experience with Pink Homes, especially with brokers Rahul and Pramod. From the start, they run a disgusting bait-and-switch: showing you a series of awful properties, then presenting one decent one to trap you. After signing, it escalates horribly. They hound you for references, and even after paying rent on time, they harass you with false accusations\2014claiming you host guests, drink, smoke, or damage the place. Each repair request is twisted, and after a few months, Rahul and Pramod even escalate to physical visits, intimidating you in person. If you don\2019t give them further business, they will harass you relentlessly, push you to give notice, and invent excuses to force you out so they can profit from a new client. Once you give notice, they treat you disgustingly\2014speaking rudely, forging bills, and trying to rob you of your rightful deposit. Avoid Pink Homes and these brokers at all costs\2014this is a vicious, exploitative cycle that will leave you robbed and disrespected. They exploit college students the most, so BEWARE!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.529808', 1, 259, 4),
(1611, '[Hitha A S] I had a very good experience with Pramod bhaiya at Pink homes. He was very helpful, polite and supportive throughout the process. Thank you for your help and hospitality.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.529951', 5, 259, 4),
(1612, '[Pratik Kakade] Very nice service providers by pink home,nThe agent promod is very actively resolve any problems regarding the PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.530072', 5, 259, 4),
(1613, '[sumit upadhyay] Can I have the contact details pls unable to call and connect as unable to find the contact details and name of person for checking the PG details. Looking for PG from Coming Monday Date 29th June 2026', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.559983', 3, 260, 4),
(1614, '[satheesh G] I had a very pleasant stay at your PG. Everything in my room followed the system well. It was very good. There were no water or cleaning issues, and we didn''t have to worry about cooking. Gas was provided immediately when requested. The other residents in the PG were also very good. I especially want to thank Neelesh. My stay was very pleasant, and the area is very silent. The watchman, sorry, the security, was very respectful. If I called or arrived late, the system worked well. Very good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.560127', 5, 260, 4),
(1615, '[Bapu Kadam] Not return deposit very aggressive nature', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.560314', 1, 260, 4),
