(1644, '[MAAK 17] I recently stayed at GetSetHome PG in Powai Chandivali, and I am pleased to share my positive experience. This PG facility truly stands out for its exceptional quality and service. The rooms are well-maintained and offer a comfortable and clean living environment. The management is attentive and ensures that all residents'' needs are met promptly. The amenities provided are top-notch, making it one of the best PG options in the area. The location is convenient, with easy access to local transportation and essential services. Overall, GetSetHome PG is a highly recommended choice for anyone seeking a quality and reliable PG accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.842651', 5, 265, 4),
(1645, U&'[Tanmay Shinde] I''ve heard great things about GetSetHome PG in Powai Chandivali, where my friend has been staying for a while now. It\2019s undoubtedly one of the best PGs in the area, offering a comfortable and secure living environment. The facilities are well-maintained, and the rooms are spacious and affordable. The location is convenient, with easy access to local amenities and transport. My friend is particularly impressed with the supportive staff and the overall value for money. Highly recommend this affordable PG for anyone looking to stay in Powai!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:04.8428', 5, 265, 4),
