(1699, '[Harinrain Kumar] It is a very good PG in Nerul West and they provide rooms in budget. I''ve stayed in the PG from long time.nnThe amenities in the PG are Water filter, Fully Automatic Washing Machine, High-speed Wi-Fi, Fridge.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.524046', 5, 283, 4),
(1700, '[Advocate Madhav Vyas] I had a very comfortable stay at this PG in Navi Mumbai. The rooms are clean, spacious, and well-maintained, with proper ventilation and sufficient lighting. Housekeeping is done regularly, which keeps the place hygienic and pleasant.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.524195', 5, 283, 4),
(1701, U&'[Umesh Karal] I\2019ve been staying at this PG for a few months now, and it\2019s been a great experience. The rooms are spacious. The location is convenient with good connectivity to nearby markets and public transport. Overall, it feels safe and comfortable \2014 recommended for students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.52432', 5, 283, 4),
(1702, U&'[santosh gurav] Amazing Experience with Nivara PG u0026 Real EstatenI recently had the pleasure of renting a furnished flat through Nivara PG u0026 Real Estate, and I couldn\2019t be happier with the experience. The flat is beautifully furnished, providing a comfortable and cozy living space right from day one. What stood out to me the most was the incredibly low rent, which made it an affordable option in a city where rental prices can be quite high.nnMoreover, the best part is their security deposit policy\2014only one month''s rent as the security deposit! This is such a relief compared to many other places that require hefty deposits. The team at Nivara PG u0026 Real Estate was also very professional, transparent, and quick to assist with any queries or concerns.nnIf you\2019re looking for a hassle-free, budget-friendly, and well-maintained place to stay, I highly recommend Nivara PG u0026 Real Estate. They truly stand out for their excellent service and great pricing!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.524452', 5, 283, 4),
(1703, '[Ashwin Kale] Staying at Nivara PG was nothing short of exceptional. It felt like living in a comfortable, well-maintained home rather than a typical PG. The moment I stepped in, I was greeted with a warm ambiance and a sense of belonging.nnThe facilities are top-notch. The rooms are clean, well-lit, and adequately sized. Having a fridge in the room was a game-changer, and the regular cleaning service ensured a hygienic living space. The washing machine was a huge plus, saving me both time and effort. And let''s not forget the uninterrupted Wi-Fi, essential for today''s digital age. Cooking your own meals was a breeze with the readily available gas connection.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.524577', 5, 283, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1704, U&'[Pramod Nimbalkar] Overall, my experience at Niwara PG was very positive. It provided a safe, comfortable, and friendly environment, making my stay in a new city enjoyable and memorable. If you\2019re looking for more than just accommodation, I highly recommend considering a PG like Niwara PG. It\2019s an experience worth having....\+01f490', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.524698', 5, 283, 4),
(1705, U&'[Shrushti Mane] a month agonAmazing Experience with Nivara PG u0026 Real EstatenI recently had the pleasure of renting a furnished flat through Nivara PG u0026 Real Estate, and I couldn\2019t be happier with the experience. The flat is beautifully furnished, providing a comfortable and cozy living space right from day one. What stood out to me the most was the incredibly low rent, which made it an affordable option in a city where rental prices can be quite high.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.524875', 5, 283, 4),
(1706, '[Durga Prasad] I have stayed probably one year in this pg. Great service. Govind is the bestest person here. He''s friendly and also helpful in needs. They got wifi, cleaner, fridge, washing machine, etc. and it works perfectly fine. Cleaner come everyday to clean the stuff.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.525012', 5, 283, 4),
(1707, U&'[Sahanawaj Ali Khan] Well-maintained, safe, and secure properties in prime Navi Mumbai locations. The rooms and common areas are clean and kept in excellent condition, and the building security gives peace of mind. Their property management team is streamlined and responsive \2014 maintenance requests are handled promptly and check-ins run smoothly. They treat tenants and their guests with care and respect, creating a comfortable, community-oriented environment. Highly recommended for professionals and students looking for reliable PG accommodation in Navi Mumbai.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.556857', 5, 284, 4),
(1708, U&'[Presheel Deepak] I have been staying in a PG in Nerul Sector 17 for almost 2 months now, and my experience has been good so far.nThe housekeeping service is well maintained. Cleaning is done regularly, and every 2 days the washroom and floors are properly wet mopped.nKitchen facility is available with all basic amenities like fridge, washing machine, oven, and RO water.nThe PG is secure and has good overall amenities, making it comfortable to stay.nOverall, it\2019s a good place to stay in this area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.557', 5, 284, 4),
(1709, U&'[Mugdha Salvi] Gopal PG for Girls is one of the best PG accommodations any girl can find in the Navi Mumbai area. The properties and services offered are excellent. Amenities such as Wi\2011Fi, a washing machine, mixer, microwave, toaster, etc., are all provided and included in the rent. Overall, the experience was great.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.557159', 5, 284, 4),
(1710, U&'[Abhishek Deshmane] I\2019ve stayed here for almost a year and love it. The rooms are big, the kitchen has everything you need, and the staff is very helpful. It\2019s in a safe area, just 10 minutes from the train station. They do a deep clean every four months, so it stays fresh. If you need a place to stay, I highly recommend it!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.557281', 5, 284, 4),
(1711, '[Atharva Kulkarni] My experience with Gopal PG Services has been excellent. They are extremely professional and will make sure your stay remains hasslefree. Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.557408', 5, 284, 4),
(1712, '[Ganesh Gahiwad] I recently completed 4 years at Gopal PG. My experience has been very good. The service is good and the staff are polite and supportive. Special thanks to Kamleshwar Sir for his support from day one.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.557611', 5, 284, 4),
(1713, '[Ravi Teja] Best PG services in Navi Mumbai.nAlways responds whatever the problem is and acts swiftly. Maintenance and facilities are extremely good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.557734', 5, 284, 4),
(1714, '[Ashutosh Kalbande] I stayed in this PG for more than 4 years, and it has been a really good experience overall. The rooms are spacious and well-maintained, with regular cleaning and reliable facilities like Wi-Fi, water supply, and electricity. The location is also very convenient, with shops, markets, and public transport nearby, making daily life much easier.nnWhat I appreciated the most was the safe and homely environment here. Over the years, I met some amazing people and built good memories, which made my stay even more comfortable.nnA special thanks to Kamleshwar Sir for his constant support and approachable nature. Whenever there was any issue, he made sure it was resolved quickly. His care and management truly made this PG feel like a second home.nnThough I have now moved out, I would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a safe, comfortable, and long-term stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.557854', 5, 284, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1715, '[Joncya R G Toms] PG is great, affordable and very convenient for travel since its near nerul railway station and also near bus stop. Online orders come quickly as well and shops like medical, kiraana, sweets and chinese, bakery and all are just downstairs, very nearby and convenient. U just need to cross the bridge nearby station to reach east of nerul. Overall a great place convenient for working people who travel through bus or train.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.592583', 5, 285, 4),
(1716, U&'[Rampravesh Chauhan (Cyber cafe)] Shivaji PG Services is a good PG with all necessary facilities. They provide LPG, washing machine, refrigerator, RO water and other useful services. The rooms and facilities are well maintained, and the overall experience is comfortable. Good place to stay. \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.592742', 5, 285, 4),
(1717, '[Saurabh Utekar] Cheap u0026 good PG if you want to live for long-term...stayed for almost 2 years with little to no issues. Spacious kitchen with all amenities such as gas, washing machine, separate cupboard, enough space and ventilation, Two washrooms. Owner is also good...always in reach within a phone call. Overall good experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.593029', 5, 285, 4),
(1718, U&'[RAJARSHI NEOGI] Best pg....I stayed here for long 1 year.....room environment u0026 pg owner also friendly, well maintained hygiene, also location is good.....I spent here for long time till my transfer to other state....good memory\2763\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.593185', 5, 285, 4),
(1719, '[Babai Ghosh] The PG room was overall good. The room was clean, and the environment was calm and suitable for studying or working. The food quality was decent, and regular maintenance was provided. The owner/manager was helpful, and the location is convenient.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.59331', 5, 285, 4),
(1720, '[Prashant] One of the worst PG i ever seen in my life. I stayed here 1 day and they charge me Rs. 400. Even it''s not worth 100. Unhygienic bed, congested room. No proper air flow. Suffocation all the night. Guys don''t trust on this paid review. It''s not worth 1 star.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.593433', 1, 285, 4),
(1721, '[priya falke] Very convenient location, just 2 minutes from the station. Cleaning is good and the beds are comfortable. Good option for a budget stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.593555', 5, 285, 4),
(1722, '[Nikhil Tiwary] Have stayed there for 1.5 years. Shiva and Swapnil bhai are best guys to deal with everything related to PGs. I didn''t even waited for more than one day to get any problem fixed like water or gas or electric issues. I stayed in Mumbai for 1.5 years and never felt going to another pg or changing my pg. It was a blessing in disguise in the chaos of Navi Mumbai.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.593676', 5, 285, 4),
(1723, '[Sandesh Shinde] This pg is opposite of Nerul East and West both sidenBest part is with all inclusive no additional charges and no brokeragenAnd the important part is smoking and drinking is not allowednnOwner swapnil dada is very nice person', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.631284', 5, 286, 4),
(1724, U&'[Ashok Samse] Excellent pg in Nerul west and east, management is very good, 24/7 security guard, CCTV camera every main door, 24/7 water supply, Cleaning and all facilities there.nImportant :- Smoking and Drinking not allowed sickly prohibited\+01f6ad\+01f6d1nOwner Swapnil dada is very friendly and Supportive', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.631428', 5, 286, 4),
(1725, U&'[ROHIT PANDEY] \200bHelpful and responsive management.nWould definitely recommend to others.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.631565', 5, 286, 4),
(1726, U&'[Anil Kumar Soniya] PG owner Swapnil Bhai more support u0026 friendly person . Best PG in Nerul (Navi Mumbai)nAll facility available  AC, non Ac both are available washing machine, refrigerator,free kitchen.24\00d77 water supply free wifi .nAffordable price PG in NerulnSafe and secure PG .nnThanks and regardsnAnil kumarnNoida', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.632045', 5, 286, 4);       
