(1729, '[shiva telange] Best PG in Nerul city.nn1.tRoom quality: Size, cleanliness, ventilation, and furnishings.n2.tFacilities: Wi-Fi, laundry, food, electricity, water supply, and housekeeping.n3.tSafety: Security features, neighborhood safety, and entry policies.n4.tPricing: Affordability compared to local alternatives.n5.tLocation: Proximity to workplaces, educational institutions, or public transport.n6.tRules: Curfew, guest policies, and other restriction', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.632435', 5, 286, 4),
(1730, '[Ranjit Kumar] One of the best PG in Nerul Navi Mumbai I prefer this I stayed here for 4 years PG owner behaviour is also good I recommended this PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.633005', 5, 286, 4),
(1731, '[sri veerendra] Absolutely recommended! It is the best PGs in Navi Mumbai. It''s clean and tidy. I would genuinely suggest it to anyone who is looking for an accommodation in Navi MumbainExcellent management with every possible facilities that a pg can provide at more than reasonable rent. Nice and clean rooms too.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.671745', 5, 287, 4),
(1732, '[Muzzamil Shaikh] Nice place to live.nOne of the best PG you will get in navi Mumbai.nAll essential facilities provided.nHas gated bike parking, washing machine, water filter, 24hr water, gas+cylinder(cook whatever you like), bed, cubboard, maid for cleaning (frequency daily), dustbin in all room, separate bathroom for all rooms.nAlso PG manager is Engineer so.... He manages things properly as and when required.nHAPPY WITH THE SERVICE.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.671915', 5, 287, 4),
(1733, '[Hitesh Kumar Sahu] If you are looking for a PG in Navi Mumbai area then this is the best option to go for without having a second thought. Let me highlight some points which this PG is having so that it would be helpful if somebody would go for it.n1- Spaciousn2- Neat and Cleann3- Nearby markets and shopping complexn4- ATMs are nearbyn5- Restaurants are easily accessiblen6- Co-operative owner', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.672087', 5, 287, 4),
(1734, '[Surjit Singh Chauhan] I''ve stayed at many PGs in Navi Mumbai and this was the best one out of them. Though it was near station and spacious Asim bhai never tried to cram extra guys overfill it the way PGs usually do.nHe was always prompt to adress our issues, infact half of the times we didn''t even have to tell him about our issues; he kept doing regular inspections of the house and identified and solved any problems that he would found.nThe only PG I''ve seen where the entire house didn''t have to share one washing machine, one water-filter and one fridge and the wifi never crashed!!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.672246', 5, 287, 4),
(1735, '[Amit Gorade] Navi Mumbai PG is a very good guest house and the people are very nice and co-operative. It is best place to stay with family as well as friends. I really recommend a stay here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.672404', 5, 287, 4),
(1736, '[Omprakash Dikondwar] Very Good PG.nAll facilities are good.nOwner is very co-operative.nIf looking out for PG then, the best place to live.nHighly Recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.672556', 5, 287, 4),
(1737, '[Sayed Ali] It was my very comfortable days in Mumbai beacuse of this PG, with all basic required aminities, house hold services, cleanliness and good cooperative  attitude of PG owner, this PG is highly recommendable !', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.672706', 5, 287, 4),
(1738, '[Harish s] Nice pg u0026 really cool friendly pg owner. No maintenance or any kind of problem.nEverything is perfect to live there.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.672856', 5, 287, 4),
(1739, '[Arup Gupta] I found this PG like my home. Everyday the maid comes and the PG is cleaned. Also the number of tenants is okay so no problem with the bathroom. The rent is slightly higher but its okay considering the facilities you get. I stayed for 8 months at the PG and today I vacated it. I recommend anyone wanting to stay in Belapur to look for a space here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.712471', 5, 288, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1740, '[Shwetha N] Staying here has been a really pleasant experience. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and feel comfortable even after a long day. The owner is very supportive and quick to help whenever needed, which makes a big difference. Overall, it feels safe, peaceful, and truly like a home away from home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.712619', 5, 288, 4),
(1741, '[vicky Sahdeo] This is the best PG in Belapur, all the basic services are available and rate is not that expensive will always choose PG whenever I''d need or recommend others.nnJust wanted to thank you for your accommodation and services. Thanx.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.71274', 5, 288, 4),
(1742, '[Ojas Patil] Great initiative by PG Stay Living!nThey provide access to really useful groups for flats, flatmates, jobs, internships, and local updates. It''s especially helpful for people shifting to a new city. Totally free and very supportive.nHighly recommended', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.713062', 5, 288, 4),
(1743, '[Nitya Belani] Clean and well-maintained PG with a convenient location in CBD Belapur. Rooms are comfortable, security is decent, and basic amenities are available. Suitable for students and working professionals looking for a hassle-free stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.713323', 5, 288, 4),
(1744, U&'[Nigel Cardozo] Please don\2019t book by seeing the photos they send and post online .not worth the money you pay them .they say prime property but it\2019s actually nothing close to prime ..it\2019s in a shady locality always .and also they do not receive calls and respond as soon as you pay them .find a better place elsewhere.be warned', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.713447', 1, 288, 4),
(1745, '[prajapat asmi] Wonderful experience! The rooms are very clean and safety is top notch', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.71356', 5, 288, 4),
(1746, '[keerthi rathod] Owner has bike rental service and provided bike to me and gave me and my friend time to ride bike near a lone road it was peacefull and nice', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.71367', 5, 288, 4),
(1747, U&'[saras dubey] I just wrapped up a wonderful stay at the PG in Vashi and felt compelled to share how great it was.nnFrom the moment I checked in, the staff were warm and attentive\2014always ready with a smile and quick to address any little request. The rooms were clean, well\2011ventilated, and surprisingly spacious for a PG, with comfy beds and reliable Wi\2011Fi that made late\2011night study sessions a breeze.nnThe location is a major plus: just a short walk from the Vashi station and a handful of cafes, grocery stores, and a pharmacy. Evening walks along the nearby promenade added a nice touch of calm after a busy day.nnOverall, the blend of comfortable accommodation, friendly service, and convenient location made my stay truly pleasant. I\2019d definitely recommend this PG to anyone heading to Vashi\2014whether for work, study, or a short visit.nn\2014 A happy guest.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.750309', 5, 289, 4),
(1748, '[Gaurav jagarwal] I had a truly pleasant experience during my stay at this PG. The place was clean, well-maintained, and felt like a comfortable home away from home. The rooms were spacious and well-ventilated, and the common areas were always tidy. The management and staff were extremely polite, cooperative, and quick to address any concerns, which made my stay hassle-free. The environment was safe, friendly, and perfect for both work and relaxation.nnOverall, I thoroughly enjoyed my time here and would highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable, convenient, and well-managed place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.750481', 5, 289, 4),
(1749, '[akshay shri] I stayed at City Nest Premium PG for 3 months during my internship in MumbainnThe experience was absolutely wonderful. The rooms are clean, well maintained, and comfortable, with 24 hours water supply and no electricity issues at all. The location is convenient and the environment feels safe and homely.nnA special mention to the owner Mr. Narayan who is an extremely humble and respectful person. He treats tenants with the utmost courtesy and ensures their comfort is always a priority. His approach makes you feel valued and cared for which is rare to find in a big city.nnI would highly recommend City Nest Premium PG to anyone looking for a hassle-free and pleasant stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.750655', 5, 289, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1750, '[Ankita Shringarpure] My brother had a pleasant stay at this PG. The rooms were clean and well-maintained, with adequate space and ventilation. The location is convenient, with easy access to public transport, shops, and eateries. Overall, a comfortable and safe place to stay, offering good value for money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.750767', 5, 289, 4),
(1751, '[Dr.Tushar More] I had a wonderful experience staying at City Nest PG. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and spacious, providing a comfortable environment for both work and relaxation. The staff is friendly, cooperative, and always ready to help. The location is convenient, with easy access to public transport, shops, and eateries. The food served is homely and hygienic, and overall facilities like Wi-Fi, laundry, and security are excellent. I would highly recommend City Nest PG to anyone looking for a safe, affordable, and pleasant place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.750876', 5, 289, 4),
(1752, '[Akash Mahindrakar] I had a wonderful experience staying at this PG. The rooms are always clean and well-maintained, and the facilities like Wi-Fi and laundry are top-notch.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.750982', 5, 289, 4),
(1753, '[Eswar Mahalingam] I had paid a rent of Rs. 28,000 to a property located near the company on 28th August 2025 . However, I have not received any refund from them despite repeated follow-ups. They are cheating people by not returning the money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.751092', 1, 289, 4),
(1754, '[sagar patil] A great place to stay! Clean rooms, Affordable rent, hygienic atmosphere.The environment is peaceful and safe. Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.7512', 5, 289, 4),
(1755, '[neelesh sable] I had a great stay at this PG. The rooms are clean, the food is good, and the PG owner is very helpful and responsive. The location is convenient, and the overall environment is safe and comfortable. I would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a peaceful place to stay. Nearby ground is available, and palm beach road also available- an amazing area.nnSpecial thanks to Mr.Naidu for when I had a fever; he cared for me like Family Members.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.789214', 5, 290, 4),
(1756, '[Harshal Ingale] I stayed at Sundaram PG for nearly 10 months, and it has been a really good experience overall. The food quality was good and consistent, which made daily life much easier. The amenities provided, especially the washing machine facility and alternate-day room cleaning, were very helpful and well maintained. The environment was comfortable and suitable for working professionals/students. Thank you for making my stay smooth and hassle-free. Would definitely recommend this PG to others looking for a comfortable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.789364', 5, 290, 4),
(1757, '[Sundar Karthick] I stayed in this PG for 7 years and recently moved out with wonderful memories. The care and support provided by the management were exceptional throughout my stay. The home-style food, cleanliness, maintenance, and prompt attention to any issues made it feel like a second home. Thank you for making my stay comfortable and enjoyable. I highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a safe and well-managed place to stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.789494', 5, 290, 4),
(1758, U&'[elango doss] I have been staying at Sundaram PG from 2023 to 2026. My overall experience has been very good. The environment is peaceful, safe, and comfortable for working professionals and students.nThe facilities are well maintained, and the management is supportive and responsive whenever needed. One of the best parts is the food \2013 especially dinner. It feels like homemade food, which makes it comfortable and satisfying after a long day.nI would definitely recommend Sundaram PG to anyone looking for a clean, friendly, and comfortable place to stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.789623', 5, 290, 4),
(1759, '[Nishanth Balaji] I stayed in the PG for 6 months.This is the first stay for me in Mumbai.I really felt like it was in my home. Food served were home made and nutritious. Room cleaning is done regularly and all basic amenities are available.I would recommend this for all person who want to stay in PG and having food.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.789743', 5, 290, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1760, U&'[amol chavan] I stayed for 2 months at Sundram PG and had a very pleasant experience. The overall stay was comfortable and hassle-free.nnThe owner, Mr. Dinesh, is friendly and highly cooperative. He goes above and beyond with his hospitality, making you feel right at home. Any room-related issues are addressed promptly.nnThe rooms are well-maintained, and the management is responsive. Overall, it\2019s a comfortable and supportive place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.789861', 5, 290, 4),
(1761, '[RAJ SHRIVASTAVA] This PG is one of the best places to stay. Rooms are clean, spacious, and well-maintained. Food quality is very good and feels like home. The owner and staff are polite, helpful, and always available. Location is safe and well connected with transport, market, and office areas. Overall, very comfortable stay and totally value for money. Highly recommended for students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.78998', 5, 290, 4),
(1762, '[Vikas Velip] It was a really great experience staying at Sundaram PG for the past 1.5 years. I truly enjoyed my time there and would definitely recommend Sundaram PG to anyone looking for a good PG accommodation option nearby Nerul area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.790214', 5, 290, 4),
(1763, '[Varshini Subramani] I''ll say it as best Pg.. I''m from Tamilnadu shifted to Navi mumbai.. Everything was New..this PG was best option..The PG guy Naranayan Bhai was very good and helpful.. Even i had my best experience with PG mates..i stayed for one month it was worth the money and it will feel like my own place there will be no problem or any other disturbance... I''ll recommend this PG to people who start their new beginnings..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.870401', 5, 292, 4),
(1764, U&'[PRIT Gor] Finding the right PG can be challenging, but my experience with this PG has been genuinely positive, and I feel it deserves a detailed review for anyone considering it. I moved in a few months ago, and from the very beginning, I noticed a level of professionalism, comfort, and care that immediately set this PG apart from others I had previously visited.nnOne of the first things that impressed me was the cleanliness and maintenance of the property. The rooms were well-kept, properly ventilated, and furnished with everything essential for a comfortable stay\2014bed, mattress, study table, cupboard, and functional electrical fittings. The housekeeping staff is consistent, punctual, and polite. They clean the rooms and common areas regularly, which creates a hygienic living environment. In many PGs, maintenance issues can go unnoticed for long periods, but here, repairs are handled quickly whenever something is reported.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.870559', 5, 292, 4),
(1765, '[Anuj Mane] Clean rooms, decent food and peaceful atmosphere. Good location and reasonable rent. Pleasant experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.870767', 5, 292, 4),
(1766, '[Rakshita Poojary] I had a really pleasant stay at Service Fox PG in Vashi. The place is extremely clean, well-maintained, and equipped with all the basic amenities like a cupboard, table, and washing machine, which makes day-to-day living very easy. The rooms are tidy, and the daily cleaning keeps the environment fresh and hygienic. The location is also convenient because the bus stop and Vashi station are close by, so travelling becomes hassle-free.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.870891', 5, 292, 4),
(1767, '[dagumati sarvankumar] I had a great stay at this PG in Vashi. The owner is very responsive and always available for any queries. The place is well-maintained, and a big plus is that cleaning is done every day, which keeps the environment neat and hygienic. The kitchen facility made my stay even more convenient and comfortable. overall, the rooms and services are definitely worth the rent charged.nThanks to the PG and the owner for providing such a comfortable stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.871018', 5, 292, 4),
(1768, U&'[Arya Tiwari] Such a great experience, everything was well prepared and all the amenities were in good and hygienic condition. The owner is very nice and very respectful, the location is very pause and peaceful as well. Quite happy with all the services provided. If you are planning to stay in Vashi, then i highly recommend you to visit this PG. \+01f64c', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.871149', 5, 292, 4);           
