(1769, '[swapnajit patra] Very honest and genuine owner. Transparent in dealings and always helpful. Had a smooth and trustworthy experience. Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.871273', 5, 292, 4),
(1770, '[Mr. Uday Mathur 5 Year IDD Engineering Physics] It was a great experience! The property is located in a prime location, both bus stand and Vashi local station are within of 1km range. regular cleaning and maintanence were all managed with obvio some little lags, but overall good. All facilities like the fridge, washing machine, water purifier, etc were available and are in working condition.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.872662', 5, 292, 4),
