(1774, '[sumit negi] Excellent place to be. Good location. Regularly cleaning supportive staff. Best place to stay at belapur.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.90722', 5, 293, 4),
(1775, '[Adarsh Yenorkar] Nice and affordable PG. The staff here is cooperative. Purified drinking water available for every floor. Neat and tidy rooms available', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.907339', 5, 293, 4),
(1776, '[Dharmendra Kumar] Neat and clean pg, and affordable price ac and non ac', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.907457', 5, 293, 4),
