(1778, '[Olina] The owner is very nice his way of talking is very friendly, thank you dilip sir', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.907698', 4, 293, 4),
(1779, U&'[Dummy clone] Decent PG with basic facilities. Rooms are okay and manageable, but cleanliness and maintenance need improvement. Food is average\2014not great, not terrible. Good location, but management response can be slow. Overall, suitable only if you\2019re on a budget and don\2019t expect too much.\201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.945891', 5, 294, 4),
(1780, U&'[Utkarsh Shahi] I lived here for more than 2.5 years KK sec 4 location.nnIt was more like a home, far from home.nI have seen others PG as well where my other friends use to live, but this one feel more comfortable, a little bit more spacious, more open.nnThe PG owner and caretakers are awesome persons.nnIt deserve a 5 Star rating especially in a place like Mumbai and Navi Mumbai.nnThank you \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.946032', 5, 294, 4),
(1781, '[Aditya Jadhav] It was very nice living in SK pg as there facilities were good and there was no water issue and electricity issue and the help us for each of the issue and when the time was of deposit the gave us full deposit it was good overall', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.946161', 5, 294, 4),
(1782, '[Anshul Pathrabe] Pretty good PG in budget. Very good and cooperative staff.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:05.946436', 4, 294, 4),
