(1800, '[Rajesh Ramanan] Comfortable, clean, healthy, and safe place to stay.nBetter standards to resolve any queries .nLoved the place during my stay at Nerul.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.062122', 5, 297, 4),
(1801, '[Mayur Hatture] Gopal PG is Nerul is very much Accessible form any locations. All facilities are good. Staff is very friendly and helpful and polite.nPG location is near by Station so good for travel.nOverall PG is very good.nRecommend for all community.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.062272', 4, 297, 4),
(1802, '[Mayuresh Shitole] Good service and reasonable prices. Team is very supportive', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.062458', 5, 297, 4),
(1803, U&'[Celeb pr] \200bI highly recommend this PG room, especially for female students or working professionals. It truly exceeds expectations and provides a safe, comfortable, and stress-free living environment.n\200bWhat immediately stood out was how extremely hygienic and well maintained the entire property is. The management clearly takes pride in keeping everything spotless.n\200bBeyond the excellent cleanliness, the financial setup is incredibly convenient: all essential utilities are provided, and the fact that the electricity and gas bill are both included in the rent is a huge bonus that simplifies budgeting.n\200bMost importantly, the PG is genuinely safe for girls. The security measures and environment made me feel completely secure throughout my stay. If you are looking for a reliable, clean, and worry-free place to live, this is it!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.098113', 5, 298, 4),
(1804, '[Novus] The PG is really good, super clean and well maintained.It''s safe and secure, especially for girls. A great option for students or working professionals looking for a comfortable stay.The property is extremely hygienic and very well maintained. A perfect choice for anyone looking for a clean and reliable stay. All utilities, including electricity and gas, are covered in the rent, which makes it very convenient.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.098272', 5, 298, 4);               
