(1805, '[Jyoti Parab] I''ve been staying at this PG for a while now, and I must say, it''s been a great experience. The rooms are spacious and well-furnished, and the food is delicious. The staff is friendly and approachable, always willing to lend a helping hand. The PG also has a great location, with plenty of amenities and services nearby. Overall, I''d definitely recommend this place to anyone looking for a comfortable and hassle-free stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.098432', 5, 298, 4),
(1806, '[Sheza Saleem] I have been staying at this PG for some time and it has been a very comfortable experience. The place is extremely hygienic and well maintained. All utilities are provided, including electricity and gas, which makes it very convenient. It also feels very safe for girls and has a peaceful environment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.098577', 5, 298, 4),
(1807, U&'[Suzan Ray] This accommodation is an excellent choice, especially for girls. It\2019s extremely hygienic, well-maintained, and located in a safe area. All essential utilities are provided, including electricity and gas bills, which are included in the rent\2014making it hassle-free and budget-friendly. The environment is clean, secure, and ideal for students or working professionals looking for a comfortable and reliable place to stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.098718', 5, 298, 4),
(1808, U&'[Bhuvi Pawar] This PG is super clean and well maintained! Electricity and gas bills are already included, which is really convenient. It\2019s a very safe place for girls, with all basic utilities provided. Overall, a great option for anyone who values hygiene, comfort, and security', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.098839', 5, 298, 4),
(1809, U&'[Akshar Parab] I had a really good experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean, the environment is peaceful, and the staff is helpful. Food quality is decent and all basic facilities like Wi-Fi, laundry, and water supply are well maintained. It\2019s a comfortable and safe place for students and working people.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.09896', 5, 298, 4),
(1810, '[Vijayalaxmi Mudaliar] The property is extremely hygienic and very well maintained. All utilities, including electricity and gas, are covered in the rent, which makes it very convenient. The environment is peaceful and completely safe for girls. A perfect choice for anyone looking for a clean and reliable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.09908', 5, 298, 4),
