(1818, '[Pratap Raje] Really Good services rahul bhai', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.13689', 5, 299, 4),
(1819, '[Riyaz] I had a wonderful stay at CozyDroms PG, Ghansoli. I stayed there for 2 years and did not face any issues during my time. The property provides 24-hour water supply, electricity, and regular maintenance services. Special thanks to the property manager, baibhav, for making my stay comfortable. He is very friendly and always available to help, Recommend stay for corporate people.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.175981', 5, 300, 4),
