(1821, '[Maheswar M] I had a comfortable stay at this PG accommodation. The rooms were clean and well-maintained, and the housekeeping was done regularly. The food provided was homely and hygienic.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.176277', 5, 300, 4),
(1822, '[Saumya Gokhale] I had a really comfortable experience at Cozy Stays PG.The atmosphere was peaceful, which made it easy to focus on studies and relax after a long day.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.176403', 5, 300, 4),
(1823, '[Pracheta Behera] Being an outsider and settling at Mumbai is a task for real , as sometimes you will find matchbox size rooms and rent will be so expensive. I found cozydorms is perfect in all its way and I liked the fact it was comforting and worth it. Thanks cozydorms for making an outsider of Maharashtra so comfortable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.176671', 4, 300, 4),
(1824, '[Shweta Kumari] This pg just exploits people...At the time of contract they pretend that they are good and will not charge any extra amount but once u join this, they charge extra amount in the name of electricity bill...When I joined this pg, I got an electricity bill of Rs1420 of just 11 days...I was just wondering that how 11 days costs Rs 1420. And every month they increase their electricity bill and when you ask them about this they start arguing.nnThey just exploits the innocent ones by charging extra amount. Almost every person of the pg are working professionals, they leave the PG at 9-10 am and comes at 8-9 pm. Hardly people stays in PG fir 8-9 hrs and still they charge electricity bill above 2500 and even sometimes 3000 and 4000....I suggest you all not to go for this worst PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.176798', 1, 300, 4),
(1825, U&'[sai motupalli] Recently, we stayed at Parashuram Nivas Cozy Stay. They charged \20b911,000 per person, promising amenities such as TV, refrigerator, AC, Wi-Fi, and more. However, upon arrival, we found that even basic facilities were missing \2014 there were no proper beds, the rooms were leaking, and the water had a foul smell, with drainage water mixing into the drinking supply. The place was unhygienic, and as a result, my friend and I developed salivary gland infections that required surgery, costing us around \20b92 lakhs. Moreover, we did not receive any refund when vacating. Please avoid staying at Cozy Stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.176921', 1, 300, 4),
(1826, '[Indu Kumar Rai] I stayed at for 2.5 years, and it was a great experience overall. The facilities were well-maintained, and the management was always responsive to any concerns. The rooms were clean, spacious, and well-ventilated, making it a comfortable place to stay long-term. The location was also convenient, with easy access to public transport, markets, and essential services.nnI highly recommend to anyone looking for a comfortable and safe PG accommodation!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.177512', 5, 300, 4),
(1827, '[Dilip kumar] I had a very good stay at NEW GREEN HOUSE PG. The rooms were clean and comfortable, the location is convenient, and the overall atmosphere was peaceful. The staff was polite and responsive whenever I needed assistance. The amenities met my expectations, and I found it to be good value for money. I would recommend this PG to students and working professionals looking for a comfortable place to stay in CBD Belapur.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.253028', 5, 302, 4),
(1828, U&'[Deepak Mishra] Worst experience ever in my life. This pg is full of bed bugs. Staff here are extremely rude especially the caretaker Raj Kumar u0026 the cleaning guy. 8 people use single toilet u0026 bathroom. Their is no restriction of Alcohol in this pg, some people drink u0026 do vomiting u0026 toilet inside the room itself and when we try to do complaint of such things, caretaker seems to be careless, he never takes action on such people\+01f613', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.253177', 1, 302, 4),
(1829, '[Shahaji Nair] Cleaning is done for the sake of doing. Bare minimal facilties (Hot water, pest control, wifi issues). The area is housing complex, hence bare minimal food facilities also. Feels too crowded (2 bathrooms for 12 people). No cupboard, instead they have under bed drawer. Overall average experience for cost.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.253301', 3, 302, 4); 
