(1831, U&'[Atmaram Vishwakarma] Very disappointing experience with this PG hostel. The services are poor and not maintained properly. Basic facilities like wifi, and timely support are lacking. The biggest issue is the staff behavior \2014 they are rude, unprofessional, and do not respond respectfully to residents\2019 concerns. I would not recommend this place to anyone looking for a comfortable and respectful living environment. Management seriously needs to improve service quality and staff manners.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:01:06.253536', 1, 302, 4),
