(1854, '[Divyansh Nautiyal] I had a great stay at Awesome Boys PG. Its biggest advantage is the location, being within walking distance of Connaught Place while still remaining affordable. The PG provides all the basic facilities needed for a comfortable stay, and there are plenty of nearby shops for daily essentials. Although the area can be a bit crowded with traffic at times, the convenience of the location makes up for it. The owner is very polite, soft-spoken, and helpful. Overall, it''s a good budget-friendly option for students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.879744', 5, 307, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1855, U&'[DHEERAJ KHANDELWAL] I\2019ve stayed here for over a year and it\2019s been a great experience. The PG is perfectly located near New Delhi Railway Station and provides all the essentials: AC, geyser, quality furniture, and good food options.n\200bThe best part is the management. The owners are incredibly helpful and genuinely care about the residents. Any issue I\2019ve ever had was resolved the very same day. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a hassle-free stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.880041', 5, 307, 4),
(1856, U&'[Shashank Pandey] This place is fantastic, especially due to its unbeatable closeness to New Delhi Railway Station and Connaught Place\2014perfect for commuters and students. The owner, Mr. Gaurav Nanda, is incredibly friendly and cooperative, always going out of his way to help with any request. There''s a caretaker available 24/7 for round-the-clock support, and the open terrace garden is a serene spot to unwind after a busy day. Clean, comfortable, and great value\2014couldn''t ask for more!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.880368', 5, 307, 4),
(1857, U&'[Abhishek Mishra] As the name suggests, it''s actually Awesome PG.nI had a wonderful experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean, spacious, and well-maintained. The owner is friendly and a safe and comfortable environment is available at the place.nnThe location is convenient, with easy access to New Delhi Railway Station just a few metres apart.nnOverall, it\2019s an excellent choice for anyone looking for affordable yet quality accommodation. I would definitely recommend it to anyone seeking a hassle-free living experience! :)', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.880635', 5, 307, 4),
(1858, '[vaibhav karanwal] One of the best and affordable PG near New Delhi Railway Station. PG Owner Uncle Behaviour is nice , the best part of this PG is it is located near New Delhi Railway station and metro station is also neaby as well as Paharganj is also nearby. If you are looking for stay in new delhi you must choose this PG .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.880969', 5, 307, 4),
(1859, '[Ajay CHADHA] I had a Chance to stay in this PG for a long time.This PG is well located near new Delhi railway stn and metro stn and market, ideal for students and service persons.peaceful and friendly atmosphere,well secured and provides all the facilities mentioned.Never experienced any breakdown. The owner Gaurav Nanda is very helpful and gives due respect to everyone staying there.I enjoyed staying in this PG and recommend for students,service persons who are in search of peaceful and secured PG in New Delhi must visit this . regards', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.881202', 5, 307, 4),
(1860, U&'[rahul chandola] Hi all recently I checked in this awesome boys pg on May 2025nThe rooms were nice and upto the mark whereas the owner namely Mr. Gourav Nanda was helpful, friendly and helpful always suggested the right things to me.nActually my job location was in Gurgaon and as Gurgaon is quite expensive in terms of PG so this PG was on the budget even the single room with attached washroom was offered at reasonable price all thanks \+01f64f to the owner.nThe owner is of adjustable nature if one cannot pay the rent on time he can adjust the same to pay later no issues with the samenAlso there is security also as the caretaker there closes the gate on time for the safety and security purposenAlso food is available as one can order the same by informing the caretaker beforehand.nThe pg is quite close to New Delhi railway station and metro station so it is quite feasible for office goersnOne must try to come and live in this pg as prices for single and double rooms are within budget all thanks \+01f44d to the owner Mr. Gourav Nanda \+01f64f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.881434', 5, 307, 4),
(1861, '[Ajay Khedkar] Hello,nI am recently staying at Awesome PG for boys from the 28 June 2025 to 10 Dec 2025. The my experience about PG is great. I want to tell you about my experience the environment was good. The facilities they provide are are top notch just like room,wifi, water purifier and giser system for winter season. The our caretaker didi is helpful and give you good suggestions for any problem is happen. The our owner Gourav Nanda Bhaiya is co-operative, loving nature. If any problem regarding rent and  room is happen they solve your problem as you tell them and their sense of humour is good also so they make you comfortable treat like you like their son. I recommend you to check in this PG for job workers, students and competitive exam aspirants. The main part of this PG is near railway station and metro so you can travel for your need and market place is near so you can buy things as per your need.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.881671', 5, 307, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1862, U&'[Me youn Me youn] Hello everyone! Whenever you visit Delhi, you can choose to stay at the Evergreen Guest House. I highly recommend this guest house; it offers excellent value at a very affordable price. You are welcome to stay here anytime you wish. The owner (Uncle) has a wonderful demeanor, and tiffin service is available 24 hours a day. Seriously, whenever you''re in town, give it a try\2014the rates are very reasonable. The staff behavior is excellent, the rooms are great, and the location is nice.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.888646', 5, 308, 4),
(1863, '[martianw2026] Its in centre of paharganj, which is very close to delhi central station.|It was nice place to stay and location is  perfect to visit other monumental sites in delhi. Staffs were nice and rooms were affordable plus clean. Its very in our budget.|Drinking water was available. |I would recommend it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.888795', 0, 308, 4),
(1864, '[meghraj singh] The hotel location was in perfect spot , walking distance from central station. The staffs were very nice and friendly. Very affordable rooms with A/c service. Drinking water was free. Great place to stay for quiet evening . Nice environment around.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.88897', 5, 308, 4),
(1865, U&'[\30b8\30ed\30b8\30ed\5ea7\53f3\885b\9580] The room was reasonable for the price. It may be a suitable option for travelers looking for a budget stay.nnHowever, the owner demonstrated an exceptionally attentive management style. He entered my room unexpectedly to carefully confirm whether I use illegal drugs or might be interested in them. It seems the property maintains very strict standards.nnHe also took the time to thoroughly inquire about my travel schedule, whether I had already arranged a driver or tour, and even how much cash I was carrying in my wallet. It was impressive to see such detailed attention given to a guest\2019s personal finances.nnWhen I explained that I do not use drugs, that my tour was already arranged, and that I only had 100 rupees in cash, he asked me that I might actually be carrying a 10,000 yen bill inside wallet. I was impressed by his level of insight.nnAll of the above are facts.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.889316', 5, 308, 4),
(1866, '[mahesh babariya] Vinod singh have very genuine personality with excellent accomodation and helpful staff. I will definitely recommend this location with all connectivity near by. Had great experience staying.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.889464', 5, 308, 4),
(1867, '[622oka] A long-established guesthouse in Paharganj, beloved by regulars.||The common areas are cleaned daily, ensuring a spotless environment.||There are many delicious restaurants nearby, and the owner is very helpful and willing to answer any questions you may have.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.889594', 0, 308, 4),
(1868, '[Roar Editz] People think that these type of guest house are dirty and not friendly but I''ve stayed there for 2 days and everything was nice and the behaviour of the owner was very polite and chill', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.889743', 5, 308, 4),
(1869, U&'[Nirmal Kushwaha] One of the best and cheap hotel for traveller. Maneger has good behaviour and ask about our day and tell suggest to make day better , I am satisfied to took a such a wonderful hotel \+01f3e8', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.889887', 5, 308, 4),
(1870, '[Romeo Rohith] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.896602', 5, 309, 4),
(1871, '[Ananya] Worst place to live in Delhi and the worst hostel I have ever seen in my life (I have lived in hostels all my life), they don''t clean washrooms for months on end, clean rooms once a week, paint is falling off, fans and lights don''t work, everything is useless, sockets stop working randomly, clean water is barely available, wardens are not helpful at all and the worst part their rents are those of good hostels but services poorer than motels and the staff is so rude as if it is a privilege for you to stay there and do not take your problems seriously at all, where is the 5000+ additional maintenance going, bribes?', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.904796', 1, 310, 4);         
