(1872, '[Wafa Pookunju] It''s a safe hostel rite in the heart of the city.  Provides good food and amenities. They have a very nice courtyard lawn too where one can do morning jog and exercises.nStayed here for almost 3 yrs and loved it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.905102', 5, 310, 4),
(1873, '[Malavika Rao] Clean, safe and well maintained. Locality is good and relatively close to Patel Chowk metro station. The food can be better and if ACs were allowed, it would be famtastic. Overall value for money', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.905287', 3, 310, 4),
(1874, '[Shreyash Mishra] They make you feel like you are at college or some school!! The staff is misbehaving. And they really don''t even have water to drink at night hours.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.905458', 1, 310, 4),
(1875, '[Moumita Das] Very good hostel, mainly foods and cleanliness', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.905621', 5, 310, 4),
(1876, '[Madhurima] I lived here for one year. Apart from food, everything was nice.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.905795', 4, 310, 4),
