(1878, '[Dr Sameerdev Kesarwani] High price', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.906151', 1, 310, 4),
(1879, '[Kabi Prasad Mallick] Best place to stay in the city! The PG is located very close to the metro, which makes daily travel super convenient. The location is in the heart of the town, so everything like markets, food spots, and essentials are nearby. Rooms are clean, well-maintained, and the environment feels safe and comfortable. The owner and staff are also very supportive and friendly. Highly recommended for students and working professionals looking for a hassle-free stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.911925', 5, 311, 4),
(1880, U&'[Vidushi Bhandari] Delhi\2019s most comfortable, affordable and safest PG, they provide best facilities in most modern way and the owner is very kind and wise person, I really feel glad to join this family.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.91213', 5, 311, 4),
(1881, '[Aniket Kumar] It was really nice experience in Sharma''s pg , all services are available, and specially the meal is amazing,  so hygienic and rent is affordable for students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.912275', 5, 311, 4),
(1882, '[shreya verma] Very kind owner', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.912409', 5, 311, 4),
