(1888, '[Varun kumar] Good in treatment for lady but very bad management,cleanings, junior doctors, bed shortage,doctors shortage....security not allowed to click more photos..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.925558', 1, 313, 4),
(1889, '[Harsharan Singh Sabharwal] Situated inside Lady Harding Hospital complex. Infrastructure is good. But can be improved for caring staff. They deserve it. Ample parking space and canteen 24 hours a day. Banking services and chemist is also there adjoining hostel building just a stone throw away. Stray dogs are there that''s the problem for new commers. Regular and old old nurses have no problem with them as they dogs are friendly with them. Lot''s of poor people came daily in this hospital for treatment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:56.925788', 4, 313, 4),
