(1897, '[Kunal Yadav] good and best girls pg in North campus delhi university Kamla Nagar jawahar nagar roop nagar near all colleges ramjas hansraj kmc miranada house drc all faci6 are good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.042382', 5, 315, 4),
(1898, '[Bhanu Yadav] Best girls pg in North campus delhi university all facilities are good staff and owner also good behaviour good best for girls safe and secure pg for girls', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.042536', 5, 315, 4),
(1899, '[Krit Kumar] Best pg in north campus all facilities are good highly recommend safe and secure for girls near all colleges', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.042683', 5, 315, 4),
(1900, '[Eram Zafar] Very nice , comfortable pg to live in. Very affordable, good food, 24hrs wifi available . Plus point and the greatest of all the owners are very friendly and very good they always listen to each and everyone''s problems and try to solve it in less than 24hrs.nHighly recommended', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.042833', 5, 315, 4),
(1901, U&'[Priyanshi Gangwar] Living since past 2 years and will continue my 3rd year here, completely satisfied with food and all other services..highly recommended \+01f44c\+01f44c', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.042968', 5, 315, 4),
(1902, '[Ajit Singh] Pg location is best owner is helpfull and has good experience in this industry best pg in North campus kamla nagar Delhi University', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.043106', 5, 315, 4),
(1903, '[Akansha Chauhan] Very nice PG. Facilitates are good even food is awesome. Proximity from all the north campus colleges.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.043245', 5, 315, 4),
(1904, '[Abhishek Diwaker] My cousin has been staying at North Campus Girls PG for some time now, and after visiting the place a few times, I can genuinely say it has a very positive atmosphere.nnOne thing that really stands out is the location. Being surrounded by lush green grounds, the area feels much fresher than many other parts of Delhi. The fresh air and open surroundings make it a pleasant place for students to live and study.nnThe rooms are spacious, clean, and well maintained. Another thing my cousin appreciates is that fresh vegetarian meals are cooked daily in the in-house kitchen, so there''s no need to depend on outside food. The food is hygienic, tasty, and served on time.nnThe Gupta family manages the PG personally, and they seem to take good care of the residents. Whenever I''ve visited, the staff has been polite and the environment has felt safe and well organized.nnConsidering the excellent location, spacious rooms, quality food, and overall facilities, I feel the charges are quite reasonable. It''s a place I would happily recommend to any student or working woman looking for comfortable accommodation near Delhi University.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.055228', 5, 316, 4),
(1905, '[Satishkumatkumar Kumar] My younger sister has been staying at North Campus Girls PG for the last few months, and as a brother, safety and comfort were my biggest concerns while selecting a place in Delhi. After visiting many options for a Girls PG Near Me and Girls PG in Delhi, this PG genuinely felt the most secure and professional.nThe management is very supportive, the environment is disciplined, and the rooms are neat, spacious, and well maintained. The food quality is also very good, which is a huge relief for parents and guardians. Facilities like AC rooms, WiFi, laundry, RO water, and proper security make it one of the best Girls PG in North Campus.nThe location near Delhi University, Kamla Nagar, and Vijay Nagar is extremely convenient for students. My sister feels comfortable and safe here, and that gives our family peace of mind. I would definitely recommend this place to anyone searching for a reliable and premium Girls Hostel in Delhi University North Campus.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.055398', 5, 316, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1906, '[Sunil Kumar] My daughter stayed at North Campus Girls PG for around 40 days while completing her DRDO Internship in Delhi. As a parent, my primary concern was her safety, comfort, and well-being in an unfamiliar city. I am happy to say that this PG met all our expectations.nThe management was cooperative and professional from the very beginning. The rooms were clean, spacious, and well-maintained, and the food served was hygienic and homely. Regular housekeeping and a disciplined environment gave us complete peace of mind during her stay.nThis Girls PG near Delhi University is an excellent option for students looking for short-term stay, internship accommodation, and temporary housing in Delhi. The location is convenient, and the atmosphere is suitable for serious students and interns.nI would confidently recommend this Girls PG in Delhi to parents whose daughters are coming for DRDO Internship, summer internship, training programs, coaching, entrance examinations, or academic projects. It is a safe and reliable place that truly feels like a home away from home.nThank you to the entire team for taking good care of my daughter during her internship period.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.05555', 5, 316, 4),
(1907, U&'[Dhiraj Rai] I\2019m writing this as a brother, and honestly, finding a safe and comfortable place for my sister in Delhi was my biggest concern. After a lot of searching, we finalized North Campus Girls PG \2013 Premium Girls Hostel, and it turned out to be the right decision.nnThe rooms are clean, spacious, and fully furnished with AC. The food quality is really good and hygienic, which was very important for us. What impressed me the most is the safety, management support, and overall environment\2014they genuinely take care of the girls staying here.nnThe location is perfect, very close to North Campus and easily accessible from GTB Nagar. My sister feels safe and comfortable, which gives our family peace of mind.nnIn my opinion, this is the Best Girls PG in Vijay Nagar Delhi for students looking for a secure and premium stay. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.055703', 5, 316, 4),
(1908, '[Mirav Tmmehrra] I had a wonderful experience staying at this Girls PG in Delhi. The rates are very reasonable for the quality of accommodation and services provided. The location is excellent, making it convenient for students and working professionals. The food is always fresh, tasty, and hygienically prepared in the in-house kitchen. The rooms and facilities are clean, spacious, and well maintained. The staff is friendly, supportive, and always ready to help. If you''re looking for a safe and comfortable Girls Hostel near Delhi University, I highly recommend this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.05584', 5, 316, 4),
(1909, '[Abhishek Kumar] I visited several Girls PGs before choosing North Campus Girls PG, and this one truly stands out. The biggest advantage is its lush green surroundings facing the Delhi University Ground and Polo Ground. The fresh air and peaceful atmosphere make it a wonderful place to live and study.nnThe rooms are spacious, clean, well-maintained, and available at a reasonable price compared to many other Girls PGs in North Delhi. The food is hygienic, the staff is supportive, and the overall environment feels safe and comfortable.nnIf you are searching for a Girls PG in Delhi University North Campus or a Girls Hostel near Delhi University, I would definitely recommend this place. It offers excellent value for money with quality accommodation in a prime location.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.055973', 5, 316, 4),
(1910, '[Anshu Anshu] If anyone is searching for a Girls PG in GTB Nagar or Girls PG in Vijay Nagar, I would definitely recommend this place. Safe environment, good management, timely meals, lift facility, laundry, and a peaceful atmosphere make it a perfect choice for students as well as working women. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.056181', 5, 316, 4),
(1911, '[Rekha Devi] As a parent, I explored many options for a girls PG near me in Delhi and visited several girls PG in GTB Nagar and Vijay Nagar Delhi University North Campus.nnThis PG looked more structured and secure. Rooms are furnished properly, and safety arrangements are in place. My daughter feels comfortable staying here.nnIt is a dependable girls PG in Delhi for students coming from outside.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.056322', 5, 316, 4);        
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1912, '[Sonam Mishra] Worst hostel to live in.nWater scarcity,no clean washrooms and pathetic room conditions and worst behaviour of wardens.n(Most honest review as i have lived there during my first year (2023)nLiterally there were days when we had to roam around all the blocks in search of drinking water specially in the month of may and june. Now talking about hostel staffnSpecially two lady hostel wardens, literally they dont know how to behave with students and deal with the conditions in more polite manner.nNumber of students remain absent for the whole night and they( staffs) dont even get to know about that as no proper attention is given to the students'' attention by these ladies.nMany of the students who are failing in their exams or getting backlogs are still residing in this hostel as the staffs are not vigilant enough.nnIf you are getting something good in this hostel that is the space to live as they have a ground and few trees to watch.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.066308', 1, 317, 4),
(1913, U&'[Shailendra Singh] My experience here was incredibly disappointing \+01f629. There was no water available, which made everything inconvenient and uncomfortable. I found the lack of basic amenities to be a significant issue. This place completely failed to meet even the most fundamental expectations \+01f4a7\+01f6ab.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.066465', 2, 317, 4),
(1914, '[Shilpa Mahato] Such an amazing experience to visit undergraduate hostel for girls University of Delhi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.066599', 5, 317, 4),
(1915, '[Ruchi Yadav] Best out of best .nDelhi University hostel are best place in delhi for du students . In food , environment , security all are on 10/10 .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.066798', 5, 317, 4),
(1916, '[Pragya Kaushal] Hostel for post graduate students of University of Delhi. Double occupancy rooms. Surrounded by lavish green gardens. Very spacious, hygienic and serene.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.066929', 5, 317, 4),
(1917, '[Jaishree Jainth] This is the best place one can dream for hostel of girls . Fresh air , food is served thrice .Rules and regulations are strict .and you have occasionally party like dandia night .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.067144', 5, 317, 4),
(1918, U&'[Dikshita Borah] RGHG is widely praised for its beautiful campus-style setting, safety, and facilities for female postgrad researchers. It\2019s an excellent option if you value greenery, quiet, and a structured, secure atmosphere.nnAt the same time\2014especially if you''re concerned about day-to-day comfort\2014be aware that students have flagged occasional deficiencies in amenities (especially water, AC, Wi-Fi) and some friction with administration. Still, student action has, in recent years, successfully prompted maintenance and improvements.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.067402', 5, 317, 4),
(1919, '[aditya raj] Very good and big hostel for delhi university girls', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.067535', 5, 317, 4),
(1920, '[Riya gupta Hh] Swati Working Women Hostel was established by NDMC to provide safe and secure accommodation to working women only. But for the last several months the environment here has become very unsafe and unpleasant.nnThe issues are as follows:nn**1. Illegal Stay by Ineligible Persons**nMs. Nisha Pal has been residing in the hostel for the last 2 years. She has taken admission by submitting fake/false documents. She is a student and not a working woman. This is a clear violation of NDMC hostel rules. There are 2-3 other such girls also.nn**2. Misbehavior and Harassment**nMs. Nisha Pal regularly misbehaves with other residents. She talks in a very rude and abusive manner. She has no manners of speaking. She creates unnecessary fights and quarrels and makes the environment tense. Many girls are scared to talk to her.nn**3. Theft from Common Areas**nShe has a habit of stealing food items, fruits, milk and other eatables from the common refrigerator. Many residents including me have lost our food items. When we ask her, she denies and misbehaves further.nn**4. Gross Negligence by Warden**nWe have brought all these matters to the notice of the Warden Madam multiple times. But she has ignored all complaints. She is not doing any verification of residents. She is not maintaining discipline and not taking any action against Ms. Nisha Pal. Due to her inaction, illegal residents are getting encouraged.nnBecause of all this, genuine working women are facing mental harassment, insecurity and financial loss. The basic purpose of the hostel is getting defeated.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.076794', 1, 318, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1921, '[sharda fulwariya] So much clean and affordable. But food is not upto the mark', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.076981', 4, 318, 4),
(1922, '[Yogita Jain] Worst place inhave ever lived... The doors are not closing properly of the balcony due to which cold breeze continuously comes in winters and hot wind in summer will eventually make you sick...nI have asked to shift me some vegetarian girl but was placed with a non veg eating girl who use go cook eggsnLift facility is not there we have to walk till fifth floor again and againnFood is worst here and they also charged me extra amount before leaving the hostelnDon''t take it it''s worst', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.077279', 1, 318, 4),
(1923, '[Pragati] wati Working Girls'' Hostel is a girls hostel and student dormitory located in New Delhi, Delhi. The street address of this place is J5JX+H8C, Mandir Marg, Pocket H, Type 2, President''s Estate, New Delhi, Delhi 110001, India. It is about 1.37 kilometers away from the New Delhi railway station.Swati Working Girls'' Hostel is nearly 0.82 kilometers away from Shivaji Stadium Metro Station. You can go to this metro station by using the Metro MRT Orange Line.New Delhi railway station is the nearest railway station to Swati Working Girls'' Hostel. It is nearly 1.37 kilometers away from it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.077418', 3, 318, 4),
(1924, '[Vibha Shakya] One of the worst PG''s. Only good thing they have is their interior. They don''t have water coolers. When asked, many girls informed that the water coolers are not working from past 2 years. More than 100s of mails have been done by the girls and still no action has been taken against the mails. Mess doors are locked and drinking water is not available at any floor. If any girl forgets or gets late to fill her water bottle, she will be thirsty all night. Worst environment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.077574', 1, 318, 4),
(1925, '[Uma Maheswari] Located at the main area and is easy to access any part by metro/bus. Maintained properly,neatly and the people who are working are very kind enough to move. The only problem I face is the type of food supplied(variety and not the quality or quantity) being south Indian who like to eat green vegetables with less oil.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.077712', 5, 318, 4),
(1926, '[Preeti Rathee] Very bad .... Food is not of good quality , only oil  chilli powder find in sabji . Food is not according to menu decided by them . Only potatoes and pumpkin given. No proper water purifier. Water quality is very poor. Wrost quality of tea. No healthy food included in menu . You can''t sleep properly due to the traffic sounds. So that you may irritate the whole day due to insufficient sleep.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.077862', 1, 318, 4),
(1927, '[Babar Khan] Found it to be good for working women. Though it cannot be compared to other hostels like YWCA. Looks very secure place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.07806', 4, 318, 4),
(1928, '[Aditi Tanwar] The best hostel any child can opt for a comfortable stay.nThey provide fresh and tasty food.nThe rooms are well ventilated and clean.nAlso the owners are very kind and helpful. I have also seen other hostel,say Asha hostels,Bansal hostel and many more but this is much much better.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.114194', 5, 322, 4),
(1929, '[Sunaina Kradiya] Best hostel for aakshiansnThey provide fresh, healthy and tasty mealsnAlso their rooms are cleaned, ventilated and good study environment and owner of the hostel is so cooperative and supportive and here warden are well behaved, caring and so cooperative', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.114346', 5, 322, 4),
(1930, '[Suhana Khan] It is the best hostel near aakash institute food quality here is really so good I recommended every student to choose kapoor hostel the owner of the hostel always motivate students for their studies they are very helpful and friendly and warden here are very well behaved', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.114481', 5, 322, 4),
(1931, '[navneet saini] One of the best hostel in this area as compared to other ones in the vicinity..nGood management of resources, best food quality, homely environment with neat u0026 clean peacefull rooms.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.114619', 5, 322, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1932, '[Harsimran Singh] Kapoor hostel is one of the BEST accommodation facility for other state students.nProvides proper safety and hygienic rooms along with all the basic amenities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.114765', 5, 322, 4),
(1933, '[AMAN MALHOTRA] One of the best, safest,  cleanest place for students to live. This place provides a good environment for students to live and study. It''s a smoke free and  Air conditioned space providing full comfort  to live.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.114906', 5, 322, 4),
(1934, '[Chef Suraj Chadha] Good place to stay for students. Feels like proper hostel environment and nicely maintained and great service by staff and have very spacious rooms and liked it very much.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.115032', 5, 322, 4),
(1935, '[Nazahat Umar] it''s a best hostel near Aakash Institute with all the facilities available. The food is good nd hygienic and the owners are also very kind nd helpful.  i would recommend everyone to have a stay in this hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.115173', 5, 322, 4),
(1936, U&'[Mahima Porwal] A very convenient place to live in Delhi, specially if you preparing for upsc or any  competitive examination.nSpacious air conditioned rooms, canteen area, 24\00d77 ac library, washing machine and also equipped with all the basic amenities. Environment and culture of the hostel is also very supportive and good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.224892', 5, 323, 4),
(1937, '[Shalakha Bang] A good place with perfect combination of Studious environment, helping aspirants, mentor support, peaceful library (both AC and Non AC), Spacious living and dining area. Most important - always ready to help management team and hostel warden.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.225066', 5, 323, 4),
(1938, '[Garima Mundra] Infra is really good, very spacious rooms, unlike most hostels in the area. Plus very well maintained.nProvides a supportive environment for upsc prep.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.225262', 5, 323, 4),
(1939, '[ABHISHEK TOSHNIWAL] A boon for maheshwari samaj students. Great hostel for students preparing for different examinations which require great deal of hardwork and concentration. Good rooms, good food, good ambiance, etc all at reasonable rates.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.225441', 5, 323, 4),
(1940, '[Krishna Rathi] The hostel with best in class facilities with optimum cost, suits perfect for UPSC aspirants. Food quality u0026 quantity both were never compromised!!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.225588', 5, 323, 4),
(1941, '[Pragyam Maheshwari] It is very good, 2 kms for karol bagh metro,  good connectivity with bus stop right in front of the hostel. Rooms on sharing basis, 2 people in 1 room', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.225712', 5, 323, 4),
(1942, U&'[Sunny Maheshwari] Best Hostel for upsc aspirants ...good facilities , 24\00d77 library , free WiFi , good food and neat and clean rooms ...\+01f4ab', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.225835', 5, 323, 4),
(1943, '[Vaibhav Daga] One of the best hostels for students....along with all modern day requirements and good food.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.225971', 5, 323, 4),
(1944, '[BHAVYA SHARMA] Great hostel with proper cleanliness and spacious rooms and all facilities available. Great food and great and helping owners.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.276751', 5, 326, 4),
(1945, '[SHEERSTA GUPTA] I had a wonderful experience at Anu Girls Hostel. The rooms are impressively spacious and impeccably clean. One of the standout features is that each room comes with an attached washroom, which is a real perk compared to other accommodations with shared facilities. For any girl starting her journey at MAIT, I highly recommend considering this hostel for a comfortable and convenient stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.276934', 5, 326, 4),
(1946, '[Bhumika Y] A second home indeed.Lived here for my entire college life.nLocated within walking distance of the college - making commute super easy.Rooms are hygienic,spacious and airy ventilated.nAffordable rates with good food and the owner is genuinely kind and caring.Had a very pleasant experience overall!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.277135', 5, 326, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1947, '[Simran yadav] The rooms are spacious, hygienic too.... Atmosphere is also friendly and supportive.... I had a great experience as it offered me a perfect blend of comfort , safety and convenience...and I highly recommend this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.277284', 5, 326, 4),
(1948, '[Rupali negi] Home like environment with good food and ambience. Owners are very caring and treat you like family. Rooms are spacious and clean. Best place to stay in rohini if you''re looking for a pg or hostel near maharaja agrasen college.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.277413', 5, 326, 4),
(1949, '[jiya khatri] The hostel is well maintained with cleaning of the rooms on regular basis . 4 meals a day are served timely ensuring full hygiene. The owners are friendly and understanding.Would definitely recommend this pg .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.277537', 5, 326, 4),
(1950, '[Mansi Goel] Best place to stay in rohini. Have lived here for 4 consecutive years of my college life. I''m a student of MAIT. Anu di is really friendly and kind. Rates are also nominal and food is really good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.277655', 5, 326, 4),
(1951, U&'[Anshi Bhardwaj] Excellent PG I\2019ve stayed here myself and it was a wholesome experience! best pg in town for girls everyone was very caring and environment is safe and the food was also good! Totally worth it', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.277778', 5, 326, 4),
(1952, U&'[Komal Verma] Best PG in Laxmi Nagar with delicious food, excellent security, and a clean, hygienic environment. The owners are extremely helpful, cooperative, and always available whenever needed, making you feel safe and well cared for. It\2019s also a perfect place for students, offering a peaceful and comfortable atmosphere for studying. If you\2019re planning to shift to a PG, there\2019s truly no need to think twice \2014 one of the best places to stay when you\2019re away from home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.288313', 5, 327, 4),
(1953, '[Karman Bajwa] I had a wonderful stay at this PG and would highly recommend it to anyone looking for a comfortable place to live. The PG is newly built, beautifully furnished, and equipped with all the amenities you need for a comfortable stay.nnOne of the best things about this place is its cleanliness. Housekeeping is done every day, and the hygiene standards are excellent. The food is genuinely delicious, and I really enjoyed every meal. They even allow you to pack your food and take it to the office, which is a huge plus.nnThe owners are extremely kind, approachable, and always check in to make sure there are no issues. The Wi-Fi works perfectly, there are washing facilities for clothes, a lift for convenience, and a refrigerator to store your food.nnOverall, everything is thoughtfully managed, making it feel like a home away from home. I truly loved my stay here and would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a clean, well-maintained, and welcoming place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.288469', 5, 327, 4),
(1954, '[Astha Mishra] I had a really comfortable and pleasant experience staying at this PG. The rooms were clean, well-maintained, and had all the basic amenities required for a hassle-free stay. The hygiene standards were impressive, and regular cleaning was ensured.nnThe food quality was decent and homely, which made it feel like a second home. The staff and management were polite, helpful, and always available in case of any issues. Security was also well taken care of, which gave a sense of safety.nnThe location of the PG is another major plus point, as it is well-connected to nearby markets, public transport, and essential facilities.nnOverall, it is a great place to stay for students or working professionals looking for a comfortable, safe, and affordable accommodation. I would definitely recommend this PG to others.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.288661', 5, 327, 4),
(1955, '[Rajnandini Harichandan] Staying in this PG has honestly felt like a second home. The rooms are very luxurious, spacious, and always kept super clean and hygienic. The environment here is peaceful and comfortable, which makes living away from home much easier.nnThe owner uncle and aunty are one of the best parts of this PG, they are extremely kind, caring, and supportive. They genuinely take care of everyone like their own children and are always there whenever needed.nnMeals are provided on time every day, and the food is also really tasty and homely. The cook bhaiyas are very polite and hardworking, and they make sure the food quality is always maintained. Special appreciation to the cleaner aunty as well, she is always on time and cleans the rooms daily without fail, keeping the entire place neat and fresh.nnThe overall management, safety, cleanliness, and positive atmosphere here are truly amazing. I would highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a safe, comfortable, and family-like place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.288794', 5, 327, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1956, U&'[SMRITI SHARMA] A genuinely wonderful experience staying at this PG. The biggest advantage is definitely the location and connectivity \2014 Laxmi Nagar Metro Station is just a 2-minute walk away, and the bus stand is also within 5 minutes walking distance, making commuting extremely convenient. On top of that, everything you need for daily life is easily available nearby, so the location is really perfect.nnThe rooms are spacious, clean, fully furnished , well-maintained, and properly equipped with all the necessary amenities . The availability of attached washrooms, WiFi facility, and lift access makes the stay even more comfortable and convenient. The hygiene and overall maintenance of the PG are also very well taken care of.nnAnd the absolute cherry on the cake is the food. The food here is genuinely delicious and homely.nIt\2019s one of the major reasons that makes this place feel so comfortable and welcoming.nnAnother thing worth appreciating is the owners \2014 Uncle and Aunty are extremely kind, understanding, and cooperative. They are always approachable and helpful whenever needed. The staff members are also polite, supportive, and well-behaved, which creates a very positive and friendly environment.nnOverall, staying here has been a really pleasant and stress-free experience. A perfect combination of excellent connectivity, comfortable rooms, great facilities, amazing food, and caring people. Would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable and hassle-free stay in Laxmi Nagar.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.288919', 5, 327, 4),
(1957, U&'[S Shanthi] I had an amazing experience at Shyam Ji Girls Pg! The facilities are top-notch, and the environment is so welcoming and safe. I especially loved the friendly Manoj Gupta uncle and aunty for caring. Very near to Laxmi nagar metro station. This was my first visit to delhi, I feel like home and This was my room where I stayed u0026 Highly recommend it!  . Whoever is searching in around this area \+01f60a\+01f3e1\2728', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.28905', 5, 327, 4),
(1958, '[Jigeesha] The PG is located very close to Laxmi Nagar Metro Station (Gate No. 3 and 4), which makes commuting across Delhi very convenient. The area itself is quite comfortable for daily living, with markets and all essential shops nearby.nnThe rooms are clean and decently spacious. The food quality is also satisfactory. The staff and management are generally cooperative and approachable. Overall, it is a good option for someone looking to stay in this locality.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.289258', 5, 327, 4),
(1959, U&'[pallavi malla] I had a really good experience staying at this hostel. The food is one of the best parts it\2019s fresh, tasty, and feels like home-cooked meals, which is a big comfort.nnThe hostel also maintains a strong focus on safety, which made me feel secure throughout my stay. The management is attentive and ensures that proper rules are followed.nnAnother great thing is the maintenance. The rooms, washrooms, and common areas are kept clean and well-managed regularly.nnOverall, it\2019s a comfortable, safe, and well maintained place to stay with good food.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.28939', 5, 327, 4),
(1960, U&'[Mousumi Sarma] Staying at Desire Hostel in Delhi turned out to be one of the best days of my trip everytime. The place has a very warm and welcoming vibe. The staff is kind, approachable, and always ready to help, which makes a big difference.nThe rooms were clean, comfortable, and thoughtfully maintained. Everything felt simple yet well-managed, creating a relaxed and stress-free environment. It\2019s the kind of place where you can actually unwind after a long day.nWhat really stands out is the vibe of the hostel. It\2019s calm, friendly, and easygoing. Whether you want to meet new people or just enjoy some quiet time, it gives you the perfect balance. It never feels chaotic or overwhelming like some hostels can be. It truly felt like a cozy and safe place to stay. The location is also a plus, making it convenient to explore the city without much hassle. Overall, I had a genuinely great experience here. Desire Hostel is a perfect choice if you\2019re looking for a comfortable, affordable, and welcoming place to stay. I would definitely love to come back again.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.300603', 5, 328, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1961, '[609amardeepc] Every thing is good but they are a lier about being fully air-conditioned. AC is only available at night not in day time. If you are planning to take rest in morning or afternoon forget about it. Sometimes they even turn of the fan. Rest of the things are good. And yes dont bring your car with you.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.30154', 0, 328, 4),
(1962, '[Lore Monique] Hostel needs serious update. The pictures are old and not depicting the reality.  Should be cleaned properly. Bedbucks were there. The host was helpful but they need to take complaints like this serious and change their accommodation to the norms of today''s international travel standards.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.301728', 2, 328, 4),
(1963, U&'[Divya Bakshi] Conveniently located with easy access to Malviya Nagar Market and public transport and essential services. Rooms are decent in size and generally clean. Housekeeping is regular ,though sometimes improvements can be made in maintaining bathrooms. Reasonable pricing considering facilities and location. Overall a good stay \+01f603', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.301862', 5, 328, 4),
(1964, U&'[chaitanya kulkarni] THE IMAGES ONLINE ARE FAKE AND NOTHING LIKE THE REAL HOSTEL.nnPaid for the whole day even though I was meant to only use the room to sleep as my flight only landed at 3am in the morning. As I went in the hostel, it was dusty and leakage marks on the walls. The room was used before me to probably have a quickie by someone else. The bed was used and was in a mess. There were lipstick marks, multiple hair strands, dried fluid marks on the bed. As well as cigarette buds, spilled water, and dirty shoe marks in the room.n\200bThis place is disgusting.n\200bI am sure this property is used by couple on short term basis in the nighttime as the room next to mine was occupied when I reached, but the occupants had left by around 6AM when I decided to leave and check in into a different hotel.n\200bThis hostel is nothing and I repeat NOTHING like what is shown in the listing.nnPeople without any basic hygiene or self respect should consider this hostel to stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.301991', 1, 328, 4),
(1965, U&'[Sakshi Bakshi] Heistal Delhi is clean, cozy, and well-managed. The staff is friendly, the atmosphere is welcoming, and it\2019s a great spot for both solo travelers and groups. Highly recommended for a comfortable stay in Delhi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.30212', 5, 328, 4),
(1966, U&'[Kamal Sharma] The Desire Hostel has become like my Delhi home. I\2019ve stayed here on three different occasions throughout the past year and the staff is always friendly, Especially Mr. Rohit (Manager) is a great host, He really take care of everyone, he knows very well how to attend their guests. He was very supportive in anyway. The space is cleaned often.The guests are mostly young, friendly u0026 traveling for work or school and a few tourists like myself. There\2019s a lovely gated neighborhood and park nearby to stroll through, and the nearby bus will take you anywhere you need to go. The room and bathroom were in good condition, service requests were quick. hostel for low budget travellers and it was a great experience. Everything was efficient and smooth. The place is well maintained. Staff is cordial and we had no issues throughout.nAlways happy to stay- thank you Desire staff! I will definitely be staying here again. Great experience staying here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.302256', 5, 328, 4),
(1967, '[theculturetrails] Amazing and affordable place to stay if you are planning to stay around south delhi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.302384', 5, 328, 4),
(1968, '[Pragya Pathak] This is one of the best girls'' PGs in Delhi. It''s completely safe with CCTV cameras installed throughout the property. The owners are very supportive and resolve any issues promptly. The cook maintains excellent cleanliness and hygiene standards, and the food is great too. I highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a safe, comfortable, and well-managed place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.313161', 5, 329, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1969, '[muskan chauhan] The PG is clean and well maintained. Rooms are decent and facilities like Wi-Fi, food, and laundry are available. The staff and owner are cooperative. Security is good and the location is convenient for students/working people. Overall it is a good place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.313297', 4, 329, 4),
(1970, '[Palak] Stayed here for 4 months, located at a nice place close to the metro, rooms are comfy, food is also good overall hygiene is maintained! Pg owner is also very sweet :)', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.313442', 5, 329, 4),
(1971, '[Sannu] One of the best girls PG in the area! Clean rooms, good security, peaceful environment and homely food. The management is very helpful and always available if needed. I feel safe and comfortable here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.313578', 5, 329, 4),
(1972, '[Ambili PT] I have stayed here for six months. I can vouch that the rooms are clean, well maintained and all required facilities are available at disposal. I highly recommend for any female working professional/students to choose this place for their stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.313701', 5, 329, 4),
(1973, '[Smita Pattanaik] Good place to stay if you want a unpretentious, affordable and comfortable place. There is prompt response upon any sort of complain, housekeeping is regularly done.Food was not consistently good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.313842', 4, 329, 4),
(1974, '[Neeti] My PG experience is quite good. The food is nice with a vast menu, which is really convenient for me. The location is also good, as it''s situated in a spot where public transport is easily available. The staff is friendly and nice, which makes the overall experience even better. I would highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable and convenient place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.313973', 4, 329, 4),
(1975, '[Valli SuryaTejaswini Mekala] The best pg one can find in Delhi. Rajni aunty here cares like your own people. Seema aunty makes healthy and great food like home and never let you leave on empty stomach for work and raj Kumar di cleans the room and washrooms every other day.if u r hygiene freak this pg is a best choice . Aunty resolves any problem in a day .I enjoyed my three month stay here and hope you will too.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.314111', 5, 329, 4),
(1976, '[Aarya Jha] The biggest asset of Kakkar''s PG is the homely environment the owners offer with unconditional love. You''ll miss your home a little less.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.326953', 5, 330, 4),
(1977, '[Sahil Minhas] This is one of the best places to stay in Delhi. They are very good ppl when it comes to services. My sister stayed in here for more than 10 months and her experience was pretty good. Good and Honest people to take care of you. You can definitely go for it without a doubt.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.327117', 5, 330, 4),
(1978, '[amita srivastava] Best places to stay in Delhi and that too like living at home. Been there for 4 years, and never felt alone. Sumedha ji is so charming. She take care of everyone as her child only.nNeat and clean place with good security and people around. Nothing to worry once you are here. A highly recommended PG for Girls.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.327247', 5, 330, 4),
(1979, '[akash sharma] Cool family when I talk about environment here. My daughter, Maanu has stayed in here for 2 years and her experience was pretty good. She always felt like her second home here.nSumedha ji took care of her like her own daughter. What else we can expect from someone outside. I was never worried about her. Sumedha Ji was really cooperative at every instance, no matter what time it is.nThe services as well given were excellent. Nice Experience. A must recommend PG!!! You can choose this place without any second thought.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.327379', 5, 330, 4),
(1980, '[SYED NAZISH] I had personally spend around  1.5 months in thiz girls pg . My personal experience , i can say that don''t go for it if u want to be safe . Be alert the family is not good as seems . Doing harrasment towards students . They even not provide better food to the students , in this house there is no respect for the human dignity , stone hearted persons are living there . As i spend only 1.5 months then i got to know this much about them . So friends i request u to , while going fo a pg be careful ,always remember u can first investigate from neighbours , be safe and carefully .nIn this pg i didn''t feel safe as there was cameras all around even near washroom with recorder . U cannot enjoy ur personal security as u was under cctv surveillance . In this pg u feel like as a prisoner .nU will even not feel safe while calling ur parents  . U may be thinking all had commented good why I am doing this ...nFriends while reading comment juzt check the ids even boys had commented here but this a home  for a girls my personal opinion itz known as jail , as prisoner the girls who goes there .nThe owner of pg locked my friends inside room  while they were going to left the pg she was saying that she is going in a loss in her  business .   Itz totally harrasment to the students .nWhile others went to help my friends she through out there luggage even , and harrassing them too . Itz very bad experience in this pg  . So while looking for a pg be careful . Bad pg i can call it a hell .....', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.327509', 1, 330, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1981, '[Rhonda Kakkar] I have never felt more at home and cared for than I did during my stay here.  The home is clean, comfortable and full of loving people.  I would recommend this pg to anyone.  It is a home away from home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.327967', 5, 330, 4),
(1982, '[Sana Muti] Homely atmosphere with all the facilities! The food served here is amazing and gives a home like feeling. Best place for college students. Love this PG!!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.328101', 5, 330, 4),
(1983, '[Gunjan Gogia] One of the Best hostel in North Delhi..a home away from home for girls. hygienic,good quality of food, good and friendly environment,a safe place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.32859', 5, 330, 4),
(1984, U&'[Khushi Here] Living here is honestly a nightmare. There\2019s no permanent staff \2014 the aunty literally disappears without notice, leaving everything unmanaged. And if you try reaching out for help, good luck with that because the owner is extremely rude and uncooperative. He genuinely doesn\2019t care about anything except taking your money.nnThe lift doesn\2019t work, the main gate doesn\2019t lock, and there\2019s zero security. Add all this to the fact that the rent is way too expensive for what\2019s being offered \2014 you\2019re basically paying a premium price to live in a mess.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.33967', 1, 331, 4),
(1985, U&'[Aamir Iqbal (Farhan)] Nice \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.339911', 5, 331, 4),
(1986, '[zain khan] Is there nothing like girls pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.340134', 2, 331, 4),
(1987, '[Mohammad Aziz] very nice girls hostel, safe and clean room,', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.340272', 5, 331, 4),
(1988, '[Divyansh Singh] It is very nice place for studying and staying', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.340481', 5, 331, 4),
(1989, '[Latif mumtaz] There is no pg contact no. Share the contact on this add', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.340681', 1, 331, 4),
(1990, '[Pragati Shukla] What is the monthly fees of this pg????', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.340878', 1, 331, 4),
(1991, '[Shah Faisal Faridi] Safe PG For Girls', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.340997', 5, 331, 4),
(1992, '[Papender Kumar] I stayed at Working Women Hostel in Delhi for several months while working in Central Delhi, and my experience was very positive. The hostel is clean, secure, and well-managed. The rooms are comfortable, housekeeping is regular, and the meals are fresh and hygienic.nnOne of the biggest advantages is the convenient location and easy connectivity to offices, metro stations, and major commercial areas. The staff is supportive and always available when needed, which makes it a comfortable option for women staying away from home.nnIf you are searching for a Working Women Hostel near Connaught Place or a Ladies Hostel near me, this is definitely a good place to consider. The environment is safe, peaceful, and suitable for both students and working professionals.nnHighly recommended for anyone looking for a reliable and comfortable stay in Delhi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.354365', 5, 332, 4),
(1993, '[Ram Raajbeer] My sister has been staying at this Working Women Hostel in Delhi, and our family is very satisfied with the experience. The hostel provides a safe, clean, and comfortable environment for girls and working women. The rooms are spacious, well-maintained, and the staff is supportive.nnOne of the biggest advantages is its scenic location opposite Delhi University Ground and Polo Ground. The greenery and open surroundings create a peaceful atmosphere, which is quite rare in Delhi. The area feels safe and pleasant for daily walks and commuting.nnThe food quality is good, hygiene is maintained, and the overall facilities are excellent. I would highly recommend this hostel to parents, students, and working professionals looking for secure and premium accommodation in North Delhi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.354534', 5, 332, 4),
(1994, '[Kiran] Stayed at this amazing Working Women Hostel in Delhi located in Vijay Nagar and had a very comfortable experience. The rooms are clean, spacious and well maintained. Food quality is really good and the environment is safe for girls and working professionals.nnOne of the best options for anyone searching for a Working Women Hostel in Vijay Nagar, Girls PG in Delhi, or Working Women PG near North Campus.nnThe location is very convenient for office-going girls and students. Facilities like 4 times tasty meals, WiFi, AC rooms, laundry, RO water etc. are properly managed. The staff is polite and supportive.nnHighly recommended for girls looking for a safe and premium Working Women Hostel near Delhi University.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.354677', 5, 332, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(1995, '[Narang Eye Hospital] My sister has been staying here for the past few months, and our family is very satisfied with the facilities and overall environment. The hostel is clean, well-maintained, and provides a safe atmosphere for working women.nnThe staff is supportive, and the meals are served regularly.nnWe visited several options while searching for a Ladies Hostel Near Me, and this property stood out because of its cleanliness, security arrangements, and convenient location.nnIt is also a good choice for anyone looking for a Working Women Hostel Near Cannaught Place with comfortable accommodation and essential facilities.nnI would definitely recommend it to working professionals and families looking for a reliable place for their daughters or sisters.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.354813', 5, 332, 4),
(1996, '[Rajhans Maitreya] Staying here was a good experience. Nice, Gentle, overall Good experience of my Daughter during her internship in Delhi. Well connected with Metro. You can say best working women hostel in Delhi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.354949', 5, 332, 4),
(1997, '[singh kishan] My sister is working at GTB Nagar and is residing at the Pg and found most suitable working woman hostel in North campus. She is fully satisfied with the location, Food Quality and maintenance.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.355169', 5, 332, 4),
(1998, '[Punam Arora] Excellent in all way. It''s a well connected place from Metro. All facilities are awesome. Management is co-operative.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.355307', 5, 332, 4),
(1999, '[surender kumar] Very safe and secure hostel. All required facilities are available. Staff is very co-operative.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.355442', 5, 332, 4),
(2000, '[Abhishek Virkar] I had a satisfactory experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean, adequately maintained, and reasonably spacious, offering a comfortable living environment. The washrooms are kept hygienic, and regular housekeeping helps maintain cleanliness. The Wi-Fi connection is stable and suitable for both work and general use.nnThe owner is approachable and responsive to concerns when required. CCTV surveillance is available on the premises, contributing to a sense of security. The location is convenient, with access to public transport and essential amenities nearby.nnOverall, it is a suitable option for those looking for a well-maintained and conveniently located accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.392989', 5, 335, 4),
(2001, '[AKSHAR ADITYA SEC-C 2022] The stay was really comfortable. I have stayed in the PG for two months consecutively and never felt the need to look for a place anywhere else. Every complaint was catered to momentarily and promptly. If anyone is looking for a stay which can be longer than usual, this PG is highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.39316', 5, 335, 4),
(2002, '[Udayangshu Sharma] The place is well-managed and ideal for students. I had a short stay of one and a half month for internship. The PG has all necessary facilities like 24/7 wifi, water filter, fridge, AC, attached washrooms. The location is ideal and the markets nearby. It is a great accomodation specially for students who are interning in Delhi for a month or two.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.393288', 5, 335, 4),
(2003, U&'[Parag Yadav] Nice PG for 3 month or 6 month stay or may be even longer best environments best part there''s a park as well so good for students peaceful place and budget friendly \2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.393421', 5, 335, 4),
(2004, '[Rameshwar Ghade] I am currently staying here. It is really good experience to stay here. Nicely maintained rooms and proximity to a garden makes it even better.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.393554', 5, 335, 4),
(2005, '[vedant sharma] One of the best stay to have, as it is near to almost everything, also there is no interference from mam whatsoever and the issues get resolve instantly if you gave any. Highly recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.393694', 5, 335, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2006, '[Zabiulla Zabi] I stayed in this PG for 6 months and my experience was amazing. The place is very safe, comfortable, and well-maintained. All the facilities were provided properly and everything was managed very well. The environment was peaceful and homely, which made my stay very enjoyable.nnSpecial thanks to the landowners for being so kind, supportive, and cooperative throughout my stay. They always ensured our safety and comfort, which truly made a difference.nnI would highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a safe and comfortable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.393824', 5, 335, 4),
(2007, '[sri R] I first came to stay for 6 months, but I ended up living in the PG for almost 2 years. It is a safe and well-maintained place. The rooms are clean, and both the rooms and common areas are cleaned every day. If there were any problems with the AC, electricity, restrooms, geysers, or drinking water, they were fixed quickly.nnThe owner is very helpful and always supported me. In the end, it felt like living with a family. I did face some small local problems, but the owner always tried to solve them. I had a good experience and made many nice memories at this PG.nAnyone coming from another state or city will find this PG very safe. I highly recommend it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.393945', 5, 335, 4),
(2008, U&'[Daksh Middha] Comfortable PG with proper facilities. Clean rooms and cooperative owner. No basic issues faced. \+01f64f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.416612', 5, 337, 4),
(2009, '[Aayush Chhatpuria] Nice place to stay. Good cleanliness, good food, and no power or water problems. Owner is supportive.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.416758', 5, 337, 4),
(2010, '[Rishabh Jha] Clean and well maintained. Owner responsive and considerate. Would definitely recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.416895', 5, 337, 4),
(2011, '[Anurag 5949] Comfortable PG with proper facilities.nClean rooms and coperative owner.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.417025', 5, 337, 4),
(2012, '[archit agrawal] It is a nice place to stay, with comfortable rooms, good homely food and a family atmosphere', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.417156', 5, 337, 4),
(2013, '[abhinandan sharma] Well managed PG. Hygiene is good , food is good and services are smooth.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.417287', 5, 337, 4),
(2014, '[Ankitesh Ojha] i dont think there is a better pg than this in delhi', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.417415', 5, 337, 4),
(2015, '[Mayank Dubey] Comfortable PG with proper facilities. Clean rooms and cooperative owner. No basic issues faced.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.41754', 5, 337, 4),
(2016, U&'[Shreya Chaturvedi] Excellent PG with a Homely Environment!nThe best part is the kind and caring aunty who treats everyone like family and is always ready to help. The food served is hygienic, and feels just like home-cooked meals. Special food is also prepared in birthday\2019s.nThese small gestures create beautiful memories and a sense of family that is very rare to find.nThe atmosphere is friendly and welcoming, making it easy to settle in. What\2019s also best is the location completely safe for girls within a friendly society.nnThe staff is extremely polite, friendly, and supportive, making the stay very comfortable. The location is excellent, with easy accessibility to all daily necessities.nThe rooms are clean, well-maintained, and the overall atmosphere is safe and peaceful.nThey always ensure residents have everything they need and are always responsive to any concerns.nI highly recommend this PG to students and working professionals looking for a comfortable, secure, and welcoming place to stay. Truly one of the best PGs with great food, caring people, and an amazing location! \+01f60a\+01f3e1\2728', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.430731', 5, 338, 4),
(2017, U&'[Pooja Kumari] I had a very bad experience staying in this PG and would strongly not recommend it to anyone.nInitially, when you visit the PG, the owner behaves very politely and makes everything seem perfect. However, once you move in, her behavior completely changes. If you raise any genuine concerns\2014like the maid not cleaning the washroom, kitchen, or even your room regularly\2014she becomes extremely rude and starts using abusive language.nThe  cleanliness is very poor. The maid does not come daily, and sometimes even lies about cleaning. Instead of addressing the issue, the owner blindly trusts the maid over the residents.nOne of the most serious concerns is food hygiene. There have been instances where cockroaches were found in the food. When this was raised in the group, instead of resolving the issue, the owner started fighting and pressured to delete the message. She shows zero concern for the health of the girls, which is very alarming.nShe also falsely claims that her own family eats the same food, which is clearly not true. The cook has mentioned that she is instructed to add extra water to dal just to increase quantity, while separate food is prepared for the owner\2019s family.nAnother issue is the unfair rent system. The rent is not fixed\2014it depends on how you look. If the owner thinks you can afford more, she will charge you higher rent than others. Electricity charges are also excluded, adding to the expense. The ACs are poorly maintained or damaged, yet they consume excessive electricity, increasing your bills unnecessarily.nAdditionally, it is strange and inappropriate that men are posting reviews for a girls\2019 PG, which raises questions about authenticity.nThe owner often creates unnecessary conflicts and then accuses residents of mentally harassing her, which is very manipulative behavior. Living here feels mentally exhausting and unsafe.nOverall, this PG lacks basic hygiene, transparency, fairness, and respect for residents.nI strongly advise others to avoid this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.430894', 1, 338, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2018, '[Paridhi Tomar] Best pg in lajpat nagar... The rooms are neat, Wi-Fi works well.I have had a wonderful stay here. The facilities are excellent, the location is convenient, and the staff treats students with respect. The PG is clean, secure, and feels like a second home.The location is convenient with easy access to transportation and nearby markets. I would highly recommend this PG to students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.431137', 5, 338, 4),
(2019, U&'[Garima Dharwan] WORST PG EVER !nI m genuinely surprised by some of the positive reviews here because they are so shady and felt paid as they don\2019t reflect wht I or many of my knowns experienced here !nNo cleanliness, pathetic food, the staff was rude and unhelpful whenever concerns were raised.nnIf u\2019re looking for a place that feels lyks a home away from home thn this is definitely not it. My experience here was extremely disappointing.nnI wouldn\2019t recommend this PG to anyone looking for a clean, comfortable, nd a welcoming environment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.431411', 1, 338, 4),
(2020, '[Pooja Thakur] A well-maintained and safe PG for girls. The environment is comfortable and homely, making it suitable for students. The management is cooperative and attentive to residents'' needs.The rooms and common areas are maintained properly.nThe food is hygienic and satisfying. Overall, a good place to stay with a peaceful atmosphere.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.431631', 5, 338, 4),
(2021, U&'[Harpreet Gill] I stayed in this girls\2019 PG for 1.5 months, and my experience there was very bad. The food had no taste and was extremely unhygienic. Cleanliness was also not maintained properly. There was a huge water problem \2014 sometimes there would be no water for the entire day. Even if the pipeline was damaged, it\2019s understandable, but these people wouldn\2019t even turn on the motor. They don\2019t seem to understand their responsibility and make the girls staying there suffer a lot.nEven though it\2019s a girls\2019 PG, there was no security at all. Anyone could go out or come in at night, and nobody cared. I would just say that no girl should shift there. My experience was extremely bad.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.431866', 1, 338, 4),
(2022, '[Nishita] Rooms are extremely small and dirty, and they are rarely cleaned. Washrooms are never cleaned and remain unhygienic all the time.nThe food quality is terrible and not edible. I have added images for reference, the dal is basically just water with no taste or nutrition.nOn top of all this, the owner is very rude, unprofessional, and even threatening towards residents instead of addressing issues.nOverall, this PG is not worth the money and causes unnecessary stress. Please think twice before choosing this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.432064', 1, 338, 4),
(2023, '[Vikram Jha] My sister lived here for more than 3 years during her graduation in PGDAV College best location for PGDAV students and working professionals hardly 2 mnt walking distance from Vinoba Puri metro station moreover Decent rooms, great hygiene, housekeeping staff clean the rooms everyday , home maid food according to my sister both the cooks like Abha Aunty and Seenu prepare very tasty and hygienic food it''s just like my mom the owner Sangita Aunty is so caring polite and whenever I asked any problems she resolved it within a day or two...  Great experience... Will miss you Mumma''s PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.4322', 5, 338, 4),
(2024, U&'[Antara Banerjee] My daughter has been staying at this PG for the past year, and as a parent, I couldn''t have asked for a better place for her.nnThe food is homely and nutritious, the accommodation is clean and comfortable, and the security arrangements provide complete peace of mind. Its location is another huge advantage\2014just a stone''s throw away from LSR College, making daily commuting easy and safe.nnA special mention to Sharma Uncle and his family, who go above and beyond to ensure every girl feels cared for and at home. Their warmth, personal attention, and genuine concern make all the difference.nnThe most reassuring part for any parent is knowing that your child is in the safest hands. I wholeheartedly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a secure, caring, and well-managed place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.443774', 5, 339, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2025, U&'[Sonali Bagal] Hassle free stay with good quality food. Best part is a 2 min walk from college and natural ventilation in all rooms. Uncle aunty are very helpful too.nBest PG near LSR, Highly recommended\+01f44d\+01f3fb', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.443921', 5, 339, 4),
(2026, U&'[Ashima Gulati] Very intimate and hygienic setup.nGood food,Quick solutions for breakdowns and problems etc..nA min walk to college gate.nSure worth checking out if taking admission in LSR \+01f44d\+01f3fb', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.444176', 5, 339, 4),
(2027, '[Misosoup] PROS:n- close to metron- max 3 min walk from LSRn- gated society and the owner hires a security guardn- they try to provide whatever food you ask forn- owners live downstairs so any problems are quickly addressednnCONS:n- they say laundry is included but we had to pay the didi separatelyn- (personal) when I lived here, my signed contract was set for less than a year. But the owners refused to acknowledge this and even became extremely aggressive. My parents, fearing for my safety had me leave the Pg quickly. I never got my deposit money backn- however, my other friends got their deposit backn- rent was set at different amounts for different girls in the same room. So please discuss with your potential roommates.nnEDIT:nFew years back, rent was 18k for triple sharing, 24-26k for double sharing (depends on room)nnElectricity is also paid in advance and deductions are made accordingly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.444336', 2, 339, 4),
(2028, U&'[Preethi M] One of the most hassle free and hygienic PGs I have experienced. The location is very safe and the PG has its own guard too.nThe food is awesome and aunty really takes care.nFully furnished rooms with everything taken care of and so conveniently located for metro or road connectivity.nHighly recommended\+01f44d\+01f3fb', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.444471', 5, 339, 4),
(2029, '[Sakshi] My stay at the PG accommodation was exceptionally comfortable and hassle-free. The hosts took excellent care of me, ensuring all my needs were met. The well-furnished rooms, good meals, and Wi-Fi provided added immense value. Additionally, its location in a safe area with good connectivity further enhanced my experience, making it ideal for university living.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.444606', 5, 339, 4),
(2030, '[Sooryagayathri Nair] I had a warm, comfortable, and memorable stay at Premium PG. The owners are very caring and friendly. The accomodation has spacious rooms, clean bathrooms and homely food. It is also a very safe neighbourhood, with security gaurds stationed 24/7 at the PG. Getting to meet some real adorable girls and making lasting friendships was just the icing on the cake. Had an amazing experience at Premium Girls PG!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.444735', 5, 339, 4),
(2031, U&'[Sonali Sharma] The PG accommodation is spacious and homely. Well done rooms with attached bathrooms in a peaceful neighbourhood. Park in the front is a great view from top and good for morning/evening walks. College is just a 2 min walk through the park and the metro-station, back market, food joints are a 2 min walk too. Aunty is really caring and food is good. I had a great time .nBest PG for girls near LSR, Highly recommended.\+01f44d\+01f3fb', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.445402', 5, 339, 4),
(2032, '[It''s Maan] My daughter stayed there in the month of November. Owner of this PG is so bad, she is too much greedy and provides zero facilities. One of their male servant is also look at girls in bad way and Aunti is also too bad, she is helpless.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.456066', 1, 340, 4),
(2033, '[Shivam Vasdev] Regrettably, the PG in Delhi falls short of expectations with regards to sanitation, food quality, and overall cleanliness. These aspects require urgent attention to enhance the living conditions for all residents. Your prompt action in addressing these concerns would be highly appreciated.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.456214', 1, 340, 4),
(2034, '[Nisha Nanda] I stayed in this pg for 3 years. It was an amazing experience.  The owner of this pg (aunty ) is the nicest person I met . She is very supportive.  She used to listen to any issue related to accommodation would resolve it immediately.  She is very humble. She makes pg feel lik home. My personal experience has been really really good that everytime I come to Delhi I prefer to stay in pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.456339', 5, 340, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2035, U&'[Dr. Bhumika Arora] I was almost there at this PG for more than an year during my internship in delhi,nThe environment there is so clean n homely. Landlady there Pinky aunty is really cooperative u0026 so kind at heart, she actually puts an active effort in making the pg friendly and home like and making everything smooth n comfortable for everyone.nIncluding the food services.nI must say, Highly recommended \+01f44d\+01f44d\+01f3fbnSo mentioning, If you\2019re studying anywhere near south campus or even central delhi colleges, i think its a good place plus its in heart of Lajpat nagar central market.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.456462', 5, 340, 4),
(2036, U&'[Priya Bhardwaj] This pg is so nice...My daughter is staying in this pg since 9 months...The warden is so good , polite , supportive and and most importantly caring in nature...She helps all the girls staying there in every way....Best experience \+01f64f\+01f929\+01f929\+01f44c', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.456589', 5, 340, 4),
(2037, U&'[Shehnaz Kumari] This pg is so nice ! The aunty is so good and helpful and humble !! I don''t know these mean girls can write anything for aunty who has always helped us in every way !! Past one year I m stayingnRecommended \2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.456714', 5, 340, 4),
(2038, '[sanchary basu] It''s a very good pg, with hospitable ambiance. The owner of the PG is very helpful and provides with every assistance. Being located in middle of the market, every small needs are available at hand. Moreover, the Lajpat Nagar and Mool Chand metro stations are quite near. It''s a girls PG which is quite secured.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.456837', 5, 340, 4),
(2039, U&'[Jagrati Bhardwaj] Best pg in lajpat nagar...I''m staying since 9 months  and have excellent experience......Owner is very nice and sweet person and most importantly highly cooperative...Feels like a home....I''m extremely happy here\+01f4ab\+01f4ab\+01f917 \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.457328', 5, 340, 4),
(2040, '[Harsh Shandilya] After nearly two years of staying here, i can confirm it is a safe and excellent residential neighborhood.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.470892', 5, 341, 4),
(2041, '[PRATHMESH] To be honest, Best PG for Job employees and students, Overall environment is good around PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.471031', 5, 341, 4),
(2042, '[Sid] Facilities provided here and the surrounding environment is very good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.471163', 5, 341, 4),
(2043, '[Sarvesh Rathi] I had a wonderful stay here for a period of 6 months. The owners are quite friendly and accommodating giving quick resolution to any problem that you face. All the basic facilities are provided and even your needs are aligned. If anyone wishes to stay in Delhi, this is a PG I would highly recommend', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.471286', 5, 341, 4),
(2044, '[Lol Tso] The room is clean and spacious and the environment is a very peaceful one with a park right next to the building.. The owner is very friendly and is always Swift and ready to help you in solving ur issues and problems ( if such case arises) . Privacy is given to the tenants and gives a homely feel and also the neighborhood is a secure neighborhood.. overall this pg is really good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.471408', 5, 341, 4),
(2045, '[Divyansh Agarwal] very bad PG very dangy placenrooms are very bad there are no facilities', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.471532', 1, 341, 4),
(2046, '[Krishna Goyal] Excellent rating model - baleno sigma rm- gurpreet lajpat nagar', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.471651', 5, 341, 4),
(2047, '[Akshat Mishra] Location is wrong and there exists no single double sharing pg.nOwner deliberately didn''t enter the house number to trick people', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.471822', 1, 341, 4),
(2048, U&'[Joker] This PG is extremely poor and not worth staying in. There are multiple serious issues:nn* Drinking water is unsafe; the water filter has clearly not been changed for a long time.n* Bathrooms frequently have water blockage problems.n* Rooms are infested with bedbugs, making it very difficult to live here.n* The biggest issue is the security deposit. Even after 1\20131.5 months, it has not been returned.n* Repeated calls and follow-ups have been ignored; they don\2019t even answer the phone.nnThis level of negligence and irresponsible behavior is completely unacceptable. I strongly urge management to resolve these issues immediately and return my security deposit without further delay.nThis is my personal experience because I am stay this PG3 months and I am leaving before 15 days. I will pay it all three months rent, and after I am going, them is too much problems, not giving two security money after two months and too much calling, calling and don\2019t pick up my calls answering is very headache.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.511374', 1, 344, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2049, '[Sahil Chahar] Very unhygienic Food, cockroach everywhere, bedbugs.nUse tap water for making foodnOwner is a Physco , Uneducated, mindless person . Beat a little boy frequently very badly.. Don''t even want to give one star but one star is for all roommate i had they are very helpful and good hearted people.....', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.511509', 1, 344, 4),
(2050, '[Mohit Giri] Give 1 star..by commenting didn''t return the security deposit', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.512008', 1, 344, 4),
(2051, '[Sudhanshu Kumar 714] The worst PG ever.nThe Fraudulent are running this PG...i lived there 2 months nd they will call you 4-5 times in 4-5 minutes on the exact date to rent payment bt when you will leave and you will call them for security money then they will not pick your phone...i also tried more the 20-22 times bt they didn''t pick my phone. When i take big action against them then they returned my money but not full money... they cut 2000 don''t know for what.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.512307', 1, 344, 4),
(2052, '[tushar chaurasiya] The location of the pg is nice overall it''s a good pg but some maintenance should be there. I stayed 6 months in 2 room attached where 6 beds are there where we have to use a single washroom and the hygiene was soo bad to live we faced infinite red small cockroaches types and they are all around the kitchen u0026 washroom.Providing toilet cleaning once at a month was non understandable. The food was ok..sometimes it''s good and sometimes it''s bad.Rest I don''t face any issues regarding security money refund.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.512587', 3, 344, 4),
(2053, '[Kalyani K] I had a great stay at a sunshine girls PG in Delhi. The location was excellent, close to metro stations and essential services. The facilities were well-maintained, with clean rooms, a common kitchen, and reliable Wi-Fi. Security was solid, and there was no restriction. The included meals were tasty and hygienic. The owner kavya di was friendly and responsive, always ready to help. Overall, the PG offered excellent value for money and provided a comfortable and safe environment. Highly recommended for students and professionals seeking affordable accommodation in Delhi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.512739', 5, 344, 4),
(2054, '[Kabir kishan Bana] Stayed here 3 months everything is fine also you will get your full security deposit when you leave no charges this is good reason . Must try in good price range', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.51296', 4, 344, 4),
(2055, '[Abhimanyu Kanwal] WORST PG. Service is very poor and the owners are very greedy and have a very bad attitude. It took the owner almost 3 weeks (19 days) to return my security money and that too after dozens and dozens of calls and messages from me. The owner has done this again and again with many other young students who come there to study, taking their undue advantage.  He promises to return the security money on the leaving date but when the time arrives, the series of forced excuses begin. He has refused to give security back to many others, even forcing some students to stay there for an extra month instead. Also, the rooms are unclean and cockroach infested and the kitchen is in very bad and unhygienic condition. He also overcharges the electricity bill by a lot and refuses to be transparent about it. PLEASE AVOID THIS PG AT ALL COST.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.51317', 1, 344, 4),
(2056, '[NAVI BANSAL] Can I Get contact details', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.527476', 4, 345, 4),
(2057, U&'[Sanjana Gupta] Amazing pg with great food taste\+01f44d\+01f3fbnThe behaviour of owner and the staff is so polite and respectful\+01fa77nEven they maintain the hygiene and cleaning of the rooms.nOverall the best experience\+01f64f\+01f3fb\+01fa77', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.542432', 5, 346, 4),
(2058, '[Anamika Singh] Yes this nice you can visit this it is nearby LSR College not so far just it will took only 5 minutes to go there so you can visit', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.542695', 5, 346, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2059, '[Sunil Kumar] Worst pg ...rude owner....mess food is also bad ...owner never listen to any problems... hygeine is never maintained.. kitchen always smells bad ... overall if you are looking for a pg ..avoid this pg in this price .. nothing is good about this pg ...', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.542895', 1, 346, 4),
(2060, U&'[Meenu Bhalothia] Pg is really nice and food is great best pg in this area \+01f44d\+01f44d\+01f44d\+01f44d\+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.54305', 5, 346, 4),
(2061, U&'[Pardeep Yadav] Wow \+01f632 nice pgnGood food good cleaningnOwner aur pg wala friend', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.54322', 5, 346, 4),
(2062, '[Satyam Rawat] Nice pg good food', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.543364', 5, 346, 4),
(2063, '[Tiger Bhai] Single person pg price', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.543499', 4, 346, 4),
(2064, U&'[Ridhi Paswan] Highy recommend pg \+01f44c', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.54364', 5, 346, 4),
(2065, '[Aditi Anand] I stayed at this PG for a good period of three years, and my experience was genuinely very positive. The facilities are well maintained. The food quality is good, and the best part is that the menu changes every day, so there is always variety across all 7 days of the week.nnOne thing I really appreciated was how receptive the owner aunty is to feedback. She is always available when needed, and she handles concerns with a very polite, caring, and understanding attitude. It really makes the place feel comfortable and supportive.nnAnother big plus is that there is a house help on every floor, so any small or big need is taken care of quickly. Overall, it is a well-managed PG with good amenities, good food, and a very considerate owner.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.557246', 5, 347, 4),
(2066, '[Medha Karmwar] I have had a very pleasant stay of 3 years at this PG. The place is kept extremely clean and the hygiene standards are consistently good, which makes it feel comfortable and well managed. The rooms and common areas are maintained nicely, and the overall environment feels fresh and orderly.nnAnother thing I really appreciate is that uncle is very responsive to complaints or concerns regarding any amenities. Any issue, big or small, is addressed quickly with an immediate solution, which shows how attentive and responsible the management is. It really gives a sense of reassurance and care.nnOverall, this PG is a well-maintained, hygienic, and dependable place to stay, with prompt support whenever needed.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.557394', 5, 347, 4),
(2067, '[Narendrasinh Rana] 82, GIRLS PG National Park is the cleanest, safest and closest to COLLEGE.nFrom the moment I chose it, it felt like a family. Absolutely worry-free. The owner uncle and aunt are very caring and kind-hearted. Whenever I visited as a father, I received a lot of respect and  hospitality.nAlso very cooperative. Also understood my situation. My daughter stayed here and studied worry-free and safely.n1. PG equipped with CCTV cameran2. Food like a Homen3. Just a few steps from college.n4. 24*7 caring uncle auntyn5. Equipped with every facility.nIn few words it''s very worth and worry free PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.557531', 5, 347, 4),
(2068, '[Devanshi Kumar] I stayed at this PG for nearly two years. The facilities are comparatively better than many nearby options, and the food quality is decent. However, the menu tends to become repetitive as there is very little variation over time.nnOne concern I faced was that feedback and resident concerns were not always handled constructively, and communication during disagreements could have been more accommodating. In some cases, residents were asked to vacate instead of issues being resolved collaboratively.nnAdditionally, the pricing feels quite steep for what is being offered, especially considering there are now better-value options available in the same area with similar amenities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.557664', 2, 347, 4),
(2069, '[Ananya Ahluwalia] Since it was my first time living alone in a new city for internship, they made it absolutely worthwhile. From safety or location to food or hygiene, this PG ticks every box. Everyone is so welcoming that it makes you feel like home. Irrespective of whether you are a vegetarian or non-vegetarian, you are in for a treat as the food is delicious, which I suppose is the prime concern of most people. I absolutely loved my stay here and made the best memories.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.557937', 5, 347, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2070, '[Preeti Singla Gupta] My daughter has been staying here for the past year, I as a parent from out of Delhi would highly recommend this place to everyone for number of reasons- safety being the paramount, cleanliness, convenience, easy commute to LSR, lift, full time security guards, good meals.nSpecial mention to  the PG owner Mrs Veena Arora who is extremely responsive and responsible an extremely progressive mindset lady who delivers on her commitment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.55833', 5, 347, 4),
(2071, U&'[Seema Sandhu] My daughter had a great experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean, well-ventilated, and equipped with all the basic facilities that make day-to-day living comfortable. The food deserves a special mention \2013 it\2019s tasty, feels like home-cooked meals, and there\2019s a good variety in the menu. The staff and management are also very supportive and approachable. They ensure a safe and friendly environment, which makes it easy to adjust even if you\2019re staying away from home for the first time. The PG also maintains excellent hygiene in the common areas and provides a peaceful atmosphere for studying or relaxing. Overall, I would highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a clean, safe, and homely place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.558746', 5, 347, 4),
(2072, '[Janya Goyal] Decent PG. Neither very good nor very poor. The facilities provided are satisfactory, but not quite worth the high rent, as similar amenities are available in other decent PGs at lower charges.nThe owner (Aunty) is very hardworking; however, she struggles to receive and process student feedback in a constructive manner. This leads to resentment among students and, unfortunately, fades out some of the positive experiences at the PG. She tends to become defensive and overpowering even when concerns are raised calmly and respectfully - which, in itself, happens quite rarely.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.558995', 3, 347, 4),
(2073, '[ruchika sharma] A very good environment. The staff is very supportive, the rooms are clean and quite airy. it is Walking distance from metro. Well furnished AC rooms with attached washroom.nOverall everything is balanced:', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.57704', 5, 348, 4),
(2074, '[Dushyant Kumar] Really affordable PG for girls, all facilities are available here. Have the nearest metro station.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.577219', 5, 348, 4),
(2075, '[Mandvi Chaudhary] Affordable with best facilities and good environment', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.577397', 5, 348, 4),
(2076, '[Rashmi Janiya] Affordable pg with best facilities', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.577559', 5, 348, 4),
(2077, '[Sejal] Price for single occupancy room?', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.577696', 5, 348, 4),
