(2081, '[Sivakumar Swaminathan] It is an old building complex. I did not go inside the campus. I stayed opposite to the place. Tall trees are grown in front of the building to create a visual barrier from the people moving on the road. Within a kilometre distance from the bus stand.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.595444', 4, 349, 4),
(2082, '[Abu zar ali] It''s good in decent money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.595683', 3, 349, 4),
