(2114, '[Divya sharma] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.777448', 5, 354, 4),
(2115, '[Riya Katiyar, LSR] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.777677', 5, 354, 4),
(2116, '[Chhana Chhuaha] Occupancy: Double SharingnDuration: July, 2025 (1 Month)nnThe PG is run by a young bachelor and his father and both parties are very attentive to your needs and requirements.nnThe price quoted at me was pretty good but keep in mind that food is not included in the accommodation, thus you have to subscribe to their tiffin service.nnThere is pretty much all other facilities tho including a washing machine, decent toilet facilities and a well furnished room. However the lack of more than 1 table can be a drawback for some occupants.nnThe PG has a strict no alcohol and cigarette policy and while there is no curfew time per se, at times the respected uncle can lock the door during the night which may be something you will have to negotiate.nnOverral the PG is very solid. It isn''t great by any measures but you won''t have any serious problems with it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.79393', 4, 355, 4),
(2117, '[Sadashiva Damera] Recently I stayed in the pg for 3 days. The room is clean and tidy. Owners are co-operative and responsive. Its budget friendly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.794066', 4, 355, 4),
(2118, U&'[Shashi Kant] I stayed here for a while and honestly, it felt like home. Rooms are clean, vibe is peaceful, and Nik bhai is always ready to help with a smile. The best part \2014 Rohini East Metro Station is just 500 meters away, super convenient! Really good place to stay \2014 simple, safe, and full of good vibes.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.794194', 5, 355, 4),
(2119, '[Saksham] I stayed at this PG in Delhi and had a really good experience. The rooms were clean and well-maintained, with all the basic amenities like Wi-Fi, geyser, and a good bed setup. The location was also convenient, with easy access to public transport and nearby markets. Overall, it was a comfortable and pleasant stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.794316', 5, 355, 4),
(2120, '[pratyay mandal] I had a great experience staying at this PG near Rohini East metro for over a year. The location is convenient, with easy access to public transportation and nearby amenities. The PG is well-maintained, clean, and has a welcoming atmosphere. The owner is very responsive and helpful, always ensuring that any issues are addressed promptly. I felt safe and comfortable throughout my stay, and the environment was conducive to both studying and relaxing. Highly recommend this place for anyone looking for a reliable and comfortable accommodation option in the area!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.794499', 5, 355, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2121, '[Ayush Gyanani] I had an excellent experience staying at this PG for one month. The proximity to nearby metro transportation made my daily commute extremely convenient. The owner was very kind and attentive, ensuring that all my needs were met. Additionally, I was fortunate to make a good friends during my stay, which added to the overall positive experience. Only there is one feedback I want to give for improvement is that please provide space to Drying up for clothes just this.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.794619', 4, 355, 4),
(2122, U&'[Cm K] I stayed at this PG during my exam days, and I must say it\2019s one of the best choices for students. The environment is peaceful and perfect for studying without any disturbances. The food availability through the tiffin system is timely, hygienic, and homely in taste, which is a big relief during stressful times. The rooms are clean, well-ventilated, and regularly maintained. The owner is a very kind, supportive, and well-behaved person who always ensures a comfortable stay for everyone. Safety, cleanliness, and a positive atmosphere make this PG truly stand out. Highly recommended for students and working professionals alike.nnChandra mohan', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.794742', 5, 355, 4),
(2123, '[Vaibhav Joshi] It was a nice stay.. i''ve been there for few months.. rooms were clean.. there is no disturbance by owner.. and owner is helpful and ready to solve issues related to pg.. thank you', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.794928', 5, 355, 4),
(2124, '[ajay kumar] I am an electrical engineer. I had come for my job for a month, but after 10-12 days suddenly I had to leave. I told Mr. Karan to deduct the money for the days I stayed with security and return the rest, but Karan G spoke very calmly and said Sir any PG charges a minimum charge for a month, which is correct, but I said whatever you feel appropriate, Karan ji provided full security and returned the money for 15 days as well, with very good behaviour. He is a very nice person, daily cleaning is done in the PG, it is a great PG, I recommend it to everyone', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.81206', 5, 356, 4),
(2125, '[Ritik Ranjan] I came for just a month for my internship and it was really a nice experience of staying here. Owner is very friendly and there is no issue of security money refund, it was a smooth transaction. Plus room was nice and cleaniness was also good, they provide RO water and fridge too so it was all good. I will recommend this pg to everyone who is looking to stay here for working professional considering that it is nearby metro also', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.812352', 5, 356, 4),
(2126, '[Priyanshu Thakur] Overall a good place for students to stay in rohini.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.812561', 5, 356, 4),
(2127, '[Paras Jain] One of the best PG in this location, hygienic room with best of facilities. Owner is very humble and helpful. I will recommend everyone.!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.812706', 5, 356, 4),
(2128, '[B SHIVRAM] This is the place to stay if you want a real feel for the warmth u0026 charm of VK hospitality. The owner make you feel like part of their family and give wonderful support in every need of your stay. VK PG is adjacent to Rohini East Metro. Hardly 300 meters from the PG to Rohini Metro station. I would urge to look for VK PG when needed. I bet you will remember the hospitality for ages..Thank you VK PG and Karan Bhaiya ji..Radhey Radhey', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.812839', 5, 356, 4),
(2129, '[HARINARAYAN HARI] Had a very pleasant stay. Property is well maintained and owner is polite. Pricing is good and property is well connected to rohini east metro station which will save you a lot of time. Overall I will definitely recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.81297', 5, 356, 4),
(2130, '[Mohammad Wahid Ali Khan] I didn''t live here but my friend did. I did visit him though. More lights would be helpful, poorly lit. Didn''t try food though my friend said that most of the time they preferred to eat outside. For someone on budget obviously won''t afford that. Features would be ac, inside society, main door lock, a keeper, no lift so stairs are healthy I guess., near metro.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.813104', 3, 356, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2131, '[Kanchan Chauhan] selected this PG for my brother for 2 months.nhe had a very good stay, owner is well behaved. Will definately recommend this pg to all my knowns looking for a pg in delhi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.813238', 5, 356, 4),
(2132, '[Deepanshu Yadav] A really well-maintained PG in Rohini with extra spacious rooms that feel comfortable and airy. The food is genuinely tasty and feels homely, which is a big plus. Housekeeping is very good and keeps everything clean and organized. The staff is polite and helpful, and the location is quite convenient. Overall, a great place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.833143', 5, 357, 4),
(2133, U&'[Jagdamba Transport Service] Best Pg in Rohini with extra spacious rooms, proper ventilation, and good basic facilities. Pricing is reasonable (\20b97500 triple, \20b98500 double), and the food feels homely. Housekeeping is regular, staff is cooperative, and connectivity to metro and nearby areas is very convenient. Stayed there for a short time but overall, a comfortable and hassle-free stay.nTotally recommended !', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.833386', 5, 357, 4),
(2134, '[Komal Yadav] My brother used to stay in this pg. The rooms are spacious and clean. The food is very tasty and hygiene is maintained .Overallnhis experience was very good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.834146', 5, 357, 4),
(2135, '[Anil Yadav] Very bad quality foodnRoti quality is very badnThey don''t even make fresh breakfastnMix rat ki daal with atta and make paratha in morning and call it methi ka parathannIt you want to lose your weight you can come to this pgnnIn lunch they will give you rice and raita only', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.83437', 1, 357, 4),
(2136, '[Prabhath Yadav] The room is neat and clean. Food is of average quality. 2 sharing room costs RS 8,500/-. You have to pay  electricity bills other than this. Drinking water is okay and will suggest in Rohini Sector 7 this PG is at affordable price. Facilities like Cold water, A/c rooms, Dining room, geyser, unlimited WIFI and also include 3 time meals. Also note rooms are bigger and there is enough space compared to other PGs.n3 Sharing room Rs 7,500/-', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.834522', 4, 357, 4),
(2137, '[MOHAMMAD AZMAL Ali] Hi there sir, This side MD AZMAL ALI Can you provide your pg rate list and can you provide food', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.834674', 5, 357, 4),
(2138, U&'[Shubham Kumar] This pg is one of the best pg in delhi,nTheir room with 2 sharing is 8500\20b9nFood included, and their food quality is top notch. They also provide room service.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.835025', 5, 357, 4),
(2139, '[Shivam Kushwaha] Great pg for students and job persons ....food is good and rooms are also clean and  big', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.835314', 5, 357, 4),
(2140, '[Jessica Konsam] Even though I live far away from my home, this PG gives me a true sense of comfort and belonging. It feels less like a place to stay and more like a second home. The environment is always clean, well-maintained, and peaceful, which makes it very easy to relax and focus on daily life.nThe security here is excellent, providing a strong sense of safety and reassurance. All the necessary facilities are available and thoughtfully arranged, making everyday living convenient and hassle-free.nLastly, the most important our owner is very polite and generous.She treat the hosteller like her own children.Whenever you need anything she will be always there for you.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.851983', 5, 358, 4),
(2141, U&'[Veno vese] The place is very well-kept,you can really tell they put real care into making everything comfy and organized. Aunty is just the kindest, most generous person,she\2019s always there if you need her and truly cares about how the residents are doing.nLocation wise, it\2019s a total win,markets are right around the corner for easy errands and there\2019s also a park nearby.nAll in all, it\2019s a comfy, well run spot that\2019s safe and welcoming. Highly recommend it', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.852148', 5, 358, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2142, '[Zoulian Tombing] The PG is clean and well maintained, with regular and good-quality cleaning services. The rooms are nice and comfortable, and the kitchen is well equipped with everything needed for daily cooking. Auntie is very polite and kind which makes the stay even more comfortable. The neighborhood is calm and pleasant, making it a good place to live. Overall, it has been a satisfactory and peaceful stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.852357', 5, 358, 4),
(2143, '[priya dabas] I absolutely loved everything about this PG. The amenities, well organized space and maintenance by the owner aunty is superb. It feels like home here, and even the environment around PG is very safe and peaceful. Highly recommend this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.852641', 5, 358, 4),
(2144, U&'[navya hk] I had a wonderful experience staying at this PG. The place is very well-maintained, clean, and feels completely safe with good security. The owner aunty is incredibly sweet and caring, and she truly makes you feel comfortable from day one. It honestly felt like my second home. Highly recommended! \+01f31f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.852844', 5, 358, 4),
(2145, U&'[Shwetal Khetade] It is a really good place. Aunty, the owner, keeps it really clean and well-maintained. The people here are friendly, the place is safe. It feels like a part of a small community living here. I really love it \2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.853007', 5, 358, 4),
(2146, U&'[Prasastha Mazumder] The stay at this girls\2019 PG has been really comfortable and hassle-free. The rooms are cleaned on a daily basis and are well-maintained, the food is homely, and sunita aunty is really helpful and approachable. It feels safe and secure, with a friendly environment and it also has a nearby market that makes it easy to focus on studies and accessible for other works too.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.853248', 5, 358, 4),
(2147, U&'[Sangeeta Sarma] My daughter has been staying here for the past 1 year. The maintenance is very good. It is very neat and clean u0026 the rooms are cleaned everyday by a maid. Aunty is also very homely.It feels like my daughter is living in her own home with full love and security\+01f970', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.85338', 5, 358, 4),
(2148, U&'[Sujoy Bhowal] My son stayed here for around 2 months. Owner is very well behaved and a reasonable person. Nice location. Recommended for students. However the caretaker sleeps too much. \+01f601', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.871074', 4, 359, 4),
(2149, '[Arjun K. sah] Contact number pls I want to join', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.871231', 5, 359, 4),
(2150, '[Nishant rajput] Best place for students and working professionals. Full furnished accommodation with alll amenities. Owner''s behavior is quite good and helpfull. Highly recommend for all.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.871399', 5, 359, 4),
(2151, '[Saurabh] The ambience was good and given I am a student trust me no noise. Absolutely pin drop silence and helpful caretaker and lanlord!ncheers', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.87177', 5, 359, 4),
(2152, '[Anmol Sabharwal] I stayed here for approximately 5-6 months. I just want to say that this PG is the best in this locality.with very good facilities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.871934', 5, 359, 4),
(2153, '[Ishan Malhotra] I have stayed here it was a great experience as compared to nearby accommodationnKey features : it''s clean , nicely furnished, value for money', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.872077', 4, 359, 4),
(2154, U&'[Nikhilesh Sawant] Best place to stay in Rohini Sector 8. Great owner, great caretaker. Well maintained. Highly recommended. \+01f64c\+01f3fb\2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.872218', 5, 359, 4),
(2155, '[Jatin Dandona] Stayed for 8-10 months at this PG and I can assure you that this PG provide best facilities at best price.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.872357', 4, 359, 4),
(2156, '[Raj Kumar Kedia] Best pg in rohini', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.887976', 5, 360, 4),
(2157, U&'[Pramod Gupta] \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50nnMy brother Tushar stayed in this Boys PG for almost 2 years, and his experience was truly wonderful. The environment is clean, peaceful, and feels just like home.nnThe food is always fresh, delicious, and homely, which makes a big difference for anyone staying away from family. Everything is well-managed, and the overall atmosphere is friendly and comfortable.nnA special thanks to Nimmi Aunty, whose caring and kind nature makes this place even more special. She treats everyone like family and is always supportive and helpful, making all the residents feel welcomed and cared for.nnI highly recommend this Boys PG to anyone looking for a safe, comfortable, and well-maintained place to stay. Thank you, Nimmi Aunty, for creating such a wonderful home away from home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.903407', 5, 361, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2158, U&'[Updesh Kumar] I stayed at Nimmi Boys PG, Rohini for almost a year, and my experience was excellent. The PG offers a clean, safe, and comfortable environment, making it feel like a home away from home.nnThe best part of my stay was the kind and caring nature of the aunty who manages the PG. She is very supportive, friendly, and always makes sure that everyone is comfortable and well taken care of.nnThe food is fresh, hygienic, and delicious, with a homely taste that I really enjoyed throughout my stay. The rooms are well-maintained, and the overall atmosphere is peaceful and welcoming.nnI would highly recommend Nimmi Boys PG to students and working professionals looking for a comfortable and reliable place to stay in Rohini. Thank you for making my one-year stay so pleasant and memorable.\+01f917', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.903551', 5, 361, 4),
(2159, '[Ayush Punetha] As I lived there for a year so I am sharing my personal experience,guys if you are looking for a jail than you can come here,the owner of the pg is terrible,her only aim is to earn money. I remember the days of my last month there she didn''t gave me food for which I have paid for 3 days continuously,after giving rent i had ordered food from outside.And guys if you are looking for the Ac room which is the only so called room in the pg than pls don''t cause that is occupied by the nimmi aunty itself in the daytime for her massage session and at the time of electricity bill she asked for the money which she takes 11 rupees per unit, it means if the bill was not even generated if it was under 200units than also you have to pay for every unit you have used either it was used in the massage session or by you.And the most important thing that there is no privacy,she can enter in your room without any knock any even there is no lock in the room you cannot even lock it from inside ,anyone can come inside either its owner or maid.I felt really disappointed and dissatisfied with this PG when I stay there.So i recommend you to choose wisely cause if you enter in the PG once she ask you to sign a contract for a year in the very first day and until you don''t sign she will not let you live peacefully.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.903683', 1, 361, 4),
(2160, '[Shubham Pandey] I''m leaving this place it''s was so amazing to meet the different people in this pg and the landlord is very pretty woman. I''m stay 1 year and my college was done going to home .please visit all things is well maintained and clean and we''ll furnished. Please vist this pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.903809', 5, 361, 4),
(2161, '[Deepak] The PG was safe, clean, and comfortable for my son. Supportive staff and hygienic food ensured his well-being. The rooms were tidy, and management promptly resolved any issues. Its peaceful location is ideal for focused study. The PG offers useful amenities and a secure environment for students living away from home. I highly recommend this PG for parents seeking a reliable place for their children to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.904078', 5, 361, 4),
(2162, U&'[YASH SANJAY MARKAM] Highly Recommended Boys PG \2013 Feels Like Home! \+01f3e1nStaying at this 4-sharing boys PG (sometimes 5 as per bed availability) for almost a half a year, feels like a good decision.n\2705 Meals: 3 times a day \2013 delicious, home-cooked, and the best in taste!n\2705 Cleanliness: Spotless rooms, common areas, and washrooms \2013 maintained daily.n\2705 Owner Auntyji:  understanding, treats us like family.n\2705 Location: good area with everything nearby \2013n\+01f3e7 ATM | \+01f3e5 Medical store u0026 Jaipur Golden Hospital | \+01f333 Lake u0026 Garden | \+01f4aa Gyms | \+01f6d2 Grocery u0026 Food outletsnPeaceful, good, and recommended for students/professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.904264', 5, 361, 4),
(2163, '[Mamta Sharma] The best place for PG.. very understanding owner. (Nimmi aunty ji)... feel like home... homemade food...heiginic atmosphere..my brother stayed there for 1year duration in his job.. in Delhi... unforgettable experience living there...our family''s gratitude towards her.. definitely my brother would love to stay there again ... if any chance..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.904418', 5, 361, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2164, '[archana khurana] My nephew had a great experience living in this PG .The rooms are clean,u0026 comfortable .Nimmi mam'', the owner of the PG is a sweetheart,she treated my nephew as her own son......', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.904546', 5, 361, 4),
(2165, '[Son Goku] I stayed here for 2 months, all the basic amenities for living are provided. Rooms and common area are well cleaned and maintained. Rent is very affordable, services offered in the common area and wifi is actually good, also there is a tiffin service just downstairs if you want one. There is no gate closing timings, also as a security measure the owner has installed cctv cameras. The owner is nice too and cares about the needs and problems of tenants.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.939011', 4, 363, 4),
(2166, '[Parth Kumar] Plz tell me how to contact the owner u , I want a pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.939161', 5, 363, 4),
(2167, '[dinesh saini] Good service', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.939285', 5, 363, 4),
(2168, '[vyoma jagya] Boys pg, clean and affordable.. near to Rohini East u0026 West.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.939401', 5, 363, 4),
(2169, '[Fiction Real] Good place to stay, affordable, hygienic.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.939509', 5, 363, 4),
(2170, '[RACHNA KHAN] Very comfortable and safe place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.939618', 4, 363, 4),
(2171, '[vipin saini] Affordable and we''ll maintained', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.939733', 5, 363, 4),
(2172, '[kanishk jagya] Very nominal price and approachable', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.94004', 5, 363, 4),
(2173, '[Bhavay Jain] Bhavay JainnNice facilities , good staff , very polite property manager, helps regarding every issue , overall nice experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.955176', 5, 364, 4),
(2174, '[shresth Khare] Hey i am shresth khare leaving is a great experience very supportive property manager manish bhaiya. Food quality is very good like home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.955317', 5, 364, 4),
(2175, '[Yash Gandhi] Amazing place to stay! Great vibe, clean and well-maintained rooms, delicious home-style food, and very supportive staff. It truly feels like a home away from home. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.955425', 5, 364, 4),
(2176, '[Vimal Mishra] Very delicious food and good staff', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.955534', 5, 364, 4),
(2177, '[Sumit Chauhan] One of the best pg in rohini sector 16 specially for dtu and shaheed sukhdev college students', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.955638', 5, 364, 4),
(2178, '[Aditya Rawat] It is the perfect student dorm located near SSCBS and DTU. The facilities provided are top notch and the behaviour of the property manager and the staff is quite welcoming and warm.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.955814', 5, 364, 4),
(2179, '[ashish singh] Booked yesterday for my brother the food is very good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.955957', 4, 364, 4),
(2180, '[Het Mehta] Very good service and maintenance by the staff', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.956059', 5, 364, 4),
(2181, U&'[HARSH JAT] I had a really good experience staying at this PG , I was there for almost two years and one of the biggest positives was the security \2014 the premises felt safe and well-managed at all times, which gave me peace of mind.nnThe food quality was also quite good compared to most PG accommodations. Meals were regular, hygienic, and overall satisfying.nnAnother thing I really appreciated was the smooth refund process of the security deposit. I received my amount back without any hassle or unnecessary delays, which shows the management is trustworthy.nnOverall, it was a comfortable stay, and I would definitely recommend this PG to others looking for a reliable place to live.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.99287', 5, 366, 4),
(2182, U&'[TULIKA THAKUR] I had the pleasure of staying at Hystay PG for almost two years during my post-graduation while studying at VIPS, and it truly felt like a home away from home. The PG is extremely comfortable, hygienic, and very well maintained, with great attention to security and overall living standards. The staff is very polite, cooperative, and always helpful, and the food is also very good. What makes this place even more special is the owner, who is incredibly kind, understanding, and supportive. He genuinely cares about everyone staying there and ensures that residents feel like family rather than just tenants. My experience living here has been wonderful, and I am truly grateful for the warmth, care, and comfort I received during my stay. \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.993093', 5, 366, 4);     
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2183, U&'[Tanisha Arora] I stayed at Hystay PG for two years during my post-graduation at VIPS, and my experience was genuinely wonderful. The PG is extremely clean and well-maintained, which made daily living very comfortable. The mess food is very good, hygienic, and feels like proper home-cooked meals.nnWhat truly makes this place special is the staff\2014they are very supportive, polite, and genuinely care about the tenants. It never felt like just a PG; it felt like a home away from home with a warm and welcoming environment.nnI would definitely recommend Hystay Pg to anyone looking for a clean, safe, and comfortable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.993394', 5, 366, 4),
(2184, U&'[Ishita Singh] Had a really good experience staying at Hystay PG. Stayed there for quite a long time, and honestly one of the best things was how safe and well-managed the place felt. Never really had to worry about anything.nnFood was also pretty decent compared to most PGs. It was regular, clean, and convenient, so didn\2019t have to depend on outside food much.nnAlso, the deposit refund process was smooth, which is rare with PGs. Got my money back without any hassle or delays, so that was a big plus.nnOverall, it was a comfortable stay. Would definitely recommend it if you\2019re looking for a reliable PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.99372', 5, 366, 4),
(2185, '[Niyati Goel] Excellent PG Experience!nI stayed at Hystay PG for 1.5 years, and I must say it was an incredible experience! The staff is courteous, helpful, and ensures that all your needs are met.nnFacilities and CleanlinessnThe facilities are top-notch, with daily cleaning and maintenance of hygiene being a significant competitive advantage. The PG is spotless, and the attention to detail is impressive.nnValue for MoneynThe pricing is genuine and reasonable, considering the quality of services and facilities provided.nnFood and Special TouchesnThe food is delicious, and the best part is that they provide special food on special occasions, making you feel like you''re part of a big family.nnCooperative OwnernThe owner is extremely cooperative and accommodating, making sure that you feel at home.nnHighly RecommendednOverall, I highly recommend Hystay PG to anyone looking for a comfortable, clean, and homely stay away from home. It''s the perfect place to call your second home!nnOne disadvantage is only of location, but rent is totally worth it as per location.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.993893', 5, 366, 4),
(2186, '[Akriti] I stayed here for 6 months and had a wonderful experience. The accommodation is very safe, and the staff is always helpful and kind. Security is top-notch, and everything promised was delivered exactly as said. Cleanliness is consistently maintained, and the rooms are well-kept and comfortable. The food is delicious, and the mess aunty is the sweetest, caring and motherly, always making sure we have homely food. 10/10 recommend this PG for a peaceful, homely stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.9941', 5, 366, 4),
(2187, U&'[KESHAV G] I stayed at Hystay PG for 10 months, and my experience was truly excellent. The rooms were comfortable, well-maintained, and provided a homely atmosphere. One of the best parts of my stay was the outstanding hospitality from both the owner and the manager \2013 they were always kind, supportive, and attentive to any needs. The cleaning and maintenance services were consistently reliable, ensuring a clean and hygienic environment throughout my stay. I highly recommend Hystay PG to anyone looking for a comfortable and well-managed place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.994245', 5, 366, 4),
(2188, U&'[Arindam Ghosh] When comparing PGs, we often focus on what\2019s on paper, like room size or listed amenities, but there are many other thoughtful details at HyStay PG that make a big difference. For example, the manager is present on the premises throughout the day and is always available to assist with any help you may need, whether it\2019s getting something repaired or collecting parcels when you\2019re away. They even provide a convenient way to receive food deliveries at night without stepping outside. These small, helpful conveniences have developed over time and continue to improve. The owner, Mr. Rohit, is very responsive and makes adjustments as needed to ensure a smooth living experience.nnI stayed at HyStay PG for 1.2 years and had a great experience. The rooms were always clean, with regular room cleaning services provided. As a working professional who was out most of the time, having a secure, covered parking space inside the building gave me peace of mind, especially since I couldn\2019t leave my bike in a public space. Highly recommend!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:57.994369', 5, 366, 4);          
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2189, '[ASHISH DOBHAL] Been there for 1u0026 half year ,time kab nikal gya pta nhi chala.Good food ,owner behaviour is nice and i miss cook uncle.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.135838', 5, 368, 4),
(2190, '[Siddhant Singh] I have had a great experience staying at this PG. The food is homely and well-prepared, making it feel just like home. The facilities are well-maintained, and the overall environment is comfortable and convenient. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a good place to stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.136063', 5, 368, 4),
(2191, '[JAGADEESH T] PG is good and clean and also owner is nice person. Food is very very good. PG is good for short term stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.136454', 5, 368, 4),
(2192, '[Akshat Kolhe] Stayed for 1 month here and the stay was quite decent and homely meals were provided. The owner was friendly. Overall it was a good stay. Highly recommend if you want good food', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.136635', 5, 368, 4),
(2193, '[Pvcindia Guru] Very Good PG for Boys,    and girls.    food like home made nice quality, all facilities like RO water, Wi-Fi,  etc.   Owener and staff very  nice 24.  Hours.   On duty.   All market.  Near.   All mandir. Nearest.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.136783', 5, 368, 4),
(2194, '[Shreyas Nikam] The owner was supportive and treated us like his guest. Food was best part and the wifi has high speed. Enjoyed my stay here', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.136925', 5, 368, 4),
(2195, '[Mohd Faizan Ansari] This PG has  everything you are looking for accommodation away from home. From all basic Facilities to unforgettable nature of the Owner Mr Rajesh Jha and his Staff. This place has nearby good markets and Parks as well.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.137061', 5, 368, 4),
(2196, '[RAM SINGH YADAV] Great environment for students, excellent fooding with menu options, all facility like Ro drinking water, Ac, WI-FI avilable. Owner Mr Rajesh jha  and staff is very nice and Good supported persons', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.137206', 5, 368, 4),
(2197, '[vik shar23] Good Hostel for Boys studying in the jims college sector 5. Place is ok but nearby to the institute. Calm and good . Place is between North Party hall and Utsav Mandap on the same running bawana road place is at Rohini sector -16. Near Canal. Place at the road so good for transportation. Take bus from badli metro station or Rithala metro.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.155783', 5, 369, 4),
(2198, U&'[Yashraj singh Gaur] The Truth About NDPG:-n1) Your room gets 100 units of free electricity each month, post that 10 rs per unit(DTU DOSENT TELL YOU THIS EVER)n2) Rooms are Double Sharing and Have an air conditioner.n3) DTU dosent own it, this hostel is leased by DTU, So the Caretaker (private from owner) cheaps out on electricity in common areas. For eg:- they will not turn on the water cooler or Turn On ACs in Mess.n4) They have a DTU wifi which dosent work, and everyone in the administration asks to get your own private wifi in your room, for which you have to pay.n5) rooms are small, But have attached washrooms which is a plus point.n6) The food is not prepared here, It comes from aryabhatta hostel in DTU, (FOOD QUALITY IS BELOW AVERAGE AT TIMES), Also no dinner on Saturday Nights.n7) The stupid restrictions they have on students and no prior intimation of doccuments required at the time of joining the hostel is provided.n8) The Hostel does not have a GYM for the money they are charging us.n9) Most of your work related to hostel is done in DTU which makes it a hassle for the Students to go back and forth.n10) when your classes start at 8, and breakfast starts at 8, you\2019ll go hungry for the entire duration. Lunch time for mess is 12:30 to 2:00 so if you have classes then, say goodbye to lunch as well.n11) Maintenance is very very slow given that it comes under DTU for some things and for somethings the owner is responsible.nNote:- Their are far better PGs around DTU, with far better services at the same price, which are worth considering instead of this Hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.155932', 1, 369, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2199, '[Mehrab Hosain Robin] One of The best hostel for DTU Students.  Its only for foreigner students. It has good condition, its like a mini hostel. I am living here since January 2022, It has attached bathroom, AC for two students', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.156074', 5, 369, 4),
(2200, '[Dipesh] It''s the hostel for the boys who are studying in DTU. It''s 10mins walk from the campus gate. Rooms are clean as far as I know. Food may vary depending on the day. No non veg on Saturdays and Tuesdays. Chicken once a week. Bread omlet for breakfast if you order personally except saturdays and tuesdays.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.156268', 3, 369, 4),
(2201, '[R Sudhir] DTU Hostel for International Students, with all required facility. This hostel have all required facility like wifi power, backup. Near to main road connecting to Samaypur Badli Metro Station and very near to bus stand', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.156572', 4, 369, 4),
(2202, U&'[Dev] \+01f92b', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.156768', 1, 369, 4),
(2203, '[Ritam Saha] I have lived here for one year . The pg is very good, food is very hygienic, and pg owner is very cooperative with everyone', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.15693', 5, 369, 4),
(2204, '[Sharad] Perfectly better than other ynThe room msy be smaller  but they have bathroom attached', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.157073', 3, 369, 4),
(2205, '[Jamna bansal] Great hostel to stay and study. All facilities and good service.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.200958', 5, 371, 4),
(2206, U&'[Sofia] worst pg . The owner does not know how to talk to a girl and her parents . The owner and his wife and his son , every one of them are very rude and always beg for money .  They take too much electricity bill from everyone and they extend the metre on their own . Girls take the room because they provide single room which is rare and mess . But believe me you all are going to regret taking this pg because you won\2019t be able to drink water of this pg . It is tooo bad .  Workers also come to floors which is not allowed . I have left this pg a long time ago for that reason . It is too bad . Hopefully i got hostel in dtu . If you want pg try some other pg in that area but don\2019t take this one because the owner is too rude and take so much money . He acts like a beggar at the end of the month when he needs the money . I hope this pg closes soon because that they are so so so bad I can\2019t express .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.20129', 1, 371, 4),
(2207, '[Tarun] Room was nice totally good impression  5 star for all that but its  out of my budgetn1. Room was too good.n2. Wifi facility availablen3. Gym facilities nicen4. Fully secured (as i have seen camera, owner told us that she takes attendance of every girl before going to home', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.201453', 5, 371, 4),
(2208, '[Swati Bansal] Best pg in this area. Staying here for 2 years now and no complaints at all. The food, staff, hygiene, timely maintenance , facilities such as gym, open kitchen, lift etc and everything else including security is just perfect for someone staying away from home', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.201578', 5, 371, 4),
(2209, '[Jagdish singh] Very good PG with good security', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.201756', 5, 371, 4),
(2210, '[Yashita Jain] Special care for hygiene. Good and tasty food. Spacious. And charges are also very suitable. They have taken special care for girls'' safety as well.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.202079', 5, 371, 4),
(2211, '[Markush Murmu] Great PG for all', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.202601', 5, 371, 4),
(2212, '[Manik Aggarwal] Safe place for girls, owners are always there till 10:pm.nSuper clean rooms.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.202801', 5, 371, 4),
(2213, U&'[Aryansh Singh Dhakad] *Rao PG near MAIT College: Unreliable Management and Poor Facilities*nI strongly advise students to look elsewhere. The food quality here is consistently poor, and they often run out by 9:00 PM, leaving students who arrive late with no dinner and no alternative arrangements. The owner\2019s behavior is unprofessional and often abusive toward residents.nBe cautious of the high rating; most positive reviews appear to be from short-term guests (1\20132 days) who don''t experience the daily reality. If you are a long-term student, talk to people who have lived in Begampur for over a year\2014they will confirm that the facilities do not match the promises.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.22851', 1, 372, 4);     
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2214, '[RAVI KUMAR] Very good place for students', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.22867', 5, 372, 4),
(2215, '[Prateek Singh] Worst conditions to live in,nRooms have very less space and are too suffocatingnRailway have better condition of toilet then this place.nnFood quality is too bad,nMost of the time it''s better not to eat instead of that low nutrient food.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.228796', 1, 372, 4),
(2216, '[GOURI SHANKAR] Best  PG cum hostel in rohini ,I m here from last 4 yrs and I m not suffer any problem from the owners side as well as from their son....Very good behaviour both of them ...I m shifting to karnataka that''s why I leave this PG otherwise this best in rohini, much more spacious rooms as per the price, and the quality of food is best.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.228932', 5, 372, 4),
(2217, '[Pushpendra Kumar] Best PG near by MAIT roms are spacious with self care owner overall 5 star for thisnI had spent 4 years there for completion of my course suggest others.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.229226', 5, 372, 4),
(2218, '[33 Rizwan khan] Best rooms with all amneties atleast 90% pg in begampur are fake but RAO PG is genuine with self owner cares all', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.229537', 5, 372, 4),
(2219, U&'[Shashi Kumar] Very nice room,  well maintained ane food quality is awesome \+01f4afnnMost recommended', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.229736', 5, 372, 4),
(2220, '[Sumit Kumar] Great pg with proper cleaned and spacious rooms, with mess , wifi includednShops nearby so can easily get any stuff needed', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.229926', 5, 372, 4),
(2221, U&'[Aryan Pandey] Overall good,good owner uncle with well behaviour,must visit if you\2019re searching for a place to stay close to dtu college', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.253524', 5, 373, 4),
(2222, U&'[Ayush Kumar] I stayed here for a year and had a great experience! The place was super affordable and the vibe was really nice. Food was always on time and well-prepared, which was a big plus!nAnd rooms are also of decent size.nWould definitely recommend to anyone looking for a comfortable and budget-friendly option. \+01f64c', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.253685', 5, 373, 4),
(2223, '[Rohanrajan Vadivelraj] Very well managed PG. The owner Mr.Pradip ji is very warm and welcoming.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.253826', 5, 373, 4),
(2224, '[Third Friend] I Had Lived Here Before And Beleive me it''s so Shit That the owner says that you''ll get the power supply 24/7 but that''s just not the thing if the light goes out and the electricity is on inverter so u don''t have charging ports that can charge on inverter in the room .... I had. A very Important Work Or my college But there was no electricity and not any port that have inverter connection I lost my work don''t come to this place it''s doesn''t worthnnJust for a tip I want to tell the owner or ask him please change the ports to the inverter ones that must be easy of upcoming generation', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.253963', 1, 373, 4),
(2225, '[Ranjith Anburaj] Good place to live, owner is easily approachable.there is no unwanted interruptions.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.254104', 4, 373, 4),
(2226, U&'[Jai Parkash] Good place to stay  , much recommend that \+01f44d\+01f642', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.254229', 5, 373, 4),
(2227, '[Ishan Srivastava] If u want proximity to dtu and feel like u are at home and want this experience for cheap then, this is your place.nnWhat attracted me the most about this pg in first sight was how home like the atmosphere this pg has. The rooms are big like your own bedroom. Bedrooms have AC and more than sufficient lighting. Also, all rooms are connected to a hall which makes it like a mini indoor gokul dham society where everyone can have meetings when they get out of their rooms. Tables are good. Maybe bring your own chair but the chairs they provided were good enough for me.nnFood also tastes good. They need to improve their breakfast platter which can get below average sometimes and is mostly average but, the dinner and the lunch is outstanding if you get that on a regular basis. I promise you that the food you get here daily is better than the food you get on home on a daily basis.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.254358', 5, 373, 4);        
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2228, '[PRAVEEN BANSAL] It was nice stay in the Royal Homes PG. The  rooms are equipped with AC , table with chair, bed . Wifi faculty is available in each floor with good connectivity.  Location is very near to DTU college and at last the behaviour of uncle and aunty ( owner) is awesome ...', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.254485', 5, 373, 4),
(2229, '[Bhavy Doshi] I stayed at this PG for some time, and overall the experience was mixed. The owner is a very sweet and polite person, which made communication easy and comfortable. However, there were some issues that affected my stay.nnThe owner had mentioned that cleaning would be done every alternate day, but in reality, this was not followed regularly, and cleanliness was not maintained as expected. Additionally, the food provided in the mess was very poor in quality and taste, which was quite disappointing.nnApart from these issues, everything else was manageable. With better maintenance and improvement in food quality, this place could be much better.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.283947', 3, 374, 4),
(2230, '[Kashish Soni] Had a wonderful stay at this PG! The environment is safe. The owner is extremely supportive and always ready to help, which made my experience even more comfortable. It truly felt like a home away from home. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a peaceful and friendly place to stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.284248', 5, 374, 4),
(2231, U&'[ASHUTOSH RANJAN] It has been a year since I arrived in Delhi, and I have spent some of my finest moments in this PG. From the mess facilities and the atmosphere of the society to the proximity of the metro (within walking distance) and the cleanliness of the premises\2014everything here, from the mess staff right up to the owner, has truly given me a home-like feeling.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.284414', 5, 374, 4),
(2232, U&'[Buddhi prakash Saini] I honestly saying that I live this pg last 2 years till now but I have no any issues regarding anything and owner mr Narendra Singh uncleji very excellent or brilliant human\2764\fe0f any issue resolve with in 24 hours.this is very nice pg with affordable price with 2 time food and their chef Kailash cooking food very nice and their behavior very humble,kind or very good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.284718', 5, 374, 4),
(2233, '[Shaiza Rinso] Had a comfortable stay overall. The place was well-maintained and the management was supportive and responsive. Basic facilities were in place, making it a smooth experience. Thank you.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.28531', 5, 374, 4),
(2234, U&'[Iconic Surbhi] Must have pg if you are new in Delhi , the nature of the landlord is so supportive and everything is too good about them , space , living , everything is clean and affordable, food is also eatable , will prefer this pg again if needed \+01f493', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.285532', 5, 374, 4),
(2235, '[Navleen Saluja] It was good experience living here although food is ok. Everyone was very cooperative and any issue faced was solved on time. Cleaning was also proper.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.285685', 5, 374, 4),
(2236, U&'[Ritik Vats] I had a really good experience staying at Harpreet PG. The owner is very friendly, cooperative, and always ready to help with any issue. The food provided here is homely, tasty, , which makes it feel like you\2019re eating at home. Overall, a comfortable and welcoming place to stay. Highly recommended! \+01f31f\+01f31f\+01f31f\+01f31f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.285883', 4, 374, 4),
(2237, U&'[Chitrakshi Choudhary] I\2019m currently staying at BMR Girls PG, and my experience has been really good so far. The management is supportive and always ready to help whenever there\2019s any issue. The rooms are clean, the facilities are well maintained, and the overall environment is safe and comfortable for girls.nnOne of the biggest advantages is the location. It\2019s very close to DDUC, NSUT, NLU Delhi, and IP University Dwarka, which makes commuting to college extremely convenient.nnThe food is another highlight. It\2019s fresh, hygienic, and tastes like home, which is something I genuinely appreciate. Overall, I\2019m happy with my decision to stay here and would definitely recommend BMR Girls PG to students looking for a safe, peaceful, and well-managed place to live.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.308478', 5, 375, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2238, '[Sachin Lathwal] One of the best girls PG in sector 13 Dwarka in terms of safety for girls, food quality, living standard and amenities. Most compatible for students for nearby areas whether studying in colleges, training institutes and more pertinent to mention that even working women cannot get any place better than this PG in the vicinity. Reliable and cooperative staff who are willing to serve any time of the day whether day or night or in case of any medical emergency.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.308657', 5, 375, 4),
(2239, '[Ghanshyam yadav] If you are in search for a Best Girls PG in Dwarka area . It''s all about safety and comfort. A great PG should have 24*7 light and water supply ,CCTV cameras, a safe and secure gated society, and a female warden to help with any problem in day as well as in night time.nInside, the rooms must be clean and have good light. It is important to have fast Wi-Fi, regular cleaning, and tasty, home-style food . Being close to the Metro or bus stand makes traveling much easier in anywhere in Delhi NCR. A quiet and friendly and Green environment helps you feel relaxed after a long day of work or study.nBMR PG is Better than Best option in sector -13 Dwarka, New Delhi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.30879', 5, 375, 4),
(2240, '[Ajay Vashist] Best Girls PG in sector-13 Dwarka. Best Girls PG for DDUC,NSUT, NLU and IP University students ,Best environment for Allen, PW, VMC, Aaksah Narayana institute Students.nNeat and Clean PG , Awesome Food. Responsible owner.nFully Recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.308924', 5, 375, 4),
(2241, '[Dilip Pradhan] This is a very Good and safe PG for Girls.Neat and clean PG. Owner is very responsible person.nFood Quality is veryGood.nFully recommend by me and my Daughter.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.309058', 5, 375, 4),
(2242, '[Abhay Singh] Very Best PG for NSUT and DDUC students.nNice option For NLU and IPU university.nResponsible owner and Green Environment.nAwesome food and attached proper Mess.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.309345', 5, 375, 4),
(2243, '[Rajesh Kannan] Very Nice PG for Girls,Best option for NSUT Girls Students. Nearest Girls PG from DDUC . Responsible and reliable owner.Neat and Clean PG .Best Mess facilities available.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.309476', 5, 375, 4),
(2244, '[Satender Maina] Best Girls PG Near Sector-13 metro station for working women and Girls students, Vegas And Reliance mall and Radisson Blue Hotel.nSafe and secure with CCTV SERVELINCE.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.3096', 5, 375, 4),
(2245, '[Poonam Singh] Finding a reliable PG near Delhi University can be difficult, but DU INN offers a comfortable and hassle-free stay. Its location near North Campus is highly convenient for students. The rooms are clean, the facilities are good, and the staff is supportive, making it a dependable accommodation option.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.328988', 5, 376, 4),
(2246, '[Ranjan Kumar Singh] After taking admission in Delhi University, finding a good PG was quite challenging. Staying at DU INN made things much easier. Its location is one of the biggest advantages, with North Campus colleges like Hansraj, Hindu, KMC, and SRCC located nearby. Kamla Nagar market is also within easy reach, making daily life convenient. Overall, it is a comfortable and student-friendly place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.329129', 5, 376, 4),
(2247, U&'[R\00eet\00eek Sh\00fakl\00e0] DU INN not only exemplified the name of the institution but also provided one of the best accommodations around the campus with everything one could want. The food was top-notch and accompanied by a great ambiance in the rooms. Some of the extra amenities provided by them are good, and using the app to provide every possible solution that one faces sets the benchmark to follow. The management in the crisis to follow up was something commendable. Shout out to the students living there.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.32925', 5, 376, 4),
(2248, '[HavoKav] Has been asking to refund security deposit several times. It''s been 15 days after the end of agreement. They keep on pushing the date for refund.nnFirstly they don''t pick your calls or see messages then keep on pushing the date every 4 days.nnEdit::So 15th july is also gone now and still no refund is received.nnAlso tried contacting them several times. The only reply I got is that it will take time.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.332154', 1, 376, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2249, U&'[Keshav Sarda] The PG offers a great living experience \2014 the rooms are spacious, the food is genuinely good, and the overall environment is clean and well-maintained. Staff is helpful and everything feels organized. Perfect for anyone looking for a comfortable and reliable yet affordable student-friendly accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.332367', 5, 376, 4),
(2250, U&'[Aryan singh] \2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f (5/5)n\201cComfortable, Safe u0026 Student-Friendly!\201dnnI\2019ve been staying at DU Inn PG for a few months now, and honestly, it\2019s one of the best PGs around North Campus. The rooms are clean, spacious, and well-maintained. Wi-Fi speed is good, and there''s regular housekeeping.nnWhat I really appreciate is the homely vibe\2014peaceful environment, polite staff, and 24/7 security which makes it perfect for students, especially if you''re living alone for the first time. The food is hygienic and way better than most other PGs (ghar jaisa nahi but close enough \+01f604).nnLocation is a big plus too\2014very close to DU colleges and metro stations, so commuting is super easy.nnHighly recommend it if you''re looking for a safe and comfy stay near Delhi University!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.332504', 5, 376, 4),
(2251, '[Raghav Ramola] Staying at this pg has been a wonderful experience! The rooms are clean and comfortable, with all the necessary amenities. The food is delicious and feels just like home-cooked meals. The management is friendly and always ready to help. With its convenient location and warm atmosphere, truly feels like a home away from home. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.332642', 5, 376, 4),
(2252, U&'[Avichal Bhardwaj] My experience personally  is very good about this pg.nThe staff is good and coperative.nSometimes there are delaysnBut that is acceptablenBcz the behavior of the owner and staff is very goodnAnd it feels like  home.nIt is my third year staying in the same pgn\+01fac2\2764\fe0flove it', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.33277', 5, 376, 4),
(2253, U&'[Tosh Sharma] Best experience in my life. Bahut badiya PG hai family ki wajah se jana pada warna mai change nhi krta.bike parking,wifi,RO,washing machine, near by metro, near by all market everything is near pg, clean and safe pg.agar koi PG search kr raha hai to pls visit \+01f64f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.351797', 5, 377, 4),
(2254, U&'[NEHA DUBEY] \2022 My younger sister Gunjan lives here, and I also visit this PG regularly. Based on her experience, she feels very stress-free, safe, and comfortable because of the positive and caring environment.nn\2022 Walking distance from Metro station and bus stop, very convenient for daily travel.n\2022 Spacious big rooms and large terrace (2 rooftops) to walk and relax.n\2022 CCTV cameras installed for full safety and security.n\2022 Market is very near, everything is easily available.n\2022 Living here since last 2 years, and stayed in 3 other PGs in Delhi NCR before \2014 this is the most comfortable one.n\2022 Owner\2019s behavior is very good and family-like, no unnecessary interference and full privacy maintained.n\2022 Any issue gets resolved immediately, even at night.n\2022clean roomn\2022Two different pg for girls and boys in different locationsn\2022Neary by food shops and groceries shops available,n\2022 washing machine available', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.351926', 5, 377, 4),
(2255, '[Ankit 5430] Best living place for single boys.nFacilitynBike parkingnKitchen availablen2 min walking distance from metronRo waternWashing machinenFreezenI am staying about 2 years best place', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.352094', 5, 377, 4),
(2256, '[Dharmendra] Kitchen available for self cooking,nNearby Mess option u0026 tiffin services also availablenMetro(Dashrath puri, Mahavir Enclave) 1 minute walking.nFull cooperation from owner Naveen bhai.nOverall an affordable option.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.352219', 5, 377, 4),
(2257, '[Lata Bisht] I personally like this PG very much...... owner are very friendly and cooperative..... Great choice for those who don''t want to spend half of their earning in rent.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.352336', 5, 377, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2258, '[Ankit Ghosh] Good pg . Metro station are nearby . Kitchen was available in the pg . Good location. Wifi , cooler , fridge are available', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.352482', 5, 377, 4),
(2259, '[Shashikant Yadav] My experience here was very good. The rooms are clean and airy, and have all the necessary amenities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.352597', 5, 377, 4),
(2260, '[Kriti Chawla] I have been staying in this PG for the last 2 years and the food is really good, and homemade. The owner is very cooperative and sweet, takes any kind of issue on priority and resolve it quickly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.352711', 5, 377, 4),
(2261, '[Daksh Bhatnagar] Stayed here for almost a year and it truly felt like home. The rooms are clean, food is good, and the owner is very supportive. Never faced any major issues. Would definitely recommend this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.378735', 5, 378, 4),
(2262, '[prithvi raj] One of the better PGs in this area. Clean rooms, homely food, and a peaceful environment. The owner and staff are supportive and responsive. Would definitely recommend for students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.379096', 5, 378, 4),
(2263, '[Swastikaa Bhatnagar] Nice PG with a homely vibe. Rooms are spacious, WiFi works well, and cleaning is done regularly. Felt safe throughout my stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.379227', 5, 378, 4),
(2264, '[Shankar dayal] I stayed in this student accommodation and overall it was a positive experience. The room was well-sized for a student, with enough space for studying and storing my belongings', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.37935', 5, 378, 4),
(2265, U&'[Sona Bhatnagar] Highly recommended! Clean rooms, good food, and no unnecessary restrictions. It\2019s a stress-free place to live.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.379478', 5, 378, 4),
(2266, '[Sanjay Bhatnagar] I had a very comfortable stay here. The owner is understanding and responsive, and all basic facilities are well maintained. Worth the price.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.379717', 5, 378, 4),
(2267, '[Shalabh Singh] This is Krishna pg is a kind of a home away from home. We all stay being a part of their family. The environment is cool and calm and safe indeed. Being in this pg is a good choice of mine and the best thing is this the behaviour of owner is so good as compared to other pg. Attractive infrastructure and good facilities at a responsible rate. Neat and hygiene rooms. I visited more than 10 pg at this location but this pg is the best as compared to other.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.379988', 5, 378, 4),
(2268, '[Ankit Kalshan] I spend 4 months in krishna pg and i can say, this is best in the area. Owner is also good and quality of room is what you can go for. 5 star ac, automatic washing machine, beautiful roof view are the one of the best features of it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.380128', 5, 378, 4),
(2269, U&'[Ayushi Singh] I had a wonderful stay at the PG. The environment was clean, safe and homely. The staff was courteous and always ready to help, making my time there comfortable and hassle-free. I truly appreciated the peaceful atmosphere and the well-maintained facilities. It felt like a home away from home and I\2019d gladly recommend it to anyone looking for a quality stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.425097', 5, 380, 4),
(2270, '[Sunita Kathpalia] Lovely location. Very close to commercial areas and hospitals and SPM college. Food is healthy and safe. Good family living below us- always ready to help. Spacious rooms and terrace. Would always choose it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.42524', 5, 380, 4),
(2271, '[Ashok Kathpalia] My daughter had a nice time. Big rooms- spacious and airy- homely food. Good landlords. Would 100% recommend to anyone. Budget friendly and secure place', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.425378', 5, 380, 4),
(2272, '[Sudipti Saxena] This is my home away from home. The caretakers were very helpful and the landlord treated me like their own daughter. Never let me feel like I was staying away from my family.nThe rooms are spacious and amenities work well. Metro station is very close-by too. Really good pg!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.425583', 5, 380, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2273, '[SJ] Had a really comfortable stay at this PG. The rooms were clean, peaceful environment, and everything well-maintained. The host was really kind and  responsive, and made sure all our needs were taken care of. Would definitely recommend!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.425954', 5, 380, 4),
(2274, '[Ojas Jain] Amazing place to live at , the hosts are very kind and cooperative and the area is also very safe', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.426218', 5, 380, 4),
(2275, '[Lakshya Choudhary] The PG is nothing less than a home. It is clean, spacious , safe. Closely situated to metro station, SPM college , Central Market, Club road. The family lived just below us and was extremely warm and welcoming. Helped my sister when she was sick. Would recommend it 100 percent .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.426361', 5, 380, 4),
(2276, '[Ayushmaan Wanchoo] The best PG I could ask for my family members. Helped my sister personally during her financial and health crisis, while the family was away. Great hosts!! Spacious and well lit. Safe and secure, centrally located .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.426489', 5, 380, 4),
(2277, U&'[vaibhav bumb] I stayed in this PG for almost 2 years and had a really great experience \+01f60a\2728. The food  feels just like home-cooked meals \+01f372\+01f35b.nThe owner is very kind, supportive, and caring, and they treat everyone like family \+01f91d\+01f3e1\2764\fe0f.nThe rooms and common areas are also cleaned regularly, which keeps the place neat and hygienic \+01f9f9\2728nI truly appreciate the care and hospitality I received here \+01f64f\2728 and would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a safe, peaceful, and homely place to live \+01f31f.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.470372', 5, 382, 4),
(2278, U&'[Deepanshu Garg] \201cClean rooms, decent facilities, and a comfortable stay overall. Management is responsive and basic amenities are well maintained. Good option for students/working professionals looking for a practical and affordable PG.\201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.470516', 5, 382, 4),
(2279, U&'[NISHITH SINHA] I''ve been living here for three years and can confidently say the experience has been excellent. The behavior of the owner as well as staff, the cleanliness of the place, and the quality of the food are all top-notch. What stands out the most is the overall environment they maintain. It''s a fantastic, budget-friendly place to live\2014something that''s incredibly hard to find in a city like Delhi.n\200bI highly recommend this place to students and working professionals looking for a great PG (paying guest accommodation). Come and experience the difference for yourself', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.470646', 5, 382, 4),
(2280, '[Pranshu Gupta] Nice and comfortable place to stay. The best part is the food, the mess is really good. Cleaning is done daily. I would definitely recommend it to MAIT and MAIMS students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.47081', 5, 382, 4),
(2281, '[Shimul Sharma] I''ve been here for almost 2 years. The best part is the food, best in the nearby locality. Everyday cleaning of rooms and that too on a very reasonable price.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.470945', 5, 382, 4),
(2282, '[Devansh Adlakha] Undoubtedly the best pg present in the locality. Cleaning done on daily basis.  Issues are resolved at the earliest without any unnecessary delay. They place the highest priority on food quality and unarguably serve the best food in the locality.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.471074', 5, 382, 4),
(2283, U&'[Shreyam Jain] My stay at this PG was truly amazing. The environment was peaceful and felt like home. The owner was kind, approachable, and always made sure everything was perfect for the students.nnThe food was delicious and hygienic, offering a homely touch to every meal. The daily cleaning of the rooms ensured everything stayed fresh and tidy, which added to the overall comfort.nnI couldn\2019t have asked for a better place to stay. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a clean, comfortable, and well-managed PG!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.471206', 5, 382, 4);          
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2284, '[Abhas] Best food in the locality, cleaning of rooms every day, reasonable price, owners are very friendly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.471346', 5, 382, 4),
(2285, '[Anima Champromary] This pg near du for boys is very nice I stayed here for two years. Very comfortable stay. Owner and staff was very cooperative. Good was nice and was like my home food. Thanks to the warden and the cook kali ji. I love you all', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.49206', 5, 383, 4),
(2286, '[Sharma RPC Aiims] I used to live here back in 2024 and my personal experience with this pg was extremely good. The owner and warden were polite. The rent fees was reasonable enough. The room and catering services were on time. It helped me a lot to prepare for my ias exam. The environment was clean and silent which overall boosted my performance.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.492205', 5, 383, 4),
(2287, U&'[Thoi Thoi] I\2019ve had a really good experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean, food is decent, and the environment is peaceful. The owner/warden is cooperative and any issues are resolved quickly. Overall, a comfortable and safe place to stay. Would definitely recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.492345', 5, 383, 4),
(2288, '[Ramesh Yadav] Very comfortable stay at My Den Boys PG near Nangia Park. They provide 4-time meals, WiFi, laundry, and housekeeping. Great facilities at a reasonable price.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.492627', 5, 383, 4),
(2289, '[Ravinandan Kumar] For some time I stayed in this pg hostel. Good ambience. Good management. Good food. Reasonable price. Good staff. I was happy and will come again. Best of luck to all the management', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.492793', 5, 383, 4),
(2290, '[Taquee Ahmad Qadri] I have been staying at MY DEN Boys PG, Shakti Nagar for around 1.5 years, and my overall experience has been quite positive. The food quality is decent and consistent considering the price range, and the environment is comfortable for students. Rooms are maintained properly, and basic facilities are provided without unnecessary issues. The management and warden are supportive and responsive when needed. For anyone looking for a budget-friendly PG in this area, this place is a reliable and practical option', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.492932', 4, 383, 4),
(2291, '[Sumesh Meena] Safe and peaceful environment. The rooms are spacious and well-ventilated. Food is tasty and served on time. Best PG in this area..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.493073', 5, 383, 4),
(2292, U&'[Yogesh Patel] My Den PG is good for staying for long period . Familiar environment and supportive warden and other staff members, food quality is also good like at home \+01f3e1.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.493209', 4, 383, 4),
(2293, U&'[Dhaarna Arora] It\2019s the best PG in West Delhi, located in a prime area with everything nearby (market, grocery shops, etc.). The owners personally manage the PG and serve delicious, homely cooked food. They are very friendly and treat you like a member of their own family. Highly recommend for everyone to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.537798', 5, 385, 4),
(2294, U&'[bhavna sharma] My junior stayed at this girls\2019 PG accommodation, and her experience was satisfactory. The place was clean, safe, and suitable for students. She was comfortable with the facilities and overall environment. It is a decent and reliable option for girls looking for accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.538789', 5, 385, 4),
(2295, U&'[Sourabh Samra] Highly recommend this PG! My cousin stayed here while studying at Maharaja Surajmal Institute, and it was a great experience. The location is perfect, the rooms are well-maintained, and most importantly, it\2019s very safe. The food quality was consistently good, which is rare to find!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.539167', 5, 385, 4),
(2296, '[Roshani Nigam] My sister stayed in this pg while studying in bharti college. The environment is amazing and very good.the owners are very cooperative. Food is hygienic,clean and tidy. They provide every facility which include maid for cleaning of rooms and washrooms , hygienic food. The owners are poltie and very cooperative. The transportation facilities is near to this place .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.539331', 5, 385, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2297, '[Deepak Verma] Clean, well-maintained rooms (often featuring AC and modern interiors).nHygiene-focused food services.nHigh-speed Wi-Fi and 24x7 security/CCTV', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.539463', 5, 385, 4),
(2298, '[Rakesh Verma] My sister stayed here and she loved staying there..food is amazing and owners are very polite cooperative and nice. Totally recommended and safe', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.539595', 5, 385, 4),
(2299, U&'[Ayush Verma] I had a very good experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean and well-maintained.\201dn\201cThe owner is very kind and helpful. I felt safe and comfortable here.\201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.539712', 5, 385, 4),
(2300, U&'[Arisa Nasreen] My stay here was mentally draining The food is terrible unhygienic, and repetitive. On top of that, the owner\2019s behavior is extremely controlling and rude There is constant negativity  and unnecessary interference in residents\2019 lives The toxic environment created by the owner affects mental peace badly  No student or working person should have to live in such an uncomfortable and stressful place  I regret choosing this PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.539917', 1, 385, 4),
(2301, U&'[Rahul Kumar] The PG is clean and well mentained with regular and good quality cleaning service.nThe rooms are nice and comfortable and the kitchen is well equipped with everything needed for daily cooking.nOwner is very polite and kind which makes the stay even more comfortable.nThe neighborhood is claim and pleasent making it a good place to live.nOverall it has been a satisfactory and peaceful stay. \+01f607\+01f44c\+01f44c', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.574069', 5, 386, 4),
(2302, '[Md aslam Md aslam] Probably the best pg for boys in pitampura at cheapest prices.owner is very soft and polite.Food is so so delicious here.l will surely recommend everyone to must visit and stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.574225', 5, 386, 4),
(2303, '[INDER Nishad] Best pg in peeragarhi delhinI am staying in amarjeet pg.nOwner is so good person.nFood quality is good.nClean rooms. Fresh, homely food served 3 times a daynFully furnished rooms with attached bathroom u0026 balcony, separate almirah, study table u0026 chairnHigh-speed Wi-Fi, RO water, water dispenser, daily housekeeping, 24x7 power u0026 water backupnDining area, CCTV surveillancenPosh area, nearby banks, ATMs, gyms, markets, malls', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.574347', 5, 386, 4),
(2304, '[Shivang Mauryanshi] Best pg and good and hygiene food and management services', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.574465', 5, 386, 4),
(2305, U&'[Sadhavi Verma] Good location and this pg is very nice. It''s very good pg. This pg is near West enclave. Location is good according to transport. I love the food of this full house vibes. People is also good here. This place is good for students and  job worker. This pg fells like home it is very beautiful place \+01f44c', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.574582', 5, 386, 4),
(2306, '[Rupali Rathour] This pg is best. It is very affordable and food quality is very good . It is very nice place with a low price . This pg is safe for girls and boys both . Staff is also nice here . I strongly recommend this pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.574773', 5, 386, 4),
(2307, '[Bioology Chemistry] Best pg for students or working person food service and environment is also very nice affordable price and water wi-fi cleaning laundry etc service available', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.574958', 5, 386, 4),
(2308, '[official Anjali] It is worth money, positive feedback on friendly family commendably good, everyone is very supportive and you will get total familiar environment here.Room are clean hygiene landlord doesn''t treat you like pg tenant instead make you feel like home', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.575165', 5, 386, 4),
(2309, U&'[sanjay] Excellent Stay and Perfect Location!nnI\2019ve had a wonderful experience staying at this PG near the metro station in Delhi. The location is super convenient \2014 just a short walk to the metro, which makes commuting so easy. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and spacious. The staff is very polite and always ready to help with anything you need.nnThe atmosphere here feels safe and homely, and all the facilities like Wi-Fi, laundry, and regular cleaning are top-notch. It\2019s also great value for money considering the location and comfort.nnHighly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable, affordable, and convenient place to stay in Delhi!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.599637', 5, 387, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2310, '[Al Salah] At first 5 out of 5nVery good and well condition roomnNo crowd and noise no disturbance. Good behaviour.nI would like to suggest Those who are looking for PG in Delhi should come and visit once', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.59979', 5, 387, 4),
(2311, '[Sajal Kumar Awasthi] I have been staying at PG for the past few days and it has been a wonderful experience. The staff and the owner are friendly and helpful. The rooms are spacious, clean and well maintained. The amenities are top-notch and the location is great. I love the fact that there is an in-house kitchen, which makes it easy to prepare meals. The common area is also a great place to socialize and meet other people. Overall, I am very satisfied with my stay here and would highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.599923', 5, 387, 4),
(2312, '[rahulyadav rahul] The pg is good and budget friendly for all', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.600046', 5, 387, 4),
(2313, '[Abhay Pratap Singh] The worst pg I have ever seen. The owner is very rude and take a month time to do any work and there is a dog in pg who poops everywhere and it takes 2-3 days for cleaning.She charges extra Rent on me when I was vacating the room.Please never go in this pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.600226', 1, 387, 4),
(2314, '[The Unusual Guy] It''s a great place you can find in pahadganj regardless of you are studying or job.Good environment, people are good here, especially the owner is a kind hearted person.nRO water, bathroom, Toilet, Kitchen,bed ...etc everything is good.nI had a great time living here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.600347', 5, 387, 4),
(2315, '[Mudit Singh] It is an okay place to stay. The rooms are well maintained and well lit. The owner, Mr. Rajesh Nanda is an amicable person, but has to be told 3 times before resolving of an issue.Does not interfere much. The PG is quite big with near about 25 rooms providing single, double and triple accommodation. Geyser, AC and free WiFi(good speed) are provided. Maid comes to clean as well. There is space to dry clothes as well. The cost is competitive but food is an issue. You need to find an alternative for food. I am staying for 8 months now, had a pleasant experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.600466', 3, 387, 4),
(2316, '[PRADEEP JHA] Feel like homestaynLove the place', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.600584', 5, 387, 4),
(2317, '[Subhadeep Mondal] I am from West Bengal, and I really like this PG. The food quality is much better compared to other PGs, and the rooms are also clean and comfortable. Overall, a good place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.64693', 5, 389, 4),
(2318, '[NAYAN KUMAR ROY] This PG is a comfortable and pleasant place to live. An aunty and an uncle look after everyone very well and are always caring and supportive. The food they provide is good in quality, tasty, and healthy. The rooms are neat, cozy, and properly maintained. The overall environment is calm, safe, and welcoming. The residents here are polite and friendly, which makes living here even better. Compared to other PGs in Tilak Nagar, this one is quite affordable. Overall, it is a great place to stay, and I would surely recommend it to others.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.647067', 5, 389, 4),
(2319, '[Jakir Hussain] This PG is a very nice and comfortable place. An aunty and an uncle take very good care of the residents. They always provide good food, and the food is tasty and healthy. They are very kind, helpful, and caring people. The rooms are clean, comfortable, and well maintained. The atmosphere of the PG is peaceful and pleasant. The people living here are also respectful and friendly. In my opinion, this is one of the best PGs in Tilak Nagar. The facilities are good, and the environment feels safe. The PG is also very affordable compared to other PGs in the area. Overall, it is a very good place to stay, and I would definitely recommend this PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.647298', 5, 389, 4),
(2320, '[Amit Kumar] I''ve been living here for last 3 months. Conditions of pgs are good , Neat and clean.nBatra uncle is such a humble person. Always available to help childrens.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.647512', 5, 389, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2321, '[Mayank Kumar] I am from jharkhand I stay for 2 months. I like their behavior as family members. They provide good food and clean room. If anybody from Nepal or from India can come to stay in Batra Boys PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.647649', 5, 389, 4),
(2322, U&'[Pawan Kumar] Hello friends, my name is Pawan Kumar and I am from Punjab province. I had a great time at Batra PG, Ganesh Nagar (New Delhi). I got a lot of love and support from aunty and uncle here. I never faced any problem while staying here, rather whatever I needed, Batra uncle used to fulfill it immediately. Aunty also fed me good food with a lot of love, in fact, she used to feed me as much as I wanted to eat. Uncle is also cheerful and friendly due to which I had a great time. So whoever wants to come here can come without hesitation. Both AC and non AC rooms are available here. Thank you \+01f64f\+01f495', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.647827', 5, 389, 4),
(2323, '[Sohelshaikh] I really liked staying in this Pen u0026 Guest House. I am from Gujarat and I also study in Multi Tech Institute in Tilak Nagar. I did not have any accommodation arrangement here, so I got a chance to stay in Batra Boys PG and I liked the food, accommodation and facilities here very much. I love to live here. I cannot believe that I was not my home. And I want to give this suggestion or advice to you people that if someone is coming to Delhi in Tilak Nagar or is studying near Tilak Nagar, then he can stay in Batra Boys PG. It is good, you will be able to stay from home. And thanks to the owner of Batra PG for giving me such a good facility. Thank you so much.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.647958', 5, 389, 4),
(2324, U&'[Jagesh Chauhan] I''m staying at Batra PG from last one year, and it was an outstanding experience. The facilities are top-notch, with clean and well-maintained rooms. The location is convenient, with easy access to public transport, shops, and restaurants. The food provided is delicious and hygienic. I highly recommend Batra PG to anyone looking for a comfortable and hassle-free stay.\+01f44d\+01f44d\+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.648151', 5, 389, 4),
(2325, '[Shivam Chaouhan] All grocery stores are nearby and the road lanes are quite wide so it was easy to bring our traveller bus here', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.703854', 5, 391, 4),
(2326, U&'[Anjali Kumari] I had a great experience over here, people were so humble and kind, completely homely feeling it was.nnWould love to visit again\+01f33b', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.704429', 5, 391, 4),
(2327, '[Nitish Tomar] Had a beautiful time staying here with friends, never had any problems while staying, everything was properly managed', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.704789', 5, 391, 4),
(2328, U&'[Surbhi Rao] Amazing place, near to metro station and prices are lenient compared to other pgs I\2019ve visited', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.704989', 5, 391, 4),
(2329, '[Supriyo Sarkar] Good experience... Very comfortable and with good supporting staffs... It''s very affordable in budget', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.705151', 5, 391, 4),
(2330, '[It''s Aalok nagar] Amazing place, it''s couple friendly and is not like many other places, staff is friendly and easy going space', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.705438', 5, 391, 4),
(2331, '[Cecil Anita] Walking distance to the main road, has all facilities required, overall good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.705586', 5, 391, 4),
(2332, '[Shaki Kumar] The parking is a very good feature this building has, nowadays that''s hard to find', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.705779', 5, 391, 4),
(2333, '[Ram Tripathi] Amazing hospitality and awesome facilities. Well maintained and clean rooms at decent pricing. Good stay if you''re a student from NSUT or DDU college. I have stayed at Max PG for four years without any problems.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.757579', 5, 393, 4),
(2334, '[Amit Kumar] A calm, peaceful, and hygiene-focused PG with well-behaved and courteous staff. A place where you can stay comfortably without a second thought.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.757713', 5, 393, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2335, U&'[Sayantan Sikdar] I used to live in Room 101, and the experience was very good. I had my own personal washroom, and I paid \20b911,000 for a single room. The PG is located very close to NSUT Delhi, which made it extremely convenient. It also provided free washing machine facilities and 24/7 hot and cold water. The staff maintained the cleanliness well throughout my stay.nnThere was a three-month agreement for my stay, and I had paid an advance equal to one month\2019s rent, which I received back two days after vacating the PG. The only drawback was the electricity charge, which was quite high at \20b910 per unit.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.757832', 5, 393, 4),
(2336, '[Shohit Virmani] The most pathetic and horrible experience. The person didn''t capture the details in advance and called me to his PG which was located way away from the metro location and then asked me to go. When I countered him that this is the second day I am visiting ur PG why wasn''t I informed earlier he said it was the other guys fault of the same PG. Pathetic service.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.75795', 1, 393, 4),
(2337, '[6ZERO] I have visited many P.G ''snBut MAX P.G has its own qualitynIt is none of kindnAffordable PricenExcellent AmbiencenWell MaintainednAnd the most important thing is it''s FoodnVery nice and fresh , tasty foodnAnd it''s Owner Mr.Sachin Singh ,very friendly person.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.758067', 5, 393, 4),
(2338, '[Piyush] In my opinion the best pg in Dwarka mor. The facilities are top notch and absolutely recommend it!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.758267', 5, 393, 4),
(2339, '[Manju Gupta] My experience with sister Sanju in oncology treatment room is very good she is very supportive and friendly nature .Her treatment procedure  is best.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.758382', 5, 393, 4),
(2340, '[Vikas Kumar] I am satisfied with the facilities provided. The environment is well-maintained, peaceful, and suitable for comfortable living.nnBest PG for students and job workers.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.758508', 5, 393, 4),
(2341, U&'[Siddhant] Good owner, listens and responds to queries. Supportive staff. Food is tasty and the vegetable selection is thoughtful, rotis can be better. Nice tenants. Sector 8 can\2019t have better PG than this for the price.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.782433', 5, 394, 4),
(2342, '[R J] This PG is one of the worst places to stay. The owner behaves very badly and is often drunk, which creates an uncomfortable and unsafe environment for tenants. They make false promises at the time of joining and later refuse to return the security deposit to anyone. Management is extremely unprofessional, and they do not care about students or working people living there. Rooms and services are also not worth the money they charge. I would strongly advise everyone to avoid this PG if you want peace of mind and honest treatment', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.782567', 1, 394, 4),
(2343, U&'[Abhishek Kumar Singh] Staying here as a college student was a seamless experience. The owner\2019s behavior is excellent and highly supportive; please do not believe the baseless rumors suggesting otherwise. Everything is offered at a reasonable price, and I never faced any difficulty. I highly recommend this PG for its great environment and management.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.782692', 5, 394, 4),
(2344, '[Owaiz Ali ansari] I had a great stay at Suman PG. The rooms are clean and well-maintained, and the environment is comfortable for students. The owner is cooperative and responsive. Location is also convenient with nearby shops and transport. Overall, a good place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.78281', 5, 394, 4),
(2345, U&'[shailendra sahu] My experience at Suman PG was very good. The rooms were clean and comfortable. The food quality was nice\2014simple, tasty, and felt like homemade meals. The staff was helpful and friendly. Overall, the stay was peaceful and safe. Considering the budget, this PG is a great option.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.782928', 5, 394, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2346, '[JK Pandey] Nice and comfortable place to stay. Clean rooms, good facilities, and supportive management. Overall, a great experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.783047', 5, 394, 4),
(2347, '[Dheeraj Pathak] Amazing facilities nd Friendly staff along with best food service', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.783175', 5, 394, 4),
(2348, '[Nishant Thakur] Good place to stay for students or people looking for affordable stays. Food can be better.nYes security is completely refunded.nOwner is always responsive for any kind of query.nHad a decent stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.783352', 3, 394, 4),
(2349, '[Kaushal S.] Quite a pathetic place to choose for your next accomodation, whether temporary or long term.nnThe services promised at the time of joining will be all available, but will not work properly, or might not work at all.nnA donkey would be better than the caretakers or customer support, as the donkey may at least pay a little attention to what you have to say. The whole management plays blame games while taking no accountability of the issues at the hand.nnThe ticket system is the dumbest gimmick, because literally nobody gives a Fvck.nnYou are better off considering other PGs or even a flat than coming to this hellhole.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.805701', 1, 395, 4),
(2350, '[Mahmiz Mallick] Worst pg ever would never recommend living here. The bathrooms are dirty showers leak all the time. No dustbin is provided. They broke my 11 month contract and shut the place down in 3 months barely gave any notice to move out and had to figure out something to move out within 2 days. Will NEVER RECOMMEND', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.805841', 1, 395, 4),
(2351, '[Abhishek Chaudhary] Very well everything is neet an clean and the staff of that pg is so good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.805962', 5, 395, 4),
(2352, U&'[Yogesh Agrahari] Zolo ke online listing par jab maine 1 month stay ke liye property dekhi, toh price \20b97,000\2013\20b98,000 ke aaspaas dikhaya gaya tha. Yeh dekh kar laga ki kaafi budget-friendly option hai. Lekin jab actual booking aur payment ka time aaya, tab asli picture saamne aayi.nn\+01f4b8 Hidden Charges u0026 Taxes:nnFinal amount \20b915,000 ke kareeb tha, jo initial price se lagbhag double hai.nnBooking ke baad service charges, maintenance fees, platform fees, aur GST alag se add kiya gaya.nnKahi bhi clearly mention nahi kiya gaya tha ki itne saare extra charges lagenge.nn\+01f4c9 Transparency ki kami:nnWebsite ya app par jo price dikhaya jata hai, wo misleading hai.nnBooking ke baad hi full breakdown milta hai, tab tak user commitment kar chuka hota hai.nn\+01f615 User Experience:nnPehli baar Zolo use karne wale logon ke liye yeh experience confusing aur disappointing ho sakta hai.nnAgar aap budget mein rehna chahte hain, toh yeh hidden costs aapke plans ko bigaad sakte hain.nn\+01f4cc Suggestion: Zolo ko chahiye ki wo upfront pricing dikhaye \2013 jisme saare charges included ho \2013 taaki users ko koi surprise na mile.nnMisleading Pricing u0026 Hidden ChargesnnI recently booked a 1-month stay at a Zolo property. The app showed a price of \20b97,000\2013\20b98,000, which seemed affordable. But when the rent agreement arrived, the actual cost was nearly \20b915,000. That\2019s almost double!nn\+01f4b8 Hidden Charges Galore:nnThe app doesn\2019t show any of the extra charges like service fees, maintenance, platform charges, or GST.nnAll these are quietly added in the rent agreement \2014 after you\2019ve already committed to the booking.nn\+01f4f1 Why Hide Charges on the App? If Zolo already knows the full cost, why not show it upfront on the app? Why wait till the rent agreement to reveal everything? This lack of transparency is frustrating and feels like a trap for first-time users.nn\+01f615 Confusing u0026 Misleading Experience:nnThe pricing structure is not clear at all.nnYou think you\2019re booking a budget stay, but end up paying almost double.nnThere\2019s no proper breakdown until it\2019s too late.nn\+01f4cc My Advice: Zolo should clearly display the total monthly cost \2014 including all taxes and fees \2014 right on the app. Rent agreements shouldn\2019t be the first place users discover the real price.]', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.806078', 1, 395, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2353, '[Arman Aarzii] I recently had the opportunity to stay at Zolo Sun N Sand Co-living | Redefined PG, and I must say it was a delightful experience. From the moment I checked in, I felt welcomed and well taken care of.nnLet''s start with the food. The meals provided were delicious and diverse. The menu offered a variety of options to suit different tastes and dietary preferences. The quality of the ingredients used was impressive, and the meals were always served fresh and hot. I thoroughly enjoyed the dining experience during my stay.nnThe accommodation''s air conditioning system deserves a special mention. The AC units in the rooms were highly efficient and ensured a cool and comfortable environment even during the hottest days. It was a relief to come back to a well-cooled room after a day of exploring the city.nnSpeaking of the rooms, they were spacious, clean, and well-maintained. The bed was comfortable, providing a good night''s sleep. The overall ambiance of the room was cozy and inviting, making me feel right at home.nnIn addition to the AC, each room also had a fan, which was a thoughtful addition. It provided an alternative cooling option for those who prefer natural airflow or want to conserve energy. The fan worked well and helped create a pleasant breeze in the room.nnThe washrooms were kept clean at all times. The cleanliness standards were commendable, and I never encountered any issues with hygiene. The hot water supply was consistent, and the bathroom amenities provided were of good quality.nnOverall, my stay at Zolo Sun N Sand Co-living | Redefined PG was a memorable one. The food, AC, room, fan, and washroom facilities all exceeded my expectations. The staff was friendly and attentive, ensuring that my needs were met throughout my stay. I would highly recommend this accommodation to anyone looking for a comfortable and convenient place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.806203', 5, 395, 4),
(2354, '[Anavadya Kalathingal] The worst pg ever, bad service, worst maintainance u can ever imagine and idk how they got rating 4! Cockroachs in the room, no ventilation. They will even charge maintainace for not maintaining, more than 2k rupees.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.806388', 1, 395, 4),
(2355, '[Inaaya Baig] Serives are excellent. All facilities available.nStaff is cooperative and helpful.nManager is humble.His behavior is good.nPg is located in good place.nRoom cleaning services are good.nThey provide you all facilities including refrigerator, ac,geyser,wifi,washing machines etc.nHighly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.806506', 5, 395, 4),
(2356, '[Hansraj Prajapati] A good place to stay. They provide all the facilities including ac,geyser, refrigerator, washing machine, induction,RO,TV etc .nBehaviour of property manager is good. The whole staff behaves nicely. If someone face any difficulty related to staying,they can contact to property manager. He listens to problem and give solutions.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:58.806618', 5, 395, 4),
(2357, '[Krishna Tyagi] Very nice PG with a friendly atmosphere. The rooms are clean, the food is decent, and the owner is supportive. It''s a safe and comfortable place for students and working professionals. Would recommend it to anyone looking for a good PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.009599', 5, 398, 4),
(2358, '[Rishi Kumar Tokas] This PG provides everything a student or working professional needs. The rooms are spacious, housekeeping is done regularly, Wi-Fi is reliable, and the food feels like home. The peaceful environment makes it easy to study and relax after work.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.009738', 5, 398, 4),
(2359, '[MOHAMMED ASJAD] I am Dr Asjad I was  staying in tokas pg since 1 year it was a wonderful experience and the services it provides is good and staff is well mannernnSecurity of pg is good the card , camera''snnThank you sir and mamntokas pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.009856', 5, 398, 4),
(2360, '[Divij Sain] One of the best PGs in Dwarka Mor. Clean rooms, good amenities, and hassle-free stay. Definite 5 stars!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.010384', 5, 398, 4);    
