(2361, '[Mohammed Asjad] I am Dr Asjad I was  staying in tokas pg since 1 year it was a wonderful experience and the services it provides is goodnnThank you sir and mamntokas pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.010564', 5, 398, 4),
(2362, '[Ashok Chauhan] I had an absolutely wonderful experience at Tokas PG! The moment I stepped in, I felt right at home. The accommodations were clean, comfortable, and well-maintained. The staff was incredibly friendly, helpful, and went above and beyond to ensure my stay was pleasant.nnThe food was delicious and hygienic, with a variety of options to cater to different tastes. The atmosphere was warm and welcoming, making it easy to connect with fellow residents.nnWhat truly sets Tokas PG apart is the attention to detail and genuine care for the guests'' well-being. I highly recommend Tokas PG to anyone looking for a safe, comfortable, and homely stay. Keep up the fantastic work', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.010698', 5, 398, 4),
(2363, '[Raj] I had recommended my son''s college mates to stay there as I have always got positive reviews for this PG and I am happy to say that my recommendation didn''t go in vain and the new students I sent there are highly satisfied with their services. Tokas PG is fully safe for girls and especially food is awesome. For me I give them 5 stars. Keep it up guys. Good luck.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.010836', 5, 398, 4),
(2364, '[Pratyush Rawat] I really liked my stay at pg as a bachelor working in night', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.010962', 5, 398, 4),
