(2366, '[Ashish Poria] I have fantastic experience staying at this Boys PG. The facilities are top-notch with spacious, clean, and comfortable rooms. The management is friendly and always ready to help with any concerns. The location is excellent, making it easy to commute to college or work. The food is delicious and homely, which makes you feel like you are at home. The environment is safe and secure, which is a big plus for parents. Overall, it''s an excellent place to stay, and I highly recommend it to anyone looking for a comfortable and hassle-free living experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.064506', 5, 400, 4),
(2367, '[sahil jaspal] The Boys PG offers a comfortable and secure living space with well-maintained rooms and essential amenities. The staff is friendly and attentive, ensuring a hassle-free stay. The location is convenient, with easy access to public transport, and the food is consistently good. A great option for students or working professionals looking for a reliable and affordable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.064624', 5, 400, 4),
(2368, '[Archana Mishra] It''s a home converted to PGn1. Zero Safetyn2. No Fire Exit, No Emergency Exitn3. No Fire Fighting equipment''s of any kindn4. Poisonous Aluminum Utensils being used for cooking foodn5. No Proper Ventilation in Roomsn6. Semi Slum Area', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.064758', 2, 400, 4),
(2369, U&'[Abc Xyz] Nice pg with all facilities\2026 all amenities\2026 good food\2026 location is great \+01f44d\+01f3fb', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.064888', 5, 400, 4),
(2370, '[Hitesh Khati] The location is exceptionally convenient,  facilities are top-notch and there are no restrictions of any kind like in other PGs.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.066196', 5, 400, 4),
(2371, '[Sapphire furnishers] Great place to stay. Good food and friendly staff with Neat and clean rooms. Fits well in the budget. Definitely staying again there.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.066397', 5, 400, 4),
(2372, '[Rohit Kumar] Nice place to live for nearby college or work places . Food quality is very good and internet speed is also very good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.066532', 5, 400, 4),
(2373, '[Abhi Kashyap] I have had a very positive experience at sat Sahib PG . The rooms are clean , well maintained and comfortable. The management is responsible approachable and quick resolve any issues. Safety cleanliness and discipline are given proper importance creating a peaceful environment for residents. Basics facilities are provided efficiently and the overall atmosphere feels welcoming and homely. It is a good choice for both students and working professionals looking for a secure and comfortable place to stay.nHighly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.092631', 5, 401, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2374, '[Rajender Singh] Experienced well in this , My whole year experience i am sharing guys.nBe free to choose thisnReason why:n1) Privacy bestn2) food good hygiene, tasty and healthy.n3) Security great high-techn4) behaviour of staff really good, owner personally handle any issue.n5) Roooms spacious and good ventilationn6) cleaning maintain properly.n7) Really in this era finding this sat sahib pg is miraculous.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.092908', 5, 401, 4),
(2375, '[Hema Kashyap] As a mother finding a safe and comfortable place for my child was my biggest concern. I am very satisfied with Sat Sahib PG. The management is responsible and maintains proper displant which give parents piece of mind. The rooms are clean hygiene and well maintained and the overall environment safe and suitable for students. Communication from the management is clear whenever needed. It is re assurance to know that my child is staying in a place where safety clean less and student well being a taken seriously.nSat Sahib PG  near to NSUT , DDUC , GGSIPUnHighly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.093955', 5, 401, 4),
(2376, '[Sanjay Kumar Singh] My 1 st year in this pg  experience is good and going to continue my next year also . When I compare my meal with my friends who stays in another pg is awesome. Actually I find food tasty and Healthy.nPrivacy and study environment.nSpacious roomnEducated interaction with owner .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.094167', 5, 401, 4),
(2377, '[Raj Kunar] Fantastic experience the rooms are cleaned daily and very well furnished.  The food is nutritious tasty and feels like home. The staff is friendly and the high security makes it safe. Absolutely recommended for students and working professionals.nHigh speed Wi-Fi AC facilitiesnthey maintained privacy very well for each one.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.094324', 5, 401, 4),
(2378, '[Ritu Singh] My son stay here, and I''m very comfortable and feel secured .nThey take care of every member and very polite nature they have a good facility of fooding very hygienic a healthy as well as tasty , fully spacious room,nThis much big rooms I have never seen in this area . Worth money', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.094648', 5, 401, 4),
(2379, '[Devbati] Very cooperative staff , good facility . Boys pg near to Deen Dayal upadhya college is walkable. Dwarka best boys pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.094831', 5, 401, 4),
(2380, '[Bhola Man] I am really impressed with such genuine people who are running this pg . They really take of my child he is studying in DDUCn1 hygiene maintainn2 good taste of foodn3 big roomn4 fully ventilationn5 security centric approachnnThank sat sahib pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.094975', 5, 401, 4),
(2381, '[Sanjay Asiwal] Amazing home like food and very good location. Market is Just outside the property and you can get almost everything there. a Big thumbs up and 5 stars from me.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.120525', 5, 402, 4),
(2382, '[Sahil Sharma] Dont go by the pictures. The room condition is very bad. 4 people sharing one room and only 2 charging point. No cleanliness at all. Also some cockroaches were there in the washroom.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.120663', 1, 402, 4),
(2383, '[Ady Das] One of the best pg in dwarka sector 7nAnd more over owner is very good in nature and soft spoken.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.120793', 5, 402, 4),
