(2396, '[Nishika Sundrani] Aunty is very sweet. She makes amazing food. It''s a home like feeling', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.187862', 5, 404, 4),
(2397, '[som dutt] It was awesome to have a PG like this in Dwarka area at fair price. The owner behaviour is tremendous and very helpful. Also food quality and rooms are well maintained.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.217603', 5, 405, 4),
(2398, '[Aryan] I strongly recommend this if you''re looking nearby this area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.217752', 5, 405, 4),
(2399, '[Devendra Bisht] Very nice PG. Owner is very good Ex Army Person.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.217879', 5, 405, 4),
(2400, U&'[Amit Tomar] Outstanding Service and Facilities - A Five-Star ExperiencenRating: \2605\2605\2605\2605\2605 (5/5)nI recently had the pleasure of experiencing exceptional service and top-notch facilities at Aashiyana PG accommodation, and I cannot express my satisfaction enough. This PG has set the bar high for what a comfortable and welcoming living arrangement should be like.nService (\2605\2605\2605\2605\2605):nThe service at Aashiyana PG is nothing short of outstanding. From the moment I arrived, I was greeted by friendly and attentive staff who made me feel right at home. They went above and beyond to ensure that my stay was comfortable and hassle-free.n1.tWarm and Friendly Staff: The owner of this PG is ex-serviceman from \201cArmy\201d an honorable department of India. Being an Army personnel he is well behaved, disciplined and caring person    The other staff members are not just employees; they are like a family. Their warm welcome and willingness to assist with any request or concern is truly remarkable.n2.tPrompt Response: Whether it was a maintenance issue or a simple request for additional amenities, the response time was impressively fast. They make sure that you feel heard and valued.n3.tAttention to Detail: The attention to detail in housekeeping and maintenance is impeccable. The common areas and rooms are always clean and well-maintained.nFacilities (\2605\2605\2605\2605\2605):nThe facilities provided at this Aashiyana PG are outstanding. It''s like living in a hotel, but with the comfort and privacy of a home.n1.tSpacious and Well-Designed Rooms: The rooms are spacious and well-furnished. The stay creates a pleasant and cozy atmosphere.n2.tModern Amenities: The PG is equipped with modern amenities such as high-speed internet, cable TV, and air conditioning, ensuring a comfortable and convenient stay.n3.tCommon Areas: The common areas are thoughtfully designed for residents to socialize and relax. There''s a common lounge, a well-equipped kitchen.n4.tSecurity: Security is a top priority here, with round-the-clock surveillance and secure access to the premises, providing peace of mind to residents.n5.tHygiene and Cleanliness: Hygiene is given paramount importance, especially in the current times. The Aashiyana PG is spotlessly clean, and stringent cleanliness protocols are followed.nIn conclusion, this Aashiyana PG is the epitome of excellence when it comes to service and facilities. It offers a comfortable, secure, and homely atmosphere that is hard to find elsewhere. Whether you are a student or a professional, this PG is the ideal place to call home. I can confidently say that my stay here has been perfect, and I wholeheartedly recommend it to anyone seeking the best service and facilities in a PG accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.217999', 5, 405, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2401, '[Divyanshu] Awesome experience ..stayed here for 7 - 8 months.Never had any problem. Food is great , staff behaves as a family. Never thought a hostel or pg would make me feel like home. Owner is friendly , to the point and honest person.nFood is great ( the chef right now cooks really good. If you want a pg in dwarka this is definitely the best hostelyoy can stay in.nIn short , loved the place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.218153', 5, 405, 4),
(2402, U&'[Aditya Vivek Raj] There should be an option for 0stars\2026The owner is very rude, food is also not upto the mark. Variety is also very less u can''t get any other than chola or rajma (mostly). Lift is working but they don''t turn it on idk why? Washing clothes is a big problem as the washing machine is damaged since a month or two and they don''t even care to get it repaired. Rooms are not cleaned frequently and bathroom is never ever cleaned. The only positive point is that the rooms are big...other than that there is nothing.nnEdit:- If the individual who lives their gives bad review to this place the owner calls to either delete it or change it to 5stars hence you will see a lot of 5star reviews in it. Most of them are fake and there may be reviews by people who haven\2019t even visited the place. There are way better PGs out there who care about the needs of the tenant. Hopefully it helps\2026', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.218445', 1, 405, 4),
(2403, '[Jha Ji the Local Guide] This is one of the Best PG in this Area for Students of DDUC and NSUT . Food Is Awesome . This PG got Spacious Rooms Nad Common Area . The Owner of PG is also very Supportive', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.21857', 5, 405, 4),
(2404, '[Anjli Rana] It is an amazing pg to stay, with very good food . Cleanliness is a priority . Its totally worth the price and I will definitely recommend this pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.218701', 5, 405, 4),
(2405, U&'[Aman Choudhary] Stayed here for a while and honestly, one of the best PGs I\2019ve experienced. The rooms were clean, well-maintained, and didn\2019t give those \201csurvival mode\201d vibes you get in most places. Basic amenities were reliable (which is rare), and everything just worked without constant follow-ups.nnThe environment felt safe and chill, no unnecessary drama. Management was responsive and handled issues without making it a whole side quest. Location is also convenient, so daily life was pretty smooth.nnIf you\2019re looking for a PG that actually respects your sanity, this one\2019s a solid pick. Left the place, but no complaints \2014 just a good, hassle-free stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.291985', 5, 406, 4),
(2406, U&'[shahi Adarsh] One of the finest PG at Ramphal.nThe best part about this PG is it''s location. Unlike other streets, this street is very calm and quite, with some trees and greenery.nOwner is also very sorted. I received back my full security deposit right on time.n5 star from my side \+01f31f\+01f31f\+01f31f\+01f31f\+01f31f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.29218', 5, 406, 4),
(2407, '[Dhruv] Best PG in Ramphal chowk-Delhi. Clean rooms, facilities available in the pg are top notch.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.292341', 5, 406, 4),
(2408, '[Shreyas Pise] I am very happy with my stay here. The PG owner is extremely understanding and supportive, which makes the overall experience very comfortable. All the staff members do their work efficiently and genuinely, ensuring that everything runs smoothly. Cleaning is done regularly, and the place is always well maintained. The environment is very friendly and homely, making it a great place to live.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.2925', 5, 406, 4),
(2409, '[RAKSHIT] It was lovely staying here. Everyone is very helpful and welcoming and the place truly feels comfortable and homely.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.292662', 5, 406, 4),
(2410, '[Rishabh Nayan] One of my best 14 months experience of this PG.nn1. Cleanliness is the major aspect which is taken care of. Bathrooms are hygienic and no water shortage. Geyser also provided.nn2. AC is present in every room and electricity bill is minimum.nn3. Water is clean and water cooler is provided.nn4. Located in quiet locality away from main market. Everyday use items can be bought from shops located nearby. Chemist and clinic is also present. Saloon, stationary, tiffin service all are present at a walking distance.nn5. Parking facility available.nn6. CCTV Cameras at every floor and outside the PG also to ensure the safety of parked vehiclesnnPrice of this PG is affordable unlike other overpriced PGs', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.292816', 5, 406, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2411, '[Sharan Bhat] Wonderful experience.Very good and friendly care taker.Rooms are clean and hygiene.Room cleaning is done each and everyday.Different types of rooms are available based on your preference.All the required facilities like AC,Common kitchen,Fridge,washing machine, wifi etc are available.Situated in a very good place which is calm and quite yet nearer to most of the shops and places.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.292982', 5, 406, 4),
(2412, '[Rahul CAT] I recently stayed at Anshul PG in Dwarka Sector 7 during my work trip to Delhi, and I must say it was a fantastic experience! The PG is conveniently located, making it easy for me to commute to my workplace and explore the city.nnThe accommodation at Anshul PG was clean, comfortable, and well-maintained. The rooms were spacious and provided all the necessary amenities I needed during my stay. The bed was cozy, ensuring a good night''s sleep after a long day of work.nnThe staff at Anshul PG were friendly, courteous, and always ready to assist. They made sure that all my needs were met promptly, making my stay hassle-free and enjoyable. The overall atmosphere was pleasant and welcoming.nnThe location of Anshul PG in Dwarka Sector 7 is excellent, with several nearby restaurants, shops, and public transportation options. It made it convenient for me to explore the local attractions and try out different cuisines.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.293863', 5, 406, 4),
(2413, '[Mohamed Anis] I had stayed in welcome PG for more than 6 months. Had a good time. Security. Perfect place with accessibility to all local market.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.318963', 4, 407, 4),
(2414, U&'[utkarsh anurag] Stayed at Welcome PG and had a really good experience \2013 the place is clean, comfy, and feels like home. The owner is nice.  Rahul the caretaker. He\2019s super helpful, always around if you need anything, and honestly one of the most genuine people I\2019ve met. Whether it\2019s food issues or finding your way around, Rahul\2019s got your back. Definitely a good spot if you\2019re looking for a hassle-free stay with someone reliable to help out.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.319101', 5, 407, 4),
(2415, '[Aman Nilesh] I stayed in Welcome Pg for 3 months. Location is good. Market is easily accessible. Although it is close to a garbage heap, so avoid going to matiala side. Else 50mtrs away from DPS Dwarka back gate. If you have a bike or car then it is better. The pg is overall good. Housekeeping in rooms is not that great. The warden/watchman is responsible for it. He wont clean your room, until you complain once to the owner and tighten his screw. There are rats in the property. Water purifier, gas stove is common. Water purifier cleaning and servicing is questionable. Overall 3 stars.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.319218', 3, 407, 4),
(2416, '[Jayanta Chatterjee] My experience of staying at Welcome PG has been extremely satisfying right from the start to the end. The reception and the professionalism of the proprietor Mr Nipun Jain, the complete paperwork necessary for corporate clients, the location of the premises, the spaciousness and the quality of the room, were all that went into making the experience a memorable one. I would highly recommend it to others', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.319335', 5, 407, 4),
(2417, '[Gaurav Mittal] Pg facilities and grievance resolution is quick....1 less star just because the market nearby is not fulfilling', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.319503', 4, 407, 4),
(2418, '[Simran Jeet] Nice experience overall , caretaker rahul bhaiya was helpful but I personally experience a tough time against the mattress of bed which can be improved for future tenants.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.319622', 4, 407, 4),
(2419, '[Anirudh Prasad] I have stayed at welcome pg for the last few months, I was quite desperate for a place close to my workplace and this was great, quick and easy moving in , and very helpful staff, Rahul ji in particular, and warm and gracious atmosphere due to Mr.Nipun. rent is standard as per location ,room sizes are quite big and very well maintained. If you need a place to stay you can definitely go for it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.319834', 5, 407, 4);        
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2420, '[Kalai Thamizh] I have stayed there for 2 months and I felt Delhi ppl and roomes are not genune but Mr. nipun helped me to stay in. Welcome pg for wonderful times and helped me a lot.. now I wish I should stay again in his pg ... Especially in his balcony room ...nnFinally it''s really safety tinsaty for girls and boys as well', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.319961', 5, 407, 4),
(2421, '[Arnav Mahajan] Dont bother going here, worst pg ever seen by me. Dark rooms dark corridor smelly uncovered acs and non recommended for girls. Seriously 0 star hota toh wohi deta.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.348492', 1, 408, 4),
(2422, '[K_ RahuL] Good rooms ....and cheaper one too!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.348634', 4, 408, 4),
(2423, '[Vikram Thaman] Reasonable place to stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.348759', 5, 408, 4),
(2424, '[Amit kumar] Good place to stay in', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.34888', 4, 408, 4),
(2425, '[Rushi Brahmbhatt] Average place to live', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.349004', 4, 408, 4),
(2426, '[Kumar Saurav] Not that Good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.349192', 2, 408, 4),
(2427, '[MAYANK SINGH] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.349308', 5, 408, 4),
(2428, '[Vignesh Deepa Muthu Vasanthan] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.349421', 5, 408, 4),
(2429, '[Rekha] This PG provides a comfortable and safe living environment. The rooms are clean and well-maintained, the food quality is good, and the staff is cooperative.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.486094', 5, 409, 4),
(2430, '[Devender Singh] I stayed at Campus PG during my college time and had a very good experience. The rooms are clean, food is good, and the staff is helpful. It feels safe and comfortable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.486255', 4, 409, 4),
(2431, '[jaya vohra] I moved to Delhi for my studies and finding a good PG was a challenge. CampusPG turned out to be a great choice. The rooms are clean, the location is convenient, and the staff is always ready to help. Overall, a comfortable place for students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.486383', 5, 409, 4),
(2432, U&'[negi] I\2019ve been staying at Campus PG for a few months now and the experience has been really good. The rooms are clean and well maintained, and the staff is always helpful. Definitely a good place for students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.486517', 5, 409, 4),
(2433, U&'[ROHAN NEGI] I\2019ve been staying at CampusPG for quite some time and my experience has been very positive. The rooms are neat and well-maintained, housekeeping is regular, and the staff is supportive. The location is excellent for students as everything is nearby. Overall, a reliable and comfortable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.486652', 4, 409, 4),
(2434, '[Saniya Manral] One of the best PGs in this area. Clean rooms, proper hygiene, and a peaceful atmosphere. The management is responsive and takes care of issues quickly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.486861', 5, 409, 4),
(2435, '[Bhawna Bora] What I like most about Campus PG is the balance between affordability and comfort. The facilities are well maintained, and everything a student needs is easily accessible nearby. Happy with my stay so far.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.48698', 5, 409, 4),
(2436, '[Ayush Rawat] Great PG with clean rooms, good food, fast Wi-Fi, and a safe environment. Highly recommended for students!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.487103', 5, 409, 4),
(2437, '[Amrik Singh] Uncle aunty treat everyone not just like tenants but like family.The environment is homely safe u0026 Peaceful perfect for students and working professionals  The food is always fresh u0026 hygienic.you should definitely come here', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.542211', 5, 411, 4),
(2438, '[Chikku] Ashray Living Best Girl PG is one of the best places for girls to stay.nThe rooms are neat, spacious, and well-maintained.nDaily cleaning and proper hygiene are always ensured.nThe food is tasty, healthy, and feels like home-cooked meals.nStaff members are polite, supportive, and very cooperative.nSafety and security are well managed with proper facilities.nThe environment feels homely, peaceful, and comfortable.nThe location is convenient with access to colleges, offices, and markets.nBoth students and working women find it very suitable.nOverall, it is a safe, affordable, and highly recommended PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.542434', 5, 411, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2439, U&'[Additi Mehrotra] it\2019s one of the best places to stay in! they\2019re comfortable and well maintained', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.54258', 5, 411, 4),
(2440, U&'[Arjun Vasudeva] I had a comfortable stay at this PG. The rooms are clean and well-maintained, with all basic facilities provided. The staff is supportive, and the environment feels safe. It\2019s also in a convenient location, close to markets and transport. Overall, a good option for students and working professionals..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.54275', 5, 411, 4),
(2441, U&'[Sreya Krishna] I stayed at PG Ashray Living and had a comfortable experience. The rooms were clean and well-maintained. The staff was helpful and polite. Food was decent and served on time. The place felt safe and had a good atmosphere for students or working professionals. Overall, it\2019s a good option if you''re looking for a peaceful and affordable PG stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.542879', 5, 411, 4),
(2442, '[Ojasvi Bhat] The PG is well-maintained, safe, and comfortable. The rooms are clean, food quality is good, and all the basic facilities are provided. The environment feels homely, and the staff is cooperative. A good option for girls looking for a secure and convenient place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.543004', 5, 411, 4),
(2443, U&'[Sai Praneeth] Ashray Living PG is a wonderful place to stay with clean and comfortable rooms, homely food, and a safe environment. The management is friendly and supportive, always making sure residents feel at ease. It\2019s the perfect balance of comfort, care, and convenience \2013 truly a home away from home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.543246', 5, 411, 4),
(2444, '[Stanzin Jordan] best pg for both boys and girls, good food and overall services are also satisfactory', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.543372', 5, 411, 4),
(2445, '[Prathmesh Mogre] The staff is very well-mannered, friendly, and always ready to help. A special thanks to Kapor Uncle, the owner, who treats everyone like family. He is not only supportive but also a great motivator who genuinely cares about the well-being of every resident. His positive attitude and willingness to help make this place feel like a second home. I highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a safe, comfortable, and welcoming place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.570603', 5, 412, 4),
(2446, U&'[Alihasnain Khan] This is one of the best PG accommodations in Delhi, offering all necessary facilities. If you ever face any problem, it is resolved within 10\201315 minutes. The environment is very safe, the students living here are well-mannered, and the owner is extremely supportive.nThe staff working in the PG are also very polite and helpful. There is no disturbance at all ,everyone minds their own business, which creates a peaceful atmosphere.nLiving in this PG truly feels like staying at home. Our owner, Rahul Sir u0026 Ankur Sir both sre very kind and caring . They regularly interact with us, keep us updated about new things, and ensure that we are comfortable.nStaying here never makes us feel like we are away from home....', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.570825', 5, 412, 4),
(2447, '[Saurabh Raj] One of the best PG in ORN. Affordable with flexible rent according to different rooms.nDaily cleaning, washing machine available, 24/7 guard available, common kitchen with fridge, microwave and toaster.nThe owner is super friendly and take care of issues within couple of days.. highly recommend this place', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.571122', 5, 412, 4),
(2448, '[Shashwat Jain] The PG is well-maintained and provides a peaceful and comfortable living space with all the necessary facilities. The owner ensures everything runs smoothly, and he is honest, respectful, and easy to communicate with, making the overall experience stress-free.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.57168', 5, 412, 4),
(2449, '[Sachan Chhetri] Really nice PG! Clean rooms, good food, and helpful staff. Feels safe and well-managed. Worth the price.nOne of the best in ORN', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.571905', 5, 412, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2450, U&'[Rudresh Yadav] The PG offers a clean and comfortable environment with all the essential amenities.nThe overall atmosphere feels safe and homely.nAnd the landlord  is also polite and responsive to any concerns..\2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.572038', 5, 412, 4),
(2451, '[Abhishek Maharana] Hostel is excellent, the owner Rahul bhaiya is wonderful and great person treats me like a brother. The support staff is Friendly and coordinate and the room is cleaned everyday. These 2 months went very well, there was no problem .nThanks Rahul bhaiya', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.572165', 5, 412, 4),
(2452, '[Karthick M] This review is edited because I want to  give (out of personal satisfaction) 5 whole stars from earlier being 4. As this pg provides us with thenHOMELY FEELING with its spacious rooms,nAll day usable kitchen with major kitchen appliances and utensils,ndaily room keeping,nadequate washrooms,ngood ventilation,nsecurity guard 24/7 with biometric lock,nmajor landmarks (market, institutes, study halls, departmental stores, metro station, book centres, shopsrtc) within its vicinity,nhelpful and accessible management, purified RO water,ncommon terrace,nWashing machine ( no limit in number of clothes),nnTo be Frank , it (particularly this building of the owner) deserves to be the primary consideration for a fresher to Delhi (especially for an UPSC aspirant)', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.572287', 5, 412, 4),
(2453, U&'[Ankit Jain] I had a wonderful stay at this hostel for the past 3 years. The environment was comfortable, safe, and felt like a second home. The management and staff were always supportive and responsive whenever needed. The facilities were well-maintained, and my overall experience was very positive. Thank you for making my stay pleasant and memorable. I would highly recommend this hostel to anyone looking for a comfortable and reliable place to stay.\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.597941', 5, 413, 4),
(2454, '[Tabrej alam] I had a great experience staying at Rana Boys'' PG. The rooms are clean and comfortable, the food is tasty, and the overall environment is peaceful. The owner and staff are very helpful and polite. Security is good, and all basic facilities like Wi-Fi, electricity, and water are available. The location is also convenient and close to markets and public transport. I highly recommend Rana Boy PG to anyone looking for a safe and comfortable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.598081', 5, 413, 4),
(2455, '[shradha prasad] My brother stayed at this PG during his masters and our family had a very positive experience.nThe most reassuring thing was how caring and supportive the owner was. They maintain a very homely and safe environment for the boys. The food quality is also really good and hygienic. It genuinely felt like my brother was staying with responsible people away from home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.598296', 5, 413, 4),
(2456, '[the Vaibhav bhardwaj] One of the best PGs in Delhi! The rooms are clean, the staff is cooperative, the food quality is good, and all essential facilities are well maintained. The environment is safe, comfortable, and perfect for students as well as working professionals. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.598426', 5, 413, 4),
(2457, '[A Google User] Pathetic experience staying at this place. Would not suggest this PG to anyone', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.598544', 2, 413, 4),
(2458, U&'[harshita dubey] \2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0fnHighly recommended!nMy brother stayed at Rana boys PG, and we couldn\2019t be happier with the experience. The place is clean, well-maintained, and feels just like home. The management is responsive and genuinely cares about the comfort of the residents. Safety, hygiene, and a peaceful environment are clearly top priorities here. Thank you for providing such a reliable and comfortable stay \2014 it made a big difference!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.598661', 5, 413, 4),
(2459, '[Muskan Panwar] The management seems very responsive and dedicated to providing a comfortable stay for residents.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.598778', 5, 413, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2460, '[Sanjeev Bansal] My son stayed in his pg for four years and it was a great experience. He is a geniune person . I recommend this pg for sure...', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.598895', 5, 413, 4),
(2461, '[chandan pratap] My brother stayed here for 2 years. Got best remarks of location during his college times', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.622281', 5, 414, 4),
(2462, '[Rajput] I lived here, always feels like a family to me during my ssc preparations', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.622416', 5, 414, 4),
(2463, '[Abhishek Rawat] The parameters of stay is best - Security, quality, privacy !', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.622538', 5, 414, 4),
(2464, '[arvind kumar] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.622754', 5, 414, 4),
(2465, U&'[Sahil Srivastava] I lived almost 11 months here so i think i am in right position to review:-nn1) Firstly the pg is at the prime location in subhash nagar. You got 2 parks just in front of the pg. It is almost on the main road.nn2) The PG owner Mr. Naveen Mittal bhaiya is very sweet guy. He is very supportive and understanding.nHe is genuinely very helping guy. He treats you like your own. I had left the pg but still had some good memories with him\2728nn3) You got almost all the amenities like :-n#A common kitchen an#cooking area 2 washroom on each floor.n#Wifi , drinking water and all other facilities along with food also.nnThey have single and double rooms, food is good \+01f44dhome like.nnU can definitely check this.nBest for working professional and students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.646245', 5, 415, 4),
(2466, U&'[Pradumna Tripathi] I\2019ve been staying at Mittal PG and my experience has been really great. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and provide a comfortable living environment. The management is cooperative and always ready to help, which makes daily life much easier.nnThe location in Subhash Nagar is very convenient, with easy access to markets, metro, and essential facilities. Food quality is also good, hygienic, and served on time.nnOverall, it\2019s a perfect place for students and working professionals looking for a safe, affordable, and comfortable stay. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.646448', 5, 415, 4),
(2467, '[Pdf book] Pg is at very good location,nBest study environment area, calm and composed.nOwner is very sweet.nFood is good. Overall good cleanliness', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.646552', 5, 415, 4),
(2468, '[Gurpreet Kaur] Really nice pg, my brother stayed here. The owner of pg Mr. Mittal is also really nice. He even told us other pg options, which shows how good character he has. They also are 100% vegetarian. Great place. There is also park in front', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.646649', 5, 415, 4),
(2469, U&'[Rahul Kumar] Owner is a very humble person, always ready to help. PG is very economical and budget friendly. Silent place for both study and work. Homely food and always served on time. \2764', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.646797', 5, 415, 4),
(2470, '[Rishabh Jain] Peaceful and calm environment with uninterrupted electricity and water availability. Maid will keep your room clean. Owner is calm and supportive in your ventures. Overall you can have a good time away from home here at Mittal PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.646894', 5, 415, 4),
(2471, U&'[Rajan Dhingra] THE BEST PG BOY''S IN DELHI:nn\2605 Owner Mr. Naveen Mittal is a GOD loving and a very humble person, always ready to helpn\2605 PG is very economical and budget friendlyn\2605  Corner property with ample ventilation and is park facingn\2605Serene u0026 silent place for both study and work.n\2605 Homely food and always served on timen\2605 Locality is clean u0026 peaceful with lush green environmentn\2605 Good metro connectivity with Tagore Garden and Mayapuri metro in vicinity', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.647006', 5, 415, 4),
(2472, '[david mittal] This is my personal opinion review because, i was there for some days , first if i talk about there room they are so dirty , and there were cigarette buds behind the wardrobe, and the food is really awful, and toilets are soooo dirty there are hairs , and they just offered food for two meals only,nThey provide smallest cooler which they charge 700 per cooler, and they charge 8000 rent for month, and the main thing the mother of the owner didn''t know how to talk to someone, she is literally so awful', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.64713', 1, 415, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2473, '[Ajay Partap] Rooms and pg are good but behaviour of the owners is very disgusting and frustrating .I don''t want to give them a single star.If you go to this pg please confirm everything before payment and click the pics of electricity bill because I stayed for one month in winter and there 1 month rent for 2 rooms is 2100/-.be careful guys.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.675109', 1, 416, 4),
(2474, '[Manpreet Singh] I stayed at this pg for serval months and had a nice experience. Rooms are comfortable,clean, and well maintained. Food is homely and hygienic and owner is polite,cooperative and helpful. And security deposited refunded easily after termination.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.675278', 5, 416, 4),
(2475, '[Adarsh Vijay] Staying at Guru Nanak PG has been a fantastic experience! The facilities are top-notch, with spacious, well-maintained rooms and all the necessary amenities. The management is incredibly responsive and ensures a secure and welcoming atmosphere. The food quality is excellent, and the common areas are perfect for relaxing or socializing. The location is ideal, with everything you need just a short walk away. This PG truly sets the standard for comfort and convenience. Highly recommend it to anyone seeking a peaceful and reliable stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.675425', 5, 416, 4),
(2476, U&'[Dvs] I stayed here for a week and to be honest this place will Make you feel as home .nRestroom, rooms and security wise everything is great. I would like to suggest this beautiful stay for everyone who wish to stay for days and why not even for years.nHygiene - \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50nRestroom - \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50nFood - \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50nYou may be from any state but here the food will make you feel home .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.675538', 5, 416, 4),
(2477, '[Lavishka Wadhwani] Great stays at affordable price, the food quality is also good. Stays are clean and hygienic. All necessary amenities are available.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.675711', 5, 416, 4),
(2478, U&'[Mayank Bathla] Best PG in Pitampura area . Lived here for a year and it felt like a home . Uncle and Aunty have a nature like parents . They care for us like their own children. And plus point the food . Its like your mother serving fresh food in your plate . \+01f60d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.675827', 5, 416, 4),
(2479, '[Manoj Bhosale] If you''re far from your family and need a family feeling you should definitely chose this destination Service and behaviour is very good. You feel a homely atmosphere. They arranged everything very beautifully. If you want to make yourself comfortable with a calm surrounding you should definitely choose this place.  food was really good. People made me feel like home. Location is also close to main road.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.675935', 5, 416, 4),
(2480, '[vamshi krishna] Very good experience in this pg, with respect to room, food and maintenance. The owners are really supportive. Even the food we get is of good quality (homely food).', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.676046', 5, 416, 4),
(2481, U&'[GANGA RAMESH] Great Week-Long Stay at Saiyam PG!nI recently spent a full week at Saiyam PG Stay, and it exceeded my expectations in every way. The rooms were spotlessly clean and well-maintained throughout my stay, with fresh linens and no issues at all. The staff were incredibly supportive\2014always quick to respond to any small request and super friendly, making me feel right at home.nAmenities were more than enough for a comfortable stay: reliable Wi-Fi, a clean common kitchen with basics,hot water round the clock, laundry service. Location is convenient too, close to all coaching institutes and local eats and transport. Highly recommend for short or extended stays\2014I\2019ll be back!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.703933', 4, 417, 4),
(2482, '[mahesh nani] The room are clean and well maintained, staff with good behaviour and can respond quickly on the time, Location is convenient too, close to all coaching institutes and local eats and transport', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.704073', 5, 417, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2483, '[Arul] Good place to have the stay and friendly environment and I stayed over 8 days here', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.704291', 5, 417, 4),
(2484, '[tulsiram naik] Good room and service very affordable', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.704781', 5, 417, 4),
(2485, '[Yogesh Patel] Good safe room and good facility. Owner is very good person', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.705046', 5, 417, 4),
(2486, '[Gagandeep V] Best pg with facilities, owner is friendly and cooperative, clean and spacious. Highly Recommended for professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.705185', 5, 417, 4),
(2487, '[Anjanbir Singh] Stayed there in August 2024. It was a mid experience. The main guy is rude and grumpy and not nice. Rooms were not what was shown in photos. Not worth the price. And we had mouse coming in and out of our room.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.705305', 1, 417, 4),
(2488, '[abhishek yadav] One of the best pg in Karol Bagh. Facilates with one of the most humble care taker Mr. Inder Kumar, very sweet person .Owner Mr. Vineet bansal very supportive he makes sure students don''t face any problem regarding staying.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.705482', 4, 417, 4),
(2489, '[Prathmesh Mogre] I had a wonderful experience staying at this PG. The staff is very well-mannered, friendly, and always ready to help. A special thanks to Kapor Uncle, the owner, who treats everyone like family. He is not only supportive but also a great motivator who genuinely cares about the well-being of every resident. His positive attitude and willingness to help make this place feel like a second home. I highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a safe, comfortable, and welcoming place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.732628', 5, 418, 4),
(2490, U&'[Dhruv Mathur] \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50 Excellent PG with a Responsible u0026 Caring OwnernI\2019ve had a really great experience staying in this PG. The room is clean, comfortable, and well-maintained, with all the basic amenities provided to make daily life smooth and stress-free. The environment here is peaceful and suitable for students as well as working professionals.nOne of the best parts of this PG is the friendly and respectful roommates, which creates a positive and homely atmosphere. The owner deserves special appreciation \2014 he is extremely responsible, approachable, and genuinely cares about the well-being of all tenants. Any issue or problem is addressed and fixed as soon as possible, without unnecessary delays.nWhat I truly admire is the discipline maintained in the PG. The owner ensures that all tenants follow basic rules, maintain decorum, and avoid any chaos, which helps everyone live comfortably and without disturbance.nA special mention to his thoughtful gesture in February, when he hosted a wonderful party at Barbeque Nation for all the tenants. It was done with open heart and grace, and it really showed how much he values and respects the people staying here \2014 something very rare to find.nOverall, this PG feels more like a home than just a place to stay. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a safe, disciplined, comfortable, and friendly living environment with an excellent owner.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.73277', 5, 418, 4),
(2491, U&'[Shashwat Jain] The facilities at the PG are quite good, and the landlord is a very genuine and trustworthy person. He doesn\2019t make any false claims and keeps everything clear and straightforward.nSo yes, you can definitely consider this PG as a good option for staying.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.732894', 5, 418, 4),
(2492, '[Amit Hivarkar] My lifes 3rd pg, become my best pg ever during upsc preparation.nIn affordable rent getting maximum goods and services.nMy heartfelt regards to the owner. I truly appreciate you are all commitments.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.733013', 5, 418, 4),
(2493, '[Chethan Gowda] I stayed here few for a few months and had a great experience . The room were clean and the rent was affordable . The management was friendly and supportive and overall good ,i would recommend this pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.733131', 5, 418, 4);        
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2494, U&'[Rajat Srivastava] To my mind this PG is marvelous it has multiple qualities for instance renovated rooms, aile , refrigerator, washing machine as well as air conditioner and it''s interrior too spectacular even helper or maid is recruited here for sanitation and so many things are here in this PG . So please do enroll yourself here and commence your journey of UPSC from Kapoor''s PG ...Best of luck to all..... Radheshyam\+01f64f\+01f600', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.733245', 5, 418, 4),
(2495, U&'[Alihasnain Khan] Kapoor''s PG is one of the best PGs in Delhi with all necessary facilities. Any issue is resolved within 10\201315 minutes. The environment is safe and peaceful, with good students and helpful staff. The owner, Rahul ji is kind and caring..If an aspirant genuinely wants to study with peace and focus Kapoor''s PG is good PG to choose.....', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.73336', 5, 418, 4),
(2496, '[Kichi] This kapoor PG is one of the best in ORN area. Best part is the security we get. The kitchen facilities and cleaning services are good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.733483', 5, 418, 4),
(2497, '[Shankar] It has been a wonderful experience staying at this PG. More than just a place to live, it truly felt like a home away from home.nnA heartfelt thank you to the PG Owner for your kindness, understanding, and constant support throughout my stay. Your caring nature, prompt help whenever needed, and the way you treated every resident with respect made a lasting impression on me.nnI carry many beautiful memories from this place. I will always be grateful for the comfort, safety, and positive environment you provided.nI sincerely wish you and your PG continued success and happiness. Thank you once again for everything. I will always remember this place with gratitude and affection.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.759655', 5, 419, 4),
(2498, U&'[Rishi Singh] I had a wonderful experience staying at Guruham PG in Karol Bagh. The rooms are clean, spacious, and well-maintained, creating a comfortable and homely environment. The staff and management are extremely polite, helpful, and always ready to assist whenever needed.nnThe food is hygienic and tasty, housekeeping is regular, and the overall cleanliness is excellent. The location is another big advantage\2014it\2019s close to the metro, coaching institutes, markets, and other essential facilities, making daily life very convenient.nnSafety and security are well taken care of, which makes it an ideal place for students and working professionals. If you\2019re looking for a peaceful, safe, and well-managed PG in Karol Bagh, I would definitely recommend Guruham PG. Truly one of the best places to stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.75987', 5, 419, 4),
(2499, '[cutiepiew reviews] Best PG in Karol Bagh. Recommend To Everybody. Stayed For 2 Years And Faced Literally no problem. The Staff are good and corporative. Best Facilities And Quality.  Top rated amongst all . I stayed in many PGs over my preparation of 3 years. No pg felt so great', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.759994', 5, 419, 4),
(2500, '[saurabh raka] Finding a good PG in Karol Bagh is honestly very difficult, but Guruhum PG turned out to be a really good choice for me.nnI stayed here for almost a year, and my overall experience was very nice and comfortable. Both Ankit Bhaiya and Madam are very genuine, helpful, and understanding. The environment feels safe and homely, and any issues are handled properly.nnIf someone is looking for a decent and trustworthy PG in Karol Bagh, I would definitely recommend Guruhum PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.760119', 5, 419, 4),
(2501, '[karthik Bhukya] I have stayed in this PG (boys) for a year and i can assure the guys who are searching for a very friendly and comfortable stay for long period, this is the best choice.nFood over here is good and there was no problem ever as they have their own kitchen.nnPlease consider it for a long term stay.nThe owners and staff are very friendly and cooperative.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.760239', 5, 419, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2502, U&'[Alka Prajapati] I stayed at Guruham Girls PG for around 2.5 years and I had a really wonderful experience there .nMeenu Ma\2019am is very friendly, caring, supportive, and understandingnShe always listens patiently and tries her best to understand and help with any problemsnThe PG has a safe and comfortable environment which made my stay peaceful and pleasantnI truly enjoyed my time here and would highly recommend Guruham Girls PG to anyone looking for a safe and comfortable place to stay \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.760454', 5, 419, 4),
(2503, U&'[Chahat Kohli] I have lived here for 1.5 Years, and my experience has been very positive. All the facilities promised by the management are genuinely provided. Any maintenance work, whenever required, is addressed promptly\2014usually within a few hours. The environment here is peaceful and satisfactory, making it a comfortable place to live.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.760764', 5, 419, 4),
(2504, U&'[Nihanshu sahu] Review 1:nIt was a very good experience staying here. The rooms are clean and comfortable, and the environment is safe and peaceful. Meenu ma\2019am is very helpful and caring.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:04:59.760939', 5, 419, 4),
(2505, '[Pradeep Chitteti] Very good PG in Kharadi with food, hot water and AC facility. Ganesh in the front desk is very polite and supportive. They offer day wise rentals as well as monthly with reasonable price.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.325469', 5, 420, 4),
(2506, '[Shiihrani Mao] I am currently staying at this PG, and my experience has been good so far. The rooms are clean and well-maintained, and the basic amenities are satisfactory. The staff is friendly and responsive whenever any issues arise. The location is convenient, with easy access to shops and public transport. I would recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable and affordable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.325629', 4, 420, 4),
(2507, '[Lawan Lyngdoh] House keeping staff are really polite and they maintain the cleanliness really well. Rooms are cleaned everyday. Food menu actually changes everyday which is good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.325768', 5, 420, 4),
(2508, '[Aswin C] Well maintained and great food variety.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.326266', 5, 420, 4),
(2509, '[Manyata Srivastava] Everything works as promised. No drama, no issues that go unresolved. That''s honestly all I wanted from a PG near Kharadi.nSecurity is solid here. Access is controlled, cameras are there, and you feel like someone is actually managing the place properly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.326478', 5, 420, 4),
(2510, '[vardhani vyakaranam] I had a great experience staying at this hostel and would definitely recommend it. The daily meals are consistently good, providing quality food that makes a long-term stay very comfortable. Additionally, the maintenance of the property is excellent; everything is kept clean and in good working order along with security provided . I didn''t encounter any issues during my stay, making it a hassle-free and pleasant environment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.326641', 5, 420, 4),
(2511, U&'[Harsha Rajpurohit] Works perfectly from my room without any lag \2014 that was the first thing I tested before booking. The WiFi at this PG near EON IT Park, Kharadi is stable even during peak hours, which is great for work-from-home and online meetings.nnThe internet speed here is actually good. I was expecting the usual PG WiFi that drops every 20 minutes. This one holds. Happy with the paying guest in Kharadi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.326783', 5, 420, 4),
(2512, '[Ishika] Bathrooms are the real test of any PG and this one passes easily. Clean, functional, no complaints in 5 months.nMy parents visited once and the first thing they noticed was the CCTV and secure access. It gave them a lot of comfort. Good paying guest in Kharadi Pune.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.32693', 5, 420, 4),
(2513, U&'[Sem Mobile] Worst PG experience ever. This place feels like hell on earth.nnI stayed at Deshmukh PG 6, and the condition was extremely disappointing. Cleanliness is almost zero \2014 cockroaches, mosquitoes, and poor hygiene everywhere. The PG is very congested and not worth the money.nnThe owner and caretaker\2019s behaviour is also very unprofessional. Once they take the payment, they don\2019t care about tenants\2019 problems. I paid \20b911,000 and had to leave due to an emergency from the next day, but the owner refused to return my money and did not even provide any proper support.nnThink twice before choosing this PG. My experience was one of the worst.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.332222', 1, 421, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2514, '[Samiksha Patil] The PG accommodation is clean, well-maintained, and provides a comfortable living environment.nRooms are spacious with good ventilation and essential facilities.nThe food quality is decent and feels homely.nThe staff and management are cooperative and responsive to issues.nOverall, it is a safe and convenient place for students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.332451', 5, 421, 4),
(2515, '[Patel chintan] This is one of the best PGs and I highly recommend it to anyone who can afford it. The owner is very good and humble. He also returned my deposit within 2 days after I left the PG and even requested a review. Overall, a great experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.332625', 5, 421, 4),
(2516, '[Kaushal Warke] One The Best PG In Kharadi, Near to Wtc u0026 Eon IT Park.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.332875', 5, 421, 4),
(2517, '[037 Mohanish Wankhede] Very good place for comfortable living. Definitely enjoyed my stay here as I have stayed there for more than 6 months . The staff is also very supportive and helpful. Highly recommend this place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.33308', 5, 421, 4),
(2518, '[Latha Devi] Worst pg pls don''t come anyone cleanness is zero and main owner attitude . Pls guys don''t come Plss waste of money here worst pg I ever seen in pune', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.333217', 1, 421, 4),
(2519, U&'[Aniket Patil] I\2019ve been staying at this PG for a few months now, and overall, it\2019s been a great experience. The rooms are clean and well-maintained, and the staff is cooperative. Food quality is decent and served on time. Wi-Fi and laundry facilities work properly most of the time. The location is convenient, especially for working professionals. It feels safe and homely \2014 definitely one of the better PG options in the area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.333347', 5, 421, 4),
(2520, U&'[Ranjit Rajane] I\2019ve been staying at Deshmukh PG for a while now, and my experience has been excellent.n\2705 The rooms are clean, spacious, and well maintained.n\+01f371 The food is hygienic and tastes like home.n\+01f9f9 Daily cleaning and good maintenance make the stay comfortable.n\+01f468\200d\+01f4bc The owner and staff are very helpful and always respond quickly to any issue.n\+01f4cd The location is perfect \2014 close to offices, shops, and public transport.n\+01f4b0 Overall, it\2019s great value for money and one of the best PGs I\2019ve stayed in.nnHighly recommended for students and working professionals looking for a safe and friendly place to stay! \+01f31f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.333478', 5, 421, 4),
(2521, '[Sadat Khan] Breakfast and dinner okiee to eat,water capacity of tanks are poor, atmosphere of rooms are good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.337805', 3, 422, 4),
(2522, '[Sumit Sharma] Great Pg in kharadi, near by bus stop and auto stand.food is really very good.rooms are same as given in sites.very very nice staff.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.337934', 5, 422, 4),
(2523, '[Ishant Agarwal] PG is good. All the rooms are shared (6 people - el3 rooms). No separate 2 sharing room available. Cost wise its cheap. Only 6k for 2 sharing (in 3bhk). Cleaning also happens almost daily. PG owner is also friendly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.338055', 4, 422, 4),
(2524, '[Kunal Chaudhari] Really Nice PG. Rooms and food is excellent. Other services are also good.nLandlord is very kind and helpful. Recommend if you are looking nice PG in Kharadi', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.338174', 5, 422, 4),
(2525, '[Antara Indulkar] As compared to all pgs best food u can have here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.338295', 5, 422, 4),
(2526, '[Navin Kumar Navin Kumar.] I stayed here for one day as guest experience was good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.338467', 5, 422, 4),
(2527, '[Sheikh Sartaj] Hi , please share your contact number, I want to come pune and book this pg for job purpose', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.338588', 5, 422, 4),
(2528, '[DHIRAJ BHALERAO] Nice pg food quality best', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.338706', 5, 422, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2529, '[Vijayasimha reddy Bijivemula] One of the best budget-friendly PGs near Kharadi Bypass! The rooms are clean, comfortable, and well-maintained. The biggest advantage is the delicious homely food, which makes staying here feel just like home. The owner and staff are friendly, supportive, and quick to help whenever needed. The location is also convenient, with easy access to nearby offices and colleges. If you''re looking for a clean, affordable PG with great food and a welcoming atmosphere, I highly recommend this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.342662', 5, 423, 4),
(2530, '[Hardik Patel] It is best PG in kharadi with affordable price..the owner''s nature is so sweet and friendly and food is also very tasty', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.342864', 5, 423, 4),
(2531, '[raje shivaji] Best pg near kharadi Bypass', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.342985', 5, 423, 4),
(2532, '[Suhas Gaikwad] Nice PG well maintained and the management is amazing', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.343112', 5, 423, 4),
(2533, U&'[Pamuri Sujatha] good maintenance,and rooms super \+01f44c,beds ,food items are super', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.343286', 5, 423, 4),
(2534, '[Pokala Sowmya] Nice pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.343477', 5, 423, 4),
(2535, '[Koduru Eswaramma] Very clean and good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.343601', 5, 423, 4),
(2536, '[Kamaljeet Singh] Awesome facilities and good Pg to stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.34372', 5, 423, 4),
(2537, '[Aryan Mandla] I stayed at OM Sai PG, Pune for around 5 months, and my overall experience was good. The rooms were clean and well-maintained, and regular housekeeping was provided, which helped keep the living space neat. A washing machine is also available for residents, which is quite convenient for both students and working professionals.nnThe food quality was okay and manageable for daily living. Dinner was served regularly with chapatis, rice, and a different curry or gravy each day. The chapatis were usually soft and freshly prepared. As someone from a different region, I found that some breakfast items did not always match my taste preferences, but overall the food was decent.nnThe owner is polite, helpful, and trustworthy. He delivers on the commitments made before the agreement, which creates a sense of reliability and comfort during the stay. Any concerns were addressed in a reasonable manner.nnOverall, my 5-month stay was comfortable, and I would recommend this PG to anyone looking for a clean and well-managed accommodation in Pune.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.349641', 4, 424, 4),
(2538, U&'[Chandan Bhai] So far, my experience at **OM SAi PG** has been very good. All the facilities here are well managed. The best part is the food. You get simple and tasty daily meals, including breakfast in the morning and dinner in the evening.nnThe most important thing is that you get **handmade rotis** here. Nowadays, almost 90%\201399% of PGs provide machine-made rotis, which are not as good. But at Homesai PG, you get fresh handmade rotis every day without a single skip.nnAnother great thing is the **daily cleaning service**. Cleaning is done regularly, so there are no concerns about hygiene. Yes, sometimes the cleaning staff takes a day off because no one can work all seven days continuously. Even on those days, the owner personally comes, collects the garbage, and ensures the place s', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.349803', 5, 424, 4),
(2539, '[Yukesh Kumaran] I had a great experience staying in this PG. The rooms are very clean, spacious, and well maintained. The environment is calm, safe, and comfortable, making it perfect for students and working professionals.nThe food quality is good and hygienic. The owner is very very good, friendly, and supportive, and always ready to help whenever there is any issue. Management response is quick and helpful.nRegular cleaning, good water supply, electricity, and washing machine facility are also available, making living here very convenient. I would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable and peaceful place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.34994', 5, 424, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2540, '[Abhishek Nemmaniwar] Excellent pg at affordable price. Fresh and hygienic food is served everyday. Pranav and colleagues take care of everything and won''t let anyone have any smallest discomfort.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.350063', 5, 424, 4),
(2541, '[Saran S] I stayed at OM Sai PG, Pune for one month. The rooms were neat and clean, and daily housekeeping was done properly. Washing machine is also available, which is very helpful for working people and students. The food was good. Dinner was served daily with chapathi (with daily one different gravy)and rice, and I must say the chapathi was very soft and well prepared. As someone from Tamil Nadu, I felt that on some days the morning breakfast was not very suitable for South Indian taste, but it was manageable. The owner is a nice and kind person. He clearly follows what he promises before the agreement, which gives a sense of trust and comfort while staying here. My overall experience was very good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.350191', 5, 424, 4),
(2542, U&'[Suman Khanna] The only positive aspect of this PG is the relatively affordable price. Apart from that, the overall experience has been quite disappointing.nn* The food provided in the mess is extremely poor in quality. The lentils are mostly water, and the vegetable curries are similarly diluted and lack taste.n* The PG advertises daily room cleaning, but in reality it seems to happen only two or three times a week. Dust often remains unchanged throughout the day.n* Washroom cleaning is claimed to happen every alternate day, but it appears to occur only about once a week. Because of this, residents often have to rely on their own air fresheners to manage the smell.n* The washing machine frequently malfunctions. A normal 45-minute cycle sometimes takes more than two hours, and at times it doesn\2019t wash properly at all, leaving clothes with dry detergent still on them.n* Even when cleaning is done, it appears very superficial. Hair and dust on the floor often remain, areas like under the bed are rarely cleaned, and insects such as cockroaches have occasionally been seen.n* The balcony is practically unusable. Its condition makes it difficult to use for drying clothes.n* Additionally, due to ongoing construction nearby, the balcony area becomes very dusty. Clothes hung there often end up getting dirty again, which defeats the purpose of drying them outside.nnOverall, while the rent may be affordable, the cleanliness, maintenance, and food quality need significant improvement.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.350311', 1, 424, 4),
(2543, '[hemant gavaria] I am staying at om sai pg day basis. It is one of the best pg I''ve lived in so far. The rooms are clean and well maintained. The food is good and the environment is safe and peaceful.nThe management is very kind and supportive.nI highly recommend this PG for students and professionals who are searching for PG in Kharadi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.350433', 5, 424, 4),
(2544, '[Akash Bade] I had a great experience at Om Sai PG. The rooms are clean, spacious, and well-maintained with all necessary facilities. The environment is safe and peaceful, making it ideal for students and working professionals. The management is very supportive and always ready to help. Food is hygienic and tastes good, and Wi-Fi and housekeeping are provided regularly. Overall, a comfortable stay at a reasonable price. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.350637', 5, 424, 4),
(2545, U&'[Nikita Pouranik] Just wanted to share that my stay at Avishya PG was fantastic! This is a place where I came in with a mindset that I will stay for quite sometime then vl move to flat, however I was here until I left the city....and that''s more than a year\+01f60dnn*What I loved:*n1. *Room u0026 Cleanliness*: Rooms are spacious, well-ventilated and housekeeping is done regularly. Feels like home.n2. *Food*: Home-cooked,  good food with good variety. Special meals on weekends too.n3. *Staff*: The owner and caretaker are super supportive and responsive. Any issue is resolved within hours.n4. *Amenities*: WiFi is fast, water is 24/7, laundry service is available, and security feels very safe.n5. *Location*: Well connected and close to my officennOverall great value for money. If you\2019re looking for a safe, clean and hassle-free PG in, this is it. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.358703', 5, 425, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2546, '[Vishal Mishra] I have been staying at Avishya PG for the last 1.5 years, and my experience has been very good. The food is very delicious, the rooms are spacious, and housekeeping service is available 24/7. I have stayed in many places, but this is one of the best stays in my life.nnAll rooms have attached bathrooms and balconies. The owners respond very quickly and are very supportive whenever there is any problem. I always feel a friendly and comfortable environment here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.358852', 5, 425, 4),
(2547, U&'[Ritul Paul] I\2019ve been staying here for almost eight months and it\2019s been a wonderful experience, especially considering it\2019s a PG. The crowd is great, the food is good, and all the facilities are top-notch. The owners are always trying their best to solve any problems that arise, they are just one text away. Highly recommend staying here, this is my best PG experience in Pune up until now!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.358995', 5, 425, 4),
(2548, '[Naipunya Mhatre] I have been staying at Avishya PG and my experience has been excellent. This is one of the best PG accommodations I have stayed in.nThe rooms are spacious, clean, and well-maintained with attached washrooms and balconies. The environment is friendly, comfortable, and feels like home.nThey provide many useful facilities such as washing machine, fridge, water dispenser on each floor, 24/7 water supply, solar heater, free housekeeping, Wi-Fi in every room, RO drinking water, CCTV security, parking, gym, and play area.nThe owners and staff are very supportive and respond quickly whenever any issue arises. The location is also very convenient, near Zensar IT Park, EON IT Park, BNY Mellon, World Trade Center, and Gera Commerzone.nI highly recommend Avishya PG for both boys and girls looking for a safe, clean, and comfortable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.359122', 5, 425, 4),
(2549, U&'[thiruvannamala hareendra] I have stayed in many PGs in Kharadi, but Avishya PG truly feels like home. They provide tasty food based on residents\2019 choices, delicious buttermilk in summer, and special menus on special days. The management is friendly and cooperative, and the cleanliness makes the stay comfortable. Separate Wi-Fi routers, laptop tables, and chairs make it worth the rent. A safe and highly recommended place to stay in Kharadi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.359244', 5, 425, 4),
(2550, '[PRAJWAL H M] This PG is choice for accommodation. They offer 2 and 3 sharing rooms. All the rooms have an attached bathroom and a balcony. The food served is delicious, they managed to serve both South and North Indian cuisine and the ample parking space for bikes is a big plus. Its convenient proximity to public transportation adds to its appeal. Highly recommended for those seeking a comfortable and well-connected living space in Kharadi', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.359364', 5, 425, 4),
(2551, '[chandra] I have had a wonderful experience at Avishya PG. The rooms are spacious and come with attached bathrooms, balconies, and a Wi-Fi router in each room, which makes the stay more comfortable.nnThe food is delicious, and this is one of the best PG I can say. The environment is friendly, comfortable, and feels like home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.359527', 5, 425, 4),
(2552, '[Arjun Rai] I have stayed here for a short period, but I must say this is one of the best PGs in Thitenagar. The food quality is really good, and there are absolutely no complaints when it comes to hygiene and cleanliness. You also get ample parking space for both 2-wheelers and 4-wheelers.nnTalking about the management, the owners are extremely cooperative and always ensure the best service for everyone. Most importantly, there is absolutely no compromise on food quality.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.359645', 5, 425, 4),
(2553, '[Saumyaa Khurranaa] Extremely disappointing and unprofessional experience with Zolo Stays.nnI was scheduled to move in on 1st April, however, I want to clearly state that I NEVER moved into the property due to its unacceptable condition.nnThe property manager, Manjeet, had already made me complete the full registration process days BEFORE I even visited the property, which is highly questionable and misleading. Upon visiting, I found the room to be in a completely unlivable state torn sofa, inadequate and poorly maintained furniture, and only one almirah provided for two occupants. The property was nowhere close to the standards advertised.nnThis amounts to clear misrepresentation of services.nnI made multiple attempts to resolve the issue on-site by contacting the manager and requesting him to come over before I left. Despite repeated calls and waiting for a considerable amount of time, he failed to show up or provide any assistance. This reflects a serious lack of accountability.nnSince I did not move in and the accommodation provided was not as promised, I am entitled to a full refund of my deposit.nnIf my refund is not processed promptly, I will be forced to escalate this matter formally through consumer forums and legal channels for deficiency of service and unfair trade practices.nnI strongly advise others to exercise caution before booking with Zolo Stays.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.371232', 1, 426, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2554, U&'[Chingreitim Shaiza] Zolo PG is such a scam.nAfter giving notice period we had a deal that I''ll be getting my deposit but in the end they didn''t pay anything. They make excuse after excuses. Zolo caretaker even told me don''t worry about anything it will automatically credited in your account. He''s the one who denied that I''m the one who''s not following the rules. All the proof are in the cctv camera only please check it out guys. Worst pg ever \+01f621\+01f621\+01f92c\+01f92c', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.371423', 1, 426, 4),
(2555, U&'[Mahima Iyer] \26a0\fe0f Honest Review of ZOLO Altius, Pune \26a0\fe0fnnI recently booked a PG through the Zolo app \+01f3e0 for Pune, and I really want to share my experience so others don\2019t make the same mistake I did \+01f645\200d\2640\fe0f.nnI had just got a new job \+01f4bc and was shifting from Mumbai \+01f697, so I searched for PGs online. After checking many options, I came across Zolo. Since they have multiple properties across cities like Pune, Bangalore, and Coimbatore, I assumed they\2019d be professional and reliable. Unfortunately, that wasn\2019t the case \+01f61e.nnI shortlisted a dual-sharing room on the app that showed a rent of around \20b99,100 (\20b98,900 if paid under a 3-month plan). I even requested a virtual video call \+01f4f1 since I couldn\2019t visit in person. They showed me a nice room, and based on that, I went ahead and booked it \2014 thankfully, by paying only a small booking amount \+01f4b0.nnBut when I reached Pune and saw the place in person, the real issue started \26a1. The staff told me the room I was shown on video was actually \20b913,000, and the one I had booked through the app was for men only \+01f6ab \2014 something they never mentioned earlier, nor was it updated on the app.nnImagine traveling all the way from Mumbai with all your luggage \+01f392, trusting a reputed platform like Zolo, only to be told you can\2019t stay in the room you booked. It was extremely frustrating and disappointing \+01f624. Luckily, I had friends and relatives in Pune who helped me for a few days until I found another PG \+01f64f.nnThis entire experience made me lose complete trust in Zolo \+01f494. The lack of communication, misinformation, and unprofessional handling was shocking.nn\+01f449 My advice: Please, don\2019t make the same mistake I did. Read Google reviews carefully \2b50 before booking any Zolo property. Even if you have to pay a little extra elsewhere, go for it \+01f4b8 \2014 at least you\2019ll avoid unnecessary stress and disappointment.nn\+01f6ab I would never recommend Zolo to anyone. They lost my trust completely.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.371566', 1, 426, 4),
(2556, '[Arideep Sengupta] Near to shops and Eon IT. Too costly as a Zolo without any good reasons. Rooms are too small for the amount we are paying plus electricity bills extra. Good view.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.371736', 4, 426, 4),
(2557, '[Anushka Sanganeria] Worst ever services even after paying 12K a month for a 3bhk with 7 people sharing a single flat. If you want your stay peaceful then don''t go for it. I regret stepping in zolo properties. During the initial phase they would be really sweet but when you will be exiting, they will charge you the exit fees and along with that when you will clear all the dues they will still not refund your deposit and make unnecessary deductions.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.371894', 1, 426, 4),
(2558, '[Shashwat Goyal] Very unclean and unhygienic. Place is not managed by owner and is quite poorly maintained. Photos on Google have nothing to do with the actual place', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.372108', 1, 426, 4),
(2559, U&'[yuvraj singh kushwah] Went to check this place for a possible stay, but it was truly disappointing. The actual setup is nothing like the pictures \2014 they\2019ve turned kitchen spaces into single rooms and separated them with plastic doors. They\2019re branding it as a luxury stay, but honestly, you can find much better PGs at lower prices. Feels completely misleading.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.372237', 1, 426, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2560, '[Mr Janardhan] Superb  best services in totality. Customer satisfaction is their top priority for sure. Rooms are damn spacious and they provide you with all', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.372356', 5, 426, 4),
(2561, U&'[Nidhi Bawane] One of the best PGs in Kharadi. It\2019s just a short walking distance from EON and WTC.nI stayed here for almost two years and had a great experience. The rooms are clean, hygienic, and well maintained. The food is good and other facilities are well taken care of.nThe owner and staff are accommodating and always helpful.nHighly recommend this place if you\2019re looking for a comfortable and reliable stay in Kharadi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.379975', 5, 427, 4),
(2562, '[Sayanti Das] I recently had the pleasure of staying at a PG that truly exceeded my expectations in every way. The rooms were spacious, well-maintained, and offered a comfortable atmosphere that made it feel like home. The food was another highlight, with a variety of delicious meals served daily, catering to different tastes and preferences. The owners are friendly and attentive, ensuring that all residents had a pleasant experience. The location is convenient, making it easy to commute and explore the surrounding area. Overall, this PG is undoubtedly one of the best in town, offering excellent value for money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.380213', 5, 427, 4),
(2563, '[Bhavana Sahu] I stayed at VM PG for approximately 1.5 years, and it was a wonderful experience. The PG provides all the necessary facilities with excellent cleanliness and overall maintenance. The environment is safe, comfortable, and one of the best accommodations in the Kharadi location.nnI''m truly happy and satisfied with my stay at VM PG. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.380338', 5, 427, 4),
(2564, '[Vaishali More] Best Pg in kharadi, Clean rooms. good for girls because of safety of the pg and good food.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.380512', 5, 427, 4),
(2565, '[Dnyaneshwar Bhil] I spent three months there. The rooms were exceptionally nice, and the owner of the PG was very accommodating. The food quality was excellent, and its proximity to both the WTC and EON IT park was convenient.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.380636', 5, 427, 4),
(2566, '[Ayush Vinchurkar] Amazing place to stay with home vibes. Best food i can have is the place VM pg. You are not treated like a guest, but a family member. If any problem you face, this can be sorted out easily with communication. Owners are supportive and beleive in sharing the best facilities in reasonable price', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.380754', 5, 427, 4),
(2567, '[Prasad Suvarna] One of best PG apartments around Kharadi, very close to EON IT park and WTC. Excellent facilities and good food options provided. Owner is very accommodating and Staff is also very helpful.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.380871', 5, 427, 4),
(2568, '[Rajasekhar Reddy] Excellent PgnRooms are neat n cleannOwner Srinivas is a nice n friendly person', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.381123', 5, 427, 4),
(2569, '[Saloni] Owner uncle is good but the caretaker is rude and you will have to call multiple times for small issues. My room was too small and still they charged me a lot and cut 500 from my deposit for no reason. There was a small bulb in my room and after weeks u0026 multiple calls they changed to tubelight. I was charged a lot and my work was hampered . There was no wifi signal in my room and caretaker will not pick you calls or even if he picks he will talk rudely. Totally frustrating experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.389407', 1, 428, 4),
(2570, '[Dharani Ravi] I had a comfortable stay at the PG. The food facilities were good and hygienic, the rooms and common areas were maintained clean, and the overall environment felt safe and secure. The management was also supportive and responsive whenever needed. Overall, it was a pleasant experience staying here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.389625', 5, 428, 4),
(2571, '[VILAS BHAMBURDEKAR] Its a safe and secure PG for girls. They have all the facilities like  wifi ; washing machines ; good quality food and  also spacious .This area is under CCTV surveillance.Its a really nice and comfortable atmosphere.I highly recommend Diamond PG .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.389779', 5, 428, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2572, U&'[Nikhil Andhale] Hey future Kharadi residents! I can''t recommend Diamond PG enough!  If you''re a girl searching for the perfect PG, your search ends here.  Seriously, this place is fantastic. My sister stayed here for 2 years. They''ve thought of everything \2013 multiple washing machines (laundry day just got way easier!), a lift, hot water around the clock, and a beautiful rooftop garden where you can chill and relax.  The rooms are really spacious and well-ventilated, plus the entire place is spotless.  Security is a big deal for me, and Diamond PG nails it with their CCTV system and on-site caretaker.  The food is delicious and home-cooked, and the coolest thing is they have a separate cooking area with its own gas line so you can satisfy those late-night cravings whenever they hit \2013 even at 2 AM!  The owner is a retired Class One officer who takes a personal interest in the well-being of the residents, which is awesome.  Parking is never an issue, which is a major bonus.  They do have a no-smoking/no-drinking rule, but honestly, that''s part of what makes the vibe here so great \2013 it''s a really positive and comfortable environment.  If you''re looking for a top-notch girls'' PG in Kharadi, Diamond PG is the place to be!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.389914', 5, 428, 4),
(2573, U&'[Prachi Bodkhe] Hey everyone, I just wanted to share my amazing experience at Diamond PG in Kharadi.  Seriously, if you''re a girl looking for a place to stay, this is it!  They have everything you could possibly need \2013 three washing machines (lifesaver!), a lift, 24/7 hot water, and even a rooftop garden with swings!  The rooms are spacious and airy, and they keep the whole place super clean.  I was also really impressed with the security \2013 they have CCTV everywhere and a caretaker on site all the time.  The food is great too, and the best part? They let you cook whenever you want!  They have a separate gas connection for PG girls, so even if you''re craving Maggi at 2 AM, you can make it.  The owner is a retired Class One officer, and he''s really involved in making sure everything runs smoothly.  Oh, and they have plenty of parking, which is a huge plus.  They do have a no-smoking/no-drinking policy, but honestly, I think that just makes the place even better.  It creates a really nice, comfortable atmosphere.  I highly recommend Diamond PG \2013 it''s the best girls'' PG I''ve found\00a0in\00a0Kharadi!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.390038', 5, 428, 4),
(2574, '[Aparimita Kashinath] I stayed at Diamond PG for 2.5 years and it was very comfortable. Baban sir (owner) and Raju bhaiya (caretaker) were always available to resolve even the smallest inconvenience.nnThe rooms are well ventilated with good natural light. Rooms are cleaned everyday and there was never any issues with water u0026 electricity. Two things that really make the PG exceptional is the food and the three washing machines!nnThere are no restrictions on timings for coming in/going out. There is even a gas connection on the terrace that can be used anytime.nnWould highly recommend to anyone looking for a PG in Kharadi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.390163', 5, 428, 4),
(2575, U&'[Sanjay Andhale] It brings me so much peace of mind to share our family''s experience with Diamond PG in Kharadi. My daughter stayed there for a full year, and as a parent, I honestly couldn''t have asked for a better place for her. From the moment she moved in, we were so impressed with the facilities. They have three washing machines, which is a huge convenience, a lift, and even a beautiful rooftop garden with swings \2013 a real bonus for unwinding after a long day. And the 24-hour hot water was always a blessing.nWhat really stood out was the food quality. My daughter always raved about the meals, and the fact that the owner, a retired Class One officer, personally eats from the mess really speaks volumes about the standard. He truly oversees everything to ensure a hassle-free stay. The flexibility of the 24/7 cooking access was a lifesaver for her late-night study cravings; having that separate gas connection for quick Maggi or tea was such a thoughtful touch.nAs a parent, safety and cleanliness were my top priorities, and Diamond PG excelled in both. The spacious, well-ventilated rooms were always immaculate, and the 16 HD CCTV cameras along with the 24-hour caretaker made me feel completely at ease about her security. While they have a strict no-smoking and no-drinking policy, I actually appreciated that; it contributed to a very positive and respectful atmosphere throughout the premises. There''s also ample parking, which was convenient for us when visiting. Honestly, the positive vibes there are palpable, and knowing my daughter was in such a caring, well-managed environment made her year away from home so much easier for all of us.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.390278', 5, 428, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2576, '[sanika kalaskar] Okay, here''s my review of Diamond PG, from my own experience:nLet me tell you, finding a good, safe, and clean PG in Kharadi, especially when you''re working odd hours in the IT hub, is like finding a unicorn. But I found mine at Diamond PG, and honestly, I don''t know what I''d do without it.nFirst off, the location is unbeatable. Walking distance to all the major IT parks? Yes, please! No more battling Pune traffic after a long day. But what really sets Diamond PG apart is the cleanliness. They don''t just say they''re clean; they are. My room gets cleaned every single day! It''s such a relief to come back to a tidy space, especially when you''re juggling a demanding job.nAnd the amenities? Forget what you think you know about PGs. They have a lift, which is a blessing when you''re on the higher floors. But the real gems are the rooftop garden and kitchen. Imagine unwinding after work with a cup of tea in a green space, or whipping up a midnight snack with a view. It''s fantastic! They have 3 fully automatic washing machines only for girls and 24 hours hot water. The high speed internet is a blessing with every room having separate connection.nSpeaking of food, the mess is honestly the best I''ve ever had in a PG. The owner and his family eat the same food, which speaks volumes about the quality. It feels like home-cooked meals, and it''s always delicious. Plus, they have a separate kitchen for us girls who want to cook our own meals, especially late at night. That''s been a lifesaver for my late-night cravings.nThe owner, a retired class one officer, is incredibly attentive. He genuinely cares about the well-being of the residents. And the 24-hour access? Absolutely perfect for those of us working night shifts. Safety is also paramount here. With 16 ultra HD CCTV cameras covering every inch of the PG, I always feel secure.nBut the best part? The genuine kindness of the owner and his family. I remember when I fell sick, they were so supportive and helpful. And having a doctor in the family (the owner''s daughter-in-law) is a huge comfort.nHonestly, Diamond PG is more than just a place to stay. It''s a safe, clean, and comfortable home away from home. I wholeheartedly recommend it to any working woman or girl looking for a top-notch PG in Kharadi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.391242', 5, 428, 4),
(2577, '[Nitesh Goyal] Pg is really good, clean and a lot of peacenNo bhasad herenOnly 2 persons in one room , you can get single sharing also, less crowd which is good things, high standardnOnly problem is rent is slightly high for per day basis but per month basis it''s cheapnnOther problem is staff there is only one staff', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.398402', 4, 429, 4),
(2578, '[Aneesh Jain] I stayed here for 15 days as it was not a flat system and it has personal washrooms and location is good but As per the Room Rent the amenities are not proper and as expected to be in the pay  of room.nnPros :  Good Location as near by its has good food stalls / restaurants.nnCons :  Rooms are small , Maintenance is poor ,  They mention that they provide Semi Washing Machine but even that semi washing machine doesn''t works as expected, Wi-Fi Speed fluctuates alot with no proper speed. Gas / Refrigerator is old . terrace is so small to hang/dry Clothes. Take care doesn''t response properly', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.398547', 1, 429, 4),
(2579, '[pratyush tripathi] Great service , rooms are tidy. Overall good experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.398675', 5, 429, 4),
(2580, '[Pushkaraj Yadav] The PG is really a great place to say. The caretaker and owner both are really good. The cleanliness is maintained from time to time. The rooms are well equipped with cupboards and shoe rack. The bathroom is clean as well.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.398795', 5, 429, 4),
(2581, '[Vinay CS] I''m very impressed with the cleanliness and maintenance. The PG is always well-kept, and I also feel very secure here.  The furniture is comfortable and of good quality. Overall, I would highly recommend RNA PG to anyone looking for a clean, safe, and well-maintained PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.398916', 4, 429, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2582, '[Avdhut Pailwan] Well maintained and clean rooms. Washing machine, WiFi, Water purifier, refrigerator, Bed, pillow, gas, cupboard and wardrobe, fan, Chappal stand, heater available. Do give it a go if you''re considering living at a PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.399044', 5, 429, 4),
(2583, '[Shreyansh Agrawal] I stayed here for almost 6 months. RNA PG is one of the cleanest PGs around the area. RNA Sir is very co-operative and makes sure you feel the comfort and privacy just like your home. The facility and infrastructure is well-maintained with CCTVs and ample parking space for two-wheelers. Overall, totally recommended over every other PG I checked out in the area.nnPS. Beware of MagicBricks scammers as RNA PG is not listed online anywhere other than Google Business as of 12/10/2023 as confirmed by the owner.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.39917', 4, 429, 4),
(2584, '[Ajay Joshi] An excellent location and PG, stayed  here . Found the owner , very helpful in resolving issues and a good person by nature.nBest part is the location, while still being secluded. Step out and eat, catch a cab, do your shopping at Reliance Mall.. everything within walking distance.nTrue value for money and a home away from home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.399295', 5, 429, 4),
(2585, U&'[Sunil Chaudhari] Very poor experience at Zolo Lilac PG, Kharadi.nNo proper service is provided after joining.nRooms and common areas are not cleaned regularly.nThe overall environment is unhealthy and unhygienic.nSerious issues with payment and deposit refund.nThey collected a deposit of \20b96,650, but at the time of exit they returned only \20b93,873, stating various exit charges without proper justification.nBecause of these problems, I do not recommend staying at this property. Please think carefully before choosing this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.407735', 1, 430, 4),
(2586, '[Abhishek Ghatiya] Very good pg, super location and Very much hygienic and clean. And All amenities are working condition. Staff is also helpful. @manoj patidar', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.407889', 5, 430, 4),
(2587, '[Prajyot Walali] Zolo lilac pg very clean, staff members are very friendly and helpful.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.408075', 5, 430, 4),
(2588, '[Sunil Kumar] Not suitable for working professionals.  Rooms are pathetic, dirty, peeled paint walls, no privacy and to add salt to the injury the room rents are exorbitant.  Better to take a flat on sharing basis rather than taking a room in ZOLO.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.408218', 1, 430, 4),
(2589, '[Manjeet singh] This pg is affordable and best services  are provided by zolo company fully managed staff  good parking area is available', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.408339', 5, 430, 4),
(2590, U&'[Lokesh Bhardwaj] Good accommodation to stay \+01f44d\+01f60anAlso staff is helpful', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.408454', 5, 430, 4),
(2591, U&'[Vinay Khadgi] Never stay in zolo lilac.n1. Every month they update the policy and stop giving the service in name of policy update. When I had joined they were providing food and tea, after some time they degrade the quality of food and stop giving tea and coffee in name of policy update even no change in rent. After some days I complaint about the quality of food they update the policy again and stop giving the food . Before stopping the food rent was 7000 after that stopping the food rent was 5500 then very next month they again update the policy and increased the rent and rent becomes 6200. Even I hadn''t completed 6 month they increased the rent. After 3 week again they update the policy ,So earlier if you don''t pay rent by 7th of month fine was 100 per day till 15 th of month and then you have to leave  after policy update they are charging 500 per day for late rent pay. So this is issue in name of policy update they will charge you unnecessary  amount.nn2. Earlier the quality of service are good room cleaning was proper now they are not cleaning room properly no pest control nothing. My room was having cockroach problem and mosquito \+01f99f problem even after multiple times complaint no pest control done. Some room even have bedbugs problem which is nightmare if you got such rooms.nn3.Very slow wifi,if you think pg has wifi so you can do work from home forgot about that. Wifi is useless even if you have 3g net in mobile better than zolo wifi.nn4 . Sales man will tell you you can leave when ever you want that is not true. Lockin period is there if you leave pg befor 1year then 2000 will be deducted from deposit and you have to even give 1 month prior notice for that. And even after that you have to call multiple times to get deposit back and still they will deduct some random amount from that in name of damages and maintenance.nn5. No response from the property management. if you have any issues then they will not respond you have to raise ticket and take frequent follow up.nn6. TV is just a joke. TV is just for name you cannot find any channel which you can watch.nn7. Don''t join zolo if u want to join be ready for trouble.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.408642', 1, 430, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2592, '[KARPUR KABI] Water quality is badnThis is the type of water we get for washroom purpose', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.408765', 1, 430, 4),
(2593, U&'[Pradhumna Kulkarni] Zolo Home stay are best options of homestay or Pg for lots of reasons . Majorly i noted these.n1. Cleanliness - Regular cleanliness of rooms and corridors.n2. Facilities such as Washing machine , inductions for quite bite , TV in every room , WiFi ,water heater , Common Refrigerator ,drinking water at each floor.n3. Food - Food is average bcoz the fact that I get bored of repetitive food items overall it''s Ok .n4. Parking space - Good parking space for 2 wheelers.nGarbage disposal buckets at each floor with seperate dray and wet waste. This is good \+01f44dnI feel this is the best Homestay or PG you will find .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.425629', 5, 432, 4),
(2594, '[vishwas tripathi] One of the worst experience I had with Zolo Agora.nI booked single room based on the pictures available in their website, on the last day before moving to Pune, they showed me the flat and told that they don''t have any single room.nAt that time, I don''t have any option aas I don''t have any time to search any new location.nWhen I checked in, I found that in 1 bhk there are 5 persons and single washroom. When I raised this issue, caretaker told me that he will shift in another flat where I need to share with another persons, flats are dirty and unhygienic.nAfter all such things, I finally decided to move out from that PG and I did not recive any amount which I deposited initially.nMy recommendation is that think twice before moving in this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.425839', 1, 432, 4),
(2595, '[Ganesh] Too expensive...nn5 people in 1 bhk flat. 1 bathroom to be shared with all.nnRoom has only lights fans cupboard and bed.nnSingle sharing person stays in kitchen.nnDon''t fall for this Zolo name.nnIt is not what they show on their website. The current photos not uploaded on site.nnFood cooked by north indian teenage boys.nnThere are many many better options nearby. Do check them out', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.425966', 2, 432, 4),
(2596, '[akshay yawale] Great service. Good rooms. Cleaning on time. Had a pleasant experience. Staff is prompt and polite.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.426089', 5, 432, 4),
(2597, U&'[Manuj Sharma] Nice living facility, app operated check-in/ out.nnAffordable, better than usual PG facilities in terms of house-keeping, security.nnFood could be slightly better, since the catering service is outsourced u0026 takes time to deliver to every location.!nnCheck out their offers while joining \+01f642\+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.426206', 4, 432, 4),
(2598, '[Vishal Mishra] It cannot be more worse. Recently visited this PG and saw the pathetic state of this PG. Pics posted are way too old because the current state is worst. Coming to food now, it even worse. People living here have their own tiffin arranged from outside as you cannot even swallow the food provided here. Not professional at all as stated on their website. Pls pls stay away all those good ratings are fake. Visit once and you will clearly agree with my words.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.426324', 1, 432, 4),
(2599, U&'[Amar Zalte] One of the best Zolo Pg in kharadi for men''s. The care taking staff(PM) is very friendly. The property is well maintained,clean and rooms are also good here.The food is great and has variety all over the week so it''s healthy and tasty. Has 24*7 WiFi service.Tv in each room. The also provides,a common fridge and washing machine. All of this at pocket friendly price. Hot water is available. Has parking space. Overall you can have nice experience living here\+01f609', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.42652', 5, 432, 4),
(2600, '[Ankush Kitukale] I checked it out once. Never stayed here. 1bhk flats are available. In Bed room 2 persons, 1 in kitchen, It''s like a small modified room and 2 persons in hall. Not so Big space, nice and clean environment. Parking available, food available. WiFi, TV, beds, (freezer and washing machine are commonly used) etc all the amenities available. Roughly 2 Kms away from World trade center, Kharadi Pune. Recommended for bachelor''s, students etc.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.426641', 4, 432, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2601, U&'[Amit Jha] I\2019ve been staying at this PG for the past two months, and I couldn''t be happier. The food is consistently good and varied, making me look forward to every meal. The Wi-Fi is reliable, which is essential for my studies and work. The daily cleaning service keeps the rooms and common areas spotless, creating a pleasant living environment.nnThe other residents are friendly and easy to get along with, making it feel like a supportive community. The rooms are well-maintained and comfortable, providing a great space to relax. Overall, I highly recommend this PG for anyone looking for a comfortable and hassle-free living experience!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.432481', 5, 433, 4),
(2602, '[Prajwal Kumbhar] Safe and secureenvironment.nFriendly and cooperative staff.nAffordable pricing with good facilities.nBest food quality.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.432608', 5, 433, 4),
(2603, '[Emraan Hashmi] Best service in kharadi area including all like food, hygiene, room management etc.specially I like food because it''s like home made quality and also daily room cleaning and healthy...', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.432731', 5, 433, 4),
(2604, '[Vaibhav Hivarkar] This pg is very well developed, the pg owner is also very well developed, all the facilities are available here, the day is very clean, food is also available somewhere, where can we say that this pg is luxury.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.432852', 5, 433, 4),
(2605, '[Nihal Kale] My experience is good, PG Owner is supportive and friends, Pg rooms is actually big. I feel homely environment', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.432972', 5, 433, 4),
