(2607, '[Ajinkya Kale] Best of in Kharade for living near to all companies. Good food . spacious rooms and co-operative owner.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.433268', 5, 433, 4),
(2608, U&'[Omkar Mundada] It\2019s a very friendly and care taking atmosphere.we feel very safe here. I just love this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.433385', 5, 433, 4),
(2609, '[Sreehari Chandran] Great Pg in tulja bhawani nagar.. easily accessible, affordable includes food which also good.they provid parking facilities..maintained rooms well..owner behuth acha admi hei... worth for money', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.442729', 5, 434, 4),
(2610, '[Sreekanth yadav] Excellent PG with clean rooms and a very good environment. The building is new and well maintained. Good location, affordable rent, and all basic facilities available. Highly recommended for students and working professionals looking for a comfortable stay in Kharadi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.442866', 5, 434, 4),
(2611, '[Dharaneesh SA] The rooms are good and daily they are cleaning the rooms ..The food is not so good but it is ok ...The people can adjust means they can eat the food and stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.442991', 5, 434, 4),
(2612, '[Vishnu S S] Good accomodation and hygiene also.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.443203', 5, 434, 4),
(2613, '[Nitya C] Worst food and the most rude managers, these people just want to scam your money and want you to leave as soon as they notify, like if there someone offering even a 500 extra they will want you to leave on the same night and the food omg they served the same dal and rice and if any rice is leftover today you will be served the same until it is completed. And you get to taste all kinds of fusion foods here, pasta upma, puffed rice upma, sprouts dal and many more fusions also. Only stay here if you have good health insurance or dont care about you gut heath.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.443322', 1, 434, 4),
(2614, '[Vinit Bolla] I would surely recommend, neat and clean PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.443442', 5, 434, 4),
