(2616, '[sagar sisodiya] Good pg and good owner', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.444213', 5, 434, 4);        
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2617, '[Mahesh Akkishetty] Exceptional Stay - Highly RecommendnI have had a great experience staying at Sai Luxury Boys PG. The rooms are spacious, well-ventilated, and kept remarkably clean with regular housekeeping.What stands out:Top-notch Amenities: The high-speed Wi-Fi is incredibly reliable for work and streaming, and having a fridge, TV, and proper storage makes it feel like home.Great Food: Unlike many PGs, the food served here is hygienic, flavorful, and offers a good variety.Management u0026 Security: The management is approachable and professional. Using an app to log requests makes maintenance quick and hassle-free. The building is also very secure with CCTV and helpful staff.If you are a student or a working professional looking for a hassle-free, premium, and comfortable stay in the area, this PG is definitely worth every rupee!To make this review look even more authentic, tell me:Which specific room type did you stay in? (Single, double, or triple sharing)What was your favorite meal or amenity?I can instantly plug those details in to customize it perfectly for you!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.455791', 5, 435, 4),
(2618, '[Ashish Kumar] Near to eon it park World  trade clean and safe great facilities and friendly manager it office are walkable distance good service if anyone needs a pg,i can tell you witch one is the best', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.456306', 5, 435, 4),
(2619, '[Soamnath Paul] Hi All,nLet me share my honest and non commercial feedback about Sai Luxury Boys Pg in Kharadi.n1. I have been staying in pg for more than one year and trust me this is the best pg I have ever stayed in.n2. Owner Madhav ji always supported and very good person.n3. Close to Kharadi IT park and viman Nagar..n4. Food is delicious and room cleanness top notch.n5. Great roommates and pg mates.n6. If you planing to shift in this area, I''m highly recommended this PG.n7. Overall very good experience. Thank you Madhav ji for Ganpati puja invitation.n8. It''s feel like home. I''ll be missed this pg and area and people very much.n.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.456477', 5, 435, 4),
(2620, '[Gyanesh] One of the best PGs to stay. The owner is very welcoming. Overall had a nice experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.456608', 5, 435, 4),
(2621, '[Gaurav Walia] Excellent PG with economical rates and on demand services. Must stay if you are considering a quick accommodation in kharadi. Mr. Madhav sir is the most humble caretaker in the whole area. Any problem contact this man and it will be solved. :) I have stayed there for a year.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.456736', 5, 435, 4),
(2622, '[Sudhansu Sekhar Nahak] Nice PG with good facilities in affordable price. The caretaker, Mr. Madhav is well mannered and responds well to all the queries. A great PG for professionals working in Kharadi and Viman Nagar.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.456861', 5, 435, 4),
(2623, '[Abhishek Sagare] One of the best place I have been...nnVery silent...No drama...nnPG owner Madhav Shetty is also very corportivennDefinately one can try if want searching for PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.456981', 5, 435, 4),
(2624, '[Rishi Chelasani] Very good service awesome pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.457104', 5, 435, 4),
(2625, '[Sandeep Yadav] Very bad property it is, lot of bedbugs are there in this property, i have been staying in this property from past 3 weeks, i am facing bedbugs issues, I am unable to sleep at night due to this issues, i have raised the problem with the zolo care but the issue are not resolved, they are not taking any action, i have spoken with them multiple times but they have not listened.nKindly never come to this property, one of waste property i ever seen.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.466332', 1, 436, 4),
(2626, U&'[Sandeep Yadav] Worst experience!\+01f926nOne of waste property it is, many bedbugs issues are there in the bed, mattress and also rooms are not clean. And also zolo customer service is very bad, whatever i have raised the complaint not a single issue has been resolved but they have closed the ticket. It''s very bad experience with this zolo property.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.466567', 1, 436, 4); 
