(2627, '[Pratik Dhawas] The PG will give you experience that nothing can be worst than this. The staff is very careless, no proper cleaning of the rooms, the care taker does it only for maintaining records. The manager doesn''t answer you properly nor he visits the pg. I had horrible experience within a month.nI absolutely won''t suggest this pg, don''t fall in the trap of branding done by Zolo.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.466748', 1, 436, 4),
(2628, '[Sandeep Yadav] Waste pg, bedbugs issues are too much.nnZolo service is also waste, without resolving the issues, they had closed the ticket.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.467005', 1, 436, 4),
(2629, '[Vyankatesh Joshi] Worst Experience!!nRight from Management to Caretaker each and everything is miserable. Before entering they will showcase their brand and all and Once you enter they start showing original colours. The Customer care will never pick up call. Caretaker will just give reasons to escape from his work. Miscalculation in Electricity bills, rooms will not be cleaned properly. Think twice thrice before JoiningnnRegards', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.467286', 1, 436, 4),
(2630, '[Ankosh Rathod] A very nice PG here in Kharadi. You will get a fully furnished flat with all the amenities Inside the flat itself they provide standard and premium quality if you are in kharadi must visit this PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.467455', 5, 436, 4),
(2631, '[Kailas Thatte] Zolo Volantis is good PG in Kharadi area. Clean and neat. It facilitates best accommodation in reasonable price. Food quality is not that good but not bad also. PG Staff is polite and helping to all.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.467618', 4, 436, 4),
(2632, '[Sai Varun Chaganti] Positives.n1) Friendly staffn2) Room cleaning is done neatly.n3) Food (Breakfast).nNegative.n1) Rent(Too much)n2) Frequent power cuts(It irritates a lot).n3) Room is not so great as per rent.nnSuggestionnGo for other PG''s if you have options because it''s too much costly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.467774', 2, 436, 4),
(2633, '[prashant yadav] This PG is clean and spacious with a decent parking. Very close to my workplace. Experience here is good and the amenities are decent. Brahma who takes care of everything is so elegant and resourceful.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.478309', 5, 437, 4),
(2634, '[sushil rathi] Lived here for 3 years. Amazing place, helpful and humble owner, nice well ventilated rooms, affordable rent, minimal deposit, decent food.nThey have all amenities like Wi-Fi, Washing machine, Refrigerator, Hot Water, Room cleaning.nSuggested this to two of my friends and they have also lived here for multiple years.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.478493', 5, 437, 4),
(2635, '[Ravikumar Mandal] Great experience so far at Prathamesh Pg. Clean rooms, friendly staff, and a safe environment. Everything you need for a comfortable stay at a reasonable price.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.478665', 5, 437, 4),
(2636, '[shaurya singh] The PG is a great place to live, especially if you''re on a budget. The rooms are clean and the food is good. The owners are friendly and helpful, and the location is convenient. Overall, I would recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable and affordable place to stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.478837', 5, 437, 4),
(2637, U&'[Nitin Khade] I\2019m staying here in single occupancy self contained room from Jan25, I stayed here for weekdays n leave for my home in Thane on weekends. Basic amenities for work professionals like me eg study table, chair, lock n key cupboards with unlimited WiFi access, common washing machine n fridge are provided within the rent. Most importantly the daily housekeeping, washroom n room cleaning is the key which makes me feel like home. Good outside tiffin facility is the extended support given by the PG with door pick up n drop arrangements. This PG is only for males n under strict rules by owner for visitors makes the stay environment  more disciplined. I can not comment on shared occupancy as I have not experienced it, In n all I recommend Prathamesh PG good place to stay specially for single occupancy of sure. Pl keep it up !!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.479004', 5, 437, 4);              
