(2642, '[ARVIND PANDEY] One of the best PG with clean room and good food at a reasonable price', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.492435', 5, 438, 4),
(2643, '[Anshu Kumari] Very well-maintained PG with clean rooms and regular housekeeping.nFood quality is good and homely.nOwner and staff are supportive and responsive.nSafe location with all basic amenities available.nHighly recommended for working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.492561', 5, 438, 4),
