(2645, '[Rihan Cool] Best PG  Room Service Cleaning Very GoodnOwner Very Helpful and Good human being', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.492812', 5, 438, 4),
(2646, U&'[Anshu Shahi] The PG offers a clean, well-maintained, and comfortable living environment with all essential amenities.nThe management is supportive and responsive to any concerns.nSafety and hygiene standards are well maintained.nFacilities like food, Wi-Fi, and housekeeping are consistently reliable.nThe staff is cooperative and ensures a comfortable stay.nHighly recommended for working professionals and students.nOverall, it\2019s an excellent choice for a hassle-free stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.492933', 5, 438, 4),
(2647, U&'[Naina Shukla] Best place to have a good time and wonderful stay in khadadi. All the facilities provided are great and in budget \2026. Highly recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.493056', 5, 438, 4),
(2648, '[Yash] Posh pg but ventilation is not that good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.493266', 4, 438, 4),
(2649, '[Milind Rane] I had a great experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean, spacious, and well-maintained. The management is extremely cooperative and always available to help with anything. Food quality is really good, hygiene is maintained daily, and all basic amenities like WiFi, hot water, and laundry are properly provided.nnThe environment is safe and peaceful, making it perfect for students as well as working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.504706', 5, 439, 4),
(2650, U&'[Balakumar V] I love my PG , If I came to pune stay here only I like there service and carrying...\2764 both Anna u0026 Akka are so good kind hearted\+01f60d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.504868', 5, 439, 4),
(2651, U&'[Gaurav Bharti] All is good in this PG very nice. Everything in that PG good to all things like Sequrity , Food , Room Cleaning specially good Food and this PG Good for up-dawning for office person no restrictions for night shift parking area also always available filter water and cold water also available. Value for money \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.505039', 5, 439, 4),
(2652, '[Shaik Ali] Super nice Good food,  rooms super very very nice pg good facilitates', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.505218', 5, 439, 4),
(2653, '[Mohit Jadhao] This PG is good in kharadi compare with other PG''s. All facilities are there including dinner, lunch, washing machine, WiFi, 24/4 water and Parking, etc. The most important this is cleanness which everyone needs. overalls its good PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.505967', 5, 439, 4),
(2654, '[yogesh patil] The PG is like home stay, good food, the chaptis are very good as they are made by hand in PG only.nFood is excellent.nRooms are good and cleand every day.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.50821', 5, 439, 4);        
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2655, '[Prasad Dhend] best pg in kharadi. regular maintenance done. good service.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.508448', 5, 439, 4),
(2656, '[bhushan nalawade] Rooms are Clean , owner is great,washing machines and cleaning lady available, great atmosphere, food is ok, non-veg is available 2 days ina week, if food is not considered everything is great', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.508586', 4, 439, 4),
(2657, '[shruti Bhardwaj] My overall experience at Zolo Snehangan has been quite good. The property is clean, well-maintained, and has a peaceful environment which makes it comfortable to stay for students and working professionals. The rooms are spacious and hygiene is mostly maintained properly. The staff and management are cooperative and try to resolve issues whenever raised, though sometimes there can be slight delays. The location is also convenient, with nearby shops and easynconnectivity. Security arrangements are satisfactory, which gives a sense of safety. Overall, Zolo Sneha Angan provides good facilities and a comfortable living experience, and I would recommend it to anyone looking for a decent PGnaccommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.592577', 5, 440, 4),
(2658, '[Ankit Wagh] I had a pleasant stay at Zolo Snehangan PG for around 2 months. The rooms were clean and well-maintained, and the overall hygiene standards were good. The amenities provided were convenient, especially for someone new to the city. The staff was cooperative and responsive whenever needed. The location in Wakad is also a big plus, with easy access to nearby offices, eateries, and transport. Overall, it was a comfortable and hassle-free experience, and I would recommend it to anyone looking for a decent PG in Pune.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.593799', 5, 440, 4),
(2659, U&'[swadheen singh tomar] Decent place to stay, checked-in here two days back. Maybe it\2019s too early to comment, rating may increase or decrease with respect to time. See u soonnnLatest review post 2 weeks- No restrictions as such for a bachelor on late arrivals except few mandatory ones.nI changed the rating from 3-4 star since their ticket response and resolution time is quick. Though I found insects doing my welcome but they did pest control and repaired off AC in few days after I joined.nCleaning is also decent, kitchen setup is there for Maggi and tea. There are areas of improvement as well like drinking water availability, need to remind them to fill it sometimes etc. For every problem you cannot raise ticket but that\2019s how it is now. I hope my rating isn\2019t degraded wrt time.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.59409', 4, 440, 4),
(2660, '[Only Backup] Not a good place if you wish to make new friends here. Better live in colive if you really want to socialise and make new friends. Such a boring place this is. Lived in colive and must say, that place has excellent vibes', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.594246', 2, 440, 4),
(2661, U&'[Vedant Prakash] I have been staying at Zolo Snehanagan for quite some time now, and my experience has been truly amazing. The property is well-maintained, clean, and peaceful \2014 perfect for students and working professionals. The rooms are comfortable, the facilities are reliable, and the overall environment feels very safe and homely.nnA special appreciation goes to Manager Suraj, who is extremely supportive and responsive. He ensures that all issues are resolved quickly and always maintains a friendly attitude. His management makes daily living smooth and hassle-free, and he genuinely cares about the residents\2019 comfort.nnOverall, Zolo Snehanagan has been one of the best PG experiences I\2019ve had. Highly recommended to anyone looking for a comfortable and well-managed place to stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.594379', 5, 440, 4),
(2662, U&'[Akshay Sonawane] Very good service and a neat, clean room. The staff\2019s behavior was also good. Overall, it was a very pleasant experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.59451', 5, 440, 4),
(2663, '[Basant Soni] Zolo Snehangan in Wakad offers a clean, comfortable, and well-maintained living space. The amenities like WiFi, housekeeping, laundry, and security are reliable, and the location is great for daily convenience and IT park access. A good option for a hassle-free stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.594644', 5, 440, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2664, '[Rahul Rathaur] Had a great time and affordable stay in zolo wakad. Essentias are available at door step. Zolo food option is also just a call away depending on your requirements. Will consider for sure during my pune stay again.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.59477', 5, 440, 4),
(2665, '[Apx Predator] WOTST PG IN THE WORLD DONT CAME HERE IF YOU ARE GULAAM OR DOING JOB THIS PLACE IS JANNAT FOR U  , saw first ever pg where i pay fees for no food , i pay for food , but many times this happens with me , that after paying for food I don''t get food . Don''t ever try to came here . This is not pg this is feel like total jail. Biggest khulasa of all times if they says this is the pure veg pg don''t believe their staff cooks and eats non-veg in the same kitchen and then says management can eat . Rules are only for Payers .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.610036', 1, 441, 4),
(2666, '[Akash Chandrakant Pawar] Worst PG in the world , saw first ever pg where i pay fees for no food , i pay for food , but many times this happens with me , that after paying for food I don''t get food . Don''t ever try to came here . This is not pg this is feel like total jail.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.611113', 5, 441, 4),
(2667, '[Rahul Rathod] All staff member and good and nice and owner always resolve any problem we have', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.611401', 5, 441, 4),
(2668, '[Ranjeet Masram] I''ve stayed in this PG and it has been a really comfortable experience. The rooms are good, and the staff is always helpful. The location is convenient with easy access to public transport and nearby markets. The management is responsive. Good for students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.611718', 5, 441, 4),
(2669, '[pranav rane] I stayed in a single room on 3rd floor. I felt that the room was spacious enough for me to live comfortably. Never had trouble with water shortage (both drinking and other usage). Food was included in the rent and I found it hygienic and healthy. I would recommend this PG as it is affordable and services are good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.611935', 5, 441, 4),
(2670, '[Pritam Bagde] I went to meet my son to handover some clothes to him and also to use his washroom.  The caretaker not allowed me to go upstairs. He behave in very rudely manner. The timing for breakfast has been fixed between 08:00 AM and 10:00 AM. But even if you visit on time, you will find that the breakfast is finished. This happened with my son. Requesting to provide breakfast was straight away refused. The cleanliness is also major issue in and surrounding. Very poor management by this PG. Think many times before booking this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.612271', 1, 441, 4),
(2671, '[sameer khan] Cozy Haven Paying Guest Accommodation exceeds expectations with warm hospitality, impeccably clean rooms, and delicious home-cooked meals. Exceptional service and well-appointed facilities ensure a memorable stay. Highly recommended for travelers seeking comfort and convenience. A gem in hospitality.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.612456', 4, 441, 4),
(2672, '[Yamuna Lokesh] Don''t join guys care taker don''t take care properly their are lots of problems here like mosquitoes, water, hygiene, electricity and electricity switch boards garbage collection care takers are not working properly but owner sends message to pay rent on time  and some problem yah log PCC bol ke paisa leta hai but PCC Karte Nahin Hai Kisi Ka a review ka reply Nahin aaega q Ki ans nhi hai inka 4 PG ka pura a to z report hai mere pass 9 ka food quality hai 9 ka water quality Hai PG proper maintain kar sakta hai', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.612671', 1, 441, 4),
(2673, '[Pooja Kavitkar] One of the best PG in wakad I have experienced.  Purely an homely experience with always up to date facilities. All staff and team are very helpful and kind in nature', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.62708', 5, 442, 4),
(2674, '[Jaya Sahay] Best PG in this area. Nice and clean place to stay. Located at prime location.. Good security and nice facility.. Owner  and staff  are very good and helpful.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.627351', 5, 442, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2675, '[Shalaka Patel] Best PG in wakad, with all the facilities, very hygienic, security, locality, everything is nearby. Star bazar, Croma, good connectivity.  It is the best pg i have stayed in so far. Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.627476', 5, 442, 4),
(2676, '[shailu thorat] Best place to say. Electricity, water supply,  purifier everything is good. 24*7 security.  Best place for girls.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.627604', 5, 442, 4),
(2677, '[Priyanka Rai] Pg is clean and maintained. Owner is very helpful. I had a good stay here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.627724', 5, 442, 4),
(2678, U&'[Aarti Verma] This PG is really good in terms of cleanliness, comfort, and overall management. The rooms are well maintained and the environment is calm and pleasant. If I come back here again, I\2019ll stay here for sure without a second thought.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.627844', 5, 442, 4),
(2679, U&'[nidhi bisen] I have spent almost 3 yrs in this pg, It has been great experience living here. It has security and cctv cameras. The area is safe for girls. You can get daily groceries and stuff nearby.nMy roommates became my best friends\263a\fe0f. PG owner is very humble and supportive. I''ll always miss this place \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.628102', 5, 442, 4),
(2680, U&'[Pranjali Mehetre] Mauli girls PG is very good in Wakad u0026 pg is safe and clean all facilities and management are best.nNice PG\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.628343', 5, 442, 4),
(2681, U&'[Ajay Choundkar] \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50 5/5 \2013 Excellent Boys PG near Wakad Police StationnI had a very good experience staying at this boys PG near Wakad Police Station. The location is extremely convenient with easy access to public transport, markets, medical stores, and daily essentials, which makes day-to-day life very easy.nThe rooms are clean, spacious, and well maintained. Housekeeping is done regularly, so the PG always feels neat and hygienic. The washrooms and common areas are also kept clean, which is really appreciated.nThe food quality is very good \2014 fresh, tasty, and prepared in a hygienic way. It feels like proper home-style food and is much better than typical hostel food. The menu is decent and filling, especially for students and working professionals.nThe management and staff are very polite, supportive, and quick to respond if there is any issue. They genuinely care about the residents\2019 comfort and are always ready to help.nThe environment is peaceful and friendly, and security is good, making it a safe and comfortable place to stay. Overall, this PG provides excellent facilities, a great location, good food, and a very positive living experience.nI would definitely recommend this boys PG to anyone looking for a clean, safe, and comfortable stay near Wakad. Totally worth it!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.639049', 5, 443, 4),
(2682, U&'[Megha Sahu] Good cleanliness u0026 maintenance compared to average Pune PGsnFully furnished rooms (bed, wardrobe, sometimes AC)nBetter locality (Wakad / IT area) \2013 useful if you work in HinjewadinSecurity u0026 basic safety availablenMany users mention it feels more like a co-living space than cheap PGnIt feels like home', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.639212', 5, 443, 4),
(2683, '[Prathmesh Bhosale] Had a very pleasant stay here. The hostel is neat, well-organized, and regularly cleaned. Basic facilities like water, electricity, and Wi-Fi are reliable. The atmosphere feels friendly and homely. Security is good, and the location is convenient. Definitely a good choice for anyone looking for a comfortable PG stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.639527', 5, 443, 4),
(2684, '[smita d] I highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a well-maintained and caring environment. It has truly been a pleasant and worry-free stay for me. and I must say it''s been a wonderful experience. The facilities provided are excellent. The PG offers essential amenities like a refrigerator, water filter, comfortable bed, table, chair, and a gas making it very convenient for daily living.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.639691', 5, 443, 4);     
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2685, '[Sama] The PG owner is highly supportive and professional in his approach. He treats all residents with care and respect, like a responsible brother, ensuring a safe and positive living environment. His prompt response to issues and understanding nature make the PG a reliable and comfortable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.63982', 5, 443, 4),
(2686, '[Atharva Mahajan] A very nice PG hostel with a calm and positive environment. Rooms are comfortable and properly ventilated. Cleanliness is maintained daily, The management is supportive and responds quickly to any issues. Felt safe and comfortable throughout my stay. Would definitely recommend it to others.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.640054', 5, 443, 4),
(2687, U&'[Yash Suryarao] My experience at Darsh Boys PG has been wonderful. The rooms are always neat and properly maintained, and the atmosphere here is calm and welcoming. The owner is cooperative and quick to respond to any concerns. It\2019s a great place for students or professionals who want a comfortable and safe place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.640266', 5, 443, 4),
(2688, '[pooja pawar] I stayed in this PG for 2 years and overall, it was a good experience. The place was safe and well-maintained. The owner was cooperative and responsive to issues. The rooms were clean and spacious enough for one person.Basic amenities like Wi-Fi, hot water were provided regularly. I felt comfortable and secure here throughout my stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.640489', 5, 443, 4),
(2689, '[Asif Sayyad] I stayed at Alankapuri PG, Wakad for around 1.5 years, and my overall experience was excellent. The rooms were clean and well-maintained, the environment was peaceful, and the staff was friendly and helpful. The location is very convenient, making it easy to commute to offices and other nearby places. I would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for comfortable accommodation in Wakad.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.652648', 5, 444, 4),
(2690, U&'[Vishwajit Jahagirdar] Best PG for Boys In Wakad\+01f44c\+01f3fb\+01f44c\+01f3fb\+01f44c\+01f3fbnn1) I stayed here 8 Months, Nor a single issue faced, Neither any other inconvenience in 8 months. All amenities in working condition.nn2) The Phadtare Kaka(Owner) here, is very understanding man u0026 always ready to help. Solves any issue within a day and adjusts small things if needed...very understanding.nn3) Prime area, Everything available next to PG, Best Connectivity to Whole Pune.nnLoved Staying here \2764\fe0f\+01f44d\+01f3fb\+01f607', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.652942', 5, 444, 4),
(2691, U&'[Rushikesh Jadhav] I had a good experience staying at this PG in Wakad. The location is very convenient, with easy access to shops, transport, and daily essentials. The rooms are comfortable and well-ventilated. The Owner is friendly and supportive. Overall, it\2019s a nice and reliable place for students or working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.653107', 5, 444, 4),
(2692, '[Vijay Chavda] Best PG in Kaveri nagar in wakad, Nature of owner is Good,They are cooperative and rectify  your problem immediately .Cleanliness is best in this PG.Also your two wheeler park under shadow. Close to market and calm area .Best for student as well as other who are on job.Both veg and nonverbal food station is near the PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.653395', 5, 444, 4),
(2693, '[Nikhil khot] Excellent PG with all required facilities. Clean rooms, good quality, peaceful environment and very supportive management. Best place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.653657', 5, 444, 4),
(2694, U&'[Kartik Khotele] It is very good PG. Owner uncle is very helpful and well mannered. Ammenities are great. Overall a very good experience living in this PG without a single problem. One of the best PG of pune \+01f4af.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.654033', 5, 444, 4),
(2695, '[Vinay Mangla] The PG is wonderful, all facilities like water supply and electricity are available with the addition of wifi and the owner is very caring and responsive.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.654301', 5, 444, 4);             
