(2698, '[Kiran Phadatare] Decent unisex PG. No food, but other facilities are quite ok. Free electricity, washing machines, wifi, cooking gas, regular cleaning. Biometric entry, cctv surveillance.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.666394', 4, 445, 4),
