(2700, '[Arun Yadav] It is good... pg owner is very polite...nI am here from last 1 and half year, I don''t have any problem...', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.666661', 5, 445, 4),
(2701, '[pranita talekar] Very unhygienic place, there are lot ofncockroaches and bed bug.nPG owner is not interested in taking any responsibility', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.666839', 1, 445, 4),
(2702, '[neha khanzode] Really nice experiencenOne could manage to survive with all the facilities:nWifinGasnRefrigeratornWashingmachinenTv', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.666965', 5, 445, 4),
(2703, '[Prolay Ghosh] Security system is good but deduct unusual amount of deposit while leaving the pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.667262', 3, 445, 4),
(2704, '[renu sharma] Awesome service...Lived here for 4 months but so live and good environment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.667516', 5, 445, 4),
(2705, '[Prateek Yadav] Its an amazing pg .. the owner is soo good that u cant even imagine .. in platinum you will feel like you are in own flat because there is no restrictions every thing is so perfect in here .. and wakad is a very good area so go for it', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.679275', 4, 446, 4),
(2706, '[Harshal Yeole] Good PG. Ok ok food. Better management and yes poker friendly in area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.679417', 4, 446, 4),
(2707, U&'[Mayank Madhav] That''s how we get Acquaguard filtered water in Zolo. \+01f60b . Take water from tank which is filled by the corporation water truck. Put into drinking containers and dump into Acquaguard output Chambers. Problem solved. There''s no drinking water shortage.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.679546', 1, 446, 4),
(2708, '[Rider 57 Pune] Flat And Of Available fully furnished boy And girls', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.679743', 4, 446, 4),
(2709, '[Nilesh Phadtare] One of the best PG in Wakad. I stayed there for 18 months and liked their service. Care taker was good. Other facilities were good. Internet was slow but good enough to watch video on youtube. I was staying there in 2 sharing rooms ( Master bed with 2 occupants ) . Crowd was good and most of them were corporate entities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.679871', 4, 446, 4),
(2710, '[Rakesh Kumar] Good to stay here, Now this PG is managed by Zolo.nRent would be Rs 5500 for three sharing, including food, and Rs 6500 for double sharing including food. Food quality is good . You will have two times of food in week days and three time for Saturday and Sunday.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.679996', 4, 446, 4),
(2711, '[Adnan Ansari] Stayed here for 15 days and had a pretty good experience.nnThe rooms are spacious and well maintained. Unlike most PG''s which have steel beds and cupboards, the beds and wardrobes here are wooden.nThere''s Wi-Fi, a TV in every room, common washing machines (on the ground floor) and refrigerators (on every floor). The washroom was decent too.nnThere''s no food available here but since it''s located right on the Datta Mandir Road there are plenty of eateries nearby for all budgets.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.680126', 4, 446, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2712, '[Anshuman Sahu] Good place to stay at reasonable price.nThe place is in between market and hospitals.nnCons:n-u003eDrinking water not available (you have to buy it from local shop)n-u003eYou will find Cockroaches in wardrobe and drawers.nnPros:n-u003eEvery week washroom will be cleaned by house keeping.n-u003eEarlier this was a hotel so bed''s are good.n-u003eFree wifi with average speed ( most of us are using jio and jio network is good, in pune most of the places you will struggle to get Jio network)n-u003eThere are many affordable restaurants nearby.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.680246', 4, 446, 4),
(2713, U&'[Abid Dasurkar] C Building \2013 Room 101 Feedbacknn\2022 Water is readily available.n\2022 RO-purified drinking water is provided.n\2022 A geyser is available.n\2022 Washing machine is available.n\2022 Wi-Fi is available.n\2022 A masjid is nearby.n\2022 Located in a prime location.n\2022 All essential facilities and shops are nearby.n\2022 Travel time to Phase 3 is approximately 35\201345 minutes, depending on traffic.n\2022 Bike parking is available.nnPlease Note:n\2022 Lift facility is not available.n\2022 Food is not provided, but you can join a tiffin service.n\2022 Tiffin charges are approximately \20b990\2013\20b9100 per meal.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.690881', 5, 447, 4),
(2714, '[azhar khan] Aslam Alikm,nIs there any bed available?nActually I am looking a place near mosque. Please let me know', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.691118', 5, 447, 4),
(2715, '[Shahid Akhtar] The place is quiet and clean. Affordable rent for job seeking person and college going person', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.691273', 5, 447, 4),
(2716, '[Ammar Mirkar] Best PG, Budget rate for each room, good and hardworking room mates and its near to Highway which gives great benefit for mumbai people to travel back home..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.691402', 5, 447, 4),
(2717, '[Mohammad Asim] Good PG near Mosque and Amenities are also good. Owners are also cooperative and support the tenets.nPlease note food is not included you have to arrange for it', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.691524', 5, 447, 4),
(2718, '[Asif Maner] Awesome place to stay near wakad area.nEverything you need is at walking distance like food, grocery, veggies, masjid, bus stop etc.  Service is very good and fast. Owner is so humble.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.691927', 4, 447, 4),
(2719, '[Anisa Sutar] Good PG to stay in wakad area there is always cleaness surrounding decent locality owners are also co operative and supportive all facilities are available 24*7 water availability', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.69205', 5, 447, 4),
(2720, '[siddik sayyad] I m living here since last 2 yearsnThis is the cleanest pg in the Wakad area everything is too good here the atmosphere and oh is too silentnWater is 24*7 no issuenI will recommend everyone to once visit this place and then take the decisionnAnd this is prime locationnTiffin service is also too good in pocket friendly rates', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.692178', 5, 447, 4),
(2721, '[Sachin Agre] Rooms are ok .. don''t expect so much . As i can say itane paiso mai itna hi milega... Still they can improve somewhere.. 1st apol no one service boy or care taker available all the time at PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.707179', 3, 448, 4),
(2722, '[Deepak Metkari] Zolo PG is a scam..We had the worst experience with these guys.. The pic shared with us and actuals are much different. The apartment was in a pathetic state .. And when we called all they did was just apologised. They were asking us to pay upfront. Luckily we didnt. Pls dont get fooled by the pics and the positive reviews . These guys are horrible', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.707412', 1, 448, 4),
(2723, '[naveen naveen] I went to hometown for a few days and this is the situation of the room. Door was broke and opened along with the cupboard and left it like that for 10days. No intimation and repair was initiated regarding this. I left my laptop in the room. Thank god, my roomate kept if safe.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.707543', 1, 448, 4);           
