(2726, '[Rajyavardhan Choudhury] It is situated at a very good metropolitan spot, with Zudio, Star Bazaar and Croma nearby, any sort of issue or problem, A shop for your requirements is also nearby. Room could have been better but service is outstanding. No power backup available.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.707966', 4, 448, 4),
(2727, '[Aditya Singh] So bad experience, the photos is shown is exactly the opposite of what the have. The lift they use is so pathetic. I have got stuck 2 times in the lift and there are more of bed bugs. They don''t give the service of amount which they take. I prefer you to take some other pg for stay but never, not zolo legacy and they increase rent as they want, in 2-3 months they increase rent. Water canes are not washed.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.708093', 1, 448, 4),
(2728, '[Dhruv Gada] Please visit than take decision. No proper lights on room and floor. The PG was unhygienic. They are not cleaning properly.nRooms were not cleaned. Mess was far from PG. No proper maintenance as per cost. The washing machines and lift were not on working condition. And area near to washing machine was not properly cleaned.nPlease visit than decide.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.708543', 1, 448, 4),
(2729, '[Chand Pasha] I am living in Krushnakunj PG wakad from some months. I really like atmosphere and nature. All facilities are very nice. All my roommates are very impress on owner behaviour.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.722494', 5, 449, 4),
(2730, '[Pravin sutar] I am living in Krushnakunj PG from last 6 months and I will be here for next 4 years because I am very to here. Owner is very helpfull and polite. Room ventilation is perfect and fresh air. Daily housekeeping to clean washroom and floor.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.722737', 5, 449, 4),
(2731, '[Vedant Padole] One of the best PG that I have been seen ever in my life. Not because the building and facility of the PG due to Owner behavior. He is the humblest and gentleman person and great human being who solved any problem at any time in just one call and respond quickly. He makes the PG like home environment; you forget that you live in PG and feel that like a home. Do not choose the PG on the basis on amenities and choose PG on the basis on PG owner behavior because owner play most vital role in PG and everything is secondary. I have lived in PG from last 4 month. Please try the PG who learner and professional. If anyone have admission in Ethan coaching classes then KrushaKunj PG is best choice for you because it is very near from Ethan coaching classes and you get buses from here to any part of Pune and food messes. PG location is just next to Wakad premium society that is the USB of PG as well as PG owner are the main USB of your PG not amenities because amenities have in every PG that is common.Please try it. Thank you for everything and your kindness Mr. Yogesh Sir', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.723071', 5, 449, 4),
(2732, '[Mhd Shazeb] The PG is well maintained with all necessary facilities like WiFi, cleaning, drinking water, and washing machine. The owner is very polite and humble, and the rent is quite affordable. Safe and comfortable place for students or working professionals. One of the best options in the nearby area at this price.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.723243', 5, 449, 4),
(2733, U&'[Balendra Singh] \274c\274c\274c\274c\274c\274c\274c\274c\274c\274c\274c\274c\+01f514\+01f514I lived this PG in last month around 1 month. Literally it''s  very worst\+01f62b experience of this PG.n1)PG Owner car\+01f697 in parking so no proper space for parking.\+01f3cd\fe0f\+01f6f5n2) No Bathroom\+01f92e cleaning on daily basis.n3) There is no any locker\+01f510 facility for in rooms.n4) No any food\+01f958 facility and no any food near PG.n5) Owners behaviour is very bad he always come to every room and close all lights and fan no any reason.\+01f937n6) In front of room there is Family living so no any privacy for bachelor people.\+01f611n7) Owner charges 5000/ months + non refundable 2000 deposit for this worst PG.\+01f971n8) There is Old washing machine for Cloth cleaning. So you have patience to stand there for atleast 1 or 2 hours for machine use.nn\2622\fe0f\+01f6d1\+01f6d1\+01f6d1\+01f6d1\+01f6d1Note :- This all above good reviews are paid review and no one is real. This all write by owner himself.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.723377', 1, 449, 4);         
