(2734, '[Asha Thorat] I am living in krushnakunj PG at wakad. It''s very nice and rooms are very clean. Owner is very polite and helpfull.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.723509', 5, 449, 4),
(2735, '[Yadnya Learning] Krushnakunj PG is only as good as the caretaker of the pg. Owner is very humble and polite. Location is perfect in middle of PCMC area. Connect to all location to move quick.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.723639', 5, 449, 4),
(2736, '[GMC RAJ Palace] Krushnakunj PG is best option to stay in PCMC area to students and working professional. I have best experience in Krushnakunj. Cleaning is proper and maintained as quality. Owner is very polite to communication.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.723767', 5, 449, 4),
(2737, '[Parikshit Nagpure] Review 2 -nToday 14th May 26'', they''ve crossed all the limits. No food available for the third consecutive time during dinner. No one cares to arrange it. I''ve been asked to adjust for today. I''m given justifications that''s due to less number of residents we''re not able to arrange adequate food.nThey will keep you hungry. To all looking forward to taking an accomodation here please don''t! Don''t waste your parents''/your own hard earned money for them.nnReview 1-nThe quantity of food provided is not adequate for each person.nnThere are insufficient utensils available for people to eat properly, eg. No spoons available.nnElectricity charges are extremely high and seem unreasonable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.736726', 1, 450, 4),
(2738, '[Mithun Kumar] Great place to stay with a comfortable environment and good facilities. The management is helpful, and the overall resident experience has been very positive.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.736867', 5, 450, 4),
(2739, '[Yuvaansh rahul Kudal] Everything runs smoothly with good coordination from the team. The team checks on things regularly to keep it hassle-free. Shakti Sudhakar Pujari follows up proactively and ensures resident comfort stays a priority.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.736991', 5, 450, 4),
(2740, '[paras badhe] My experience at Stanza Living Schengen House, Wakad was extremely disappointing. The reality was very different from what was promised during admission. The rooms and common areas were often not maintained properly, housekeeping was inconsistent, and response times for complaints were frustratingly slow.nnThe food quality was below expectations and lacked variety. Basic issues that affected daily living took a long time to get resolved. For the amount being charged, the overall service and facilities did not justify the cost.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.73728', 1, 450, 4),
(2741, '[Praful Wagh] Had a nice experience staying at Schengen house. But which ticket are raised to solve early', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.737495', 2, 450, 4),
(2742, U&'[Samarth Dongale] Worst PG, don''t dare to come here it''s a warning \+01f64f\+01f3fb\+01f621nElectricity charges crossing 1200 monthlynFood quality below averagenWifi disconnected frequently', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.737736', 1, 450, 4),
(2743, '[Aditya Shirodkar] Stanza Living Schengen House Boys Hostel is known for offering co-living spaces to students and young professionals in various cities. Here''s a detailed review of the hostel based on factors like amenities, services, cleanliness, community, and overall experience:nn1. Location: Schengen House Boys Hostel is ideally located in a convenient area close to educational institutions such as Sri Balaji University(MBA college),Indira College, public transportation, and daily necessities. The accessibility and proximity to essentials are usually highly appreciated by the residents.nn2. Amenities: The hostel typically offers a range of amenities to ensure a comfortable living experience. This includes fully furnished rooms, air conditioning, high-speed Wi-Fi, laundry facilities, common areas for relaxation and study, and well-equipped kitchens.nn3. Services: The quality of services provided by the hostel staff plays a significant role in the overall experience. Positive reviews often mention the friendly and helpful staff members who are responsive to residents'' needs and quick to address any issues.nn4. Cleanliness: Maintaining cleanliness and hygiene is crucial in shared living spaces. Generally, Schengen House Boys Hostel aims to keep its premises clean and tidy. Regular cleaning of common areas and bathrooms is expected.nn5. Community and Social Activities: A standout aspect of many Stanza Living hostels is the strong sense of community they foster. Regular social activities, events, and interactions with fellow residents help create a friendly and inclusive atmosphere.nn6. Safety and Security: Residents'' safety and security are of utmost importance, and the hostel typically implements various measures to ensure a secure living environment.nn7. Pricing: The pricing of the accommodation should be reasonable and in line with the offered amenities and services. Some residents may find the cost a bit higher compared to other options, but the added value of a strong community and quality services may justify the price for many.nnOverall, Stanza Living Schengen House Boys Hostel is generally perceived positively by its residents for its amenities, services, and community-building efforts. However, individual experiences can vary, and it''s essential to research recent reviews and reach out to current residents for up-to-date feedback before making a decision.nnAlways visit the hostel in person or through virtual tours, if available, to get a firsthand look at the facilities and gauge if it aligns with your preferences and requirements.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.738037', 5, 450, 4);            
