(2753, U&'[Shubham Mapara] I am having great experience here. The rooms are nice and clean, and hygiene is very well maintained throughout the PG.nnThey also provide high-speed Wi-Fi, an induction stove, a washing machine, and an iron.nDedicated two-wheeler parking available.n\200bnThanks to Mr. Bhushan (coordinator) and Anil Dada (caretaker) for helping whenever needed.nn\200bOverall, it\2019s a fantastic place to stay with all the essential facilities at an affordable price. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.787169', 5, 453, 4),
(2754, U&'[Akash Raut] I am currently staying at My Hostel Room, and my experience has been truly amazing. The management is very supportive, friendly, and always ready to help whenever needed. The staff maintains a professional and polite attitude towards all residents. The rooms are neat, clean, and well maintained. Regular housekeeping ensures proper hygiene and comfort. The food quality is also very good fresh, tasty, and served on time. They really take care of residents\2019 preferences and health. Security and safety arrangements are well managed, which gives peace of mind. The overall environment is calm, comfortable, and perfect for students and working professionals.I highly recommend My Hostel Room to anyone looking for a safe, clean, and comfortable place to stay. Truly satisfied with the service and hospitality.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.78739', 5, 453, 4),
(2755, U&'[Ram Gaikwad] I had a good stay at MyHotelRoomOG \2013 Taurus. The room is comfortable and well maintained. The property also has a nice common area which is useful for relaxing or working. Amenities provided are good and meet daily needs. The caretaker is very helpful and a genuinely nice person, always available when needed. Overall, a pleasant and convenient place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.787518', 5, 453, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2756, U&'[Dr.Saurabh Patil] I\2019ve had a great experience here. The rooms are nice and clean, and hygiene is very well maintained throughout the property.n\200bn\200bTop-notch Amenities: Great common area with a TV, fridge, games, and mineral water. They also provide high-speed Wi-Fi, an induction stove, a washing machine, and an iron.nDedicated two-wheeler parking available.n\200bnBig shoutout to Mr. Bhushan (coordinator) for his kind and supportive nature and Anil Dada (caretaker) for being so helpful.nn\200bOverall, it\2019s a fantastic place to stay with all the essential facilities at an affordable price. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.787643', 5, 453, 4),
(2757, U&'[Ashutosh Sawai Patil] \201cMyHostelRoom Tourus PG is a great place to stay! The rooms are clean and well-maintained, with all the necessary facilities. The staff is friendly and helpful, and the environment feels safe and comfortable. Highly recommended for students and working professionals!\201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.787761', 5, 453, 4),
(2758, '[tejas dhamane] Best PG! The cleaning is very good and everything is well maintained. The staff and owner are very polite and supportive. I am staying in My Hostel Room Taurus and my experience is very comfortable. I highly recommend this PG for a peaceful and clean stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.78788', 5, 453, 4),
(2759, U&'[Akshay Yeole] \201cI had an absolutely wonderful stay at My Hostel Room \2013 Taurus! The rooms are clean, spacious, and beautifully maintained, with plenty of natural light and ventilation that makes the space feel fresh and comfortable. The hygiene standards are excellent, and everything is well organized.nnOne of the biggest highlights is the amazing amenities \2014 high-speed WiFi, TV, washing machine, refrigerator, and comfortable sofas in the common areas. The lawns provide a peaceful and relaxing vibe after a long day, and the indoor games are a great addition for unwinding and socializing with fellow residents.nnThe staff is incredibly friendly, supportive, and always ready to help. The food is hygienic and tasty, and the overall environment feels safe, welcoming, and homely. It\2019s truly a budget-friendly place that doesn\2019t compromise on quality.nnI highly recommend My Hostel Room \2013 Taurus to students and working professionals looking for a comfortable, well-equipped, and hassle-free stay in Wakad, Pune!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.787999', 5, 453, 4),
(2760, U&'[Pratik Mansukh] I had a really pleasant experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and spacious compared to many other options in the city. Basic amenities like Wi-Fi, washing machine, and regular cleaning are provided, which makes daily life comfortable. The location is convenient, with easy access to markets, public transport, and essentials. The management is cooperative and responsive \2014 any small issue gets resolved quickly. Security measures like CCTV and gated entry give peace of mind, especially for students and working professionals.nnOverall, it\2019s a safe, budget-friendly, and comfortable place to stay in Pune. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a hassle-free PG accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.788122', 5, 453, 4),
(2761, U&'[Vaishnavi Naik] Your Space PG is completely unprofessional and misleading. They broke the contract themselves by asking us to leave as they wanted to tie up with another college. They promised to refund the deposit without a 3-month wait, but till now they have not returned the money. I am not the only one \2014 many girls have still not received their deposits. Their team avoids calls, blocks communication, and gives false assurances. This is nothing but making students fool and exploiting them. Such irresponsible and unethical behavior shows they cannot be trusted. I strongly warn others not to choose this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.804142', 1, 454, 4),
(2762, '[Pragya Jyotsna] Fraud alert! Worst pg experience. It''s been more than 9 months and still I haven''t got my security deposit back. Whenever I ask them, they tell me that I broke my contract of 11 months which I wasn''t! They have so many excuses to not give your money back. Even the team works there is not at all polite. Food as expected worst! Please do not choose your space. Not at all recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:15.804289', 1, 454, 4);         
