(2800, U&'[Niket Ranjan] I spent 8 months at this PG in Sainath Nagar, Kharadi, and here''s my honest review. When I first moved to Pune, I found this PG, and it turned out to be a great choice. If you''re working in Viman Nagar, World Trade Center, EON IT Park, or Magarpatta, this PG is in a prime location. The rent is budget-friendly compared to other PGs in the area, with options for 2-sharing, 3-sharing, and single-sharing rooms.nnThe PG is also flexible if you need a short stay\2014whether it''s for just 1-2 days or a month, they provide excellent facilities. The place is kept very clean, and the food is prepared on the terrace, which ensures fresh and hygienic meals. The deposit process is straightforward, and they refund it promptly when you leave. Transportation is convenient with buses and autos easily accessible nearby.nnThe food quality is better than many other PGs, and there''s flexibility with meal timings, which is ideal if you work night shifts. The owner is polite and always ready to help, which made my stay comfortable. While some of my friends had different experiences in other PGs, mine was definitely positive. Highly recommended if you''re looking for affordable, clean, and convenient accommodation in Pune City.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.13838', 5, 460, 4),
(2801, '[Siya maraskole] Great and very good Pg for honey new luxury pgnFilling this very very lovely and nice place fornSainath nagar pune Maharashtra', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.138681', 5, 460, 4),
