(2820, '[Nikhil Tembulkar] I stayed here for couple of months. Very nice and decent area to stay. 24/7 alert security, Daily cleaning of rooms, Hot water facility, WiFi facility is available. Owner is supportive and friendly. Non veg and Alcohol consumption, smoking is strictly prohibited inside the rooms as well as in society premises. Owner''s family is religious. Highly recommended for stay especially students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.242655', 5, 464, 4),
(2821, U&'[Gaurang W] Good pg option in Pune.nI stayed here for a month and had a good experience.nThe PG is located inside society hence there is security guard round the clock.nFacilities available :n\2022 24/7 hot water, drinking water(normal,hot,cold)n\2022 Daily room cleaningn\2022 WiFin\2022 nearby bus stop u003c 500mn\2022 many mess, breakfast options available nearbynOwner is supportive u0026 friendly.nPersonally, I haven''t encountered any challenges regarding deposit refunds with the owner, contrary to concerns raised in certain reviews.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.242843', 4, 464, 4),
(2822, '[amol dhotre] Good place to live for Bachelors, secure and nice society. Owner is very supportive, also enquiry about any issue facing so that he can resolve. Nearby food street and bus stop.Recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.242987', 5, 464, 4),
(2823, '[Tushar Buchade] PG is located near to the bus stop so good access for traveling. Nice atmosphere and aesthetics surrounding of PG. Best service of water, room cleaning, AC room in affordable rent. Owner is genuine person and give all the support for students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.243127', 5, 464, 4);        
