(2824, '[Mohammed Noman Baig] My experience at this Boys PG hostel in Pune has been truly wonderful. The rooms are spacious, well-maintained, and provide all the comforts needed for a peaceful stay. The common areas are clean and the overall ambiance is friendly and relaxed. The staff is extremely helpful and attentive, making sure everything runs smoothly. The location is very convenient, with easy access to public transport and nearby amenities. The reliable Wi-Fi connection and secure environment make it an ideal choice. Highly recommend this PG for anyone seeking a comfortable and hassle-free stay in Pune!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.263605', 5, 465, 4),
