(2832, U&'[Ganeshh Gadgil] I had a really great experience staying at this PG. The owner is extremely kind, polite, makes the place feel like home. The PG is lavish, fully furnished, and very well maintained with all the necessary amenities. Rooms are clean, comfortable, and thoughtfully designed. Overall, it\2019s a perfect place for a peaceful and comfortable stay. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.281571', 5, 466, 4),
(2833, U&'[Bhawana nikam] The rooms are clean, well maintained, and well ventilated, ensuring a bright and comfortable living environment. The location is convenient, with close proximity to Magarpatta\2019s work hubs, public transport, and local markets. The accommodation offers budget-friendly options without compromising on essential amenities. The staff ( owner ) is friendly, cooperative, and supportive, contributing to a pleasant stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.281716', 5, 466, 4),
(2834, '[Jyotirekha Pradhan] We having a great experience that we  visited pune for 3 days. We stayed in this pg. It''s very affordable price we got in Pune. Really the pg owner (Mr.martin shaik) was very good by heart. Madam also very good. They were behave like own family members. Neat and clean room.. They have provided all the facility there. Highly I will recommend this pg. I hope we will visit again.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.28225', 5, 466, 4),
