(2840, '[Akanksha Ghogare] I had a wonderful experience staying at Thopate Girls PG, Yogeshwar Apartment, Shivajinagar Gavthan. The PG is clean, well-maintained, safe, and provides a comfortable environment for both students and working professionals. The rooms are neat, the facilities are well managed, and the location is very convenient with easy access to public transport, colleges, offices, and essential stores.The facilities provided are excellent, including high-speed Wi-Fi, induction  facilities, hot water with a geyser,  and a secure living environment. These amenities make day-to-day living comfortable and convenient.nnA special thanks to Poonam Ma''am, whose dedication and supportive nature truly make this place feel like home. She is approachable, kind, and always available to help whenever needed. She manages the PG with great professionalism, ensures that residents are comfortable, and responds promptly to any concerns. Her caring attitude, attention to cleanliness, and commitment to maintaining a safe and positive environment are highly appreciated.nnI genuinely appreciate the effort Poonam Ma''am puts into making every resident feel welcome and comfortable. I highly recommend Thopate Girls PG to anyone looking for a secure, clean, and well-managed accommodation in Shivajinagar.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.300047', 5, 467, 4),
(2841, '[Vijay Londhe] I have been staying at Thopte PG for almost a year, and my experience has been very positive. The rooms are clean, spacious, and regularly maintained. The management is cooperative and responds quickly to any issues. The environment is peaceful and suitable for both students and working professionals. The location is convenient, with grocery stores, restaurants, and public transport within walking distance. Overall, it has been a comfortable and hassle-free place to stay, and I would definitely recommend Thopte PG to anyone looking for good accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.300186', 5, 467, 4),
(2842, '[shivani Karale] The hostel provides decent facilities and a comfortable stay. The rooms are satisfactory, and cleanliness is maintained most of the time. The staff is cooperative and helpful when needed. The location is convenient, with easy access to daily necessities. There is some scope for improvement in maintenance and amenities, but overall it offers good value for money and is a suitable option for students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.300575', 4, 467, 4),
(2843, '[Prajakta Bagade] I had a great experience staying at this PG. The rooms were clean, comfortable, and well-maintained. All basic facilities like WiFi, water, and electricity were reliable. The location is very convenient, with shops and transport nearby, making daily life easy. Overall, a good place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.300697', 5, 467, 4),
(2844, U&'[R\1d1cs\029c\026a\1d0b\1d07s\029c N\1d00\1d20\1d00\029f\1d07] I recently stayed at this PG and overall had a decent experience. The rooms were clean and well-maintained, and the basic facilities like WiFi, water, and electricity were reliable. The location is convenient with shops and transport nearby, which makes daily life easier.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.300818', 5, 467, 4),
(2845, U&'[Kalyani Surwase] Calling my review ''fake'' does not change what I experienced. My review was never about cleanliness disputes\2014it was about how I was treated and the overall environment I experienced during my stay. Instead of addressing my concerns respectfully, the response focuses on personal allegations against me. Future residents can make their own judgment based on this, but I have shared my experience honestly and truthfully.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.300937', 1, 467, 4),
(2846, '[Ajit] After visiting their office nobody was there when I call them, man from other side said to Wait, and then after a girl came and showed me the pg first one was 5 sharing, it didn''t even have proper cleaning which was 3800/- a month second one was 3 sharing it was about 4300/-  and third one was 2 sharing it has rent 7000/- month , none of the rooms have safety locker', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.301054', 1, 467, 4); 
