(2864, '[Bharat Hadshi] What I liked most about this PG House was it''s location...it''s very well connected to the city.. bus stop, railway station and metro station all within walking distance. I stayed here for 14months...!!!nStaff is also very supportive...!!!nOverall experience is very good...!!!nSpecial thanks to Mr. Sohail and Mr. Kamlesh for their extensive support...!!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.365311', 5, 471, 4),
(2865, '[Gouri Shirwadkar] The pg is fairly spacious compared to other places around. The right type of crowd in the pg makes up the entire experience although. The guardians are somewhat prompt at solving issues in cases that they can''t they inform about the reason to do so. A househelp is provided which makes lives easier. Minimal water and electricity issues only in summers.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.365453', 4, 471, 4);  
