(2867, '[Pawan Kumar] I had a good experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean and well-maintained, and all the basic facilities are available properly. The environment is peaceful and suitable for both students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.365714', 4, 471, 4),
(2868, '[Amit B] Best PG for working professionals and it is very well maintained in terms of hygiene and cleanliness and the best part is the strategic location near Pune Railway Station.nnThanks to the whole team for the great support provided during my stay here for 6 months', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.365844', 5, 471, 4),
(2869, '[SOMU S] It''s a good pg. I lived here for 15-20 days on daily basis. Caretakers are good and well behaved. Management is smooth. I''d surely recommend this pg for affordable living.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.366027', 5, 471, 4),
(2870, '[Divya Randive] I stayed here for an year, and was in contact with Sohel for any of my problem, he was always understanding about it. Had a great time and made many memories.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.366149', 4, 471, 4),
(2871, U&'[Samrat Joshi] My stay at PG house.in was excellent \2014 the environment was clean, safe, and comfortable.nThe staff was supportive and always available for help.nFacilities were well-maintained, making it feel like home.nHighly recommend it for anyone seeking a pleasant and hassle-free stay.nnRegardsnSamrat Joshi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.366267', 5, 471, 4),
(2872, U&'[Pratik Deshmukh] \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50nnI''ve had a great experience staying at Satwik Boys PG. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and comfortable. The management is friendly, responsive, and always willing to help with any issues. The food is hygienic and tastes good, and the overall environment is peaceful and ideal for students as well as working professionals.nnThe location is convenient, with easy access to public transport, shops, and daily essentials. Housekeeping is regular, and the facilities are well looked after. Overall, it''s a safe, affordable, and comfortable place to stay. I would definitely recommend Satwik Boys PG to anyone looking for quality accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.383812', 5, 472, 4),
(2873, '[A-35 Vedant Gawande] Great PG with clean rooms and good facilities. The management is helpful, and the location is convenient. Safe and comfortable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.383941', 5, 472, 4),
(2874, '[Faizan sheikh] This is a great PG for boys with a friendly and helpful owner. I stayed here for 9 months, and my experience was very comfortable and positive. I would definitely recommend it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.384049', 5, 472, 4),
(2875, '[Praful Kalpande] Good PG with clean rooms and a friendly environment. The facilities are well maintained and the stay is comfortable. Recommended and most important affordable', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.384216', 5, 472, 4),
(2876, '[kim kima] I highly recommend who ever coming to work or study on this place , the owners are friendly ,polite and kind, room was clean everyday, it is the best choice for everyone', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.384325', 5, 472, 4),
(2877, U&'[Prafull Rastogi] Best pg for boys in gokhle nagar,nClean rooms, with necessary facilitiesnincluding gym \+01f4aa friendly people that live in this pg for a long time because of the trustworthiness of this pg and owner. The best part of this pg in my opinion is the kind behaviour of the pg owner he is very friendly and supportive in all terms.nIf you are looking for pg in gokhle nagar you must visit here once, and i assure you, you will not look for another pg after this.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.384433', 5, 472, 4),
