(2879, '[Affan Mirzaa] Best in town, Didi is too cooperative.nWe stayed there for few days and yes it felt like home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.38512', 5, 472, 4),
(2880, U&'[Naruto Montage] This PG offers a comfortable and convenient living experience. The room is well-furnished with a bed, study table, and almirah, which is ideal for students or working professionals. There''s 24x7 water availability and a water purifier on every floor, ensuring hygiene and ease. One of the standout features is the daily room and bathroom cleaning service, which keeps the place neat and fresh.nnAdditionally, the owner and supervisor are supportive and approachable, making the stay even more hassle-free. Overall, it\2019s a great value for money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.402003', 5, 473, 4),
(2881, '[Samarth Gundap] Yamuna pg is excellent pg there are all facilities it is very clean and  best living area', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.402147', 5, 473, 4),
(2882, '[Devansh Bhageria] Had a great experience. The owner and caretaker are very supportive and all the services are good provided by them.nnCleaning and proper timings of water supply, moreover the kitchen and washing area is so good without any failure.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.402363', 5, 473, 4),
(2883, '[MRIDUL DUTTA] Comfortable and peaceful stay - Highly recommended!!nnI stayed here for nearly 2 months and had a very pleasant experience.nnThis place is quiet, clean and well maintained with daily housekeeping, 24 hours water, reliable Wi-Fi, geyser, automatic washing machines, refrigerator, induction cooktop and Aquaguard drinking water.nnThe management is extremely supportive and responsive and they provide flexible payment options (daily and monthly).nnIdeal for both students and working professionals looking for a peaceful, well managed and maintained PG.nnThe only downside is lack of electricity backup and no lift. However these are minor compared to the overall comfort and experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.402491', 5, 473, 4),
(2884, '[Driptanshu Das] Very cooperative owner and staffs... If anyone looking for hasslefree staying in gokhalenagar...this is the best option', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.402616', 5, 473, 4),
(2885, '[L. Shivam] Good place to stay here in Yamuna PG All the staff members and owner are very kind and all the basic amenities are available', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.402739', 5, 473, 4),
(2886, '[Vedant Deshpande] Staying at this PG has been a great experience! The owner is friendly, responsive, and ensures that all amenities are well-maintained. The rooms are clean, spacious, and the environment feels safe and homely. It''s a perfect place for students and professionals alike. Highly recommend this PG for anyone looking for comfortable and hassle-free living!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.402856', 5, 473, 4),
(2887, '[Kumar Ankit] Undoubtedly one of the cleanest PG anyone would find. All amenities available. Overall good experience during my stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.403084', 5, 473, 4),
(2888, '[Arti Bankar] I had a very bad experience staying at this PG. The food was repeatedly the same and dinner quality was poor. Many times the food was insufficient. Management is very bad and unresponsive. There is no proper ventilation, and 9 girls stay in one flat and there is common toilet and bathroom for those 9 girls. cleanliness is not maintained at all. Overall, I would not recommend this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.419578', 1, 474, 4),
(2889, U&'[Aman Kumar] This place is honestly terrible. People are crammed into small rooms, and the smell is awful most of the time because socks and shoes are left everywhere. One good thing is that the place is cleaned daily, but even after cleaning, the smell from shoes and socks is still very unpleasant.nnThe 1st floor rooms are especially bad. I have heard that the 2nd floor rooms are somewhat better and more decent in comparison. Also, during April and May, the rooms get extremely hot, making it very uncomfortable to stay here. My allocated bed was changed in the middle of my stay \+01f621', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.419713', 1, 474, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2890, '[harish harry] An exceptional PG that blends comfort, cleanliness, and quiet luxury. Beautifully maintained, well-managed, and thoughtfully designed for peaceful living. Truly a five-star experience in everyday accommodation', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.419838', 5, 474, 4),
(2891, '[Sanjana Phad] I had a very good experience staying at this boys PG. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and comfortable. The environment is peaceful and safe, which makes it easy to focus on work or studies.nThe owner and staff are supportive, polite, and always ready to help whenever needed. Regular cleaning is done, and basic facilities like water, electricity, and Wi-Fi work properly.nThe location is also convenient with easy access to public transport, shops, and daily necessities. Overall, this PG offers great value for money and a homely atmosphere. I would definitely recommend it to students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.419957', 5, 474, 4),
(2892, U&'[rohan bhosale] I\2019ve had a great experience staying at PG in Banner. The place is clean and comfortable, the food is tasty and hygienic, and the owner is very supportive. Safety is good and the Wi-Fi works well.nnI would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a clean, safe, and friendly place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.420077', 5, 474, 4),
(2893, '[damini date] I had a pleasant stay at this PG. The rooms are clean and well-maintained, and the food is hygienic and tasty. The owner and staff are very supportive and friendly. The location is convenient and safe. Overall, a comfortable place to stay and value for money', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.420196', 5, 474, 4),
(2894, '[Omkar Agale] One of the best pg in baner .   Comfortable  , Connectivity , and main thing affordablenThe pg owner is also polite and helpful.nPg are always clean .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.420315', 5, 474, 4),
(2895, '[Hartik_ 08] Pg was too safe . The environment was too good and cleanliness maintained. Must go for it. Experience was recommendable..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.420429', 5, 474, 4),
(2896, '[Deepsikha Chakraborty] Secure, comfortable u0026 well-maintained. Has good commute connectivity , grocery u0026 market is just at hand''s distance. The owner is extremely approachable. Would definitely recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.440559', 5, 475, 4),
(2897, '[Neha] Was studying in symbiosis and chose this pg as it is close to college. I''ve lived here for 2 years and had a good experience. The facilities are satisfactory and the owner is accomodating as well. Overall I had a good experience here', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.440767', 5, 475, 4),
(2898, U&'[dnyaneshwari Wandekar] Sky Blue PG is a really good and safe place for girls. It is very clean and well-maintained. I stayed here for almost 3 years, and my experience was excellent throughout.nnThe rooms and common areas are always kept clean, and the overall environment is comfortable and peaceful. The location is also a big plus it is very close to Pavilion Mall and JW, which makes daily travel and outings convenient.nIf any girl is looking for a clean, secure, and well located PG, Sky Blue PG is definitely one of the best options\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.440887', 5, 475, 4),
(2899, '[Shraddha Mane] I had a great experience staying at this PG. It''s clean, safe, and well-maintained perfect for girls looking for a comfortable and homely place. All essential facilities are available, including a washing machine, geyser, fridge, and kitchen, which made daily life very convenient. The environment is friendly and secure, and the management is responsive and helpful.nI highly recommend this PG to other girls looking for a peaceful and fully-equipped place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.441002', 5, 475, 4),
(2900, '[Sundar] We had a wonderful stay at this PG! The owner is extremely kind, helpful, and service-minded. Highly recommended for a safe and homely experience!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.441122', 5, 475, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2901, U&'[preeti bahare] I stayed at Sky Blue PG for almost 2.5 years, and I can confidently say it\2019s one of the best PGs for girls near Symbiosis. The facilities are very good and well-maintained.nCompared to other PGs in the area, Sky Blue PG is affordable, safe, and more comfortable. The rooms are clean, the environment is friendly, and the management is cooperative. It truly feels like a second home.nHighly recommended for girls looking for peaceful, safe, and budget-friendly accommodation near Symbiosis.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.441236', 5, 475, 4),
(2902, '[PRANALI JADHAV] Having stayed at Sky Blue PG for a year and a half, I can confidently say it''s a nice and comfortable place to live. The atmosphere is consistently pleasant, and the owner is incredibly sweet and friendly, always making you feel welcome. It truly feels like a home away from home!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.441504', 5, 475, 4),
(2903, '[Vaishnavi Farkade] One of the best PGs for girls. Very clean and comfortable. I stayed here for nearly 1 years. Great location at SB Road, Gokhalenagar near symbiosis . Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.441637', 5, 475, 4),
(2904, U&'[abhijeet kumar] Absolutely horrible PG. Don\2019t fall for the online ratings, they are extremely misleading.nnMy friend stayed here, trusting the good reviews, and the reality was shocking. Bugs everywhere, broken floors, poor paint quality, and rats all over the place. Dead rats are found regularly and the smell is unbearable. Living here is unhealthy and stressful, yet the rent is not even cheap.nnThe owner is rude and dishonest. Despite giving one-month prior notice, the deposit was not refunded. Instead of returning the money, they argued and fought.nnI wanted to give 0 or -5 stars, but since there is no option, I am forced to give 1 star.nnOne of the worst PGs in Pune. Save your money, health, and mental peace, DO NOT STAY HERE.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.463789', 1, 476, 4),
(2905, '[Abhishek Sonawane] I had a great stay at this PG! The rooms were clean, well-ventilated, and regularly maintained. The location is convenient, with easy access to public transport, markets, and other essentials. It felt like a safe and peaceful environment, which is important for both students and working professionals. I would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable and hassle-free stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.463926', 5, 476, 4),
(2906, '[shruti rai] It has been an amazing experience at this pg. I never felt alone because of such good humans the owners of pg N Bharti and his wife. Today they are like family. Because of them I never was unsafe and lived in most comfortable manner. I loved to live in their pg and definitely will take it again if I come back. Very genuine extremely helpful and caring people and provides all facilities.nI would say my family:) thank you Nbharti bhaiya Goswami girls pg is the best in viman nagar and safest.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.464055', 5, 476, 4),
(2907, U&'[Rutuja Rupanawar] I had a wonderful stay at the PG! The rooms were spacious, clean, and received regular upkeep. Located in a prime area, it offers convenient access to public transport, markets, and all necessary facilities. The atmosphere was calm and secure\2014ideal for students as well as working professionals.nOur owner Bhaiya u0026 Bhabi is extremely kind, approachable, and responsive to any concerns. Their dedication to maintaining a homely and comfortable atmosphere truly made a difference in my stay. I would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable and hassle-free living experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.464177', 5, 476, 4),
(2908, '[divya parkhi] I stayed at Konark Nagar PG in Viman Nagar for nearly a year and had an excellent experience. The location is prime with all necessities nearby, making life convenient. The society is safe, especially for girls, I always felt secure. Owner is very cooperative and helpful. Daily cleaning ensures a tidy living environment. I highly recommend this PG for its prime location, safety, supportive management, and cleanliness.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.464314', 5, 476, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2909, U&'[Anuja Gattewar] The PG is well-maintained, clean, and provides a homely environment. Facilities and services are good, and overall I\2019m satisfied with my stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.464428', 5, 476, 4),
(2910, U&'[Nanda Holkar] Best pg. Best and immediate service.owner is very nice, supportive, helpful and responsive.good food is also available at affordable rates.Rooms are very spacious and well maintained.Regular cleaning. comfortable but most important safe.They provide all the necessary services including free WiFi,washing machine etc.Everyting is accessible nearby.overall beast PG in viman nagar.\+01f44d\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.46458', 5, 476, 4),
(2911, '[Monica Kotnala] I stayed at Konark Nagar PG in Viman Nagar for nearly a year and had an excellent experience. The location is prime with all necessities nearby, making life convenient. The society is safe, especially for girls, I always felt secure. Owner is very cooperative and helpful.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.464693', 5, 476, 4),
(2912, '[Aditya Dipak Dalal] The PG is Not A very good. A dirty smell is continuosly coming also a Rats are coming. Not a hygienic place. The policy of Zolo for refunds is not very good they take lots of hidden charges and also exit charges too costly.nBut The property manager is very good in nature, supportive and very calm it''s feels like a freind.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.481126', 1, 477, 4),
(2913, '[Dipak Jadhav] Nice place for coliving nature freindly and feeling peace for living.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.481258', 5, 477, 4),
(2914, '[Nitesh More] Last 6 months I''m staying here.nEnvironment was very good.nSpacious and nature friendly location to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.481451', 5, 477, 4),
(2915, '[Amol Chawhan] Great place to stay near Mumbai Pune Highway. Clean room''s and friendly staff at zolo hanshal.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.481577', 5, 477, 4),
(2916, '[Sahil Sharma] If you want a silent and personal space this place is for you. There''s a little problem with electricity and there''s no power backup to the room fan, it''s only for one light and wifi.  You have to take a subscription to the food or else you have to take food from outside canteens.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.481754', 4, 477, 4),
(2917, '[Vikas Kamble] Nice and calm place to stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.481872', 5, 477, 4),
(2918, '[Tejas Suryawanshi] Good if you are a working professional but a bike is must also it is not on road so quite than other pgs don''t take if you don''t have bike Lakshmi chowk is 1.5km and all mess and hotels are far also it is poorely connected only one road to go to Lakshmi chowk so choose according good for working professional', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.481989', 4, 477, 4),
(2919, '[Ajeenkya Suryawanshi] This Pg is situated away from the market areas!! It''s away from main roads .... will face some problems with food if you don''t have a vehicle...nFind some other Pgs other than zolo....nYou''ll be in a safer and advantageous position!! You''ll face some hidden charges over here, so stay cautious..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.482178', 2, 477, 4),
(2920, '[Vaibhav khare] Great experience staying here...nice pg.. roommates were cooperative and the food was also okay..... moreover the facilities provided were also good at a reasonable rate.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.499336', 3, 478, 4),
(2921, '[Ajay simha reddy] I stayed at this PG for 2 weeks and had a comfortable stay. Food is good and Rooms are well maintained.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.499539', 5, 478, 4),
(2922, '[Butti Prathyusha] Perfect place for students and professionals. Comfortable rooms, prompt service, and a positive environment make it an ideal place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.499658', 5, 478, 4),
(2923, '[Shubham Goenka] Poor hygienic, food contamination, water cans poor condition, poor service, no actions, water supply irregular etc.nnDon''t recommend this PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.499773', 1, 478, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2924, '[Tushar Chaudhari] 3 buildings in front of each other and rates based on the building age.nnRooms are good but can be better at the price they ask.nnService not sure but since it is managed by South Indian people so food will mostly be South Indian which will be good for South Indian food lovers.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.499897', 3, 478, 4),
(2925, '[Avinash] Avoid this place. While the rooms are good, the owner (Siva) is unprofessional and aggressive. During a small argument regarding their own mistake, he became verbally abusive and tried to manhandle me, physically pushing me backward. Additionally, they try to overcharge on the security deposit, ignoring the original receipt. The food quality is also poor, using cheap/low-quality vegetables. Not safe or worth it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.500013', 1, 478, 4),
(2926, U&'[Chaitaly Kundu] Absolutely Disappointed \2013 Not Recommended at allnnThe food quality is terrible \2013 often stale and unhygienic. Found cockroach in the food, and the food container is always left open, attracting more insects.nnThe rooms are poorly maintained, cramped, and nothing like what\2019s shown during visits.nnAlso Rooms are tiny, with no proper ventilation and full of cockroaches.nnThere''s no power backup.nnWorst of all, the owner is extremely rude and unprofessional, doesn\2019t listen to complaints, create false narratives and behaves arrogantly.nnAvoid this PG if you value your peace of mind and health.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.500132', 1, 478, 4),
(2927, '[Daniel Ramanaboyana] Food provided here is horrible, unhygienic, below quality standards. U can understand this by seeing the kitchen. The vegetables they bring is of below quality. 0 rating for food. Rooms are fine but the management is careless and with less etiquettes. If there would be any complaints they won''t do it in proper time.nnIf anyone is looking for hygienic and minimum quality food I would suggest you to not to go here. Don''t get deceived by the outer looks of pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.500246', 1, 478, 4),
(2928, '[Adarsh Dubey] Staying at this PG has been a really good experience. The rooms are clean and well-maintained, and all basic facilities like WiFi, laundry, and security are properly managed. The environment is peaceful and comfortable for both students and working professionals. The owner and staff are very supportive and responsive whenever any issue comes up. Overall, it feels safe and homely here. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a comfortable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.534299', 5, 480, 4),
(2929, U&'[Shaon Adhikary] I\2019ve been staying at this PG for a while now and I must say, it has exceeded my expectations in many ways. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and offer a good level of privacy. The environment is peaceful, making it ideal for both students and working professionals.nnThe staff is polite, supportive, and quick to respond to any issues.nnLocation-wise, it''s conveniently situated with easy access to public transport, shops, and restaurants. Security is taken seriously here, which adds an extra layer of comfort.nnOverall, it\2019s a great place to stay if you\2019re looking for a hassle-free and comfortable living experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.534429', 5, 480, 4),
(2930, U&'[Abhishek Salunkhe] One of the best things about this hostel is the sense of community. Everyone is so approachable, from the staff to the residents. It''s super easy to make friends here, and there\2019s always something fun happening.nWhether you''re a student or a working professional, this hostel is ideal for anyone looking for a safe, fun, and community-driven place to stay. Highly recommended for both girls and boys!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.534553', 5, 480, 4),
(2931, '[Ronak. Mhatre.] I stayed at the PG for the month of December 2025. I came to know about this place through Mr. Vicky Rajput, a staff member of the PG, who was very helpful in guiding me during the initial process.nnDuring my stay, I found the rooms to be very clean, well-maintained, and comfortable. The PG provides a safe and secure environment for both boys and girls. The overall cost of accommodation is also quite reasonable compared to other options available in the area, making it a great choice for students as well as working professionals.nnThe staff members are polite, supportive, and always ready to assist. They respond quickly whenever any issue or requirement arises, which makes the stay very convenient.nnI would also like to specially appreciate Mr. Vicky Rajput for his professionalism and supportive nature. He is very approachable, helpful, and ensures that residents are comfortable and their concerns are addressed promptly. His coordination and friendly attitude make the overall experience even better.nnAnother positive aspect is that festivals and special occasions are celebrated here, which creates a friendly and homely environment for residents staying away from their families.nnOverall, my experience has been very positive, and I would highly recommend this PG to students and working professionals looking for a comfortable and well-managed place to stay.nnDue to the nature of my job, I occasionally need to work from Pune as per business requirements. Therefore, whenever I visit Pune in the future, I would prefer to stay at the same PG again.nnThank you for providing such a comfortable and well-managed accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.534672', 5, 480, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2932, '[Sambhav Kaushik] Staying at this PG has been a really great experience. The place is very nice, well-organized, clean, and properly maintained, making it comfortable to live in. The owners are kind, supportive, and always helpful, while the staff is polite and responsive. The people staying here are also friendly and respectful, which creates a warm and homely atmosphere. It truly feels like a home away from home. Considering the quality, comfort, and environment, this PG is one of the best affordable premium options available.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.534793', 5, 480, 4),
(2933, '[saurabh gaikwad] Nice place to stay in Hinjewadi. Rooms are clean and well maintained. The environment is safe and comfortable for students and working professionals. Facilities are good and the location is also convenient near IT companies. Overall a good PG to live in', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.534911', 5, 480, 4),
(2934, '[Akhilesh Malabade] I had a wonderful experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and provide a comfortable living environment. All essential amenities like Wi-Fi, regular housekeeping, and hygienic food are available. The location is convenient, with easy access to public transport, markets, and other necessities. The management is friendly and responsive, ensuring a safe and pleasant stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.535025', 5, 480, 4),
(2935, '[amit kamble] I had a wonderful stay at this PG. The environment is not just comfortable but also feels like a second home. The management and staff are very supportive and always attentive to our needs.nnOne thing I really loved is the way they host cultural and festive activities. During Ganesh Festival, the PG organized different fun games, activities, and celebrations that brought everyone together. It created such a lively and joyful atmosphere, and it was a great way to bond with other residents.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.535144', 5, 480, 4),
(2936, '[MADHU APPALA NARASIMHA GOLTHI] Food is good, owner is friendly and rent is also budget friendly, rooms are but older, and cupboards are old and does not have locker facility to lock, apart from that food is good and rent is budget friendly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.558427', 5, 481, 4),
(2937, U&'[GOPI REDDY] Chandu PG has everything\2014spacious rooms, high-speed Wi-Fi, and honestly, the best homely food I''ve had.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.558582', 5, 481, 4),
(2938, '[Shital] Cleanliness is the issue. There are rats in the kitchen. 3 stars for all the beautiful memories I have with my roommates', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.558709', 3, 481, 4),
(2939, U&'[Harshitha] Good PG, affordable and they provide south food, daily cleaning, washing machines and place to hang for clothes. No issues. Oweners are really friendly. If you want a good food and good environment, you should visit this hostel definately \+01f525', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.558834', 5, 481, 4),
(2940, '[RISHIKESH JUMANI] WORSE PG OWNER  !!nNOT RETURNING MY MONEY SINCE A MONTH !!nONLY DELAYING EVENING, OR TOMORROW BUT NEVER RETURNING !!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.558958', 1, 481, 4),
(2941, '[Mombai Trip] I was staying since 2 years the food quality was drastically reduced, now the food quality is very very bad.nnThe below comments was provided by owner family members please don''t believe those comments.nnComing good things:nnOwner is quite good and humble.nRooms are cleaned and well maintainednGood parking space.nWi-Fi router will be there no use.nnBelow are the problems:nnFood quality was reduced.nComplete PG you will see bed bugs in a room.nThe road is very bad, during rainy season it''s a horrible.nLift will work only 2 or Max 3 in a week.nEvery month TV recharge will over then the recharge will be done with delay of 2-3 daysnBefore you choose this area you should know that the power cuts are very high in this area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.559076', 3, 481, 4),
(2942, '[VEERABOINA GANGADHAR] I paid advance Rs.2000 at 10:30 pm. Next day morning at 7:00 Am, I am asking him to give my money  back. He didn''t give single rupee. The PG owner cheated me. Atleast I am asking for Rs.1500 back  then after Rs.1000 he didn''t give my money. He said, it is business, money is not refundable. It is not business man , It is completely fraud. Doing fraud things they earn money', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.559202', 1, 481, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2943, '[Nehasri pokuri] quality food and special food items on occasions ,rooms cleaning is good, PG owner is really friendly. This is the best PG compared to the surrounding PG''s.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.559321', 5, 481, 4),
(2944, '[Anirudh Pusuluri] PG is good, has Wifi router in each room, rooms are cleaned every other day, common washing machine available and a dining hall. Food is not that great but not bad either', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.604189', 5, 483, 4),
(2945, '[Lakshmi Reddy] One of the best pg in HinjewadinRoom maintenance and food are very good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.604329', 5, 483, 4),
(2946, U&'[Dinkar Pawar] One of the best PG with good facilities with reasonable faresnTasty and spicy food every day new foodn\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.604549', 5, 483, 4),
(2947, '[Chandu Reddy] Best pg in hinjawadi,near Laxmi chowk,new building,and owner behaviour is very soft,I like this pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.604672', 5, 483, 4),
(2948, '[veerababu bandaru] Very nice pg it is newly constructed so it looks clean and good.nIt is equipped with all the eminities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.604801', 5, 483, 4),
(2949, '[swati sinha] Nice PG with proper maintenance, friendly owners. Good Facilities. Go for it -u003eu003eu003eu003e', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.60492', 5, 483, 4),
(2950, '[Darshan Gardhariya] Not so good place to accommodate, no house keeping, quality of food is also very bad, no security, water problems etc.......', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.605037', 1, 483, 4),
(2951, '[suraj pawar] Such a nice cleaning system, food facility accommodation u0026 other facility as well.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.605164', 5, 483, 4),
(2952, '[Heavens Ofbeauty] Very bad experience don''t fall for the sweet words. The manager forces people to give good reviews 5 star. They will treat you like special for the first week for the 5 star review. Then nobody will care. Very poor maintenance.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.683456', 1, 487, 4),
(2953, '[Atihsi] Very poor managing. Worst food multiple people get sick. No hygiene at all. Always food gets over in just 1hr regardless of the time of day and they make soo less food half the people doesn''t even get to eat. Doesn''t gives back the deposit on time. Sometimes doesn''t gives at all. Don''t come to this pg or any pg managed by these two people', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.683596', 1, 487, 4),
(2954, U&'[Nandani Singh] I\2019ve had a really good experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean, spacious, and well-maintained with all the basic facilities provided. And also the caretaker \2013 he is very helpful, polite, and always available whenever needed. Highly recommend this pg to anyone .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.683724', 5, 487, 4),
(2955, '[ishita das] If I could I would have given minus. Initially the staff here talks sweet and pressure us to give good reviews and even after living here for 2.5 yrs and more worst food cooking staff are not treated properly they don''t have a proper stay.. they turn off the fridge multiple times a day(keeping anything will result in foul smell or go bad) very poor hygiene people ofen have stomach issues and even dengues. Dustbins are not cleared properly. Water shortages, most importantly of you keep anything in machine to wash unattended be prepared to have clothes full of soapy water or ruined clothes as they tend to switch the machine of even if it was washing..and also they abruptly force us to leave change rooms/flats. With as less as 2hrs notice. Beware if you choose to come here. I would absolutely not recommend anyone.. very very bad experience with this pg and both the manager. And also they will keep and eye on what you eat how much you eat. If something is broken them forget it as it would be months before they fix. Half the flats have broken jet. Broken handles broken door knobs broken comode top broken shower. Water seepage is another issue...nBeware before coming to this pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.683848', 1, 487, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2956, '[Nisha Agarwal] I had a great experience staying at Gokul PG. The food provided is delicious and homely, which is a huge plus when living away from home. The owner is very friendly and accommodating, always ensuring that the needs of the residents are met. The rooms are well-maintained, clean, and comfortable, providing a cozy environment to live in. Overall, Gokul PG offers a great balance of comfort, convenience. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a good place to stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.683971', 5, 487, 4),
(2957, '[Janhavi Bugadi] Best PG for girls in Anantha Nagar Area. Safe , Clean and spacious rooms available.n3 times food available with filtered water 24/7.n24/7 wifi available. Lift service.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.684103', 5, 487, 4),
(2958, U&'[Priyanka Bachhav] Highly recommended PG! It''s well-maintained, offers good food and has all essential facilities. The caretaker is very kind and supportive, making the place feel warm and homely!!! \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.684229', 5, 487, 4),
(2959, '[Janhvi Rangankar] The PG is best. The living experience here is  one of the greatest in Hinjewadi. The prices are low and the food is the best. You get home like tasty food everyday with non-veg as well.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.68435', 5, 487, 4),
(2960, U&'[Deepak Talukdar] This Place Is a Complete Scam. Do NOT Fall for the Photos.nnIf I could give zero stars, I would.nnThis PG is one of the most misleading and unhygienic places I have ever seen. The photos and videos shared by the sales team look like a premium, well-maintained property. The reality? Completely opposite.nnThe rooms are in terrible condition \2014 peeling paint, scratched walls, tiles coming off, dirty cupboards, filthy beds, and washrooms so small and unhygienic that public railway station toilets feel better maintained.nnThe so-called \201ccommon area\201d is infested with large rats and cockroaches. It is not a living space \2014 it\2019s a neglected parking zone with pests running around.nnThe rent is higher than other PGs in the area, yet the standards are shockingly poor. You are charged premium rates for substandard, unhygienic living conditions.nnSo Called amenities like place to cook food and TV is a hoax. TV  is just like a show piece and cooking place is only an2 Feet x 1.5 Feet folding board mounted on wall with a Induction so far from the switchboard. To use it you may have to hold it in your arms.nnWhat is most concerning is the clear mismatch between what is promised and what is delivered. The sales pitch creates an image of a star-rated property. What you actually get feels like deception.nnStrong warning to anyone considering this place: Visit physically before paying a single rupee. Do NOT trust the marketing material.nnThis experience has been extremely disappointing and unacceptable. If such misrepresentation continues, it leaves customers with no option but to consider escalating the matter to appropriate consumer grievance authorities.nnBefore selecting Zolo Bravos just look at the pictures and compare while visit.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.706184', 1, 488, 4),
(2961, '[umamaheswara reddy] 1. Room walls, Bathroom tiles are no where close to the pictures that they shared.n2. What they call a private room is not at all private, it will be like a hall in the flat, inside which there will be another room, called a shared room. This shared room is given to two people. So basically, it is like a flat with 3 members.n3. A lot of construction work is also going nearby. I don''t blame Zolo braavos for that but still this makes things Messier.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.706351', 1, 488, 4),
(2962, '[Salgar Shubham Vikas] The overall experience is good. Manager''s behaviour is also Good. Housekeeping services are up to date u0026 on time.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.706512', 5, 488, 4),
(2963, '[Divyans Singh] Zolo customer always closes ticket without solution and do not contact light is another issue lift is not proper else is good about room and other things', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.706678', 5, 488, 4);     
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2964, U&'[Aditya Kumar] This is by far the worst PG I have come across in Hinjewadi Phase 1.nThe overall service is pathetic and the place is extremely unhygienic. There are cockroaches everywhere and the rooms are always untidy, no matter how many times you complain.nRooms are small. They will provide dirty mattress and pillow.nnThe caretaker is highly unprofessional.nThere are many better PG options nearby, so please think twice before choosing this one. If you don\2019t want your stay to feel like hell, avoid this PG at all costs.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.706808', 1, 488, 4),
(2965, '[Yash Agrawal] The rooms and hygiene shown in pictures are not always as advertised. There is very poor network, so if you want to make calls, you need to come outside of pg. The bathroom is too small with literally no space for a separate commode and bath area. No exhaust in the bathroom, so it stays damp for longer after use which is very uncomfortable. Cleaning is not good.There is cockroach problem as well. No food provided. Barely working lift. 1 BHK flat system which has its cons compared to separate rooms style pgs. The almirah provided is very small and no table and chair provided. The environment is very unprofessional.nnHope they will make these things better in the future.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.706932', 2, 488, 4),
(2966, '[Mayur Kala] I have been staying at this PG for the past 5 months, and overall, it has been a good experience. The facilities and services provided are commendable, with a few minor drawbacks.nnOne issue that I encountered during my stay was with the lift. It often malfunctioned and didn''t work properly, causing inconvenience to the residents. It would be great if the management could address this problem and ensure the lift is consistently operational.nnAdditionally, for those who own electric vehicles, it''s worth noting that there is currently no provision for charging them at this PG. This might deter electric vehicle owners from choosing this accommodation. It would be a valuable improvement if charging facilities for electric vehicles were made available.nnOn the positive side, I must appreciate the responsiveness of the management team. Whenever I raised a ticket regarding any issue or concern, they were prompt in addressing it. Most problems were resolved within 3-4 working days, which is impressive and shows their commitment to resident satisfaction.nnIn terms of other amenities, the PG offers comfortable living spaces and adequately maintained common areas. The cleanliness and hygiene standards are generally well-maintained, creating a pleasant living environment.nnOverall, despite a few minor drawbacks, this PG has provided me with a satisfactory experience over the past 5 months. I would recommend it to others seeking affordable and well-managed accommodation, with the understanding that there are some areas for improvement.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.707228', 4, 488, 4),
(2967, '[Abhijeet Srivastava] Very nice rooms. Newly constructed, approx 3 months. All essentials are free.Food quality is also average.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.707386', 4, 488, 4),
(2968, U&'[Rahul Kumar] Extremely poor experience with Zolo. The Wi-Fi is almost unusable, especially after the number of residents increased. The speed is too low for even basic office work, and mobile network coverage is also unstable here, leaving us with practically no reliable internet option.nDespite raising complaints and requesting a speed/plan upgrade, the issue is not being handled with the urgency it deserves. This is not just my experience\2014multiple residents are facing the same problem.nWhen people are paying for accommodation and promised basic amenities, reliable internet and responsive support should be the minimum expectation. Instead, we have to repeatedly raise tickets for basic issues.nVery frustrating and disappointing experience. Zolo management should take resident complaints seriously and fix these recurring issues instead of making residents continuously follow up.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.730281', 1, 489, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2969, '[Pratik Mahajan] I hope everyone see this as I''m leaving this property soon but as far as I''m aware I really had a great stay with such a cooperative property manager azhar he''s been all kind and give quick response I would suggest this to everyone', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.730417', 5, 489, 4),
(2970, '[Trigger King] I really liked the friendly environment of this pg and hygiene level is upto the standard all credit goes to Mr Azhar for taking such great measures to provide such environment for the guest.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.730535', 5, 489, 4),
(2971, U&'[Asif khan] It\2019s a great place to stay when you need a quite and peaceful environment after your daily hectic day and thanks to the new guy who joins as GRO has clearly shown great improvement in terms of cleaning and hygiene', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.730731', 5, 489, 4),
(2972, '[Hk zope] Hi All,nZolo iterno Provided best service.Room cleaning, Service, caretaking is good.Recommend for new one who looking for room.nMr. Azar managing and providing great service as per zolo policy.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.730863', 5, 489, 4),
(2973, '[Rahul shelar] Good, comfortable and convenient PG to stay-in Mr. Shekhar Care taker - is doing is job excellently. Regular cleaning room. I am very happy with their service. Keep up the good service like this in future By mistakenly gave the zolo app rating less than 8 but actually i wanted to give it a 10 rating please consider it as 10 rating. Specially thanks to Shekhar he is very helpful. Please consider the 10 rating given by me today.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.731557', 5, 489, 4),
(2974, '[Vaibhav Fale] Very good!  I have been living here frequently when i had often come to the office on occasion. GRO azhar is friendly and on par with your request fulfilled.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.731793', 5, 489, 4),
(2975, '[Shivam Dabholkar] I have no words for GRO who has been working day and night to enhance the living experience and my my what an improvement in all aspect such a calm place to live and services are top notch all credit goes to Mr Azhar for making life so easy and comfortable here in zolo iterno such a great environment', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.73193', 5, 489, 4),
(2976, '[Gunjan] Worsssttt behaviour of staff....who managing pg they don''t have manners to talk with girls very bad experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.774601', 1, 491, 4),
(2977, '[Vinamra Jha] Good PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.774737', 5, 491, 4),
(2978, '[Rahul Jain] Worst Services. They didn''t even let your friends visit for a few minutes. I stayed there only for a few days then just cancelled my stay because of the worst experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.774941', 1, 491, 4),
(2979, '[Sham Gurav] Everything is very good. Rooms are spacious and hygiene is well maintained.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.77506', 5, 491, 4),
(2980, '[Akash Borse] It was good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.775184', 3, 491, 4),
(2981, '[Krishankant Soni] This is a new build hostel.. Room sizes are the best in the neighborhood.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.775368', 4, 491, 4),
(2982, '[Sunil] Good PG .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.775505', 5, 491, 4),
(2983, '[Amarnath Sathe] Nice place for students n working professionals in Hinjewadi', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.775623', 5, 491, 4),
(2984, U&'[Laxman Jogdankar] I\2019ve stayed in this PG for more than 2 years, and my overall experience has been really positive. The place truly feels like a second home. The management is friendly and always responsive to any issues \2014 whether it\2019s maintenance, cleanliness, or general support.nnThe rooms are well-maintained, spacious, and regularly cleaned. The food is homely and tasty, with good variety and hygiene maintained consistently. What I appreciate most is the safe and peaceful environment, which makes it perfect for both students and working professionals.nnThe location is convenient, with easy access to shops, and restaurants.nnOverall, this PG has provided comfort, safety, and a genuine sense of belonging \2014 I couldn\2019t have asked for a better place to stay! Highly recommended for anyone looking for a long-term, hassle-free stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.796296', 5, 492, 4);        
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2985, '[G.N.Naveen Kumar] The rooms are well-maintained, spacious, and regularly cleaned. The food is homely and tasty, with good variety and hygiene maintained consistently. What I appreciate most is the safe and peaceful environment, which makes it perfect for both students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.796484', 5, 492, 4),
(2986, '[Anju Abraham] They don''t give deposit money back, the cleaning staff has no manners tgey eneter room without even knocking and permission, NO PRIVACY AT ALL..!!!!   there cleaning is so bad there were full cocroaches it room.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.7966', 1, 492, 4),
(2987, U&'[Dular Nikode] Very Good PG , Everyday room cleaning.nFood is Good\+01f44d. Lived here almost 2 years.nI would heartfully recommend you this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.796714', 4, 492, 4),
(2988, '[Prashant Chinchole] Quality food, clean rooms, dalily cleaning of rooms and weekly washroom cleaning. For any issues responds immediately. 24 hrs power back and wifi facility.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.796831', 5, 492, 4),
(2989, '[lakshmikanth pachala] Food Quality is good. Neat rooms and daily cleaning. Hot water, wifi and power back up 24 hrs.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.796949', 5, 492, 4),
(2990, '[prasad prasad] Prime location for transportation and we''ll maintaining pg  ,homely food,well behavior staff,eco friendly owner Rami Reddy Anna.nVentilation also good especially power backup.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.797062', 5, 492, 4),
(2991, '[Sanket Shingade] Very nice pg.nOwner''s(Anna''s) behaviour is very friendly.nSupportive staff.nFresh u0026 good quality food.nGenerator is available as a backup for electricity.nGood strength wifi.nEveryday cleaning facility provided.nMaintained infrastructure.nOverall best service is available.nBest PG I have ever seen.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.797176', 5, 492, 4),
(2992, '[Raju Shah] Location is perfect.. road touchnCleanliness goodnBreathable environmentnOutside ATM,s, Tea shops, Gym,Grocery shop almost everything availablennFood quality has to be improved', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.819992', 4, 493, 4),
(2993, '[Abhay Deep] This PG is the best in the area!nThe owner is very good and supportive, and the food is delicious and homely. Rooms are clean, and the rent is affordable. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a comfortable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.820139', 5, 493, 4),
(2994, '[Utkarsh Sharma] Very nice pg, polite u0026 welcoming owner. I came to visit my friend here and had no issues of any kind.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.820256', 5, 493, 4),
(2995, U&'[Altamash Shaikh] Very Nice place in reasonable rate to stay. Hygiene is the best thing to observe here. Very friendly and Good Nature of Landlord Mr Sanjay Asrani. He is the one kind person helping nature he and his wife Mrs Deepali  always helps the Tenants and treat them like Family.nnIt was really very good experience to stay. My job timing was at late night but I never had any problem the quality our food was awesome. PG is fully covered by CCTV cameras so it is also very safe for Girls.nThe most important safety it is very safe to stay.nMrs Deepali Asrani is also very helpful. My stay for 2 years had been so memorable.nn\+01f60d\+01f64fSo once again Thank you SS PGnMr u0026 Mrs Asrani for the good service.\+01f60d\+01f64f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.820369', 5, 493, 4),
(2996, '[Rajat Mundra] PURE VEG(most important), Vibrant place, owner is really very cooperative, food is also very good, cleanliness is absolutely fantastic.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.820581', 5, 493, 4),
(2997, '[Kaushik D] Unbiased view - best place for a short or long term stay. Affordable price for stay, food, wifi, tv, washing machine and electricity, all included.nFood is nice and healthy. Owner is extremely co-operative and well responsive.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.820749', 5, 493, 4),
(2998, '[Anjali Pathak] Pg is very good. Pg owners is very nice, providing a homely environment. Clean rooms, tasty food and good prisoners.Located in a very nice area and close to shops and bus stops.nDefinitely recommend this PG!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.820879', 5, 493, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(2999, '[Sri Ram] Worst owner and PG. Extremely small rooms/bathrooms.nReply - I talk about same SS PG where you have brought in your entire family in PG. Exactly behindnWine shop.nAnything else you want me to add ?', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.821', 2, 493, 4),
(3000, U&'[Aarav Manoj Rathod] This is one of the worst-managed Zolo properties I have ever experienced. The manager behaves like he is the \201cking\201d of the property and guests have no value. His attitude is arrogant, disrespectful, and completely unprofessional.nEven when rooms are clearly available, guests are made to sit unnecessarily at reception. There is no proper coordination and no basic courtesy.nFrom morning till afternoon, the manager never once visited the property. He was completely absent. All updates were being given by housekeeping staff on his behalf. Is this how a manager is supposed to run a property? There is zero responsibility and zero accountability.nRoom No. 107 was allotted to me. The property listing clearly mentions geyser and WiFi facilities, but there was NO geyser and NO working WiFi in the room. This is clear misrepresentation and false commitment. Promising amenities and not providing them is unacceptable.nThe most shocking part \2014 after checkout, the manager takes guests\2019 mobile phones and writes positive reviews himself. This is highly unethical and completely dishonest. Fake reviews are being created to hide the poor service and reality of this property.nZolo management must immediately investigate this property and take strict action. Guests deserve respect, transparency, and the facilities that are advertised \2014 not arrogance, false promises, and manipulated ratings.nStrongly disappointed. Book at your own risk.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.841793', 1, 494, 4),
(3001, '[Sarbottam Singh] Had a great stay at Zolo Ample. The rooms are clean and well-maintained, the staff is friendly and helpful, and the location is very convenient. Housekeeping is regular, and the overall environment is safe and comfortable. It''s a good option for students and working professionals looking for a hassle-free stay. Highly recommended', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.841938', 4, 494, 4),
(3002, U&'[bhavana kodur] This was the worst PG I have ever stayed in. I had booked it for two days, but due to the extremely poor accommodation, I left within a few hours.nThere was absolutely no hygiene \2014 as shown in the washroom pictures, it was unclean, with multiple cracks poorly filled with putty. The entire room had a foul odor, and there was no proper ventilation. Opening the windows only made things worse, as mosquitoes would enter the room.nThe toilet jet spray was not working, and even the TV was not functioning.nThey didn\2019t even provide basic amenities like mineral water. The bottle in my room was empty, and when I asked for water, they refused and told me to refill it myself from a dispenser outside.nAdditionally, they do not have any refund policy, which made the experience even more frustrating.nOverall, I would not recommend this place at all.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.842081', 1, 494, 4),
(3003, '[dnyaneshwar pawar] Worst of all. Youbetter stay in normal pg.nAll zolodoes is changing for everything yet giving nothing.nNo electricity backupnWorst food which is not included in monthly rent. You have spend another 3000 yet it is worst of kindnnZero cleaning in the property.nWorst waternWorst lift.nWorst service and attention to people issue.nWorst at keeping the pg parking cleannWorst at keeping drainage betternWorst at  maintaining garbage buckets clean.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.842312', 1, 494, 4),
(3004, U&'[Anuraag Borah] I have spent only 4hrs there. Rooms are clean and nice. some amenities were also provided. Great staff \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.842528', 5, 494, 4),
(3005, '[rahul c nair] This is an average stay. The price is very high for the rooms they are providing. Go for it only if you want cheap rooms for high cost. They don''t even clean rooms properly even if their app tells you everyday that your room is cleaned. And they will charge you an electricity bill for 2 months in 1 month of stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.842765', 2, 494, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3006, '[Naina Bhagat] This was very excellent experience for me... I was here for 1 night.nThis one of the best option in hinjewadi for stay... I really enjoy this', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.842907', 5, 494, 4),
(3007, U&'[Yash Gurao] A good pg service for bachelors as well as couples. Food is good compared to most of the pgs. Rooms are clean and cleaning is done every alternate day by organization staff. Drinking water(filtered) is avaliable outside every room. Washing machine, wifi, vehicle parking, television(need to recharge on your own) etc facilities are provided. And most importantly everything is nearby. Hinjawadi chowk is hardly 500-600 meters away from where  every single bus or a cab stops. Electricity bill is not included in monthly rent. Staff behavior is good so far. Open for 24 hours, There is no rule that gate will be closed at this or that time. Baki kuch hoga to update kdrunga... bye-bye \+01f44b', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.843095', 4, 494, 4),
(3008, '[Oindrila Mukherjee] I had a great time here. Very spacious full of greenery, two separate toilets and a balcony. Lift facilities. Owners were very helpful and food was just average. Rest we never had cleaning issues etc. I stayed here in later months of 2019 to 2020. rent might be higher than other places but worth it. They also printed my tickets etc in the office whenever needed.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.864214', 4, 495, 4),
(3009, '[Ankit Kumar] The pg is good. No restrictions. If you are few friends who are looking for a hostel type accommodation then this is the best pg in hinjewadi. You get all basic amenities in here. And all the extras like tv, ac will be provided after some charges.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.864362', 4, 495, 4),
(3010, '[Swaroop Warankar] Superb PG in Phase 1....Both for Girls as well as Boys....Very close to Blueridge or Ambassy Infotech Park. Nice and Specious Room. Good Food and 5 star Hygeine as well as some Indoor Sports like carrom and Table-Tennis.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.864572', 5, 495, 4),
(3011, '[Akash Unnikrishnan] I''ve been staying here since 3 months. It is a well justifiable price that it costs. All the wanted amenities are being provided. Moreover its a place for the youngsters which makes the living vibe even better. Single, 2 sharing, 3 sharing and 4 sharing rooms available.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.864766', 4, 495, 4),
(3012, '[Shrey Patnaik] It is one finest PG in the area I don''t think you would get any better PG in that area until you pay hefty amount of rent. I checked out almost all the PGs in that area. The amenities they provide is at par with what every person would require, hot water, wifi, mess food, electricity included in rent, parking for 2 wheelers, balcony, daily room cleaning, lifts, recreational activities, washing machine and security.nHope they maintain the standard of services they offer.nLooking forward to staying with them again when I''m back in Pune!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.864888', 5, 495, 4),
(3013, U&'[Tanmay Shukla] If you''re looking for the best PG accommodation in Hinjewadi Phase 1, this one stands out for all the right reasons. The rooms are spacious and well-maintained, providing a comfortable living experience. Their services are prompt and efficient, ensuring a hassle-free stay. One of the major highlights is the food quality \2013 it''s consistently delicious and hygienic. They also offer the option to avail lunch, which adds to the convenience for working professionals.nnWhat truly sets this PG apart is its unbeatable location \2013 it''s the closest PG to the Phase 1 Tech Park, making daily commutes quick and stress-free.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.865008', 5, 495, 4),
(3014, '[Sk. Nadim Islam] HIGHEST COST! This might have been a great PG in the past, but now it''s worst. They will promise so many facilities which you''ll never get. No HOT water in room. WIFI won''t connect, if it does, no speed. No CLEANING of rooms. Provides PLATES for meals, but food particles and soap stuck in those after they wash it. Promised me to provide study table before 1month which I didn''t get till now.nDidn''t clean previous tenant''s leftovers, been complaining from 1month. And all those problems I wrote now, I also did write them in a Complaint Book provided by them.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.865142', 1, 495, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3015, U&'[Rued] Pathetic management and completely unprofessional place. I stayed here for more than 2 years and the management shamelessly kept begging for good reviews in exchange for rent discount \2014 that\2019s why most of the positive reviews you see are fake. The place is full of favoritism; I personally know someone paying only around \20b93,500 while others are charged \20b98,500+ for 3 sharing room.nnThe guards are downright ill-mannered and abusive. In one incident, a resident was stopped from carrying just a packet of tetra milk, and the guard forcefully checked his bag out of personal grudges. This shows the level of toxicity and harassment here.nnIf you value your money, time, and respect, stay away from this place.nn- Utkarsh', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.865262', 1, 495, 4),
(3016, '[Kumar Laungani] Poor Service  - 5  in factnMy first time with this propertynTwice the electricity fused for two hours no inverter backupnNo cleanliness happened no housekeeping carefree staffnWhat''s shown in the picture - and in the reality - it''s v different ( poor )nI will never come to this property ever again', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.887822', 1, 496, 4),
(3017, '[shiv] It was very  nice experience  in zolo', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.888102', 5, 496, 4),
(3018, '[Swapnil Borse] Excellent stay, clean rooms and friendly staff. Highly recommended.nGreat location, smooth check-in and value for money.nRooms were neat, service was quick.nComfortable stay with all amenities as promised.nnGood experience overall, would definitely book again.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.888354', 5, 496, 4),
(3019, '[Mitesh Kumar] Good clean rooms and good staff, value for money.nRecommended', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.888627', 5, 496, 4),
(3020, '[Yash Yadav] Good pg to stay and also the Shekhar who is the caretaker of this pg is best and provide timely response in resolving the issue', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.888842', 5, 496, 4),
(3021, '[Aadarsh Talokar] Non-AC rooms only, no complaints only suggestion to take place a handwash and give a soap with towl', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.888979', 4, 496, 4),
(3022, '[urja dhagga] Not a very good pg ...I will.mot recommend', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.889114', 1, 496, 4),
(3023, '[Anamika Mukhi] They are just buying these reviews of 5 star ratings to increase their ratings .nI have been living here for the past 1 year , every other day there is a issue regarding the electricity or the water supply , idk what are they charging 8.5k for . People are not responsible atall , lack atleast minimum accountably. If u come up with a concern rather thn resolving the concern they would ask you to leave the primises crazzzyyy . And if you guys agree on leaving the premises thn they wont pay back the deposit . Sharan is the caretaker of the building havent seen someone as irresponsible as him', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.889239', 1, 496, 4),
(3024, '[Huma Mirza] Please can you share your contact no to discuss price', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.916049', 5, 497, 4),
(3025, U&'[Auditor ex] Best part is facilities provided by them.. very good facilities provided in less price...If you are searching for best hostel in Koregaon park then u must visit this place..\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.916208', 5, 497, 4),
(3026, U&'[ANUJA LOMTE] I had very good experience after staying here.. it feels staying at new home every day..very clean u0026 neat place. Best part is facilities provided by them.. very good facilities provided in less price...If you are searching for best hostel in Koregaon park then u must visit this place..\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.916327', 5, 497, 4),
(3027, '[APEKSHA AMALE] Very nice place and comfortable with affordable. Provided  good amenities like fridge, washing machine, wifi. One of the best hostel in this place', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.916439', 5, 497, 4),
(3028, U&'[Deepika Lomate] This is a best hostel ,where you live like a family ,best amenities provided ... great experience....\+01f60a\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.916551', 5, 497, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3029, '[Manisha Lomate] My experience about this hostel is very good. Its not a hostel its like a home', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.91666', 5, 497, 4),
(3030, '[Gopal Burukle] Best pg my sister stay 6 month very good lg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.916784', 5, 497, 4),
(3031, U&'[Pallavi Shitole] Nice place for girlsnHouse keeping and other facilities is good \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.916892', 5, 497, 4),
(3032, '[David Krishnavanshi] Dont stay with them , they charge unwanted and unnecessary , there is no one to connect and unwanted bill and even that bill is wrong', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.941676', 1, 498, 4),
(3033, U&'[PRATIK RANGARI] THE ONLY REVIEW YOU NEED TO SEE.\+01f621nnMy sister lived for 1 month only u0026 customer service agents were troubling her with their stupid calls at anytime...After 15 days of joining PG customer service agents called and asked did you received the key for apartment.( I mean behen konsa maal fuk k baithi h tu customer care me )nnWorst service, Worst PG, Worst employees will never recommend to anyone.nAnd you won''t get your money/deposit back  even after 1-2 months leaving/begging/crying.nI had to contact police/legal authorities to solve my issue.nEven after asking politely u0026 following up for more than 1 month of all instructions no they didn''t give refund within timeline, customer service agents were not at all helpful ,no empathy,no manners,rude behaviour.nnThey have phone call facility only for sales team u0026 disturb the tenant.nBut they don''t have phone call facility for refund.nWhen you call them for refund they will say we have we are different team contact queries team - Queries team ( call transfer)- then Queries team will say contact finance team ( tranfer to finance team) then finance team will say ( refund team is not available on office /call) - Send email to them And you would only get 1 email response that will be like ( sorry for inconvenience etc etc but zero solution) but probelm is they will reply to your email only once in 1-2 days...So you will keep wondering why they did not reply.nnThey didn''t even mention why they keeping your money u0026 not refunding without any reason.nThey only send stupid irrelevant email when you ask for your refund.nnWhat else I can say just don''t book their PG. Their tagline should be - Get set home ( Tagline - best experience \274c Your worst trauma \2705)nnZero leadership zero onwehship zero responsibility.nBut full loaded trauma guaranteed.nnThis is an 100 % honest review.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.941812', 1, 498, 4),
(3034, '[ANEESH KARTHIKEYAN] Collecting money advanced before seeing the room and asked me to stay in a broken bed. Even though I raised the bed issue they are asking for the remaining cash.nIt''s not GetSet home it''s the Getset HELL for accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.941951', 1, 498, 4),
(3035, '[Apurv Nirali] This in rahul housing societynnVery bad servicenBefore i came that property some damages already happen there I informed that property CR ( jo show kar raha tha) this damages happen he told me he will handle that after my period ends they deducted some amount from my deposit also every time electricity bill has high compared to other propertiesnnAlso contacting issue with this company like vice call and allnnAnd also they not know about there property amenities also witch thing are damage before coming new customers likenBefore me coming there iron already damaged after some time someone rise complaint for iron they charge from mennAlso if anything happen service is very slow like wifi recharge they recharge after complaint that wifi not working', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.94207', 1, 498, 4),
(3036, '[Nikhil Deshmukh] They didn''t have courtesy to know the requirement of clients.. he told me to pay the charges 1st then visit is possible.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.942198', 1, 498, 4),
(3037, '[Vinayak Shejawal] Worst stay ever making trauma', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.942314', 1, 498, 4),
(3038, '[Vicky Khan] It''s a luxurious area,nice to stay without any fear', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.942432', 5, 498, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3039, U&'[Eknath Naik] Good \+01f44d\+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:16.942547', 5, 498, 4),
(3040, '[Imran Sayyed] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.082909', 5, 499, 4),
(3041, U&'[ghostmachine 06] The manager asked me to leave without any valid reason even though I paid rent on time and followed all rules. Communication was poor, and I wouldn\2019t recommend this PG to anyone looking for a stable and long term stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.105235', 1, 500, 4),
(3042, U&'[Kunal Karadiya] I like a wonderful and reassuring experience! It takes a lot of courage to move to a new city for the first time, especially when you are leaving home in Ujjain.n\200bIt''s fantastic that you found Joy Hostel and that it has made your transition to Pune so positive. Knowing you have an affordable place with a kind manager and good-hearted people around you is the best start you could ask for!.\2728\+01f4af', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.105461', 5, 500, 4),
(3043, '[Ingrid Walz] This is a very, very good hostel. The manager is very friendly and helpful. We were even able to check in early in the morning after our night flight. It''s super clean and is cleaned every day. The kitchen is great. There is a washing machine.  There are common rooms. A very good place to stay!!!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.105587', 5, 500, 4),
(3044, '[Emmanuel Laryea] I spent a night at Joy Hostel in Pune and I I had a lovely, relaxing time at this place. The facilities are very new, cleaned daily and homely. The staff member was super helpful with directions and treated me very well and pleasant.nHostel mates are friendly, helpful, full of vibe for conversations and go the extra mile. I had an amazing experience having a meal with them too and I feel I have made friends for life! I would highly recommend staying here and will definitely return. It was an absolute vibe and very chill!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.105708', 5, 500, 4),
(3045, U&'[Shailendra Singh] I had a great stay at Joy Hostel! The warm hospitality and friendly staff made the experience truly enjoyable. The room was clean and well-maintained, with a good level of hygiene throughout. The common hall on the 2nd floor was a wonderful space to relax and connect with others. Overall, it was a comfortable and pleasant stay\2014I\2019d definitely recommend it!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.105831', 5, 500, 4),
(3046, U&'[Gaayatri] One of the best hostels I\2019ve stayed in throughout my India trip. Its clean, comfortable, offers self service laundry as well (which i rarely find here) It\2019s also located at a very happening and convenient area, a lot of eateries and bars in walking distance yet still a quiet place. Its been my go to, to stop by in between my travels from north to south or vice versa.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.105949', 5, 500, 4),
(3047, U&'[muskan arora] stayed here for a month and the manager was very nosy , he entered my room without my permission multiple times behind my back,  he constantly blackmailed me and threatened to call my family and put false allegations, one day he locked me outside the building at 1am and while i called him he declined and started watching match which was very disrespectful, he asked me to follow his page and give a good review as soon as i did it , he started misbehaving with me. he used to argue with almost every girl on the floor for useless reasons. the place is amazing and the area is wonderful but the manager is the worst caretaker i\2019ve ever met who doesn\2019t respect girls half his age. even asked me to pay extra to him after i moved in because he \201caccidentally\201d rented me for the wrong rate. kindly change your manager rest everything is wonderful. must recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.106068', 1, 500, 4),
(3048, '[Deepak UMRAO] The hostel is well maintained, neat and tidy with all necessary facilities like Air conditioner, geyser, refrigerator, R.O. water, we get full furnished open kitchen- just bring ur grocery and cook whatever u want also u get long gallery attached with kitchen having modern table, chairs where u can enjoy ur meal.....washing machine for cleaning clothes....apart from room or dormitory whatever u choose u get a big lobby which will be common place to chill out....we get bean bags, beach chairs to relax or just use rope swings to calm ur body after having a hefty day, moreover if u want to play some games like carrom, chess or playing cards u can also enjoy that or if u are a party lover u can enjoy music too wid disco lights, (what more u can expect from hostel) .....everyday proper cleaning is done by housekeeper and also change the bedsheets, pillow covers time to time so that u can hv each day refreshing....Note- in case u find any difficulty or things not done properly, u can always contact the manager- ''Devaraj''(clear-sighted person) who is available 24*7 to help u. Overall I can say that I loved the place very much and I must recommend to all u''ll definitely enjoy the place u0026 the vibes that surrounds here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.106194', 4, 500, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3049, '[Saurabh Jha] Twin sharing, triple sharing and individual room available. Nice location in koregaon park. Visited one of my friends here. They have included various decorative portraits in the property. Bit difficult to navigate to this location and can be a bit costly if we consider it is a glorified PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.232885', 3, 501, 4),
(3050, '[Keshav Batra] Good managementnBetter than usual average student accommodation', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.233077', 3, 501, 4),
(3051, '[lonley prince] I have stayed there find a great experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.233203', 5, 501, 4),
(3052, '[prashant jadhav] Cleaning issues', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.233311', 1, 501, 4),
(3053, '[Ratish Ahuja] Contact please', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.233416', 5, 501, 4),
(3054, '[madan dahale] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.233518', 1, 501, 4),
(3055, '[Nikita Tayade] Owner of the house is not good and the rent is very high according to services', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.401064', 1, 504, 4),
(3056, '[Ajay chauhan] Dirty', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.401213', 1, 504, 4),
(3057, '[The Greener Mind] The most unclean place in Pune. They dont even have the Zolo Logo at the entrance. Also they say they have a single private room but it is just a bed in a kitchen. The app says it''s a private room.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.425194', 1, 505, 4),
(3058, '[Digvijay Kamalkar] Good property and good management care taker digambar is so kind and so helpful', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.425387', 5, 505, 4),
(3059, '[Muju Muju] Very nice pg and staff digambar very great proper mangement', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.425517', 5, 505, 4),
(3060, '[Chetan Jadhav] Good property and good management caretaker is digmbar .very great talent management.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.425641', 5, 505, 4),
(3061, '[Murali Manohar] Images placed in zolo web page totally different compared to the ground realities,', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.425764', 1, 505, 4),
(3062, '[thinking speaker] Zolo fincorp is good poprety and gigambar the caretaker s good job', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.425887', 5, 505, 4),
(3063, '[Pramod Sinha] Good property and good management caretaker is disembar .very great talent management.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.426009', 5, 505, 4),
(3064, '[Satadru Mukherjee] Wonderful place to stay in. Manager Keshav and in-house caretaker Pawan makes this place feel like home.nZolostays provide all the facilities that a home can provide you starting from food to housekeeping to cleanliness...... Absolutely loving it......', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.426132', 5, 505, 4),
(3065, '[Sanket suryawanshi] I had an amazing stay at HOSTEL99. From the moment I checked in, the staff made me feel so welcome and comfortable. The rooms were clean, cozy, and had such a homely vibe. It truly felt like a second home. Will definitely come back again! also it was my first visit I was given a free of cost upgrade in room-stay was able to interact with different people from different countriesnnPerfect budgeted stay mostly focused on providing good quality and service and good wifi speed 24/7 hot water available', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.44871', 4, 506, 4),
(3066, '[Mohammed Zeeshan] I had a wonderful stay at Hoshtel99 for one week. The rooms were clean, comfortable, and well-maintained, and the overall atmosphere was peaceful and welcoming. The staff was friendly, helpful, and always ready to assist whenever needed. The facilities were excellent, making my stay very comfortable and enjoyable. I truly enjoyed my time here and would highly recommend Hoshtel99 to anyone looking for a clean, safe, and pleasant place to stay. Looking forward to staying here again!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.448834', 5, 506, 4),
(3067, '[jalp prajapati] Excellent Stay!nnI had a wonderful stay at this hostel and was genuinely impressed with the overall experience. The rooms and washrooms were clean, spacious, and very well maintained. The beds were comfortable, and having facilities like a personal study lamp at each bed made the stay even more convenient. The Wi-Fi worked well throughout my visit.nnThe staff were extremely friendly, helpful, and cooperative, always ready to assist with anything needed. I also appreciated the available amenities, including the washing machine, fully equipped kitchen, common play area, and TV room, which made the hostel feel like a home away from home.nnThe atmosphere was peaceful, safe, and social, making it easy to relax and meet new people. The food was good, the location was convenient, and the hostel offered excellent value for money.nnOverall, I am very satisfied with my stay and would highly recommend this hostel to solo travelers, students, and anyone looking for a comfortable and welcoming place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.448952', 5, 506, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3068, '[Nishant Tyagi] I had a two day stay here, my experience was amazing. Beola Madam and Vishal they were very kind, helpful and they took us out so that we can interact with other room mates and make new friends and that happened also. I made new friends which made my stay even more memorable.nRooms was good, bathroom was clean and tidy.nOverall stay experience was so good. Definitely coming back to stay here when I am in Pune', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.449077', 4, 506, 4),
(3069, U&'[itz sarthak] This hostel exceeded my expectations in every way. Its perfect for both relaxing and meeting fellow travelers. The cleanliness was top-notch, and the beds were really comfortable after a long day.nnWhat stood out the most was the staff\2014they were incredibly kind, approachable, and always made sure guests felt at home. The location was also very convenient, with easy access to nearby attractions and transport.nnIf you''re looking for a budget-friendly place with great energy and good people, this hostel is definitely worth it. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.449197', 5, 506, 4),
(3070, U&'[Shreyas Gursal] Stayed here for a few nights and it turned out to be one of the better decisions of the trip. Koregaon Park is a fantastic location, quiet inside but everything you need is right around the corner. Food options nearby are great and the whole area has a good energy to it.nnThe rooms are clean and well-maintained, beds are comfortable and the washrooms are kept properly. Wi-Fi worked without issues which matters a lot when you\2019re travelling for work or just need to stay connected. The coworking setup is a genuine plus, not just a table in the corner but an actual usable space.nnWhat really stood out was how peaceful the atmosphere was. You get a good mix of solo travellers and working professionals so it stays disciplined without feeling stiff. Staff were friendly and actually helpful, not just present.nnThe cafe is a nice touch too. Overall it is well-priced for what you get and the location alone makes it worth it. Would come back without second thoughts.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.449315', 5, 506, 4),
(3071, U&'[Vaibhav Chavan] had a great experience staying at PG Hostel99. The rooms are clean and well-maintained, and the overall environment is safe and comfortable. The staff is helpful and responsive whenever needed. Facilities like WiFi, housekeeping, and security are properly managed. It\2019s a good option for working professionals and students looking for a budget-friendly and peaceful stay. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.449431', 5, 506, 4),
(3072, '[lone wolf] For those who need accomodation for atleast 3 days stay. It''s the best place to live, full of positive energy and good people around.nnOnly thing was missing was the mattress outside the bathroom and room.nRest all was top notch', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.449589', 5, 506, 4),
(3073, '[Ritika L.] Hygienic compared to other pg and systematic, only issue about food because in Summers can get spoiled', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.495524', 4, 508, 4),
(3074, U&'[Abhishek Kushare] \2022 A good place to live which is very closed to Kalyani Nagar , Yerwada and Creaticity Mall.n\2022 PG has seperate Gents and Ladies Section in building.n\2022 Society has 24 hours of watchman''s security.n\2022 They provide free WiFi (seperate for different flats).n\2022 Overall rent is okay.n\2022 You''ll get sharing options for 3 or 4 beds in single room. Alongwith they also provide cupboard with lock and bed mattress.n\2022 Also they provide everyday breakfast , dinner and weekend lunch and food facility is optional.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.495734', 5, 508, 4),
(3075, '[Harsh Prasad] Such a pathetic condition... PG is kinda inhabitable... I was looking for a decent PG.. owner sent me different pics and when I went there to check the PG ,I was stunned... I wonder how can one live in such an ugly looking smelly place..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.495857', 1, 508, 4);          
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3076, '[Mahesh Waghmare] Can I get a contact number', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.495976', 1, 508, 4),
(3077, '[Farhan Choudhary] Good place for searchers for pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.496095', 5, 508, 4),
(3078, '[MAYANK PUNJ] Scammers.. beware of this PG.. this is a scam', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.496213', 1, 508, 4),
(3079, '[Shiva wale] Good one.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.496328', 3, 508, 4),
(3080, '[Ram Naresh Yadav] It''s fine', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.496439', 3, 508, 4),
(3081, U&'[Shreeraj Gade] I''ve been staying at this PG for a while, and here\2019s my honest feedback:nn\+01f9fc Cleanliness: Daily cleaning is well-maintained, which keeps the environment fresh and hygienic.n\2668\fe0f Hot Water: Hot water is available consistently, which is a big plus.n\+01f5c4\fe0f Storage: Each resident gets a separate cupboard, which is convenient and helps keep things organized.n\+01f35b Food Quality: This is one area that needs improvement. The overall food is okay, but the subji and chapati could be better in terms of taste and freshness.n\+01f9fd Washing Machine: There is only one washing machine available, which often leads to longer waiting times for your turn.nnOverall: It\2019s a decent place with good basic amenities, but food quality\2014especially the main meals\2014and laundry availability could use some improvement.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.518876', 4, 509, 4),
(3082, U&'[Pranay Zalke] My experience at this PG has been very good. Rooms are clean, spacious, and well-maintained. Wi-Fi speed is stable, and there is proper security. The owner is supportive and responds quickly to any issues. Overall, it\2019s a comfortable and safe place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.519014', 4, 509, 4),
(3083, '[Mhetshelo Puro] Room is decent food is also decent according to the budget...nSo far i didn''t face any problem...', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.519139', 5, 509, 4),
(3084, '[ALTAFHUSEN SAIYED] I didn''t want to give 1 star either, this should be in negative.nOwner doesn''t take any accountability and ghosts you when it comes to refund your security money. He stops answering your calls and eventually you endup disappointed.nnAmenities don''t work properly, hygiene is nowhere to find.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.519257', 1, 509, 4),
(3085, U&'[Naveen Patil] Clean rooms, decent food, and supportive management. Good place to stay \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.519378', 4, 509, 4),
(3086, U&'[siddhesh dhomne] Pg is good \+01f44d\+01f3fc all services are good . But pg shuld work to improve food. And cleanliness.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.519497', 3, 509, 4),
(3087, '[Anos Voldigoad] Good pg falls in budget just need some changes here and there and waste management that''s all', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.519659', 3, 509, 4),
(3088, '[Sushanth S] I stayed in shree Balaji PG in last 4 years. My experience was very good.nRooms are clean, food quality is nice, and the environment is comfortable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.519781', 5, 509, 4),
(3089, '[Anuradha Tumbare] Amazing place to stay in Koregaon Park!nI stayed here on a daily basis and loved it. The hostel is super clean and very well maintained every single day.nThe premises are very peaceful, open, and beautifully designed. It has a great vibe with comfortable spaces to sit, relax, or get some work done.nA big thank you to Sushant sir and Jaya mam at the reception. They are very friendly, helpful, and made my check-in and stay so smooth.nAlso, a special mention to the incredible support staff, Mantu uncle and Devaki aunty, who ensure daily cleanliness and maintenance are flawless. Their warm presence make the place feel like home.nWant a hygienic, budget-friendly, and supportive place to stay in KP, this is the best choice!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.546376', 5, 510, 4),
(3090, U&'[Gourav Tiwari] The absolute best place to stay in Koregaon Park!nI had an amazing stay at Hostel Travotale! The location is unbeatable\2014it is right in the heart of Koregaon Park, meaning all the best cafes, lounges, and eateries are just a short walk away. Plus, being so close to the metro station made exploring the rest of Pune incredibly easy.nThe hostel has fantastic spaces to chill. There is a great open common area packed with various board games, which is perfect for meeting fellow travelers. But my absolute favorite spot was the terrace! It\2019s a beautiful place where you can relax, spot various birds during the day, and enjoy the peaceful night skies in the evening.nAs for the amenities, the rooms were spotlessly clean and very well-maintained. A huge shoutout to the staff as well\2014they are super friendly, welcoming, and always ready to help with a smile.nWhether you are a backpacker or a solo traveler, I highly recommend this place! I\2019ll definitely be back.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.546559', 5, 510, 4);          
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3091, '[Anushka] I had a wonderful experience staying at Travotale Hostel u0026 Co-Work. The place is very clean, comfortable, and well-maintained, making it feel like a home away from home. The staff are incredibly friendly, welcoming, and always ready to help with a smile.nnThe co-working space is peaceful and perfect for getting work done, while the hostel has a warm and relaxing atmosphere. I really appreciated the cleanliness, comfort, and overall positive vibe throughout my stay.nnI would definitely recommend Travotale Hostel u0026 Co-Work to anyone looking for a comfortable, clean, and friendly place to stay. Looking forward to staying here again!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.546672', 5, 510, 4),
(3092, U&'[NIK HILL] Had an excellent stay at this hostel \2014 Clean, Comfortable, and Welcoming from the moment I walked in. The Staff Sushant and Jaya are polite and helpful and make this place feel homelynnThe kitchen and bathrooms were always tidy, Common areas are bright and well-maintained, perfect for meeting fellow travelers, and the beds were comfy with secure lockers for peace of mind.nnLocation is ideal, close to public transport and nearby cafes, making it easy to explore the city. Overall, great value for money and a friendly vibe that made my trip much more enjoyable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.546787', 5, 510, 4),
(3093, U&'[joppu joseph] I stayed here for a night and overall had a great experience. The location is the biggest selling point, but I was equally impressed by the cleanliness of the facilities.nThe dorm rooms were spotless, and the shared bathrooms were clearly well-maintained and scrubbed frequently. Even the common areas felt fresh and tidy, which isn''t always easy to find in a shared living space. It\2019s rare to find a spot that\2019s both this central and this well-kept', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.546908', 5, 510, 4),
(3094, '[Suhas N] I had an excellent stay at Travotale, Koregaon Park. From the moment I checked in at around 12:10 AM, the staff was incredibly welcoming, cooperative, and professional. Despite the late hour, the check-in process was smooth and hassle-free.nnThe hotel was exceptionally clean, well-maintained, and comfortable, making my stay very pleasant. The staff''s friendly attitude and willingness to help truly stood out and made me feel valued as a guest.nnI highly recommend Travotale to anyone looking for a clean, comfortable place to stay with outstanding hospitality. I''ll definitely choose this hotel again whenever I''m in Pune!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.547023', 5, 510, 4),
(3095, '[Ashu Ashutosh] I was incredibly happy and had a fabulous experience in this travotale hostel and co work. All the people follow the rules and are disciplined. Tap water is clean and fresh. Very well maintained and the cleanest hostel i have found in pune. I can say this is a premium 3 star to 5 star quality hostel feels like premium hotel at an affordable price', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.547227', 5, 510, 4),
(3096, U&'[Soumyajyoti Halder] Had a great stay here. Prashanth, the manager, was extremely helpful and welcoming throughout. The dorms were neat, clean, and very well maintained. I stayed in the Copper dorm and particularly liked the single-person workstation located just outside the room near the bathroom, its a quiet and practical spot to work. The common work area is also good, and there\2019s an outdoor bench area where you can relax and smoke. Overall, a comfortable stay with a good balance of work and leisure spaces.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.547345', 5, 510, 4),
(3097, '[Amol Sonawane] very good place is to staying here. they also provide , wi-fi, TV ,fan, lights,one tableu0026 chair and bed for your accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.573355', 5, 511, 4),
(3098, U&'[Rushikesh Wadghane] It was a great experience staying here. Rooms are comfortable,it was calm and peaceful place. Good place to stay for a good price.\+01f60a\+01f44d\+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.573731', 5, 511, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3099, '[Prashant Dange] This PG gives me a good experience. Services provided are awesome compared to other .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.573871', 5, 511, 4),
(3100, '[shubham awaghade] Great place, budget friendly', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.573982', 5, 511, 4),
(3101, '[Deepak Bhosale] Best place for PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.575672', 5, 511, 4),
(3102, '[Amit Talukdar] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.577115', 4, 511, 4),
(3103, '[Aman Pal] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.57727', 4, 511, 4),
(3104, '[P Ram] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.577399', 5, 511, 4),
(3105, '[Jon Garcia] My stay was excellent from start to finish. The accommodation was spotless, very well equipped, and tastefully decorated. The location is ideal, with easy access to the main attractions while still being quiet and perfect for relaxing.nnThe host was incredibly friendly and attentive throughout our stay, responding quickly to any questions and making sure I had everything I needed. I truly felt at home.nnI would definitely recommend this accommodation to anyone looking for comfort, peace and quiet, and outstanding hospitality.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.603873', 5, 512, 4),
(3106, U&'[Srikar P] Easy To Go is one of the best co-living spaces I''ve stayed in. The rooms are practical and feel like compact studio apartments, with almost everything you need\2014TV, fridge, microwave, induction, a comfortable couch, and a well balanced attached washroom. The location is excellent, just a short walk from the metro, and they even have parking for four-wheelers. They also have a dedicated app for maintenance and room-cleaning requests, and the response is always quick. A special mention to the property manager, Ashish, who was incredibly helpful, responsive, and made the entire stay smooth and hassle-free.nnThey''ve recently started serving food, which is\00a0 decently good and convenient to have, and for the laundry they do provide couple of washing machines, with only a small inconvenience when it comes to drying clothes. They also offer rooms for short stays or for per night stay, which are great value for money compared to nearby hotels while providing the same amenities. The rent is a little on the higher side, but that''s mainly because of the prime location and the facilities. You''ll also meet people from different states and backgrounds, making it a great place to connect with others. Overall, I had a fantastic experience and would definitely recommend Easy To Go to anyone looking for a comfortable, well-managed, and fully equipped co-living space.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.60409', 5, 512, 4),
(3107, U&'[Kenneth Fernandis] Stayed here during our time in Pune and had a great experience. The location in Koregaon Park was very convenient \2014 close to restaurants, caf\00e9s and markets, while still being in a safe and mostly residential area.nnThe room was spacious, clean and had all the basic amenities needed for a comfortable stay. The interiors were simple, uncluttered and practical. Check-in was seamless and the host was responsive throughout the stay.nnOverall, it offered good value for money and was a comfortable, hassle-free place to stay in KP. Would definitely recommend it to anyone visiting the area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.60423', 4, 512, 4),
(3108, U&'[dishit bhatt] I\2019ve had a wonderful experience staying at House of KP by Union Living for the past three months. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and equipped with all the essential amenities, making the stay very comfortable. The ambiance of the property is pleasant and welcoming.nnA special thanks to the property manager, Ashish, who has been incredibly helpful and supportive throughout my stay. The people and the community at House of KP are also friendly and welcoming, which adds to the overall positive experience.nnI would definitely recommend House of KP by Union Living to anyone looking for a comfortable and well-managed place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.604367', 5, 512, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3109, U&'[Shraddha Shashidhar] Fantastic stay. The staff is very helpful from housekeeping to the managers in the building . It\2019s always clean and well maintained . Food is simple u0026 basic - homely u0026 nice . Thanks a lot for a fantastic few months stay here', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.60449', 5, 512, 4),
(3110, '[Himalayan Tools.] The room has everything you would ever want from an airBNB.nThe location is central near Koregaon park and the guy doing the room management is very effective. But its an Indian building with paper thin walls. Unfortunately the guy next to me had daily long phone conversations til 2am, I could even hear the voice coming from his phone. So sleep, even with earplugs, was a bit of a gamble. Add to that noise from the building opposite where construction was going on.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.604709', 4, 512, 4),
(3111, '[Sushmitha Reddy] I stayed at this property for nearly two weeks, and it was a great experience. The place was very clean, well-maintained, and felt safe at all times. The staff/hosts were extremely supportive and helpful with any requests. I truly enjoyed my stay and would recommend it to others. Special thanks to Ashish and Naman who were always responsive. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.604861', 5, 512, 4),
(3112, '[Aayush Rathod- 25BBA051] Great place to stay! Clean rooms, well-maintained property, and a very supportive management team. Comfortable living with all basic amenities and a good location. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.60506', 5, 512, 4),
(3113, '[Nandkishor Rathod] i   don''t got the hostel . like koregao don''t had samaj kalyan hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.627988', 1, 513, 4),
(3114, '[Bhavesh Dhamone] As usual .nU can''t expect more from govt. : (', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.628127', 2, 513, 4),
(3115, '[Abhishek Singh] Please send me your mobile number..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.62825', 5, 513, 4),
(3116, '[Suraj Madavi] Oopps not reliable to live', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.628369', 4, 513, 4),
(3117, '[Rohit Rathod] Nice pic environment', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.628486', 4, 513, 4),
(3118, '[Sagar Jadhvar] Nice hostel and best facilities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.628602', 5, 513, 4),
(3119, '[chaitanya borude] for adivasi students only', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.628723', 3, 513, 4),
(3120, '[Sanket Yadav] I don''t know', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.628844', 4, 513, 4),
(3121, U&'[Abhay Rathod] We had an experience at Goyal\2019s for my friend for 6 months, and it has been a wonderful experience! The living atmosphere is vibrant and welcoming, making it easy to meet new people and feel at home. The facilities are well-maintained, and the staff ensures that everything runs smoothly.nnA special shout-out to Richa Mam for her support.Staffs are always available to help with any queries or concerns, making the experience even better. I highly recommend it to anyone looking for a comfortable and friendly living space!nnVery good rooms and facilities available. Location is also very prime.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.654947', 5, 514, 4),
(3122, '[Sunita Bhosale] Must must try this place . Located in one of the prime location. Everything is available at 1min walk away. People are nice and owners are very good. Richa mam is polite and sweet. Rooms are very good and well maintained. All amenities available on premises. I will definitely recommend to my friends and family.nnKeep the good work guys :)', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.655084', 5, 514, 4),
(3123, '[Komal Nanaware] Great college accommodation for students in Pune. Superb facilities. The entire place is under CCTV surveillance and is controlled from a CCTV room. There are full time caretakers who helps people in solving issues. More importantly, the rooms are fantastic! The rooms vary in size, but each room has mostly attached washroom, good length wardrobe, storage bed ,side table and furniture. There''s always a security personnel, so the parents can rest assured. No guests are allowed inside the rooms, but that''s a small price to pay for such a great facility. There are convenience stores nearby, rickshaws are easily available and it''s 10 minutes from Symbiosis Viman Nagar.nnOwners are genuine people and helpful.Great work guys .nnThanks for helping us find pg in such good area which feels like home. You will be able to make life long relations there and will cherish it forever.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.65521', 5, 514, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3124, '[Parbati Chaudhary] Goyal''s PG Viman Nagar is a fantastic place for young travelers, digital nomads, and backpackers looking for a good and affordable stay. The modern room design, clean rooms, and comfortable beds make it feel more like living at home . The open space and fast WiFi were great for getting work done, and the common area made it easy to meet new people. The staff was friendly and helpful, and the location is super convenient, close to the airport and great cafes. Any issues faced is taken care of and tried to solved asap. Owners are genuine people and helpful. Richa mam adds value to the place . She is sweet spoken and treats people with kindness. I totally loved living there and will tell my friends also for the same. Also little bit ups and down is always there everywhere but good thing is they try to help and not judge people. Over-all it is really good option for females in viman nagar.Highly recommend!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.655327', 4, 514, 4),
(3125, U&'[Manoj Kumar] We had a really good experience staying at this hostel. The rooms are clean, spacious, and well-maintained, making it comfortable to live here for a long time. The environment is peaceful and safe, which is very important, especially for students.nThe staff  is supportive, cooperative, and always ready to help whenever needed specially Suhana mam . Food quality is good and hygienic, with proper meal timings. Cleanliness is taken seriously in both rooms and common areas.nWhat I liked the most is the friendly atmosphere\2014everyone feels respectful and welcoming, which makes the hostel feel like a home away from home. The location is also convenient, with easy access to nearby markets and areas .nOverall, it\2019s a great place to stay. I would definitely recommend this hostel to anyone looking for a comfortable, safe, and pleasant living experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.65545', 5, 514, 4),
(3126, U&'[Vijaya Jadhav] This pg has been one of the best accommodation so far and I\2019m talking from a working and students perspective. No need to monitor anything because you already have a lot on your plate. These guys are there to help you out. Laundry Wi-Fi food (that too good food) gym and many more things are there. The best 3 things which I find here is that they plan events according to the community by putting polls interacting with the residents to know about their interest, housekeeping team is super hygienic and respectable towards every resident (no foul launguage nothing) they will be just like your househelp who have been working w you since years. Rooms are well maintained and washrooms are clean and hygeinic. Owners are responsible and supportive. You will get to meet new friends here and cherish memory for lifetime.Love the place and will keep loving it forever it\2019s more than just an accommodation. Definitely definitely recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.655603', 5, 514, 4),
(3127, '[Nandani Gawai] Best pg for females in viman Nagar area. Good rooms ,genuine owners and any problem faced is resolved quickly. Rooms are good and rate is affordable.It is value for money. I will definitely recommend this to my friends in Pune.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.655722', 5, 514, 4),
(3128, U&'[Anurag] Highly Recommended \2013 Don\2019t Think Twice!nnThis PG truly stands out because of the great overall vibe. It feels positive, calm, and comfortable from the moment you move in.nnThe caretaker and the owner are genuinely very good- polite, helpful, and always approachable. Any concern is handled quickly, which makes the stay stress-free and smooth.nnThe location in Viman Nagar is excellent, well connected, safe, and surrounded by everything you need for daily living. Overall, this is one of the best PGs in this area, especially if you\2019re looking for comfort, peace, and good management.nYou would also get a kitchen option where you can cook your own food or just order with them.nnWould definitely recommend this place without hesitation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.655838', 5, 514, 4);          
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3129, '[Vivek Gujar] One of the worst management possible. They accept deposit and rent gladly, but at the time of repayment of deposit, they don''t receive your calls. I stayed there for 5 months and now it''s been more than 1 year that they have not repaid me my deposit amount. They receive calls after 2-3 months , tell you that you will be repaid , but don''t repay even after you call them numerous times. I have called them about 100 times but they just don''t receive any calls about repayment or service of any kind.  Cheap and dirty management, I don''t recommend staying there by any means !!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.68052', 1, 515, 4),
(3130, '[Gopal Keshri] My first month experience was good no trouble, no security issue etc. But now I will not recommend this place to anyone. Since I have stayed here for more than 3 Months this is my honest review.n(1) Daily cleanliness : They hardly do cleaning once in a week or sometimes in 2-3 weeknn(2) Water: Water facility is good you get filter water for drinking.nn(3) Security : No Security, I have seen things getting stolen here, Extra precaution is needed otherwise your things will be stolen. Also the flat doors are open in mid night , which is very unsafe anyone can enter here in mid night.nn(4) Network : No Network issue ,Wifi/Internet works good.nn(5) Difficulty in Refunding Security Deposit: Once you leave this place its very difficult to take deposit from them , although they return it but after 20-25 days and Hundereds of call.nn(6) Washrooms: Sometimes , water doesnot come in washroom, On my floor there was only one washroom but on another floor you get 2 washrooms.nnAnd yes beaware of the service boy Mallesh the other service boy is nice but mallesh is not good.He  does not resolve your  isuues/problems , doesnot pick up the calls. He is a scammer.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.680644', 1, 515, 4),
(3131, U&'[EnvoyOP Gaming] All 5 stars review in one day?? Owner trying to increase star rating? It seems all the reviews are fake and done by the owner itself.nJust here to explore the pg''s...nWon''t visit this place as it seems fake...n\+01f44e\+01f44e', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.680774', 1, 515, 4),
(3132, '[Atharv Kakani] I stayed in PG for near about 4 monthsn.....Really bad with management because they still haven''t returned my compensation for the loss of iron(loss was due to the carelessness of care taker) .. Me 4 din se call karrha hun bt management call nahi utha rahi hai....nThink before you join the PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.680893', 1, 515, 4),
(3133, '[Vivek Gupta] The first and foremost thing in pg is behaviour of owner . It is so much good.nRooms and washrooms are clean on daily basis. Some other facilities are also provided by this pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.681011', 5, 515, 4),
(3134, '[Omkar Totala] I live almost 2 months , DON''T GO WITH RHOMESnReally bad management and there service boys also CAN''T REPAY DEPOSIT ON TIME ALMOST 2OR MONTH TO GIVE MY DEPOSIT AFTER XALLING MORE THAN 100 CALLS TO OWNER AND MANAGEMENT', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.68117', 1, 515, 4),
(3135, '[deepak jain] One of the best pg in the area. Neat, Spacious and affordable too... Highly recommendable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.681284', 5, 515, 4),
(3136, '[vedant sharma] A very good place for hostel...The facility of room provider is very good and they are very connected with us for any problem relating the hostel...Vivek bhaiyaa is always ready for us for any problem relating to the room and hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.681397', 5, 515, 4),
(3137, U&'[Priyanka Kolpe] \201cI had a very good experience at Subhadra PG. The rooms are clean, the environment is safe, and the facilities are well maintained. The owner and staff are helpful and cooperative. It is a comfortable place to stay for students and working women. Highly recommended!\201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.708614', 5, 516, 4),
(3138, '[Yashika Papne] all inclusive for a very affordable price. the owner is friendly u0026 accomodating. meals are also good. safe environment u0026 everything is available at a short distance. will definitely lodge here again.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.708835', 5, 516, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3139, U&'[Dhanashree Baswante] It was a good experience. It was affordable u0026 the management has very good u0026 very homely . Aunty''s nature is really kind u0026 helpful.Aunty was very familiar to all girls . Aunty treats u like their own child .Very safe u0026 good environment of pg .I highly recommend this pg \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.708958', 5, 516, 4),
(3140, U&'[Lavina Sharma] Stayed here for 3 months. Chhaya Aunty is very caring, and the accommodation is safe and comfortable. Thanks a lot to everyone for your support \2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.709079', 5, 516, 4),
(3141, '[Sunita Kumawat] Very nice PG 100% recommended the food is pure homely made rooms are clean and ventilated each amenities is very good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.709255', 5, 516, 4),
(3142, U&'[Bharti Kharate] It was a good experience 1 year staying in this Pg. It was affordable and the management has very good and very homely. Aunty''s nature is really kind and helpful. Delicious meal and safe environment. I really enjoyed my stay, whenever I am in Pune, this will be my place to stay. Owner will always try all the possible way to make us stay very comfortable.nThank u Aunty \263a\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.709373', 5, 516, 4),
(3143, U&'[Nain K] I am leaving this PG due to family reasons, but my stay here was amazing. The PG is very clean, and the food is delicious. Aunty is extremely supportive and cares for everyone like family. One of the best things is that she provides a cooler in every room during summer, ensuring a comfortable stay. The environment is safe, especially for girls. I highly recommend this PG for anyone looking for a secure and homely place to stay\2728 thank you soo much Aunty for everything \+01f618\+01fac2', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.709491', 5, 516, 4),
(3144, U&'[Tejaswini Gholap] Very nice pg and aunty was very familiar to all girls and each every thing is comfortable and good I highly recommend this pg to all girl\2019s whoever wants to join , thank u', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.709609', 5, 516, 4),
(3145, '[Anna] Fantastic Experience in Pune while studying. Great hostel with lots of facilities ( Washing Machine, Lift, Aquaguard, WiFi u0026 Parking Facility). Really spacious and clean!nnRector u0026 Admin staff are polite u0026 helpful. They try to Resolve problems (if any) at the earliest.nnArea is good, worth the bucks.  Recommend this hostel if you are looking in Sinhagad Road Area.nnPs: Washing machine is always occupied. It''s tough to wash clothes with a single machine for whole building.nnUpdate: They have installed one more machine. Now waiting time has reduced significantly!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.739055', 5, 517, 4),
(3146, '[Amit] Best experience of living. Daily cleanliness maintained. Drinking water is of purifier. To wash cloth ,2  washing machines available. Ample space for 2 wheeler parking. Vegetarian Food service is also available within hostel. Rooms are large enough than regular space normally available. Lift facility provided. Overall it is one of the best hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.739254', 5, 517, 4),
(3147, U&'[Mukesh Patro] It\2019s been 1 yr since I\2019m staying in this hostel , the facilities provided here is superb and hygiene is also maintained all time. Ayush bhaiya is the person managing the hostel who is very humble and taking most care of students and hostel too.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.739379', 5, 517, 4),
(3148, '[Sonu Das] Very very  hygienic rooms with well behaved staffs and all basic amenities needed for everyday tasks', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.739498', 5, 517, 4),
(3149, '[Aditya Zawar] One of the best decisions of mine was to move to this hostel. The hostel is very well maintained, with all top class facilities provided at a very reasonable price. Also, the management is very co-operative and available to help 24/7. Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.739611', 5, 517, 4),
(3150, '[AYUSH SANANDA] Yes its been 1 month now its newly opened hostel for boys and seriously guys in this amount you will never get this much amenities and services they are givingnDaily floor cleaningnDaily dustingnDaily washroom toilet cleaningnAll are done by time to timenAlso manager is coperativenYou can ask for any help 5g wifi washing machinenWorth its visit one you will definitely like it', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.739799', 5, 517, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3151, '[Sumit Deshmukh] Why should I lie yeah it''s very good place to staynI like suggest this hostel for studentsnVery good environment of study you can focus you can meditate in balcony worth it worth stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.740353', 5, 517, 4),
(3152, '[Shaikh Saood] It was great stay for us guys seriously not kidding they provide very good service also ayush bhaiya very decent guy he understands the real situation . all amenities are good we feel like we were staying in a hotel neat clean and hygienic place worth for money', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.74049', 5, 517, 4),
(3153, '[Arth Wankhede] I stayed in this PG for 1.5 year and overall my experience was good. The rooms are clean and well maintained. The facilities like Wi-Fi, water supply, and electricity are reliable. The environment is peaceful and suitable for students and working people. The owner and staff are helpful and responsive if any issues arise. The location is also convenient with nearby shops and transport. Overall, it is a comfortable and affordable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.766345', 5, 518, 4),
(3154, '[Krushna Gayke] Initially, for the first 2 months, the PG service was good. Cleaning was done regularly, and the WiFi worked properly. However, after that, the overall service quality declined significantly.nnThe cleaning was not done properly, and the WiFi became extremely unreliable, which was a major issue for me since I work from home. Even after raising complaints multiple times, the caretaker did not respond properly, and the owner never seemed to take the issues seriously.nnAnother major issue was the delay in returning the security deposit after leaving the PG. I had to follow up multiple times to get updates.nnAdditionally, I later contacted them again for a 10-day stay. They collected an advance amount and deposit, but due to a medical emergency, I could not stay there and left within 10 minutes. Even in this situation, they did not return my deposit on time and were not responding properly unless I continuously followed up. They also deducted some amount from the deposit without informing me about such charges at the time of booking.nnOverall, my experience started well but became disappointing due to poor management, lack of responsiveness, unreliable WiFi, and issues with deposit handling.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.766472', 2, 518, 4),
(3155, '[Anil Jaiswal] A sweet home away from my home.nAs a banker I have visited many place of India and lived in many PG but my experience about krushna kunj boys hostel was amazing.nHere I got everything great services, cleaning, good behavioural staff and many more things.nI again thanks to all colleagues and supporting staff to becoming memorable moment.nnThanksnAnil jaiswalnIcici bank branch sales manager', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.766601', 5, 518, 4),
(3156, '[Ashut Pujari] I have been staying in this PG for the past one year and my experience has been very positive. The PG is well maintained and the overall cleanliness standards are consistently good which makes the living environment comfortable and hygienic.nI would especially like to appreciate the support provided by the caretakers. Mr. Sidharth is extremely helpful and always available whenever assistance is required. The other staff members, Mr. Sahil and Mr. Ritesh, are also very cooperative and supportive.nOne of the best aspects of this PG is the strong focus on cleanliness. The owner personally supervises the cleaning process and ensures that proper cleaning is carried out regularly. In fact the owner also verifies the work by checking photos after the cleaning is completed which shows the seriousness and commitment towards maintaining hygiene.nOverall the management, staff support and cleanliness make this PG a reliable and comfortable place to stay. I would highly recommend it to anyone looking for a well managed and clean PG accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.766717', 5, 518, 4),
(3157, '[Aditya] I had a great stay at this hostel. The rooms were clean and well-maintained, and the staff was very friendly and helpful. The environment is peaceful and safe, which makes it perfect for students. Facilities like Wi-Fi, and security are good. Overall, a comfortable and value-for-money place to stay. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.766847', 5, 518, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3158, '[Pawan Shelke] Kindly read the group msgs for real n true review as most of the reviews are fake and owner may asks for good review for 100% refund amount.nShortly-  1 wifi issuen2 water supply issuen3 parking issuen4 geyser issuesn5 local goons issue and owner also threats about the same... Can read in screenshotn6 high rent no servicen7 cleaning issuen8 drinking water issuenAnd much more...read chatting in screenshot of the official krushna kunj group.nGiven 5 star jst to stay top in the review list...nNot worthit to stay there are much more better places under 6000/-nNo electric appliances allowed here. Where i am staying now has no such restrictions.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.766984', 5, 518, 4),
(3159, '[Kartikey Bagdi] Great experience with this PG. The management was very responsive, and my refund was processed quickly and smoothly. Really appreciate their prompt service and professionalism. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.767105', 5, 518, 4),
(3160, '[Shrey Dubey] Best amites for co-livingnGood for college students and also for professional.nI stayed for 10 months rooms are good and clean even Manager is also very supportive.nSiddharth bhaiya is very kind guy.nEven Sachin sir is also good at taking responsibility.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.767217', 5, 518, 4),
(3161, '[Ashutosh Ingle] The hostel is for students who are economically backward and can''t afford a stay outside their hometown. The hostel has a great building and the cleaning is top notch. You can''t get outside such a quality of food you get here. The students get breakfast,lunch and dinner for free. You have to submit application form to get the admission. The admission process starts almost in the month of june. Then the merit list is set out and the students are taken on the base of their income,caste and percentage. SC students have the highest probability to get admission here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.819416', 5, 520, 4),
(3162, '[Salim Shaikh] The Samaj kalyan hostel is the best for migrants and poor students. Hostel provided all of free of cost.The place of Hostel environmentaly clean and fresh..nHostel building is newly made in the hostel rooms excellent facilities. Hostel admission is offline you can visit hostel and take admission...................', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.819914', 5, 520, 4),
(3163, '[Pratik Dhotre] Very Good accommodation for those whose family background is not much more capable. To get Addition in hostel you have to fill offline form which is available in hostel. Generally admssions started in june-july month. It is totally depend on your marks.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.820098', 4, 520, 4),
(3164, U&'[Sumit Ingole] This are not one but 3hostels all are govt . Facilities are awesome and free .mess is also goodnGiving some info..nMandatory documents (\092e\0939\0924\094d\0935\093e\091a\0940 \0906\0935\0936\094d\092f\0915 \0915\093e\0917\0926\092a\0924\094d\0930):nnLatest mark-sheet (\092e\093e\0930\094d\0915\0936\093f\091f)nnSchool leaving and/or college/university transfer certificate (\0936\093e\0933\093e/\0915\0949\0932\0947\091c \0938\094b\0921\0932\094d\092f\093e\091a\093e \0926\093e\0916\0932\093e)nnBoard certificate (\092c\094b\0930\094d\0921 \0926\093e\0916\0932\093e)nnCaste certificate (\091c\093e\0924\0940\091a\093e \0926\093e\0916\0932\093e)nnIncome certificate (\0909\0924\094d\092a\0928\094d\0928\093e\091a\093e \0926\093e\0916\0932\093e)nnThree (3) passport size photos. Make sure all these photos are same. (\0969 \092a\093e\0938\092a\094b\0930\094d\091f \0938\093e\0908\091c \092b\094b\091f\094b)nnCaste verification certificate (if asked) (\091c\093e\0924 \092a\0921\0924\093e\0933\0923\0940 \0926\093e\0916\0932\093e - \0935\093f\091a\093e\0930\0932\094d\092f\093e\0938)nnDomicile certificate\00a0(if asked) (\0930\0939\093f\0935\093e\0938\0940 \0926\093e\0916\0932\093e - \0935\093f\091a\093e\0930\0932\094d\092f\093e\0938)nnNationality certificate (if asked) (\0930\093e\0937\094d\091f\094d\0930\0940\092f\0924\094d\0935\093e\091a\093e \0926\093e\0916\0932\093e - \0935\093f\091a\093e\0930\0932\094d\092f\093e\0938)nnOptional (good to have) documents (\0916\093e\0932\0940\0932 \0915\093e\0917\0926\092a\0924\094d\0930 \0905\0938\0932\094d\092f\093e\0938 \0909\0924\094d\0924\092e):nnIdentity proof (School / College / University I-Card OR Election Card OR Passport OR Driving Licence OR Aadhaar Card OR PAN Card etc.) (\0913\0933\0916\092a\0924\094d\0930)nnAddress proof (Light-bill, Passport, Aadhaar etc.) (\0930\093e\0939\0924 \0905\0938\0932\094d\092f\093e\091a\093e \092a\0941\0930\093e\0935\093e)nnAge proof (mentioned in your school leaving and/or college/university transfer certificate) (\0935\092f\093e\091a\093e \092a\0941\0930\093e\0935\093e)nnNOC (No Objection Certificate)nnStuden''s bank account passbook (\0935\093f\0926\094d\092f\093e\0930\094d\0925\094d\092f\093e\091a\0902 \092c\0901\0915 \092a\093e\0938\092c\0941\0915)nnAdditional (good to have) Things:nnTwo envelopsnnPostage stampsnnRevenew stampsnnBoth blue and black ink pensnnPencil and erasernnAdditional xerox (at least two copies) of all the documents you havennStapler with enough staple pinsnnEligibility (\092a\093e\0924\094d\0930\0924\093e)nn10th (for Junior college education)nn11th (for 12th education)nn12th (for Senior college education)nnGraduation (for Post Graduation education)nnPost Graduation (for M.Phil, Ph.D etc. education)nnGraduation (or last year of graduation) (for competitive - UPSC/MPSC/Bank Probationary Officer/Staff Selection etc. - examination you will have to take admission in college, university)nnDistance\00a0- from your current location to the expected hostel location. The more the distance, the more chances to get admission in hostel.n(\0935\093f\0926\094d\092f\093e\0930\094d\0925\094d\092f\093e\091a\0902\00a0\0930\093e\0939\0924 \0920\093f\0915\093e\0923 \0905\0928 \0924\0941\092e\091a\0940 \0936\093e\0933\093e/\0915\0949\0932\0947\091c/\0935\093f\0926\094d\092f\093e\092a\0940\0920 \092f\093e\0924\0940\0932 \0905\0902\0924\0930)nnNeed\00a0- It is important that you ''really'' need the hostel. Hostel rector checks your need also.n(\0935\093f\0926\094d\092f\093e\0930\094d\0925\094d\092f\093e\091a\0940 \0939\0949\0938\094d\091f\0947\0932\091a\0940 \0928\093f\0915\0921/\0917\0930\091c \0915\093f\0924\0940 \0906\0939\0947)nnIncome\00a0- The income limit mentions in the form.n(\0918\0930\093e\0924\0940\0932 \090f\0915\0942\0923 \0909\0924\094d\092a\0928\094d\0928)nnShould be able to pay hostel''s monthly/yearly fees (not always but if mentioned in the form. Mostly applicable to private hostels only.)nnSelection Criteria (\0928\093f\0935\0921\0940\091a\0947 \0928\093f\0915\0937)nnSelection criteria mostly based on the eligibility points.nnYou should first get an admission.nnDistance\00a0matters the most in selection criteria. For example if you are leaving in Nagpur, and got admission in Pune, then you fit in the criteria.nnYour hostel\00a0need\00a0gets checked before and during the process. If at any stage, concern person noticed that you are not in need of hostel, your application will be rejected.nnShould be able to pay hostel''s monthly/yearly fees (if mentioned in the form)nnQuantity\00a0- There are always limited seats available in all hostels. That means, the selection happens on\00a0first-come first-serve\00a0basis. So you have to apply as soon as possible.nnGender\00a0- If a hostel is specifically for females, then only female candidates can apply.nIf a hostel is only for males, then only male candidates can apply.nIf a hostel is for both males and females, then both male and female candidates can apply.nnIncome\00a0- Hostels run for needy candidates. The income limit also mentions in the form', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.820235', 5, 520, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3165, '[Chaitanya Waghmare] It is very good accomodation also food facility and all the thing which are free if cost.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.820371', 5, 520, 4),
(3166, '[VIDYADHAR SHINDE] Better Hostel to stay for poor and merit  students totally controlled by the Government of Maharashtra. Provide too much facilities than expected and also provide stipend to students who get admission in this Hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.820494', 5, 520, 4),
(3167, '[krushna hankare] It''s important for student and good facility in hostel i.e library, cleaning, playing, eating, hot water, cold water, computer section, wife for information about study knowledge,  TV for news  etc.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.820622', 5, 520, 4),
(3168, '[Rohit Bagade] Hostel is very nice ! So many things are good in hostel.It is not like a hostel it is like a home. It all  control by maharashtra government.It is very important for poor students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.820743', 4, 520, 4),
(3169, '[Amit] Good rooms with a balcony, mini kitchen, and water heater. The ambiance is pleasant and comfortable. An open shared kitchen and washing machine are available. A clothesline is provided for hanging clothes, and a lockable wardrobe is available for safely storing clothes and personal belongings.nThe location is very good with many eateries nearby. The two-sharing room was satisfactory and well maintained. Overall, this is one of the best places you can get in Pune at this price. As a Malayali, I felt comfortable staying here. Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.845439', 5, 521, 4),
(3170, '[Karuna kar Mandali] Good facilities, well maintained. Good PG in Viman Nagar,Good place for transportation and communication between the different places.Near by bus station and metro station,Food is good, affordable price', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.84591', 5, 521, 4),
(3171, '[PRITHVI KUMAR] Nice PG, food is okay okaynRooms are clean , WiFi, washing machine is also available', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.846113', 5, 521, 4),
(3172, '[gangadhar ontela] nice pg near viman nagar area,Food is okay,rooms are goodnbike Parking is also availablenRent is affordable', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.846254', 5, 521, 4),
(3173, '[Riya Kumari] Sai srinivasa pg is good and clean,I stayed here for around year.the environment inand around the pg is quite friendly,the food is ok ok', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.846371', 4, 521, 4),
(3174, '[srinivasarao kotipalli] Good PG for boys in viman nagar area,all facilities available on premises.nGood room and washrooms,good people and crowd available herennRoom are very well maintained and washrooms are good.nOverall it is a good experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.846491', 5, 521, 4),
(3175, '[Shivshagar kumar] This paying guest has really exceeded all my expectations and honestly speaking it is  value for money and more over owners are very helpful...I booked for myself with the help of Google search  and got good pricing with quality room and was in constant followup ...More over I was very happy with all the facilities provided, rooms are of big size and modern.nFood was very tasty and they made sure about hygiene and cleanliness.nnNo restrictions is there and Owners are very cooperative and welcoming.nThey made sure if there is any issue it is addressed quickly and solved. They treated us like family member and I felt like home there.nnI would definitely definitely suggest this place to all my friends relatives and family as I have myself lived here and my experience was simply awesome.nnstrongly recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.846604', 5, 521, 4),
(3176, '[Rushikesh Santosh Anarse C-28] Good Hostel for boys. All facilities are available like washing machine, filter, geyser.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.846723', 4, 521, 4),
(3177, U&'[Jatin Agarwal] Overall, staying here has been a good experience. Rooms are clean, basic facilities work fine, and the vibe is pretty chill.nnBig shoutout to Ganesh Bhaiya, Rajendra Guard Uncle, and Vikas Bhaiya\+01f468\200d\+01f373. Rajendra Uncle keeps things safe and handles everything calmly without being rude. Ganesh is quick to sort out any room issues.nnAnd Vikas Bhaiya is a gem in the kitchen - we really enjoy the food here. He actually listens and tries to make dishes according to ourntaste and wishes, which is rare.nnIf you want a hostel with staff who genuinely care, from security to food, this one\2019s solid.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.872439', 5, 522, 4);        
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3178, '[Madhur Gundecha] We had a very positive experience. My son needed temporary accommodation while transitioning to a new place and preparing for his exams. I wasn''t aware that rooms were available on a day-use basis, and this option proved very helpful. The entire process, from onboarding to check-out, was smooth, transparent, and professionally managed. Everything was handled efficiently, which made a potentially stressful situation much easier. Thank you for the support and flexibility.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.872876', 5, 522, 4),
(3179, '[Anshumaan Singh] I think the Vidyaniketan staff and team are skilled and well trained. The Warden Mr. Ganesh Bhaiya is really helpful And quick at responding. Watchman, uncle is Very strict about the timing Still very nice and soft spoken. I am also satisfied with the cleaning staff. The best part of within Ketan is the Mess and the food that we are getting. The food is hygienic and very tasty.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.873187', 5, 522, 4),
(3180, U&'[Vesta Acc] Everyone seems very cooperative in the beginning, but over time they end up causing a lot of problems. The security guard is really nice and helpful, but Ganesh Kaka always seems to have an issue with everything. Also, don\2019t expect the food quality to remain the same as it was when you first joined\2014it tends to get worse over time.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.873408', 1, 522, 4),
(3181, '[Bodhayan Basu] Had a great stay here , no problems at all. Very diligent housekeeping , everyday. And especially ganesh kaka and rajendra ji were really lovely and helpful in making my stay good and memorable', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.873536', 5, 522, 4),
(3182, '[Shreyash Chavan] Amazing amazing amazing hostel surfacenA1 staffnRoom is cleaned every single daynI had a plant in my room and when I was not there the staff watered it regularlynFood is on another levelnBest quality of food available herenHostel supervisor ganesh uncle is so helpful any of any problem is there it is sorted out within minutes the watchman uncle is also very sweet', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.873654', 5, 522, 4),
(3183, '[Archit Badkul] Living here for the past 2 years. Great experience overall. Food quality is very good and consistent, rooms are decent, and all basic facilities are well maintained.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.873771', 5, 522, 4),
(3184, U&'[Jaydev joshi] Staff is exceptionally good , the services , warden dada , gaurd dada and cooking staff are very warm n welcoming . From food to cleanliness of rooms and other services it is great . Having a great time here staying . \+01faf6\+01f3fd\2728', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.873889', 5, 522, 4),
(3185, '[Akshat Jaiswal] I stayed here for almost a year, and my overall experience was excellent. The hostel is well maintained, clean, and provides a comfortable living environment. All the basic amenities are available, making day to day life very convenient.nnThe location is another big advantage, with easy access to nearby markets and transportation. A special mention to Rahul Bhaiya, who is extremely helpful, approachable, and always ready to assist whenever needed. His support really makes a difference.nnIf you''re looking for a clean, convenient, and well managed hostel with great service, I would definitely recommend this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.902528', 5, 523, 4),
(3186, '[Susmita Jaigadi] My brother Harsh Jaigadi stayed at Alpine hostel for 2 years. His experience was really nice. Rooms are clean and spacious.also they provide basic amenities with good wifi. Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.902735', 5, 523, 4),
(3187, '[Sandip Rathod] I stayed at Alpine Hostel Services for a few months and overall had a very good experience. The rooms were neat and hygienic, and all basic facilities were provided. The management was cooperative and quick to respond to any issues. The location is convenient, especially for students and working professionals. It feels safe and comfortable. Definitely a good place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.902854', 5, 523, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3188, U&'[Chinmay Swami] Really nice boys hostel on Senapati Bapat road, Pune. The rooms are clean and comfortable with a homely atmosphere. Mr Rahul Advani is very cooperative and is always available whenever needed. It\2019s a great place for students and working professionals!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.902971', 5, 523, 4),
(3189, '[Sameer Panchpor] One of best boys hostel on SB road, Pune.nThe hostel is clean, safe and has a very positive atmosphere. Rahul Advani is very helpful and manages everything really well. Would definitely recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.903092', 5, 523, 4),
(3190, '[Abhijeet Kamble] Great experience at Alpine Hostel on SB Road, Pune. Clean rooms, good environment, and very well managed. Rahul Advani is very supportive and ensures everyone is comfortable. Highly recommended boys hostel in Pune.!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.903213', 5, 523, 4),
(3191, '[Karthik Sarva] Excellent service and all facilities available like washing machine, wifi, induction fridge and a terrace space where we can do our work and look at the surrounding mountains you can cook and cleaning is done everyday.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.903327', 5, 523, 4),
(3192, '[Royal Singh] Comfortable and very affordable for students. Provides basic facilities. Located near symbiosis college. Best accommodation for students. Highly recommended', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.903441', 5, 523, 4),
(3193, '[Kedar Joshi] Pathetic experience. Charged 350 per night... Too much compared to experience. Bunk bed not cleaned. Pillow is too much dirty. Mosquitos and small insects are all the hostels. Mr. Mishra... Owner of the hostel, not answering in right manner. Common toilets not cleaned.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.932184', 1, 524, 4),
(3194, U&'[Thrishul Gowda B N] I stayed at Sunny''s Boys Hostel in Pune for 5 days with 8 of my friends, and it was a really good experience. The place was very affordable and had great facilities. We had 24/7 hot water and free Wi-Fi, and though the AC was available only at night, it was comfortable.nThere were a few mosquitoes at night, and the bathrooms were a bit small, but they were clean and usable.nnThe highlight was the terrace \2013 it had mini gym equipment, a smart TV, and even a cooking option, making it a perfect place to chill and spend time with friends.nOverall, it was one of the best places for group stays at a reasonable price.nnThank you to Goibibo for providing a great offer and helping us book this wonderful stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.932393', 4, 524, 4),
(3195, '[Rishabh Bhargava] Worth it!nBest fit from Budget perspective.nThe washrooms were clean and Hot water was available 24/7.nHad a nice and comfortable stay at this place.nWould recommend this to others as well.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.932527', 5, 524, 4),
(3196, U&'[Puneetpal Sharma] I had a great experience during my recent stay. It''s a budget-friendly option that doesn''t compromise on comfort or essential amenities. The room was well-equipped with a washing machine, television, geyser, and access to cafeteria facilities, which made the stay even more convenient. What truly stood out was the supportive and courteous behavior of the staff (Mishra ji) \2013 always ready to help and made sure everything was taken care of. Highly recommended for travelers looking for a value-for-money and comfortable stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.93265', 5, 524, 4),
(3197, '[eema yo] The place has been closed.nI visited the building last week.nThe building was vacant.nnKindly confirm if has shifted to a different location.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.932774', 3, 524, 4),
(3198, U&'[Ayush shah] It was a smooth experience but ya if you want any extra facility then it has a charge so for towel 50\20b9 charge is there and also if you want a lower bunk bed then it also has a different charge. Suitable for solo travelers just washrooms needs to be renovated it''s is just usable not too good not too bad.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.932891', 3, 524, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3199, '[Moinak Bera] Very nice comfy hostel in budget with all essentials beds are available as per budget', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.933009', 5, 524, 4),
(3200, '[Akshat Khurana] Best place ever! Stayed here for 7 days and didn''t face a single problem or issue. The owner Rupesh is also very sweet and friendly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.933138', 5, 524, 4),
(3201, U&'[Hitesh Chhatralia] In Google they show you the pictures of exc\00e9llent location with bytes from students, that is all fake. When I visited, it was a chawl a ruined place. Worst place. Do not go there at all.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.996', 1, 526, 4),
(3202, U&'[Prasad Tambe] I had a great experience staying at this boys'' hostel. The facilities are well-maintained, and the rooms are clean and comfortable. The staff is friendly and always ready to help with any concerns. The location is also convenient, with easy access to transportation and nearby shops. Overall, it\2019s a safe and affordable place to stay, and I would highly recommend it to anyone looking for a good hostel experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.996309', 5, 526, 4),
(3203, '[Avinash Gund] The environment is friendly and supportive, perfect for students. Rooms are well-maintained, clean, and comfortable. The food is hygienic and tastes like home most days, which is a big plus. Security is strict and 24/7, so we always feel safe. The management is responsive and makes sure everything runs smoothly. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a safe and student-friendly hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.996445', 5, 526, 4),
(3204, U&'[Siddhant] Staying at this hostel was honestly one of the worst experiences I\2019ve had. The four-sharing rooms are massively overpriced for what you get.nThe food is ok on some days but on some days the food is terrible .It\2019s excessively oily and feels unhealthy to eatnnThe staff clearly seem underpaid and overworked, and it shows. They\2019re not rude, but they\2019re visibly frustrated.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.99657', 1, 526, 4),
(3205, '[Danish Suhail] Didn''t live upto the bold promises they made, I feel bad for the staff who work here, they are under paid and overworked. And asking 3.5Lakhs per person for a 4 sharing room is absolutely diabolical. They went to every room and asked for a 5 star review just after a month of moving into this hostel, nah I ain''t do that. Pay your staff well.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.996704', 1, 526, 4),
(3206, '[X_aarav_X] A very good place to staynWith luxury facilitiesnHave not seen a hostel this good', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.996832', 5, 526, 4),
(3207, '[Shashank Singh] It really frustrated me whatever the promises they had made... Was never meet by them even their mess food was also worst and don''t take the whole 1 year package whatever they offer that was another style of stealing money... You can get it from other places... there are plenty of food store', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.996953', 1, 526, 4),
(3208, '[sharada pisal] My son is being stay in Metrocity hostel vanaz from last 2 year.nMetrocity Hostel is a well-regarded accommodation option for male students and working professionals seeking a secure and comfortable living environment..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:17.997275', 5, 526, 4),
(3209, '[Dhrunal Thakur] The rajyog boys hostel was best hostel in pune,nBecause they maintain the perfect cleanliness, and about the behavior of the owner was kind.nI will suggest this hostel if anyone was searching for good and budget friendly hostel in pune.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.022721', 5, 527, 4),
(3210, '[Aman Bodkhe] No doubt this is the osm hostel with polite owner i recommend this hostel to live in cleaning is done by after 2 days. there is no reason to reject itnMelodi Khao Khud Jaan Jao', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.022856', 4, 527, 4),
(3211, '[Ishant sontakke] This PG is a fantastic place to live! The atmosphere is great and the owners are very helpful. The rooms are clean.I highly recommend this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.023043', 5, 527, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3212, U&'[Sumit Khandagale] Best PG for boys \+01f44c neat and clean owner is very friendly and helpful \+01f44d they provide WiFi, hot water, Water filter and daily cleaning.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.023177', 5, 527, 4),
(3213, '[Ankush Shaiwale] Best place to stay  for bachelor special for those who r preparing for  higher level of examination and all ....', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.0233', 5, 527, 4),
(3214, '[Rushikesh Mahale] Great hostel -full of facilities', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.023422', 5, 527, 4),
(3215, '[Nairith B-127] Friendly u0026 supportivenBest hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.023545', 5, 527, 4),
(3216, '[Devidas Langote] Friendly owner u0026 cooperative u0026 excellent ambiance', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.02366', 5, 527, 4),
(3217, U&'[cricket jet] BJ Medical Gents Hostel is one of the best places to stay. Peaceful environment, beautiful surroundings, good mess, comfortable rooms, and a nice playground. Every day is filled with enjoyment, fun, and great memories with friends. I really love this hostel and my hostel life here.\+01f90d\+01f31f\+01f973\+01f64c\+01f3fb\+01f64c\+01f3fb\+01f64c\+01f3fb', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.05436', 5, 528, 4),
(3218, U&'[Shivam] These will be your best years of your life\2026.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.0545', 5, 528, 4),
(3219, '[sahil Kathe] Hostel Life is best. Hostel has a good surrounding garden, ground, cannten, mess great life here .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.054621', 4, 528, 4),
(3220, '[Rajeshri L] Gents hostel just opposite to the hospital and medical clg .nHas a peaceful env with well maintained  campus.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.054737', 4, 528, 4),
(3221, U&'[Umakant Patil] Have lived there my entire undergraduation.. arguably the best hostel a government medical college could offer.nWith a lot of greenery and chaos free environment despite being in the heart of the Pune City.nIf you have got an admission into BJGMC pune don\2019t let people trick you saying don\2019t take a hostel we can rent a flat and blah blah blah\2026! Yeah, maybe you won\2019t get all the comfort of a flat or a home but what you will get is beyond just a habitat for 4- years of MBBS. Good Luck!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.054854', 4, 528, 4),
(3222, U&'[tushar khade] It''s not just hostel,it is heaven\2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.054969', 5, 528, 4),
(3223, '[Tushar Kalkumbe] Very good Infrastructure.nVery spacious rooms and washrooms are clean with washing machine facility available.nThere is garden in front and space reserved for parking.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.055086', 5, 528, 4),
(3224, '[Anish Daga] Surely the best hostel in the town.Its like family far from home or 2nd home for the students of this prestigious institute.Speaking of facilities it has everything you need and greenery around makes it more special.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.055199', 5, 528, 4),
(3225, '[ELDHO THOMAS] Its a good place to stay for those who came here for the first time. its like big dormetry. Stay is fine and you can find good food outside the hostel for one month here around 2400 rupees. Bathroom facility is poor...overall good place to stay for first time. And for students its a good option. privacy is also an issue.but for this rate and among other hostels this is much better.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.087189', 4, 529, 4),
(3226, U&'[KrishnaKumar Vibhute] I want to tell you a my worst experience at siddhivinayk hostel , the hostel very worst they don\2019t have any management is very unsupportive .nAnd also they don\2019t clean the hostel flores and also the washrooms this hostel is very unhygienic and in this hostel bedbucks  have big issue and thew don\2019t resolve the issue after compliant many times.nI hope you don\2019t go to this worst hostel .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.087369', 1, 529, 4),
(3227, '[Sakshi yedage] It is very costly according other hostel 4000rs per head and facility is not provided according to this price points 1. Hot water 2.water purifier. Cleaning is also not done by regular', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.087526', 2, 529, 4);     
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3228, '[prashant lonkar] Best condition of rooms at most highlighted place. Do visit if you looking for comfortable stay for reasonable price.nThank you', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.087681', 5, 529, 4),
(3229, '[Abhishek Bhise] Well for who came in Pune for educational/job purposes situated in middle of pune city near from railway station and chhtrapati Shivaji Maharaj nagar if live in this hostel and you go wherever in Pune from this hostel then you are in right place', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.087804', 4, 529, 4),
(3230, '[Gaurav Powar] The receptionist was eating gutka. Looks very nice in photo but in reality very dirty place. Never go here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.087923', 1, 529, 4),
(3231, '[Rakesh Shahapurkar] Best hostel for Students in reasonable price, good management and coordination by owner.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.088034', 5, 529, 4),
(3232, U&'[Suraj Bhise] Best Place In Pune...For Students u0026 Tourist..\+01f4ab\+01f44dnnSiddivinayak Hostels All over In Pune..\270c', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.088158', 5, 529, 4),
(3233, U&'[Vansh Jaiswal] \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50 5/5 \2013 Fantastic Stay!nnI had an amazing experience at this hostel!nRooms: Super clean, well-maintained. The beds were really comfortable charging ports for each guest. The air conditioning worked perfectly, and the shared bathrooms were spotless and regularly cleaned.nnFood: Absolutely delicious! The hostel offers a variety of meals throughout the day, and the breakfast was a great way to start the morning  eggs, local dishes.They also had vegetarian options, which was a huge plus.nnHighly recommend for both solo travelers and groups looking for a comfortable and budget-friendly place with top-notch amenities!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.207457', 5, 533, 4),
(3234, '[Sanchit Jouhri] Finding such a great room in Pune is very hard. The landlords are very kind and very helpful. Also the breakfast and dinner and lunch taste is very amazing (ghar jaisa taste). And also it is very low cost. If your group is looking for a hostel in Pune in maharishi nagar. This is the place for you', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.20762', 5, 533, 4),
(3235, '[Shobhit Verma] Best hostel for boys. Mr. Ganesh, the hostel owner and his wife serve the meals also at a very low price. The taste of the food is awesome. Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.207731', 5, 533, 4),
(3236, '[Ganesh Chavhan] One of the best Boys Hostel in Maharshi Nagar and Mukund Nagar area, all necessary things available in nearby market, CDAC Institute,market yard and other college/Institute are in walkable distance and facility of public transport near 100 mtr from hostel..also very close to Swarget bus depot.nnMy experience regarding Food and stay..I must say its second home for me..as the owner treat us like there family members, and on daily basis provides tasty and hot home cooked food, including brekfast, lunch dinner and evening snack, tea as well.nSo no worries about your helth, coz you will get healthy and delicious food every time of the day. As I work in morning shift so even that early 7:30 AM time also owner aunty provides fresh (chapati+bhaji) Tiffin to carry to office.nnYou must stay here then only you can feel and experience the reality and you will definitely #miss this place and family care/love# once you left the hostel.nnSo overall a very good stay for Students as well as employees with bed,locker and others safety features along with home made food facility on #rooftop mess#.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.207837', 5, 533, 4),
(3237, '[Yatin Vaidya] Accurate service affordable price anddinner nice test', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.207943', 5, 533, 4),
(3238, '[Manas] Very nice and good food service... Rooms are good... Polite behaviour, Aunty aur Uncle dono acche hai.!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.208051', 5, 533, 4),
(3239, '[Saurabh Shelke] Very nice place to live... I am living here from so many months.. I have experienced nice behavior of the owner... They also provide tiffin service with a nice quality of food.. Healthy food like our house.. And rooftop mess is the best concept I have everseen', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.208168', 5, 533, 4);        
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3240, U&'[Sh\00e1\00efl\00ebsh m\00e1dh\00fck\00e1r M\00e3h\00e4b\00e3l\00eb] Krusha boy''s hostel is very good place to stay for students as well employees. They provides better facilities and very healthy environment is there.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.208319', 5, 533, 4),
(3241, U&'[Jayesh Talewar] \2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0fnnI stayed at Balaji Boys Hostel from Jan 2026 to May 2026. The owner is very good and supportive, cleanliness is well maintained, and overall everything was perfect. Highly recommended for students and working people.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.237163', 4, 534, 4),
(3242, '[Narendra Kasarikar-Patil] Had a good stay at Balaji Boys Hostel and PG. Facilities are good, rooms are comfortable, and management is supportive. Overall nice experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.237311', 5, 534, 4),
(3243, '[Ansh Tripathi] It''s a fantastic P.G for bachelors and  the owner is also very humble and coperative.nIf you are looking for a pocket friendly P.G  you should definitely check out', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.237435', 5, 534, 4),
(3244, '[Vishank Kumar] Very good hostel with high view floor fresh air , There are no water problem. 24 hrs water is available and most important It is very close to Katraj bus stop.WiFi facility is also available.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.237607', 5, 534, 4),
(3245, U&'[Sagar Pandhare] When searching for a place to stay, it goes beyond finding a mere accommodation\2014it''s about discovering a home away from home. The ideal living arrangement transcends the conventional concept of a hostel; it should embody a sense of family where the caretaker extends support beyond the confines of the residence.nnA paramount consideration in this quest is locating a place where the caretaker assumes a role far beyond their title. An exceptional residence is one where the caretaker not only oversees the day-to-day functioning of the accommodation but also fosters an atmosphere akin to familial warmth.nnIn such a dwelling, the caretaker becomes a pillar of support, offering assistance in various aspects of life. It goes beyond the duties associated with a hostel manager; it''s about being a companion and guide in navigating the challenges of daily life. From providing guidance on local amenities to offering a sympathetic ear during moments of distress, a caretaker who treats everyone under their purview as family elevates the living experience.nnCrucially, a caretaker who goes above and beyond in their responsibilities is not limited to addressing hostel-related concerns. They extend their assistance to encompass the broader spectrum of life''s challenges. Whether it''s helping residents acclimate to a new city, offering advice on personal matters, or simply being there as a trustworthy confidant, this caretaker becomes an integral part of each resident''s journey.nnIn conclusion, the search for accommodation transcends the physical space; it''s about finding a place where the caretaker''s role evolves from a managerial position to that of a caring family member. It''s this unique blend of professionalism and personal concern that transforms a place to stay into a true haven\2014a sanctuary where one not only resides but truly belongs.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.237724', 5, 534, 4),
(3246, U&'[Abhishek Patake] Wifi Available And All Are Good \+01f44d\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.237845', 5, 534, 4),
(3247, '[Rohan Shrivastav] Superb hostel !nThe various facilities like wifi,cot,table,chair,hot water for bath,cctv camera for security purposes, water filter for drinking water and very supportive nature of owner.nDaily cleaning the rooms.nI am satisfied by the service''s provided by Balaji hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.237959', 5, 534, 4),
(3248, '[Shivam Deshmukh] This pg good  for budget friendly', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.238077', 4, 534, 4),
(3249, '[Durgesh Solapure] I had a very disappointing experience at Bhawakar Bhawan Hostel. The management is extremely poor and quality of service drops drastically after the admission process. Initially, they may seem responsive, but once you''re admitted, no one takes responsibility for basic needs.nOne of major issues has been the non-functional lights in the passage and bathrooms they  have not been working from October 2024 till now and the maintenance are also completely neglected (as shown in photos)nnI do not recommend this hostel based on my experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.271776', 1, 535, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3250, '[Atharva Chaudhari] I strongly advise against taking admission here. The hostel is poorly maintained, with broken facilities that are rarely repaired or improved. Cleaning is highly neglected, and hygiene standards are unacceptable, making it an unhealthy and uncomfortable place to stay. Additionally, hot water is available for only 3 hours a day, which is highly inconvenient for students. On top of this, the staff''s behavior towards students is rude and unhelpful, showing a complete lack of professionalism. Overall, this hostel fails in providing even basic amenities and a proper living environment. Avoid this place if you value your comfort and well-being', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.274819', 1, 535, 4),
(3251, '[Nirmal Pawar] Being asked to leave a facility simply for raising genuine complaints is not only frustrating but also deeply concerning. It reflects poorly on the management''s ability to address issues constructively and maintain a fair environment. Here''s a more detailed breakdown of the issues and potential courses of action:nnIssues Facednn1. Lack of Accountability: The hostel management appears unwilling to take responsibility for addressing complaints or resolving problems faced by residents.nn2. Unprofessional Behavior: Forcing residents to leave the facility instead of addressing grievances is an inappropriate and unprofessional response.nn3. Safety Concerns: If complaints were related to hygiene, security, or other critical aspects of the hostel, failing to resolve them could compromise residents'' safety and well-being.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.275192', 1, 535, 4),
(3252, '[Simran Sinha] Unsettling place to live. They ignore the issue and treat students like trash. Never ever plan to live here; it is preferable to live on the road instead of in that hostel.There is no generator or inverter for the hostel''s lighting problems. Facing this issue three to four times per week.The MCB will trip if you try to charge more than two devices in the same room, and no one will come to fix the problem for the next two days.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.275642', 1, 535, 4),
(3253, '[MRS3] very disgusting management and owner is very egoistic. in first 6 months he gives nice room and then he shift 2 sharing to 4 sharing . and not gives option', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.275872', 1, 535, 4),
(3254, '[Atharv Patil] It''s very good hostelnSpecialitynEvery day cleaningn24 hr lightnHot water availablenEvery day Cleaning bathroom and toilet', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.276315', 5, 535, 4),
(3255, '[Dipesh Chandekar] 10 months argument', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.276516', 2, 535, 4),
(3256, '[Puneet Rawat] Manager is very rude, they charges 5month fees to one student on the other hand asks 1year deposit to other student, partiality and rude behaviour towards students', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.276649', 1, 535, 4),
(3257, '[Saurabh Pandagale] I am staying in this hostel for almost 1.5 years. The hostel is really well maintained and hygiene. There is no disturbance from any member of the hostel. The people who manage the hostel are so humble and considerate.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.310543', 5, 536, 4),
(3258, '[Vrushabh Mugalkhod] I am staying in this hostel for almost 1.5 years. The hostel is really well maintained and hygiene. There is no disturbance from any member of the hostel. The people who manage the hostel are so humble and considerate. Any issues in the hostel are resolved immediately.nHostel is situated in such area that all the essentials are easily available.nYou can definitely consider staying here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.310683', 5, 536, 4),
(3259, '[Ramesh] Third class owner!! No sense how to talk with people politely. Owner is very abusive.He behave like there is no other better PG in Pune.And his kamvali bai also very third class. She ask too many personal questions like family background and payment related..So I would recommend for bachelor don''t stay for long term there..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.310795', 1, 536, 4);        
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3260, '[D Shelake] Nice PG with all essential amenities. You get free Wi-Fi, hot water, CCTV security, and safe drinking water with an AquaGuard purifier. An Android TV is also available for entertainment', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.310907', 5, 536, 4),
(3261, '[Prathmesh Thorat] Best Place for boysn24hour wifi + hot water + aqua water and many other facility providennabortable prize PG with full privacy and full securitynnBest Location For JOB Persons because 2 min walking distance Katraj bus u0026 auto stationnnAlways Clean u0026 Good maintenancenncaring Owner with PG like a Home', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.311017', 5, 536, 4),
(3262, '[Shivam Dafe] Nice and clean PG with a peaceful environment. Facilities are well maintained. Good place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.311141', 5, 536, 4),
(3263, U&'[Prathamesh Gaikwad] I had a very good experience staying at this hostel. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and comfortable,also free wifi available,Comfortable stay and value for money. Recommended \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.311252', 5, 536, 4),
(3264, U&'[Vijay Hogale] I had a really good experience staying at this hostel. The rooms are clean, comfortable, and well-maintained. The staff is friendly and always ready to help with any needs. The environment feels safe and homely, with proper facilities like Wi-Fi, fresh water  and clean washrooms. The location is also convenient, with easy access to shops Overall, it\2019s a great place for students and working professionals looking for a budget-friendly and peaceful stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.311361', 5, 536, 4),
(3265, '[Himanshi Dadhich] I have been living here for 1 year and having a great experience.The rooms are clean and well-maintained.Staff is friendly and always supportive.The environment feels safe and comfortable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.344816', 5, 537, 4),
(3266, '[Surtika Waikhom] I am very happy with Tulips Girls Hostel. The facilities are good, the warden is helpful, and the environment is safe and comfortable. Everything is well managed, and I am fully satisfied with my experience here. I highly recommend this hostel to others.Thank you for providing such a pleasant stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.345016', 4, 537, 4),
(3267, '[Manisha Nerlekar] Hostel is at premium location in market area and providing comfortable and safe living environment. The management is responsive nad co operative. Overall quality of food is good..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.345151', 5, 537, 4),
(3268, '[Dhanashree Dhavale] Good hostel staff and all facilities. Everything is good. Safe for girls. Must visit this hostel and take opportunity to live here !!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.345275', 5, 537, 4),
(3269, '[743_Diya Mudhale] I have lived in tulip for nearly 2 years, it is a good place if you want to consider shifting, It is safe and the staff is very helpful and they help you a lot.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.345399', 5, 537, 4),
(3270, '[Nandini Patil] I have been staying here since the last 6 months....good services, good ambience and overall decent stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.345516', 5, 537, 4),
(3271, '[Fatima Hussain] Lived here for 2 years now. I had great experience. It''s safe and staff is also good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.345693', 5, 537, 4),
(3272, '[Pooja daydar] This hostel is really good. Staff, interior, environment and facilities are good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.345816', 4, 537, 4),
(3273, '[Pragya Jain] True u0026 genuinely reviewn-Clean u0026 Hygiene -Rooms,corridors u0026Washroomn-Library where silence is maintained properlyn-Good networkn-Food is good in quality,taste and they maintain a variety as well ,with well hygiene.Jain food option is also there.n-They are Cooperative as well ,if reasons are genuine.n-Security u0026safety is  there.n-No staffs or owners interfere until and unless you do mischief .n-Ample amount of space for drying up the clothes.n-Inverters are therennSo its worth the cost/fees of hostelnnOnly thing one might feel lack is -lack of sunlight in rooms.nTho mess is rooftop ,so we do get sunlight anyways.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.374923', 5, 538, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3274, '[Driti] My experience at this hostel has been extremely disappointing. From the very first day, I felt unhappy because of the rude behavior of the owner and the unfair way rules are enforced. Many girls do not follow the rules, but only a few of us are constantly told to follow them, which feels very partial and unfair.nnThe behavior of the management is often very rude. There is clear partiality among the girls, and some girls are frequently targeted. If someone makes a complaint about an issue, that girl is then repeatedly scolded and singled out afterwards, which creates a very uncomfortable and stressful environment.nnOverall, my experience here has been very negative. Instead of feeling safe and supported, many girls feel constantly stressed because of the behavior of the owners. I would not recommend this hostel to anyone who wants a peaceful place to stay and study.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.375046', 1, 538, 4),
(3275, '[Shani Gangrade] My experience in the hostel has been quite mixed but valuable. It has helped me become more independent and responsible. Food quality is good ambience and people are helpful', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.375166', 5, 538, 4),
(3276, '[Divya Ahujaa] The facilities they show are just bluff, the mess they fancy got closed due to fire issues and non compliance issues, and library they fancy they make food there now, weirdly management is not up to the mark and they just have posted few fake comments with review of same written handwriting of reviews of rector, and cleaning issues as it always smells weird they don''t keep refresher spray. Y did I stay here....', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.375324', 1, 538, 4),
(3277, '[Mukesh M sewlani] Had a great experience. Loved the way they maintain hygiene. 24 hrs wifi and Ac library facility made my journey super smooth. Wash rooms are also clean.The main thing I felt appreciable is cleaning of rooms everyday. Loved the management. I would like to say that studies with cleanliness is what made my journey smoother. At last i would like to add that I feel super safe as outsiders are not allowed to enter the campus. Daily attendance is compulsory.nThe owner is sweet and takes care of everything.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.375858', 5, 538, 4),
(3278, '[Harshita Jain] I visited this hostel for accomodation for myself. Rector was explaining me about rent, timings, rules and regulations and when i asked can i see hostel she said u can see the poster or visit hostel web site. She denied to show hostel and rudely behaved. This was my experience at reception (with rector) of Parshwanath Jain hostel. This is how they behave with  visitors at jain hostel. Hopeless.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.375993', 1, 538, 4),
(3279, '[Sanjana Nankani] Rather than other hostels I like the food here. They have maintained the cleanliness and discipline.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.376114', 5, 538, 4),
(3280, '[Shravani Acharya] This hostel is very castist! They asked our surnames before even showing rooms to us. The food preference of vegetarian is understandable but their way of asking about this is very rude and honestly disgusting. These people seem prejudiced about other castes.Their employee constantly asked us if the rooms are in our budget and then only she would show us the rooms. Pathetic! The rent is too high for the space that they are providing. It''s not even worth it. Think thousand times before even visiting here let alone rent a space here!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.376225', 1, 538, 4),
(3281, '[Rashmi Kumari] Good PG, comfortable and safe for girls. All basic facilities (cleaning, wifi, drinking water, laundry) are available. There is no food service but a kitchen is provided for cooking. The landlady is very sweet and helpful.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.421319', 5, 539, 4),
(3282, U&'[Janvi Singh] The hostel is really nice the owner aunty  is really sweet and friendly as well as the accomodation is also very nice the beds are comfortable and rooms get enough of sunlight and fresh air . There is no such problem of water supply and the maid aunty is also very sweet .\+01f340', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.421445', 5, 539, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3283, '[Darshini Gadgoli] Swami krupa is a great place to stay. It''s safe and has all the facilities and maintenance. The owner aunty is very cooperative.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.421565', 5, 539, 4),
(3284, '[Tessy Thomas] My Daughter lived here for two years, she had a safe and peaceful stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.421736', 5, 539, 4),
(3285, '[Manjushree Bayas] Best hostel, Nice environment can really feel like my 2nd home. Loved there and nice experience to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.42185', 5, 539, 4),
(3286, '[Samruddhi Pardeshi] This is a very nice PG with all the necessary amenities, rooms are clean and airy. The aunty is very sweet and helpful. It''s well connected to nearby shops, pharmacies, and bus stops. Security is taken care of,and daily needs like Wi-Fi and laundry are also provided.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.421962', 5, 539, 4),
(3287, '[Prashant Orse] Clean rooms, good food, peaceful atmosphere, and supportive management.Great location with easy access to transport and nearby facilities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.422075', 5, 539, 4),
(3288, U&'[C2_626_SRUSHTI_ JADHAV] Excellent Hostel to live in!! I''m very Greatful for their care for girls .nThank you \+01f64f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.42219', 5, 539, 4),
(3289, U&'[Sanskruti Bhargude] Perfect example of how a good hostel should be!!\201d for the new girl in city punenBecause i was the totally new in the city from the home for the first timenMost friendly and helpful owner. Delicious meal and Safe environment feels like home .Close proximity to college and coaching centre. Rooms are clean. Always someone around if needed for anytimenI will highly recomend this hostel for the new girl in the citynEach and every thing is near the hostelnFood quality is amazing and there is variety of food too....', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.544643', 5, 543, 4),
(3290, '[Sakshi Zambare] Food is good cleaning is best', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.544882', 5, 543, 4),
(3291, '[Priyanka Velhal] Its a good hostel for girls both hygiene and safety wise.As it is in the center of pune everything is accessible very easily.And it is reasonable too.nFood quality is also good and tasty. The canteen is upstairs so need not to go in search of meals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.545006', 5, 543, 4),
(3292, U&'[Avijita pathak] Hostel is amazing and in very affordable price.. food is so good and yummy..just like Home..I am very happy with the overall experience of Hostel..I saw many hostel but this hostel gave me Home vibe.. Happy to stay here..\263a\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.545115', 5, 543, 4),
(3293, U&'[Shivali RK] Well maintained rooms and safe to stay. Situated in heart of the city. Quality of the food is also good..most recommended and affordable hostel\+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.54522', 5, 543, 4),
(3294, '[abhishek shringarpure] Honestly speaking i was worried about my cousin sister''s stay in pune when she was about to come for her UPSC preparations, we approached to Deccan Girls hostel and Glad to see their all hostel management,nCleanness up to the mark /nSafety which is big questions they solved it with proper precautions/ good Food under the roof from breakfast To dinner / easily accessible from all top INSTITUTES in pune / i will give 5 star for this hostel and its all New ..nThank you', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.545317', 5, 543, 4),
(3295, '[Aarya Velhal] Happy, healthy,safe environment..best food quality (breakfast lunch, evening tea, dinner) located near all emergency services and recreational centres', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.545454', 5, 543, 4),
(3296, '[Ajit Velhal] Visited for my sister and  found this hostel very clean and  neat. In the heart of city with affordable rates its just like a home. Will definitely recommend Deccan Girls Hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.545692', 5, 543, 4),
(3297, U&'[manoj Varbade] My sister stayed at this hostel and had a really positive experience. It\2019s safe, clean, and well-managed \2014 exactly what you hope for when someone from your family is living away from home. The staff was helpful, and she always felt secure and comfortable there. A good place for girls looking for a peaceful and supportive environment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.590828', 5, 544, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3298, U&'[Arya] I had a really great experience staying here. The hostel is clean, safe, and has a very friendly atmosphere. The staff is extremely helpful and always ready to assist with anything. The rooms are comfortable, the ambience is peaceful, and the whole place genuinely gives a \201cfeels like home\201d vibe.nnThe common areas are well-maintained, and the overall environment is perfect for a comfortable and budget-friendly stay. Definitely recommended', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.591739', 5, 544, 4),
(3299, '[purvaa arora] I stayed at this hostel for a while and overall, it was an okay experience. The location is definitely convenient as it''s right on the main road, but that also comes with a downside, constant noise throughout the day, which was a big issue for me.nThe rooms are a bit small for the price, and while the basic facilities are there, I personally felt the cleanliness wasn''t up to the mark. The cleaning staff really needs to be more attentive.nThat said, the owners are polite and helpful, which made the stay more manageable. If you''re someone who doesn''t mind noise and can adjust a bit, this place might work for you.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.591938', 4, 544, 4),
(3300, U&'[Mamta Sharma] My daughter has stayed in this hostel for the past two years and will continue this year as well. Her experience has been nothing short of wonderful. She always felt comfortable, secure, and truly at home, even while being away from us.nnIn fact, my younger daughter, along with her friend, will also be joining this year. I wholeheartedly recommend this hostel to everyone because they excel in every aspect of their service.nnThe hostel is exceptionally safe and impeccably clean. The people here are warm, welcoming, and genuinely attentive to every detail. Any issue, no matter how small, is addressed promptly and with care.nnI couldn\2019t be more satisfied with this hostel. It has been a great experience for both my daughter and our family, and I\2019m grateful for the exceptional care they provide.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.592076', 5, 544, 4),
(3301, '[Sheelu Shakya] My sister stayed in this hostel for 2 years (sb road). She found this hostel extremely comfortable and homely. This hostel provides exceptional warmth, support and safe environment. The rooms are well maintained and very well kept. The staff is friendly and attentive,always ensuring that the needs of the residents are met. The overall atmosphere is welcoming, making it not just a place to stay but a home away from home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.592212', 5, 544, 4),
(3302, U&'[Swayam Kate] One of the best hostels I\2019ve stayed in so far. The rooms were clean, well-maintained, and had all the basic amenities needed for a comfortable stay. The staff was polite and always ready to help, which made the experience even better.nnThe food served was fresh and hygienic, and the Wi-Fi speed was reliable for both work and entertainment. Common areas were spacious and perfect for relaxing or socializing after a long day.nnSecurity was top-notch with proper CCTV surveillance and round-the-clock guards, which gave peace of mind\2014especially important in a new city.nnOverall, it felt more like a second home than just a hostel. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a safe, comfortable, and well-managed place to stay in Pune.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.592462', 5, 544, 4),
(3303, '[Abhishek Choudhary] This hostel is one of the most safest and cleanest hostel. My sister and her friend stayed here for 2 years and had a truly wonderful experience. Rooms are very clean and hostel is very secure and safe. I have recommended this hostel to all my friends and relatives as we had a good experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.592781', 5, 544, 4),
(3304, U&'[Kushagara Khanna] Terrible Experience \2013 Do Not stay here !nnMy stay at this hostel was nothing short of a nightmare. From the moment I walked in, I knew I had made a huge mistake. The place is disgustingly dirty \2013 the floors were sticky, the walls covered in stains, and the bathrooms absolutely reeked. The \201ccleaning staff\201d clearly never do their job properly.nnThe rooms are tiny, cramped, and suffocating. The beds are uncomfortable, the sheets had stains, and I could hear every single noise from the room next door. It felt like I was sleeping in a prison cell rather than a hostel. Not to mention, the place was infested with bugs \2013 I woke up with bites all over my body.nnThe staff were incredibly rude and unhelpful. Anytime I asked a question, they acted as if I was bothering them. They seemed completely uninterested in providing any kind of service or assistance. The wifi barely worked, and when I brought it up to them, they just shrugged and told me to figure it out.nnOn top of that, the common areas were constantly noisy, filled with rowdy, disrespectful guests who didn\2019t seem to care about anyone else. There were no rules enforced, so good luck trying to get any rest. The atmosphere was chaotic, and I didn\2019t feel safe leaving my belongings unattended.nnFor the price they charge, you\2019re better off staying anywhere else. This hostel is a complete disaster. Save yourself the trouble and avoid this place at all costs!nn!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.592905', 1, 544, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3305, U&'[Bhakti Deshmukh] \201cThis girls\2019 hostel is truly exceptional. From day one, it feels safe, warm, and welcoming\2014just like a second home. The rooms are spotlessly clean, well-ventilated, and comfortable. Food quality is excellent, hygienic, and prepared with care. Security is strict and reliable, which gives complete peace of mind to both girls and parents. The environment is calm, positive, and perfect for studying and personal growth. Without a doubt, one of the best girls\2019 hostels\2014highly recommended.\201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.626058', 5, 545, 4),
(3306, U&'[Vaibhavi Kosambe] A perfect place for girls\2014safe, peaceful, and positive. Great study environment, good food, and friendly atmosphere. Truly feels like home away from home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.626214', 5, 545, 4),
(3307, '[Purva Velapure] Nice hostel with good facilities and comfort which also provide food and library', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.6264', 5, 545, 4),
(3308, U&'[Yashi Dubey] The rector is extremely rude and does not know how to speak properly. I also faced issues with the deposit\2014even after vacating the hostel, my security deposit was not returned. No proper response was given despite several follow-ups. I would not recommend this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.626554', 1, 545, 4),
(3309, '[Nutan Kale] Jijai Girls Hostel is a nice place to stay. The rooms and common areas are very clean. It is in a good location, close to shops and transport. There is also a library for reading and studying. I like this hostel and recommend it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.626677', 5, 545, 4),
(3310, '[Shreyash Makrampure] I was looking for a girls hostel for my sister and found Jijai Girls Hostel, located in Narayan Peth, Pune. The hostel is very safe and kept clean. I feel it would be a secure and comfortable place for her.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.626797', 5, 545, 4),
(3311, '[Siddhi Patil] The hostel is fine, but if you have a genuine reason to leave the hostel it''s not counted they directly refuse to return the deposit. Which is a huge amount. The hostel is not worth to its rent and the rector is quite uncooperative.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.62692', 1, 545, 4),
(3312, '[Kajal Mandekar] The hostel is located in a prime area of Pune, with easy access to public transportation, educational institutions, and shopping centers. The amenities provided were excellent, including a study room, Wi-Fi connectivity. The hostel management was responsive and proactive in addressing any concerns. Overall, it was a fantastic experience, and I would definitely recommend this hostel to other girls. This is the best girls hostel in pune.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.627169', 5, 545, 4),
(3313, '[Pratika Bhondve] I stayed at Swamini PG Girls Hostel for several months, and my experience was truly positive. The hostel is exclusively for girls, which makes it feel very safe and secure. The environment is calm, peaceful, and perfect for focused studying. The rooms and common areas are clean and well-maintained. The owner and staff members are extremely cooperative and supportive, always ready to help when needed. I would highly recommend this hostel to any girl looking for a comfortable and secure place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.72819', 5, 548, 4),
(3314, U&'[Prachi Wahile] Staying at Swamini Girls Hostel has truly been a comforting and positive experience. From the very first day, the environment felt welcoming and secure. The management maintains strict safety measures, which creates a sense of trust and peace for both students and parents.nThe rooms are spacious, airy, and regularly cleaned. Hygiene is clearly a priority here. One thing I personally appreciate is the calm and disciplined atmosphere.nThe food feels homely and nutritious, just like home-cooked meals. The staff is cooperative, polite, and always ready to help whenever needed\2014 just go for ittt\2026 it\2019s woww! \2728', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.728378', 5, 548, 4),
(3315, '[Kanchan Zare] had a very good experience staying in this hostel. The rooms are clean and comfortable, and the environment is peaceful which is great for studying. The staff is helpful and supportive whenever needed. water facilities are also good. Overall, it is a safe and pleasant place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.728514', 5, 548, 4);     
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3316, U&'[Arpita Chavan] Our hostel is safe and has good security.nThe rooms are clean and comfortable.nThe environment is friendly and peaceful.nBasic facilities like water, electricity, and food are good.nOverall, it is a nice place to stay for students. \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.7287', 5, 548, 4),
(3317, '[Chaitanya Langade] The hostel is clean and comfortable. The rooms are good and the environment is friendly. Basic facilities like water, food, and security are available.nAll necessary things are available near hostel .nStaff are cooperative.nMost recommended hosteln@uma mam@', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.728849', 5, 548, 4),
(3318, '[Archana Rathod] The hostel is clean and comfortable. The rooms are good and the environment is friendly. Basic facilities like water, induction and security are available.nAll necessary things are available.nMost recommended hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.728974', 5, 548, 4),
(3319, '[shinde prerana] The hostel is very comfortable and clean. The environment is friendly and safe. Staff is supportive and the facilities are good. I had a great experience staying here. I recommend to visit this hostel once.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.729096', 5, 548, 4),
(3320, '[GAURI CHAVAN] Hostel rooms are very clean and ventilated.nCleanliness well maintained.nVery secure to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.729262', 5, 548, 4),
(3321, '[Kratika Chandwani] Worst hostel to live ever. Warden here is very strict full of attitude does not respond to the complaints nd always pin points the girls her nature is not good and no facilities are there in the pg.nFood is also okish only on sundays ny chance something nice is there otherwise its very poor. My experience is very bad i wont reccommend to any of you joining here', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.766686', 1, 549, 4),
(3322, U&'[Pallavi Bamane] I had a very good experience at this hostel. The rooms are spacious, well-maintained, and come with air conditioning for comfort. The hostel provides tasty and hygienic food with good variety, which is a big plus.nnThe premises are safe and secure \2013 with a dedicated security guard on duty 24/7. Parking space is also available, which makes it very convenient.nnOverall, the hostel offers top-quality living with all essential facilities \2013 perfect for students looking for a comfortable and safe stay. Highly recommended! \2705', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.766835', 5, 549, 4),
(3323, '[Sanjana Dhade] Best girls hostel having all facilitates and proper accommodation', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.766967', 5, 549, 4),
(3324, U&'[Sabina Mulla] Insignia girls hostel is the best .. because of fassilities...and cleaning..The hostel is simply perfect for girls. It has all basic amenities including wifi and geysers. The food served here is nutritious and you get a feeling of balanced meal. Ambience is great, surroundings are clean and the most important part - the security is top notch. I highly recommend this hostel if you are new in the city for a comfortable experience.\+01f4ab', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.767098', 5, 549, 4),
(3325, '[Shubhangi Mangte] This is my candid review about this place I stayed here for at least one year.The staff really work hard to keep this place cleanThe building is well ventilated with ample natural lightnmost comfortable ans secure hostel for girls.nGreat location and good caring management....', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.767276', 5, 549, 4),
(3326, '[Sanjay Dubey] Though the exterior seems to be good, but it is actually the skeleton stumbing from the cupboard. Two  important things of the most offensive observed as 1.There were repeated occurrences of cockroaches and ants in the food. The food is not prepared at this establishment and comes from outside and has been observed not sufficient for resident here. The so called warden or female partner who looks after the children in hostel lacks basic human behaviour and attitude. Most of the time she was found to be uptight unapproachable to children and humiliating children giving references of their parents. SHE LACKS BASIC SENSE OF DIGNITY THOUGH SERVING IN HOSPITALITY INDUSTRY. I WOULD LIKE TO WARN NEW PARENTS TO NOT GET SWAYED BY THE INFRASTRUCTURE EXTERIOR.nnYes,  they are also liars, daughter stayed for full one month and not for week. It is also a lie that we argued for return of money of 1 month deposit. But when the rule was explained. We gave in. However regarding the behaviour and food quality info is completely true.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.767402', 1, 549, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3327, '[Harshali Patil] The hostel is amazing with lots of amenities. Specially the food and security is to notch.nThe hostel is also near to many known colleges, which makes it easier to travel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.76752', 5, 549, 4),
(3328, U&'[Diksha khandekar] I had wonderful stay !! Ambience was good ...rooms were neat and spaciou... The staff was polite and attentive ... highly recommend this place for comfortable stay \+01f603', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.767635', 4, 549, 4),
(3329, U&'[Jiya Ostwal] I had a really comfortable stay at this hostel. The place is very well maintained, clean, and nicely furnished, which made it feel homely and comfortable from the beginning. The rooms and common areas are kept neat and hygienic, and the overall environment is peaceful and pleasant.nnThe owner and caretaker are both very helpful, kind, and approachable. They are always available whenever needed and make sure everything is managed properly. Their behaviour and support made the stay even better.nnOverall, it\2019s a safe, clean, and well-managed place to stay, and I would definitely recommend it to anyone looking for a comfortable hostel accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.835212', 5, 551, 4),
(3330, U&'[mansi raut] The owner is a cunning lady. took half the rent stating it as a security deposit. when i asked for the refund not even 5 hours later due to change of plans because of a family emergency, she refused saying its the penalty charge. mind it i did not stay a single minute at the hostel or use any hostel amenities and was still charged a \201cpenalty\201d.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.835381', 1, 551, 4),
(3331, '[Priyasha Gupta] Yash Shelters is a haven for girls seeking a secure and comfortable PG accommodation. The facilities are top-notch, with spacious rooms and impeccable hygiene. The management is incredibly supportive, ensuring a friendly atmosphere. Conveniently located, this property earns a well-deserved 5 stars from me!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.835507', 5, 551, 4),
(3332, '[richa agrawal] I stayed in this PG of about 1.5 months and my stay was not at all pleasant.Every second day there is a new issue coming up.There are fire accidents happening,security issues,issues on what you can eat ,especially being forced to take food from the premises only even when you are unwilling to.There are hygiene issues inside.And to the worst of all no strict actions have ever been taken.nnAt the first when I saw the PG it seemed quite good in fact it is with regard to furniture and fixtures,area in which it is located.nBut I felt that the negative overweights the positive.nnThe stay was a shear waste of my time and money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.835631', 1, 551, 4),
(3333, '[Seema Prabhu] My daughter is a sportsperson and stayed at yash shelters for 2 months for her national coaching. The place is well connected to major places in Pune by bus. Her roommates were helpful, staff was friendly. Rooms were well kept and my daughter didn''t even complain once. Recommended for girls studying in Pune .', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.835749', 4, 551, 4),
(3334, '[srijita chakraborty] It''s really spacious and best PG you can get at affordable prices, services are up to the mark, you could surely go for this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.835865', 5, 551, 4),
(3335, '[Aarya Musale] It''s cleannHousekeeping is availablenThey also give u complementary breakfast and pantrynElectric appliances allowednA cozy n a comfortable placenSeparate study room available toonI pay 9000 monthly for 4 sharing room with study table', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.835979', 5, 551, 4),
(3336, '[Tuhina Tali] Very comfortable stay, specially as a single girl in Pune. It felt very safe and the location is very favorable. Would recommend 10/10', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.836098', 5, 551, 4),
(3337, '[atendra Yadav] Best in taste...Shawarma, Biryani, Chinese all in one place... Great Experience..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.866963', 5, 552, 4),
(3338, U&'[Dhanashree Salunke] Highly recommended ! The rooms are clean, the premises are well maintained. The management is supportive and responsive whenever help is needed. The atmosphere feels safe and homely. The facilities are good, and the location is excellent with easy access to public transport, and daily essentials. Overall, it\2019s a good place for students and working professionals looking for a comfortable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.901973', 5, 553, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3339, U&'[shravni salvi] I\2019ve been staying at Trinity Girls PG for a few months now, and it honestly feels like a home away from home. The safety here is top-notch with 24/7 CCTV. The rooms are well-ventilated, spacious, and kept very clean by the housekeeping staff. What I love most is the food\2014it\2019s hygienic and tastes much better than typical hostel food! Highly recommend this to any student moving to the city for the first time.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.902147', 5, 553, 4),
(3340, U&'[Leesha Sawant] \201cSafe, clean and very comfortable place to stay. The rooms are well maintained, food is good, and the owner/warden is very supportive. Perfect PG for girls. Highly recommended!\201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.902271', 5, 553, 4),
(3341, '[Sanika] Very comfortable and well maintained hostel.nThe facilities are good and the management is cooperative. Would definitely recommend!', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.902463', 5, 553, 4),
(3342, U&'[Mayuri Bhosale] Trusted this hostel with my sister, and it exceeded every expectation \2014 safe, caring, and truly feels like home.\+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.902582', 5, 553, 4),
(3343, '[Anushka Arankalle] Really good PG with a very clean and hygienic environment. The staff is extremely helpful and kind. Anyone looking for a comfortable, home-like PG should definitely consider this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.9027', 5, 553, 4),
(3344, '[Shachi Brahme] Very nice pg - clean, safe, with wifi facility as well as in a location from where everything is convenient.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.902818', 5, 553, 4),
(3345, '[Sanika Badhe] This girls PG is safe, clean, and comfortable. The rooms are well-maintained. The location is convenient. Highly recommended for girls.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.902933', 5, 553, 4),
(3346, U&'[Munna Tripathi] The owner has not paid the society maintenance for the last 4\20135 years. Because of this, society members often shout at us. On 2\20133 occasions, we were even abused verbally.nThey sometimes cut the water supply and do not allow us to use the lift. Many times, people entered our flat to fight and create arguments. So please save your valuable money...', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.940009', 1, 554, 4),
(3347, '[Divya Borde] best Girls pg in shukrwar peth ,all amenity with affordable rate ..', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.940258', 5, 554, 4),
(3348, '[shyamasree bhattacharya] Very good location, nice and safe. Very friendly and cordial roommates.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.940433', 5, 554, 4),
(3349, '[DIVYA GAIKWAD] Best Hostel in Pune.nnI had 6 months stay in this hostel and it was a very pleasant stay.  It''s a complete package hostel bed, Wifi, refrigerator, wardrobe, washing machine, induction, oven, biometric etc.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.940547', 5, 554, 4),
(3350, '[shruti mandlik] I visited this  place and it is very good for girls living in pune for their jobs or studies. The facilities given by them in such a less rental is noticeable.I recommend this hostel 100% to every girl searching in pune.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.940669', 5, 554, 4),
(3351, '[Sayali Somani] Great place to live.nAll facilities are very good and regular.nCleaning, water, wifi, lift everything is good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.940784', 5, 554, 4),
(3352, '[Diksha Borawake] Best hostel near swarget', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.940909', 5, 554, 4),
(3353, '[Nikita Gore] Nice experience.... clean, equipped and friendly hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-09-26 22:05:18.941015', 5, 554, 4),
(3355, '[Sagnik Pan] I am currently staying here and they don''t seem to resolve the problem of bed bugs, they called pest control but nothing really happened. Idk why can''t they simply provide a good mattress, the current mattress has holes in it through which bed bugs are coming out. Please look into this , this is directly affecting our health .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:54.001263', 1, 563, 4),
(3356, U&'[HARIKESH SINGH] Very disappointing experience with Zolo.nnElectricity billing is completely non-transparent and feels like a planned overcharge. Every month the bill never comes below \20b91500 per head, and this month they charged \20b92300 per head even though there was minimal AC usage and no TV usage at all.nnThe biggest issue is that they never share unit consumption, meter readings, or per unit rate. Despite asking multiple times, no proper breakdown is provided.nnWhat makes it more suspicious is that this high bill was generated right when I am exiting, which clearly feels unfair and intentional.nnIf you are planning to stay here, be very careful about hidden electricity charges. Always demand proper billing details, otherwise you may end up paying much more than actual usage.nnNot recommended at all due to lack of transparency and unfair billing practices.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:54.002818', 1, 563, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3357, U&'[Ekshita] I had a very disappointing experience with Zolo Stays in Madapur. The room was not maintained at all and did not match basic hygiene standards. There were multiple cockroaches in the room, the washroom was unclean, and the hand jet was broken. The surroundings were also unhygienic, with a large dustbin right outside the room.nAfter paying \20b910,000 for 8 days, this was completely unacceptable. This kind of condition is not suitable for anyone to stay in. I would not recommend this property unless proper maintenance and cleanliness are ensured. Currently seeking a refund for this stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:54.004023', 1, 563, 4),
(3358, U&'[ID Chirag Mehta] I had a very disappointing experience at Zolo Lotus. The overall cleanliness is extremely poor, rooms and common areas are never properly maintained. There\2019s a serious bed bug issue, and insects are everywhere, making it very uncomfortable to live here.nnThe manager is never available on time, and even after raising complaints multiple times, no action is taken. The senior management team is equally unresponsive and unhelpful.nnBasic facilities like AC and microwave rarely work properly, and it takes ages to get them fixed. On top of that, the food service is a complete mess. dinner is almost always delayed till around 10:20 PM, which is totally unacceptable.nnOverall, I wouldn\2019t recommend Zolo Lotus to anyone looking for a clean, well-managed, and reliable co-living space. Totally not worth the money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:54.004964', 1, 563, 4),
(3359, U&'[Madhava Sai] If there is a zero or minus rating, I would have definitely given that. It\2019s one of the worst places I have visited. Don\2019t ever stay here. This is A PG and the same should be mentioned in all booking websites which they don\2019t. Utter cheap and worthless staff. They don\2019t give you key to the room and they make you wait for more than a hour just to give you room. No body here cares about the customer. Extremely filthy and disgusting.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:54.005942', 1, 563, 4),
(3360, U&'[Somya Sinha] Bed bugs is worst part. Induction goes here n there for cooking.  Bugs \+01f41b also inside microwave. Rest cleaning is regular . I would say some tenants also responsible who doesn''t keep the food items safely and in a hygienic way.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:54.006676', 3, 563, 4),
(3361, '[Sudhiip KrishnanS] The facilities and overall maintenance could be significantly improved, and I felt that more attention to cleanliness, pest control and resident privacy and comfort would make a significant difference.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:54.007717', 1, 563, 4),
(3362, '[Akshay Ghadigaonkar] Worst check in experience. Paying fair money in advance. surprise go get bed bug with no electrical equipment working. With disturbed morning you won''t get hot water from geyser.nnIf you are not confident just dont promise fake services which you can''t deliver. We are asking for basic services with pest free rooms.nnHope someone will help us !', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:54.008529', 1, 563, 4),
(3363, '[Sphoorthi Adusumilli] Hostel cleanness and maintenance all are goodnWhatever the reviews that are given negative all are seems fakenFirst come and check and take decision.nBased on my experience everything is good.nGood PG I have seen in Telangana.nNot restricted anythingnFood is available anytime.nAll people here are very responsible and owner also taking well care for the tenants.nAll problems well taken care of.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:55.497954', 5, 565, 4),
(3364, '[akanksha verma] Food is good, north + south indian meals are provided along with sweets on sunday. Rooms are clean and well maintained, overall it is good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:55.498482', 5, 565, 4),
(3365, '[Naveen Gaddam] Guest mentione this pg offers spacious and clean and well maintained rooms and  along  good facilities like water and backup food  including vegetarian and non-vegetarian options and visitors appreciate the helpful', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:55.499268', 5, 565, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3366, '[PRATIVA BAIDYA] Its really awesome PG Hostel with great environment, homely food, be like a home in new city u0026 also the rooms, roommates u0026 administration also very kind u0026 humble to each other, regular visit also make the stay more comfortable.nIf you''re want to stay in Kokapet do visit Hacku0026Slepp.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:55.499605', 5, 565, 4),
(3367, U&'[Asddgh] Worst \274c\+01f6a8nVery disappointed with this PG. The food is tasteless and poor quality (worst). There are also constant water problems for all uses. Maintenance guy(ground floor) here who makes everyone uncomfortable by staring badly from head to toe. His constant disrespectful attitude u0026 worst behaviour have created a very uncomfortable u0026 unsafe environment for all the women in the PG....', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:55.49991', 1, 565, 4),
(3368, '[Vaibhav Kushwah] Best place to stay comfortably and enjoy good food. No time restrictions, and all basic facilities are available. I stayed for one month and extended to two months.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:55.500311', 5, 565, 4),
(3369, U&'[Siri Pateru] The rooms are well-maintained, food is good, and the management is very cooperative. Overall, a comfortable and safe place to stay.\201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:55.500589', 5, 565, 4),
(3370, '[Manisha Nepak] Very good PG for working women and college students. Staff behaviour also very good. Food quality also good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:55.500898', 5, 565, 4),
(3371, '[R.Ranjan Kumar] If you want to come at this PG come at your own risk. Living here is a painful and horrible experience.nYou will pay like an premium PG but in return what you will get literally nothing. You will pay big amount but in return you will get lack of normal water, shortage of drinking water, electric shocks in bathroom, Housekeeping will come once a month, horrible common kitchen and dirty fridges.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:56.026024', 1, 566, 4),
(3372, U&'[Krushna Janjal] Not recommended. They cannot maintain property well not sure if it\2019s management or property manager but this PG is not in good hands. They say they provide power backup however if there is power/electricity outages they will always be put of diesel and generator will not work.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:56.027426', 1, 566, 4),
(3373, '[Rutvik Shete] Good place. They keep it clean, food is good since they changed the chef. Wifi is strong although it does give some problems on bad days includes TV, geyser and a common kitchen.nSome improvements could be made. Small table in room or a cupboard above TV could give some more space to put things, it just feels a bit congested as space is less.nnOther than that it''s good place to spend few months while you settle.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:56.02863', 4, 566, 4),
(3374, '[Sachin Jadhav] PG is very well maintained however surrounding is very dirty, noisy and crowded.nWeekly market is main issue u0026 surrounding u0026 roads are very durty.nProperty manager is helpful and cleaning staff is polite.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:56.029704', 3, 566, 4),
(3375, U&'[Sourabh Singh] Honest Review \2013 Not RecommendednnThis is the worst PG I have ever stayed in. The management is careless and does not respond quickly to problems. During the rainy season, my room got flooded with water, due to leakage from window side, even though the window remains closed all day. It took them more than a month to fix the issue.nnThe food is also very bad. They serve it in plastic and don\2019t allow second servings. The food is not cooked in the PG \2014 it comes from outside, and they give very small portions. It feels like they don\2019t treat the people living here with basic respect.nnI would not recommend this PG to anyone who cares about cleanliness, good food, and proper management.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:56.030479', 1, 566, 4),
(3376, '[Chandra Kanth Gottipati] Zolo Quest in Hitech City offers well-maintained, clean rooms with good security and friendly staff. The location is prime for IT professionals, close to offices and amenities. The WiFi and housekeeping services are reliable, making it a convenient stay. However, some additional charges like electricity are extra. Overall, it provides good value for money for professionals seeking hassle-free PG accommodation', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:56.031049', 5, 566, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3377, U&'[Aditya Sunder Raj] I had a very disappointing experience at this PG. The management is extremely unprofessional\2014especially the manager, who seems more interested in his meals than addressing residents'' concerns. The rest of the staff appear to be more focused on collecting good ratings rather than providing proper service.nnOne particularly alarming incident occurred when a staff member threatened to withhold my room keys unless I gave them a positive rating. As someone working the night shift, this was especially distressing and unacceptable. Unfortunately, even when I submitted my honest feedback through the Zolo app, it didn\2019t reflect the ratings I gave, which makes me question the transparency of the platform.nnIn summary, I strongly advise others to avoid this PG. It''s poorly managed, lacks basic professionalism, and uses unethical practices to manipulate ratings.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:56.031411', 1, 566, 4),
(3378, '[Kunal Jalan] This is the worst PG i have seen in my life, third class service, zero customer support', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:56.031768', 1, 566, 4),
(3379, '[SANJEEV PATNAIK] I stayed at Metro City Hostel for almost an year and it was really good compared to rest of the hostels/PGs from the surrounding areas. Close to metro, NIMS, malls and close to tank bund too. Food is decent and my 2 sharing room was spacious. Also close enough to bus boarding points. Good management and care takers who fix issues quickly which is rare in PGs and hostels. Parking for two wheeler available too.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:59.214744', 5, 569, 4),
(3380, '[Ramesh Junju] In my opinion it is the best hostel in somajiguda area compared to the other hostels. Best in Food, it''s like homely food. Santosh Anna (owner) is very much supportive and friendly. Sharing room price is reasonable. All facilities are available, like mixer to make juice, refridgerator,  wi-fi, water in each floor.. very near to irrum manzil metro station, etc.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:59.216549', 5, 569, 4),
(3381, U&'[ANEESH gadewar] Clean and well-maintained rooms, good quality food, excellent upkeep, and a friendly atmosphere make this a great place to stay. It\2019s an ideal choice for both students and working professionals. The food is tasty and consistently good, adding to the overall comfort and convenience. Definitely worth staying here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:59.217228', 5, 569, 4),
(3382, '[sai teja gujja] Very good PG with clean rooms, good food, friendly management. Safe and comfortable place to stay. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:59.217582', 5, 569, 4),
(3383, '[Gangula Srikanth] I have been staying in Metro City Hostel for the past two years and I am very satisfied. It is the best PG in Hyderabad, well-maintained, safe, and comfortable. The staff is supportive and the environment feels like home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:59.217811', 5, 569, 4),
(3384, '[harsha vardhan] Pretty decent pg with decent food according to the cost, only thing which cud be included is a washing machine.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:59.218054', 4, 569, 4),
(3385, '[Vamshi Rathod] Good rooms ,good food and good facilities with  high speed wifi  i have been staying for 16 months in metro city boys hostel my experience was too good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:59.2186', 5, 569, 4),
(3386, U&'[Abdul Aziz] One of the best PGs I\2019ve ever stayed in, located in Hyderabad. The metro station is nearby, and so are a shopping mall and a hospital. The owner is very friendly and cooperative. I stayed here for almost 8 months and never faced any issues during my stay. The food is good, overall, it\2019s a great choice. If you\2019re new to the city and looking for a budget-friendly PG, I highly recommend it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:43:59.219031', 5, 569, 4),
(3387, '[munwar s] Fake details there is no one available in this place I think it''s old adress', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:00.600557', 1, 571, 4),
(3388, '[Hameed khan] I have been to the location, it''s not hostel, a 2BHK Deplux is for rent preferred Bachelors', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:00.600948', 1, 571, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3389, '[Waseem Abbas] I tried calling but no ine is responding. Messaged on wats app no responsenVery poor responsr.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:00.602302', 1, 571, 4),
(3390, '[Mohammed Amer] I''m staying at the Elite BOYS PG HYDERABAD from a 3 Months and I had a great time. The PG is located in a peaceful area, close to the Mosques and the market. The Owner is friendly and helpful, and the atmosphere is relaxed and social. The PG offers TV, WiFi, lockers, Owan, Dinning Table and Geyser. The rooms are clean and spacious, and the beds are comfortable. The PG also has a Washing Machine, a common area for clothes, The PG is very affordable, I would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a budget-friendly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:00.602566', 5, 571, 4),
(3391, U&'[Faizaan Basheer] Ma sha allah,nVery hygienic , good facilitiesnWell maintained \+01f44dnNo pest \+01f99f\+01fab3problems', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:00.607164', 5, 571, 4),
(3392, '[sonu khatik] this is what I liked about this PG, Calm environment to mind your own job, count on these things for sure - cleanliness, personal space, with all the facilities you need like Wifi, tv yada yada yada.....nnI don''t think their is a another PG like it anywhere nearby - Highly recommended. Walk in distance to mehdipatnam bus stop and all the shops are nearby pg like food stall,medical, super market etc.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:00.607546', 5, 571, 4),
(3393, '[sallauddin kureshi] I have seen many pg''s but not like this in hyderabad the best pg in mehdipatnam area they provide all the facilities which is necessary in daily life cycle the mosque near by pg and all the things are in walk in distance like bus stop, cafeteria, snack shop etc. Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:00.607748', 5, 571, 4),
(3394, '[Khalid shaik] I have been staying here for over a year now and I highly recommend anyone looking for the PG to have a glance at starboys pg. PG offers an exotic ambience with spacious rooms always maintained clean and hygienic and covers all amenities required for anyone at decent price.nn....feels like you are not far from home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:00.608173', 5, 571, 4),
(3395, U&'[surendra b] Swag Coliving is one of the best PGs in Hyderabad! The rooms are clean, spacious, and well-maintained, and the overall atmosphere is safe and comfortable.nnThe food is outstanding\2014fresh, hygienic, and delicious every day. It''s one of the biggest reasons I enjoy staying here.nnThe owner is extremely friendly, humble, and caring. Whenever any issue is reported, he responds immediately and makes sure it is resolved as quickly as possible. The management genuinely cares about the residents and provides excellent service.nnI highly recommend Swag Coliving to anyone looking for a comfortable, well-managed, and affordable place to stay in Hyderabad. Definitely a 5-star experience!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:01.667443', 5, 572, 4),
(3396, '[seetharamaiah chappidi] One of the best coliving PGs in Hyderabad! The rooms are clean, comfortable, and well maintained. The food is delicious, hygienic, and served with good variety. The owner is very friendly, approachable, and always resolves any issues promptly. The staff is supportive, and the overall atmosphere is safe and welcoming. With excellent amenities, regular housekeeping, and a convenient location, it''s a great place for both students and working professionals. I highly recommend Swag Coliving to anyone looking for a comfortable and hassle-free stay. Truly one of the best PGs in Hyderabad!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:01.667682', 5, 572, 4),
(3397, '[Sanker Nuthalapati] Very good pg homely atmosphere and food pg is situated very near to my institute rooms are clean and neat lt was nice staying here for 11 months and', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:01.667932', 5, 572, 4),
(3398, '[naragam monesh] Very well maintained rooms peaceful area good ventilation best pg in the locality', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:01.66813', 5, 572, 4),
(3399, '[Gayathri K] Had a fantastic stay here the rooms and common areas were kept spotlessly clean andbeds were very comfortable food is gud', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:01.668491', 5, 572, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3400, '[siva6 devarapu] I''ve stayed here for tha past 1.5 years and it''s honestly one of tha best coliving pg  in madhapur near by main road', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:01.668833', 5, 572, 4),
(3401, U&'[Mr. Akib Raza] Its really a peaceful place to live..every staff is humble,helpful.. everyone is cooperative and kind..nIf you looking for a pg, I recommend this pg\2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:01.66923', 5, 572, 4),
(3402, U&'[Atharva Khiste] It was Nice staying here for 6 Months.nGood Rooms \+01f6cf\fe0fnNice Terrace \2728nTT and Carrom \+01f3d3nnGood Management', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:01.669478', 5, 572, 4),
(3403, U&'[Subhajit Paul] **Hotel Review \2014 5-Night Stay**nnI stayed here for 5 nights, and my overall experience was decent, especially considering the price point. The hotel is quite affordable compared to similar properties in the area, making it a good choice for budget travelers or couples looking for a short stay.nn**Pros:**n- Rooms are decent in size with a comfortable double bed.n- Bathroom is clean with a continuous water supply and a working geyser, which is great during winters.n- Electricity backup ensures no major disruptions during power cuts.n- Bath towels and drinking water are provided.n- Couples are welcomed without any unnecessary hassle.n- Multiple food options are available nearby, and you can also bring outside food.n- Location has good transport connectivity \2014 cabs, autos, and bike taxis are easily available.nn**Cons:**n- The hotel is close to a lake, which can sometimes cause an unpleasant smell.n- Rooms don\2019t get much natural sunlight due to their layout.n- Daily cleaning isn\2019t automatic; you need to request it.n- Wi-Fi speed is poor and nearly unusable, so having a good mobile data backup helps.n- Mobile network fluctuates between 4G and 5G, which can drain your data quickly.n- The lift is usually out of service (possibly to save electricity), though stairs are accessible.n- The hotel itself doesn\2019t have an in-house restaurant; you\2019ll need to order from nearby places.nn**Overall Verdict:**nA budget-friendly stay with basic amenities and a few compromises. If you\2019re okay with limited sunlight, slow Wi-Fi, and using stairs, it\2019s worth the price for short stays \2014 especially given its good connectivity and welcoming environment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:02.486244', 3, 573, 4),
(3404, '[Shivam Sharma] A big big no for this place.nnZOLO Lakeview feels like a very fancy name. But here is my experiencennUpon reaching the location, I faced significant difficulty in even locating the property. I had to spend nearly one hour searching for it, as the contact number provided via WhatsApp communication was incorrect. This caused considerable inconvenience and stress to both me and my wife.nnAfter finally finding the property, the situation did not improve. The property is located in a very poor area, surrounded by ongoing construction work and an unbearable foul smell. There was no staff present at the reception upon arrival, and I had to wait an additional 30 minutes before someone attended to us.nnThe condition of the room was completely unacceptable. It was extremely dirty, with paan stains visible in multiple places. The buckets were unclean, the bathroom was unhygienic and not fit for use, and the air conditioner was not functioning at all.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:02.48653', 1, 573, 4),
(3405, U&'[Vijaya Prasad] Z Express Lakeview is nothing but a misrepresented, poorly maintained PG being falsely marketed as a proper accommodation.nnThe rooms are filthy, and the bathrooms, doors, and common areas are in an equally unhygienic and neglected state. Basic cleanliness standards are completely ignored.nnThe so-called \201cLakeview\201d is outright deceptive\2014there is no lake, only a small stagnant pond filled with what appears to be dirty, foul-smelling water. The stench itself makes the surroundings unpleasant.nnThere is absolutely no reception or management support. No staff is available to assist guests\2014room allocation was handled by a security guard, which clearly reflects the lack of any proper system or accountability. Even the lifts are dirty and poorly maintained.nnThe photos displayed on MakeMyTrip and similar platforms are blatantly misleading and do not match reality at all. They appear heavily edited and are clearly intended to deceive customers.nnIn reality, this is just a basic PG setup where anyone\2014students, unemployed individuals, and working professionals\2014are staying, with no standards, no service, and no resemblance to what is being advertised.nnStrongly not recommended. This place is a complete disappointment and a clear case of false advertising.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:02.486733', 1, 573, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3406, '[Snigdha Ghosh] It''s not worst like many reviews said, it''s a cheap hostel. If you''re expecting luxury or comfort or hotel feel, this is not the place at all. I stayed on a per day basis for 12days in single occupancy room. If you are looking for cheap place to stay near financial district, go for it. It''s a 2.5 rating out of 5. Good thing list: safe place, clean and cleaned daily, nearby availability of shops, utilities, groceries, tiffin centre etc, auto power backup, wifi, fire TV stick with TV, good water supply, RO for drinking water, lift and parking, everyday cleaning, AC, geyser, soft pillows, quiet ambience, Manager Dinesh is goid and responsive. Cons of the place: rooms are not freshly painted, walls are chipped due to sepage, mattress is hard, rooms have a damp smell, no mosquito repellent in room, common area isnt great but has washing machine, no food facility, no iron facility.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:02.486915', 2, 573, 4),
(3407, U&'[Adhika Joshi] Lift not working since 4 days and they are switching on lift in morning and off at night daily i have to walk 5 floors at 2 am midnight \+01f621\+01f621\+01f621\+01f621\+01f621worst service in last 3 months lift is not working after every 15/20 days very worst zolo service very worst worst worst experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:02.487099', 1, 573, 4),
(3408, U&'[Vamshi Putti] Staying at Zolo Lakeview feels just like home. The staff maintain the property well and respond quickly. Karthik helped me a lot with the booking and guided me clearly whenever I didn\2019t understand something. Overall, staying here has been a very good experience for me', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:02.487277', 5, 573, 4),
(3409, U&'[Tanveer Ahmed] Property does not arrange food. They discontinued Zolo Food Subscription and that\2019s a huge pain. Also, does not have table and chair.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:02.487459', 3, 573, 4),
(3410, '[KARTHICK M] - Too costly.n- Service is good.n- But it feels like staying in a lodge since the rooms were very small and I wasn''t able to make a WFH setup.n- No food provided by them. Self cookingn-  The electricity bill is too high. Don''t know how the government approved this.n- In the area you won''t get jio internet. Do always depends on their wifi . Which does not work most of the days.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:02.487632', 2, 573, 4),
(3411, '[Nilesh Dracula] Lift is broken, lights not working, but nothing is being fixed.nnthere is fixed electricity charge, even if electricity is not used you have to pay 1k per month as fixed amount, total lootnnmess is closed at 10pm. If your roommate switches off light and you have to eat, no place to eat.nnarrogant owner does not care about maintenance.nnbike parking always full.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:03.533687', 1, 574, 4),
(3412, '[Susanth Das] Live well luxury pg service offersnExcellent accommodation withallnThe required facilities the room quality isimpressive, andevrything iskept neat and organized', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:03.533914', 5, 574, 4),
(3413, '[De ep] Worst PG to live in, food is tremendously bad especially on Lunch menus, if you are looking for PG around Kondapur don''t come to this PG, thank me later .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:03.534094', 1, 574, 4),
(3414, U&'[abhishek barik] Very good PG for Men. Well maintained and clean. Food here is very good compared to other PG\2019s. There\2019s lift facility, Wifi, Water, Washing Machine etc. I would recommend to join this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:03.53427', 4, 574, 4),
(3415, U&'[bala krishnan] Poor service lift won\2019t work sometimes shock will come  in lift no maintenance power cut issue non of a response you get from the owner and even at morning water won\2019t come', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:03.53445', 1, 574, 4),
(3416, '[Shrikanth Kulkarni] Very clean and neat rooms with good quality food and mentainence...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:03.53462', 5, 574, 4),
(3417, '[Suryam M] One of the worst service and owner behaviour no.1 worst hostel in Hyderabad', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:03.534793', 1, 574, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3418, '[akhilraj bandi] Worst pg in recent timesnIssuesn1) seperate electricity bill atleast 500 rupees need to pay even when we haven''t use of power for particular month.n2) lift is the worst part I have seen . I got struck manytimes here .n3) food quality is average.n4) wifi speed is not good.n5) no generator facility. Very frequent power cuts present.n6) most of the pgs are collecting advance of 2-3 k but here we need to pay 5000.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:03.53496', 1, 574, 4),
(3419, '[graphicanjelo] Stating here for 1 year and 3 months, they are good in food and accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:04.111841', 4, 575, 4),
(3420, '[Sahil Syed] This PG is really better when compared to most of the PG''s in the same locality. It has well maintained rooms with all the amenities like TV with firestick, Washing machine, dhobi service, high speed internet etc. They also provide workstation in the room. The food is great and management is friendly and receptive to feedback.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:04.112451', 5, 575, 4),
(3421, U&'[Phaninndra Nani] No dought of joining ! Definitely a worthy u0026 cleanliness is main part of this PG and food part is too perfect (no limit) \+01f44d\+01f3fb and too spacious building and for 2 wheeler vehicle parking also and good atmosphere environment', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:04.112768', 5, 575, 4),
(3422, '[Prince kumar] The best thing of this PG is food, fresh food and whenever u have some problem in PG the owner resolve it asap', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:04.112964', 5, 575, 4),
(3423, '[nistala saichaitanya] Very good pg with healthy maintenance of rooms (daily) and hygienic food. Quality facilities with a neat environment. The area is also best for any type of commute. Management was also good with quick response for any issues. Would recommend for the ones looking for pg in Gachibowli area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:04.113151', 5, 575, 4),
(3424, '[Jayakrishna Reddy] I''ve found a fantastic PG near Gachibowli where the first food is delightful, reminiscent of home-cooked meals. The maintenance team ensures daily cleaning of both the rooms and washrooms. It''s a comfortable and welcoming place!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:04.113328', 5, 575, 4),
(3425, '[Thomas Paul] Verry good PG in this locality. Lived here for more than a year. It has well maintained rooms with all the amenities like TV with firestick, Washing machine, dhobi service, high speed internet etc. good for wfh. The food is great and management is friendly and open to feedback and also imediate resolution.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:04.113512', 5, 575, 4),
(3426, '[Akhil Mohan] Best place to live in this area.nFood is good, specially the breakfast, you won''t skip it.nRooms have proper ventilation.nBut the best part of this PG is hygiene. Neat and tidy place to live.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:04.113682', 5, 575, 4),
(3427, U&'[Eniya TV] I recently visited Hyderabad for the first time and stayed at this hostel for five days. The rooms were neat and well-maintained, and the owner was very kind and down-to-earth.nnStaying in a completely new city can feel unfamiliar, but choosing the right place makes all the difference. This hostel made me feel safe, comfortable, and at ease throughout my stay.nnOverall, it\2019s a great and secure place to stay, and I would definitely recommend it to others.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:05.054022', 5, 576, 4),
(3428, U&'[Khushi Thakur] The PG is very good\2014it''s spacious, clean, and well maintained. I had a comfortable stay. One suggestion for improvement would be to install an RO water purifier for drinking water, as it would make the stay even more convenient.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:05.05433', 5, 576, 4),
(3429, '[ITZ- HARSHITHA] I stayed in this PG for a few months.nIt''s truly feels like a home.nSelf-cooking facilities are also available.nThe owner aunty behaviour is excellent.nIf you are looking for a peaceful place then, I highly recommend this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:05.054639', 5, 576, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3430, '[dipsikha bora] Excellent PG with clean rooms, good food, and a friendly atmosphere. The management is supportive, and the facilities are well-maintained. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:05.055107', 5, 576, 4),
(3431, U&'[Bhuvi Kothari] I highly recommend this pg . The rooms were clean and spacious  and comfortable and the management is friendly and comfortable , the location is also quite convienient making daily travel easier , overall I\2019m happy with the experience\2026\263a\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:05.055349', 5, 576, 4),
(3432, U&'[Reetu Gaidhane] Padamavathi Paying Guest Accommodation for girls has a very homely and comfortable environment. The rooms and bathrooms are well-maintained and always clean. One of the best things is the excellent ventilation \2014 the floors have an attached balcony which makes the space airy and pleasant. Overall, it feels safe, peaceful, and like a home away from home. Highly recommended for girls staying in Basant Nagar Colony, Kachiguda.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:05.055616', 5, 576, 4),
(3433, '[N140177 PEDIREDLA SOWJANYA] The PG was good, rooms are spacious and maintained clean every day. Have to cook your own food the kitchen space also Good. Management responds well with any queries quickly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:05.055811', 5, 576, 4),
(3434, U&'[Dr. Pratiksha Warkad] Highly recommended place to stay for girls...very safe environment for girls and rooms are very clean and neat with attached washroom . Every room is spacious with sufficient ventilation and washrooms are very well maintained with regular cleaning. Really love this place ...\+01f493', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:05.056049', 5, 576, 4),
(3435, U&'[S.v.s Verra 18] I\2019ve had a great experience staying at this PG. The staff here are extremely polite, helpful, and always available to assist with any needs. Their friendly behavior and professional attitude create a very homely and comfortable environment.nnThe food served is hygienic, well-prepared, and feels like home-cooked meals. There\2019s a good variety in the menu, and they try to accommodate everyone\2019s taste preferences.nnThere was a recent gas issue, but the PG management managed the situation efficiently and ensured residents were not inconvenienced much. They arranged alternatives and resolved the issue promptly. Appreciate their effort and responsibility.\201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:05.890386', 5, 577, 4),
(3436, '[Uday Kumar] I had a great experience staying at Venkateswara PG. The rooms are clean and well-maintained, the food is tasty and hygienic, and the overall atmosphere is peaceful. The management is friendly, responsive, and always ready to help. The location is convenient with easy access to transport and nearby essentials. A safe, comfortable, and affordable place to stay. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:05.89079', 5, 577, 4),
(3437, U&'[Yarasi Sivasai] I\2019ve been staying at this hostel for the past week and my experience has been excellent. The food is very good, the rooms are comfortable, and cleanliness is maintained really well. The staff is extremely cooperative and always ready to help. The owners (aunty and uncle) are very cool, polite, and decent people who make you feel at home. Overall, it\2019s a very comfortable and positive place to stay. Highly recommended.nnFood : 5/5, feels like home food and maintains hygiene.nCleaning: 5/5, every day the staff clean the room and washroom.nRoom and lockers : for every 2 weeks, the staff changes the bed covers and pillow covers.nnOverall rating: 5/5', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:05.891079', 5, 577, 4),
(3438, '[Ashok Reddy] Hostel ambience is Excellent, Food they provide we feel ike homely food with good quality and taste.nNo compromise in daily house keeping and maintenance also excellent.nGood place to stay for all working professionals and students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:05.891372', 5, 577, 4),
(3439, '[Goddumuri Raju] I have been staying here for almost an year, it''s a good PG with cleanliness rooms, hygienic food, water, and have good maintenance. It''s located a bit far from main road so not much vehicle noise and greenery around the PG which I like. Overall it''s good and comfortable to stay and work.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:05.891615', 5, 577, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3440, U&'[teja dvv] Staying at Venkateshwara PG has been an incredibly pleasant experience. The food here is exceptionally good \2014 it truly gives you that homely feeling, which is rare to find in most PGs. The rooms and, more importantly, the washrooms are very well maintained and kept clean at all times.nnOne thing that really impressed me is their commitment to hygiene \2014 they change bed sheets and pillow covers bi-weekly without fail, something I haven''t seen in any other PG so far. Also, they make their own homemade curd, and the taste is simply amazing.nnThey provide clean, safe RO water, which I believe is one of the most essential things for good health. The rules and regulations are clearly defined and strictly followed \2014 no alcohol or smoking is allowed here, which adds to the peaceful environment.nnThe staff is very friendly and supportive, making the place feel just like home. Overall, I\2019d highly recommend this PG for anyone looking for a clean, well-managed, and homely place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:05.891793', 5, 577, 4),
(3441, U&'[Ramsai Akula] Staying in this PG for the past one year has been a very good experience for me. The rooms are comfortable, the environment feels safe, and the staff are helpful and cooperative. Food quality and cleanliness are well maintained, and basic facilities like Wi\2011Fi, water and electricity are reliable. Overall, it is a good place for students and working professionals who want a homely and budget\2011friendly stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:05.891966', 5, 577, 4),
(3442, U&'[adithyabuilding metirials] one of the best decisions I''ve made since starting my new job . The convenience factor alone is worth five stars! Everything is taken care of: high-speed Wi-Fi, delicious home-cooked meals (a lifesaver after a long day!), and prompt maintenance service. This setup allows me to focus completely on my work and studies without the daily stress of household chores and utility management.n\200bBeyond the hassle-free services, the real gem is the sense of community. It\2019s not just a place to stay; it''s a supportive environment. I''ve met incredible people here who have quickly become good friends, making the transition to a new city feel seamless and welcoming. The common areas are always clean and well-maintained, providing perfect spots for late-night study sessions or weekend unwinding.n\200bThe safety and security features, combined with the excellent management staff, make this PG feel truly like a second home. If you''re looking for an affordable, convenient, and friendly place that delivers exceptional value, I highly recommend checking out a well-run PG like this one. It\2019s comfortable, friendly, and truly a great place to live!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:05.892136', 5, 577, 4),
(3443, '[Mohammad tauseef] I came for my medical in Hyderabad diagnostic centre. So I search this hostel.nThe hostel is good to stay for 2 to 3 daysnStaff is management is good . 3 times food . If you have any questions directly call to management.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:07.713557', 4, 579, 4),
(3444, '[sampath kumar] I had a wonderful stay at this PG. The rooms are clean, comfortable, and well-maintained, and the food feels just like home. The pricing is very reasonable compared to other places nearby.nnRahul, the owner, is very friendly and supportive, always ready to help and ensure everyone feels at home.nnI highly recommend this PG for anyone looking for a safe, comfortable, and welcoming stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:07.713774', 5, 579, 4),
(3445, '[Shaik Shahid] A good hostel for employeesnNeat and clean MentiancenFood also good in this pricenWardenu0026owner rahul was a osm friendly person', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:07.713956', 5, 579, 4),
(3446, U&'[RAVI KUMAR] I stayed at Sri Devi Boys Hostel, Somajiguda and honestly it\2019s the best hostel in Somajiguda, Punjagutta area. The rooms are clean, food is homely, and the prices are very affordable compared to other hostels nearby.nnSpecial thanks to Rahul anna, the owner. he is very humble, helpful and treats everyone like family. Really happy with the stay. Highly recommend this place if you are looking for comfort and safety! \+01f64c\+01f3fd\+01f3e1\2728', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:07.714129', 5, 579, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3447, U&'[Baddam Madhav Reddy] you''re looking for a hostel with great food and a peaceful stay, just book this place. The owner is an amazing guy\2014very humble, down-to-earth, and always helpful', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:07.714313', 5, 579, 4),
(3448, U&'[The Destroyer] Only tomato \+01f345 here...nI don''t know why many brain less people say''s homely food and all that..\+01f92e\+01f92e\+01f92e', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:07.714536', 1, 579, 4),
(3449, '[srikanth sriramoju] The best hostel with cleanliness, security, friendly staff, great location, social atmosphere, good Wi-Fi, and value for money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:07.714851', 5, 579, 4),
(3450, '[HEMANTH VEERA] The best PG in Somajiguda punjagutta with Spacious rooms, good ventilation and big size beds...The Management is so friendly, and they respond so quickly. The food is good...The locality is so peaceful...overall it is the best PG u can find for reasonable prices...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:07.715083', 5, 579, 4),
(3451, U&'[Sandhya Rani] Good Accommodation for Girls.nI stayed here for a month.nNice Locality with Good Greenary all around.nPleasant Mornings with Peacocks Wake-up Calls.nMay look bit Costly but Can''t Expect Budget ones in Banjara hills no..? \+01f60a.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:08.245619', 5, 580, 4),
(3452, '[Krishna Dey] When I visited this place for the stay of my sister in law.they were talking to us very sweet and nicely.later she went to stay there, it''s very terrible.once monsoon starts,there will be flooded infront of this pg, and it''s full of drainage water.cant even walk through that way.and she itself seen rats and cockroaches all over in the kitchen and rooms. If anyone is planning to stay there please don''t go.had bery bad experience from this pg owners , they won''t be doing what they''ve said ,when you meet them first.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:08.246051', 1, 580, 4),
(3453, '[Sai Ram] My sister was here for her job relocation and stayed here for more than a year. I didn''t have to worry about anything, be it safety, food or anything for that matter. Landlords were kind enough to sort and make any adjustments. Overall she was happy with her stay here', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:08.246225', 5, 580, 4),
(3454, '[Sherin Susy A Paul] I stayed in the pg for my internship for about four months. The stay was good and safe. Issues and concerns were addressed appropriately. Had good provision for cooking and the provided food qas also good. Overall satisfied with the stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:08.246407', 5, 580, 4),
(3455, '[Mallela Ravi] Not at all worthy place according to the rent ,the photos they sent in the beginning was older photos ,and its completely different from the photos . Owners are very Sweet at first later once we enrolled there they''ll rude.they only need rent and reviews.i came to know that ,the reviews that appears here are mostly from their own relatives and even the person who''s working there is posted positive reviews.please none fall for these fake reviews,if you ask the existing ladies there. They''ll be saying the truth.because my sister got trapped there and survived very hardly for 4 months.rent is very costly,and they don''t provide the quality', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:08.246572', 1, 580, 4),
(3456, '[Civil Knowledge] A nice pg that I found inbudget and rooms are very clean and maintain neatly. The surroundings environment also green and very pleasant.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:08.246809', 5, 580, 4),
(3457, '[Nisha Thomas] I had pretty good experience with sangeeta paying guest pg good environment and clean hygience rooms good food really a nice pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:08.247117', 5, 580, 4),
(3458, '[aditi das] great place to stay! the environment is safe and comfortable and the location is perfect. food and basic amenities are well taken care of, i had a very pleasant experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:08.247881', 5, 580, 4),
(3459, '[Anshul] I stayed here from May 2024 till April 2025. Its the best PG in entire east Hyderabad near to NSL uppal. Food is also good as per the price. The facilities are also good and the ambience is very good. Must try and get a place to stay here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:09.271169', 5, 581, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3460, '[SUJITH RAJ] * The stay was comfortable and well-maintained.n* Rooms were clean and hygiene standards were good.n* Food quality was decent and served on time.n* Location is convenient with easy access to transport and shops.n* Owner/management was cooperative and responsive.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:09.271476', 5, 581, 4),
(3461, '[SAQLAIN SAQU] I would like to share my feedback about Nest PG. The caretaker, Satish, is very kind, helpful, and responsible. He always supports residents and maintains a friendly environment. The cleaning department team is also very humble and does a great job in keeping the premises clean and well-maintained. Overall, I am very satisfied with the service and management.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:09.272111', 5, 581, 4),
(3462, U&'[Vadde Rajesh Mitra] One of the Best PG i have seen in HyderabadnLiterally the food was excellent and compared to remaining PG highly recommend this nest PGnSatish bro ..he treat like ownnThank you so much for the good environment \263a\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:09.272755', 5, 581, 4),
(3463, '[Jaswanth naidu Sakhumalla] I stayed for over 2years and maintenance and food are very good and staff are very available if anything needed and good experience thorough out my time in nest pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:09.273228', 5, 581, 4),
(3464, U&'[Sai Krishna] The Best PG in Hyderabad what I would say. Owner''s were really nice people. Owner Karan he''ll really generous and kind person. He''ll provide all the amenities u0026 responds quickly if you''re facing any issues he''ll try to sort it out asap. Food is fabulous, it really taste as Home Food. The area is under surveillance 24/7, Rooms are so spacious and clean. Overall ambience is pretty good. Open Terrace with a scenic view it really makes you feel pleasant in the mornings. We can have a nice cup of coffee or else we can use it as a workplace in the mornings.nI feel this is best you get in Hyderabad to stay with feasible prices. I would recommend this place to my friends cuz it''s worth it! \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:09.27346', 5, 581, 4),
(3465, '[Ansh Arak] The Accomodation is pretty good compared to other hostels/PGs in this area... If you are looking for a peaceful place to stay , I  would definitely suggest this', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:09.273715', 4, 581, 4),
(3466, '[Chetan Dhondekar] I have came from Mumbai for short stay. Very good PG in Hyderabad,  Also good for people who are looking for short stay. Owner is very nice and humble guy. Responds quickly if you are facing any issue and will try to solve it as soon as possible.nGood ambience and spacious rooms, Good view from terrace, no power issues, foods are home made, good food, cleanliness maintained as the maid cleans the room and corridors every day. Also having good WIFI connectivity. Near to metro station and can be located easily. I would strongly recommended to people who are looking to stay in Hyderabad.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:09.274249', 5, 581, 4),
(3467, '[Reva Reyaz] It''s hard to put into words how grateful I am for my four years at this PG. It has been much more than just a place to stay.Throughout my stay, the hygiene and cleanliness were consistently well maintained, making it a comfortable and healthy place to live. Every meal reflected the care and effort put into maintaining both quality and taste, making dining here a pleasant experience.nnOne of the things I appreciated the most was the excellent security, which made me feel safe and secure at all times. The owners and staff are incredibly caring, welcoming, and treat every resident like family. Their warmth, hospitality, and willingness to help made my entire stay a wonderful experience.nI am truly grateful for all the care and support I received over the years. I would highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a clean, safe, and homely place to stay. Thank you for making my four years so memorable!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:10.07739', 5, 582, 4),
(3468, U&'[Jasmine Muskan] My stay at this PG was truly amazing and felt just like being at home. Aunty and the entire family are incredibly warm, welcoming, and always ready to help, which made the experience even more special. The food is absolutely delicious, with a homely touch that you don\2019t often find elsewhere. The rooms are very clean, well-maintained, and hygienic, ensuring a comfortable and stress-free stay. The overall environment is peaceful, safe, and friendly, making it a perfect place for anyone looking for both comfort and care. I would highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a pleasant and memorable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:10.077676', 5, 582, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3469, U&'[Madhura Ghan] This PG was by far the best choice I made when moving to Hyderabad. The environment is friendly, the food is good and Ayesha maam ensures that all things are in order.nThe feel of the place is quite safe. Cleaning happens everyday. Overall, a pretty good place if you\2019re look for a PG in the area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:10.07785', 5, 582, 4),
(3470, '[jeeshitha venkatesulu] Comfortable PG with a pleasant living environment.nRooms are neat, well-maintained, and provide all essential amenities.nSpecial thanks to Ayesha aunty for taking such good care and making the stay feel like home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:10.078059', 5, 582, 4),
(3471, U&'[SAI KUMAR REDDY] Worst management and Very disappointed with the management of this women\2019s PG. They do not provide proper or clear information to residents and often change details later. The staff behavior is very rude and unprofessional. Instead of helping politely, they speak disrespectfully and do not respond properly to concerns. Management should improve communication and learn how to treat residents with basic respect.nCalling a review \201cfake\201d instead of understanding the concern only proves the point about unprofessional behavior. Clear communication and respectful responses are expected from any management team. Mentioning someone\2019s budget in a public reply is unnecessary and inappropriate. Reviews are based on experiences and interactions, and this was mine.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:10.078219', 1, 582, 4),
(3472, '[Joann Elizabeth] Stayed here for two months and it was a really great experience.It was a great place with really good food and great people who treat and take care of you like family.Felt really safe and at home during my stay.Would recommend to everyone and especially to people who''s moving to a big new city alone for the first time.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:10.078455', 5, 582, 4),
(3473, '[rachna meshram] I had a fantastic experience staying at this PG. The hosts were incredibly welcoming and made me feel right at home from the moment I arrived. The rooms are clean, cozy, and well-maintained, with all the amenities needed for a comfortable stay.nnThe food is home cooked and delicious. The environment is very peaceful and everyone is very amiable. It is just the place to make you feel home away from home!nnI want thank Ayesha auntie for the lovely time!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:10.078617', 5, 582, 4),
(3474, '[Shweta Menon] It''s a good place to stay . maintains good hygiene and Environment is homely .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:10.078778', 5, 582, 4),
(3475, U&'[Yash Sonone] Over the past 10 months at Homestay Men\2019s PG, I\2019ve had a wonderful experience. Manohar, the owner, and Shyam, the supervisor, are genuinely caring. I especially want to highlight that even when there was a gas cylinder crisis, they made sure we were well fed. They solved any issues instantly and made me feel truly at home. I\2019m really grateful for their care!nI also want to mention that the entire staff from the food team to the cleaning staff are so friendly and deserve appreciation. Plus, all the facilities, like the washing machine, refrigerator, water dispenser are excellent. And I\2019ve got to say, the Wi-Fi is impressively strong on every floor. All in all, it\2019s a place I\2019m truly happy to have stayed!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:12.212629', 5, 584, 4),
(3476, '[Narasingarao Kondapalli] I stayed at this PG from almost 1 year and had a very good experience. The owner is very kind, supportive, and always helpful whenever needed. The accommodation is clean, comfortable, and well maintained. The food quality is also good and feels like home-cooked meals. Overall, it is a great place to stay for students and working professionals. I highly recommend this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:12.212786', 5, 584, 4),
(3477, U&'[Theja Kotte] The best PG I''ve ever stayed in Hyderabad! The food is absolutely top-notch. \+01f525 The rooms, maintenance, cleanliness, and overall ambience truly define luxury. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a premium PG experience!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:12.212916', 5, 584, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3478, '[mahesh venneti] Well maintained.nImmediate response from management. Spacious rooms for 2 and 1 sharing. Budget friendly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:12.213102', 5, 584, 4),
(3479, U&'[arun karthik] Staying in a hostel was a good experience overall. The place was budget-friendly and suitable for short stays. The rooms were decent, and basic facilities were available. It\2019s a great option for meeting new people and sharing experiences.Overall, it\2019s a good choice if you are looking for an affordable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:12.213268', 5, 584, 4),
(3480, U&'[Akhil Gautam] Lived here for almost 6 months, great experience, large single room, never had any problem with management either.nSupervisor and owner are great, the workers are also quite friendly.n3 meals a day, hygienic, and they clean the dining hall after every meal.nHad a good experience \+01f44d\+01f3fb\+01f44d\+01f3fb', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:12.213405', 5, 584, 4),
(3481, '[Lokesh T] Stayed here for almost a year and it truly felt like a home stay. The owner is very kind and friendly, food quality is good, and overall atmosphere is comfortable and safe. Thank you for the great stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:12.213538', 5, 584, 4),
(3482, '[Rohith Kotipalli] One of the Best Pg''s in Hyderabad. I''ve stayed here for 6 months. The rooms are good. They clean it regularly. Good wifi no interruptions. The food is above average. The supervisor and staff are very friendly. If you mention a problem, they react soon. Even spare keys are maintained. The parking space is good. They have CCTV''S every where. All I can say is, it''s really a peaceful place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:12.21383', 5, 584, 4),
(3483, U&'[Saroj Patnaik] \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50nnI had a great experience staying here. The rooms are always clean and well maintained. The food is good and hygienic. Bike parking is available, which is very convenient. They also provide clean mineral drinking water. The management is friendly and supportive, and the overall environment is comfortable and peaceful. I would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a good place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:13.337908', 5, 585, 4),
(3484, '[surendra b] I had a great experience staying at Prasanth Luxury Men''s PG. The rooms are clean, spacious, and well-maintained. The food is tasty and served on time. Housekeeping is regular, and the Wi-Fi works well for office work. The owner and staff are friendly, helpful, and quick to resolve any issues. The location is excellent, especially for professionals working in Madhapur and Hitech City. Overall, it''s one of the best PGs in the area. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:13.338139', 5, 585, 4),
(3485, '[satyanarayana reddy] Very decent place to stay, which provides timely amenities  essentials for day to day living. Awesome network and wifi which supports us in doing work from home as wellnDisciplined and healthy food, homely food and no regrets on food, especially during this gas shortage time as well there is no food shortage where other hostels in the community had restrictions.nnRecommending for good stay.nnAll rooms like 1 bhk, 2/3/4 sharing are avalaible.nnRegards,nJaya krishnanStay Period - 11 months.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:13.338287', 5, 585, 4),
(3486, '[Shivananda Purohit] Ultimate choice for Bachelors like us. Great rooms, management is very systematic. Hygiene is their top priority. Parking is always available. Elevator is there. Top of everything you get a nice terrace to dry clothes and hang out.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:13.338428', 5, 585, 4),
(3487, '[Vittri Vijay] Best PG stay in Madhapur, food is too good. Affordable PG, walkable distance to Main road. Good boys PG. I liked it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:13.33862', 5, 585, 4),
(3488, U&'[Abhijit Karmakar] I have stayed in this PG for the last 2 years, and my experience has been excellent. The rooms are spacious and well-maintained, and cleanliness is always up to the mark. It''s true that all depends on room partners.The food quality is also very good compared to other PGs I have stayed in. The owner is very well-behaved and approachable \2014 whenever we have any issue, he listens and resolves it quickly. Overall, it\2019s a comfortable, safe, and homely place to stay. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:13.338801', 5, 585, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3489, '[Sudesh Kadam] The service quality is poor is not good, and there are extra charges like electricity every month. Management is not supportive, and communication with the owner is difficult and often rude. I faced unnecessary stress regarding rent and deposit. Overall, the experience was unprofessional. I would not recommend this PG to others. Please think carefully before joining. Deposit not returned, Luggage being withheld, Very rude owner behavior, Poor food u0026 facilities, Extra hidden charges, No empathy for medical emergencies.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:13.338988', 1, 585, 4),
(3490, '[Nigam Patro] One of the best PG available in Madhapur. Super clean rooms, best quality food, spacious rooms, geaser, 24/7 electricity, super speed WiFi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:13.339168', 5, 585, 4),
(3491, U&'[Tarun] I stayed at Nexin PG in Hyderabad for one month when I was new to the city and took a 2-sharing room. Before joining, I clearly informed the caretaker that I would vacate after one month. He took the payment but never informed me that I needed to send a separate message for deposit refund processing.nnAfter vacating, they refused to return my deposit money saying I didn\2019t send any message. This condition was never communicated to me earlier. I even tried discussing the issue with the owner, but they kept talking in their local language, which I could not understand, and my issue was not resolved.nnVery disappointing experience, especially for someone new to Hyderabad. Please make all refund rules clear to tenants in advance.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:13.92857', 1, 586, 4),
(3492, '[anesh Bathula] Nice supervisor name venkatesh talk like a friend...rooms was excellent food is so Good compare with other hostels', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:13.928768', 5, 586, 4),
(3493, '[mandapalli Jaswanth] One of worst PG in my entire lifenThey will scam you with money they say maintenance is refundable but they will find a reason to argue and the amount will not be refunded to you.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:13.928915', 1, 586, 4),
(3494, '[BTech Student] Worst foodnFully water in chicken curry and too regular curriesnStaying purpose is ok but food is not good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:13.92905', 1, 586, 4),
(3495, U&'[Sravan yadav] Ambience was too good , homely food , friendly management mainly the owner pratap anna \+01f64c', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:13.929189', 5, 586, 4),
(3496, U&'[Chandra Kishore] I had a great experience staying at this hostel. The rooms are spacious and well-ventilated, providing plenty of comfort and privacy. One thing I really appreciated was the cleanliness \2013 the staff ensures daily cleaning, which keeps everything fresh and tidy. It\2019s also a great place for accommodation, whether you\2019re traveling for work or leisure. The location is convenient, and the overall environment is peaceful and welcoming. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:13.929516', 5, 586, 4),
(3497, '[venkateswara reddy gajjala] Overall very great experience, owner also very friendly and food taste also like home food, maintanence excellent. Owner also have separate pgs for boys and girls. If I want to suggest a pg in madhapur I would like to suggest this pg for boys and another pg for girls', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:13.929934', 5, 586, 4),
(3498, '[Santosh Kumar] Good maintenance and best choice for boy and also food very good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:13.930238', 5, 586, 4),
(3499, U&'[Venkatesh Dangeti] \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50nStayed here for a few months and had a good experience. Rooms are clean, food is decent, Wi-Fi is reliable, and housekeeping is regular. The staff is friendly and responsive, and the location is convenient for IT professionals working in Madhapur/HITEC City. Overall, a comfortable and budget-friendly place to stay. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:14.671689', 5, 587, 4),
(3500, U&'[Irshad Shaik] I had a really good experience staying at Colours Men''s PG u0026 Hostel in Madhapur. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and comfortable, with a nice modern feel.nnThe facilities are great\2014good Wi-Fi, regular housekeeping, and hygienic food. The location is also very convenient, especially if you\2019re working in the IT area.nnSpecial thanks to the owner (Anna), who is very friendly, helpful, and always available if you need anything. He makes sure everyone feels comfortable and taken care of.nnOverall, it\2019s a safe, well-managed, and comfortable place to stay. Definitely recommended for anyone looking for a quality PG in Madhapur.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:14.671932', 5, 587, 4);          
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3501, '[Vipin Bhardwaj] One of the best luxury PGs in Madhapur! The facilities are top-notch with daily housekeeping, good Wi-Fi, and a calm environment. The staff is friendly and very supportive. Security is also well taken care of, which gives great peace of mind. Highly recommended for anyone searching for a clean and comfortable PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:14.672086', 5, 587, 4),
(3502, '[waseem saha] One of the best Pg in madhapur ayyappa society PG owner is too friendly u0026 food very good i feel homely atmosphere strongly recommend in whole Hyderabad', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:14.672388', 5, 587, 4),
(3503, U&'[Vicky] Clean rooms, good security, and reliable water and power backup. That\2019s what matters, and Colours delivers on all three. Wi-Fi speed is decent, housekeeping is regular, and the terrace is a nice bonus. Compared to other PGs in the area, this feels organized and well maintained.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:14.672754', 5, 587, 4),
(3504, U&'[Atul mishra] Stayed at Colours Colive for a few months and honestly had a smooth experience. Rooms are well ventilated, mattress quality is surprisingly good, and having a proper work table made WFH easy. Food is consistent and the location is a big plus if you work around Hitec City or Mindspace. Management is responsive and doesn\2019t complicate things.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:14.672938', 5, 587, 4),
(3505, '[monica benjamin] This PG feels premium at homely dast office polite food qualities excellent and location is super convenient close to metro and mindspace', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:14.673066', 5, 587, 4),
(3506, '[Sudhir Behera] I had a wonderful experience staying at this PG for 9  months. The affordability and cleanliness were truly impressive. The housekeeping staff did an exceptional job, ensuring the entire building was spotless every single day.nnThe owner, Mr. Prashanth, was extremely supportive throughout my stay. Even during my checkout, the final settlement of my advance was smooth and hassle-free.nnI highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable and clean place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:14.673264', 5, 587, 4),
(3507, '[Raja Gopal] Its PG for both male and female. Everything is fine but only pillow and bed is there you need to manage on your own in AC room without blankets or bedspread.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:15.958468', 4, 588, 4),
(3508, '[Vardhan Raju] Worst experience evernI paid my hostel fee but account got freezed bcz of the hostel people when I went to bank and police station they said that hostel has been suspicious and there are so many suspicious transactions listed and keeping their mistake they took my bike and locked it in a room for their mistake it''s been 6 months still my money got stucked and account is in freeze only.nso never ever choose this OLIVE Nest or their associated pg they are totally scam.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:15.958663', 1, 588, 4),
(3509, '[dimpu manu] Nice co-Living PG for long term  and short term stay feels like home with homely food... I recommend this PG stay. As well as they have hotel with all facilities. They have great security and safety for both PG and Hotel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:15.958978', 5, 588, 4),
(3510, '[Satheesh Naini] Daily  Room cleaning  is goodnBathroom  are cleaning  is goodnGood  foodnNice stay..', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:15.959737', 5, 588, 4),
(3511, '[Abhi Mannem] Subject: Disappointing Experience with Drinking Water HygienennI recently had the unfortunate experience of encountering subpar hygiene standards regarding the drinking water at your hostel(Pg). Despite my expectations for a clean and comfortable stay, the quality of the water provided was far from satisfactory.nnI kindly urge the hostel(Pg) management to conduct a thorough examination of their water supply system, ensuring that it meets the necessary health and safety standards. It is crucial to address this issue promptly to safeguard the well-being of your guests and maintain the reputation of the hostel(Pg).nnI trust that you will take immediate action to rectify this matter and prevent similar incidents in the future. Your attention to this concern is greatly appreciated.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:15.960439', 1, 588, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3512, '[Ajay Kumar] I am staying one yearnDaily cleaning was goodnFriendly staffnNice stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:15.960961', 5, 588, 4),
(3513, U&'[Manikonda Teja] Scam hotelnPower bill - total scamnMaintenance - zeronFood - doesn\2019t improve even if we complainnWater - running water plant is not a problem they don\2019t even maintain it properlynWi-Fi  or signal- we don\2019t get signal in this building and 30% of the month we don\2019t get Wi-FinWashing machines - useless check with the medium hostel who are providing best washing machines for customer. This hostel provide useless washing machines whenever u ask they keep on saying we have raised compliant to company it been months no repair has been done.nFeedback - how much u compliant they won\2019t hear the simple answer they say is want to stay  - stay  otherwise check for other PG shame on people who working herennFor people who are coming here don\2019t check for reviews just check with customers and this are feedback got by forcing customers', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:15.961471', 1, 588, 4),
(3514, '[Shankey Gujjar] Daily rooms clean was goodnGood foodnFriendly staffnPrasanna mam nice talkingnNice stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:15.961849', 5, 588, 4),
(3515, '[sumedh patil] Spacious pg with parking space available.nNo restrictions.nFood is good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:17.443062', 5, 589, 4),
(3516, '[Srinivas Thrinath] I joined this PG today. The rooms are good, the washrooms are clean, and overall everything is comfortable here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:17.443345', 5, 589, 4),
(3517, '[Harsha Vardhan Mandala] Excellent place to stay. Affordable rents. Good management and food. Best in the area. Would recommend it for sure.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:17.443661', 5, 589, 4),
(3518, '[Dipti Ranjan Biswal] This PG is excellent for living, free space and freedom and also very comfortable to staying and food quality is excellent, I am already staying last 2 years in this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:17.443815', 5, 589, 4),
(3519, '[Sri Harsha] It is a co living pg where you can share your room with rats.nWorst management.nYou need to beg for any work to be done.nEven the water cans won''t be maintained properly.nSome of the rooms don''t even have any ventilation at all', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:17.444163', 1, 589, 4),
(3520, '[Harshavardhan Gurram (Chinuku)] Stayed there for almost a year! Impressed with the taste of food compared to other hostels I stayed at. Rooms are spacious. Common hall for all fun.nnThe only con with the hostel is bed bugs. I hope they''ll be taken care soon so that tenants can have sleepless nights.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:17.444356', 4, 589, 4),
(3521, '[rakesh gali] PG accommodation is excellent, offering clean and comfortable rooms with all necessary amenities. The food is consistently delicious, with a good variety of dishes that cater to different tastes.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:17.444919', 5, 589, 4),
(3522, '[Avinash Perli] Spacious rooms, amenities like Hall, Tv, Fridge, sofa are available (which I haven''t seen in most of the madhapur pg''s). Good food. Night rotis are also available. Friendly management.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:17.445257', 4, 589, 4),
(3523, '[SRIKAR.G] Really happy with my stay here. The rooms are neat, clean, and comfortable. The food is quite good and has a decent variety. Cleaning is done regularly, and the common areas are also maintained well. The staff are friendly and cooperative. Overall, a nice place for a comfortable and hassle-free stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:18.122235', 5, 590, 4),
(3524, '[Bathula Bharatreddy] Nice PG with clean rooms, good food, and regular housekeeping. The staff are polite and helpful. The facilities are well maintained and the overall environment is comfortable. Good value for a stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:18.122475', 5, 590, 4),
(3525, '[Upendra Nannam] This PG is really good! The rooms are very comfortable, and daily cleaning keeps the place neat and tidy. The food tastes great and feels just like a home-cooked meal.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:18.122723', 5, 590, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3526, U&'[Madhu babu Padditi] One of the best PGs I\2019ve stayed at in Hyderabad! The rooms are incredibly spacious, well-ventilated, and come with premium beds, personal cupboards, and reliable high-speed Wi-Fi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:18.122944', 5, 590, 4),
(3527, '[Sumanth Cruzzer] Very well-maintained PG hostel with clean rooms and hygienic surroundings. The food is fresh, tasty, and prepared with good quality ingredients. Regular cleaning is done in rooms, washrooms, and common areas. All facilities are properly managed, making it a comfortable and worry-free place to stay Highiy satisfied', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:18.123116', 5, 590, 4),
(3528, '[Sasidhar Gundapaneni] Good place to stay with clean rooms and decent facilities. The food is tasty and there is enough variety. Cleaning is done regularly, and the staff are cooperative. Overall, I had a comfortable stay here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:18.123265', 5, 590, 4),
(3529, '[Dakhuasi 143] This PG hostel offers a great living experience with neat and well-maintained rooms. The food is wholesome, hygienic, and consistently good in quality. Housekeeping is done regularly, keeping rooms and common spaces clean at all times Overall maintenance and facilities are well managed, making it a comfortable place to stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:18.123382', 5, 590, 4),
(3530, '[Goutham Kumar jena Gautham] The PG hostel provides quality food, excellent maintenance, and high standards of cleanliness. Rooms and facilities are well maintained, making it a comfortable place to live.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:18.123496', 5, 590, 4),
(3531, U&'[Sashank Anand] I had a great experience staying at Vihari Luxury co-living u0026 PG. The rooms are very well-maintained, clean, spacious, and comfortable, making it a pleasant place to stay.nnThe food is one of the best I\2019ve come across compared to the many PGs I\2019ve stayed in before. There\2019s a good variety, and the quality and taste are consistently excellent.nnA special mention to Mahesh, who has been extremely helpful throughout my stay. Any issues or concerns are addressed quickly, and he ensures they are resolved without delay. The entire staff is courteous, supportive, and always willing to help, which makes the overall experience even better.nnI would definitely recommend Vihari Luxury co-living u0026 PG to anyone looking for a clean, comfortable, and well-managed place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:19.377508', 5, 591, 4),
(3532, U&'[Udhay Raghunath] An excellent PG experience with top-notch hygiene and quality! The daily maintenance is great, with rooms cleaned and mopped every single day. The living space is great, especially since the beds and mattresses are wide and very comfortable.nnThe food provided is consistently good, and they don''t cut corners, the curd they serve is thick and genuine, completely unlike the watery versions most hostels serve. The Sunday afternoon biryani is a major highlight and honestly beats many local restaurants. Finally, the management is fantastic; Mahesh bro is incredibly supportive and resolves any concerns immediately. 5/5!\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:19.377641', 5, 591, 4),
(3533, '[karthick Malathy] I am staying in this pg for past 6 month but here the food is very excellent I have had a very pleasant stay in this PG. The food is excellent, tasty, and feels just like home-cooked meals. Especially dum chicken biriyani The quality, hygiene, and cleanliness maintained in the kitchen and dining area are highly appreciable.nnThe rooms are well-maintained, clean, and comfortable. The management ensures regular upkeep and provides a good living environment for residents. The staff are supportive and responsive whenever assistance is needed.nnOverall, this PG offers a comfortable, hygienic, and homely atmosphere. I would highly recommend it to anyone looking for a safe and well-maintained place to stay.nnHighly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:19.377748', 5, 591, 4),
(3534, '[Sudheer Sripati] The PG provides fresh, clean, and well-cooked food every day. The taste is good, and the menu has decent variety. The dining area is maintained properly, and the staff ensures meals are served on time. Overall, the food quality is better than many other PGs and offers good value for money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:19.377851', 5, 591, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3535, U&'[partheep bommina] This PG is very well maintained and hygienic. The rooms are clean and comfortable, the food is good, and the staff are polite, friendly, and well-mannered. Overall, it\2019s a great place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:19.37795', 5, 591, 4),
(3536, '[jagadesh jadesh] I had a good experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean and well-maintained, and the overall environment is comfortable. The food is also good, with tasty and hygienic meals served regularly. The staff are friendly and supportive. Overall, it is a nice place to stay and offers good value for money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:19.378059', 5, 591, 4),
(3537, U&'[Pavan Regalagadda] Excellent PG! Comfortable beds, quality furniture, and rooms are kept neat and clean every day. The food is very good, especially the Sunday Chicken Dum Biryani\2014absolutely delicious. The staff are friendly, helpful, and always supportive. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:19.378166', 5, 591, 4),
(3538, '[Nagesh Biradar] I had a very good experience staying at this PG. The food is delicious, hygienic, and feels like home-cooked meals. One of the best things is that the accommodation is available at a very reasonable cost without compromising on quality.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:19.378357', 5, 591, 4),
(3539, U&'[Vina A] I''ve been here for 3 months ... cleanliness is some what good and you can find cockroaches \+01fab3 everywhere in hostel and coming to food in one word it''s the worst PG where that i had Chicken curry and also worst puri ever i had in my hostel life and also worst lunch box curries for employees.. parking is good...but hostel is not worth for what you are paying ...hope they maintain well on coming days \+01f643', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:20.431745', 2, 592, 4),
(3540, U&'[Dhivakaran S] One of the best PGs in Hyderabad \2665\fe0f My stay here for 1 year was amazing \2014 safe, comfortable, and homely. Everything from the facilities to the environment was perfect. I\2019ll always have good memories of this place!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:20.431869', 5, 592, 4),
(3541, U&'[AGT] I joined this hostel two years ago, and it started off great. The staff n supervisor were friendly and welcoming. The service was efficient, and the food was good.nnHowever, over time, things have declined. The service isn\2019t as reliable, and the food quality has dropped. There are also significant issues with basic amenities: the Wi-Fi frequently disconnects, the washing machines often break down, and there''s no power backup during frequent outages. Additionally, some hostellers lock their bikes, causing inconvenience, and management should address this.nnWhile the friendly atmosphere remains a plus, the overall decline in quality and amenities is disappointing. I hope the management takes steps to improve these issues.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:20.432034', 3, 592, 4),
(3542, U&'[Akash Das] 3 months ago I stay in keerthana pgnOne of the best colivings I have seen during the search. Everyone is very friendly and helping here. The food is good and rooms are clean and spacious.nNice and clean rooms(Cleaned every day).n- Very good management.n- Good quality food with tastenBest pg of the Madhapur Ayyappa societyn\+01f970\+01f970\+01f970\+01f970', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:20.432147', 5, 592, 4),
(3543, U&'[Kiran Mahadasyam] Well-Maintained, Hygienic, and Worth the StaynnThis is by far the best PG I\2019ve seen in Madhapur. The property is well-maintained, and cleanliness and hygiene are clearly a top priority. The owners treat the PG like their own home, even eating food from the same PG canteen, which shows their commitment to quality and care.nnIf you\2019re looking for a comfortable and reliable place to stay, I highly recommend this PG. It\2019s a great combination of value, cleanliness, and attention to detail.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:20.432302', 5, 592, 4),
(3544, '[Akhil Majeti] Good accommodation. Reasonable prices. Situated in Ayyappa Society and very near to Hitec City and Madhapur. They provide decent food with all types of South Indian Breakfast items and curries. They provide Chicken 2 times a week and eggs once a week. Rooms are a bit small but can be easily lived in. They also provide Washing Machines for your laundry. Overall this place helps in saving a lot of money for employees.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:20.432407', 4, 592, 4);        
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3545, '[Hobiga M] It''s a good option for a comfortable stay. There is a boys hostel as well as Colive. Very clean and spacious rooms. Polite PG owners. Room cleaning is done on a daily basis. Food is very good and hygenic. It''s little far from metro.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:20.432557', 5, 592, 4),
(3546, '[Venkata Prasad] This is a very good Hostel. I am staying here for the past 6 months. Good food, Hygienic rooms, decent management u0026 humble staff can be experienced here!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:20.432651', 5, 592, 4),
(3547, '[Sudheer] Best PG I''ve ever lived in, considering the price. Location is also very nice n away from all the hustle bustle of traffic n city pollution. Rooms are clean n Food is hygienic. If you''re lucky enough to find good roommates, then you''re in for an awesome stay here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:21.443623', 5, 593, 4),
(3548, U&'[Ravi Kiran] I\2019ve had a comfortable stay at this PG. The rooms are cleaned daily, which keeps the place neat and well-maintained. The beds are comfortable, making it easy to rest after a long day. The food served is South Indian and tastes good, which is a big plus if you prefer simple, homely meals.nnThe location is another highlight. The main road nearby has a lively atmosphere, especially at night, with plenty of activity around. Basic facilities like cool drinking water, refrigerator access, and geysers are all functional and reliable.nnOne drawback is the lack of power backup, although power cuts in this area are quite rare, so it hasn\2019t really been a major issue during my stay. Another thing that could be improved is the absence of AC in some of the rooms, which can be a bit uncomfortable on very sunny days.nnOverall, it\2019s a decent place to stay with good maintenance, comfortable bedding, and good food.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:21.44568', 5, 593, 4),
(3549, U&'[Kalivarapu Vamsi] Stating food was nice but after 1month chef changed and the food is not as much tastynMainly advance amount was too high around 3k owner tells that he will give 2k return but he gave me 1400 only.nNot that much worth 3share 9knAnd washing machine is worst by washibg clothes in that washroom my 1pant and 2shirts are spoiled now i not even in the stage to use the filters will not cleaned and sink has very less waternExcept good food and maintenance nothing worth of 9k so i say its. Not that much worth to pay 9k to this hostelnOverall experience:nFood :\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0fnRoom maintenance:\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0fnAdvance return back:\2b50\fe0fnElectricity/power:\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:21.446296', 3, 593, 4),
(3550, U&'[MaD MusiC!!] It was so good staying in pure living the ambience is so peaceful u0026 the food is homely u get clean u0026 hygeine rooms. You have spacious hallsu0026  balconies to sit u0026 work, socialize u0026 friendly managing staff. Thanks vinod for the hospitality you gave us..\+01f642', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:21.447044', 5, 593, 4),
(3551, '[BackBeees] You call this a PG, this is not even a dedicated flat for anyone.nnThey have a 2 or 3 room flat converted to a pg where they sell out 15K kitchen room as single.nnPathetic and waste of time and energy.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:21.44763', 1, 593, 4),
(3552, '[Ravi chandra] I joined here with 5000 and but due to some problems, I have to leave just next day. But I have asked to give 2000 refund and take 3000 for just 1 night stay and they ignored and said it''s mentioned in bill that the amount is not refunded.nIt''s ok but regarding maintenance, bed is full of bed bugs, all night I have scratches, common bathroom for entire floor, even small rooms not a small breeze coming from outside environment. They even not provided me a pillow after I asked also. Food is some what good but the dining place is very bad with bad odour. If anyone think it''s fake review, once think how much I faced in just 1 night.nClearly, if anyone wants to waste money on this pg I pity on them and the road connectivity is also not great. Once it''s rained outside, the road is fully flooded.the pg photos they published are the one about years ago.nJust check the room and bed for any bugs, main thing is no power backup.nSo think twice for wasting your valuable money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:21.448008', 1, 593, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3553, U&'[Raghavendra Kulkarni] This PG is too good compared with other PG in Madhapur because maintained clean and hygienic food. I didn\2019t even face any challenges (health) since 1+ years within this PG. PG comes Center location of the Madhapur and good ventilation rooms.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:21.448436', 5, 593, 4),
(3554, '[Rakesh Reddy] I''ve had an exceptionally positive experience with the Pureliving PG. Food was hygiene and good in taste. Best location, price for stay and amenities are worth. And the team members are very prompt and friendly to the needs.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:21.448651', 5, 593, 4),
(3555, U&'[N Suresh] \201cI had a great stay at this hostel. The rooms were clean, the food was good, and the staff were friendly and supportive. The environment was safe and comfortable, making me feel at home. Thank you to the management and all the staff for making my stay memorable. I highly recommend this hostel to anyone looking for a peaceful and comfortable place to stay.\201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:22.126243', 5, 594, 4),
(3556, U&'[Ujjwal kumar Srivastava] Both the food and the PG are good. The staff here are very polite, and Srikanth, the PG owner, is also very cooperative. The PG is very clean as well. If we exclude the location factor \2014 since places like tea shops and other stores are quite far away \2014 everything else is excellent. My experience with Manoj PG has been great, and I would highly recommend it to anyone looking for a good place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:22.126674', 5, 594, 4),
(3557, U&'[Dr Honey] Worst pg ever in Hyderabad. Rude management. Poor facilities. Caution deposit will not be returned. Money minded freaks. Owner uses filthy language. It\2019s such a disrespect and disgraceful experience. Adding few more points in response to the owners reply as they denied access to my reply. Rather than bluffing regarding refunding i dare you to do it for real and explain ur so called rules on the day of admission not during vacating.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:22.127066', 1, 594, 4),
(3558, U&'[Bhavani Chowdary] Best PG with all the amenities, Management is really good. Rooms was Excellent - Very Spacious, Well Maintained Cleaning and everything. Food is very tasty with ultimate Quality and hygiene.nI would highly recommend this to anyone looking for a good place to stay in Madhapur Surroundingsn## Homely Feeling ##.n\+01f44d\+01f44d\+01f44d\+01f44d\+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:22.128519', 5, 594, 4),
(3559, U&'[Ankush aka Ak] Affordable and best in these price range .. but if you''re a north indian person or west you can''t adjust with the foods n all .. you will definitely order only outside foods \+01f972 also location is lit bit far from the metro station so you will get extra pain in ur legs or get extra pain in ur budget too \+01f600', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:22.12973', 4, 594, 4),
(3560, U&'[NARESH GOUD AKKILI] First of all food nd taste awesome. Rooms cleaning daily 2 times, well furnished rooms nd private bathroom, hot water. PG environment too good. PG owners are behaving like our family. I strongly recommended for all nd students too.nThank you Manoj u0026 Sreekanth \+01f642', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:22.130401', 5, 594, 4),
(3561, U&'[Nikhil Dixit] No one should ever consider this. Not even for single day because:n1. Poor managementn2. Over expensive compared to facilitiesn3. AC doesn''t cool even the smaller room: no one for maintenancen4. Never return deposit amount \+01f614n5. Insects in foodn6. Rude behaviour after bookingn7. No proper bike parking and not at call car parking spacen8. No grocery shops, no medical store, not even tea point within 500 meter of radiusn9. Poor food taste and quality.n10 Ony extract hard earned money from guests like blood warms.nn#boycottManojColivingGuestHouseAndPG', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:22.13083', 1, 594, 4),
(3562, U&'[Sagar] Worst Pg in Hyderabad .n1. multiple owners. Everyone will behave like owner, even guests who are their friends will behave like owner. For a single issue, there are 5-10 peoples to complain and each will put things on another. One person who finds himself the only owner will is greedy, egoistic and carries worst behaviour.n2. No privacy , their rule is they can come in anyone\2019s room anytime and you can\2019t say no.n3. If another person will pay more money for room that is allotted to you, multiple owners will ask you to shift instantly or vacate by threatening.n4. You will find mosquitoes in food.n5. Every owner in that pg brings new terms and policies every month and will increase rent whenever they wis.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:22.131209', 1, 594, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3563, '[Dinesh Manikandan] The facilities are great, like those of other PGs. The most notable aspect that distinguishes this PG from other PGs is the food. Comfort, tasty, and varied food is all one expects when we stay out of our house. I must say the food is really excellent when compared to other PGs that I stayed at, and I have heard from my circle.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:22.841845', 5, 595, 4),
(3564, '[Sunil Singh] It''s good place for Men like working professional, students, WFH workers.nMaintain Hygiene and daily basis cleaning.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:22.842006', 4, 595, 4),
(3565, '[SRAVAN KUMAR] After staying in the pg for 5 months writing this reviewnnWell maintained, hygienic, clean and peaceful environment with big size beds and good South Indian food', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:22.842192', 4, 595, 4),
(3566, '[Arghya Dip Paul] Good accommodation price wise, owners fulfill help requests ASAP. Good experience overall.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:22.842354', 5, 595, 4),
(3567, '[bala manidhar] Stayed at casavir great spot! Friendly staff, clean rooms with comfy beds, strong WiFi, and fun common area. Perfect location and value. Highly recommend!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:22.842473', 5, 595, 4),
(3568, '[sai samskruth yaramanedi] The hospitality here is top notch. Food here is same as we get back at our home. Having a comfortable and happy stay at this place', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:22.842604', 5, 595, 4),
(3569, '[SK Traders] Just stayed for 2 days but food is excellent and rooms has good ventilation', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:22.842709', 5, 595, 4),
(3570, '[Sandeep Kulkarni] One of the best PGs with 3-sharing and 2-sharing options, AC rooms, parking facility, washing machine, and Wi-Fi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:22.842814', 5, 595, 4),
(3571, '[Bharath Kinnera] ROOM 105nStayed for 6months in 3sharing. Had a pleasant stay. Management is friendly and like a family!nFood by Raju Bhai is decent!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:23.743323', 5, 596, 4),
(3572, '[Chatrapathi King] I have stayed here for 9 months, owners are very friendlynFood:- goodnCleaning:- room  Cleaning daily [ bathroom day by day Cleaning]', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:23.743485', 5, 596, 4),
(3573, '[Roshan Pathak] The owners and management are disinterested, I think they could care more about their customers. The cleaner does not do a very good job, but it''s okay.nThe food is okay, but boring. Every week the same menu. No change, no sweet, no treats.nThe place to wash plates is horrible and there''s a leaky sealing just above that.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:23.743732', 3, 596, 4),
(3574, '[Ram Charan] Currently staying here. Feeling great for staying here. Very good atmosphere very good Maintenance. Food will be available all the time mostly. Only disadvantage is only 2 washing machines available', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:23.743854', 5, 596, 4),
(3575, '[Vinay Varma Uppalapati] Rooms are good daily cleaning, Food is great at price compared to any pg hostel in Hyderabad, weekly twice chicken, once egg, daily morning tiffin, night chapathi.. Lunch box packing service available according to early morning office timings,All unlimited except chicken, pakodi, vada..', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:23.743966', 5, 596, 4),
(3576, '[Pavan Kumar Dharmana] Best pg in Hyderabad, Good accommodation with different varieties of Food unlimited (North u0026 South Indian), Friendly warden, Good maintenance (daily cleaning), overall 5/5 ratings', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:23.744327', 5, 596, 4),
(3577, '[Harsha Reddy] 1. Outstanding PG at affordable price.n2. Located at heart of the cityn3. Mouth watering foodn4. Rooms are clean u0026 tidyn5. All facilities are availablenOverall I would recommend to join this PG without second thought..Cheers !!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:23.744518', 5, 596, 4),
(3578, '[Vishnu V] What I liked about my stay at Maruthi Men''s PG is Homely Food, Spacious Room, 24 Hours Water Facility and uninterrupted Internet services along with the Connectivity to both Office and Entertainment place in Madhapur and Hitech City.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:23.744648', 5, 596, 4);     
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3579, '[GAYATRI CHAVHAN] Feels like Home....so clean and clear super safe for girlsnhad a really good experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and comfortable. The facilities provided are great, including proper security, regular housekeeping.One of the best things is that it is 24/7 open, which is very convenient.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:24.544571', 5, 597, 4),
(3580, '[Srinivasun Atmakuri] The PG provides a very comfortable and safe stay. Rooms are clean, well-maintained, and have all basic facilities. The food quality is very good, hygienic, and tastes like home. Overall, a great place for working professionals and students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:24.544854', 5, 597, 4),
(3581, '[Happy Rock] Very disappointing experience.nn1. No Wi-Fi. They promised Wi-Fi while joining, but later asked us to arrange our own connection.nn2. Recently, the rent was increased without any improvement in facilities.n3. Food finishes very early during lunch and dinner. Even if you come on time, it may not be available.n4. Complaints are ignored. There is no response even after raising issues multiple times. We complaint for change the tubelight before more than 1 week even they didn''t change.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:24.54511', 1, 597, 4),
(3582, '[prasad mukka] The PG provides a very comfortable and safe stay. Rooms are clean, well-maintained, and have all basic facilities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:24.545288', 5, 597, 4),
(3583, '[19BTB421 Adeeba Khanam] I want to express my deepest appreciation for this PG.nFrom the very first day, I felt welcomed and safe, the atmosphere here is warm, calm, and respectful. The rooms are always clean and comfortable, meals are lovingly prepared, and everything is managed with care and kindness.nHonestly, I just love this PG, it never feels like I am staying away from home.   Everyone is so helpful and friendly that even the toughest days feel easier. Thank you for creating such a comfortable and positive spacenIt truly makes everyday life so much better!nThankyou indraprastha', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:24.545528', 5, 597, 4),
(3584, '[Arjun Kumar] Very good pg in this area .nAc and non ac rooms are available.nRent is also very good.nFood is very clean and hygienic.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:24.545657', 4, 597, 4),
(3585, '[Jemsingh Kadian] homely atmosphere, tasty food with proper vegetarian  meals friendly  management,nice owner ,has very comfortable and spacious room very daily room and daily room keeping and good speed wifinAnd also has health millet meal option in afternoon .had a great stay in Hyderabad', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:24.545946', 5, 597, 4),
(3586, '[Gnana Priyanka B] I''ve been staying here  for over 7 months now, and the pg is well maintained. Food quality is really good. I''ve been to many hostels before, but I haven''t seen such spacious, well lit and ventilated rooms. As a whole, the environment in pg is refreshing and rejuvenating with all the indoor sports.. just what we need after a lousy day at work!!.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:24.546104', 5, 597, 4),
(3587, '[Basireddy Siddareddy] This is the best pg for stay monthly and daily with low price and best food ,stayn,washing machine,safety locker,geyser,bike parking', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:25.271644', 5, 598, 4),
(3588, '[Tunu Deo] I discovered this hostel through Airbnb and what a lucky discovery it was! The people, the hostel itself and the good-vibes over here are unparalleled. So much so that it''ll actually make you ''not want to leave''. Everything from the rooms to the common area is super peaceful and comfortable. Rangareddy is one of the best hosts you could ask for and he goes out of his way to make your stay comfortable and complete... Thanks Rangareddy and co. at the hostel, you all shall be heavily missed.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:25.271764', 5, 598, 4),
(3589, '[Fach Rotmg] Very good hostel and double sharing room was reasonably priced at 9500 rupees. The food offered is good, with options for both vegetarian and non-vegetarian dishes, including roti and rice for dinner.nWhile AC is not available, the rooms have good ventilation and come with fast fans. The hostel also provides mattresses, pillows, and individual cupboards in advance.nPower cuts were rare and they also have a small water heater in the bathroom.nSmall general store also present across the road for soap, shampoo etc.nnOverall a great choice for a budget PG in close premises of Madhapur.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:25.271864', 5, 598, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3590, '[Santhosh yadav] Good accomodation for gens,good facilities,24hot water available,healthy food,cool management ,I recomended for everyone ,if u want to PG nearby madhapur ayyapa society ,I recommended to all thankyou', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:25.271961', 5, 598, 4),
(3591, '[Lalana Biridi] Don''t don''t don''t ever join this pg... Literally one of the worst pgnThe food is so so unhygienic and there are way too many cockroaches and insects in the kitchen, dining area and more in the rooms... The rooms are so congested and the area itself is very bad with extreme water logging... My friend ate food here and he developed infections... Please save yourself... If you want to join just go into kitchen and take a look... The owner is useless he doesn''t care about anything he doesn''t do anything... And coming to beds they are ingested with bed bugs and you will develop skin diseases for sure... I''m still in the pg that''s why I''m posting this review from another account but please guys don''t join this', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:25.272056', 1, 598, 4),
(3592, '[Deekshith Chandu] This is the worst PG I''ve ever seen. I stayed here for almost a year; initially, it was good, but problems started piling up. The washing machine wasn''t working, and the food was terrible - they served the same type of sambar every day for a week! The kitchen was a disaster, infested with tiny mice and cockroaches. Looking at the cooks made me regret eating the food. Bed bugs in the beds were another issue, and the owner didn''t bother fixing it. When we complained, he was unhelpful, saying ''If you want to stay, stay; otherwise, leave.'' When I gave them a one-star rating on Google, he demanded I vacate immediately.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:25.27217', 1, 598, 4),
(3593, U&'[PAIDI PAVAN SAI] The homely food is a major plus! It\2019s so nice to have meals that remind me of home. Cleanliness is top-notch too', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:25.272273', 5, 598, 4),
(3594, '[Chenna Harshavardhan] Absolutely loved my stay here! The hostel is always neat and clean, making it a comfortable place to live', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:25.272369', 5, 598, 4),
(3595, '[Bala Chandu Prakash] The hostel management is very responsive and resolves any issues promptly. The security arrangements are excellent, making it one of the safest hostels to stay in. The rooms are well-maintained and clean, and the staff are friendly, supportive, and always willing to help. The hostel also provides a comfortable and peaceful environment, making it a great place for both study and living.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:26.154606', 4, 599, 4),
(3596, '[Shekhar P] I recently stayed at this PG for the past 10 months. The PG was clean and well-maintained, with comfortable rooms and a convenient location. The management team was responsive and helpful, and the amenities were good value for money. The food is very good.Highly recommend this PG for a comfortable and safe stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:26.154764', 5, 599, 4),
(3597, '[ganesh ponthapalli] Its been 3 years , I''m so happy with sai kutter PG! The food here is absolutely delicious and always satisfying. I''m also really impressed with how well-maintained the property is. A special shout-out to our supervisor, Prasanth, for always being so helpful and ensuring everything runs smoothly. It''s a great environment to live in! Must try pg.nPrices are but high but for there maintenance and food it''s worth it.nAlso owner Sunitha garu is so friendly and supportive.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:26.154862', 5, 599, 4),
(3598, '[Lohith kumar Reddy] Have been staying in this pg for more than 3 years. Maintenance is soo good. I never face any issues with room neatness or Maintenance. Rooms are a bit smaller but manageable. Food quality is also good and maintained well and hygienic. Sometimes, i feel food could be better but compared to other pgs, we find the food very much better here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:26.154963', 5, 599, 4),
(3599, '[siddu siddu] Food quality and standards are excellent. Maintenance also good. Not compromising in food quality. Special mention PG owner Sunitha really handling it in very nice manner and more responsive.nnSupervisor prashant more helpful and supportive.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:26.155154', 5, 599, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3600, '[ARUNIMA CHOWDHURY] I stayed in this PG for six months. The highlight is the food. It has great food. You can definitely try this PG. The location is also good. It''s in Hitech city. Walking distance from Mindspace.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:26.155247', 4, 599, 4),
(3601, '[AKHIL VELURU] I am staying here since past 1.5 years. Food was so good compares to other hostels nearby. Even in gas shortage they kept the same menu.nManagement was so responsible when complain something.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:26.155432', 5, 599, 4),
(3602, '[golla vamshi] It''s been 3+ years and still counting in this PG, all these years I have been lived here without any disturbance and inconvenience because of it''s smooth and friendly management and maintenance by staff.nTq suneetha for visiting regularly and taking feedback every Saturday.nnSpecial thanks to supervisor prashanth for being available at all the time.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:26.155736', 5, 599, 4),
(3603, '[Mohan Sayini] I have been living here since two years, it is just like a home. It''s a Very friendly environment and the rooms are comfortable and spacious. I loved this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:26.76995', 5, 600, 4),
(3604, '[Aswin Kumar] Good Management, Good food and good bike parking , Old building and old style lift.nBest thing is we can have 24/7 hot water and laundry service and daily room cleaning.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:26.770057', 4, 600, 4),
(3605, '[Krishan Kumar Singh] Great PG near the office,  Society guys are very supportive and food also good for North Indian guys.nEverything near the PG. Very supportive owner PG.nFeel like home. Clean area..nAC is also available.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:26.770208', 5, 600, 4),
(3606, '[Saikumar Burada] I am happy to be in this PGnThere will be daily cleaning for each and every room.nThe owner is very helpfull for the issues we raised and sorted out with in timenFood is not that bad it''s ok when compare to other PGs around us.nThe building is old but facility are goodnI love the parking arres for our vehicles', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:26.770303', 5, 600, 4),
(3607, '[Sanket Salve] PG is ok.nDon''t expect for much facility.nPros : Hot water facility is very good and 24/7.nCons : Worst room cleanliness. Food is not good, putting more soda in food. Cloth washing facility is for name sake.nRent : 5500 for 4sharingnDeposit: 1000', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:26.770425', 3, 600, 4),
(3608, '[sritam rout] World''s worst place to live in. Don''t know about their Pg services but rental rooms are worst here. No water or mud water are the things that are best available here. Doesn''t even deserve 1 star.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:26.770509', 1, 600, 4),
(3609, '[Siva Korumilli] Most worst hostel...at time of joining he (owner) said all services are provided like 24 hours water and hot water And Wifi  after paying the rent he said that the services are not available if you''re interested staying on here otherwise wicket this hostel I don''t give anyone rupee rupee be careful', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:26.770593', 1, 600, 4),
(3610, '[Daniel Svensson] Wow! Very nice PG! We were 7 swedes who lived here for 2 months and it was like living with family. The food was great and really nice staff!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:26.770693', 5, 600, 4),
(3611, '[Sowmya M] Where do I start?n1) The main problem is the owner does not answer your phone calls and you call him 50 times for him to answer your calln2)Even if the owner answers your call, he will not solve your problem, if you are lucky the problem will solve in 3-4 monthsnIf not, Moving out is the only solution. Which I did. I struggled till the last day of staying there.n3) Washing machine has dryer lint that will spoil your clothesn4)Coming to the most curious topic, how is food??nDid you ever eat Brinjal and paneer curry?nYou must never try it, because it will ruin your health, you might think maybe that is fresh and tasty. No No you are wrong, brinjal curry was last night''s leftover, and paneer was leftover 2 days ago.n5) Will the rooms be cleaned?nNo No, rooms are cleaned once in 3-4 days if you are lucky, if not rooms and washrooms are cleaned once a week. By then you will catch some disease.What will happen if the rooms are not cleaned? You have coakroaches all over your bed, cupboard any food items you may have.n6) Is your room on 3rd or 4th floor?nDoes the lift work?nGod no, lift/elevator does not work, it stops working very randomly when you need to carry something heavy to your roomnnThis is my genuine opinion don''t want to hurt anyone or anyone''s business. Hope this helps someonenThank you.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:27.245735', 1, 601, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3612, '[cb Kota] Rooms are spacious,thats the only reason everyone stays herenWorst part is helper Bhaskar pee at the tap every night,where utensils are washednHygenic wise worst and worstnAnd the workers(cook and the helpers) consume alcohol almost everyday in the pg itself near dining area which should not be acceptable by the management,but no one ever bothers.nI dont mean to spoil anyone''s business,but these things made my very uncomfortable here,writing here so that this helps someone', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:27.246057', 1, 601, 4),
(3613, '[Priyanka Dabir] Spacious rooms. Cleaning is nice. BUT they won''t provide you morning and evening tea / milk even after paying this much amount. U have to get that from outside . Told them many times still no action taken. Same goes for chapati ( Roti) You won''t get it on Wednesday, Friday and Sunday.  Caretakers ( the cooks ) are rude if you ask for something . In short, even after paying here, your 2k will go extra every month on food and milk and other stuffs. Also, i forgot to mention about cockroaches in rooms. Asked for spray so many times, I ended up buying my own for my room. They did spray in kitchen but not in rooms. Even after asking for 3-4 times.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:27.246186', 3, 601, 4),
(3614, '[Soumyashree Jena] It''s really a nice pg for staying food is much more better'' than other hostel,owner is very friendly and hostel cook uncle is very nice and if you have any problem they will shortout after one phone call, it''s a nice pg in Madhapur area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:27.246287', 5, 601, 4),
(3615, '[Badugu Jyothi] Hostel is very nice when comparing to other hostel the main thing is rooms are so spacious and more space to put luggage I am staying here more than one year and food is better than comparing with other hostel I feeled like my home to stay here', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:27.246386', 5, 601, 4),
(3616, '[Richa Shiny] I''ve been staying in this PG since last year almost and the hospitality is great. If you''ve got any problems, they fix it right after a call. Food is far better than any other hostel. You should definitely stay here if you''re willing to find PGs here or nearby Madhapur.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:27.246478', 5, 601, 4),
(3617, '[Murali Krishna] Nice management and Mr Satish take caring the inmates with proper required with good emanitees. As parent of my daughter I may recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:27.246571', 4, 601, 4),
(3618, '[Pujitha marka] It was my first experience with staying at hostel and I really really liked it. The vibe of Girls hostel was the most comfortable ever in my life. Thank youuuu!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:27.246662', 5, 601, 4),
(3619, U&'[Naveen V] \201cThe boys hostel is very clean and well maintained.nRooms are comfortable and provide a good environment for living.nThe management and staff are friendly and very supportive.nFood quality is good and served on time every day.nSecurity and safety are well taken care of.nThe hostel has a peaceful atmosphere suitable for students and working professionals.nOverall, it is a great place to stay and I highly recommend it.\201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:27.792557', 5, 602, 4),
(3620, '[suryaphaneendra vadali] Good food, nice rooms, quick response from staff, highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:27.792744', 5, 602, 4),
(3621, '[Prateek Mohanty] The place is good for living and is on the expensive side, if the quality is considered. Rooms are cleaned everyday and bedsheets are changed every fortnight. Food is terrible, absolutely terrible. If you want to risk your digestive system, then only consider eating there. Otherwise a good place to live in, the owner and staff are good and cooperative people.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:27.792848', 3, 602, 4),
(3622, '[Srinu A] Nice to stay. PG maintenance and cleniness is good. It''s  is easy to get transport from here. Food is good and worthable  for cost.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:27.79294', 5, 602, 4),
(3623, '[Amit Charde] Nice hostel but washing machine is not available but they are giving londry service , daily cleaning', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:27.793026', 5, 602, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3624, '[Vinesh Marthala] The stay at this PG was overall a great experience. The food is exceptional, with every meal feeling like a home-cooked treat. The maintenance is on point, and the cleanliness and upkeep truly stand out. Highly recommend it for anyone looking for a comfortable and hassle-free living experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:27.793116', 4, 602, 4),
(3625, U&'[Shashi Shashi] **Worst PG Experience - Stay Away!**nnThis is by far the worst PG I have ever stayed in. The entire place is infested with cockroaches, rodents, and bedbugs. The rooms are filthy, and no proper cleaning is done despite repeated complaints. The water supply is inconsistent, making daily activities a nightmare.nnThe food served in the kitchen and dining hall is beyond terrible. Every day, the kitchen is filled with cockroaches, and bedbugs are found crawling on the dining chairs. It\2019s impossible to have a decent meal without feeling disgusted.nnTo make things worse, the management is extremely unprofessional and rude. They refuse to return the advance amount, even if you inform them one month in advance about leaving. On top of that, they demand an extra month\2019s rent without any justification. When questioned, they resort to abusive language and harassment.nnThe mental stress caused by their behavior is unbearable. If you care about your health, hygiene, and peace of mind, I strongly advise you to avoid this place at all costs. Absolutely unacceptable living conditions!nnRating: \2b50(0/5)', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:27.793247', 1, 602, 4),
(3626, U&'[Sai] Please don\2019t go to this pg, very worst management and food is not so good. Pg owner is very arrogant, while you joining they don\2019t inform you about the rules like cash on deposit and vacating . And while you vacating the pg  they will tell  you like you should have informed one month before and they will ask you to pay one month rent . Price is very high i will say not worthnNo power backupnNo washing machinenFood is not goodnCockroaches are there in wardrobesnBathroom are very dirty even they cleannChefs are from north they don\2019t know what is the meaning of (clean)', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:27.793409', 1, 602, 4),
(3627, U&'[Raj Krishna] Awesome Pg great food, also worth for money. If any one looking for PG near by Hitech City I would strongly suggest this PG.Rooms are cleaned daily, refrigerator available on every floor. Owners/management is very humble and understanding person. Food quality is excellent. Highly recommended if looking for a P.G in this location.nnThank you \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:28.482043', 5, 603, 4),
(3628, '[Omkar Waghmare] I had an exceptional experience at Venkateshwara PG! The food was delicious, the maintenance was top-notch, and the cleaning was impeccable. The overall facilities and services exceeded my expectations. I''m thoroughly impressed and would highly recommend it to anyone looking for a comfortable and hassle-free stay. I''ll definitely be returning whenever I need accommodation in the future!nnThank you', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:28.482173', 5, 603, 4),
(3629, '[Sistla Krishna Vamsi] I personally didn''t liked the food there. Rooms I would say average but not great. I stayed here for 1 day and experience is average.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:28.482267', 3, 603, 4),
(3630, '[Sai Bharath] Good maintenance and better food according to budget and near to all facilities', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:28.482353', 5, 603, 4),
(3631, '[Laxmidhar Mahana] One of the best place to stay in the hitech city ....they do cleaning every day and also maintain hygienic food..', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:28.482432', 5, 603, 4),
(3632, '[Sumit Kundu] Food was great fills like homemadenGreat for tourist or student coming from deferent statenBehaviour is so good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:28.482511', 5, 603, 4),
(3633, '[Gali Vamsi] Vh men''s pg one of the best pg in madhapur am staying in past 7 months the room''s are good they cleaned it every day gud WiFi the food is above avarage the management and staff are very friendly if you are mentioned a problem they react soon quickly response enough bike parking space really a peaceful location near by metro food restaurants', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:28.482589', 5, 603, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3634, U&'[Sagar Kumar Athghara] Disappointing and unprofessional experience with the owner, Amar.nHe kept all my advance money, claiming it was spent on maintenance\2014yet the rooms remained unclean all week and were only cleaned on Sundays. He may come across as polite initially, but don\2019t be fooled.nnFood was awful.nIn two years, I only ate there 4\20135 times. Every time I did, it upset my stomach. The only reason I stayed was because it was close to my office and I could eat elsewhere.nnAlso, very poor treatment of workers.nI spoke with a few of them, and some hadn\2019t been paid in 6\20137 months. Totally unprofessional and unethical.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:28.482666', 1, 603, 4),
(3635, '[Vinod Kumar Bhookya] I had a great experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and comfortable. The management is friendly, supportive, and responds quickly to any concerns. The food is hygienic and tasty, and the overall environment is safe and peaceful. The location is convenient, with easy access to public transport, shops, and other essential facilities. I would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable and hassle-free stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:29.244258', 5, 604, 4),
(3636, '[Ramana Saagula] Excellent place to stay, especially for working professionals. The rooms are clean, spacious, and well maintained, with daily housekeeping ensuring a hygienic environment.nThe food is fresh, tasty, and feels just like home. Amenities include high-speed Wi-Fi, TV, washing machines, power backup, and parking for both two-wheelers and four-wheelers.nThe PG also has a well-equipped gym and indoor games like table tennis, carrom, and chess, making it a great place to relax after work.nThe management is friendly and responsive, and the overall atmosphere is safe, peaceful, and comfortable. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a quality PG with great facilities and value for money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:29.244376', 5, 604, 4),
(3637, '[Pravin More] I had a very pleasant stay in this PG. The rooms and common areas are always clean and well-maintained, which makes living here very comfortable. The food quality is good, hygienic, and served on time every day.nnThe environment here is friendly and peaceful. All the people are very cooperative and supportive, which makes it feel like a second home.nnA special thanks to Samsher and Prabhakar for being extremely helpful and approachable. He is always ready to assist with any issue and ensures everything runs smoothly.nnOverall, I highly recommend this PG for anyone looking for a clean, safe, and comfortable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:29.24448', 4, 604, 4),
(3638, U&'[Abhishek Sajjanar] I\2019ve had a great experience living at Nandu Mens PG. The food is delicious, hygienic, and feels like home-cooked meals. The place is exceptionally clean, with well-maintained rooms and common areas.n\200bWhat really sets this PG apart is the culture and friendly environment. A special shoutout to Shamsher, the manager and caretaker! He is extremely helpful, polite, and always ensures everything runs smoothly for all the residents.n\200bHighly recommended for anyone looking for a comfortable stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:29.244563', 5, 604, 4),
(3639, U&'[Baskaran Govindaraj] Highly Recommended!n\200bI had an absolutely wonderful experience staying at Nandhu Mens PG near Hi-Tech City.n\200bThe accommodation is exceptionally neat and clean, and the food is excellent. What truly sets this place apart, however, is the owner. When I faced some personal issues during my stay, they went completely out of their way to support and help me resolve them. Even after a year, when I reached out to them again, they treated me with the utmost respect and warmth.n\200bThe location is also perfect\2014very close and accessible to everything you need in the Hi-Tech City area.n\200bIf you are looking for a great PG with a supportive management team, excellent food, and a clean environment, I highly recommend giving Nandhu Mens PG your first priority', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:29.244646', 5, 604, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3640, U&'[Shailesh Kumar] I have been staying at Nandu PG for more than 2 years now. Overall, it has been a good experience. The staff are cooperative and supportive whenever needed. Cleanliness is well maintained, especially compared to many other hostels.nThe food is above average and definitely could have been more better. However, the price is slightly on the higher side compared to other hostels .nOne issue I\2019ve faced a few times is food getting stolen from the fridge. Although the management provides CCTV access after a complaint, it usually comes a bit late to identify the exact moment.nThat said, it\2019s still a good hostel overall and a decent place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:29.244724', 4, 604, 4),
(3641, '[Ramesh S] I had a very good stay at Nandu PG. The rooms are clean and well maintained, and the food is tasty and served on time. The management is friendly, responsive, and takes care of residents needs. The location is convenient, and the overall atmosphere is safe and comfortable. I would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a good place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:29.244802', 5, 604, 4),
(3642, U&'[SRIRAM _karri] The rooms are kept neat, tidy, and cleaned daily, which makes the stay comfortable. The only area where I feel there is room for improvement is the food. I understand that, given the reasonable pricing and the location in Hitech City, it\2019s difficult to offer a wide variety of meals. However, if the food quality or variety could be improved, it would make the overall experience even better.nnI would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking to stay close to their office and avoid the stress of long daily commutes.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:29.244879', 4, 604, 4),
(3643, '[Maya Mathews] I am currently staying in this PG. Been staying here starting August 2024..nnPros:nnRooms are decently spacious compared to most pgs in this localitynnThe cupboard is also quite good with a mirror or separate dressing table mirrornnFood is okok. Neither bad nor good. They don''t provide tea or coffee thoughnnArea looks safe since its a residential onennThere are no restrictions. U get ur freedom and privacy.nnCons:nnCockroaches everywhere. In this last 1 week i literally killed 50 roachesnnThey dont clean the room daily. Either 2 days once or 3 days once. Same goes for bathroomsnnThe ceiling sometimes leaks. I will add pictures, refer thatnnNo pest control done at all.nnThe building looks quite old on the inside. So it means there''s no maintenance. But I''m not sure if it will be possible as people stay here all the time, they have close down the pg for a week and completely do repainting and pest control.. but it might not be feasible.nnACs are mostly not working well. In most rooms remote control doesn''t work. Its just direct turn on turn off.nnEach room style is different. It completely depends on ur luck which u get. Sone has spacious bathroom, some with cloth drying area, some with balcony but most with none of these.nnThey dont prepare food here they bring from some other branch. That''s not really a problem though.nnMostly theres something broken in every room, either window, bathroom, ac something.. as I mentioned no maintenance at all. In my room window is broken, but since theres mosquito net and thick curtain we can manage.nnThere are cockroaches inside the fridge too. Under the cot too. Inside the cupboard. In the table. Everywhere literally.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:30.356808', 2, 605, 4),
(3644, '[vineethteja neela] Great PG for girls at walkable distance from Mindspace at 8000 per bed in 3 sharing room.  Has lot of playing amenities and ground floor has a very large common place for both boys and girls to hangout', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:30.357037', 4, 605, 4),
(3645, U&'[Nidhi Palavelli] Very hygienic food is given  everydaynRooms are well maintainednFacilities (including activities such as table tennis ) are providednSecurity is good \+01f44d\+01f3fb', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:30.357132', 5, 605, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3646, U&'[Jazzz 101] It''s very good pg in Madhapur Hyd, with every facility and also faculty is very useful helpful in all situation especially Mr Rajesh and Hanif \+01f60e\270c', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:30.357222', 5, 605, 4),
(3647, '[A VAMSI] 3 sharing-8,500 rupees for eachn2 sharing-10,000 rupees per headn1sharing-18,000 rupeesn(As on sep4-2021)nn**Ac charges extra applicable(basing on usage-every ac room have sub meter)nAc, indoor games, hot water, wifi, parking...etc availablennNice area and Clean Hostel(when rain comes little bit water stocked). Its nearby to mindspace and Hotel Westin. Little bit transportation problem(if you have own bike no problem, if not.. you have to use cabs and autos by booking only). There is no public transportation available near by.nIf you want public transportation like metro, busses or normal sharing autos.. you have to goto ''durgam chervu metro station''(its nearby image hospital-its upto 1 km distance)nn*****if this review help please like and if you have extra info please add on******nn###Need more details contact the number on attached photo', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:30.357305', 4, 605, 4),
(3648, '[Bhavana Neelam] Best Hygiene Hostel I have ever Seen...Nice facilities,Good furniture,Best washrooms.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:30.357384', 5, 605, 4),
(3649, U&'[sai geethika] I had a comfortable stay in this PG. The rooms were clean and well-maintained, and have the basic amenities like Wi-Fi, washing machines. The staff were helpful. The food served was hygienic .It\2019s a good option for anyone looking for affordable and convenient accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:30.357502', 5, 605, 4),
(3650, '[palaparthi yamini] The PG is different from the pictures you see in the internet and original.. I just stayed for one month only Since, the money will not be refunded.nn3 share - 13,000 not as expected waste of money.nFood is not that quality.nLost of cockroaches in the rooms bed bucks on beds.nWashroom flush is not proper covered.nNo exhaust fans in washroomsnNo tea or coffee providednOnly one time buttermilk will be there.nCleaning will be twice a week.. it is ok ok that toonSome smell will be there all time in rooms, lifts.nnOn Sunday evening food will be like that water rice type dal, rasam.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:30.357582', 1, 605, 4),
(3651, U&'[itssmartyshahzeb DJ] I stayed there for four months during my internship(2023). The rent was \20b98,500 per month, excluding electricity, for a four-sharing room. The food quality was average, and there were only two washing machines available for the entire building.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:32.26315', 3, 607, 4),
(3652, U&'[Vinay Sriram] Worst management. They treat you like they''re running a charity and you''re just a homeless person whom they gave a stay. You have to pay your monthly fees on-time but they won''t serve the food on-time. If you complain, they ask you to vacate. These guys are very strict when coming to restrictions and rules on tenants but find excuses when we ask to serve better like good food,basic maintanence,lift and washing machine repairs(half of the time they will be in repair mode only).nFinally, the arrogance of the superviser and owner\+01f64f\+01f64f. Choose this PG only if you want a affordable stay while they treat you like shit.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:32.263234', 1, 607, 4),
(3653, '[Tarun] Stayed here for nearly 4 years. Great views of Cyber towers and hitech city, close proximity to Mindspace and several IT Companies. Maintenance is great, there will be daily cleaning of rooms. The room ambience is good and the food was okay. Had great experience living there', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:32.263306', 4, 607, 4),
(3654, U&'[Anjan Chilukuri] Stayed at SVR Grand PG for Men and had a good experience. The location is convenient, with easy access to the metro, Cyber Towers, and nearby offices in Hitech City.nnThe food was good, and the rooms are well-ventilated and comfortable. The terrace is also nice and offers a good view of the Hitech City skyline.nnOverall, it\2019s a good option for working professionals looking for a PG near Hitech City.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:32.263439', 5, 607, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3655, U&'[Rajaking Rajaking] I''m from pune ,I looked for a good pg hostel here in hi-tech city. So I really liked this pg and the maintenance also good , I stayed here for six months. The management is also a bit friendly\+01f607 this pg is good even if you want to stay here long term . The hostel area surroundings, view points is very Nice and peaceful \270c\fe0f \+01f607', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:32.26355', 5, 607, 4),
(3656, '[Rajiv Marlapudi] I''m recently joined pg ,the hostel surrounding, rooms is very nice , maintain cleanly corridors ,terrace area very nice,management also good Management treated to guests friendly. Food is good . overall this pg is good to the hitec city', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:32.263631', 5, 607, 4),
(3657, '[elumalingam Lingam] I''m staying in this pg in 1 year . Good View points is there . And near by Metro station here hitech City and rayadurgam is close lo walkable distance. And 3 share 4 share rooms available . I''m staying in 3 share room is good very clearly maintained . And this pg area is very peaceful place . This is One if best pg in the madhapur locality . Thank you anyone searching in near metro statios choose to this pg . Food is 3 times , washing machines is there , and terrace view point is very beautiful.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:32.263706', 5, 607, 4),
(3658, '[Sam B.] Update : It has been 2 months and washing machines are still not working, they always have reasons to justify, these people also increased charges by 300 rupees. 2 months, no change, 2 months ago, I posted a review and they replied, but no actual change. This P.G is running only because of the location, otherwise it is just bullshit, no person would like to stay here more than 2-3 days. Anyone who stays here will get to know how worst this P.G is, in just 2-3 days.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:32.263777', 1, 607, 4),
(3659, '[Sai charan Vanguru] Good food and good ambience overall this is best for students', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:33.114399', 5, 608, 4),
(3660, '[TM CV GAMING] Most affordable one and good for its resonable pricing', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:33.114523', 5, 608, 4),
(3661, U&'[Varun Version] Good pg\2026\+01f44d\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:33.1146', 5, 608, 4),
(3662, '[Sangem Hari] Very good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:33.114674', 5, 608, 4),
(3663, '[Sathwik Reddy Yasa] Very good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:33.11496', 5, 608, 4),
(3664, '[Adithya Challa] Nice', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:33.115087', 5, 608, 4),
(3665, '[Gopichand Kalasani] Excellent', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:33.11533', 5, 608, 4),
(3666, '[Aravind Eggidi] Goog', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:33.115399', 5, 608, 4),
(3667, '[Sharath Kumar Sibbala] Food is going worst day by day, it used to be good when the pg was started but now its almost worst. there was an issue with fan since 2 weeks in the room which is not working properly ,and conveyed the same thing to hostel owner ramu and the next moment he asked me to vacate the hostel, i dont recommend this hostel coz we are paying for services and owner should maintain the basic needs.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:35.153105', 1, 610, 4),
(3668, '[yashuu_ Yashuu] Rent 7.5knDeposit 2k', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:35.153201', 3, 610, 4),
(3669, U&'[Nelluri Mahesh] I have stayed in it for 3months , when I ask about food and is going worst day by day. Next day he called me and said vacate the room I didn\2019t like this. Guys when u also ask about food he will ask u to vacate better try another. Rooms are also conjusted and washing clothes also  worst some different smell comes from washed clothes. Chicken also they will not give enough quantity they will count pieces 4, they are also very small. Try not this choose a best one. He is arrogant 1st he talks slowly and then he shows his attitude', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:35.153276', 1, 610, 4),
(3670, U&'[Raja Sekhara] # rooms are congested there is not enough place since all beds are attached close by.n#clothes are not properly washed, the dobhi answer is unacceptable, he spoiled my two jeans and every time he''s not getting back my room mates one of the shirts.n# Wi-Fi signal will only available to half of the rooms, no response from owner for this problem since last 4 months.n# food was good at the beginning when this pg is started in Feb2018, now its no different from any other average pg''s.nnOne more problem here is there is water flooding behind melange tower to hometel which is in the only way to this hostel, in rainy season it would be hell to walk here.nnIf you are ok with all these welcome home  \+01f917\+01f601', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:35.153352', 3, 610, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3671, '[Kamalakar Reddy] Comparing to my previous hostel this is very satisfactory and maintance is good and owner is also very friendly with us. Food is good. Facilities also good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:35.15342', 5, 610, 4),
(3672, '[Ayyappa Malla] Worst management and food is so bad they will maximum cook with 3 vegetables ( carrot, beatroot or cabbage), owner is very impolite. So bad to stay their.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:35.153496', 1, 610, 4),
(3673, '[QASrinivasarao Kandikattu] Good hostel accommodation as peasefull environment.at this place we cant expect peaceful environment but here it is possible', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:35.153563', 5, 610, 4),
(3674, '[venkat naveen] Very nice Accommodation service we leave for a year,nBack view of westin hotel is bit pulpy', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:35.153631', 4, 610, 4),
(3675, '[Murali Ramalingam] Rooms are good. Food is horrible. They give frequently noodles for breakfast in Andhra, can you believe it? They can give idli, upma, dosa, pesarattu etc.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:36.444316', 2, 611, 4),
(3676, '[gayatri bathula] Clean rooms and hygienic environmentnFriendly management and safe for working womennGood food and maintenancenQuiet environment for students u0026 employees', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:36.44453', 5, 611, 4),
(3677, '[Mohammed Fahad F S] Good place and they returns the deposit amount immediately ... The owner here is sooo kind person.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:36.444606', 5, 611, 4),
(3678, '[Jahnavi Saladi] Good food owner is very kind hearted person it feels like a home', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:36.444676', 5, 611, 4),
(3679, '[Ramana B] Very spacious rooms, Good food', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:36.444746', 5, 611, 4),
(3680, '[Naveen Kumar Salipalli] Food, maintenance, service everything is good...!!nManagement is also very cool and Friendly', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:36.444814', 5, 611, 4),
(3681, '[Raviteja katukuri] It''s a good room which I got, double bed, very spacious, cup boards, TV, geyser, and most entertaining part is I got a room with balcony so that I can enjoy fresh air, good view of nature. Owner and workers are very friendly even at midnight they provide drinking water bottles supply.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:36.444887', 4, 611, 4),
(3682, '[Siddharth mathur] Good accommodation for north indians. The room are bigger than any other pg in this area and the food is also nice. They give roti and sabji every day so that is one of the plus point of this pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:36.444954', 5, 611, 4),
(3683, '[Bhargava Varanasi] Food is good, stay is good (depends on which room you stay in).nNo matter how many times we complain about issues, management is not responding at all.nnHave prepaid power meters, and you have to bear the money excluding hostel fee.nnManagement says weekly two times washroom cleaning but done only once.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:37.819847', 3, 612, 4),
(3684, U&'[SHIV ASHISH AGRAHARI] \2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0fn**Star Marigold PG, Hyderabad**nnStar Marigold PG is an excellent place to stay, especially for working professionals and students. The location is very convenient, close to HITEC City, offices, and public transport. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and furnished with all basic amenities. The food quality is good, and hygiene is well taken care of. Staff and management are friendly, supportive, and responsive to any concerns. Overall, it\2019s a comfortable, safe, and hassle-free PG with a pleasant living environment. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:37.820042', 5, 612, 4),
(3685, '[Chandrasekhar Reddy] Star mari gold pg in Madhapur food is tasty and hygiene,rooms are clean daily base cleaning.The one point is negative point is need washing machine and lift', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:37.820174', 5, 612, 4),
(3686, '[Mohan Sunkara] If food ,room  is not problem you can choseee thiss pg ..... I have the worst experience with food and worst room maintaince. As you know you have to pay the extra for electricity bill. It''s aa another challenge for you soo .... Think again to join this pg for monthly or daily basis...nAnother important thing is don''t pay in advance if are know that you will stay up to that date you can pay or else you can''t get the refund amount from them .. it''s aa another worst thing with them ..', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:37.820258', 1, 612, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3687, U&'[Kishor Raut] Hygeine food and nice maintenance and co operating staff and house keeping is good everyday cleaning. Nice ambience in prime location , near to mind space is very useful to IT employees with in 2 km radius and ver affordable price \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:37.820333', 5, 612, 4),
(3688, '[Muna Naik] I am staying in this pg last 2 years, here food is very hygeine and maintenance is good. Daily cleaning and environmmet is also nice . Affordable rince in prime areanOverall is good pg for everyone', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:37.820405', 5, 612, 4),
(3689, '[GANESH KIRLA] I  am writing this review after spending 1 year in this hostel.nFood is fine.....everything will be prepared on time.No water issue.nBut management wise, they are not at all good. If any issue comes to the room facilities they will take a lot of time to resolve.nFor example as I added in the photonThe bathroom door is damaged andnIt''s been 2 months  since this issue came and still they need time to resolve this.nAs you can see, we can get hurt by this door if we are not careful when we enter the bathroom. They saw this and suggested us to be careful, and left the issue till date.nNot just thisnEven they took 3 days to replace light in the room. How can we stay in the room without light? And one more thing...nJust for 1 room light, fan, bathroom bulb and heater we are getting around  1200/- to 1400/- power bill which is a mistry to figure out how power bill is generated.nnJust because of the office location I had to stay here.nHope they understand our issue and resolve it soon.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:37.820479', 1, 612, 4),
(3690, '[Uday Karri] I stayed in this pg for nearly 6 months.nOne of the best pg in patrika Nagar region.nFood is very good.nHomely pgnThe only minus here is pg rent.It is bit costly. If you came with your friends then you can bargain with pg owner.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:37.820552', 4, 612, 4),
(3691, '[Prajwal Mahalle] The manager/owner is very rude. Even if you do simple enquiry about the room rent and sharings, they will reply rudely. Will not suggest anyone to consider this PG/hostel as your time here is gonna be absolutely worse. There are a hell lot of good options nearby, make sure to look out for other options.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:38.603474', 1, 613, 4),
(3692, '[Yeswanth Sai] Since from last 3 yrs I am staying in dream house mens Hostal here the team is good and ,the food is also so good comfortable stay for every some I will must recommend to every one to stay here with your comfort', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:38.603577', 5, 613, 4),
(3693, '[DevanshAI Creations] Worst pg, don''t stay here, food quality is below average, same item n same taste , not ideal to stay more than 1 day', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:38.603688', 1, 613, 4),
(3694, '[Prakash R] I have been staying here for one month. I have stayed in some other hostels before, and this is the Best hostel that I have stayed in so far.nThe first thing I like is Hygiene, Rooms are cleaned everyday. Coming to maintanence ,the Owner will resolve the any issues as quick as a wink.nNext is the Food. The food here is great. There will be tea in morning and evening. Rotis are only available at night. Roti lovers might need to adjust here. Weekly twice Chicken, four times Egg and Snacks on weekends. Its really bang for the buck.nAlso there is awashing machine for laundry.nI am happy for what they provide here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:38.603785', 5, 613, 4),
(3695, U&'[naveen gummala] As soon as you enter Dream House Men''s Hostel, you don\2019t just get a room\2014you get a complete experience. The hostel is clean, well-designed, and full of positive vibes. It\2019s not just a place to stay, it\2019s a peaceful and comfortable home for students and working professionals.nThe food here is delicious and hygienic. It feels just like home-cooked meals, and they take good care of your health.nYou get fast Wi-Fi, 24/7 security, laundry service, and a peaceful place to study. Everything you need is right here.nThe staff is polite and helpful. The people staying here are friendly, and you\2019ll feel like part of a big family.nIf you\2019re looking for a hostel that gives you comfort, safety, and a homely vibe\2014Dream House Men''s Hostel is the perfect choice.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:38.60387', 5, 613, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3696, U&'[Cmoon Testing] Homely food good Ambience good to stay must recommend place for the every mens soon if you stay here you feel feel comfortable as home \+01f49e\+01f3e1', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:38.603951', 5, 613, 4),
(3697, '[Sreenivas Thatikonda] Good to stay ,since from last 3 yrs I am staying here ,good food, everyday cleaning, friendly staff  must recommend to the person who want to stay .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:38.604031', 5, 613, 4),
(3698, '[Naveen Masipogu] It''s a good experience hostel is Affordable andnConvenient Location Wi-Fi, laundry facilities, and meal plans. offer flexible rental plans, including short-term and long-term stays and Safety and Security Hygienic and Well-Maintained. Finally good experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:38.604114', 5, 613, 4),
(3699, '[Prakash Singh] Very nice accommodation with a highly supportive owner. I stayed here for a month and had a great experience. Before choosing this PG, I visited several others, but most of them were quite congested. This PG is spacious, comfortable, and well-maintained. I would definitely recommend it to others.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:39.653747', 5, 614, 4),
(3700, U&'[ashok Sankurathri] I stayed here for 2 months, I liked the stay and food. I love cooking and I have a habit of checking ingredients (they use freshly homemade masalas and maintain hygiene kitchen), Rooms are good and they maintain well.nnFriendly owner and 24/7 security (you don\2019t need to worry, even if you\2019re parking your bike outside.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:39.653962', 5, 614, 4),
(3701, '[Pratik Patil] Very polite and affectionate nature of owner and the staff. Cleanliness and all the facilities are exceptional. Food quality is also good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:39.654167', 4, 614, 4),
(3702, U&'[Naveen Kumar] Stayed here for 3 months till Dec in single occupancy paying \20b923K/month. Food was better than many nearby PGs, and daily cleaning was done.nnHowever, overall hygiene and maintenance were disappointing. I found cockroaches in the common fridge, and I personally faced issues with the drinking water. I kept getting throat infections after using the common filter water, so I eventually switched to buying mineral water.nnDuring my stay, none of the washing machines worked properly.nnI also noticed many residents complaining about bedbugs, so be careful.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:39.654418', 2, 614, 4),
(3703, '[Venkata Manoj Rachakonda] Stayed here for 9 months. Have been a very cozy stay. Cleanliness and hygiene is not an option here. The food is good, though a monotonous taste will develop in time, like any other mess. Fee is affordable. Any grievances if found will be addressed ASAP. I really recommend this PG for all. Comfortable, cozy and safe PG for men and women.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:39.655001', 5, 614, 4),
(3704, '[Siddarth Rajput] I had a great experience staying at this hostel. The rooms are neat and clean, ensuring a comfortable status. The food is good and well-prepared. One of the best thing is the availability of 24/7 water and electricity, which adds to the convenience. Plus, the hostel is newly constructed making everything fresh and well-maintained. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:39.655344', 5, 614, 4),
(3705, '[Charles Franco] White House Elite PG is truly my second home. Though this is my first time away from family, I never felt alone thanks to the supportive and friendly environment here. The food is homely, tasty, and hygienic, with good variety and daily fresh meals. The amenities are excellent 24/7 water and electricity, spacious rooms, automatic lift, CCTVs, fridge and water filter on each floor, and washing machines on the rooftop. The management and staff are caring, and cleanliness is always maintained. Highly recommended for anyone looking for comfort and a sense of belonging.  I highly recommend White House Elite PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:39.655735', 5, 614, 4),
(3706, U&'[Ravi Kumar] I was nervous about PG food, but [White House Elite luxury hostel] genuinely provides delicious, home-cooked, and varied meals! They offer both North and South Indian options throughout the week, and the kitchen hygiene is top-notch. Beyond the food, the amenities are excellent: power backup is seamless, and the laundry service is quick and reliable. The rooms are fully furnished with good quality furniture and an attached clean bathroom. It\2019s great value for money considering all the services included.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:39.655906', 5, 614, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3707, '[Prasanna Guduru] Security and room size is good. But most annoying part is the Owner. He doesn''t know how to behave politely he just need money that''s it. If you say about any issue or complaint he will blame us in the reverse saying it happened because of us and that too in very arrogant way. If anything damages in the PG he will blame us and he won''t repair that for few days.  Even workers at the PG behaves like they are the owners. PG is okay but Owner behavior is worst', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:40.564367', 1, 615, 4),
(3708, '[Rajeswari Geddam] I had a great experience staying at Sri Toshini Women''s PG Hostel in Patrika Nagar, HITEC City. The hostel is well-maintained, and cleanliness is given top priority, making it a comfortable place to stay.nnThe staff is friendly and helpful, always ensuring a smooth and hassle-free stay. They are quick to address any concerns, which adds to the overall positive experience.nnThe location is also a plus, being in HITEC City, which makes it convenient for working professionals and students.nnOverall, if you''re looking for a clean, safe, and well-managed women''s hostel in the area, I would definitely recommend Sri Toshini Women''s PG Hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:40.564545', 4, 615, 4),
(3709, '[Chereddy Mohana Lakshmi Priya] The food is good, the rooms are also good. The locality is peaceful and safe too. One thing that is bothering me here is the Current Bill policy. Recharging the current meter by myself is a bit annoying. Apart from that, i don''t have any complaints about staying here. I recommend you to join.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:40.564621', 4, 615, 4),
(3710, '[Ramu143] Worst hostel in Hyd don''t choose this hostel to join  If u face any issue  Owner will not take care, his behavior is very rude.... Just he want money.... money ....money....moneynnCharges are tooooo high currently they will collect current bill charges and lift Charges and washing machine charges Fridge ........etc  these charges are seperate and room fee is seperate  FOR ME 4 SHARING ROOM COST IS 10K (including all charges) Waste of moneynnOwner wants to only money...money...money...he doesn''t take about our health. he is take care  about how to earn more money from my hostlers never seen these type of owner in my life.....nnBoys will come for cleaning will get uncomfortable.nnOnce Stay in This Hostel worst Hostel.... Waste Management, Food Is Not Good...too worst....... I can say One Thing this is Most Worst Hostel In Hyderabad....Okka maata Lo Cheppalante Chetha Management', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:40.564686', 1, 615, 4),
(3711, '[Apoorva Agrawal] Good place for accommodation within the budget. It serves south Indian breakfast but the food taste good. Provides breakfast, lunch, tea in the evening and dinner, room cleaning service and laundry service. Personally had a good time spent obviously if you have good roommates...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:40.564748', 4, 615, 4),
(3712, '[Nihaarika N] This one star is only because of the lady warden who has no manners at all and no sense of talking at all. Owners please change the warden. This is a common complaint with most of them living in the hostel. I wanted to stay longer but with her Witch like screaming and dirty stares. Very disappointed. She doesn''t deserve to be there at all. Remove her immediately. Otherwise the hostel is very well maintained and good food and no in timings :)', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:40.564809', 1, 615, 4),
(3713, '[Durga manjula Boori] I lived two years in Toshini pg . Food is good and clean maintenance. Perfect to stay here . Workers and Owners very careful in taking care of each and every service.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:40.564873', 4, 615, 4),
(3714, '[kotsko tech] Worst Paying Guest Accommodation. My cousin faced lot of problems over there. Previous it was good and from past few weeks the management became worst ever. They are having lot of issues coming to food.  People  need to have food like a prison asking for food. And the management is to rude even they are not giving proper response to the people. The lady warden is  ridiculous.  Try to not join in this Paying Guest and if at all THe PG guys are replying to this Message with improper statements it leads  to worst situations, So Try to change the management and be regularized.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:40.564936', 1, 615, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3715, '[Ankita Chatterjee] I spent about 9 months at the pg and the only good part was the less traffic noice (since it''s the last building in the lane) and the little continent store they. The staff people were decent too (even though their work wasn''t...)nnThe food was same every week and sometimes undercooked; the hygiene (of kitchen area) and cleanliness of the rooms weren''t up to the mark; the washing machines are old and terrace has a large empty pool which is basically a waste of space; even though there is biometric locks, they are never used; unlike the images posted, the rooms are quite small for anything more than 2 shares. The last straw for me was the increase in pests. There were bed-bugs and despite complaints, all they did was some sprays and some powder which didn''t produce results.nnAll in all, it''s not worth the rent paid.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:42.258401', 1, 616, 4),
(3716, '[murali krishna] My sister staying in queens pg it''s only for womennParkingnSecurity u0026 saftey ,wifi , power backupnCleaningnNice ambience Good vibes friendly staff management was kind and good response homely food extra stove for self coocking on rooftop washing machine for clothes', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:42.259346', 5, 616, 4),
(3717, U&'[Vinitha Saranya] \201cThe quality of the food is excellent, the meals are healthy, and the rooms are maintained very cleanly. Perfect! \+01f44c\201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:42.259476', 5, 616, 4),
(3718, '[Vedica Kandoi] I stayed at queens pg for 2 months and it was a very good experience. The caretaker and staff and everyone is super helpful and friendly. Daily cleaning is done properly. Facilities are very good. Only being a north indian, the food menu was not as per my choices but that was manageable - I mostly ordered. Overall, I didn''t face any problems. And I would definitely recommend everyone to stay here!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:42.271771', 5, 616, 4),
(3719, '[Kritz Reamer] The PG rooms are very congested with limited space, making it uncomfortable to live and move around. Proper ventilation and natural light are lacking, which adds to the discomfort. The food quality is not good and does not meet basic hygiene or taste standards. The meals are repetitive, often cold, and not prepared properly, making it difficult to depend on the PG food daily. Overall, the living conditions need significant improvement.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:42.272039', 1, 616, 4),
(3720, '[Shreya Mukhopadhyay] This PG was for good for a few months after the new building was constructed. Soon after it started degrading in all its facilities.nnThis PG is short-staffed due to which the rooms and washrooms are not cleaned regularly, washrooms are cleaned only once a week, brooming of the room is done regularly but very poorly and sweeping is never with clean water.nnThe washing machines are never all working properly and even after repeatedly informing, it takes days to get repaired. The ropes for drying clothes are almost always breaking and very clumsy.nnThe self cooking area consists of just a single two burner oven which is occupied by the PG staff during busy morning hours.nnThe food quanlity is also poor, there is gravy more and very little of the actual food item. Also the taste has deteriorated a lot and options are so monotonous and almost no veggies. Maximum 3 days of the week you can except a proper meal here.nnThe behaviour of the staff is good that is probably the only good point here in this PG. All the facilities here were good in the initial days and when things started turning down, there is no effort to pull up through it seems.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:42.272168', 1, 616, 4),
(3721, U&'[Void Spirit] A great place for working women to stay. Near hi-tech city Shilparamam with good neighbor hood and environment. With a pond and park being developed by Telangana government, it''s a good place to relax and a near place to all the companies.nIt''s a bit costly \+01f642\+01f642.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:42.276994', 5, 616, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3722, U&'[Aishwarya Singh] Disappointing Experience at Queens PGnnRating: 3/5nnI recently stayed at Queens PG, and unfortunately, my experience was quite disappointing. The place had a significant issue with mosquitoes, making it uncomfortable to stay.nn## Staff and ManagementnWhile the staff was courteous and helpful, the owner''s behavior was unacceptable. When I requested a refund for my deposit upon checking out, I was met with resistance and had to insist multiple times to get it back.nn## Additional ConcernsnWhat''s more, I was charged an extra \20b93,000 to switch on the AC in my room during peak summer, despite being promised an AC room.nn## ConclusionnGiven the mosquito issue and the owner''s unprofessional behavior, I would advise potential guests to think twice before booking here. Hopefully, they will address these concerns to improve their guests'' experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:42.277433', 3, 616, 4),
(3723, '[dhruv singh] Cleanliness is OK. But power back is not upto the mark. The area where it is located is not very upmarket. However, everything is near by.. I mean walking distance. The property is not really well kept with lots of service related issues. I would recommend this place only if you have no other options.. Their all the properties  don''t have food available in the facilities. Don''t look at the photos of the property posted by the owner because they are very old.. Current situation is sometimes extreme opposite of what is shown.nWashing facility is also not upto the mark. The caretaker however is a good person and he tries to help.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:42.828743', 2, 617, 4),
(3724, '[Pranay kanth Reddy Bokka] Water problem is therenNo minimum facilities will be provided not suggest poor surroundings roads all muddy roads from 4 sides of this pg and full of left and right side parking vehicles on that roads onlynfull traffic blocks dailynSome stupid driver come like drunk and some stupid people will walk in between the roadsnwhere and how u will go they are defnno lift will be provided with proper maintenance every time break down problem u have to use stair case.nno place to dry ur clothes on the terrace if you dry by doing something ur clothes will be thrown some where.nNo cctv cameras only to show no use of it .nNo Parking place to park ur vehicle daily all outside people come and park inside they distrub ur vehiclenNot worth it.nOnly 2 washing machine will be there for all but to show 5 will be there', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:42.828819', 1, 617, 4),
(3725, '[Dr hhsg] They deserve a minus rating. They block room for wrong dates and refuse to answer calls or give refund. Pathetic people. Don''t waste your time trying to book this place and spoil your peace of mind.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:42.828885', 1, 617, 4),
(3726, '[Anmol Fagho] Great place to stay clean room good food and friends staff highly recommend', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:42.828946', 5, 617, 4),
(3727, '[Ravikumar Rajendiran] Good place to stay, very spacious, room service and two wheeler parking available. Cost of living is little bit high.nOverall clean and silent place to live a short period.nKitchen with induction facility also available for self cooking. Some of the rooms have balcony. Good ventilation rooms, 24/7 water and electricity. TV and Wifi is also available. Two and Three sharing rooms available. This is one of the nice PG in the city.nnTransport is not much available in this area, always depend on the own vehicle or Ola and Uber only.nnBe aware of prices, when you will choosing room here. They will give some false commitments like price dropped or offer for you like this. After one month they will revise the price or increased eventually.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:42.829014', 4, 617, 4),
(3728, '[Jahnavi Gajula] This is the worst PG experience I have ever gone through. The geaser is not working and when i called property manager he didn''t even answer my call, but whole the workers in PG calls him he is answering their calls, the rooms are not clean cupboards are full of dust. They didn''t even clean the room before my check-in. In the morning itself I left the PG. If you wanna stay in zolo property please do not. They just cheat you with large amount of fees. Maintenance is very worst. Please don''t believe the images in Google.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:42.829078', 1, 617, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3729, '[sundar kumar] Electricity bill is so high, no one is answerable, only fake reasons', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:42.829137', 1, 617, 4),
(3730, '[Rameswar Patra] The images online vs the real place are miles apart (as with most pg, I have nothing against this one in particular).nJust don''t get deceived by the online photos. Go there, take a look around and then decide whether the place is good for your budget or not.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:42.829198', 3, 617, 4),
(3731, '[ravi sharma] Everything is good ref food. You people r not concentrating on room maintenance like locks, lights, wifi, geyser. Not even giving proper response. I request you to kindly check all the problems atleast once in a month.nIf not, we left no choice than vacating. As I saw your review answer about the rent, we are losing 16,000/- x2 , 32,000/-. We pay for power bill.nSo, please concentrate', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:44.347626', 2, 619, 4),
(3732, '[Shalini] Room is good with proper cross ventilation also has free gym and enough parking space', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:44.347718', 5, 619, 4),
(3733, U&'[AKASH kumar] Very good women\2019s PG with a safe and peaceful environment. Rooms are clean and well maintained. Food is tasty and hygienic. Management is very caring and supportive.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:44.347786', 5, 619, 4),
(3734, '[Garima] The room is spacious u0026 the cupboards are decent too. Overall it''s a decent one to live at!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:44.347906', 5, 619, 4),
(3735, '[SriPraba Srinivasan] Food is really good... They are maintaining rooms clearly. I stayed there for a week. Power change will be separate. Safe for women.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:44.34797', 4, 619, 4),
(3736, '[Thatipati Nagesh] Very spacious rooms with hygenic weather and quality food really tasty i had ever eat in other pgs', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:44.34809', 5, 619, 4),
(3737, '[Sri Pallavi] Price is little high and what I don''t like is it''s a prepaid electricity bill payment 1 unit costing 12rs; if I recharge for 100 rs hardly I get it for 3days  even though 1 and my roommate don''t use TV approximately 1 month it''s costing 1000 rs for electricity .Rooms is small for 3 sharing and cost is high .Other than this everything is good eith food and management..other thing is few rooms have only one key so even after informing management they are not making duplicates', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:44.348159', 4, 619, 4),
(3738, U&'[Rishita Kumari] Bestest Pg ever found \+01f60d too good food cleanliness and perfect environment worth it\+01faf6 don\2019t think just go for it', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:44.34822', 5, 619, 4),
(3739, '[Ragini Rajbhor] I stayed here for one month in double sharing room, here''s few important things one should keep in  mind before choosing this PG (one above Sri Gautham Grammar High School, not the fancy one).nnPositive Aspects :nn1. 24 hours electricity (even during major power cuts in the city)n2. 24 hours water /Geyser facility /Washing Machine.n3. Variety of South Indian Food in Meals (3 times a day, Lunch comes early morning along with Breakfast, so that whoever has to go office, can pack it and go)n4. My room had a balcony so I kept my plants there, dried lingeries, washed plates.n5. This area is peaceful, no noise during night hours .n6. You can Cook for yourself, kitchen is all yours, fridge is also available (its a good thing for mid night cravings)n7. You can chill in Hall and entrance area (half in shed of tree)n8. At 10 O''Clock the watchman locks the main gate, but you can have the Keys and come anytime, there''s no restrictions.n9. Can go for Morning/evening/night walk, as the area is peaceful. (Else you can go to Narella Park just Beside the PG, 300 mt.s away. I could not avail this benefit because I stayed during covid period, park is still close for safety purpose)n10. If your office is nearby , you can walk down, I used to go walking as my office was just 950 Mts. away from PG.n11. Its NOT in a remote area, everything is close by, nearest mall is 500mts. away- Sarath City, nearest metro is Hitech City, cycling park is also nearby.n12. Reasonably  OK WiFi facility -24 hours.n13. The person who brings food/drinking water is really humble person, though he only speaks Telgu, but tries to communicate as much as he can.n14. I am grateful that the PG owner didn''t take any advances/security deposits from me, as I informed him , I will only stay for One month. And also provided me one separate Cupboard.nnNegative Aspects :nn1. I am hygiene freak, I left this PG because they used to clean it once a week or once in 2 weeks, that too after constant reminders (PG owner used to say, workers are not available due to covid, which is indigestible excuse to me)n2.  I didn''t know if finding a humble, kind, polite, understanding PG owner is also an important thing, so be cautious.n3. Make sure you inform the PG owner in advance (a month before) when thinking to vacate the PG, otherwise you might be asked to pay extra charges.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:45.790808', 4, 620, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3740, '[Alekhya Vemula] Good atmosphere. Food is vary tasty and healthy. Good management. Rooms are specious and comfortable. It is nice hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:45.791008', 5, 620, 4),
(3741, '[Bhavna Singh] Pros-n1) Rooms are spacious.n2) Walkable distance from AMB Mall and main roadn3) Cleaning facilitynnCons-n1) Food is the worst, no tea/milk in morning and no curd in afternoonn2) Rats/Leach/cockroach roam around dining arean3) Dogs/Cats roam on floorsn4) No proper security guards to take care in nightn5) Owner just comes to collect rent, not to ask problemsn6) By looking at food it doesn''t look healthy and hygienic. Full of oil and spices and found hair and worms once. Non veg smells very badn7) Sometimes food comes very late and gets over quicklyn8) No geyser, solar panel is there that too doesn''t work properlynnOverall the amount of money they are taking is not in proportion with quality of the facilities provided', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:45.791075', 1, 620, 4),
(3742, '[Twinkle Das] I stayed for 1 year in Signature PG. Had an excellent experience. It was like one''s own home. The interiors were like hotel and plus point is the rent was also reasonable and worth it. The owner was very friendly and co-operative, the food quality was also good, 24 X 7 water and power backup and free WiFi. The area was nice as well. Nearby to the bus stop and all the main necessities were easily accessible.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:45.791141', 5, 620, 4),
(3743, U&'[Anusha] Would definitely recommend this PG.. The environment is so good. Clean and spacious rooms. Food is also good. There''s a kitchen too ,so we can cook by ourselves when we want to eat a quick snack. WiFi facility and washing machine for clothes are also available. The location of the PG is also very much safe. If you''re looking for a good PG then go for it! \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:45.791202', 5, 620, 4),
(3744, U&'[Sowmya Battula] Pros:n1. Welcoming ambiancen2. Room is good and clean with all basic facilities required for a room.n3. Great accessibility to main roadn4. Walking distance to AMB malln5. Spacious common kitchen with good stove and some utensils. Oven is not properly maintained but was of no use to me either way.n6. Wifi worked ok in my room and never had much complaints about it.nnCons:n1. No basic common sense from management. Very rude at times.n2. Rice has worms in it and showed to management very many times. They accepted to take care of it but did not work. Quality of rice is not good. Curries will have too much oil enough for the vegetable to swim.n3. In case if any food is delicious by chance, quantity will be less and will not be refilled even within food timings of the management.nWhen asked about refilling, they refuse to refill and complain that girls are taking so much food. (I think it is not served free of cost dude!! )n4. They can revise their rental rates just like that randomly with less notice.n5. No curd or atleast buttermilk for lunch. Management claims nobody eats it \+01f602n6. Even street dogs and cats are allowed inside each floor anytime. No monitoring on this.n7. Rats enjoy all the dining space during nights. If anyone gets hungry during late night, should be aware.nnThe incidents with the PG:nn1. The management person \201cRajesh\201d can come just like that into the hostel and bang each of the doors and shouts about rent and sharing persons count increase within short notice. Doesnt matter how girls dress during Sunday mornings. Level of dignity.n2. MAJOR important thing is if you are on vacation for more days - I was not at the hostel for more than a month and the uncle (think Ramesh ji) gave away my bed to another girl for 2 days that too without informing me. That girl used all my things and made shabby including my bedsheets etc. Had i not known this fact, he charged the amount from me too. This is truly disgusting and very cheap of them.n3. For many days i have seen a couple having Romance in the couch at the entrance during nights. Not sure what the cc cameras are for.n4. The swiggy/zomato guys comes anytime during midnights even at 2/3am straight until the room doors. This the level of security provided. Even after informing , no action.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:45.791264', 2, 620, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3745, '[Lakshmi Devi G] It''s good to stay here. These rooms looks like high class.nRooms are sanitized for every 3 days.nN95 mask will be provided for everyone.nSelf cooking options are available.nNo restrictions for in and out.nI will suggest this pg to my friends.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:45.79134', 5, 620, 4),
(3746, '[sweta roy] The location of the PG is convenient in terms of transport and communication.  However the  service is extremely poor. Despite several reminders neither the food is served on time nor cleaning is done regularly. Even they need several  several reminders for providing wifi connection in the room.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:45.791402', 1, 620, 4),
(3747, '[thota munna] I had a really great experience here. Rooms are very clean, well-maintained and spacious. Washrooms are cleaned daily. The staff and warden are very supportive and friendly. Security is good with CCTV and proper entry system. Food quality is also decent and hygienic. Peaceful environment for studying. Value for money. Highly recommended for students and working professionals', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:46.295029', 5, 621, 4),
(3748, '[Rakesh Thatikonda] The pg is awesome.  Have been known this pg for past one year.  Management is good food is good.  Excellent for couples.  Many people are staying in this area coliving.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:46.295116', 5, 621, 4),
(3749, U&'[Karimulla Mogal] I\2019ve been staying at Avocado CoLiving PG for the past 7 months, and honestly, it has been a really good experience.nnJay is not just the owner; he\2019s very friendly and like a brother. He is always approachable, understands our concerns, and makes sure things are handled quickly and clearly.nnA special mention to Madhu, the chef. The food is delicious and feels like proper home-style food. He puts a lot of effort into making sure the food is tasty and satisfying.nnAlso, Eshwar from the cleaning staff is very friendly and does his work well. Everyone here is approachable and creates a comfortable atmosphere.nnOverall, after staying here for 7 months, I genuinely feel comfortable calling Avocado CoLiving my home away from home. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:46.295181', 5, 621, 4),
(3750, '[Surya CN] Clean and spacious rooms. Hygienic food. One of best in the area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:46.295249', 5, 621, 4),
(3751, '[Umakanth Gudi] Very good pg and food is excellent and rooms are very clear with security amazing experience must stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:46.295314', 5, 621, 4),
(3752, '[Ajay kumar Choudhury] The PG environment is so Good . The owner is so good in behaviour. The best part of this PG is food quality.This PG Is very suitable for coliving.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:46.295377', 5, 621, 4),
(3753, '[SREE SATHYA SAI PRATHAP] I had an exceptional experience at Avocado Living PG u0026 Col. The welcoming atmosphere made me feel at home, and the attentive owner was truly wonderful. Additionally, the food served was delicious and satisfying.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:46.295451', 5, 621, 4),
(3754, '[Prudhvi Raj] Befood quality was insane as home', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:46.295528', 5, 621, 4),
(3755, '[Rishita Madas] Best co-living PG in Kondapur with clean and fully furnished rooms.nGreat location near Gachibowli and Kothaguda X Road.nPeaceful environment with good WiFi and maintenance.nHighly recommended for working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:46.79553', 5, 622, 4),
(3756, '[solo kings] One of the best PGs in Kondapur near Gachibowli.nFully furnished rooms with modern amenities and good maintenance.nVery convenient location with easy transport access.nSafe and affordable co-living stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:46.795647', 5, 622, 4),
(3757, '[Srikanth karise] Excellent co-living stay near Kothaguda X Road, Kondapur.nRooms are neat and management is responsive.nWiFi, washing machine, and cleaning service are very good.nOne of the top-rated PGs in the area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:46.795728', 5, 622, 4);          
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3758, '[Hemanta Raj] One of the best co-living PGs in Kondapur. The rooms are clean, spacious, and well-maintained. Food quality is good, and the WiFi is reliable. Highly recommended for students and working professionals looking for a comfortable stay near Gachibowli and Madhapur.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:46.7958', 5, 622, 4),
(3759, '[Umakanth Chainpure] Had a great stay at this co-living hostel! The rooms were clean, comfortable, and well-maintained. The atmosphere was friendly and perfect for meeting new people. Staff were supportive and always available when needed. WiFi, common areas, and overall facilities were really good. Safe, affordable, and located in a convenient area. Highly recommended for students, working professionals, and travelers looking for a peaceful and social stay experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:46.795942', 5, 622, 4),
(3760, '[Viswa Anumula] Comfortable co-living space in Kondapur Hyderabad.nPrime location near Gachibowli and Hitech City offices.nGood WiFi, CCTV security, and cleaning service available.nPerfect PG for long-term stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:46.796079', 5, 622, 4),
(3761, '[Veera Prasad] Highly recommended co-living PG in Kondapur Hyderabad.nSafe and comfortable stay near Gachibowli offices.nWell-maintained rooms with good facilities and ambience.nPerfect for working men and women.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:46.796157', 5, 622, 4),
(3762, '[prasannakumari eerpina] Comfortable and budget-friendly co-living PG in Kondapur.nPrime location near Gachibowli and Hitech City.Clean rooms with peaceful atmosphere and good facilities.nOne of the best PGs in the area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:46.79631', 5, 622, 4),
(3763, U&'[Baki Akshay] Excellent Stay \2013 Highly Recommended!nI had a great experience staying at this PG. The rooms were clean, well-maintained, and comfortable. The staff was very friendly, responsive, and always willing to help with any requests.nOne of the things I appreciated most was the peaceful environment \2013 perfect for studying or relaxing .The common areas were neat, and facilities like Wi-Fi, laundry, and food service were reliable and well-organized.nThe location is also convenient, with easy access to public transport, grocery stores, and nearby eateries.nOverall, a safe and welcoming place to stay. I would definitely recommend it to students or working professionals looking for a comfortable and hassle-free living experience!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:47.324349', 5, 623, 4),
(3764, U&'[Vivek Patel] I\2019ve had a really good experience staying at this PG in Kondapur. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and comfortable. The management is friendly and always ready to help with any issues. Food quality is good, and the place feels safe and homely.nThe location is also perfect close to offices, shops, and transport options. Overall, it\2019s a great place to stay for working professionals or students looking for a peaceful and well-managed hostel in Hyderabad. Highly recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:47.324442', 5, 623, 4),
(3765, '[Lava Kumar] The hostel is amazing! The rooms are clean and spacious, and the staff is super friendly. I loved the homely food and the safe environment. You''re lucky to have such a great place to stay.nnThe location is so convenient, with everything nearby, and hostel''s 24/7 security gives me peace of mind. I''ve made some great friends here, and we always have fun together.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:47.324523', 5, 623, 4),
(3766, U&'[Usha Lenka] I\2019m staying in a PG, and this food really feels like home. So tasty and light \2014 thank you for maintaining such quality!nThe food quality is awesome. Home-cooked taste with perfect balance of spices. Neat packing and on-time delivery!n\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:47.324591', 5, 623, 4),
(3767, '[Mahendhar Boddupelly] New management is doing a great job! The food tastes like home, and the place is always clean.nnVery happy with the new management. Everything is well maintained and the staff are polite.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:47.324659', 5, 623, 4);      
