(3772, '[Vanaja] Hello all, Don''t visit this PGn1.Supervisor Response is worst and negligencen2.Room maintenance was not at all goodn3.Main food the taste is worst and neatness is not at all goodn4.No back-up powern5.Bed Bugs is there in all roomsn6.Coupels were not safe heren7.Owner(Ashok) and supervisor (pavan) no one will respond for anything.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:48.351049', 1, 624, 4),
