(3774, '[Daniyala Akhil] This pg is excellent. Room and food is very good and management is very friendly room is everyday cleaning, and also WiFi free. Excellent pg in Hyderabad.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:48.351184', 4, 624, 4),
(3775, '[Priyanka pulipaka] I stayed in this pg for 4 months and I would really say that the pg was amazing and the food was so good I recommend everyone staying near this area please choose pg over other you''ll have best experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:48.351246', 5, 624, 4),
(3776, U&'[Chapala mamatha Pandu] \201cLoved the food here! It\2019s hygienic and tasty just like home. The PG is also very clean and peaceful \2014 great experience overall!\201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:48.351307', 5, 624, 4),
(3777, '[Rayudu Veparala] Good u0026 excellent pg ,good maintenance like wifi ,rooms cleaning u0026 a very hygiene food , maintainers u0026 owner''s nature also soo friendly, well to recommend', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:48.351368', 5, 624, 4),
(3778, U&'[Venkata Sai sandeep] I stayed in this pg for 6 months there is no complaints about this pg food is excellent looking homely and here is approach also very good \+01f44d\+01f44c', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:48.351426', 5, 624, 4),
(3779, '[Priyanka Jaiswal] Lived in this PG for two entire year and loved living overhere. The pg owner is very kind and helpful. The food is good, a lil spicy and the rooms are clean and well maintained. I had taken a single room and my stay was very peaceful. The security deposit was timely returned as promised. Highly recommend staying here:)', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:50.500841', 5, 626, 4),
(3780, U&'[Debashree Poddar] Had a great and beautiful experience to stay in this pg, food, Vijaya Aunty and other staffs everyone are really helpful. Spacious room, dinning area. Spent most of the time in sofa and balcony. It was an amazing experience.  Will miss this place for sure \+01f607', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:50.500923', 5, 626, 4),
(3781, U&'[Vandana Shrivastava] I was the first occupant of this PG, and I lived at Exotica for about 6 months. The management is very kind, accommodating and professional. They genuinely want the residents to have a comfortable stay and they addressed any issue faced by any resident.nThe PG is very clean with a beautiful common area at every floor, with one common self-use kitchen with all common utensils and inductions. They food served to the residents is also very good in quality, however, it would sometimes be spicy back when I lived there. I hope they figured out the solution for that.nn10/10 recommended for stay. It\2019s a total value for money deal!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:50.500987', 5, 626, 4);             
