(3787, '[Shubham Kumar] Not recommended! Stayed here more than 2 months. Below average food quality. Non functional room lights, locker, toilet flush even after multiple reminders. Charged extra for table and chair. Owner won''t return caution money said it was for maintainance.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:51.014142', 2, 627, 4),
