(3792, '[abhishek dixit] Anna is very humble person , my room was clean and good food , they are renting the room on daily and monthly basis also.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:51.014492', 5, 627, 4),
(3793, '[naveen mabbu] Food is too good  and very tasty. stay is very comfortable', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:51.014623', 5, 627, 4),
