(3795, '[laxmi narayana] I stayed here food is excellent completely homely food..nRooms are very clean and comfortable..nStaff were friendly and helpfulnOverall Good facilities compared to other pgs in this area', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:51.476893', 5, 628, 4),
(3796, '[Kanu Priya] Polite and helpful owners, clean and well-ventilated rooms, a convenient self-cooking station on the ground floor, and an excellent location very close to Cult. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:51.47698', 5, 628, 4),
(3797, '[Ayyappa swamy] The experience was not good. The food quality was very poor, and the maintenance was not proper. Only the room was okay; apart from that, everything else was disappointing, especially the food.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:51.477098', 1, 628, 4),
(3798, '[Jayesh Jadhav] I think it''s the best pg in affordable rent.nRoom size is bigger than other PGs. They provide table and chair as well which most of the PGs don''t provide.nFood quality is good but Friday, Saturday and Sunday you will get fried rice which I don''t like.nYou will face some water problems in summer, also there is only one washing machine for whole pg bcoz of water problem.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:51.477224', 5, 628, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3799, '[ReddySekhar Reddy] Stayed here for almost 5 months building is new and it''s one of the best PG you will find in kondapur area with all the facilities. Food is good its better many other PG''s and owner is friendly he will address all the issues.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:51.47739', 5, 628, 4),
(3800, U&'[Harsha Yalla] I\2019ve been staying at PG for over a year and a half, and the experience has been excellent. Everything from food and room maintenance to Wi-Fi and overall facilities is top-notch and truly premium. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a comfortable and hassle-free stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:51.47746', 5, 628, 4),
(3801, '[Madhava Reddy] Felt like living at home..... Overall Excellent PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:51.477527', 5, 628, 4),
(3802, '[Vasanth Kumar] Best PG Hostel ReviewnnRooms u0026 Cleanliness:nThe PG hostel offers well-maintained rooms with regular cleaning services. Rooms are available in single, double, and triple-sharing options. The furniture is functional, including a comfortable bed, study table, chair, and wardrobe. The common areas and bathrooms are cleaned daily, ensuring a hygienic environment.nnFood u0026 Dining:nThe hostel provides balanced meals with a variety of cuisines. The dining area is clean, and the food is prepared under hygienic conditions. Weekly menus include both vegetarian and non-vegetarian options, and special care is taken to accommodate dietary preferences and restrictions.nnFacilities u0026 Amenities:nAmenities include high-speed Wi-Fi, a laundry service, 24/7 security, and a power backup system. Common areas have recreational facilities like TV, indoor games, and sometimes a gym. Some hostels also provide study rooms for a quiet learning environment.nnLocation u0026 Accessibility:nThe hostel is ideally located near the university and other essential facilities like grocery stores, pharmacies, and public transport. This makes it easy for residents to commute and run errands.nnSecurity u0026 Safety:nThe PG hostel has strict security protocols, including 24/7 CCTV surveillance, security guards, and access controls. The management is responsive and ensures the safety of all residents, making it a secure environment for both male and female students.nnManagement u0026 Support:nThe management staff is approachable and quick to respond to any issues or concerns. They maintain a friendly and supportive atmosphere, ensuring that residents feel comfortable and valued.nnOverall Rating: 10/10nThe PG hostel offers a balance of comfort, safety, and convenience, making it an excellent choice for postgraduate students looking for a conducive living environment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:51.477589', 5, 628, 4),
(3803, '[Hanumanth Kumar] I''ve had a great experience staying here. A special thanks to Anil Anna for being so supportive and approachable. He is always ready to help and ensures everyone feels comfortable. The rooms are clean, the food is good, and the overall environment is peaceful. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a comfortable stay in Kondapur.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:51.857734', 5, 629, 4),
(3804, U&'[Devakar Seshayee] I stayed at V-Mens PG, Kondapur for one month (June 2026), and my experience was excellent. It is one of the best PGs in Kondapur, offering great value for money with all the essential amenities such as a water purifier, washing machine, Wi-Fi, and geyser.nnThe owner is a young, friendly, and approachable person. Whenever I had any issue or needed something, a single phone call was enough\2014he responded immediately and resolved it without delay. That level of support made my stay very comfortable.nnThis was my first time visiting Hyderabad, and I booked this PG just by speaking to them over the phone a week before my arrival. They asked me to call one day before coming so they could keep my room ready, and everything was exactly as promised. I came without seeing the place in person, but I was completely satisfied.nnInitially, I told them I would stay for only three days and decide whether to continue or look for another PG. They happily agreed without any pressure. By Monday morning itself, I was so impressed that I confirmed I would stay for the entire month.nnIf you''re looking for a clean, affordable, well-maintained PG with great food, excellent amenities, and a friendly owner who genuinely cares about the residents, I highly recommend V-Mens PG. It was a wonderful experience, and I would definitely choose this place again whenever I visit Hyderabad.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:51.857975', 5, 629, 4);
