(3805, '[mrmanu] This PG is really good and comfortable. The rooms are clean, spacious, and perfect for friends to stay together. The biggest highlight is the home-made food, which is very tasty and feels just like home.nThe rent is also budget-friendly, which makes it a great option for students and working people. The environment is peaceful and well-maintained.nOverall, a great place to stay with good food, good rooms, and reasonable price. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:51.858048', 5, 629, 4),
(3806, '[Lokesh Nani1214] Great hostel with an amazing owner.... Very friendly, helpful, kind and always takes good care of us....', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:51.858121', 5, 629, 4),
