(3812, '[prasadreddy nara] This pg is very good rooms and homely taste food and rooms is very clean.pg owner also very nise and Friendly type.nVery best service and very good home food provided.very tasty food....', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:56.138989', 5, 633, 4),
(3813, '[Afroz Affu] This pg management is worst. They support men who abuse and keep accommodating rubbish people.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:56.139126', 1, 633, 4),
