(3817, '[kondapalli gopichand6] Thanks for the management for providing me a good ventilated Room and proper comfortable BedsnHealthy food with Suitable TastenI like this coliving with the facilities they providenI like most the gym.and the location be too good with decent people.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:56.139578', 5, 633, 4),
(3818, '[BHARATHI Madhu] Super rooms good  Ventileshan homely food  and nice management', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:56.139669', 5, 633, 4),
(3819, U&'[Marala Prasanth] \2022tClean, well-maintained rooms with basic furnituren\2022tSafe environment with CCTV, gated entry and responsible ownern\2022tHomely, hygienic food provided on time (3 meals a day).n\2022tGood location with easy access to market, transport and offices.n\2022tHelpful owner  who responds quickly to issues and emergencies.n\2022tAll basic facilities included like Wi\2011Fi, washing machine and regular housekeeping, so less headache for the tenant.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:56.49889', 5, 634, 4),
(3820, U&'[\0926\0941\0930\094d\0935\093e\0938\093e \091c\094d\092f\094b\0924\093f\0937 \0935\093f\091c\094d\091e\093e\0928] It is a very good PG and have homily environment and Food quality gives the vibe of home cooked food. All necessary amenities available.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:56.499', 5, 634, 4),
(3821, '[Saathvik Ch] Positives :Rooms were good. Price is affordable. Ower is a nice person.nNegatives : parking is not sufficient.nnFood is average. Sometimes it was good. Sometimes it was not.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:56.499106', 5, 634, 4);     
