(3823, '[Umashankar R] I stayed in this PG for 4 months.nEverything is Good except few thingsnOwner gives allocated beds temporarily to others in our absence if we go home for a week,nChicken quantity is too low.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:56.499278', 2, 634, 4),
