(3826, '[Sunil Kumar] Pg with all the modern amenities like wifi, Smart TV with OTT subscriptions, CCTV surveillance, Mineral Water (Hot u0026 Cool) and Geyser in the bathroom. Rooms are spacious and neat and cleanly maintained with very good ventilation. You will get breakfast, lunch and dinner everyday and washing machine and elevator is also available. Also it is located in prime location very easy connectivity towards hitech city and Gachibowli areas. I would personally suggest to go for this pg if you are looking for comfortable stay in and around hitech city, Kondapur and Gachibowli', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:56.499549', 5, 634, 4),
(3827, '[Chandu Chandu] Hostel is to good with well maintained nd also food is too good feels lyk homely food', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:56.982605', 5, 635, 4),
(3828, '[PANDU pandu] Great hostel with clean rooms, good food, and a friendly staff. The location is convenient, and the overall stay was comfortable. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:56.982756', 5, 635, 4),
(3829, '[Bhuvaneswari Rao] Best PG I have come across till date. Every floor has wifi facility 24*7. Well maintained u0026 surronded by plants wherever possible. Food facility is available 3 times per day. They don''t have particular closing timing for breakfast,lunch and dinner. They keep it for long duration. So,even if anybody is late also, food will be there for sure. Non-veg is available on few sundays,not every sunday.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:56.982892', 4, 635, 4),
(3830, '[YOGESH BIRADAR] Realiy good ambiance neet and clening rooms amezing food  thanks Gowtham grand co leaving pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:56.982987', 5, 635, 4),
(3831, '[infoservices info] Good Place.. clean and peacefull, food is okay and very nice owner and staff...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:56.983129', 5, 635, 4),
(3832, '[Mani] Staying here for 1 month and the experience has been good so far. Rooms are clean, food is decent, and facilities like Wi-Fi and water are reliable. Management is supportive and the place feels safe and comfortable. Recommended for students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:56.983213', 5, 635, 4),
(3833, '[halmadi basavaraj] Best pg in my expirenc all feslitys available good food good mentenence.... I like this pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:56.983356', 5, 635, 4),
(3834, U&'[A Google User] Nice \+01f44d\+01f3ff pg maintenance also gud gud management  \2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:56.98348', 5, 635, 4),
(3835, '[Arnav Maturkar] Most comfortable pg I have ever lived innFood was great staff was so supportive..nThanku for for good memories and wonderful time', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:57.452057', 5, 636, 4),
(3836, U&'[Vivek Sai] I\2019ve been staying at this PG for a while and I must say, it\2019s been a really good experience overall. The place is clean, well-managed, and feels like a second home. One of the biggest advantages is that there\2019s absolutely no water problem, which is often a concern in many other PGs.nnThe PG manager is very responsive and supportive\2014any issues raised are usually taken care of within no time. He ensures everything runs smoothly and the residents are comfortable.nnWhat truly makes this PG stand out is the owner\2019s excellent nature. He is friendly, professional, and genuinely cares about the residents. If any issue arises, he responds immediately and ensures that it''s resolved without delay.nnIf you are looking for a reliable and peaceful place to stay, I would definitely recommend this PG!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:57.452207', 5, 636, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3837, '[Abhimanyu] pg becoming worst day by day. Was referred by a friend for good food but now things are very bad. Owner is super irresponsible, whenever we ping on group most times no acknowledgement no resolution. We live many times without food(sometimes bad, sometimes expired), without water, many times without electricity and rarely Wi-Fi working. While yes hes trying to maintain pgbut not able to, already seen 5-6 staff in this year. On top of this hes pinging us personally to not put any complaint on group.nnOfcourse posting from friends account because owner always threating people who complaint on group. Cleaning is also bad. Once complaint on 7 days expired curd used , he simply put blame on vendor.nnNot recommended at all. Please avoid. Many new PGs are coming up', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:57.45229', 1, 636, 4),
(3838, '[Rishikesh Damodar] I have stayed very short term period, This PG was very good experienced, nice to stay here. Owner was very Hubble u0026 full support. Recommend this PG whoever stayed in Kondapur. Thank you', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:57.452359', 5, 636, 4),
(3839, '[Nagireddy Kotla] Very comfortable staynPerfect location for who are working in Google tech mahendra cyber city etc.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:57.452426', 5, 636, 4),
(3840, U&'[Siddharth Ch] Bed bugs all around. Owners don\2019t care enough o even listen to the tenants.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:57.452493', 1, 636, 4),
(3841, U&'[Sai Mounish] Anjali Pg i stayed here for more than 2 years food is good stay is good and it had 360\00b0 ventilation everyday room cleaning and twice a day bathroom cleaning. Owner Janardhan he is really good spoken person and he listens to your issues if you have any and resolves them immediately. Thank you anjali pg for the wonderful time', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:57.452554', 5, 636, 4),
(3842, '[Venkatesh Reddy] Respecting people as they are is a core principle of good manners', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:57.452613', 1, 636, 4),
(3843, '[ramavathsrinivas naik] Food is also not good. No proper hygiene in cooking. Quality is very low.nnOverall very bad experience. I will not recommend this PG too anyone.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:58.554076', 1, 637, 4),
(3844, U&'[M Rajkiran] One of the best hostels I\2019ve stayed in! The food here is consistently great\2014tasty, fresh, and feels like home-cooked meals. The place is well-maintained with regular cleaning and upkeep. The owners are kind, approachable, and genuinely care about the guests. Hygiene is a top priority here, and it \2026\2026', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:58.554159', 4, 637, 4),
(3845, '[sivaji] A Comfortable and Convenient Stay at Sri Venkateswara Men''s PGnnI stayed here for 6 months and had a pleasant experience overallnn- Spacious and well-maintained rooms with comfortable beds and clean linens.n- Delicious and varied food options, with a focus on hygiene and taste.n- Friendly and cooperative staff, always willing to help.n- Prime location, close to public transport, markets, and amenities.n- Good parking facilitynnOverall, I had a great experience at Sri Venkateswara PG. The facilities, food, and staff made my stay comfortable and convenient. I would recommend this PG to bachelors looking for a hassle-free and affordable accommodation in Kondapure.nnMy Rating: 5/5', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:58.554225', 5, 637, 4),
(3846, '[Narayanapuram Piccheiah] Taste food good maintenance and behaviour with responsibly', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:58.554289', 4, 637, 4),
(3847, '[SUJEETH KUMAR] I have stayed in so many hostels in kondapur, Hyderabad and finally settled down in this hostel as I''m enjoying tasty and homely food(unlimited 3 times/day), premises are very well maintained, providing washing machine to wash the clothes, having ample parking space, Nearer to IT companies, Safe and pleasent area. I highly recommend this hostel for staying!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:58.554351', 5, 637, 4),
(3848, U&'[rajineshraj m] Excellent accommodation and environment reasonable price and good to have food\+01f35c Excellent Rooms \+01f3e8with reasonable Price,Peaceful Place, no on hostels like this in kondapur', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:58.554413', 5, 637, 4);          
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3849, '[Venkatesh Muntala] Nice pg and best stay for employees and trainees', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:58.554477', 5, 637, 4),
(3850, '[DINAKAR MANGU] Rooms were clean and well maintainednHostel management are friendly and ready to helpnMeals are delicious and freshly prepared', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:58.554541', 5, 637, 4),
(3851, '[Aditya Raj] Great experience. I looked for a lot of time in the neighbourhood but this is the best pg around sriram nagar. It is the overall package consisting good food, regular maintenance, lift service and 24/7 access.nGood place to stay at, clean and hygienic also affordable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:59.370263', 5, 638, 4),
(3852, U&'[Prajwal Nimje] My best PG i stayed so far in 4 yrs at Hyderabad. I stayed as single sharing. And my overall experience is amazing. The rooms and surroundings are clean. Peaceful environment (as most of the rooms are 1, 2 sharing).nnPros:n1. Parking is underground, meaning there is no vehicle dust in dining arean2. Water dispenser (Hot u0026 cold) on every consecutive floor.n3. Good sitting arean4. Biryani once in a monthnnThings that could be improved:n1. Don\2019t add water in the curd', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:59.370399', 5, 638, 4),
(3853, '[Sai] One of the best PGs you can find for the price. The rooms are super clean and well-maintained. The food is actually a big plus here. There are a lot of varieties, and everything tastes good. Overall, it has everything you need for a comfortable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:59.370497', 5, 638, 4),
(3854, '[Balu Praveen] Rooms are clean, pleasant atmosphere with reasonable rent. Rooms are clean, well maintained. The care takers are very friendly and very helpful. I like the way they welcomed us, patient enough to show rooms. This is a genuine feedback.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:59.370597', 5, 638, 4),
(3855, U&'[Kamal Thakur] \200bI\2019ve had a great experience here. The rooms are clean and very well-maintained.n\200bThe pricing is very affordable, especially considering the peaceful environment the place offers.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:59.370668', 5, 638, 4),
(3856, '[Vishal Gupta] All services are good.nThis is the only pg in entire Hyderabad who gives chpathi in LPG crisis.nSo best food for North Indians.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:59.370733', 5, 638, 4),
(3857, U&'[kartheek kanike] I stayed in this PG for 1 year and 4 months, and my overall experience was excellent. The maintenance is top-notch \2014 the premises are always kept very clean and hygienic. The environment is peaceful, which makes it a comfortable place to live. The food here is much better compared to other PGs in the area, and the management is really good, always responsive and supportive. Overall, this PG is very well maintained in all aspects and is definitely one of the best options in Kondapur.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:59.370797', 5, 638, 4),
(3858, '[VENKAT SIVA GANESH] This PG house is amazing.The rooms are clean and comfortable, and the food is delicious. The owner is really friendly and helpful. I would definitely recommend this PG house to anyone looking for a place to stay in Hyderabad.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:44:59.370861', 5, 638, 4),
(3859, U&'[Vishnuvardhan Reddy] It''s been more than 6 months I am staying here.nThe management is very nice, friendly, and always ready to help with any issue. The food is delicious and feels just like homemade \2014 simple, healthy, and satisfying. Daily cleaning is done properly, so the rooms and common areas are always neat and hygienic.nAll basic amenities like Wi-Fi, washing machine, purified drinking water, and 24/7 power backup are provided. The rent is quite reasonable considering the quality and cleanliness they maintain.nI strongly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable and homely place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:01.438474', 5, 640, 4),
(3860, '[manas mohanty] Owners son''s communication is world class. Was able to hear Morning Prayers of Lord Narayana almost every day. Things can still be improved in pricing for twin sharing. Need to Put Jhadu for occasional self cleaning. Tanker water dependencycan be partially be replaced with Rain water harvesting', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:01.438577', 4, 640, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3861, '[Pasupuleti Srikrishna] I have been staying in the PG since 1 year.nOwner is very helpful in terms of food, management of all facilities including resolution of complaints at quick pace.nFood is also compatible to both North and South Indian inmates.nHighly recommend to anybody for stay!!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:01.438656', 5, 640, 4),
(3862, U&'[Ayush Sharma] Very Bad ExperiencenOne of the worst PG experiences I\2019ve had.The owner\2019s behaviour towards students is extremely disrespectful and unprofessional. He often speaks in a very cheap and inappropriate manner, especially when talking about North Indian students, which is completely unacceptable.nThe food quality and taste were also very poor. There are frequent arguments and quarrels between the owner and customers, creating a very uncomfortable environment for students.nnI would not recommend this PG to students looking for a peaceful, respectful, and comfortable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:01.438805', 1, 640, 4),
(3863, U&'[Venkatesh Venky] Had a very good stay in this men\2019s PG. The rooms are neat and clean, washrooms are maintained properly, and the environment is peaceful. Food quality is also good and feels homely. The owner/management is very supportive and responds quickly if there is any issue. Facilities like Wi-Fi, water, and power backup are reliable. Overall, it\2019s a safe, comfortable, and budget-friendly place for students and working professionals. Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:01.438874', 5, 640, 4),
(3864, U&'[Sri harsha Reddy (PSPK)] I had a very disappointing experience staying in this boys hostel. The food quality is extremely poor, most of the time it\2019s either undercooked or lacks basic taste and hygiene. It feels like there is no proper care taken in meal preparation.nThe owner\2019s behaviour is another major issue. He is often rude and unresponsive to complaints.nMaintenance is also badly neglected. Rooms and common areas are not cleaned regularly, and issues like broken fittings or repairs take a long time to be fixed. The overall environment feels unhygienic and poorly managed.nWater is a serious problem here. Not only is the supply irregular with frequent shortages, but the quality is also very poor. The water often looks unclean, dirty and doesn\2019t feel safe for drinking or even daily use, which is a major concern for health and hygiene.nOverall, I would not recommend this hostel to anyone looking for a comfortable stay. Serious improvements are needed in food quality, management attitude, maintenance, and basic facilities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:01.438938', 1, 640, 4),
(3865, '[Jatin Sisodia] It''s been 3 months in this pg, experience is great, food is good, rooms are clean. Must visit if you are looking for PG near waverock.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:01.439145', 5, 640, 4),
(3866, U&'[Unkown Kumar] I\2019m giving you a genuine review. I have been staying here for 2 months (planning to leave soon).nnFood: They use spoiled tomatoes and potatoes. There are no proper vegetables\2014just the same common items every day, and many of them are spoiled. Once a week they serve brinjal, but it\2019s often spoiled as well. I found insects in it twice, so be careful. They use a lot of tomatoes (spoiled ones) in the dal to increase the taste, but the tomatoes are not good.nnRent: The rent is comparatively higher than other PGs in the neighborhood\2014\20b912,000 for 2 sharing. Other PGs charge \20b99,000 for 2 sharing with better food. My friends stay in those PGs and they get fresh vegetables and a good lunch there. Here, they don\2019t maintain hygiene at all. They don\2019t allow food in the room even if you don\2019t want to eat at that time.nnPlease don\2019t waste your money here. There are better PGs nearby with better food, hygiene, and friendlier owners. Don''t go with the images', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:01.439359', 1, 640, 4),
(3867, '[SRINIVASULA REDDY VALLAMREDDY] I''m staying here for last one week. It''s new building and newly opened PG with Good ventilated and spacious rooms and food taste is superb. It''s very near to software offices Like Waverock,Amazon, sohini tech park And Google.nHighly Recommend PG for Men and Women with safe and comfortable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:02.959743', 5, 642, 4);     
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3868, '[Srinivasa Reddy] Had a wonderful experience staying at this coliving PG. The food is hygienic, tasty, and feels just like home with good variety every day. The maintenance is excellent, rooms and common areas are always neat, clean, and well-maintained. The owner is very friendly, supportive, and responds quickly to any concerns, making the stay comfortable and stress-free. Overall, a safe, peaceful, and well-managed place to stay. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:02.959971', 5, 642, 4),
(3869, '[Pavan kumar Velpula] Recently I''m stayed in this PG with my friend it was clean rooms, homely food, and friendly management. The rooms are clean with great ventilation and natural light. The food tastes like home, and the owner treats everyone like family. Safe, affordable, and highly recommended', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:02.960053', 5, 642, 4),
(3870, '[Ambati Reddy] The washrooms are clean, hygienic, and well maintained, which makes the stay even more comfortable. A good option for anyone looking for a clean, safe, and comfortable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:02.960127', 5, 642, 4),
(3871, U&'[Nikhil Singh] Recently shifted to this new PG and overall it has been a great experience. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and comfortable. The staff is friendly and supportive, and the food quality is also good. One of the biggest advantages is the location \2014 very close to Amazon Sohini Tech Park and Waverock.nnThe washrooms are clean, hygienic, and well maintained, which makes the stay even more comfortable. A good option for anyone looking for a clean, safe, and comfortable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:02.960191', 5, 642, 4),
(3872, '[Seelam Santhoshi] It''s a new pg hostel the rooms are clean well maintained and it''s near to wipro circle and star hospital.Very convenient location it is near to all IT offices like waverock , and Amazon peaceful environment for hybrid mode people Food is delicious,well ventilated ,wifi available and friendly management. I have browsed more than 15 pg hostel in Nanakramguda area to find a best hostel like this. I suggest this is the best pg for both men and women to stay .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:02.960258', 5, 642, 4),
(3873, '[siddi kotireddy] This is new PG hostel in New Building. Cleaned rooms and all New Furniture. Hostel food also good. Maintained quality. Best PG Hostel in hyderabad. Reasonable hostel fee', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:02.960318', 5, 642, 4),
