(3880, '[Rohith Chowdary.] Excellent co-living PG with a clean and comfortable environment. The rooms are well maintained, and the facilities are good,and the overall atmosphere is safe and peaceful. Good location and value for money. Highly recommended for students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:04.385359', 5, 643, 4),
