(3883, '[chandra shekar] I stayed here for 1 year , and I''d say my overall experience was definitely positive, i chose this place after reading positive reviews, and now I am leaving one so it can help others in the future. The owner was very responsive to my initial inquires, the rooms and premises are well maintained and cleaned regularly. I would highly recommend this place to anyone working in or around the financial district area', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:05.07693', 5, 644, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3884, '[N171190 BANDI SUSHMA FLORENCE] I had a wonderful experience staying at AG Living spaces,  The rooms are not only beautiful but also thoughtfully designed, offering comfort and convenience for both short and long stays. What really stood out was the exceptional service. The management team was incredibly prompt and helpful, especially owner and staff where they were always available to assist with any requests. Overall, AG Livingspaces is a fantastic place to stay, and I would highly recommend it to anyone looking for a welcoming and well-managed coliving space.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:05.077031', 5, 644, 4),
(3885, U&'[Shallinii Dubey] Very nice n comfortable.. Akhil is very accommodating \263a\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:05.077099', 5, 644, 4),
(3886, U&'[rssri yeshwanth12] Best place to live\2764nSupervisor is very wise and cooperative\2764nIf anybody looking up for rooms in financial district with affordable price check upto AG living spaces, you will get proper satisfaction towards everything and with a great experience\+01f64f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:05.077162', 5, 644, 4),
(3887, '[R E F L E X] I have been living here for the past 1 year and it has been a very good experience. The management is very helpful and has provided a wonderful service', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:05.077225', 5, 644, 4),
(3888, '[SK] Hostel is good but this area is too congested, hostels near the Venkateshwara temple and ratnadeep market are also good but their location is excellent and during the rainy season,ranga reddy colony is worse', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:05.077288', 2, 644, 4),
