(3891, '[Hari Kiran B] Best PG aroundnu003e Daily Cleaning, Delicious food, Comfy mattress.nu003e Owners are respectable and also address the concerns quickly.nu003e Reasonable pricing for given facilities.nnOverall 5 star PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:05.814953', 5, 645, 4),
(3892, '[aleem khan] I have been staying in this PG for the last 6 months and had a very comfortable experience. The rooms are clean and well maintained, food is hygienic, and basic facilities like water and electricity are reliable. The management is friendly and supportive, making it a good place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:05.815029', 5, 645, 4),
(3893, '[Nagendra Prasad Jangiti] The rooms are well-maintained, kept perfectly clean, and are exactly as promised. The food is hygienic, tasty, and reminds me of home cooking.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:05.815099', 5, 645, 4),
(3894, '[Ashish Kumar] One of the best PGs in this area. Facilities like WiFi, housekeeping, and food are reliable. The environment is peaceful, making it suitable for working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:05.815158', 5, 645, 4),
(3895, '[Gautham Dileep] Rainbow Co-Living PG is truly a gem! The atmosphere is so welcoming and the amenities are top-notch. I''ve had a wonderful experience living here and highly recommend it. The staff is always helpful and friendly.  It keeps the vibes so close to home. They also maintain a clean space as well. I''d definitely recommend this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:05.815218', 5, 645, 4),
(3896, '[Puli SivaReddy] The food at this PG is truly outstanding. It looks very tempting, feels completely homely, and tastes just like home-cooked meals, which is rare to find in other PGs. Compared to many other PGs, the variety, freshness, and quality of food here are much better, and every meal is prepared with proper hygiene and care.Overall, this PG is a great choice for anyone who wants a comfortable stay with delicious, home-style food every day.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:05.815276', 5, 645, 4),
(3897, U&'[SHIVAANSH SHEKHAR] I stayed at this PG for 4 months, and it was a great experience overall. The food was consistently good, with hygienic and homely meals provided daily. The managers were helpful, responsive, and maintained a friendly environment. The place operates with well-set regulations that give you independence without unnecessary restrictions. Most importantly, I felt very safe throughout my stay \2014 the security was reliable, and the premises were well-maintained. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a comfortable and secure place to stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:05.815342', 5, 645, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3898, '[Madhava Beri] I had a great experience staying at this PG from last 4 months, The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and spacious enough for comfort. The food provided is hygienic and tastes like homemade meals, which is a huge plus, The staff is friendly and always ready to help, and the environment feels safe and welcoming. It''s also located in a convenient area with easy access to public transport, shops and cafes.nDefinitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a peaceful and budget-friendly place to stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:05.815405', 5, 645, 4),
(3899, U&'[Rachana Saha] This co-living PG is located a bit inside the area and not directly on the main road, so you may need to walk some distance for daily essentials. I don\2019t stay here, so I can\2019t comment much on the quality of food or services.nnThe rooms come with beds and an attached washroom. There\2019s no self-cooking option, but food is provided and included in the rent, similar to the electricity bill.nnThere\2019s a common seating area on the ground floor for dining, food is cooked on the rooftop, and a separate space is available for drying clothes.nnParking is available on the ground floor, lift is there. Staff who showed us the room seemed polite.nnAlso, I guess the property is wheelchair accessible.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:07.052792', 4, 647, 4),
(3900, U&'[Tella Priyatham] Nova coliving I am living in that it''s the best pg in Nanakramguda i want to write the review i want thatnnHere\2019s a clean, strong review you can post \2014 no fluff, just solid positioning:nnI\2019ve stayed at Nova Coliving in Nanakramguda, and honestly, it stands out as one of the best PG options in this area.nnThe biggest advantage is how well everything is managed. The rooms are consistently clean, well-maintained, and actually feel comfortable to live in \2014 not like typical overcrowded PG setups. Housekeeping is regular, which most places fail at.nnThe location is a major plus. It\2019s very close to offices in the financial district, which saves a lot of daily commute time. If you\2019re working nearby, this alone makes a huge difference.nnFood quality is decent and consistent \2014 not amazing, but reliable, which is what actually matters when you\2019re living long-term. WiFi is stable, and power backup is not an issue, so you can work without interruptions.nnSecurity and overall environment are solid. It feels safe, and the crowd here is generally working professionals, so the vibe is much better compared to typical PGs.nnIt\2019s not the cheapest option, but you\2019re paying for consistency, cleanliness, and proper management \2014 which most PGs fail to deliver.nnIf you\2019re working in Nanakramguda or Financial District and want a place without daily headaches, Nova Coliving is a strong choice.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:07.052961', 5, 647, 4),
(3901, '[Adhi Chinna] One of the worst pgs I have stayed. In 1 month, they made me to change 3 different rooms. Beds are very poor. They were keep on saying that we ordered beds and it never came. Also they promised that they will keep fridge on each floor and it also didn''t happen. Only 2 fridges in the ground floor that too in a very worst condition. Even I lost few items which I have kept in fridge and when I asked about it, they didn''t even care. Also, theft happened in this pg at night where 3 phones and 2 laptops were stolen. The guy who is working here as a supervisor asked people to send money to his own account. Even after knowing this, the owners still not removed him. The food is average as well. Weekly 4 days upma only. Also, when I vacated, the supervisor told me that he will return my advance amount but now the owner is not ready to give it back and she is ignoring my calls. The owners are not taking the responsibility of giving the advance amount back. They are asking to check with the supervisor where the supervisor is saying that he need to check with the owner. The Owner lady is VERY RUDE AND TOO UNPROFESSIONAL.nnI highly recommend to NOT go to this Pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:07.053033', 1, 647, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3902, U&'[Ishaan Deep Singh] I stayed at Nova Co-Living from August 2025 to March 2026, and overall, my experience has been really good.nnStarting with the positives \2014 the food here is genuinely better than most PGs. As a North Indian, I especially liked dishes like rajma, chole, lobia, and soya (nutri chunks) curries. The taste is consistent and homely.nnThe staff is helpful and well-behaved, and the owner is very caring and supportive, which makes the place feel welcoming. Housekeeping is also quite good \2014 rooms are cleaned 2\20133 times a week, washrooms are cleaned regularly, and common areas like the gallery are maintained well.nnThe rooms are spacious, which is a big plus compared to many other co-living spaces. Amenities are well maintained \2014 washing machines are working, there are two functional refrigerators, and even recreational options like treadmill, carrom, and foosball are available. They\2019ve also recently upgraded the drying area, which is now very spacious and convenient.nnAnother good thing is that electricity is included in the rent, and overall it\2019s a budget-friendly option considering the facilities provided.nnComing to a few areas of improvement \2014 the beds are a bit small, especially for taller people like me (around 6 feet), so it can feel slightly uncomfortable. The mattresses could also be of better quality. Additionally, the power backup (generator) needs improvement, as it doesn\2019t always function during power cuts.nnOverall, I would rate this place 4.5 out of 5. It\2019s a great option if you\2019re looking for a comfortable, budget-friendly, and well-maintained co-living space with good food and a supportive environment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:07.053103', 5, 647, 4),
(3903, U&'[Rabi] I had a very good experience staying at this PG. The rooms are neat, clean, and well-maintained.nThe food quality is good and homely, with proper variety. The owner and staff are friendly.The location is convenient with easy access to transport.nOverall, it is a safe and comfortable place to stay, especially for students and working professionals..\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:07.053167', 4, 647, 4),
(3904, U&'[RAKSHIT SAWARN] To everyone who is looking for a stay in Hyderabad and reading this..nDON\2019T GO TO THIS PG EVEN IF IT IS THE LAST PG AVAILABLE IN HYDERABAD.nThey don\2019t return your security deposits and when you ask for it a couple of times then they just block your contact number.nApart from that the PG is also like really really bad. Electricity cuts throughout the day and they don\2019t even have any power backup. You can also get stuck in lift for a long time when there is an electricity outage. The water is so bad that can\2019t even explain. The guy named abhilash in the staff is hell annoying and arrogant. It took like almost 2 weeks of constant reminders and handling his arrogant behaviour just to get the AC repaired and even after that it wasn\2019t working properly.nnTHE CONCLUSION IS THAT DON\2019T EVEN THINK OF EVEN PASSING THROUGH THIS PG. There are plenty of other options available.nnLive on roadside but don\2019t don\2019t don\2019t go to this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:07.053231', 1, 647, 4),
(3905, U&'[Yeshwanth Yerramilli] PROS:n- Neat and clean premises (both inside and outside)n- Street is decently wide and dry with well-paved cement road, no overflowing manholes or open drains (unlike most other areas in this locality)n- Spacious rooms and corridorsn- Very friendly staff and ownership that timely resolve any complaintsn- Power bill included in the monthly rent (unlike most other PGs in the locality)n- Unisex PG, so couples can reside togethern- PG building is not covered up by surroundings, so very nice sunlight and ventilation from all sidesn- No moldy walls or bad odours in the roomn- No bedbugs or cockroaches (at least in the third-floor room where  I have stayed)n- Decent wardrobe space with functional lockingn- Spacious bathrooms with working exhaust-fans, a proper commode and washbasin. A bucket and mug is provided by default, but you may want to buy separately for yourself, as the ones given were worn out and old.n- Geyser given in each room, so 24/7 hot water facilityn- Shower works for hot water (unlike most other PGs in the locality, where shower gives out only cold water)n- Decent food and dining space in the ground floorn- 3 washing-machines (unlike most other PGs in the locality, which offer only 2)n- Adequate parking lot for 2-wheelersn- Power backup facilityn- Treadmill and cardio bicycle, along with table-tennis and other board games, are present in the 6th floor, though they all seem dusty and not been used by many on a regular basis.nnCONS:n- No fridges in each floor\2014only two in the ground floorn- No microwave facility for reheating any foodn- No main switch outside the room to switch off the power supply when not needed, so you have to make sure to switch off all the things in the room before leaving, else: incur a penalty of Rs. 500.n- Only bed and wardrobe as a part of the furniture; neither table nor chair is provided, though you are allowed to buy things yourselves as long as they don''t consume any electric power.n- Mattress is thin and made of cheap sponge, so it deforms with usage and forms a depression. This may cause back-pain if you''re not used to such. Moreover, it could make you feel quite hot and sweaty in the summer.n- Limited and inefficient space on the terrace for hanging laundry, though the terrace is fully sheltered, so there is no inconvenience of rainfall wetting your clothes.n- Shared room-keys; has to be submitted in the ground floor before leaving every day (unlike other PGs in the locality or elsewhere in Hyd, like HITEC City and Madhapur)nnSUGGESTIONS TO THE MANAGEMENT:n- Can have one more dustbin in each floor, as they are many people per floor and it gets filled up pretty quickly, especially on weekends.n- Can provide a good-sized table \2013 at least in the 2-sharing rooms.n- The gym space in the 6th floor seems to be unused or not used adequately, so you can arrange ropes or lines in some section over there for people to hang their wet laundry. The space given on the terrace is just not enough, when you''ve 200 (or more) people living in the whole building.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:07.053298', 4, 647, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3906, '[Harsh Kumar] You can just have an experience like your home. Facilities are too good. Owner , Supervisor, cleaning staff all have a too polite and sweet nature. Maintain proper hygiene and cleaning.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:07.053371', 5, 647, 4),
(3907, '[manas mohanty] Space and Cost is good for twin sharing. Food is Good and can be better( towards more different vegetable and less oily diet)  But No bedsheet for bed, Parking is meant to stay full in PGs', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:08.345377', 4, 648, 4),
(3908, '[John Ratna Raju] Didn''t like it. High fee plus extra power bill and food taste is not upto mark. Cleanliness is only thing I liked here. Security is main concern in this area. I have seen people lost laptop and headsets and I lost my 2k shoes too in this PG..so you need to be very cautious if you want to stay in this localty. people who are looking for cleaned rooms, they can go for it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:08.345455', 2, 648, 4),
(3909, '[Ganemoni Shekar] Ankur pg is a very good place to sray. The rooms are excellent - spacious, well - ventilated, and beautifully maintained. Clenliness is given too priority, which makes the stay veey comfortable.The surrounding environment is peaceful and pleasant, creating a homely feeling. The management is supportive and always available for any help. Overall, it is one of the pG accomdations, and i highly recommended it rooms are cleaning daily washing machine are available high speed wifi and food is so hygienic', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:08.345517', 5, 648, 4),
(3910, U&'[Ramisetti Durgesh] I stayed in this hostel for 17 months, and it was a very pleasant experience. The owner is extremely kind, well-disciplined, and always supportive. The maintenance of the hostel is excellent, with everything kept clean and well-organized at all times. The rooms are spacious compared to others in the area, which made the stay even more comfortable. Overall, it\2019s one of the best hostels in this locality, and I would highly recommend it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:08.345578', 5, 648, 4),
(3911, '[Deepak Laddu] Rooms are so spacious and very good food quality is very good and dining area so spacious bike parking available and wifi network so fast ,no water problem washing machines available Nanakramguda is the PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:08.345646', 5, 648, 4),
(3912, '[Lanka Nial] I stayed this pg it is hygienic end reasonable price  for software employees it is there best pg too stay food is verry hygienic ane rooms clean regularly  bike parking is so spacious  ane high speed  Wi-Fi wash machine also available  this is there best pg in nanakram hide i will  prefer this is rye best PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:08.345777', 5, 648, 4),
(3913, '[Laxmi Mandadi] Nanakramguda is the best pg food is very good and dining area near and clean also rooms are so spacious WiFi and washing machine available and bike parking available rooms cleaning regular', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:08.345839', 5, 648, 4),
(3914, '[Kishan Kumar] This pg is good and nice rooms space is so spacious and food  quality is so goodnWifi and washing machine available rooms cleaning regularly no water problem this pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:08.345897', 5, 648, 4),
(3915, '[Siva Venkata Sumanth Telanakula] Owners are very commercial, they are not bothered about the food they serve and the cleanliness. They are only concerned about money they get. They serve potato gravy daily afternoon and mix some water with soya chunks or bottle goud or drum stick to serve in the evening. Even chapathi will be very hard to eat. Buttermilk will be almost like water. They have rude rules like if the guest crosses morning 7 total next day cost is laid. Even 5 star hotel gives 30-40 minutes buffer while we vacate. Not worth the money they charge.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:10.637653', 1, 651, 4),
(3916, '[Bikesh Mayengbam] The room is clean and well-maintained. The food is hygienic, tastes good, and the menu changes daily. The cleaning staff comes regularly, ensuring everything stays neat and tidy. The owner is very supportive and understands the needs of residents, making the stay comfortable and hassle-free. I stayed here for 6 months and did not face any issues during my entire stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:10.637736', 5, 651, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3917, U&'[Kalyan Krishna] I have been staying in this PG from past 2 months and everything till now was awasome. I just wanted to thank the owner for being responsive all the time 24/7 and helped me with all the best food. I have never seen a PG serving the best food all 3 times in a day and they cook everything right in front of us. They have Breakfast and Dinner as live counters and lunch will be available with 5 varieties. Lunch was something that I haven\2019t seen in Pune, Bangalore PG\2019s where as in Pune they don\2019t serve lunch and in Bangalore they serve only Daal in lunch all the week. This PG maintains the kitchen super clean and they clean dining tables every 15mins so that the next comers can have a clean table. It feels like a restaurant rather than a PG. I have gained 4 KG\2019s in 2 months all thanks to the quality of food\+01f60b\+01f602. I started going to Gym now. Highly appreciate the dedication of everyone working and taking care of the customers. Special thanks for providing restaurant style sukka chicken and Bagara rice twice a week.\+01f64f\+01f3fb', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:10.637799', 5, 651, 4),
(3918, U&'[Vinay Kumar] I stayed here for 8 months. In terms of cleanliness, there\2019s no question \2014 the place is well maintained. However, the food quality is not great. They often reuse leftover rice from the previous night for the next morning.nnThe washing machines are not cleaned regularly, which causes a lot of white scale marks on clothes.nnIf you\2019re expecting non-vegetarian food, be aware that it\2019s provided only once a week \2014 on Sunday afternoon \2014 when most people are usually not around, so it\2019s not really useful.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:10.637862', 2, 651, 4),
(3919, U&'[KIRAN KUMAR N] 1. When we joined, the owner informed us that the rent for a three-sharing room was \20b99,000.However, we later found that another tenant who moved in after us in the same building was charged only \20b98,500 for the same type of room. This shows that the owner is not consistent with his pricing and often provides misleading information.Overall, this PG is not a suitable choice, especially for North Indian people.nn2. Although we mostly worked from home and stayed at the PG for barely 15 days each month, the owner showed no consideration when we decided to vacate. He abruptly sent a WhatsApp message asking us to leave by October 31, 2025 (Friday), claiming the bed was already booked by someone else \2014 even though the room remains vacant. He could have at least allowed us to move out on Saturday, a holiday, which would have made shifting much easier. Hence, I advise future tenants to be cautious while dealing with this PG owner.nn3. The geyser used to make a horrible noise. Even after repeatedly complaining, the owner took almost a month to address the issue, but the noise still persists. Please be careful while using it.nn4. If you\2019re looking only for cleanliness, this PG is fine. But food-wise is very very bad, no taste at all, spicy and he will keep night rice and same used to serve in morning and in that rice ants will be there, for curry he will put more salt because should not eat more people and taste is very very bad it\2019s not at all worth.nnIt\2019s better to stay in PGs for a 3-4 days and check the food quality before finalizing. You can find better PGs at the same price that offer much better food.nn5.The washing machine is not good. It doesn\2019t remove stains properly, even after washing the clothes.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:10.637925', 1, 651, 4),
(3920, '[Avadhut Gujarkar] Before 2 yrs I left this PG, 15 days is the notice period in this PG and I told to owner before 10 days due to some reason i.e. reason they have not refund my advance payment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:10.637989', 2, 651, 4),
(3921, '[Vinod Gowda s k] I stayed at this PG for two years and had a genuinely pleasant experience. The owners were always kind and accommodating, and the food served consistently felt like home-cooked meals. The rooms were cleaned twice a week. The PG has spacious  bike parking and a well-maintained washing machine. Overall, it''s a well-managed PG, and I would highly recommend it to anyone looking for a comfortable and homely stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:10.638099', 5, 651, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3922, '[SHYAM vs] I have stayed in this PG for over 2 years. This Pg is located at prime location and will be convenient specially for Professionals who is working at Financial District and Gowlidoody.nPros:nThe best thing about the pg is cleanness, food and kitchen hygiene.nThe owners are friendly and always available to approach for any issues or help and fixes all the issues at a good priority.nFor people who can''t communicate much in other languages, they can talk to the owners in English. Personally, i found it very helpful as i was new to Hyderabad.nCons:nRent is little high. As rent along with electricity charge is little high sometimes.nOverall, it''s a well maintained and great PG to stay.nI would recommend it to someone who is new to Hyderabad and job is in and around Gachibowli or Gowlidoddy. Finally, I would like to Thank Sahith bro and His father for their kind hospitality.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:10.638178', 5, 651, 4),
(3923, '[Venkat reddy Kallem] Stayed at this PG for 2 years, and it has been a great experience. The rooms are spacious, and the food is much better than most other PGs in the area. Any maintenance issues are usually resolved within a day. Overall, it''s a well-maintained PG with good management, and I would definitely recommend it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:11.206286', 5, 652, 4),
(3924, '[Narayana Reddy] I strongly recommend this pg y because the food is tasty and rooms are cleaned.nManagement is also responded very quickly as any problem.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:11.206411', 5, 652, 4),
(3925, '[Sumit Nag] Food services are too good. Staying here for 1 year the behaviour of owner is also too good along with the staffs.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:11.206489', 5, 652, 4),
(3926, '[krishnam Raju] I have been staying here in this pg for around 2 years, the food here is good especially the breakfast.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:11.206556', 5, 652, 4),
(3927, '[Prasad] Poor management, low quality food , strongly not recommend this for office employees or students , they don''t even give you the proper return of advance money we paid', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:11.206629', 1, 652, 4),
(3928, '[Salivahanreddy V] Good pg with all amenities and safety.cctv in each floor.food is especially very good and tasty.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:11.206692', 5, 652, 4),
(3929, '[Ravi 0556] Food  is good, rooms also clean. I regret leaving this PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:11.206752', 4, 652, 4),
(3930, '[Mahendra Reddy Syamala] I am staying this pg last1 10 months, maintanence and food is good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:11.206813', 5, 652, 4),
(3931, '[Supreet Mankad] Been staying here from the past few days. Very lovely people, very accommodating. Food is excellent. Simple homely delicious food, all of it gets cooked right here and we witness it pretty much everyday. Has everything one needs to live in budget while not sacrificing on food and comfort.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:11.835161', 5, 653, 4),
