(3933, '[CHaRaN Tej] A very comfortable PG with cool people. the staff and owner are very friendly', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:11.835432', 5, 653, 4),
(3934, '[TrinathReddy Gangirani] Well maintained friendly staff I really liked there rooms food', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:11.835498', 4, 653, 4),
(3935, '[Padichetty Harikrishna] Rooms were clean and good and food was ok', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:11.835563', 5, 653, 4),
(3936, '[Sai Kiran Ippili] The premises of building is not at all clean zero maintenance', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:11.835627', 1, 653, 4),
(3937, U&'[Phani Bhai] Test is very good, i am satisfied \+01f349\+01f34d\+01f955\+01f34e\+01f34c\+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:11.835692', 5, 653, 4),
