INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3939, '[Ravindra Kumar] I had a great stay at this PG. The rooms are clean and well maintained. The food is tasty and served on time. The Wi-Fi connection is fast and reliable, which is great for work and entertainment. The staff are friendly and helpful, and the overall environment is safe and comfortable. All the basic facilities are available and well maintained. I would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:12.660281', 5, 654, 4),
(3940, U&'[srinivas kothapalli] had a very pleasant and comfortable stay at this PG. The rooms are always kept clean and neat, just like how we maintain our own home. It really gives a homely feeling, and anyone staying here will feel safe and cared for.nThe food is very good, prepared with proper hygiene and a nice variety, just like home-cooked meals. It\2019s something I truly appreciated.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:12.660362', 5, 654, 4),
(3941, U&'[Satya] As a mother, I feel very happy and relieved that my son is staying in this PG. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and comfortable, which gives me peace of mind that he is living in a safe and healthy environment.nThe food is very good and hygienic, just like home-cooked meals. It\2019s very important for me that he eats properly, and I\2019m glad the PG is taking good care of that.nThe owners are very kind, understanding, and caring. They treat the residents like their own brothers, and that makes a big difference for parents like us. The staff is also very helpful, and any small issues are handled quickly.nThe location is also convenient, so my son doesn\2019t face any difficulty with daily needs or travel.nOverall, I truly feel this is a safe, comfortable, and caring place for my son. I would definitely recommend this PG to other parents who are looking for a good place for their children. It really feels like someone is taking care of them like family. \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:12.660431', 5, 654, 4),
(3942, '[Atchudhan .S] This is the worst PG I have experienced. The management is extremely unprofessional and difficult to deal with. There is no proper maintenance, and the concerns raised by residents are not addressed appropriately. When I questioned the management about these issues, the owner reacted aggressively and even attempted to physically intimidate me. I would strongly advise others to consider these issues before choosing this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:12.660508', 1, 654, 4),
(3943, '[Shivprasad Solanke] Had a wonderful stay in this PG. Moving out to Adibatla location due project allocation.nnCheff cooks tasty food like our home. Owner is always there to help you for your any queries and problems.nPG offiers least price with best facilities in this area.nOverall very nice experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:12.660571', 5, 654, 4),
(3944, U&'[Venkatesh P] I\2019ve been staying in this PG for around 7 months, and my experience has been really good. The food tastes great and feels like home, thanks to the Andhra cook. The place is clean and well maintained, and the owners are friendly and easy to talk to. Overall, it\2019s a comfortable place to stay with good food and management.\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:12.660634', 5, 654, 4),
(3945, '[Vakiri Guru Prasad] One of the best PG(hostel) in Hyderabad Nanakramguda, I have lived here about 3 and half month, I felt like the decent place to be love, well maintainance and good owner and our andra cooks, tasty food.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:12.660694', 5, 654, 4),
(3946, U&'[Thor Odinson] I\2019ve been staying here for over 6 months, and honestly, this hostel is really good in every aspect \2014 food, maintenance, Wi-Fi, and surroundings. The food is classic Andhra-style with some North Indian curries and chapati; the taste and spices are just right to satisfy your hunger.nnRooms and washrooms are cleaned every alternate day, and the washing machines work fast with enough space to dry clothes. The surroundings are great too \2014 it\2019s very close to Waverock, Wipro, and the bus stand (walkable distance).nnAll the staff here are polite and do their work happily, which makes a big difference. Most people staying here are working professionals, not students, so it\2019s peaceful. I\2019m only moving out because of my job transfers, otherwise I\2019d continue staying here. Highly recommend it if you want a hostel that\2019s truly worth every penny!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:12.660757', 5, 654, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3947, U&'[Nihith Venkata Madduri] Excellent choice for professionals working near companies like Google or Amazon. The facility is highly maintained, clean, and offers all the modern amenities you need for a hassle-free stay. It\2019s hard to find a place this well-kept in such a prime location. Great value for the quality provided!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:13.374028', 5, 655, 4),
(3948, '[chakradhar kcr] Very good ambience and nice place, decent food.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:13.374158', 5, 655, 4),
(3949, '[Santhosh] Everything is good. Nice food, Nice rooms.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:13.374261', 5, 655, 4),
(3950, '[Sriram Voonna] Rooms are good, but the maintenance, menu , food preparation process is very bad, and....', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:13.374335', 2, 655, 4),
(3951, '[Praveen Kumar] Good to stay,feeling like a home', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:13.374412', 5, 655, 4),
(3952, U&'[BujjiGadu 03] It was a great \+01f603 hostel \274c home', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:13.374481', 5, 655, 4),
(3953, '[Pragash Murugan] New and good PG in financial district', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:13.374543', 5, 655, 4),
(3954, '[rakesh bandi] Worst PG ever.nFood is not available on time.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:13.374607', 1, 655, 4),
(3955, U&'[Srujana A Rao] A decent PG compared to others with a spacious dining area and a responsive management team. While they attend to queries quickly, the overall hygiene needs serious attention particularly the cleanliness of the drinking water facilities and the washing machines. The food is extremely spicy and they cook the lunch in the morning and do not heat it again in the afternoon. They did not fix my leaking tap and I had to do it myself. There are lot of water issues. I slipped and fell in the room 3 times because they left so much water under my mat after cleaning. Electricity bill is very high compared to normal prices. There was some animal poop on the staircase and they didn\2019t clean it for 3 days.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:14.295001', 3, 656, 4),
(3956, '[Manasa S N] This PG is better than many other PGs. They respond to queries quickly, which is something I really appreciate. They come and clean the room everyday also.nnHowever, the Wi-Fi is very poor, and the mobile network is also extremely weak. I can''t even talk to my parents properly because of the network issues. Even 5G doesn''t work well here.nnThe washing machines are in very bad condition. Clothes often come out with dirt particles on them. They should really maintain the washing machines better.nnI also think the food can be improved a lot. They don''t seem to cook enough vegetables, and the paneer often feels stale and of poor quality.nnThe water is hard, and it leaves stains on the buckets. It is also not good for the skin and hair.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:14.295093', 3, 656, 4),
(3957, U&'[Mounika Alla] I stayed at Serenity PG for 3 years, and my experience has been excellent. The entire staff\2014including the housekeeping team, chefs, and management\2014are friendly, helpful, and always approachable.nnThe food is good, and they maintain proper hygiene standards. Compared to many other PGs, Serenity PG is much more spacious, clean, and comfortable. Overall, it''s a great place to stay, and I would definitely recommend it to anyone looking for a safe, well-maintained, and welcoming PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:14.295157', 5, 656, 4),
(3958, '[Rajeswari Basak] I stayed at Serenity Stay from August 2024 and had a very good experience. The PG is extremely well maintained, clean, and spacious. Honestly, it feels more like a hotel than a regular PG.nThe food quality is good but can be better . Apart from this , everything is great and feels like home comfort.I had checked a few other places before choosing this one, and this was clearly the best in terms of maintenance, hygiene, and comfort.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:14.295216', 5, 656, 4),
(3959, '[vayilada maanasa] I stayed at Serenity Stay from October 2023 and had a very good experience. The PG is extremely well maintained, clean, and spacious. Honestly, it feels more like a hotel than a regular PG.nThe food quality is very good compared to other PGs in the area. I had checked a few other places before choosing this one, and this was clearly the best in terms of maintenance, hygiene, and comfort.nI recently moved to a flat due to personal reasons, but my stay here was comfortable and pleasant. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a good PG in the Financial District area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:14.295278', 5, 656, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3960, U&'[Jyotsna] I\2019ve had a great experience staying here. The food is really good and the Sunday Hyderabadi dum biryani is one of my favorites \+01f60b Since it\2019s a women\2019s PG, it feels safe and comfortable. The rooms are spacious and clean, and the seating area outside the rooms is definitely a big plus point. Overall, it\2019s a pleasant and well-maintained place to stay....!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:14.295337', 5, 656, 4),
(3961, '[ganjai priya] I have stayed more than a year here,it''s been the best stay,food and cleanliness is well maintained also any issues will be resolved between one or two days.best in goulidodi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:14.295531', 5, 656, 4),
(3962, '[Patnala Satya tejaswini] I stayed in serenity pg for almost 3 months and the food was very good . They maintain the quality . And also the stay was good and comfortable. Recommended Pg for women .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:14.295637', 5, 656, 4),
(3963, U&'[Yaswanth Yadav] Excellent food and maintenance,nSoft corner owner,,\+01f44d\+01f44dnReasonbul prices comparing to other pgsnNewly constructed building', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:15.532008', 5, 657, 4),
(3964, '[Paramesh Reddy] House keeping was excellent with nice ambience and hostel members are friendly in nature I would definitely recommend if u want to stay in budget', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:15.532213', 5, 657, 4),
(3965, '[Rabindra Nayak] Good pg and management friendly', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:15.532281', 5, 657, 4),
(3966, '[Praveen Kumar] Rooms very clean and hostel maintaining persons behaviour also well. Very friendly Nature.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:15.532341', 5, 657, 4),
(3967, '[Vadde Chandu3] Rooms u0026 food is excellent. friendly owner', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:15.532402', 5, 657, 4),
(3968, '[Vasudhathri Kurra] Good food u0026 good facility', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:15.532461', 5, 657, 4),
(3969, '[Naveen Kumar Devarajugattu] Nice room'' s and good food', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:15.53252', 5, 657, 4),
(3970, '[Upendra Nitturu] Tasty food u0026 good facilities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:15.532583', 4, 657, 4),
(3971, U&'[Roshan Kalinkar] \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50 One of the Best Men\2019s PGs Near KPHB \2013 Highly Recommended!nnI stayed at Amma Men\2019s PG for almost 1 year while completing my course at Naresh IT, KPHB branch, and overall I had a really great experience. If you are looking for a clean, spacious, comfortable and food-focused PG in the KPHB area, I would definitely recommend this place.nnI stayed in a 3-sharing room with a separate bathroom. The rooms are quite spacious and comfortable for long-term living. The room is cleaned daily, washrooms are cleaned weekly, and they also do deep cleaning of cupboards, beds and ceilings every 15-30 days, which I found much better than many other PGs.nnThere are around 3\20134 washing machines available, so washing clothes is convenient. The terrace is also available for drying clothes, which is very useful.nn\+01f37d\fe0f Food is honestly one of the biggest highlights of this PG!nThe dining area is spacious and can accommodate around 30 people at a time. The food quality, in my experience, was among the best compared with other PGs in the area.nnThe breakfast menu has good variety according to a fixed weekly schedule, including:nn- Dosan- Idlin- Upman- Uthappamn- Lemon ricen- BondannLunch:n- Egg on Wednesdayn- Fried egg ricen- Curd rice on FridaynnDinner:n- Chicken for Sunday dinnern- Biryani once a monthn- Chapati twice a weeknn- Lunch and dinner on other days also have a fixed menu and are generally very good.nnThe food is tasty, filling and has enough variety that you don''t feel like eating the same thing every day.nnAnother thing I appreciated was the friendly and understanding behaviour of the management/staff. Since I mainly communicate in Marathi, Hindi and English, I never felt uncomfortable because of the language difference. They were cooperative and easy to communicate with.nn\+01f4b0 Rent till now SEP 2026:n\2022 4-sharing \2013 \20b97,000/monthn\2022 3-sharing \2013 \20b98,000/monthn\2022 Currently, no other sharing options are available.nnOverall, after staying here for a year, I can genuinely say that cleanliness, food, space, facilities and management behaviour were all very good. It made my stay in Hyderabad much easier while I was attending my course.nnHighly recommended for students and working professionals looking for a good-value men\2019s PG around KPHB! \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:16.386463', 5, 658, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3972, U&'[hari krishna] AMMA Mens PG offers an exceptional living experience! \2728 The facilities are top-notch and the staff is incredibly supportive. I felt right at home. Highly recommended! \+01f44d\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:16.386562', 5, 658, 4),
(3973, '[NEELAM DHEERAJ KUMAR] I stayed for 3 Months at amma pg based on my real-time experiencen-food is ok no problem morning lunch box is also available for employeesn- But coming to dine in area it''s un hygiene lots of mosquiton- water shortage every day tankers will comen- for drinking water you need to go to dine in arean- with the un hygiene dine in area and outside tanker water I had got effected with the Chikunguneya and Dengue.n- 3 share room is clean and everyday cleaning lockers available and tv for Everyroom.n- coming to deposit I haven''t got my deposit amount till now', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:16.386631', 2, 658, 4),
(3974, U&'[Anush] Best hostel trust me without a second thought can say food was tasty as well as hygiene, the rooms are maintained very well and cleaning is done every day, High speed wifi though,there is water geaser, washing machine for laundry free though,TV with cable connection in every room,Cctv, and for every person there will be a LOCKER cupboard and bed space is very good,there is lift too in rooms overall best pg in kphb trust me most of the rooms are filled up and under the budget though overall 5\fe0f\20e3\+01f31f''s', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:16.386692', 5, 658, 4),
(3975, U&'[Abdul Basith Shaik] 1) What is okay :nnKind ownernDecent rooms (8000\20b9 - 3 Sharing)nAwesome locationnDecent food options (little salty though)nDaily room cleaningn200 metres from KPHB Colony Metronn2) What is not okay :nnDine in place hygienenHard tap water (calcium deposits)nWater shortage problem sometimesnCongested parking spacennOverall I would say it is decent stay option around KPHB.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:16.386811', 4, 658, 4),
(3976, '[Bharath Ramineni] Great choice for those who are looking for PG in KPHB. Food is very tasty and feels like home made. Very hygienic and they clean rooms everyday. TV, geyser, washing machine available,beds are large enough to sleep peacefully. Owner manages hostel very well and neatly maintains it. I recommend to join. Mostly, you will not get room because it''s always filled because once entered no one will leave.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:16.386872', 5, 658, 4),
(3977, '[nikhil addaseru] It has nice facilities and very comfortable to stay. Food is also very good and it has good quality.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:16.386935', 5, 658, 4),
(3978, '[Pavan Kalyan] This is a honest review from my side.nMark my WordsnYou cannot find a PG better than this in KPHB.nFood is good. Maintainence is excellent. The working staff is very friendly. The area is good for living. Even the  metro station is at a walkable distance.I had a very good time in this PG.nI strongly recommend this PG to students and even for working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:16.386996', 5, 658, 4),
(3979, U&'[Md Shoeb] I\2019ve had a good experience staying at Aarush Men\2019s Hostel, KPHB. The rooms and floors are cleaned daily, and overall hygiene is well maintained.nnIf there are any issues like water, fan, or other maintenance problems, the staff responds quickly and gets them resolved without delay.nnThe staff is friendly and supportive, which makes the stay comfortable. Overall, a well-maintained hostel with good service \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:18.490001', 5, 660, 4),
(3980, '[umang bhatia] Excellent pg with all animities like gricer, washing machine, TV , WiFi and food quality is very good and hygiene. It feels like home made food. 24/7 CCTV surveillance..... Beds are very comfortable overall 4.8/5 rating best pg in KBHP...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:18.490084', 5, 660, 4),
(3981, '[Harish Jonnalagadda] Good accommodation good rooms and good food and very good receptionist....nnone of the best hostel in KPHB roadu No1', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:18.490151', 5, 660, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3982, '[MOHAMMAD SHAHID RAYHAAN] Best pg and best place to live food is good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:18.490212', 5, 660, 4),
(3983, '[Shaik Abdulla] Good pg in kphb , good rooms daily cleaning, food exlent ,', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:18.490271', 5, 660, 4),
(3984, '[Jaya Prakash Bomminayuni] The place is quite comfortable. If you are looking for a hostel with 3 or 4 sharing you can check out this. The surroundings are nice. I didn''t found that much disturbance. Coming to the food, it''s good. I liked it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:18.490331', 3, 660, 4),
(3985, '[guruphanindra aki] I stayed there for 1.5 months.Overall, it''s good on the basis of maintenance of the hostel. But there are more cons as compared to pros.nPros.n1. Daily brooming and moping.n2.Weekly once washroom cleaningn3. Morning tiffinnOnly these three are prosnCons.n1. Food making people are from odisha they don''t make food taste(sometimes it will be more spicy some times it will be no spices at all) i am talking about lunch and dinnern2. Food Quantity will be unlimited but before the time the food will be completed they will prepare less food either due to reduce wastage or any other reasonn3. The owner is a horrible person with no respect at all. The owner won''t be in the hostel another person will manage the pg he is a nice person. With a good attitude and humble reactiveness on any problems if you''re facing.n4. Washing machines won''t be available in Pg. dhobi weekly 2 times that due to climate change clothes won''t come on time and wont be dried it will be wet all the time. Majority of the time they get the clothes on time but in wet condition.n5. Parking is horrible due to the majority of the people being employees every person is having bike parking space won''t be available for new joining.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:18.490394', 3, 660, 4),
(3986, '[NAVEEN KUMAR Ramagiri] Very neat and clean maintenance.n100 marks for cleanliness.nFood is ok managable. Tiffins are very good and unlimited.nLift available.nNo washing machine but free dhobi facility available weekly twice.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:18.49046', 5, 660, 4),
(3987, '[Mohan Krishna] Pg ok but worst food and worst behaviour of owner wifi connect is bad worst lift service some it''s shocked low maintenance owner only think  only money  irresponsible person', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:19.465781', 1, 661, 4),
(3988, '[sai] Nice to stay, it really offers hot water, and sharing room, laundry is also available but it is average, food s also better', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:19.465864', 4, 661, 4),
(3989, '[Vinay Garje] It''s a very good PG need not vary about thinking.U can stay upto short as well as long stay.The owner is also friendly for any conversations.Its a very good place to stay.nSharing my experience isn1.Rooms are goodn2.Food is (an avg)bcoz they will provide only rice afternoon u0026 night u0026 breakfast is also good they will provide idle, dosa,pure etc u0026 twice a week they''ll provide one time nonveg also(chicken gravy with 4piece that''s all) Wednesday u0026 Sunday.nBut they never provide any chapati,roti,Tea also thats y the food is an avg...n3.Maintenance also averagenThis is my experience regarding staying in PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:19.465951', 5, 661, 4),
(3990, '[Anilkumar gunda] Rooms are good. Bathrooms are good too. Wifi is good. Food is Average as every other PG. No washing machine only Dhobi available twice a week which makes everyone feel hectic, frustrated sometimes.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:19.466021', 3, 661, 4),
(3991, '[Prem Kumar] The owner is a biggest fraudster here don''t go here he is so rude and has taken 1000 rupees extra while vacating. He is a cheater nothing is good here. Someone might take action against him forwarding to Hyderabad police if you are seeing this please do investigate him he is cheating the poor students life by taking our money illegally.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:19.466084', 1, 661, 4),
(3992, '[pusapati yuvateja] I used to stay here six months before.... Nice pg apart from food. Food is not good though. Remaining can be good not best', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:19.466144', 3, 661, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(3993, '[Aditya Emmanni] Food is not good remaining is good pg hstl is also available', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:19.466205', 2, 661, 4),
(3994, '[MHMD AFNAS] Good place to live (2 share only)nI have been there for a few months about 5 .you can get unlimited food, wi-fi , drinking water,dhobi,tv and others..nToilet will be provided one for 5nHot water timing is limitednRooms will be cleaned every daynAnd it is very economicalnOnly Morning food  is goodnI lived about 3 hostels in that area ,and  i know about 5-6 hostelsnThis is the only one that gives a economical rent', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:19.466265', 4, 661, 4),
(3995, '[Abhimanyu] Tasty Food if you want to eat non veg food everyday close your eyes and join this pg you will get multiple delicious insects as side in every meal', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:20.62716', 1, 662, 4),
(3996, '[Vishwanath] This is the worst, hostel I''ve ever been. Trust me guys you''re gonna regret joining this hostel. The food won''t be good as you think it''ll be the worst thing you''ve tasted ever in your life.. While eating you can see the cockroaches boiled along with rice, the flour for the nxt day tiffin will be kept open all the night, we can see cockroaches swimming in them. The worker staff is another, we don''t even know when they bath, they cook with the sweat on their body, they won''t even serve you well, they skip the egg and chicken to save money. And poor water maintenance, per week 3-4 days there will be water problem as you wake.nThe owner anil, greedy for money.once the drainage got leaked while eating,and there''s still many more situations that are disgusting.Trust me, my fellow students, don''t join this hostel.. You''ll regret for sure', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:20.627346', 1, 662, 4),
(3997, '[Taneesh Ev] WORST FOOD AND NO HYGIENE THE COOK DOESN''T EVEN WASH HIS FACE OR HANDS THE FOOD ARE KEPT OPEN FLYS FALLING ETC WORST FOOD ONLY WATER IN RAITHA  AND ALSO THE ATMOSPHERE THERE IS VERY BAD', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:20.627414', 1, 662, 4),
(3998, '[Naveen Kumar] liked this place very much. Owner is very good. Food is good. Owner just behaves like friend, felt nice.nI suggest who want stay in PG in KPHP area, this is best PG.nThe Owner don''t even bother about the rent, he never pressure you for rent.nAll facilities are there including cool water,', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:20.627475', 5, 662, 4),
(3999, '[Hema Sai chowdary] Good PG for mens and nice rooms at affordable prices', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:20.627556', 5, 662, 4),
(4000, '[chennakrishnareddy ramireddy] Worst hostel i have ever seen like this hostel no cleaning. The quality of food was very bad in the kitchen we can see a lot of cockroaches in the room also in the beds we can see a lot of bedbugs and wash rooms Also not good hot water and normal water is  also not available. There is no security for laptops and mobile phones The wifi is also of bad quality. Out of 10 i will give 0.5 for this pg. I can give suggestions for visitors please don''t approach that pg. The owner''s pg behaviour was the worst.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:20.627617', 1, 662, 4),
(4001, '[Ananthaiah Ananth] I liked this place very much. Owner is very good. Food is good. Owner just behaves like friend, felt nice.nI suggest who want stay in PG in KPHP area, this is best PG.nThe Owner don''t even bother about the rent, he never pressure you for rent.nAll facilities are there including cool water, one washing machine, food at anytime 24/7 almost without any timings, all time water in bathrooms, locker is there but you have to get lock.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:20.627856', 5, 662, 4),
(4002, '[nagur basha] 1km to kphb metro , if u are looking for iit or medicine coaching centres kukatpally was a better place , and for ur stay u can try this hostel , nice rooms ,price , surroundings , people , everything was fine , but u should adjust with the food', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:20.627936', 5, 662, 4),
(4003, '[Gutta Leela sai krishna] I''m staying in the hostel now .i don''t know how long I can stay here .The hostel  is pleasent and good for students as well as employees and The food is very good and i felt very happy. About anything I am very much satisfied about management and i reponse in return from them.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:23.474574', 4, 665, 4);           
