(4004, U&'[kondapalli gopichand6] A Good comfortable Hostel and Management. I stayed here 1 and 1/2 year for my Training and Job purpose feels like Homely food and management behaves closely to every one like family members.nA good speed of WiFi and A Good parking facility \+01f44d\+01f642.nSo everyone should must try this Hostel \2728', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:23.474688', 5, 665, 4),
(4005, '[Akbar Khan Sheik] Such a Wonderful pg in Hyderabad Kphb metro station . Very friendly and good atmosphere extraordinary rooms . I hope this the best pg at Kphb road no 1', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:23.47476', 5, 665, 4),
(4006, '[Lenin Gowtham] Management is not good, I visit your hostel two times, I observe that management is rude.it''s not a fake review', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:23.474827', 1, 665, 4),
(4007, '[V R] Manegenment is very friendly nature and maintenance is super and food quality is very nice compared to other PGs , and also other resources also good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:23.474892', 5, 665, 4),
(4008, '[Hin] I stayed one year above in vishnu Nivas hostel...I suggest to join this hostel with homely food and maintenance', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:23.474954', 5, 665, 4),
