(4011, '[Pixelframes] One of the worst PG in hostel community.. Food not upto the par. Quickly in bullet points.n1. People who are maintaining has no respect towards their customers.n2. No proper cleaning of rooms and corridors.n3. You can''t find washing machine slot since there are only two..n4. major flaw and draw and drawback is few hot food items are served in plastic buckets.n5. You don''t get response from staff of you have any query..n6. Water cans are not cleaned and you can find green algae marks in/on it.n7. if you start asking second time they yell at you as if in return they are paying for you to stay in their hostel..n*so my dear mitron.. oka day extra tirigina parledu hostel search ki. Check good one and join..', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:24.337426', 1, 666, 4),
(4012, '[Mani Krishna] I am writing to share honest feedback after staying here for  past 1year.nWhile I appreciate your friendliness and flexibility regarding rent payments, there are critical issues that need immediate attentionnnCellar Hygiene: Eating next to open sewage drains and getting drainage smell while eating u0026 tables is a major health hazard.nnFood Quality: While breakfast is good, lunch and dinner curries are worst, tasteless and getting smell.nnWashing Machines: The machines are not working. For 5 floor Approx 300 members have only 3 machines. In that 3 members its working 2 only.nnWater Utilities: Hard water issues and recurring shortages need a permanent fix and Drinking water not avaliable in floors.nnThe lift has not been working properly for the past month. It works only for around 10 days in a month, and repairs usually take a minimum of 5 to 7 days.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:24.337504', 1, 666, 4),
(4013, U&'[Sampath Kumar Reddy Yanamala] Food is good \+01f44cmaintainance is also good, each floor have water dispenser, alternative floor washing machines', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:24.337569', 5, 666, 4),
(4014, '[Kolusu raviteja Kolusu raviteja] New hostel food is good morning two tiffins  ,per week four times chapathinAlternative floor washing machines,each floor water dispenser,nBeside our girls hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:24.33763', 5, 666, 4),
(4015, '[Srikanth mandalapu Srikanth mandalapu] Food is good new building rooms also good best for institute students', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:24.337689', 5, 666, 4),
