(4017, '[Ganesh reddy] New good atmosphere and good and quality of food ,and daily cleaning makes me  the best choice', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:24.337807', 5, 666, 4),
(4018, '[Venkatesh Konchada] Genuine review for this hostel is below average for staying, beds not good, in all rooms 100s of cockroaches, cleaning weekly once that also not doing proper. In beds some bedbugs also there it''s very dangerous.nnFood review:-nNot using quality marerials, food quality is very bad.nFinally management is very bad, he need only money, not doing good for hostel. Worrest Food also very limited.nBefore come to hostel take good decision and take care of health', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:24.337865', 1, 666, 4),
(4019, U&'[Anirudh] Very bad experience with this PG.nnWorst food quality.nPoor maintenance of rooms and common areas.nWashing machines are not maintained properly.nFrequent water problems.nThey took \20b9500 as a maintenance charge, but there is no proper maintenance.nThey are also not returning my \20b91,000 deposit amount.nnOverall, the facilities and management are very disappointing. I would not recommend this PG unless these issues are properly addressed.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:25.103422', 1, 667, 4),
(4020, U&'[Aamir] Worst PG ..I never saw any PG like this .. Don''t join in this PG ever never ... Noo good food ..no hygienic rooms ...water , bed, problems, worst pg in Kukatpally,, Never join any one ...they say deposit amount give return..but they never give atleast one rupee... Be ware before joing ... Toilets are all worst ..no cleaning \+01f9a0\+01f9a0\+01f9a0 ..beacme health problems easily... please don''t join this PG\+01f9a0\+01f9a0', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:25.103511', 1, 667, 4),
(4021, U&'[Jagadeesh Yarrabothula] RK Premium Men''s PG is a fantastic place! \2728 I really appreciate the comfortable environment and the well-maintained facilities. It''s truly a top-notch experience. \+01f44d Highly recommend! \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:25.103576', 5, 667, 4),
(4022, '[dharmateja surabattula22] The rooms are spacious, well-maintained, and provide a comfortable living environment. The management is attentive and ensures that all facilities are in working order. The location is a significant advantage, with easy access to public transportation, shopping centers, and eateries. I highly recommend RK PG to anyone seeking a homely and convenient place to stay in Hyderabad.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:25.103639', 5, 667, 4),
(4023, '[sai santhosh] Worst food and worst maintenance, better to choose another PG instead of thisnNegatives:nworest foodnworest maintenancenwashing machine usage 3 days only per weeknwater problem', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:25.1037', 1, 667, 4),
(4024, '[daggula rajeswarireddy] Rooms are clean and comfortable. Food is also tasty. Staff are friendly and helpful Very good PG hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:25.103757', 5, 667, 4),
(4025, U&'[Prudhvi Kandimalla] Highly Recommended PGnnI had an excellent experience staying at this PG. The rooms, bathrooms, and common areas are always spotless and well-maintained. Hygiene is clearly a top priority here.nThe staff is incredibly helpful, polite, and quick to resolve any concerns. They truly make you feel at home.nThe meals provided were not only delicious but also hygienic and balanced \2014 just like homemade food. With 24x7 security and CCTV coverage, I always felt safe and at ease.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:25.103818', 5, 667, 4),
(4026, '[Sunny Jujjavarapu] The food in this hostel is really good and tasty.nI like the food here, it is fresh and well-cooked.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:25.103877', 5, 667, 4),
(4027, '[Sreekanth Gangineni] I have seen so many hostels, but in this hostel food is very tasty and cleaning also happens every day. Owner also very friendly with all the people', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:25.539078', 5, 668, 4),
(4028, '[ranjith chowdary] It''s like awesome Pg anyone can stay with no regrets love to stay here', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:25.539363', 5, 668, 4);               
