(4031, '[Ramanareddy THUMU] Very good hostel , hygiene hostel and friendly management', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:25.539606', 5, 668, 4),
(4032, '[Arun Reddy] If there is a option i could have given zero star.nOwner is Money Minded and No Proper maintenancenand Food is little bit okay. But Prices are too high for 5 Share 6500 and no daily cleaning and if any repair comes it will done after 15-20 days don''t trust the owner he is too bad with money minded.nwon''t give back the security deposit of 2000/- he will say all nonsense and stop let you out of the room.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:25.539738', 1, 668, 4),
