(4039, '[D v Narayana] It is the best pg in Hyderabad...I was changed many but this type of fesilities are not there...rooms are excellent ,, coming to food it''s fabulous..no words to say about food........', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:26.288711', 5, 669, 4),
