(4042, '[Rakesh Enjapuri] Very comfortable and food also testy . Management also response good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:26.289031', 5, 669, 4),
(4043, '[local explorer] Stanza Living Canberra House is an excellent PG option for students and working professionals in Kukatpally. The property offers well-furnished rooms, high-speed Wi-Fi, regular housekeeping, nutritious meals, and a secure living environment. Its location provides convenient access to JNTU, KPHB, Hitech City, and nearby shopping and dining areas, making daily commuting easy and hassle-free.nnThe staff are supportive, and the property focuses on cleanliness, safety, and comfortable community living. Residents particularly appreciate the managed accommodation experience, which includes meals, maintenance, and security under one roof. The overall atmosphere is friendly and suitable for both students and professionals looking for a reliable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:27.163748', 3, 670, 4);          
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4044, '[Anurag Kumar] Had a wonderful experience at Stanza Living Canberra House. The rooms are clean and well-maintained, housekeeping is regular, and the staff is polite and supportive. The location is convenient, with good Wi-Fi, tasty meals, and a safe, comfortable environment. Overall, it''s a great place for both students and working professionals. Highly recommended', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:27.163823', 5, 670, 4),
(4045, U&'[Adam Shaik_01] Support from the staff made my relocation to the property extremely pleasant. I was informed about all amenities and important details on the very first day. Every question I had was answered patiently, making the onboarding stress free. The digital process for documentation and payment made everything easy and accessible. The welcome was warm, and I felt comfortable right away. App-based steps for joining were efficient and quick. The handover of the room was on time, and the space was clean and ready. Onboarding formalities didn\2019t take long, and all queries were resolved instantly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:27.16389', 4, 670, 4),
(4046, '[_Dhiraj kumar_626] Canberra House offers a homely environment with excellent facilities. The housekeeping staff does a great job, and the food menu has a good variety. Highly recommended for students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:27.163951', 5, 670, 4),
(4047, '[Venkangouda Patil] EVERYTHING GOT STOLEN HEREnThis is very cheap hostel and if you stay in this hostel Clothes disappear, food gets stolen from common areas, and even Amazon delivery parcels go missing regularly. Every week the hostel whoreden  is posting in the WhatsApp group asking no strict actions are taken by management.nnManagement already knows this keeps happening, but nothing changes. The hostel warden just sends warning messages in the group again and again instead of actually improving security or finding the people responsible.nnImagine paying hostel fees of thousands and still not being able to trust leaving your own things safely in your room or common areas. This place has become so careless that theft feels like a routine part of hostel life now.nTHIS IS DISGUSTING TO SEE OUR BELONGINGS GOT STOLEN.nnJoin this hostel at your own risk.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:27.164013', 1, 670, 4),
(4048, U&'[Mahendra] Stanza Living Canberra House (Navodaya Colony, Kukatpally) \2013 Worst PG, total waste of money.nnThis PG is a scam. Please don\2019t get trapped by their false promises.nnWashing machines never work \2013 clothes come back half-washed or even damaged.nnCleaning is pathetic \2013 dirty rooms, stinking washrooms, no proper housekeeping.nnBed bugs everywhere \2013 makes life miserable, management never solves the issue.nnWater problems \2013 sometimes no supply at all, and drinking water is of very poor quality.nnSecurity deposit money \2013 they don\2019t return it properly, giving silly reasons and cutting huge amounts.nnOnboarding charges are very high \2013 they take unnecessary money in the beginning and never provide the promised facilities.nnManagement is irresponsible \2013 they don\2019t care about residents, only about collecting rent.nnFor the rent they charge, this is one of the worst PGs in Kukatpally. Living here is a nightmare. Strongly not recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:27.164081', 1, 670, 4),
(4049, U&'[Anish Chidera] It''s  the best pg/hostel in this area, searched for many but didn''t found better than this and the food is delicious with excellent quality..\+01f44c\+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:27.164144', 5, 670, 4),
(4050, '[Saurav Sahu] Thank you stanza loving for giving me special  IPL match we are enjoying', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:27.164203', 5, 670, 4),
(4051, U&'[Yaswanth Reddy] Overall, a very good PG with a comfortable and pleasant environment. The rooms are well maintained, the atmosphere is nice, and the staff are friendly and helpful. The main highlight is the food, which is really tasty . Cleanliness and hygiene are also well taken care of. Overall, a great place to stay and definitely worth recommending. \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:27.75544', 5, 671, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
