(4064, '[Hema] Facilities are so gud and home made food', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:29.176864', 5, 673, 4),
(4065, U&'[rali durgasatyaveni] Awesome food\+01f60d\+01f60d\+01f60dmust stay and experience the delicious food\+01f372', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:29.177058', 5, 673, 4),
(4066, '[Kondamuri Supriya] Breakfast,lunch and dinner is good and maintenance also very good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:29.177213', 5, 673, 4),
(4067, U&'[M Akash] Hi guys,nHaving lived here for 10 months, I can confidently say this hostel is fantastic! The food quality is top-notch, so you never have to worry about meals\2014the non-veg chicken dishes, in particular, are absolute top tier. Maintenance is done regularly every alternative day to keep the premises clean and comfortable. Highly recommended', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:29.872691', 5, 674, 4),
(4068, U&'[Gireesh Naidu Cherukuru] I\2019m staying at Hari Hara Srinivasa Mens PG located in 5th phase KPHB, near Nelavelli\2019s Kitchen, and my experience has been excellent. \+01f31fnnFood \2013 \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50nTasty, hygienic, and feels like home-cooked meals.nnAccommodation \2013 \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50nSpacious, comfortable, and perfectly maintained rooms with all basic facilities.nnMaintenance \2013 \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50nClean surroundings and regular upkeep, ensuring a pleasant stay.nnWashing Machinesn24*7 Hot waternnOwner Response - \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50nnOverall, this hostel is one of the best in KPHB for both comfort and food quality. Highly recommended for students and working professionals looking for a safe and friendly environment. \+01f44dnn\2728 Location Advantages:nOne of the biggest highlights of this hostel is its prime location. In just 100 meters distance, you will find everything you need:nn3 GHMC Parks \2013 Perfect for morning walks, evening relaxation, or fitness.nnDmart \2013 For all your daily groceries and essentials.nnShopping Malls u0026 Brand Factory \2013 Best for weekend shopping, fashion, and lifestyle needs.nnRestaurants, cafes, and other facilities are also close by, making it a very convenient place to live.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:29.872766', 5, 674, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4069, U&'[Venu Gopal] The overall hostel is awesome.nHostel is under surveillance system.nWifi, washing machine provided.nFood is tasty and good but except sometimes.nThe surroundings are really peaceful, huda park.n5-3 sharing rooms are available.nApart from the above all, the hostel owner is student friendly\+01f64c.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:29.872843', 5, 674, 4),
(4070, '[maheshreddy deshireddy] Very good pg when it compared to other pgs in kphb. Food tastes very good feels like we are having homely food', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:29.872906', 5, 674, 4),
