(4072, U&'[Village chinnode] earlier they provided like homely food...days going on and food quality/taste changed good to worst.. people started having food outside bcz of this ,no lift for 3 floors building and we have to go ground floor every time for drinking water..there is no value of no smoking and drink bord...seems owners already aware....but not taking serious action about smokers and alcoholic men''s in hostel .. smokers and drinkers suppose to do that in outside..it''s really uncomfortable for other roomates bcz of that sigerate and alcohol smell....\+01f972', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:29.87303', 1, 674, 4),
(4073, '[Kameneni Madhava rao] This was the best pg in Hyderabad I am living, food was excellent and it feels like homely.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:29.873092', 5, 674, 4),
(4074, '[Raviteja Devarala] Homely food and family atmosphere with roomates and higiene food', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:29.873152', 5, 674, 4),
(4075, U&'[Dharmendra Kr. Gupta] cleaning \+01f9f9\+01f9fc 2 to 3 times in a weeknFood is best for Sought Indian peoplenfor North Indian people goodnBike parking and Lift \+01f6d7nover all is Good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:31.373663', 4, 676, 4),
(4076, '[Vardha Mohan] I have been staying here for 1 year. food, parking and maintenance is good.highly recommended', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:31.373759', 5, 676, 4),
(4077, U&'[uday simha reddy] Iam staying at this hostel for five years, and it truly felt like a second home. The rooms were clean, spacious, and well-maintained with regular housekeeping. Food was simple, hygienic, and tasted like home \2014 which made a big difference during such a long stay.nThe management was supportive and quick to solve any issues, and the security was excellent with 24/7 surveillance. The hostel environment was peaceful, friendly, and perfect for focusing on studies.nOverall, I had a very positive experience here and would highly recommend it to anyone looking for a safe and comfortable long-term stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:31.373827', 5, 676, 4),
(4078, '[Good People] 1. Worst hostel with unrepaired walls and plumbing pipes.n2. Very high hostel fees, but they never allow us to eat sufficient food.n3. The hostel owner can''t even wait one day if we''re unable to pay the hostel fees.n4. For all floors, there''s only a single washing machine, but that also never works.n5.Untill 8''O clock we can''t expect food.n6. Money-wise, hygiene-wise, and maintenance-wise, it''s totally a waste. For this high hostel fee, we could join a well-maintained another hostel with AC rooms.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:31.373923', 1, 676, 4),
(4079, U&'[Phani shankar] Food quality quantity taste all are excellent \+01f44cnMaintenance also very goodnHighly recommended to allnPeaceful place.....', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:31.374027', 5, 676, 4),
(4080, '[Sunny Rao] Well-maintained and clean PG with excellent food to offer. Well-behaved staff. Big two-wheeler parking area. Overall best PG for men in Kukatpally and surrounding areas.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:31.374102', 5, 676, 4),
(4081, '[vikram chowdary (Vicky)] Homely Food 24hrs WiFi Good Maintainece', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:31.374167', 5, 676, 4),
(4082, '[Puli Manoj] I stayed here for Last 2 years Very good PGnn2,3,4 shares available with gyser separate locker , washing machine facility , liftnnCompared with all other PG''s this PG is very good. Food is good homely and quality food. Ambiance is good.nNo issues found like water cleaning etc. Daily they clean rooms and maintain hygiene conditions. Maintenance is so good.nnOverall good and comfortable stay. Budget friendly', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:31.374228', 5, 676, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4083, '[Raveen Marni] **Worst PG Experience Ever**nI regret staying at this PG. The place is an absolute waste of money. The food is consistently terrible, often inedible. The behavior of the staff is extremely rude and unprofessional, making the stay even more uncomfortable. Maintenance is practically non-existent; everything is falling apart, and nothing ever gets fixed. I would strongly advise against staying here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:32.564927', 1, 677, 4),
(4084, '[paravyshnav chowdary] Very good PG ,homely food,owner behaviour is very good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:32.565007', 5, 677, 4),
(4085, '[Mallineni Narendramn] Good pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:32.565077', 5, 677, 4),
(4086, '[rp rs] Weast of hostel owner is behaviour very bad', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:32.56514', 1, 677, 4),
(4087, '[19_540 M.madhan] Homely food maintenance is good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:32.565201', 5, 677, 4),
(4088, '[Naveen Choudary Mandadi] Homely Food Nice Accomodation', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:32.565376', 5, 677, 4),
(4089, '[Akshay Budierdla] Not Bad', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:32.565441', 4, 677, 4),
(4090, '[Siva Nekkanti] Worst pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:32.565502', 1, 677, 4),
(4091, '[Venkata Subba Naidu Kota] Worst food I have ever eaten -nIt will not even good for one day in a monthnnI want to express my strong dissatisfaction with the quality of the food provided at the hostel. The meals consistently lack taste and variety, which has been disheartening. One notable example is biryani, which contains an excessive quantity of rice, compromising its quality.nnUnfortunately, the situation has worsened recently since the owner joined an association. It seems that the food quality has been compromised in an effort to cut costs. Despite our numerous complaints, the owner has not taken any steps to improve the food quality or variety.nnLow space for bike parking else we need to park on roadnnTurning to the generator, it''s frustrating that during power outages, it takes approximately 30 minutes for it to activate. Even when it''s operational, only the lights and fans seem to work. The crucial amenities like Wi-Fi and plug points remain non-functional, causing considerable inconvenience.nnFinally, If you are looking only for room please be herenIf you planning for good food better choose other pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:33.169736', 1, 678, 4),
(4092, '[Rama Krishna] Excellent  and new pg for gents, peacefull to stay, comfortable rooms with attached bathroom, watching machine and gyser and wifi, dish tv, moreover it''s near to TCS AND DLF.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:33.169916', 5, 678, 4),
(4093, '[sk nayab] Nice pg for men with all facilities.nIts clean and the environment also good.nFood is also good in this pg.nParking also available which I can park my bike inside the pg.nOverall its near to tcs  Synergy park also.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:33.16998', 5, 678, 4),
(4094, '[UDAY KUMAR] Cleaning and maintaining rooms are good, wifi n hot water also providing but food is not good nowadays.nFor food I will give rating 3.5/5.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:33.170043', 4, 678, 4),
(4095, '[Nagarjun Vadde] Good north Indian food as well as good living space. Spacious rooms, power back up system available. Best place to stay .. You will never find such PG in nearby locations.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:33.170101', 5, 678, 4),
(4096, '[Sree Bhargava] Room may be good. Food is not good. All items are too spicy and not up to the mark.nObjects in the mirror are closer than they appear. Similarly, facilities mentioned in the banner are deceived.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:33.170162', 3, 678, 4),
(4097, '[Vikram kumar] I want to express my strong dissatisfaction with the quality of the food provided at the hostel. The meals consistently lack taste and variety, which has been disheartening. One notable example is the dosa, which contains an excessive quantity of rice, compromising its quality.nnUnfortunately, the situation has worsened recently since the owner joined an association. It seems that the food quality has been compromised in an effort to cut costs. Despite our numerous complaints, the owner has not taken any steps to improve the food quality or variety.nnFurthermore, the washing machines provided are not upto the mark. They fail to effectively clean clothes, often leaving them dirtier than before.nnTurning to the generator, it''s frustrating that during power outages, it takes approximately 30 minutes for it to activate. Even when it''s operational, only the lights and fans seem to work. The crucial amenities like Wi-Fi and plug points remain non-functional, causing considerable inconvenience.nnRegrettably, I must express that the rent I paid for this hostel is far from justified when considering the inadequate facilities and services provided. The value for the money charged does not align with the quality of the hostel.nnI''ve been contemplating to sharing my concerns for quite some time, and the situation has now reached an intolerable point. While others might have a positive opinion of the hostel, I feel compelled to voice my negative experience.nnPlease note that my name is not found in your records (database).', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:33.170223', 1, 678, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4098, U&'[Harsha NS] Best Men''s PG Near DLF u0026 TCS Gachibowli!n\2022 Rooms are clean and well maintained daily.n\2022 Food quality is excelent.n\2022 Parking availaible.n\2022 Owners are easy going, won''t restrict much.n\2022 Easy connectivity to MNC companies, colleges and malls AMB.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:33.170286', 5, 678, 4),
(4099, '[Siva Kalyan] I''ve been staying at Stayora for the past three months, and my experience has been excellent. The PG is clean, well-maintained, and provides a comfortable living environment. The management is professional, responsive, and ensures that residents are well taken care of.nnThe best part is definitely the food. The meals are tasty, hygienic, and consistently good.nnOverall, I highly recommend Stayora to anyone looking for a clean, well-managed place with great food and a pleasant atmosphere.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:33.891704', 5, 679, 4),
(4100, U&'[PRATHIMA Nandamuri] I have stayed in multiple PGs before, but the ambience, food, and overall facilities were never really up to the mark. After searching for a good place, I came across Manish Grand Co-living PG, and it has truly been a wonderful experience.nThe ambience here is very pleasant, and the hospitality is excellent. The best part is the food \2014 it is prepared so well that I honestly don\2019t feel like I\2019m away from home anymore. It really gives a homely feeling, which is very rare to find in PG accommodations.nConsidering the facilities, cleanliness, comfort, and quality of food, the pricing is also very reasonable for this area. I would definitely recommend Manish Grand Co-living PG to anyone looking for a comfortable and homely stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:33.891791', 5, 679, 4),
(4101, '[Arun Kumar] I work at TCS ,I have been staying in this pg for 7months, Nice place to stay in TNGO Colony,Gachibowli. Food is decent and rooms are comfortable. Management is helpful 24*7.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:33.891858', 5, 679, 4),
(4102, '[ABHINAV REDDY] Excellent living experience with hotel-like maintenance standards. Fresh food, clean common areas, and responsive support staff make this place stand out.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:33.89192', 5, 679, 4),
(4103, '[Abhinay Purgurthi] Good coliving PG with clean rooms, decent food, and friendly staff. Safe environment and good facilities for the price. Overall a comfortable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:33.891982', 5, 679, 4),
(4104, '[Shubham Prashar] The rooms are comfortable, clean, and well-maintained. The food quality is also good and taste. Overall, a great place to stay for students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:33.892044', 5, 679, 4),
(4105, '[vamsi Krishna] Rooms are spacious and clean. Food is also good compared to other PGs nearby. Overall nice place to stay without feeling too crowded.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:33.892105', 5, 679, 4),
(4106, '[thalluri sathwik] I have work in Infosys Best pg in recent times I have seen good food good rooms in Tngo colony Gachibowli', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:33.892163', 5, 679, 4),
(4107, U&'[Munna Mr] Stanza Living Sunderland is absolutely brilliant! \2728 The accommodations are top-notch, and the atmosphere is so welcoming. I had an exceptional stay here and would highly recommend it to anyone looking for quality student living. \+01f44d Everything was perfect! \+01f4af\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:36.105834', 5, 681, 4),
(4108, U&'[asik] My experience at Stanza Living Sunderland was truly exceptional! The facilities are top-notch, offering comfort and convenience that exceeded my expectations. I highly recommend it for anyone looking for a fantastic living situation. \2728\+01f3e1\+01f60a\+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:36.10609', 5, 681, 4),
(4109, '[Abhishek Tiwari] Bed Bugs dirty place bad staff  behaviournRaised ticket to check more electric consumption but the team is closing my ticket without contacting me or giving any resolution.nWorst expnNow I''m regretting my decision to chose stanza', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:36.106196', 1, 681, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4110, U&'[Rashid Mr] My experience at Stanza Living Sunderland was truly exceptional. I had such a wonderful time here. Highly recommend! \2728\+01f60a\+01f3e1', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:36.106275', 5, 681, 4),
(4111, U&'[Himanshu Chaudhary] My first night here was an absolute nightmare due to a severe bed bug infestation. It\2019s shocking and unacceptable that a reputed PG chain fails to maintain even the most basic standards of hygiene. A clean and safe living environment is not a luxury; it is a fundamental expectation.nnTo make matters worse, I had to struggle just to get my room changed. Instead of addressing the issue professionally, the management attempted to shift the blame to one another (even past tenants). Their dismissive attitude reflects a complete lack of accountability and concern for residents\2019 well-being.nnWhen I pointed out the presence of cockroaches, their response was outrageously casual: \201cCockroach hi toh hai.\201d Such indifference toward sanitation is deeply troubling. Suggesting that cockroaches are normal, even around food areas, is both irresponsible and unhygienic.nnAdding to the frustration, the charges here are far from transparent. Residents are asked to pay for various services without clear communication or justification. Hidden costs and arbitrary fees make the pricing structure confusing and misleading. Over time, you realize that you are paying more than what luxury PGs in the surrounding area charge - yet receiving sub-standard facilities in return.nnThis experience has been extremely disappointing. Hygiene and pest control are basic necessities, not optional amenities. A reputed PG chain should uphold higher standards of cleanliness, professionalism, and transparency. Unfortunately, this establishment falls far short of expectations and fails to deliver value for money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:36.106341', 1, 681, 4),
(4112, '[charan ambati] The employees are friendly, approachable, and always ready to help, which makes the place feel comfortable and welcoming. Communication is smooth, and any requests or concerns are handled quickly and professionally.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:36.106409', 5, 681, 4),
(4113, U&'[Amarjeet Yadav] I had a really pleasant experience staying here. The employees are friendly, approachable, and always ready to help, which makes the place feel comfortable and welcoming. Communication is smooth, and any requests or concerns are handled quickly and professionally. The overall operation of the PG is well-organized, making daily life easy and hassle-free. It\2019s clear that the staff put in genuine effort to ensure residents feel supported and at home. I personally recommend to stay here', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:36.10647', 5, 681, 4),
(4114, '[UDAY YT Gaming] Today, Stanza Living served special biryani for all residents, and everyone was happy to have it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:36.106532', 5, 681, 4),
(4115, '[vamshidhar rao Ganta] Good Food, House keeping is always done Daily Bases', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:37.28617', 4, 682, 4),
(4116, '[Mukesh Shankar] PG is good and well maintained.nBike parking, Lift, washing machine and fridge available.nnDaily they used to clean the room. all floors they have drinking waternnFood is below average. If they improve the food quality this PG is good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:37.286249', 4, 682, 4),
(4117, U&'[Bhaskar gold] Very worst PG \+01f922\+01f922 no clean no proper food room like cage, food preparation is very worst we can''t eat also for 2 sharing charging 9k but they won''t proper food proper water to us and drinking water they supply very dirt not able to drink also but they needed  money in time.nThey give TV but we have recharged for it \+01f605very worst.nnIf u r human then u won''t go there and stay\+01f605', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:37.286312', 1, 682, 4),
(4118, '[Ayush Lohani] Very dirty room. No proper cleaning. They were using double sharing room size as triple sharing room. Water also bad.nOnly good thing was food', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:37.286375', 1, 682, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4119, '[syed abdul amir] Breakfast not that much expectednOnline they show neat and cleannSpacious rooms and gym but they are notnNon negotiable overall okay starting range is 6500 for 4 sharing cleaning is good but u won''t get 4 sharing easily.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:37.286434', 3, 682, 4),
(4120, '[vidya sagar] Good maintanence,we love to stay with peace .... privacy and security is awesome', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:37.286528', 5, 682, 4),
(4121, '[Bhavik Khatri] Best PG for guys to stay in Anjaiah Nagar. Never faced any issues. Food is good and everyone at the PG is super helpful.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:37.286614', 5, 682, 4),
(4122, U&'[yugendhar reddy] Worst food worst rice they are providing government rice it\2019s to big we can\2019t even eat but they are charging 7,500 for 3 sharing and water also bad pls don\2019t join in this hostel and when I\2019m talking to owner about rice he is simply saying u can vacate hostel or u can change good hostel there is no proper response', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:37.286676', 1, 682, 4),
(4123, '[Lokeswari Chenna] I have stayed in this PG for 3 years. It is a good place to stay, and the food is also good. The PG is very clean and well-maintained. It is located near the office area, which is very convenient. Everything you need, such as kirana stores and general stores, is available nearby. Overall, it is a great PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:38.408688', 4, 683, 4),
(4124, U&'[Sindhu Stylish] I\2019ve had a great experience staying at this Women\2019s PG. It is very well-maintained, clean. The food is tasty, and they ensure good hygiene at all times. What I appreciate the most is the polite and approachable owner \2013 The owner is also very kind and responsive, which makes the stay feel even more safe and comfortable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:38.408865', 5, 683, 4),
(4125, '[Romica Raisinghani] Comfortable stay! Good and hygienic food catering to both north indian and south Indian cuisine. Room cleaning is done six times a day so that''s a plus point as well. Staff is well mannered and very polite. Highly recommend for budget stay if you''re in Hyderabad!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:38.408972', 5, 683, 4),
(4126, U&'[Sonali Nanda] I have been stayed here for more than 1 year it''s really a very nice PG. You can get homely food and maintenance is very good. My overall experience for this PG is very satisfied but I can say only one thing if rent will be with including electricity bill then it would be more efficient. \+01f970\+01f970', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:38.409046', 5, 683, 4),
(4127, '[Yeluripati Sucharitha] I have stayed here for 2 yrs. Food here is great sign of relief. Any kind of issues will be addressed very fast. It''s one of the safest and most comfortable PGs for girls, with a very friendly and caring family who ensures you feel right at home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:38.409114', 5, 683, 4),
(4128, '[Priyanka Singh] The pg is well-maintained with hygiene and cleanliness. The location is convenient with easy access to market.nFood is homely and tasty, owner is also kind and responsiveness.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:38.409178', 5, 683, 4),
(4129, '[Manasa Prakash] I am staying at this PG, and it has truly been a wonderful experience. The food here is so good, which is a big relief. It''s one of the safest and most comfortable PGs for girls, with a very friendly and caring family who ensures you feel right at home. Highly recommend this place for anyone looking for a safe and warm environment!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:38.40927', 5, 683, 4),
(4130, '[Saranya V] Good stay. Well-maintained, and CCTV is monitored 24/7. My only concern is that if electricity were also included in the rent, it would be more efficient.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:38.409336', 4, 683, 4),
(4131, U&'[Israr Ahmad] Very disappointing experience and definitely not worth the premium rent being charged. The biggest issue is the lack of transparency in billing. Several charges are never clearly communicated upfront, including \20b915 per day as common area electricity charges, \20b918 per unit for room electricity, and around \20b91,100 per month as water charges, which are silently added to monthly bills. The room electricity meter also appears to run unusually fast, resulting in very high charges.nnIt feels like the management is more focused on extracting money from residents than providing a good living experience. They seem uninterested in retaining tenants for the long term, and many residents face difficulties regarding security deposit refunds. Even after completing the contract period, getting the deposit back becomes a stressful process. The overall impression is that they benefit when residents leave early or struggle to recover their deposit amounts.nnThe facilities advertised do not match reality. Maintenance is poor, with only one lift functioning on each side of the building, leading to frequent inconvenience. The gym shown in promotional pictures is misleading, as most equipment is non-functional and only a few basic benches and weights are available. The rooms often have cockroach issues, and there appears to be inadequate pest control. The mattress quality is extremely poor, and requests for replacement are ignored. The bed itself is very narrow (around 24 inches wide), making it uncomfortable and difficult to sleep properly.nnFood quality is average at best, while hygiene standards in the dining area are quite concerning. Poor dinking water, some one of my friend got typhoid and started buying Bisleri water.nLaundry facilities are also poorly maintained; despite claiming to provide multiple washing machines, only a few are actually functional at any given time. Internet service is another major drawback. Residents are limited to approximately 105 GB of Wi-Fi data per month, which is insufficient for people working from home and gets exhausted quickly. Considering the high rent being charged, the absence of unlimited internet is difficult to justify.nnOverall, the experience has been stressful and frustrating. Between hidden charges, poor maintenance, inadequate facilities, hygiene concerns, deposit-related issues, and misleading advertisements, this property does not offer value for money. I would strongly advise prospective tenants to carefully read all terms and conditions and consider other options before choosing this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:39.19541', 1, 684, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4132, '[Sameer Khurana] Dear Stanza Team,nnI would like to share my wonderful experience staying here. The environment in the property is very comfortable and positive, and the staff always treat residents with respect and support. I would like to thank you @Priyanshu, @Mounika, and @Vikram for your continuous support and friendly communication. Today we really enjoyed a lot because of the event you organized. The projector arrangement was very good, and we all enjoyed watching the cricket match together. The snacks were also very tasty. Everyone felt like we were all family members. It was really a very good experience and I truly liked it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:39.195492', 5, 684, 4),
(4133, '[Shivani Mishra] Very disappointing experience with Stanza Living. The room is extremely dirty and has cockroaches, bed bugs/red bugs, and worms coming from the washroom. The overall hygiene is very poor. The management is not supportive, and the managers do not communicate properly or respectfully. They are also not refunding our money despite the unacceptable living conditions. Think twice before paying or booking with Stanza Living.And they are also providing the bad mattress not a single thing is working here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:39.195555', 1, 684, 4),
(4134, '[Alpha Male] This is the worst pg in gachibowli. Hidden water bill of 1200/- Rs per month is added to the rent, electricity separate meter that charge 18/- Rs per unit.nSales team (especially AMAN, HARISH) will promise a beautiful picture to you and the reality is that they will not even care to talk to you after joining.nWorst food- they will keep the food boxes near the dustbins at the back gate.nWashing machines - dont even work.nGym- in the cellar, broken equipment and infested with rats.nDont get fooled by their images online. Far from reality.nnThis is an honest review. Hope this will be helpful for people looking to stay away from problems.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:39.195614', 1, 684, 4),
(4135, U&'[Dinesh Madakasira] No water in summers and also wintersnLimited 104 gb data pernMonth and you have to pay for electricity even if you\2019re not staying atleast 350 rupees per month. If you stay just for a fan and light you would get 3000 per month.nBed bugs and huge amounts of cockroaches in washrooms.nnThey will take huge amounts of deposit and lock you in for months do not fall for the trap. I repeat please do not fall for this.nnAll in all you pay 20k without even your knowingnnProbably the worst Pg i have ever stayed where you will not even get basic amenities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:39.195675', 1, 684, 4),
(4136, '[Anjali srivastava] I visited to this pg 2 days back...... Management and staff are really rude and mannerless. Especially Roshini Reddy the property manager is very impatient and misbehaved with me .There is no hygiene in the pg. There are lots of bed bugs, cockroaches, and worms in the room and washroom. Instead of listening and resolving the issue, the roshini Reddy ,Mr.Abhinav and Mr aman ignored the issues and changing their statement everytime. This pg is not at all  recommended.nVery underrated and horrible experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:39.195734', 1, 684, 4),
(4137, U&'[Hrudheeshta A] I have been staying at Stanza Living for the past year and the quality has gone downhill badly. This place has turned into a money-extraction machine rather than a living space.nnFirst, they recently added \20b91200 per month for gas, which is completely unreasonable considering the already high rent. On top of that, electricity charges go up to around \20b92000 per person every month, and now they are also charging \20b91500 per person for water. At this point, it feels like every basic necessity is being monetized. Any small thing you use or ask for will have an extra charge.nnThe facilities are pathetic:n\2022tWashing machines barely work. In some buildings there is only one working machine for the entire property.n\2022tHygiene is extremely poor. Cleaning is rarely done properly.n\2022tHouseflies literally sit on the food before you even eat it.n\2022tUtensils are half-washed and reused, which is disgusting.nnThe food quality is terrible. There is absolutely no taste, and sometimes it feels like they are cutting down on menu items while simultaneously increasing charges.nnInfrastructure maintenance is also horrible:n\2022tFloors and corridors look dirty and poorly maintained.n\2022tOverall environment feels neglected.nnAnother frustrating thing is the WiFi limit of only 105GB, which is ridiculous in 2026 when people work, study, and stream online daily.nnThe worst part is the management attitude.nIf you raise a complaint, no one cares. If you escalate it, still no one cares. Residents keep complaining but the management simply ignores everything.nnAnd once you sign the agreement, you are basically locked in and cannot easily move out, even if the services are terrible.nnStanza Living spends a lot on marketing and advertisements, but clearly very little on actually maintaining the properties or keeping residents happy.nnStrongly NOT recommended. If you value hygiene, transparency in pricing, and decent living conditions, stay away from Stanza Living.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:39.195791', 1, 684, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4138, '[Siddharth Rai] Gym was shown in the images of property is completely different from the actual look, they have covered a part of parking and left some dumbells.nTable tennis board was broken, no activity was there in the property when I reached.nThe rooms were very small with very very small wardrobes provided for individual.nI didn''t chose this property. Way better options are available in this rate range.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:39.195855', 1, 684, 4),
(4139, '[Saranya] Best PG for ladies. Daily cleaning is there and food is good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:40.562909', 5, 685, 4),
(4140, '[Lakshmi Shenoy] I have been living in this PG for 2 months now, feel like home. The best thing about the hostel is safety, cleanliness u0026 friendly environment. It offers all the facilities like TV, wifi, hot water (no water problems), biometric access, washing machine, games room, etc. Supermarkets are in proximate distance to the hostel. Food is relatively good, hostel management takes feedback positively u0026 works on it. Overall - it''s a pleasant stay !', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:40.563103', 5, 685, 4),
(4141, '[Gayathri Gandham] I have stayed in this hostel for 7 months. The best hostel I have ever stayed. Food is the far best than any other hostels in this Area. Cleanliness is very good. The best PG to those who are looking for a homely food with great ambience and peaceful location.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:40.563199', 5, 685, 4),
(4142, '[Rajat Mehta] - Food is very poor.n- Single sharing rooms are very small.n- Mattress quality is horrendous.n- There will be mouse on every floor.n- Gets very hot from April.n- No table chairs in room.n- Wifi works seldom.n- Smelly neighbourhood.nnOnly pro is the location. Nothing else.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:40.563269', 1, 685, 4),
(4143, '[JYOTHI CHALAMALASETTI] Previously this hostel is good . Now a days it becomes very worst in maintenance and owener are very money minded food is worst and they are asking to clean the vessels when we cook any food in kitchen. And also very worst common wash area for plates water leakages are there it is not at all recommend.  If we gave any complaints owners not At all respond quickly', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:40.563336', 1, 685, 4),
(4144, '[Sesidhar Varma] We have paid advance by looking at the pictures shared by the owner. But after coming to the property, the rooms are very congested and not at all matches with the shared images... Kindly don''t choose this PG by looking at the pictures shared by the owner. They are reluctant to give the advance back as well... Please don''t go with this PG if you want something decent', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:40.563399', 1, 685, 4),
(4145, '[Chetan] PG is well maintained, I am hoping this is maintained like this only. You can pay by online also, and you can cook here. Food is average and tidy. Eat how much you want. No restrictions on drinking in your room, but make sure you don''t create a nuisance.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:40.563462', 3, 685, 4),
(4146, '[Vijaya Sennerikuppam] Excellent PG for Women Where there''s a Priority for Women, like for their safety there''s a Biometric System for the Gates and The premises, including like there are some rules and Regulations To be followed, For their Safety.nnExcellent water service and Even there''s a Lift, and Nice Healthy Food 3 times a Day.nnOverall it''s A Amazing Place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:40.563522', 5, 685, 4),
(4147, U&'[Chetna] I stayed at Cosmic Elite PG for 3 years in a twin-sharing room, and my experience was very comfortable throughout. The owner is responsive and addresses concerns promptly. The staff is helpful, humble, and always willing to assist residents. The food quality is good and consistently maintained. Overall, it\2019s a well-managed PG with a comfortable living environment, and I would recommend it to anyone looking for long-term accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:41.385799', 5, 686, 4),
(4148, U&'[Divya A] One of the best women\2019s pg in Gachibowli!! Amazing management and well maintained place.  Food, cleanliness and the rooms are top notch. Definitely feels like home. Would \+01f4af recommend. The owner u0026 staff are super quick to help if anything.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:41.385915', 5, 686, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4149, '[mrunmayee pathak] I have lived in the pg for 2.5 years and the experience was good. The food is good as compared to other pgs and also the staff here maintains cleanliness and is really kind. Owner acts quickly if any issues are reported. I would recommend this pg if anyone is looking for a place to live in gacchibowli district.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:41.38601', 5, 686, 4),
(4150, '[urvashi bhati] Stayed for 6 months, I was lucky enough to find such a good pg, the rooms are big, well maintained and management is  very supportive and responsive. I would definitely recommend it to others.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:41.386107', 5, 686, 4),
(4151, '[Surabhi j] I called them a day before I was supposed to start staying there (had only booked it a day before) that I wouldn''t be able join due to medical reasons and they should return my advance payment of 3000, they refused the return any amount. have proof on wa :)', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:41.386177', 1, 686, 4),
(4152, '[vallarapu priyanka] This hostel maintains a safe, secure, and welcoming environment that promotes comfort and well-being. The facilities are well-maintained, and the overall atmosphere encourages personal growth, discipline, and community living.nThere is clear communication regarding rules and events, fostering transparency and a respectful environment. Any concerns or issues raised by residents are taken seriously and addressed effectively.nnThis is one of the best girls pg will all facilities and provides 24/7 security.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:41.386242', 5, 686, 4),
(4153, '[ALEKHYA MADDULA] If you are reading this, you probably checking out to join this PG, you are at the right place- I have stayed in this pg for last three years, probably the best for its maintenance and quality food served ON time always. The staff has always been responsive for any maintenance requests. The cleaning service is prompt. Everything is so secure and no need to worry about our belongings. The management team has always been approachable. The noise levels are also very low as it is not so busy area.nOverall I highly recommend this PG for anyone looking for a comfortable and hassle-free stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:41.386306', 5, 686, 4),
(4154, '[mariam amaan] I stayed in Cosmic Elite Pg for approximately one year in a 2 sharing room. I had a satisfactory experience overall. The staff was really helpful and kind. The food was alright (as pg food is) and overall hygeine is maintained. I would recommend staying here if one wants to find a living space in Gachibowli district.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:41.386368', 5, 686, 4),
(4155, '[Ranganatha Reddy] The PG I stayed in was very good and comfortable. The rooms were clean, well-maintained, and had all the basic facilities needed for a pleasant stay. The environment was safe and peaceful, which made it easy to focus on daily work and rest properly. The owner and staff were friendly and cooperative. The food provided was hygienic and tasty, with a decent variety. The location was also convenient, with easy access to transport and nearby shops. Overall, my experience was very positive, and I would recommend this PG to others.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:42.077126', 5, 687, 4),
(4156, '[Chilkuri Mohankrishna] I have seen so many boys hostels since my childhood, but this boys hostel is better compared to other hostels. Nice and spacious rooms for two-sharing, we can experience peace and quiet atmosphere in rooms, They are trying to provide delicious food. Along with that so many features are available, you can visit the hostel ask for all details, your doubts if you are getting first time to hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:42.077264', 5, 687, 4),
(4157, '[P ANKIT 05N3] Overall experience in this pg 4.5/5nnFood is good.weekly 3 times chicken . 1 time egg . 1 Time Eggfried rice. owner uncle is so nice and friendly.cleaning is also ok. only minus is parking, Parking space is less. Owner uncle response is also fast for any repairs.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:42.077389', 5, 687, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4158, '[harish kumar] Good pg, clean rooms break fast and dinner is good lunch is not that much goodnBike parking is too tough to park apart from that everything is ok', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:42.077455', 4, 687, 4),
(4159, '[Tarun Santosh] Looks wise old bulidingnTwice in week cleaningnFood wise good absolutelyn3 times chicken in a weeknIf any repairs there are any issues will solved highly in 1 day maximum 1 week', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:42.077517', 3, 687, 4),
(4160, '[Rajesh Medisetti] I am writting this review after staying couple of months and very comfortable stay..! If you want try experiencing homely food then you must opt this PG without having any query. Especially, Hostel owner is friendly in nature and responds the issues if you face any difficulty during the stay. He is very responsible and taking care of each and every phase. Thanks for the management for providing wonderful stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:42.077576', 5, 687, 4),
(4161, '[Rishikesh Guggilla] Nice hostel and nice beds and daily maintaining service also', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:42.077803', 5, 687, 4),
(4162, '[chaithanya reddyavula] One of the best PG , Food (4.8/5), Neatness (4.5/5),nMain advantage is Owner Friendliness u0026 treating as our family member.nI''m staying for 2 years and most people are staying while starting PG around 3 years.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:42.078003', 5, 687, 4),
(4163, '[Swapnil Jade] Rooms are so small that even you can''t move one step without heating something and if you are sharing double then forget about even walking in the room it will be that small the places completely unhygienic there will be cockroaches in your food will be cockroaches in your room will be rats coming in your room all the furniture infected with bed bugs The Matress are gone they don''t you have cold water and hot water the owners do not care about it the only care about money. If you complain about anything they will bring goons and beat you up  to pay the money for example if you have given one month advance they will beat you up to pay 2 months advance pay that they keep on harassing you will not let you leave so please refrain from going to this PG complete harassment', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:43.146699', 1, 688, 4),
(4164, '[Ashwin Duth] The rooms are small and it was renovated from oyorooms  ,and it has 1,2 share rooms and The owner is very friendly and very cooperative, and food was great overall it was good experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:43.146783', 4, 688, 4),
(4165, '[Revilla Abhi] Food is not great, cleaning is not upto the mark. Owner is friendly and helpful but still hostel is not fully great', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:43.146872', 3, 688, 4),
(4166, '[Dr. Jay] It sounds like you''re referring to Sri Rama Lakshmi PG Hostel, which has received positive feedback regarding its environment and the friendliness of its owner. Based on your mention of the reviews, it seems like it''s a well-regarded place with a focus on providing a comfortable stay and good service.nnIf you''re considering staying there, it would be ideal to check local review sites, or even visit in person if possible, to get more specific details about the facilities, cleanliness, security, and of course, the owner''s hospitality. PG hostels often offer different types of accommodations, so it''s good to verify the amenities and services to ensure they meet your needs.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:43.147022', 5, 688, 4),
(4167, '[saleem shaik] The owner is so responsible to each and every one in the pg he listens to our concerns.nnGood food for North and South Indian people.nnNear by for wipro circle and ICICI junction.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:43.147104', 5, 688, 4),
(4168, '[Deepanshu Saxena] Very Bad PG. Food is very spicy and not good for North Indians.nnAlso rooms are very small, you can''t walk in that roomsnnNo jet/shower facilities in washroom. You need to use plastic mug.nnAlso the owner is not cooperative.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:43.147174', 1, 688, 4),
(4169, '[jani basha] PG is good. Only 2 sharing beds. A/C and non A/C rooms. The owner is very friendly with people. Food also good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:43.147236', 4, 688, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4170, '[ISATO H CHISHI] Very nice food and hygiene, free WiFi washing machine available and most importantly sekar Anna is a very good person .highly recommend to stay here with Anna', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:43.147309', 5, 688, 4),
(4171, '[Rajeswari B] I have stayed here for 1 year,,, felt safe and secure and mostly their maintenance is good,,.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:43.759554', 5, 689, 4),
(4172, '[Sahil Gupta] Very nice place to stay if you are planning to stay im Gachibowli. All the major company''s offices are nearby. Malls DLf street are on a walkable distance. The best thing is it is situated just beside the main road which makes it convenient to take commute from there itself.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:43.759641', 5, 689, 4),
(4173, '[Kusaraju P] Best Coliving PG in this Area I would say. Very close to main road that connects major parts of the city.nnIt isn''t managed by any corporate people(Zolo and Stanza). The people who manages this place is family who are humble and friendly.nnFood is great here, trust me in a pg we can''t expect any better than this place. They respond immediately to any complaints if we have. Very neat and have all the necessary amenities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:43.759707', 5, 689, 4),
(4174, U&'[R Rana] This co- living is a fake co- living .nI booked it through co-live and when i went to see the place they denied stating that we do not have any contract with co-live and asked me to pay 26000 for a pathetic room.nCo-live is a fraud brand registered in Bangalore and hyderabad their agents will take money from you and give assurance that your money will be refunded if you didn\2019t like the room,then they will not respond your call and messages stating we do not have any refund policy.nAdvice for couple that don\2019t choose this place, they will give you room in boys hostel.nAnd the place is too dirty.nnEveryone who is searching this place through co-live and faced same issue please report it to consumer court.nnAnd Fraud person from this group is - RINKUnA co-live property managers.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:43.759768', 1, 689, 4),
(4175, '[suresh chowdary] I liked the location and the facilities. Internet speed was quite nice and room was very clean. They had a parking space as well. Good facilities,organized, friendly staff and people.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:43.759834', 5, 689, 4),
(4176, '[Vasu Panidapu] Great place, management is very friendly. Food is good. Very convenient for commute as this place next to main road. Near to all the big malls in walkable distance. Highly recommend it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:43.759894', 5, 689, 4),
(4177, '[Shaheed Shaik] Excellent pg in and around Gachibowli with the best food and affordable prize. Great maintenance.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:43.759953', 5, 689, 4),
(4178, U&'[Sarath Nadiminti] Room and washroom very neat , food is top notch and service also very good recommending to my friends \+01f607', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:43.760009', 5, 689, 4),
(4179, '[Guruprasad Sanil] The photos and positive reviews you see on Google maps are all fake. This PG is infested with bed bugs, and even spray are not effectiv. It''s impossible to sleep because of bedbugs. There are hundreds of cockroaches in room. Staffs are not helpful. Rooms and washroom are not clean. Rooms are rarely cleaned. You can see rats in kitchen. Don''t waste your money, this is the worstest PG and even 1 star rating is too much for this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:45.060065', 1, 690, 4),
(4180, '[Vishbadhsah Senorita] Very neat and good food cleaned rooms everything good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:45.060146', 5, 690, 4),
(4181, U&'[Venkata Pullavarthi] Such an awesome pg with all the facilities owners are very good n caring the rent was also very less without any advance this is the best pg in Hyderabad the main important n best thing was FOOD they prepare like our home food n also healthy I was staying here from 2months n no complaints \+01f44d\+01f3fb\+01f44c\+01f3fb\270c\+01f3fb\270c\+01f3fb', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:45.060211', 5, 690, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4182, '[ruppa santosh] Very Good hostel and PG in over all Gachibowli...nDelicious Homely south and North Indian foodnBuffet type unlimited foodnWeakly 3 times non vegnEvery room attached wash room with GeezernLockers facilitynSpeed WiFinElevator facility 24 hoursn2 Washing machinesnFriendly manner owner', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:45.060317', 5, 690, 4),
(4183, '[Ritwik Ray] I have been to many PGs but nothing compares to this. First and foremost the rooms are adequately spacious and unlike other PGs you do get a spring mattress, wide enough for you to roll over and not fall down. This was a major issue I felt in many other PGs but not here.nnAlso, one of the only PGs I know which serves you 5 days non veg which includes eggs, chicken and sometimes fish as well. Veg options are also available on those days. Rooms are cleaned on a regular basis. Other essentials such as wifi, washing machine, geyser for each room, parking inside pg and 24x7 surveillance for each floor is there.nnComing to the most important aspect, the owner, is the most humble man I have met considering most pg owners are either careless or rude. I have been to Chennai, Bangalore and now in Hyderabad, most times I faced lots of issues with the owners but not here. If you have any issues staying here, get in touch with him, he will definitely help you in any way possible.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:45.060381', 5, 690, 4),
(4184, '[Khiran Sasikumar] I stayed here for a month in a three sharing room with my friends. Loved the stay. The manager was very friendly. Food was good. Non veg (chicken) was served 3 days in a week if I am not wrong and egg was served twice. Housekeeping was done once every two days (sweeping and moping). Had a bit of a problem with wifi speed at times. Overall I had a great experience here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:45.060485', 5, 690, 4),
(4185, U&'[Karthik Maddula] I have been staying in this PG from last six months. It was a good experience also the owner koti bro was so friendly with everyone.nIn case if you raise any issues he will sort it out immediately.nFood was good especially non veg three days a week. The facilities are good.n1,2,3,4 sharing rooms \+01f6cb\fe0fnHot water service 24/7nHouse keeping \+01f9f9nWashing machinenParking availability \+01f697nAttached washroom \+01f6bdnSmart tv \+01f5a5\fe0fnIf you are new to Hyderabad then this PG is highly recommended with affordable prices.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:45.060589', 5, 690, 4),
(4186, '[Abhishek Esthala] Good hospitality and friendly response by owner uncle.nTasty and homely food. 5 days nonveg (3 chicken+ 2 egg) per week. Lunch box is also provided in the morning. Hot water is also available. Good PG at reasonable price.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:45.060652', 5, 690, 4),
(4187, '[BEDUDURU HARITHA] Nice PG, clean rooms, good facilities, and friendly management. Had a good experience staying here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:45.779387', 5, 691, 4),
(4188, '[Tanvi Rajpoot] Worst pg ever, I stayed in this pg for 1 week, the food was horrible and old lady is like continuosly asking me to leave early morning when I was vacating and i was leaving at 9 am then she asked me to pay extra money for having water.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:45.779606', 1, 691, 4),
(4189, U&'[Kelsy Peters] The owner is so freaking rude ! Let me tell you guys... There will be no electricity to power your geaser for 1-1.5 months no lift Working every month for a week! And the owner will say there is a gas facility on ground floor you can hear water there and bring it upstairs. In the temperature of 16\00b0 they will ask you to take cold showers ! When I asked if he will give any concession in rent he said no! It is what it is pay full price! The mess will be closed for 7 days in every quarter! And the owner never admits his fault ! He will give rude answers or say vacate the pg if you don''t adapt! Very adamant very rude! Don''t recommend it ! I have left the pg after a lot of trouble !', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:45.779675', 1, 691, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4190, U&'[Akankshya Ray] I stayed in the PG for a year in a 4 sharing room . Room is quite spacious which you\2019ll rarely see in other PGs . Food is also good and served on time . Daily cleaning facility is there with washroom cleaning twice a week . Overall a good stay at an affordable price in Gachibowli', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:45.779747', 4, 691, 4),
(4191, '[Divya Bonthu] Food and cleanliness very good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:45.779809', 5, 691, 4),
(4192, '[Barnali Chaudhury] I stayed here for 5 months in a 4 sharing room. Room was spacious. It is a good pg, food is always served on time and everyday cleaning is made.nnAll over good service. Thank you', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:45.779872', 4, 691, 4),
(4193, '[Oh baby Sravs] I just enquired details  about monthly stay and day stay as we are 3 ppl 2wants monthly and 1 want day wise and his reply is like fordaywise fellows y you are asking monthly details ? member who pickedup call is very rude no patience for atleast 1min to answer more even replying back rudely.nI suggest owner to keep receiptionst to attend enquiry calls it just cost him 10-15k instead of yelling at clients.nnDisrespect towards customers will never make you succeed in long run.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:45.779931', 1, 691, 4),
(4194, '[Muni Prakash ganji] Hi All - I stayed in this place and Veerandra is Owner for this PG. Cleanliness and Environment are Good. Very Good thing is the food is delicious and tasty. On the festival day, Staff will prepare special food. I stayed in many other PGs as well but Monish near Hitech city is best. It is worth for money.nStaff and this Owner''s behavior are awesome.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:45.779993', 5, 691, 4),
(4195, U&'[Megha Virhe] I stayed at this PG for around 5\20136 months and had a really good experience. The food was good, and I especially liked the cuisine nights they organize every month. It\2019s a nice way for all the girls to get together, enjoy different food, and have some fun.nnSafety was also very good, which made me feel comfortable throughout my stay. The place was clean and hygienic, and the housekeeping was well maintained.nnOverall, I had a very comfortable and pleasant stay here and would definitely recommend it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:47.21602', 5, 692, 4),
(4196, U&'[Adrija Sengupta] I had a really great experience staying at Siddhi Vinayaka Executive Women PG. The stay was comfortable, the rooms were well-maintained, and the overall environment felt safe and welcoming. The food was also good and homely, and the staff were very cooperative and helpful.nnI stayed here during my time in Hyderabad, and I\2019m genuinely happy that I chose this PG. I\2019m leaving Hyderabad with some really good memories from my stay here. \2764\fe0fnnThank you to the owners and staff for making my stay comfortable and memorable! Highly recommended. \+01f338', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:47.216103', 5, 692, 4),
(4197, '[Athulya R Menon] As mentioned in many other reviews the PG is good and well maintained. The rooms look pretty new and is very spacious. As a tax employee my first preference was a space to setup my monitors for which the pg was perfect. There are cleaning staffs who would come around every mid day and is very sweet. The food is mainly North Indian type but will be comfortable for everyone. Overall I would recommend this pg to everyone searching for a homely and specious place to stay near Gachibowli Hyderabad.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:47.216165', 5, 692, 4),
(4198, '[Prarthana Sarkar] I stayed with them for over 4 months and it was a lovely experience. If you''re looking for a hassle free accommodation which is a slight upgrade from random PGs, you should check their flats out. The flats are well maintained, clean and spacious. They have caretakers assigned who clean and help you out when things don''t work. I stayed in Spring Valley and it is a lovely apartment. The food could be better, however it is hygienic and mostly light which is a good thing. The rent is slightly higher than other places but if you have the budget but still don''t want to take up responsibility of living in a flat, this is good compromise as it will be like living in a flat, but food, cleaning and electricity will be taken care of. I would recommend this place to any girls who are moving to hyderabad for the first time as the safety and security of the place is unmatched.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:47.216223', 4, 692, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4199, '[Nidhi Sarda] Stayed with them for over 6 months. Had a really good experience here. From cleanliness to the behaviour of the caretakers and the variety of food as well, everything was great. It is truly a haven for vegetarians looking for a pg here in Hyderabad. Much recommended u003c3', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:47.216359', 5, 692, 4),
(4200, U&'[Aishwarya Rani Behera] I stayed in this PG for a short period but it truly felt like home. Throughout my stay I never had a reason to complain. Whether it was related to security, food, maintenance or any other concern everything was addressed within minutes. The management was always responsive and supportive.nnLife took an unexpected turn when my father passed away. In the midst of that difficult time I had to leave the PG without even informing the owner. Later, when I explained my situation to Purab Thakore and told him that I would be shifting back to my hometown I experienced a level of kindness I will never forget.nnNot only did he waive my monthly rent but he also returned half of my security deposit and told me that I could continue staying in the PG for as long as I needed. He did not charge me a single penny. On top of that, they even helped me with the shifting process.nnIn a world where most people would simply follow rules and policies, Purab chose compassion. I kept asking myself, \201cHow can someone be this kind and generous?\201dnnThis place is much more than a business. It is run with genuine humanity, empathy and care. Had circumstances not forced me to leave, I would never have chosen to move out. I will always be grateful for the support and kindness I received during one of the most difficult phases of my life.nnThank you for making a PG feel like a home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:47.216443', 5, 692, 4),
(4201, '[Purobi Roy] I had a really good experience staying at this PG. The food was very tasty and hygienic, and the cleaning service was also excellent. The rooms were always neat and tidy, with spacious cupboards along with a chair and table which made the stay very comfortable.nnWhat I loved the most was the friendly and fun environment. They even organized movie nights, chat and bhel nights which made it feel homely and enjoyable. Overall, it was a wonderful place to stay and I truly enjoyed my time here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:47.216588', 5, 692, 4),
(4202, '[Aishwarya Sharma] I stayed at the DLF Siddhi Vinayak PG and the experience was good. The food there is really good.. as a North Indian girl, going to the South came with some concerns regarding the food, but fortunately, their food has the North Indian flavours. Also, the cleaning is worth mentioning.. it is on time and well done, so no complaints at all about the cleanliness. The caretaker, the environment of the PG, the location as well as the owners are all quite commendable. If you want a PG at a reasonable rate with well-maintained amenities and services, this is the place to go!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:47.216694', 5, 692, 4),
(4203, U&'[PRAVEEN VASUPALLI] Stanza Corporate PG lootersn1.3Lakh needs to Pay for checkout \+01f633\+01f633\+01f633nnRecently i joined in this PG. 200000% not recommended.nnCons only : (Because No Pros)n* Small rooms with congested bedsn* Dirty mattresses and they don\2019t provide bedsheets and pillowsn* Room ,wash room full of cockroachesn* No bucket and mugs in washroomn* water bill extran* electricity prepaid recharge is biggest scam ( if you turn on AC for 2-3 hrs , in single day 130-160rs gone from your electricity prepaid wallet) per month easily 3000+ extra other than rentn* they collect common area electricity charges also from us onlyn* 30+ Rooms only 2 wash machines, one fridgen* Food, they don\2019t provide 3 times in weekdays. Only 2hrs limited food only provides, if you are min late , you should order outside.n* wardrobes are there but all damaged locks . No secure.n* just 1day back LPG issue started in Bangalore, next day here started collecting 900+ rupees extra for thisn* lift making too much noise but no one take care of it .n* Last but not least. I paid 25k+ advance and one rent in advance. Now after experiencing stanza amenities, i want leave this pg, so i looked for checkout and shocked , they asked me to pay 1.3lakh  for checkout .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:48.125286', 1, 693, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4204, '[Gurudev Kurre] had a great experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and comfortable. The housekeeping is regular, and the overall hygiene standards are impressive. The food quality is good, with a decent variety and homely taste', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:48.125381', 5, 693, 4),
(4205, U&'[L George Fernandish] Stanza Living Conroe House is a well-maintained and comfortable place to stay. The rooms are clean, food quality is good, and housekeeping is regular. The staff and management are cooperative and respond quickly to any concerns. Overall, it\2019s a safe, peaceful, and well-managed residence. Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:48.125451', 5, 693, 4),
(4206, U&'[Ashok Sagar] The Conroe house PG is the best PG in this location, Its very neat and clean, Here the staff also very cooperative and very professionals, They well maintain higene!nnOverall its good on all the facilities and services they are providing \+01f44c', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:48.125517', 5, 693, 4),
(4207, U&'[Mr. Prava] Stanza proved again . Worst maintenance . No power backup . Surrounding 10s of PG running power, but stanza comes first to serve worst to the customers. On addition no support , not responding to calls . If anyone wants to join stanza , i bet you , you will regret 10000 times . Don\2019t consider positive reviews, those reviews given by some random people not actual ones.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:48.125581', 1, 693, 4),
(4208, '[Neha kurrey Neha kurrey] Nice pg to stay. Food are so delicious. Rooms are so clean.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:48.125645', 5, 693, 4),
(4209, '[KHUSHI GUPTA] Nice place to stay. Rooms are so spacious.staffs are good and supportive.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:48.12571', 5, 693, 4),
(4210, '[Mohammad Irfan] Excellent PG with clean rooms and good maintenance. Food quality is good and staff is very cooperative. Felt safe and comfortable during my stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:48.125771', 5, 693, 4),
(4211, '[Divya] 1. For monthly based people, ur notice period is 1 month how can a working women can say before one month. So, we won''t get our advance.n2. For daily basis she will ask to pay for 10-15 days advance only how can we determine how many days we can staynThese are business tricksn3. The women who are living in this pg won''t maintain their rooms clean not at all . It''s owner responsibility to command them to keep clean.n4. And mainly the food , please don''t expect anything and in dinner u can''t eat anything because not at all taste.nThis is my genuine experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:49.153194', 1, 694, 4),
(4212, U&'[Manogna Veesa] I\2018ve stayed at this hostel for 9 months and had a very good experience. The rooms were always clean and well-maintained, with good ventilation ,there was also convenient parking space available.The price was affordable and the location was convenient.Overall, the atmosphere was welcoming u0026 it is a great place for a long-term and comfortable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:49.153269', 5, 694, 4),
(4213, U&'[Sumithra V] I\2019ve stayed at this PG for 2.8 years, and it\2019s truly a great place to live\2014spacious, spotlessly clean rooms with private balconies and excellent ventilation. The food is tasty and varied, especially dinner, while the owners are friendly, responsive, and the rent remains very affordable. Safe, comfortable, and homely\2014a highly recommended choice.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:49.153331', 5, 694, 4),
(4214, '[vinny d] I stayed here for more than 2 years.The rooms are very clean.nGood ventilation and spacious stay.nThe facilities like 24 hours hot water, fridge and washing machine availability, provide a retreat after a busy day.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:49.15339', 5, 694, 4),
(4215, '[MAMTA Devi] Its hell.nThere is no window in most of the rooms.nThe gym equipment doesn''t work.nFlush was not working for me, and they didnt repaired it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:49.153449', 1, 694, 4),
(4216, '[ramya kotha] My six month stay at this PG is an amazing experience. The maintenance was very nice.nWe have 4 washing machines to use which is one of the best good facility. We also have a very good parking place.nI will definitely suggest this PG to my friends.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:49.153511', 5, 694, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4217, '[anantha krishna] A wonderful stay!nI stayed here for more than 7 months. The rooms are very clean and comfy.nGood ventilation and spacious stay.nThe facilities like 24 hours hot water, fridge and washing machine availability, provide a retreat after a busy day.nGym facility also available.nSafe place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:49.15367', 5, 694, 4),
(4218, U&'[sai naga kumari] I''m recommending this PG to join with my experience, as I''ve been staying in this for almost a year. Best and spacious (rooms u0026 Balcony) PG in and around Gachibowli(reachable to every company).nComing to maintenance, they have their own drinking water purifier (hot and cold), geyser in wash rooms, TV in every room,  Fridge for every floor, washing machines, power backup, security, gym, lunch box facility and sweeps once in every two days.nWorthy joining here\263a\fe0f.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:49.153813', 5, 694, 4),
(4219, '[Sherin Sunny] PG''s condition is really pathetic. No sunlight and food is below average. Only Sunday chicken biriyani is okayish. Lots of beds have bed bugs. They have Fridge on each floor but the overall condition of the PG is not good. Owner comes up with some different terms and conditions whenever anyone asks for the security deposit. Not recommended at all. Even in window rooms, sunlight issue is bad. Food is basic and that too is bad here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:50.114828', 2, 695, 4),
(4220, '[Aryan Khan] I strongly advise against staying here due to several critical issues. The management is unprofessional and dismissive of tenant concerns. Furthermore, the facility lacks basic security measures, leaving residents vulnerable. Additionally, the food quality is consistently poor and fails to meet basic hygiene standards.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:50.115084', 1, 695, 4),
(4221, '[Karthik Kumar Yelampalli] Worst maintenance, all rooms are infected with bed bugs, rooms and washrooms are cleaned only once every week. Food quality and taste has gone down drastically over past few months.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:50.115166', 1, 695, 4),
(4222, '[Sanjay Kotabagi] Food is good , rooms are cleaned evry alternatice day, hot water 24/7... Wifi quality os also good.. Terrus view is really good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:50.115231', 4, 695, 4),
(4223, U&'[Vasanth kumar] Overall the best hostel for working professionals at that price, still they need to maintain the lift properly, drinking water in the floors at night, parking space and coming to the food, biriyani on Sunday''s is super delicious\+01f60b', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:50.115297', 5, 695, 4),
(4224, U&'[Yogesh Kumar Nethula] I have been staying in this PG for 3 years and still continuing. The maintenance is good, with regular cleaning and mopping, and the rooms are spacious which makes the stay comfortable. Food taste is decent at times, but the serving part is not fair and needs improvement. Also, if you raise valid concerns, sometimes it\2019s not taken positively, which can be discouraging. Overall, it\2019s a manageable place, but consider all factors before joining.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:50.115406', 3, 695, 4),
(4225, U&'[kedhrnadh degala] Staying at this PG has been an excellent experience. The rooms are spotless and well-kept, the food tastes just like home, and the environment is calm and secure. The staff is warm, courteous, and always helpful. It genuinely feels like a second home. I\2019d highly recommend it to both students and working professionals! Overall Good nice pg to stay !!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:50.115516', 5, 695, 4),
(4226, U&'[TCLch] Guys owner has worst behaviour. Don''t trust their sweet words at beginning.nnRoom is good that''s all.  Everything else is thumbs down \+01f44e\+01f3fb.nnMaintanence is very bad , food is nightmare. Don''t trust this hostel. Not recommended. Please avoid this at any cost. As a experienced', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:50.115583', 1, 695, 4),
(4227, U&'[S PRASHANTH KUMAR CHARY] I stayed in this PG/hostel for a while and had a really good experience. Rooms were clean, food was decent, and the management was cooperative. Maintenance issues were resolved quickly. Overall a safe and comfortable place to stay, especially for students and working professionals.appreciating the management \+01f64c', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:52.3094', 5, 697, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4228, '[Afzalmohammad Afzal] I stayed here for 4 months:the ambience is good; I made a lot of friends; beds front garden lighting  parking everything amazing was perfect. The property owner is very friendly. They just have to look into food.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:52.309565', 5, 697, 4),
(4229, U&'[Sumanth Anumasa] I made a mistake by choosing this PG after reading Google reviews, so I want to share my experience. Please read this review till end for my advicennThe biggest issue here is the strict rules. They have lots of rules to get back your security deposit. Even if the PG isn''t good, you''re not comfortable, you get sick, or have food poisoning, they won''t give your money back. They just blame you so that u  have to stay in this PG even it\2019s their fault of not proving much value to studentsnnYou have to tell the PG owner 30 days before leaving to get your deposit back.If not owner Anna has a maturity to remind you about our freedom that you can leave PG whenever you want but deposit can\2019t refundablennThis PG has many problems:nnFood: It''s a vegetarian PG and they only provide eggs, which aren''t great. They don''t even cook the food here; they bring it from another hostel, so there''s often not enough food for latecomers.nRooms: They cleaned our room only once a week, and there''s no proper ventilation. No locks for cupboards They won\2019t provide pillow and the Wi-Fi is slow.nBathrooms: There are only common bathrooms for all students, They don\2019t even provide bucket also and the pictures on Google are fake.(smart owner)nThe good things:nnThere''s good space for bike parking.nThey have trees and a place to sit outside.nnMOST IMPORTANT -nMy advice is to try this PG for 2-3 days first. If you like it, you can stay longer. They may not offer this trial because they want to lock you in for a month or two months . If they don''t allow a trial, consider looking for another PG. This advice came from many people who are living in this PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:52.309705', 1, 697, 4),
(4230, U&'[Dhruva spk] I really had great time here. special thanks to Sushanth. I came for 2 to 3 days and was planning to shift to flat but the environment and people  I had here is fully positive. I really made some strong bonds.nnI stayed 6months yes it''s not a regular pg type so dont expect like that.nnIts a big lavish villa turned into dormitories and some great rooms in 1st floor. As it like home yes I agree some things you have adjust. First know that after that you can join.nnSo if u want a homely vibes with all together with your group of friends u can really have great time here.nnMy memories here are best.nnAfter 1and half year I am writing this as a thanks note to this Agasthya home.nSpecial Mention to Sushanth thank you Man \+01fac2\+01f4af', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:52.309855', 5, 697, 4),
(4231, '[akeeb sk] Positive:1. neat placen2. self cooking and fridge availablen3. parking space availablenNegative: 1. Some rooms don''t have any ventilationn2 all sharing rooms are connecting to each other no privacy andn3. No attached bathrooms if your in a hurry you need to wait as the bathrooms are common for everyonen4. Food Average,in a week you will definitely encounter atleast once unedible salty curryn5. Food will finish sometimes early at night if you ask before closing time they will make boiled rice', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:52.309996', 2, 697, 4),
(4232, '[Sai Srihith] This PG is so homely to live in..nI had good experience here, got good friends.nThe maintenance is good, which helps in not getting sick.nThe staff is so good and responsible.nnOne among the biggest traits in success of many hostles or PGs is providing good food.The food is good in your PG..but there should be some effective internal controls.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:52.31009', 5, 697, 4),
(4233, '[Mohammed] Cleanliness 5/5nFood 4.5/5nOne of the best PG/Hostel I have seen in this locality', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:52.310177', 5, 697, 4),
(4234, U&'[Susheeth Reddy] Best PG in the surrounding area....comparatively neat n clean rooms from other PG. Food is also good and manageable. Owners also very attentive regarding anything...overall thumsup \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:52.310259', 5, 697, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4235, '[Best Gadgets] Worst hostel no drinking water availabilitynLift keeps failing everytime .it''s very hard to climb all the floors everydaynNo water for washing machine.nThis hostel doesn''t even deserve one star', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:54.858288', 1, 700, 4),
(4236, U&'[Poojitha Aleti] The worst hostel I ever livednStaff is very rude and don\2019t even expect hygiene.nStaff is very particular in collecting fee when it comes to maintanance it will like we are speaking to some dumb and deaf peoplennDo not choose this hostelnThere are many better hostels nearby.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:54.858371', 1, 700, 4),
(4237, '[Srinidhi Bhatt] the cleanliness was far below acceptable standards. The bathroom was dirty, with mold in the shower and a strong odor. My room was not cleaned during my stay, and the linens appeared stained. The staff seemed indifferent to complaints.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:54.858497', 1, 700, 4),
(4238, '[Lovaraju Marryla] One of the best hostel in narayanaguda near by KMIT college with best facilities. I felt very happy after choosing this hostel. Friendly staff u0026 Management.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:54.858566', 5, 700, 4),
(4239, '[Bhargavi Bethi] Worst HostelnHostel staff is very RudenDrinking water issue people suffered from infection due to water issue.nNo maintenance at all.nHigh fee low facility.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:54.858629', 1, 700, 4),
(4240, U&'[Police patel charan kumar Police patel] Very worst hostelnSome of My friends including boys and girl''s stayed  here. Hostel fee starts from 7000 insects and Cockroaches come every 2 to 3 days once in food no hygiene at allnEven once food safety Authorities visited due to complaints but no change at allnThey don''t clean hosteln6 floors I think and lift will not worknn\2b50\fe0fother positive review are fake added by  those who are friends of ownernnPlease don''t join this hostel to all boys and girl''s other hostel are available in narayanguda better than this', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:54.85869', 1, 700, 4),
(4241, '[Samuel Nissy] Almost 85% reviews are fake.nManagement is least concerned about the issues the students are facing.nThere are many issues the student will face after joining. From Room cleaning, washroom cleaning, Food availability time to WIFI u0026 Lift facility. You will face problem everywhere and suffer at least 21 days a month.nYou will not find anybody answerable to your questions.nThe management will make your feel that you are Stranded.nnMy suggestion is to find a better hostel other than this.nnThank you.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:54.858753', 1, 700, 4),
(4242, '[tech review] Dont get fooled by the reviews ,, all are fake reviews .Worst hostel ever owner won''t respond to your calls . No cleaning of bathrooms and rooms and even dustbins are also not cleaned .  If u got lift in higher floors u will definitely get tired because lift doesn''t work 3 out of 4 weeks in a month lift will be in repair only . Worst maintenance ever even u can get prime minister lift your call but the hostel won''t attend the calls at all...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:54.858813', 1, 700, 4),
(4243, '[P S R REDDY P S R REDDY] The food was soo good clean and hygiene like home made. The cleanliness was outstanding and very supportive management.... And good hospitality', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:55.684073', 5, 701, 4),
(4244, '[Chennareddy A] Excellent PG with clean rooms, good food, and a safe, peaceful environment. The management is friendly and responsive, and all basic amenities are well maintained. A great place to stay. Highly recommended', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:55.684165', 5, 701, 4),
(4245, '[Srikanth Vadde] The food was very good, clean, hygienic, and tasted just like home-cooked meals. The cleanliness of the PG was outstanding, and the management was very supportive and cooperative. They provide excellent hospitality, making the stay comfortable and pleasant. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:55.684233', 5, 701, 4),
(4246, '[ashokreddy katreddy] The PG owner is friendly, and the food is tasty and feels like home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:55.684299', 5, 701, 4);          
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4247, '[Sriraj Baja] Not worth for money but apart from all nearby hostels it better', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:55.684368', 3, 701, 4),
(4248, '[Raviteja Kuvvarapu] Comfortable, like a home affordable price.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:55.684433', 5, 701, 4),
(4249, '[Venkateswara Reddy] Here food is goodnRooms are very space compare to othernWell maintained', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:55.684493', 5, 701, 4),
(4250, '[rathna reddy] Excellent pg and homely  type food and clenning is super', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:55.684555', 5, 701, 4),
(4251, '[K PavAN KumAR ReddY] Nice pg for accommodation of girlsnFood is good and reasonable price', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:56.403525', 5, 702, 4),
(4252, U&'[Talapakula Sai Vyshnavi] Best pg experience. This is my first pg experience i feel like my second home \+01f90dnFood is good nd hygienenAnd pg owner also very friendly nd loveablenRooms nd floors are very hygienicnOver all good nd best experiencenI will give 4.5/5', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:56.403873', 5, 702, 4),
(4253, '[Sheetal Bhalerao] Iam from Karnataka but this place gave me homely vibe ..Very  clean rooms, well maintained, management is friendly..safe and secure atmosphere, food is greatnIam happy with my stay here', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:56.404059', 5, 702, 4),
(4254, '[Saivani Gorati] Comfortable stay, homely food and good security spacious rooms, good ventilation', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:56.404168', 5, 702, 4),
(4255, '[Mounika Kundrapu] Very comfortable PG and homely food.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:56.404237', 5, 702, 4),
(4256, '[Anusha Narthu] Very good place and affordable and comfortable', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:56.404304', 5, 702, 4),
(4257, '[Usha kiranmayi Kundrapu] Good stay..it''s a comfortable place...food is homely..', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:56.404367', 5, 702, 4),
(4258, '[N Prasanna] Food is really good, delicious and hostel is highly secure and safe for girls', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 22:45:56.404432', 5, 702, 4),
(4259, U&'[Abinesh] I\2019ve had a very good experience staying at this PG. The rooms are neat, clean, and well maintained, with daily cleaning services provided. The owner is very friendly, approachable, and responsive, which makes the overall stay comfortable and hassle-free.nnThe food is one of the highlights here. It is homely, fresh, and well prepared, making it feel like a home-cooked meal. The overall environment is peaceful and comfortable, and the facilities are well maintained.nnOverall, I would highly recommend this PG to students and working professionals looking for a clean, comfortable, and welcoming place to stay. Truly a pleasant experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:21.138926', 5, 704, 4),
(4260, U&'[Abinesh A.v] \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50nnVery nice hostel with a great atmosphere! \+01f3e0\2728nn1. Rooms u0026 surroundings are very clean and well maintained. \+01f9f9\2728n2. Staff \+01f4af \2014 very friendly and supportive.n3. Food is semma! \+01f60b\+01f525 Tasty and good quality.n4. Overall, a comfortable and peaceful place to stay.nnHighly recommended! \2764\fe0f\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50nnVery nice hostel with a great atmosphere! \+01f3e0\2728', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:21.145218', 5, 704, 4),
(4261, U&'[Jaychandar J] My one day experience in this pg .nThe owner of the pg is genuine and kind person . I joined pg on 22/12/25 and worked in near location.  Due to some unexpected personal reason I couldn''t continue my job from the next day . So ,Called and I informed the owner that I couldn''t continue the job so that I would like to vacate from the pg on 23/12/25 . Without asking any reason or excuse, the owner returned my amount with the deduction of just 200rs only as my one day rent to my gpay ,while on call itself . Person like him is very rare that too in this money minded chennai . Thank you sir \2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:21.145578', 5, 704, 4),
(4262, '[Prabhakaran Veerabathiran] My first impression of staying here was the brand new building and excellent ventilation.nThe facilities including the various amenities are more than I expected.nAdditionally, I now appreciate the homely food and the PG owner''s hospitality.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:21.146103', 5, 704, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4263, '[Vigneswaran N] I stayed around 2 months in this pg and it was THE BEST. People who looking for pg near thoraipakkam can go for this, the food is good and well maintained clean rooms with no disturbance. The owners are too friendly, which made my stay feel like home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:21.146847', 5, 704, 4),
(4264, '[Sivaprasad Chockalingam] I highly recommend this PG to everyone because the rooms have excellent ventilation, and it''s conveniently close to OMR. Despite its proximity, it''s quiet and pollution-free, offering a pleasant environment for a comfortable stay. Enjoy your time here with a good atmosphere!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:21.14728', 5, 704, 4),
(4265, '[Karthikeyan A] Rudhra Pg hostel is an affordable hostel for working mens and students at Thooraipakkam locality. Good maintenance and timely clear the issue if any. They will provide free wifi which is very useful for the students. Also they provide good food, parking facility too. One of the best hostel in affordable rent.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:21.147764', 5, 704, 4),
(4266, '[sakthi s] Rudhra men''s PG/hostel is an affordable hostel for working men and students at Thoraipakkam locality. Mainly they provide good, hygienic and quality food.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:21.148897', 5, 704, 4),
(4267, '[Prawinsankar T] Comparatively best I would say, there are very less pg charging without food. Comfortable stay and Prabhu is taking care of everything.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:21.634481', 5, 705, 4),
(4268, '[Arivarasan Irulappan] I was here for a short term stay to catch up on a flight in a couple of days.nThe Caretaker Mr Prabhu was gracious to provide affordable accommodation for two days. Also I was staying for 9 months in his other PG house for 9 months. I recommend to everyone if you need a PG to go to the nearby offices or colleges.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:21.636181', 5, 705, 4),
(4269, '[Suresh Kannan B S] I am staying here for last 6 7 months. The PG looks good to me. Prabhu is the person who is incharge of the PG and he is very genuine and friendly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:21.636616', 4, 705, 4),
(4270, '[Saurabh Sharma] One of the best place to live in kumaran nagar. I lived here for almost 2 years and never had any complain for anything. An independent place with no restrictions with wifi availability having feasible rent .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:21.638754', 5, 705, 4),
(4271, '[Abiram Boopathi] I''ve stayed there for 2 days and it looks like a better experience for me but the price is high Per day 400 without food The owners are nice characters', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:21.639234', 3, 705, 4),
(4272, '[Vimal R B] Awesome stay for 1year. Incharge Prabhu Na very supportive in all way. If your working in OMR this is worth place for accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:21.640316', 5, 705, 4),
(4273, '[retty antony] Wonderful place to stay, never seen a PG owner as responsible as Mr. Prabhu.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:21.641437', 5, 705, 4),
(4274, '[keerthi vasan] I stayed there for one year, I never faced water problem Building in good condition , regular maintenance', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:21.641897', 5, 705, 4),
(4275, U&'[Chandan Maurya] It''s OK, not so nice but good, No north Indian food, some days they will give you 5 dosa in dinner which is not sufficient, so you have to go outside on that day for dinner. This pg is too old, you can find bedbug, mosquito also\+01f602,But one thing in other pg you have restrictions that you have to come earlier before 10pm or 11 pm but in omr pg you can come at any time\+01f601 even 2 o''clock also. On other side during Chennai floods i was their and they provided water and foods properly while in other pg they stopped providing food. At this time other pg''s are in underwater but the omr pg is only one pg who keeps safe all of us\+01f603. Thank you so much Omr Pg\+01f609', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:22.444142', 3, 706, 4),
(4276, '[Lasya A] First of all lets start with the owner... Parvin...nShe is the worse owner I have ever seen..not only as an owner.. as a person too.. I suggest not to keep any dealings with her property. Whether it is pg or flat.. Only she knew is looting from people. She doesn''t even know how to maintain a pg. U won''t be getting any wifi. Cleanliness is zero. She will do anything to get money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:22.445033', 1, 706, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4277, '[bhanesh gupta] The worst PG i have ever seen in my entire life.. No proper food, no maintenance , They will provide AC but not the remote. .. Washrooms are also in very bad condition.. The rooms and matrices are full of bed bugs.. It''s my advice please don''t stay there.. And also they won''t give the security money..In short bhut chutia pg hai dost logon... Isse accha to kisi chaul mein reh lena...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:22.445348', 1, 706, 4),
(4278, '[Rajesh Bommidi] Omr pg is the worst one in whole of sholinganallurnwater supply is very bad.nThey apply more charges than they say.nfood is worstnAdvance we pay will never come back.nthey care only about moneynnl suggest to see other pgs also which are quite decent', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:22.445874', 1, 706, 4),
(4279, '[dev babu] Worst place to live in , septic tank smell is filled in the rooms . Dont expect any maintainance . Dont get cheated by the 5* reviews, they are pg owners themselves. if you enter this pg you will come out with skin diseases and other health problems .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:22.446991', 1, 706, 4),
(4280, '[Kapilan KR] Very bad accommodation I ever seen... Poor decipline.. Poor food quality.. Unhygienic atmosphere.. 10 out of 8 people staying there have affected by skin disease. Because Room  was covered by lot of  insects ...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:22.447642', 1, 706, 4),
(4281, '[Baskar Duraisamy] Power problems, bad food, poor management, complaints are waste of time, also the rent will make u hesitate. EB bills - WHATEVER NUMBER THAT POPS UP IN THEIR HEADS. The onlyyy advantage being close to the bus stop.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:22.447954', 1, 706, 4),
(4282, '[Chanikya Devraj] Fraud peoplenThey will never return your advancennThey will cheat you , dont go for this pgnnThey are many other good pgsnnFraud people, cheating people They will never return advance They are very rude The rooms are very small, no ventilation, rooms are always under repair No proper swithboards, more insects and bugs Due to unhygennic atmospheres you will definetely get skin diseases in 10 days', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:22.44849', 1, 706, 4),
(4283, '[Vignesh S] Worst ever PG i have been . If there is a zero star option i will recommend that .nnCons:n1. Bathrooms are not clean and very bad smell .n2. Salt Water , you cant even use this water for brushing your teeth.n3. Food is very worst and you have to stand in queue for foods .n4. Atmosphere is very worst .n5. Wash basin full of clumsy and you cant even wash you hands .nnPros :nOnly positive is there is no advance amount .nnOwner parthiban will talk nicely but will not do anything for those who is staying there .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:23.018936', 1, 707, 4),
(4284, '[RAMESH M] Perfect pg hostel is providing third class quality food. No cleaning for once in a month also. I was stayed 4 months. Many cooks are changing in a week.  If 80 persons are staying , they will provide only for 50 persons. Daily 10 persons are not available food. They have to take food from hotel. Very bad experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:23.021396', 1, 707, 4),
(4285, '[Priyaranjan Mohanty] Budget friendly hostel. Their services are good. In this rent, no PGs are there.nnMost of the PGs are getting advance, current bill etcnnBut, they are not getting any advance, so, we don''t need to give any notice period to get back that amount.nnI suggest all to take this PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:23.022436', 5, 707, 4),
(4286, '[crusher 02] First this is Budget PGnnMr.Parthiban is Reply all the Call and Message as owner he is do his Duty GoodnnBut, the PG care taker is very Lazy person he  can''t ready to hear what you are saying he not even  work little bit..nnSuitable for,nnIf you are not ready to spend more money for accomdation and food this is good for younWho are not confidental in work or testing there work for first month as a fresher or temparory job it suitable for you.nWho are not expecting high class room.nWho are able to living socialy.nnNot suitable for,nnWho need high class livingnWho need privacynWho need high class foodnWho have to stay clean forever.nnOverall in my opinion for this budget, PG are will be like that only if you want more clean and perfect ,you have to pay more and search other PG ,it is ok for this budget while compare other PG in this surronding', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:23.023008', 1, 707, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4287, '[Prem K P] Food is very very very worst. Bathing water is like a beach water too salty.it is better not to take bath instead of taking bath on that water. Toilets are very poor and not hygenic.area is always with bad smell. Bus stop is near.wifi is good.owner will respect u expect that nothing is in that pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:23.023186', 1, 707, 4),
(4288, '[Manikandan Alagesan] This kind of worst PG I  never seen in any where in Chennai (bathroom, Room , dogs coming and Sleeping inside the hostel ,Salt water, worst food ,very bed small in the room and main important ambience very bad ) my humble request do not go to the hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:23.024172', 1, 707, 4),
(4289, '[Hajmeer] Poor food, poor restroom, very poor hygienic, and poor water.... And cost is too much for the service.. I never recommend this for u guys... U can get some nice pgs in this amount. Pls think twise before u enter there... Utter waste...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:23.025117', 1, 707, 4),
(4290, '[Jainesh Jai] owner will cheats you.. care full before giving cash to the owner of the pg... worst pg.. when you entered the pg you started geting bad smell from inside the hostel... dont go there . dont waste your money...nhe giving low price but the water supply and food is.. poor kindly go another pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:23.02623', 1, 707, 4),
(4291, U&'[Samuel Binoy] Never choose this pg,nWorst food and not properly maintained property.nStomach will get upset if you have food from here. I had to take pills for 1 week for my stomach to be ok. I just stayed here for 1 month. Had to pay Rs1000 as maintenance fee. I would have happily given 1000 if they would have maintained the property. The property looks like it doesn\2019t know what maintenance is. Attaching photos for reference.nCaretakers hygiene is commendable especially inside kitchen. Commendable in the sense you won\2019t feel like having food even though you are hungry , the view itself is enough to fill your stomach and heart.nnThe chairs at the dinning area was broken.As you can see in the photos.nHad to use toilet without light for a week. Even though we requested to change the light 3 times. Using mobile flashlight inside toilet is fun.!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:24.953413', 1, 709, 4),
(4292, '[Yoges Waran] Actually they are providing rooms for affordable price with three times food, I stayed in four sharing rooms with attached bathroom, it''s really value for money', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:24.953707', 5, 709, 4),
(4293, '[Sanjaiyan Ashokekumar] Good place and clean. Provide good response for the issue', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:24.953948', 4, 709, 4),
(4294, '[GIBU JULIAN] Had a pleasant stay. The owner is a very reasonable person and hears to  tenants queries . One of finest pg with best ventilation in kandhanchavadi . Decent food. It was perfect stay. Thank you.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:24.954129', 5, 709, 4),
(4295, '[Chandra sekhar Reddy] Very good PG. Friendly management. Located in prime area, near to kandanchavadi bus stop. Walkable to IT parks near by. Metro accessible.  I recommend it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:24.954306', 5, 709, 4),
(4296, '[Jay Bhagat] Thank you for the pleasant stay. The owner is a very reasonable person provides really suitable service for the tenants. It''s decent atmosphere in PG with daily cleaning service. Decent food. It was perfect stay. Thank you.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:24.954658', 5, 709, 4),
(4297, '[Ragul] Very pricy and not bad at all. Food is better than most of the PG''s', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:24.954922', 3, 709, 4),
(4298, '[SARATH KUMAR REDDY] Excellent stay, Clean rooms, good food, and friendly staff. One of the best PGs/hostels I''ve lived in. Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:24.955421', 5, 709, 4),
(4299, U&'[Tharun V M] I stayed in this PG for around 18 days in June 2024. Even though my stay was short, I had a good experience here.nnThe owner is very kind-hearted, polite, and helpful. The rooms and common areas were neat and well maintained.nnFood taste is average and manageable. Sometimes dinner would get over early, especially non-veg items around 9:15\20139:30 PM, so it is better to go a little earlier.nnReasonable rent \+01f4b0nnI vacated only because my office was far from this PG. Otherwise, it is a good place to stay. I would recommend it for anyone looking for a clean and peaceful accommodation.nnSpecial thanks to pg owner \2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:25.865971', 5, 710, 4);        
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4300, U&'[Ashfaque Ahmad] The worst PG ever; they only care about money, yet the service is terrible.nnThey cheated me; they took an advance payment of \20b94,000 from me but are refusing to return it after I vacated the PG.nnThey took \20b94,000 as an advance at the time of booking. After I vacated the room, they didn''t return the advance payment; instead, whenever I call, they insist that I first get two new people to join the PG, claiming they will return the advance only after thatnnDear Management,nnThank you for your response. I would like to clarify a few points:nn1. Notice Period: We spoke when I was vacating the PG, but at that time, you did not inform me that the advance payment would not be refunded upon leaving. Throughout my stay, I paid the rent and electricity bills on time; therefore, withholding the advance payment on these grounds is not justified.nn2. Future Commitment: Other matters or discussions regarding rejoining in the future are separate issues and have no bearing on this refund of the advance payment.nnI have always maintained transparency in all dealings; therefore, I request that my advance payment be refunded as soon as possible. I hope we can resolve this matter amicably and without any hassle.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:25.866228', 1, 710, 4),
(4301, '[PAMPARI SHRUTHI] Food was not good but maintainance, sunlight,airflow, and will be getting air conditioned rooms for reasonable price.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:25.86639', 5, 710, 4),
(4302, U&'[Pragadeesh Natarajan] I\2019ve been living here for the past 3 months (single room) and I\2019d say this has to be the best PG in OMR especially for the price you\2019re paying. It\2019s hard for a bachelor to get a better PG than this one in the Karapakkam area. My room was clean before moving and continues to be so with the help of the caretakers. Since moving in, the owner has been super friendly and helped me with everything I\2019ve asked for. He\2019s even asked me for feedback regarding the food they provide. Food is provided three times a day. It\2019s a mix of both south and north Indian cuisines, making it ideal for the Indian audience in general. It\2019s been super smooth so far and I\2019m pretty sure you\2019ll find this place comfortable and peaceful if you decide to move here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:25.86652', 5, 710, 4),
(4303, '[Bharath Dakshiraju] The PG has excellent rooms with attached washrooms. The food is quality and dishes are very good with various cuisines available. The rates are also reasonable and the owner is very cooperative. I would recommended this PG for anyone for looking for one.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:25.866684', 5, 710, 4),
(4304, '[Narasimha Murthy] I am not sure how this pg is still having 4.5 rating as most of the reviews are from the old pg owner u0026 old cook who used to prepare good andra food.nnI stayed in this pg for 4 months u0026 this is my honest review of this pg.nnRooms are good, cleaning is good but owner will not take any feedback for pg food not good and will not ask cook to prepare good food.nnFood is honestly not good, cook is very arrogant and does not prepare good food.nnCook keeps kitchen very dirty and by seeing the kitchen itself we will not feel to have food in the dining Hall, he keeps the prepared rice at the wash basin.nnThey mix maida in chapathi u0026 chapathi becomes hard like papad after half an hour.nnCook will be continuously eating vimal pan masala during preparing food.nnBetter to avoid this pg as you will have to pay rent u0026 eat food outside only.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:25.867002', 1, 710, 4),
(4305, '[Swagato Das] I really recommend this PG, who are new to Chennai.nThe owner (speaks English, Hindi, and other regional languages) will help you to settle down easily and will address all your concerns.nGood stay within budget.nLocated at Karapakkam Hot Chips Crossing, 2 mins walk from the Main Road, has Wifi, CCTV, 2 Wheeler Parking.nAll the rooms are well maintained, well ventilated with AC and NON-AC option.nHousekeeping service is regular and good. Every room has an attached washroom and the washrooms are cleaned every alternate days.nThe Food is home cooked food, mostly North and Andhra cuisines. 2 days egg, 2 days chicken, 3 days veg.nOverall 5/5.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:25.867174', 5, 710, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4306, '[Subhankar Dawn] Best thing about the pg is the food and the ambiance. The Owner will be able to communicate in most of the languages. Also the care taker is well behaved and resolves most of the issues before reaching to the owner.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:25.867569', 5, 710, 4),
(4307, '[Zafarul Hasan] Had a very bad experience wouldn''t recommend this PG to anyone staying thoraipakkam. Food was below average. No cleanliness and maintenance in the pg. Washroom was the worst, slimy floor and very badly maintained. Dogs keep coming near the utensils which are thrown out to be cleaned, the kitchen is messed up as well. They cut 1k from your deposit on the name of maintenance. AC is 10-15 yr old and two star so more power consumption and there was no cooling. At this price you can find better PGs nearby which are clean and maintained. Had to get out of this PG after 1st month itself', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:26.503581', 1, 711, 4),
(4308, '[Ujjwal Pandey] I stayed 4 months here it''s awesome memories , good u0026 quality food , clean and comfortable and budget friendly thanks to venkateshwara uncle providing quality food i didn''t miss my home in these 4 months .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:26.504635', 5, 711, 4),
(4309, '[G ABHAY DAS] The room, atmosphere, and cleanliness here are commendable. However, the food quality does not align with the rent being charged. Although complaints are addressed initially, the improvements tend to be temporary, reverting to the previous standards after about a week. Despite this, it remains a nice place to stay overall.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:26.507472', 3, 711, 4),
(4310, '[Sai Ram Krishna] I stayed 2 weeks and ill continue more to stay in my next visit and I loved the hospitality and food taste is like homely and I recommend to stay if anyone asksnOverall good to stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:26.508039', 5, 711, 4),
(4311, U&'[R Bala] One of the finest PGs in Thoraipakkam, located behind Chennai One. The food is genuinely good, and it''s a great budget-friendly option I\2019d recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:26.508279', 5, 711, 4),
(4312, '[Aniruddha Maji] Really good PG in Chennai for boys who wants to stay in Chennai for working or studying purpose. Food is really good and rent is also budget friendly. Weekly three times cleaning will happen and also you will get good water service here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:26.508472', 5, 711, 4),
(4313, U&'[Manish Kumar Yadav] Better than any pg in MCN Nagar, \+01f60bfoods are good as compared to other pgs, room cleaning 2 - 3 times a week, and daily use water\+01f6bf is nice. Siddu bro\+01f917 is very friendly and helpful.nHe returned the security money on time.nYou can trust my views\2728', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:26.508613', 5, 711, 4),
(4314, U&'[Vallavan Vicky] Good PG For Men\2019s, Neat u0026 Clean Rooms. Owner Sai is very Friendly. I am staying here for past 1 Year, Peaceful Location u0026 Rooms. Food is fine over all best place to stay like home \+01f3e1\+01f607', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:26.508793', 4, 711, 4),
(4315, U&'[pandiyan s] I had a very pleasant stay here and would definitely recommend this place to others. The rooms are neat, clean, and well-maintained, creating a comfortable and hygienic living environment. The housekeeping is done regularly, which adds to the overall positive experience.nThe food quality is really good, with decent variety and consistent taste. It feels homely and is served on time, which is very important for working professionals.nOne of the best aspects of this place is the peaceful and calm atmosphere. It\2019s ideal for both working individuals and students who need a quiet and comfortable space to relax after a long day.nThe staff and management are extremely friendly, approachable, and cooperative. They are always ready to help and address any concerns promptly, which makes staying here stress-free.nThe location is another big advantage, especially for those working in the OMR area, as it is easily accessible and saves a lot of commute time.nOverall, I did not face any major issues during my stay. It\2019s a well-managed and comfortable place that offers great value for money. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:26.994102', 5, 712, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4316, '[Karthik _Nck#07] PG was neat and good newly opened building on End of Dec 2025.nnPG owners and incharge are friendly and even consistently considered feedbacks from us.nnPros :nAttached bathroom in each roomnGeyser in all bathroomnWalkable distance from kandanchavadi , Perungudi.nNewly renovated building.nLunch is goodnFrequent cleaning .nFriendly PG owners/incharge.nnCons :nThe area which we are reaching out near to PG 200 - 500 meters alone road is not good.nIn Working days if you are in WFH is little bit noisy bcoz near by there are workshops, in weekends no problem.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:26.995559', 4, 712, 4),
(4317, '[Raj Kumar] Nice place to stay. Clean rooms, good food, and peaceful environment. The staff are friendly and cooperative. Location is very convenient for people working in OMR. No major issues during my stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:26.995844', 5, 712, 4),
(4318, '[Parani Tharan] Very homely u0026 neat well and good. Food also very homely. Totally best PG in kandanchavadi area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:26.99603', 5, 712, 4),
(4319, '[Nanda Kumar.V] The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and comfortable with a attached washroom and a geaser including all basic amenities available as needed, which is very convenient. The food is hygienic and tasty with a good variety. The management is supportive and responsive, making the stay hassle-free. Overall, PG is comfortable, value-for-money and I would definitely recommend it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:26.996593', 5, 712, 4),
(4320, U&'[Dp editzs 2.0] I had a good stay at this men''s PG. The building is new, so everything smells fresh and well-maintained. The rooms are neat and clean, and overall the environment is comfortable.nHowever, the main concern is the food. The food is not prepared in the PG itself and is brought from outside. Because of this, the timing is often delayed. Many times I had to leave for the office before breakfast (tiffin) arrived, and dinner sometimes came very late\2014sometimes after I had already gone to sleep.nIf the food timing improves, this place would be much better. Otherwise, it''s a great option for people who prefer a clean and new place to stay.n(Maybe also the best PG for people trying to lose weight! \+01f605)', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:26.997009', 3, 712, 4),
(4321, '[Deepak] One of the best PGs I have ever stayed in. Well established and well maintained.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:26.99728', 5, 712, 4),
(4322, '[S K studio] Everything is good and room service is best.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:26.997677', 4, 712, 4),
(4323, U&'[Sarathi M] Had a good and comfortable stay at this PG. The facilities and environment satisfied my needs well, and overall I\2019m happy with the experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:28.050923', 5, 713, 4),
(4324, '[Nishanth V S] Great place to stay with clean rooms and a peaceful atmosphere. Friendly management and a really comfortable experience overall!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:28.051179', 5, 713, 4),
(4325, '[Parthiban P] Good PG for working professional. Very close to my office. Owner is very easy going and friendly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:28.051457', 5, 713, 4),
(4326, '[sakthivel r] Feel Good HostelnFood is good u0026 Rooms are spaciousnVery well maintainednMust Visit', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:28.051639', 5, 713, 4),
(4327, '[ram kumar] Nice and peaceful PG to stay with delicious food owners are friendly and caring well suited within the budgetnWalkable distance we can get busstop', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:28.052265', 5, 713, 4),
(4328, '[Mohanraj] I Stayed In AC Room...For An YearnAC Cooling Is Good...nIf Any Repairs they Do Immediately', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:28.052473', 5, 713, 4),
(4329, '[Niranjan S] Good FoodnNeat and cleannFingerprint security access there so very safe place to stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:28.052859', 5, 713, 4),
(4330, '[Arunprakash Sakthivel] Good PG with neat rooms, decent food, friendly management, and good facilities. Worth the price', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:28.053028', 5, 713, 4);        
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4331, U&'[suriya] Amazing place to stay! The rooms were clean and well-maintained. Homely food with 24-hour water supply made the stay very convenient. The atmosphere was safe and comfortable, and I truly felt at home throughout my stay. The location is excellent especially for people working in Chennai One, as it\2019s within walkable distance. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:28.804912', 5, 714, 4),
(4332, '[siva kumar] I have stayed in PG for four months.nThey just informed late night we are stopping food for the next day. I haven''t seen such worst things in any PG. If we complaint about people literally stealing our food, they asked me be cautious and take food before somebody steals them. Shame.nFor electricity bill even though they have meter, they charge bill arbitrarily. They suddenly increase 200 rs without any reason.nThey charge for food, but if there is no food we should ask only the cook, not them. See they collect money but if any problem we have to speak to the cook.nnIf they make loss due to bad management  they will pass on this loss to the tenets. Worst..', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:28.805457', 1, 714, 4),
(4333, '[Hrithik 12A1] Myself staying in this PG. Homely food,good water facility and safe place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:28.806011', 5, 714, 4),
(4334, '[Sanjith Ram] Homely food .The first time I came to Chennai and found the food like the same as my  home and Safer place which feels equal to my  home and  clean and neat surrounding . Parents can feel  surely son in the safe and best place', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:28.806546', 5, 714, 4),
(4335, '[joseph kranthi] Room is nicenParking is availablenTV is availablenWifi is availablenWater is availablenFridge is not availablenWashing machine is not goodnFood is not good for Telugu people', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:28.806712', 3, 714, 4),
(4336, '[Akash] It''s all good when compared to other pg. Those who have given negative feed back are ungrateful people shame on such people.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:28.807347', 5, 714, 4),
(4337, '[Rajesh Sarkar] Food was not good but overall it was good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:28.807928', 3, 714, 4),
(4338, '[Tamilan 04] Good place to stay, safe environment, Homely food at good price', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:28.808317', 5, 714, 4),
(4339, '[Rupesh Tiwari] The most unhygienic PG... Its full of filth. There are cockroaches all over, on the bed, under the pillow. You have cockroaches crawling over you while you''re sleeping. I raised numerous request to the support to discontinue my stay but they would not let me. It''s been very torturing. I plan to file a police complaint against these fraudsters. When you join they''ll show you the best rooms and take the money and security. After you realize the filth, they''ll not agree to return the security. This is my email to them :nHi Team,nnAs I reported through the ticket and discussion with the support POC and property manager, I Forsee serious health threat with my continued stay at this property.nnSince day 1,ive noticed Cockroaches in the entire room. I''ve used hit sprays; I''ve requested the room service for pest control. I had emptied the entire room and had pesticide sprayed in the entire room. None of that helped.nnI continue to see cockroaches in the entire room. They are everywhere in the room, on the bed, under and over the pillow.nnI have been bearing this since day 1.The day before, I had a cockroach crawling on my ear while I was sleeping in the night. From the past two days, I''m feeling feverish and unwell.nnI admit that the housekeeping guys tried to solve this but it looks like a problem bigger than it looks like.nnWith the above said, I see this as a potential health threat. I don''t want to end up getting sick or seriously Ill.nnNow, having explained the above I would hold Zolo responsible for any health issues. With all these, I''m afraid I cannot continue my stay here in the property. I''m happy to look for other alternatives: more hygienicnnRequest you to review the above and confirm when can I move out.nnThank you.nnRegards,nnRupesh TiwarinRoom No 715', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:29.937032', 1, 715, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4340, '[Abhishek Gupta] Zolo is a big fraud by offering discounts in rental and then they will loot you.nWill not tell you about electricity bill. Will charge without any sub meter of your room. Approx 2k+ per bed, even it''s 4 person sharing room. Means one ac eats electricity of 8k+ per month. If you complaint no one will listen.nWill charge for exit 2950 in the name of deep cleaning, where as cockroachs can be found in each room.nThey will tell you first month 50% discount in rent, but month is calender month not 30 days. If you take pg on 25th of the month, discount will be applied on 5 days. Attachment will says everything, will not inform you on any hidden charges.nPoor way of selling the services.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:29.937272', 1, 715, 4),
(4341, '[Jeevan Akhil] Zolo Millennium is an excellent co-living choice for IT professionals and students looking for a well-maintained, secure, and hassle-free stay near the Sholinganallur/Perumbakkam IT corridor.nWhy It Stands OutnSituated right off the main road, it offers incredibly easy commuting access for anyone working in the nearby ELCOT SEZ or major IT hubs along the OMR.nThe rooms are genuinely spacious, bright, and aesthetic compared to typical, cramped local PGs.nThe daily housekeeping is consistent, the high-speed personal Wi-Fi works seamlessly for remote work, and the power backup provides complete peace of mind.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:29.937904', 5, 715, 4),
(4342, '[Nandhini D] The PG is good but price is so high. They ask advance amount before itself but when we vacate they return the amount very late more than 10 days. More food options are not available nearby the PG. They don''t clean the rooms. The old things of the previous member stayed in the room was not cleared by the management. They don''t provide pillows but mentioned in their in the benefits providing list. Their Wifi shows as unsecured. They charge very high  amount for PG and electricity. The fan speed in very low. They don''t clean the restrooms frequently. Hot water is not available only cold water. Food is not available in PG. If available, additional charges will be charged for the same. Insects are there in the bed which is unhygienic. Not worth for the high amount paid they can provide more benefits for this money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:29.938078', 1, 715, 4),
(4343, '[selvaraj palanisamy] This PG is perfectly located near Sholinganallur junction, making travel easy. The Wi-Fi speed is excellent, and the rooms are very spacious. With around 500 members living here, it''s a great chance to meet people from different states and cultures', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:29.938247', 5, 715, 4),
(4344, U&'[Google Guide SC] The biggest issue is hygiene of the place. There is a serious cockroach problem in the room, and it\2019s not minor\2014you can find them even on the bed at night. This makes it very uncomfortable to live here. Even after raising complaints, the issue hasn\2019t been properly resolved.nNon-AC rooms are also difficult to stay in, especially in Chennai weather. Ventilation and overall comfort are not great.nOn the positive side, the location is convenient if you work in or near Sholinganallur, and basic facilities are available there. But honestly, none of that matters much when cleanliness and living conditions are compromised.nWould not recommend unless you have a strict budget constraint or these issues of mine are fixed promptly and properly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:29.938724', 2, 715, 4),
(4345, U&'[AGILAN .S] (Posted on 13 Jul 2026) Not even a single star, only bed bugs and worst dungeons of insects under the bed and wood. BE AWARE OF THIS HELL OF A PLACE. I raised a ticket after 2 days of bugs all over everywhere but they was like scamming me and got me do nothg but have to spend 1 month in this hell.\+01fab2\+01fab2\+01fab2\+01fab2\+01fab2\+01fab3\+01fab3\+01fab3\+01fab3', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:29.938939', 1, 715, 4),
(4346, '[S RAJA] Balanced u0026 DetailednI''ve been staying in this PG for a while and really enjoy it. The rooms are large and comfortable, and the Wi-Fi is fast and reliable. There are around 500 members here, so you meet new people often. It''s located near Sholinganallur junction, so commuting is very convenience', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:29.939113', 5, 715, 4);           
