(4347, U&'[Learn Maddy] \2757Very bad experience. After vacating this hostel, they have still not returned my advance money. It has been more than 1 year now. Whenever I call them, they cut the call or do not respond at all. Extremely unprofessional behavior. I strongly do not recommend this PG/hostel to anyone.\274c Owner is very bad response..', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:30.794247', 1, 716, 4),
(4348, '[Zenith Z] Stayed here for 10 days, u can chill no disturbance Depends on the room u prefer. Owner is very sweet and maid is just awesome.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:30.79489', 5, 716, 4),
(4349, '[Jeyandran CM] Good place to live near navalur. If you''re working in a siruseri IT park then it''s good to be here. Okay with the amenities and food. EB is separate.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:30.795273', 3, 716, 4),
(4350, '[Santhakumar M] I stayed 1.5 years in this PG. Good pg for employees. Owner is very nice person. Some pg owners are torture the room people,but in this pg 100% freedom. The only problem is don''t expect tasty food.nRoom=8/10(some time room cleaning persons they not clean perfect)nFood= 5/10nIn and Out= 10/10nComfortable=9/10nWifi=9/10nOwner behaviour=10/10nRent=10/10nOverall I love this pg and roomates', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:30.795514', 5, 716, 4),
(4351, '[poovarasan.r Poovarasan] I have stayed here for 1 year and have experienced  the location of this PG is ideal. It''s close to public transportation and various amenities, making it easy for me to navigate the city and access everything I need.n1.Comfortable and Homely Atmospheren2.Clean and Well-Maintainedn3.Friendly and Helpful Hostsn4.Regular Maintenance and Repairs', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:30.795694', 5, 716, 4),
(4352, '[Kalam .C] please don''t join anyone because why I''m say that this is my personal experience ,  very worst food and after you leaving the pg owner didn''t refund your amount and the owner have worst behaviour', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:30.795858', 1, 716, 4),
(4353, '[Kathir S] Worst PGnFood is worstnFood is limited , if its curd rice they give only first time if we ask second time they will say one person one time , even if it''s   idly or dosa chapathi ,its 5 only ,nOwner attitude is worst , they will never give any respect', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:30.796018', 1, 716, 4),
(4354, U&'[Arun Kumar] It''s nice place to live..In my college life, i stayed in hostel.. There i really hate that foods... because it''s really worst(poori is similar to rotti)..but here i really enjoyed the food.This pg is very good for Tamilnadu people..i am working in IT company,my friends all of them told about there own PG..when i compare to other Pg it''s good for tamilans.. and one more thing i want to say.if you going to leave the pg then they will treat you badly.. seriously i experienced man.. particularly cook lady is there..she treat you good in the beginning..if she knows you are going to leave then \+01f923\+01f923 and some of the bike and cellphones are theft.after that only they said camera is not working.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:30.796182', 1, 716, 4),
(4355, '[kaku nagarjuna] 3 times Homley food,  wifi, washing meshine,  daily rooms cleaning, near by world trade, omr road, perungudi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:32.747622', 5, 719, 4),
(4356, '[Sudha Laka] Nice pg  hoomley food daily cleaning near by world tread omr road', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:32.74782', 5, 719, 4),
(4357, '[Ramana Arava] Nice pg testy hoomley food daily cleaning omr road near by world trad 3times food', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:32.748331', 5, 719, 4),
(4358, '[Status Saver] Good PG for Men, friendly owner, homely food, with all necessary amenities. Value for money', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:32.748636', 5, 719, 4),
(4359, '[sai dakshit] Nice pg hoomly food omr road perungudi', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:32.748814', 5, 719, 4),
