(4364, '[RockFort Packers u0026 Movers] I am staying 6 month for this PG, Homely Food, washing machine. Peaceful place. PG is  Very closed to OMR Road.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:33.641007', 5, 720, 4),
(4365, '[Ramesh kumar] Food, cleaning, maintaining, parking, wi-fi,  washing machine all facilities very good.very good response in the pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:33.641207', 5, 720, 4),
(4366, '[Muthukumar Jayapandian] I was stayed in the pg 7 montys.food is good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:33.64145', 5, 720, 4),
(4367, '[Dhanush Chittiboyana] Pleasant rooms and well going with no disturbances', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:33.641608', 5, 720, 4),
(4368, '[Kannan g] Room service and food is good in this PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:33.642001', 5, 720, 4),
(4369, U&'[Deva Dhan] Nice hostal good infrastructure nice\+01f44d\+01f3fb', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:33.642839', 5, 720, 4),
(4370, '[S Manikandan] Very good pg very good food very nice service nice', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:33.643244', 5, 720, 4),
(4371, U&'[Snehalata Chavan] I\2019m happy with my stay here. The rooms are well-maintained, the food is good, and the overall environment is comfortable and peaceful. The management is also supportive and responsive whenever needed. A good option for anyone looking for a comfortable PG at a reasonable price. \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:33.969588', 5, 721, 4),
(4372, '[Ganga Devaraj] Good place to stay with self cooking. Privacy is respected unlike other pgs', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:33.969991', 5, 721, 4),
(4373, '[Suganya Kumaresan] The stay provided a safe and supportive environment . Self cooking is allowednOverall a satisfying stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:33.970416', 5, 721, 4),
(4374, '[premi S rajanayagam] I have stayed since 2022. When we affected from the flood they provide us good food and place. If Issues were reported by us it''ll be resolved as quick as possible. Thank you for everything', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:33.97077', 5, 721, 4),
(4375, '[GUNAVATHI D] The  pg was very neat and clean ...is very safety and the food is good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:33.972344', 5, 721, 4),
(4376, '[Pavithra thara] The owner and caretaker was very professional and took very good care of me. Thank you for the support', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:33.973387', 5, 721, 4),
(4377, '[reshma raj] Safe PG to stay for women. Rooms are cleaned everyday. Public transportation can be easily accessed from this place. They will address to any issues asap.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:33.974117', 4, 721, 4),
(4378, '[Swati Dasgupta] I stayed there for 3 weeks and my experience is good. I definitely recommend this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:33.974407', 4, 721, 4),
(4379, '[Ashin V M] I had a pleasant experience staying at Stanza Living. The rooms are comfortable and the overall environment is clean and welcoming. The staff are polite and always ready to help when needed. I especially liked the convenience of having housekeeping, food, laundry, and maintenance services available. The facilities are good and make everyday life much easier. The atmosphere is friendly, and it is also a great place to meet new people. Overall, Stanza Living provides a comfortable and convenient stay, and I would happily recommend it to students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:34.837943', 5, 722, 4),
(4380, '[Ramya V M] My experience at Stanza Living has been good overall. The rooms are clean, comfortable, and well maintained. The common areas are also kept neat and tidy. The staff are friendly, helpful, and responsive. Housekeeping and maintenance services are convenient. The food quality is generally good, and the facilities make daily life easier. The location is also convenient for students and working professionals. The accommodation provides a comfortable and secure environment. Overall, I am satisfied with my stay at Stanza Living and would recommend it to others looking for a convenient place to live.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:34.838398', 5, 722, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4381, '[Arya] Tyler House gives you a true hassle-free living experience. Everything is well-organized, from housekeeping to maintenance. The staff is very polite and supportive. The rooms are well-ventilated and comfortable. Common areas are always kept tidy. The community is friendly and the atmosphere is peaceful. I would definitely recommend it to my friends coming to Chennai.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:34.839254', 5, 722, 4),
(4382, '[adxtya. _x] The location on Google Maps is accurate and easy to find. The rooms are recently painted and look fresh. The fans and lights are energy efficient. There is a dedicated work desk and chair for WFH. The water pressure in the bathroom is excellent. The dustbins are cleaned daily. The Property is very secure. The Property manager responds quickly on WhatsApp. The common fridge and washing machine are well maintained. Excellent service at this price point.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:34.840112', 5, 722, 4),
(4383, '[Praveen Pari] Awesome PG with excellent service. It is near to my college and bus stop so I can walk. Hospital is also very close for emergency. Transaction was hassle-free and done via app. Everything is systematic and transparent. For any issue we just raise a ticket in app. Technician comes quickly and closes it same day. Problem never stays more than a day. Very good management and quick response. Definitely recommend this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:34.840299', 5, 722, 4),
(4384, '[The Dragon] The property is newly constructed and very well maintained. All appliances like AC, geyser, and fridge are in excellent working condition. The bed and mattress are very comfortable for a good sleep. The deposit and rent policy is very transparent with no hidden charges. The management is very professional and cooperative. Guests are allowed with proper entry. The locality is very safe even during late nights. Grocery delivery is easily available to the property. Regular pest control and cleaning drives are conducted. It truly feels like a second home', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:34.840453', 5, 722, 4),
(4385, U&'[Sundararaj Devathunai] Greetings SirnI am a resident of your esteemed Stanza living, staying in Room No.0013nReally it is very excellent atmosphere to stay here and to work as well as to StudynI would like to express my views in the following aspectsn1) Stands First, is the quality of the food and every one of us enjoying the taste of the food in Stanza .Excllent ,Sir\+01f44cn2) In respect of hegine, it is very goodn3).0ther facilities provided for inmates like washing, Fridge etc is also admirablen4) In respect of electricity only, it is found every inmate facing enourmess consumption of electricity in every room. Normaly, in a room we have two or three tube lights and one fan. If we use the above alone for about 12 hours per day in 25 days a month,the electricity  charges  goes upto Rs.2000/ per month. In addition if you use A/C unit occassionally in a day, it increases another Rs.2000/ per month approximately. Therefore we presume that the number of units reading shown higher than the normal meters readings.This causes we find many of the students vacating from this Lovely Stanza Living, often ,inspite of we enjoy in other areas in this prestigious campus.Since most of the residents are College students,we humbly request to take some corrective measures to reduce the prevailing electricity charges to some extent and also to check the electricity meters reading.nI am sure that ,this will make the students to enjoy and to stay continuously. Again this will attract the student community and the I.T employees to join more and more and make this prestigious Stanza Living, the Greatest of all in Chennai.nHappy Stanza living !nExpecting a early corrective measures,SirnThanking you ,nYours Sincerely,nRoom inmate,nD.Sundararaj.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:34.840832', 5, 722, 4),
(4386, '[Adhilico] I had a really good experience staying at Stanza Living. The rooms are comfortable and well-maintained, the common areas are clean, and the staff are friendly and helpful. The food and basic facilities are also good. The location is convenient, and overall it feels like a safe and comfortable place to stay. Would definitely recommend Stanza Living to students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:34.841157', 5, 722, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4387, U&'[Adhithyan Ganesh] Stayed here for 4 months in a two sharing room. Had a very pleasant stay, responsive staff and quick action taken for any complaints raised. Had some drawbacks thoughnn- Roof access was denied suddenly to all residents making it difficult to put out clothes to dry as there was only one portable stand provided for one flat ( around 8 members )nn- AC would randomly drip water, resolved by placing a bucket but still was an issue nevertheless, fixed upon raising ticket and serviced in 3 daysnn- The rent is a bit too high, was paying around 15.5K every month including electricity charges even with a 4 month package discount, electricity bills were over 2K every monthnn- Tenants are allowed to have alcohol in the premises, Had 2 different roommates during my stay, luckily neither of them smoked or consumed alcohol. Zolo does ask you about your habits to help find a good roommate for you. Don''t know whether it was by this or just luck \+01f605', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:35.536107', 4, 723, 4),
(4388, '[python srm] Bugs all over the place. Sometimes even dogs comes in. No maintanence and cleaning. Too costly with no service. Any repairs takes atleast 1 month to solve. Manager as well wont pick the calls. There are other better zolo options available.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:35.537345', 1, 723, 4),
(4389, '[Rajat Sharma] The management here has been really pathetic, these images are the reality of Zolo Thrones property. Lift does not work most of the time, cleaning level too poor, no security, anyone is coming till room door and asking for money on name of donation, biometrics not working for more than a month, too many bugs inside property and property manager is worst - he is always having excuses in place instead of fixing customer problems. Your complaint tickets would be open for a month and you won''t get the resolution to your problems. To anyone who is looking for pg pls check around as this is not how it''s in photos. Ground reality is too bad here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:35.537794', 1, 723, 4),
(4390, '[Kishor kr. Das] It''s a good PG near Perungudi but one thing is the road is not good at all. It is located near the main OMR road but they have not built that road yet. During rainy days it becomes muddy and you can''t even walk on the road. But overall the rooms are good and it''s well maintained.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:35.538067', 4, 723, 4),
(4391, U&'[Joshua Js] Best place to live, I am staying here for 2 months and I didn\2019t face any issues, they will clean the room thrice in a week always quiet and pleasant.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:35.538397', 5, 723, 4),
(4392, '[Udit Tamrakar] In 2 months my review has been changed..it''s not worth it.. too costly goes till 12k per month..wifi doesn''t even work even after raising ticket for 3 days..plugs are very loose due to which charger plugs come keep hanging + they gave 2 extension and both don''t work..no security either', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:35.538564', 1, 723, 4),
(4393, '[Ram Ram] Nice place to stay. With good facility and management. Having near by access to WTC, SRP TOOLS, AND THARAMANI. highly recommend for the working professional', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:35.538681', 5, 723, 4),
(4394, '[Kushkumar Tanti] These buildings was so beautiful and so heavy cleaning come and stay the building the name was zolo thrones', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:35.538983', 5, 723, 4),
(4395, U&'[Siva Mani] Currently staying in this PG and the experience has been excellent. The food is very good \2014 clean, tasty, and consistent. The rooms are neat, well-maintained, and comfortable.nThe warden is supportive and manages everything properly, which makes the stay smooth and hassle-free.nOverall, a great place to stay. Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:36.53725', 5, 724, 4),
(4396, '[Karthikeyan] This PG offers a clean, comfortable, and well-maintained living environment with all the essential facilities required for students and working professionals. The owner is friendly, supportive, and committed to ensuring a positive experience for residents. Manager James handles the day-to-day operations efficiently, maintains discipline, and is always ready to assist with resident concerns. Caretaker Lewis does an excellent job maintaining cleanliness and ensuring that maintenance needs are addressed promptly. The overall atmosphere is peaceful, organized, and welcoming, making this PG a good choice for anyone looking for a comfortable place to live.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:36.53756', 5, 724, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4397, '[sampath vuda] This PG offers a safe, clean, and comfortable living environment with well-maintained rooms and essential amenities. The owner is friendly, supportive, and always available to assist residents. Manager James efficiently manages the day-to-day operations, addresses concerns promptly, and ensures a smooth and disciplined environment. Caretaker Lewis does a good job and providing timely support. Overall, it is a well-managed and comfortable place to stay for both students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:36.53781', 5, 724, 4),
(4398, '[Jafridh 220] Its nice PG, Clean and Tidy with regular cleaning people cleaning daily. Manager James very accommodating and helpful for all issues. Warden Lewis the best caretaker there could be. They also provide good authentic South Indian Food. They PG is located in a very chill place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:36.544022', 5, 724, 4),
(4399, '[Nitish k.k] Staying in ADITI  Premium PG is so comfortable and with facilities like Good South Indian meals, a cozy bed, regular housekeeping, and a safe living environment, making it feel like a home away from home.There is no water problems in the PG as well as it is easy to travel to many places. Since it is in a prime location near Sholinganallur. Within 300m there is a bus stop and 1km to places like Elcot( A Tech park). The manager and caretaker also being responsible and managing very well.Overall the PG is so comfortable and many bachelors can prefer this one.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:36.544516', 5, 724, 4),
(4400, '[Raja Gnanam] Had a pleasant stay.. Owner was approachable and proper south indian food.nGood hospitality. Overall nice experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:36.544697', 5, 724, 4),
(4401, '[Nandha Kumar G] I am staying in Aditi Premium Men''s PG for 3 months. They give 2 non veg in week, Food quality is too good, weekly house keeping come and clean the room and bathroom, what ever the compliant we rise manager james solve problem quickly, warden lewis take care of us very well', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:36.544808', 5, 724, 4),
(4402, '[Rakesh kumar Dash] Looking for good north indian pg near elcot with peaceful environment', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:36.544917', 5, 724, 4),
(4403, '[Surendhar Duke] very worst pg very very worst. electricity bill is very high and management is very worst in support and the cot is very worst and old and in room cockraich and many insect are coming in night very scary place to explore look', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:37.513896', 1, 725, 4),
(4404, '[akash rozer] Rooms are good(A3),..I stay there for 3.5yrs. it''s the PG with this much amenities, I never seen any other PG''s around this area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:37.514058', 5, 725, 4),
(4405, '[revanth Maddy] One of the worst PG in this area, Try some other PG.nFull smoke and drinks smell, AC mostly out of condition and really congested places. We don''t have place to keep our luggage, and what you are seeing in the pictures is not correct, They have only 2villas, That villas mostly occupied and they give tiny rooms in apartment that''s really a Dungeon. Try somewhere guys, Be aware of this scam boys.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:37.514253', 1, 725, 4),
(4406, '[Sasi Kumar] Nice vibe in this place. Rooftop available.nLocated close to bus station. Bed was comfortable. Large lockers provided. Plenty of common rooms, clean and fresh.nVery cheap compare to other place.nvery clean and comfy, staffs super friendly, fast wifinDinner was awesome daily', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:37.514395', 5, 725, 4),
(4407, '[saravana kumar] Best PG in the surrounding area for men''s. Rooms are neat and TV, AC and washing machine is available. But frequently washing machine will get repair. Food is good here except 1 or 2 days.. weekly thrice they will provide tasty chicken but that also limited. Rent wise reasonable only..', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:37.514629', 4, 725, 4),
(4408, '[RAMAKRISHNAN RAMASAMY] Awesome,.  Hospitality , Cleanliness and maintenance is so good . Food is better. U can''t find a PG with these ambience and facilities in the surrounding area other than NUS HOSTEL', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:37.514847', 5, 725, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4409, U&'[Vicky] The cheapest dorms are typically the rooms with the greatest number of beds \2014 and the least amount of privacy and peace. Hostels often have multiple room sizes so you\2019ll typically pay extra if you want a room with fewer beds. You\2019ll need to view the listing to get a better idea of the full range of price options.nThe food was excellent and so was the service.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:37.51502', 5, 725, 4),
(4410, U&'[04 Arul Ananth.V] I enjoyed a lot, the staff was always willing to support, the room was clean, spacious and has security lockers and a bathroom inside. Their breakfast was very good i was able to rent a bicicle and get museum tickets with them. Definitely will choose to stay there in my next visit.nit had a good reception, the people there helped me with some little problems i had. they\2019re nice and treat you well. Also they hear you if anything happend, or just any coment you had. The room is a little tiny but the bed is comfortable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:37.515223', 5, 725, 4),
(4411, U&'[Balu Rock] If you\2019re looking for a place to completely ruin your stay, this is it.nnManagement is extremely unprofessional and has no sense of how to treat customers. Any complaint is either ignored or met with rude responses.nRooms are overcrowded beyond limits, making it uncomfortable and poorly maintained. Basic facilities like AC struggle to work properly, especially at night.nBut the biggest disappointment is the food. The quality is extremely poor and feels like an afterthought. It often seems stale, lacks freshness, and is completely unappetizing. Hygiene standards in food preparation appear very questionable, and it is not something you can trust to eat regularly.nInstead of addressing these serious issues, management simply avoids responsibility and shifts blame.nOverall, a very unpleasant and frustrating experience. Definitely not recommended.nnHave some shame owner how can you provide food like this to eatnAnd smelly rooms to stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:39.17052', 1, 727, 4),
(4412, '[User0612] worst pg in this area. owner is money minded and not ready to return money. washrooms are not clean. rooms are conjusted and no proper maintenance. owner is very rude. no clarity of price. they will charge extra amount by saying random reasons.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:39.170912', 1, 727, 4),
(4413, '[Mahalakshmi] Detailed review after spending 6 monthsnnFood:nA lizard found in food. I immediately vacated after this. Same food being served to all Lakshmi Narayana Ladies and Gents PG.nnRent and Room:n500 to 1000 rupees costlier than other PGs. Room size is very small not like what you are seeing in Google. Literally, sweating and more hot. No hot or cold water machine. Just showcase to attract people.nnWifi and washing machine:nMost of the days wifi and washing machine will not work. Only one washing machine for whole PG.nnOwner:nVery good when you are in PG. When you vacate PG, you will see the true face of the owner. He will not return money, just rude behaviour.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:39.171093', 1, 727, 4),
(4414, '[Y. Varshini] Food is very good, comfortable stay , very clean and neat . Good security.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:39.171259', 5, 727, 4),
(4415, '[Vaishu Vijay] Worst, Girls don''t ever think about staying in this hostel.Rooms are very dusty, congested and unclean.food is very worst especially dinner. Electricity bill is like vary upto 400 - 500 even the person is not there on the room for stay in night only. No one in this room and owner won''t give clarity on EB. They won''t charge you correct EB bill.nCan''t step into the washroom, no ventilation, worst atmosphere and lot of mosquitoes in that area. When i asked the hostel people ''s they said there izs no protection for mosquitoes.nWashrooms are unclean, no proper maintenance.nNo proper tv connection  if we complain  the owner about tv he didn''t respond he is rude and don''t talk properly then keeps telling he will do it.nGeyser is not provided. And one more important thing as per norms there should be a lady warden but no lady warden will be available in this pg hostel everyone will be gents.ntank water is very dust particles  and unclean water  can''t  to use bathing.nThey will eat all money and take rent on time but while vacating will not give our advances and make us beg for our own money and update false records. Don''t trust 4.5 rating see all comments and take decision to stay in this hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:39.17141', 1, 727, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4416, '[tejasri padmanabhuni] Almost stayed for 1year.Owner is full of money minded. He will not return your advance money while you r vacating jst because of u got fracture in your leg. U will definitely find worms in food. When u look at surroundings that is the ultimately worst part. All waste collected from that area got dumped in dustbin present just infront of that hostel and cows will accumulate there for food and that place will be full of dungs, waste, , mosquito what not!... Will not suggest this hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:39.171566', 1, 727, 4),
(4417, '[Priya Pandey] I have been there for  and let me tell honestlynnSome rooms are spacious but washrooms are very small.food is average for Andhra people even for south indian people but for north indians, food is just wo..t.nnOne minust point is food is not available after 10.nnWifi service available but be carefull you can use that wifi only for watsapp, means speed is that much slow.nnNow some praisennSometimes owners are good.nnOh yes, not to forget to mention about prices. Money which they are asking, PG is not that worthnnGeyser is not provided. Ok i agree that in chennai, u dont need geyser but sometimes you need it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:39.171712', 3, 727, 4),
(4418, '[Milan Das] I have stayed in the PG located at Mettukuppam for almost 2+ years . The food served is good(Mix of North and South Indian food ) , wifi speeds are decent , rooms are cleaned regularly , the staff and owner is quite friendly . This pg is located in OMR , which is a prime location for IT employees. There is a gym , ATM , busstop , medical shops , grocery shops nearby .Would recommend this PG , whoever wants to stay in and around OMR .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:39.172092', 5, 727, 4),
(4419, '[HR Ashok] It is one of the best PG in Sholinganallur.Here we can provide all facilities including washing machine, good food.owner will treat you as a friend .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:40.762419', 5, 729, 4),
(4420, '[Hemachandra P] Nice pg,good food and rent is low cost compared to other pg and maintenance is good all facilities are available l''ve stayed for last 3 years', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:40.762619', 5, 729, 4),
(4421, '[KURAPATI VENKATARAMIREDDY] I have been staying in this PG since 1 year .this is excellent PG with very good ambience and hygiene food.I will reco5 this PG for who want to stay in PG''s.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:40.762784', 5, 729, 4),
(4422, '[Venkatewara Reddy] I have been staying in this PG since one year .it''s very excellent with good ambience,nice food and very friendly in nature.vey good PG over all', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:40.763465', 5, 729, 4),
(4423, '[Bhargav Satty] It''s a very good pg to stay .Homely food and affordable price.i will recommend this pg for every one who want to stay at this area', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:40.763789', 5, 729, 4),
(4424, '[srinivasulu rachala] I like that PG It''s is very good PG and beautiful location and good food', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:40.763955', 5, 729, 4),
(4425, '[Chandrakala lakku] Nice rooms and homely food all facilities available good pg for boys', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:40.764384', 5, 729, 4),
(4426, '[Praveen Reddy] Excellent for rooms food and all things available.nnExcellent pg for gents.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:40.764607', 5, 729, 4),
(4427, U&'[Muthuganesan M] Good rooms with pure water, Geyser, fan, bed and attached bathrooms. Safe for our belongings, especially laptop in room . Room cleanliness is fantastic... I personally felt good than anywhere in and around Sholinganallur. Owner is very kind, educated and humble to us . Safe for our bikes for parking is inside the compound, with CCTV cameras . House is just around 750m from OMR and it has all kind of shops nearby . If you looking for peaceful home like environment at decent low price for the facilities if you know cooking you can cook yourself everything he will arrange, I definitely prefer VJB House.Thanks vasanth Sir.\+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:42.049537', 5, 730, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4428, U&'[Sharvan Pranav] Stayed at VJB House PG for 10 months and it was genuinely one of the better accommodation experiences I\2019ve had. The place has a calm, quiet atmosphere that makes it easy to focus, rest, and unwind after long days. Something that is honestly hard to find in a PG.nnWhat stood out the most was the owner\2019s responsiveness. Whenever there were maintenance issues, they were addressed promptly and all at once. No dragging things out or making you follow up repeatedly. That alone says a lot about how the place is managed.nnThe overall vibe is clean, manageable, and hassle-free. It felt less like a temporary stay and more like a proper home base. Would recommend VJB House PG to anyone looking for comfortable, no-fuss PG accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:42.049721', 5, 730, 4),
(4429, '[Rahul R] I had a really good experience staying at this PG. The rooms are comfortable, clean, and well maintained. The owner is friendly and helpful whenever needed. The PG has a peaceful and comfortable environment for students. The location is convenient and easily accessible. Overall, it was a pleasant and comfortable stay, and I would definitely recommend this PG to other students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:42.049887', 5, 730, 4),
(4430, U&'[Eshwar eshu] I recently stayed at Vjb House and had an excellent experience! The rooms were impeccably clean, providing a comfortable retreat. The service was top-notch, Plus the location is fantastic\2014there''s a mall nearby for all your shopping needs. Booking was also incredibly easy. Highly recommend this rental stay for anyone visiting!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:42.050038', 5, 730, 4),
(4431, '[Nadaraj Thangavel] The PG rooms and booth rooms are clean and well maintained. There are no disturbances. The PG service is very good, and the staff are helpful and friendly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:42.050308', 5, 730, 4),
(4432, '[NUTAN KUMAR C V] Guests often mention that the rooms and bathrooms are kept clean and in good condition, with useful facilities. The property is appreciated for its calm atmosphere, strong security supported by CCTV monitoring.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:42.05054', 5, 730, 4),
(4433, U&'[harish kumar] VJB Men\2019s Hostel in Sholinganallur is honestly the best PG I have ever seen. The service they provide is outstanding, and the facilities are well maintained. From a security point of view, they have CCTV cameras installed, which gives complete peace of mind. The rooms are very neat and clean, equipped with well-functioning AC, washing machines, comfortable beds, and all basic amenities.nnAnother highlight is the food service\2014if opted for, it is truly next level in both taste and quality.nnAnd finally, a special mention to the owner\2014he is such a wonderful person. He responds immediately to any needs or concerns, and I have never seen this kind of care and dedication anywhere else.nnOverall, it is a perfect combination of comfort, safety, and hospitality. Highly recommended! \+01f31f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:42.050715', 5, 730, 4),
(4434, U&'[Dinesh J] Staying at VJB Men\2019s Hostel, Sholinganallur has been a really pleasant experience. What stood out to me the most is how organized and smoothly everything is managed. The hostel maintains high cleanliness standards, and the rooms are spacious, comfortable, and well ventilated with all the necessary amenities.nnSafety is clearly a priority here, with proper security measures in place, which makes daily life stress-free. The environment is calm and well suited for working professionals.nnThe food option is reliable and well prepared, making it convenient for those with busy schedules. Overall, the management is approachable and efficient, ensuring a comfortable stay.nnA great place for anyone looking for a hassle-free and secure PG in Sholinganallur.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:42.050885', 5, 730, 4),
(4435, U&'[Richard Antony] I had a very disappointing experience with Zolo Nook, Sholinganallur, Chennai.nThere were frequent water supply issues, and on multiple occasions, water was not available. Despite repeatedly informing the authorities, no timely or effective action was taken to resolve the problem, causing significant inconvenience to residents.nThe biggest issue, however, was the lack of transparency in the security deposit refund. I paid a \20b910,000 security deposit, but after checkout, I received a settlement summary with significant deductions, including unusually high electricity charges, without any proper explanation or supporting calculation. Despite repeatedly requesting a detailed breakdown, I have not received a satisfactory response.nWhat made the experience even worse was the behavior of the authorized property manager. My calls were ignored, and I was eventually blocked when I tried to seek clarification regarding the settlement. This level of customer service is highly unprofessional and unacceptable.nAdditionally, Zolo''s policy states that the security deposit refund will be processed within 3 days of checkout. However, even after 7 days, the issue remains unresolved, and I have had to continuously follow up without receiving a meaningful response.nOverall, my experience with Zolo Nook has been frustrating due to poor maintenance, lack of responsiveness, and the absence of transparency in the refund process. I hope Zolo takes these concerns seriously and improves its customer service, maintenance, and refund practices so that future residents do not have to face similar issues.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:42.798981', 1, 731, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4436, '[Maranlungbo Thiumai] I stayed in this PG around five years ago and later exited. Now I have come back to Chennai and chose the same Zolo Nook PG again. Compared to five years before, they have improved their services a lot. It is now one of the best PGs in the Sholinganallur surrounding area. The maintenance, facilities, and overall management are much better than before. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:42.799193', 5, 731, 4),
(4437, '[Nimalan] 1.Zolo Nook is a place of pure SCAM. Before initiating exit notice,they will as ask us to pay 4500 ,while doing checkout they will charge extra 3000 stating as exit fee,but if you ask why it was charged,they will tell super stories.nn2.After initiating the notice,I didn''t stay there for a month but got electricity bill of 1000 rupees without how much units were used,when I asked the manager regarding this,he said I don''t know.he said that some other people used to take reading of units.nn3.My brother and his friend,stayed in two sharing room,they also didn''t stay for one month after initiating notice .but they got 1500 EB bill each with no units mentioned.Same,when we asked manager regarding this,he narrated a super stories.nn4.No cleanliness is maintained there.if you walk in corridor,you can see more alcohol bottles and cigarate buds infront of each room.nn5.Totally 4000 rupees was illegally charged from us.If you ask manager regarding this,he will simply say,I don''t know.If you initiate a ticket regarding this in app,there will be no response.nn6.If you are a non alcoholic,this place is a pure hell for you.nn7.If you ask questions like this to manager,first he won''t pick up the phone,even if he picksup he will say like I will ask my team,but he won''t reply.later you will be blocked from zolo app.nnSTAY AWARE!! STAY AWAY FROM ZOLO NOOK!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:42.799383', 1, 731, 4),
(4438, '[Saravanan Shankar] If you''re looking for accommodation in a metropolitan city, Zolo Stays is an excellent choice. They offer professional and reliable services across India.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:42.799535', 5, 731, 4),
(4439, '[Mayank Dudwewala] Zolo Nook PG is a decent place to stay. The rooms are kept fairly clean and housekeeping is done regularly. The management is responsive and the staff addresses complaints without much delay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:42.799901', 5, 731, 4),
(4440, '[Navaneethan Shankar] Good stay for mensnHighly recommend for those who needs the budget stay with all top class amenities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:42.800155', 5, 731, 4),
(4441, '[Mars] Terrible management. They add random charges, overcharge without justification, and expect you to pay without explanation. Completely unprofessional and possibly illegal. Would not recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:42.800337', 1, 731, 4),
(4442, '[Vivek] Good pg for mens , iam staying almost a year .nnMaintanence are good , cleaning the rooms frequently, wifi facilities are good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:42.80114', 5, 731, 4),
(4443, '[Ganesh Amale] I have stayed here for 1 month My Experience as belown1)Regular Cleaningn2)Friendly Environmentn3)All facilities available near by such as Shop/stalls and food all.n4) Temple Near by 100 meter.n5) Washing machine/Geasyr/Drinking water/Food/Parking all available with affordable rates.n6)If you are from North side you have food problem because here prime food was Rice,idly,dosa and ones in week you will get Chapati/Roti.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:43.264563', 5, 732, 4),
(4444, '[Tufail Shah] One of the best PGs in Sholinganallur. Honestly, I would highly recommend this place to students and working people.nThe rooms and common areas are kept clean, and whenever there is any issue, the response is very quick. The manager is also a very good and understanding person, and he is always helpful whenever we need anything.nThe food is average, but considering the price they charge, it is definitely worth it. Overall, a really good, affordable, and comfortable place to stay in Sholinganallur(OMR).', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:43.265178', 5, 732, 4); 
