(4451, '[Narendra Chintam] I had a good experience staying at this PG. The rooms were clean and well-maintained, and the staff were polite and helpful. The food was decent, and the facilities such as Wi-Fi, housekeeping, and security were satisfactory. The location was convenient, with easy access to public transport and nearby shops. Overall, I am satisfied with my stay and would recommend this PG to others. in food variety and maintenance response time would make the experience even better.and friendly owner.....', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:44.170132', 5, 733, 4),
(4452, '[Chaitanya Palukuri] Excellent PG hostel...The premises are well-maintained, the food tastes good, and there is 24/7 water availability. The management is also very friendly and supportive. I highly recommend joining this PG...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:44.170445', 5, 733, 4),
