(4454, '[md haris hasan] The PG is neat and clean. Having all facilities like hot cool purified drinking water, washing machines for washing and food quality is also good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:44.170882', 5, 733, 4),
(4455, '[Nagoor Prema kumar] My experience at (Sri Yogi Vemana PG) has been fantastic. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and offer ample of space. The food is delicious and varied, and the staff is incredibly friendly and helpful. I feel safe and comfortable here, and it truly feels like a home away from home.nEspecially the food was surprisingly good The daily meals were tasty and hygienically prepared, with a good variety of dishes.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:44.171049', 5, 733, 4),
(4456, '[Manoj Rocky] Good pg and food super , whas room neetga untundhi , Bed sheets clean and  super maintenance in the Sri Yogi vemana PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:44.17145', 5, 733, 4),
(4457, '[Subbu Subash] Pg is very neat u0026clean rooms , owner is very friendly,food is good .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:44.171702', 5, 733, 4),
(4458, U&'[Munisekhar Sige] This Men''s PG is excellent place to stay located in peaceful place and cleanliness, maintenance is exceptional with healthy food as well \263a\263a\263a, thank you for offering the best in price compared to others!nnHigh speed Wi-Fi, 24/7 water supply, and security make it a perfect choice for comfortable living \263a\263a\263a.nnHighly preferred and recommended for others.... \+01f44d\+01f44d\+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:44.172061', 5, 733, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4459, U&'[Arsyan Zain] \2b50\2606\2606\2606\2606nnOne of the worst PG experiences I''ve ever had. \+01f621nn- Food quality is extremely poor and not worth the money. \+01f35b\274cn- The owner behaves very unprofessionally and is rude to residents. \+01f44en- Maintenance is almost non-existent. The entire PG is poorly maintained. \+01f3da\fe0fn- The bathrooms are always dirty and unhygienic. \+01f6bd\+01f922n- The bathroom is so small that it''s very uncomfortable to use. \+01f616n- Overall cleanliness is terrible, and the living environment is disappointing. \+01f9a0nnI would not recommend this PG to anyone. There are much better options available. Save your money and avoid this place. \+01f6ab', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:46.375465', 1, 736, 4),
(4460, U&'[Srinivasa Rao] One of the worst PG with small bathrooms very bad cleanliness and Scary buckets and Jug. I took bucket from one of roommate fornBath.nThey charged 400/- for 4 hrs stay.nnNot recommended for fresh up also .. better look for any near by hotel bargain Nicely.nnWould have uploaded images but haven\2019t took because of time..', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:46.375657', 1, 736, 4),
(4461, '[Saieaswer Tej] Room is okay. But the bathroom mug and bucket cleanliness should be improved. Drinking Water is only available on the ground floor. For daily stay without food is 400 and with food is 500. In other areas PG''s daily stay is 350/300 with food. Looks a bit costlier for me comparing prices for daily stay. The monthly cost is the same as other PG''s.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:46.375869', 3, 736, 4),
(4462, U&'[VIJAY] I stayed at this PG located in Sholinganallur and had a very satisfactory experience overall.nThe facilities provided are quite good \2013 including food, Wi-Fi, laundry services, and 24/7 security with CCTV surveillance, which adds to the sense of safety and comfort. The cleanliness of the PG is well-maintained, with regular housekeeping that keeps the environment neat and hygienic.nIt\2019s a suitable option for students or working professionals looking for a peaceful and reliable place to stay in the area.nnHighly recommended for anyone looking for a PG in Sholinganallur.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:46.376163', 5, 736, 4),
(4463, '[Sabarinath S] Wanna experience Homely stay and Food....This is the Right place for you. From Coimbatore to Chennai doesn''t made me feel that i am shifted. Comfortable Environment.nnProsn1. Safer place to live-in.n2.Friendly Environment.n3.Perfect Time food availability.n4.Regular Cleaning of rooms.n5.High speed Internet.nnConsnDidn''t find any till now...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:46.376659', 5, 736, 4),
(4464, '[R.CHINNAMUTHU SELVAM] Room is very nice and hygiene, safe and comport. Food is delicious, environment also nice,lot of space is there of onebed to another bed.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:46.376835', 5, 736, 4),
(4465, '[Manimaran Paulraj] Food and environment is so nice. Rooms have a lots of space between one bed to another bed', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:46.376984', 5, 736, 4),
(4466, '[Naveen Kumar] affordable price hyginic food stey very comfertable roomsu0026 bike Parking fesilities also very comfertable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:46.377591', 5, 736, 4),
(4467, U&'[Mayur Kumbhar] I had a great experience staying at Sri Sai Krishna PG (Green Branch). The rooms are very clean and the beds are super comfortable. It\2019s located perfectly near the IT area, making my commute easy. Friendly staff and well-maintained facilities', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:47.079869', 5, 737, 4),
(4468, '[Pravin Vengadessin] Excellent spot to stay in the Shollinganallur area. I wholeheartedly endorse this location to everyone, particularly freshers u0026 IT professionals. They offer high-quality Indian cuisine, both north and south. Mr. Naren is incredibly helpful and will always lend a hand whenever needed!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:47.080257', 5, 737, 4),
