(4470, '[Ejaz Ahamed Khan] Rooms are clean, food is good comparing to other PG, and Highly recommend pg near Accenture Sholinganallur', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:47.081879', 5, 737, 4),
(4471, '[Logesh V] I stayed here for past 1 year 3 months, Excellent maintenance, Excellent parking space, friendly owner, No entry/exit timing, safe place to stay, Good drinking water facility. I had made lot of memories with roommatesn-Logesh', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:47.083031', 5, 737, 4),
(4472, '[somesh] Clean and tidy stay ! Peaceful location, if you''re lill compromised on food , it''s a Good catch!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:47.083275', 4, 737, 4),
(4473, '[Arjun Goud] Good PG. Have no words. Staying in this hostel from past one year. Food is good with all facilities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:47.083434', 5, 737, 4),
(4474, '[VigneshJr] Good PG with all facilities. It''s peaceful to stay in this location. Owner is friendly as well.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:47.083967', 5, 737, 4),
(4475, U&'[AGATHIAN S] This isn\2019t just a PG, it truly feels like a home. I had a very pleasant stay at VJB. The cleanliness and amenities offered here are unmatched compared to other PGs in OMR.nThe food provided is very hygienic and has a homely taste. In many PGs around OMR, I\2019ve seen people paying around \20b9900 every month for electricity even for non-AC rooms. Here, the current bill is calculated once every two months, and residential rates help keep the cost much lower compared to other PGs.nThe owner is extremely supportive\2014any issue raised is addressed immediately. Maintenance of the kitchen, washing machine, RO system, and other facilities is done regularly and on time. This PG is also very safe and is located in a quiet and peaceful area.nHighly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:48.030295', 5, 739, 4),
(4476, U&'[M Karthik] Most Value for Money Apartment Top Class PG in OMR Semmancheri, SholinganallurnnThis is an heartfelt review from me who has been staying here for last 6 months...nnMy Journey to this PG started with a call I had with Vasanth Sir, the Owner of the PG and House Owner himself. Unlike other leased pathetically run PG all over the IT zone, this is a House owner run PG, who genuinely cares about his home and the way he treats his Guests/Tenants. First question he asks from you will be that if you have an habit of drinking alcohol or smoke, So he completely avoids someone with bad habits getting into his home for his home safety u0026 his guest. This is a completely secured Apartment about which i will be describing it down the line.nnBelow are the points that makes this PG the Most Value for Money.nn\2022 Securennu003e when you become the PG guest, every individual is given their own Gate Key\+01f511 , that gives the access to the staircase to your Apartment room.nu003e Every corners from Parking till the Terrace is secured with high quality CCTV camera for our safety reasons.nn\2022 Amenitiesnnu003e 5 star rated AC, Washing Mashine, Refrigerator which helps in lower electricity bill which we get once for two monthsnu003e Wooden Cot of good size with mattress u0026 pillownu003e Chair, wardrobes, and all required Top Class washroom u0026 lavatory equipmentsnn\2022 Servicesnnu003e Complete sensor based digitally run equipments, staircase lights and Parking lights run based on human movementnu003e Water for drinking and bathing is completely TDS checked by sensors and are tank filled by 24/7 run automatic sensor based water pumpnu003e RO Water Filternu003e Daily Room clean, washroom clean and completely mob in and around the Apartmentnu003e Every month end notification by owner on any electrical equipment faults to be repaired on the spot or any facilities to be done maintenance.nu003e whole week 3 time proper homemade good quality food except Sunday dinner is prepared for people opting extra for food.nnSo doesn`t this makes it Value for Money...nnYou will love to stay longer here as it gives a complete homely feel, so I know for everyone looking for a good PG for what you pay will expect a place that gives a good sleep and relaxation after an heavy burndown day from the work, a place with good water for drinking and bathing, and all required accessories for what you pay will be a Value for Money.nnI hope this genuine review helps you.nThanks \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:48.031128', 5, 739, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4477, '[Winston Maben] I stayed here for one year and it has been a fantastic experience. The rooms are spacious, well-ventilated, and cleaned on a daily basis. The kitchen is actually quite hygenic and good compared to other PGs in Chennai. The owner is incredibly responsive any maintenance issues are sorted out almost immediately. Highly recommend it to anyone looking for a safe, comfortable, and well-managed place near to Sholinganallur.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:48.03133', 5, 739, 4),
(4478, U&'[J K] I stayed at VJB Apartments PG for nearly two years, and honestly, it felt like a home away from home. From day one, the atmosphere was welcoming and comfortable, which made my stay really smooth and stress free.nnThe owner is very supportive and approachable ,I never faced any major issues during my time here. The place is well maintained, with good security, reliable water supply, and overall clean surroundings. It\2019s clear that they genuinely care about the residents and their comfort.nnI\2019ve made some really good memories here, and this PG played a big part in making my college life easier and more peaceful. I\2019m truly grateful for the experience and would definitely recommend it to anyone looking for a safe and comfortable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:48.032055', 5, 739, 4),
(4479, '[Swadhik Anandbabu] I had a great stay at VJB House. The place is peaceful, clean, and very well maintained, making it a comfortable and relaxing place to stay. The food was tasty and freshly prepared. The staff were very responsive and prompt in addressing any requests, which made the experience even better. I also felt safe throughout my stay thanks to the secure and welcoming environment. Overall, I would highly recommend VJB House to anyone looking for a comfortable, peaceful, and hassle-free stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:48.032345', 5, 739, 4),
(4480, '[Wesley Thomas] I stayed at VJB PG for two years, and it was a great experience. The rooms were clean, spacious, and well-maintained, with all the necessary facilities and no water issues. The environment was safe, peaceful, and friendly, making it a comfortable place to stay. The owner was supportive and ensured everything was well managed. Overall, VJB PG provided a pleasant and hassle-free living experience. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:48.033269', 5, 739, 4),
(4481, U&'[iam Dharshan] I\2019ve been staying at VJB Apartments for the past 3 years, and honestly, I\2019ve had a really good experience here. The place is peaceful, clean, and well maintained. The rooms are comfortable, and the management has always been friendly and helpful whenever I needed anything. After staying here for 3 years, I\2019m really happy with my overall experience and would definitely recommend VJB Apartments to others.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:48.033506', 5, 739, 4),
(4482, U&'[saravana adhithya] Had a really great experience staying at this PG.nThe rooms are clean, comfortable, and well-maintained.nThe food and facilities are good, and the management is very supportive.nOverall, a safe and pleasant place to stay\2014highly recommended!.i am staying 3 years', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:48.033634', 5, 739, 4),
(4483, '[lahar 240] Really secure and quite! You have a secure at entrance, so completely safe', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:48.907635', 5, 740, 4),
(4484, '[Harrish] Good food comparing to other PG''s.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:48.907834', 5, 740, 4),
(4485, '[RIO Giri] good for budget friendly ,npg food goodnGood response from pg owner', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:48.908011', 5, 740, 4),
(4486, '[SARON] A good PG and the food they provide are good. It is new experience and the workers take care ver much of all the things we needed.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:48.908176', 5, 740, 4),
(4487, '[Mallikharjuna Madduluri] The location is cool with neat and clean environment. The food quality is awesome with great taste.nFriendly owner', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:48.908334', 5, 740, 4),
(4488, '[Naveen] Hostel environment is very nice with good food and secure .best place to stay in Chennai', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:48.908484', 5, 740, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4489, '[Ajaysharma A] Hostel is clean u0026 secure .homely food .Nice to stay in Chennai', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:48.908649', 5, 740, 4),
(4490, '[keerthana srimeena] Good place stay  ,safe and secure. Homely food', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:48.908797', 5, 740, 4),
(4491, '[Shailendra Sen] Staying at this PG has been a wonderful experience, primarily due to the exceptional quality of the Indian food provided. The meals are consistently fresh, flavorful, and hygienic, with a great rotation of North and South Indian dishes. Special mention to the chapati, which is always soft and tasty. The dining area is tidy, and the staff ensures prompt service, making every meal comfortable and enjoyable. This PG sets itself apart by serving some of the best Indian food one can find outside of home. Highly recommended for anyone seeking a wholesome and satisfying food experience in their accommodation', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:50.421005', 5, 741, 4),
(4492, U&'[Ch Lokesh Prasanna] The PG is really affordable, making it a great option for students and working professionals. The food quality is much better than expected\2014tasty, fresh, and hygienic. Overall, a very budget-friendly place with good meals. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:50.422034', 5, 741, 4),
(4493, '[JAGADEESH KUMAR B] The maintenance is good but the food quality is bad not every day. Weekly twise or trise', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:50.422456', 2, 741, 4),
(4494, '[Chala Jagannadam] This PG is absolutely superb, the staff are friendly, helpful, full of local knowledge and go the extra mile. The facilities are cleaned daily, rooms are spacious, air conditioned, large lockers for the bigger backpacks, free wireless internet in the lounge with some computers also connected to the internet, with a large screen TVnnNice comfortable and food was really good. The management People made me feel like home.especially Srinadh BronnThe kindness of the hosts... they are polite and helpful people. And those idlis for breakfast were tasty.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:50.422888', 5, 741, 4),
(4495, '[santhosh kasula] It was a good experience staying in Omkar Gents Pg. If you are far from your family and need a family feeling you should definitely chose this destination.It was a calm and peaceful stay and also food u0026  maintenance we feel like homely.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:50.423483', 5, 741, 4),
(4496, '[venkatesh kondeti] One of the best PG that you can find in sholinganallur area for Telugu people as well as Tamil people. Food is good maximum of times.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:50.423939', 4, 741, 4),
(4497, '[UDAY KUMAR BANDI] Srinadh anna take a bow for maintaining that good environmental pg who take cares about each and every person living in the hostel with plenty of services with best maintenance....', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:50.424185', 5, 741, 4),
(4498, '[Kavin Muruganandham] Good Hostel to stay ! Worth for Money invested ! Boys never miss this beautiful place at any cost ! I am so happy here ! Understanding Owner!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:50.424418', 5, 741, 4),
(4499, '[umaid manzoor] The place is okay. The electricity bill can be very high, but the management is worse. The property manager, Gopi, initially told me that the full security deposit would be refunded when leaving, but when you move out, they make deductions. If you try to reach them regarding this, they will often ghost you.nnGopi also told us that we would not have to pay the common area electricity bill, but later they started charging us for that as well and then tried to apologize for the misinformation. If you ask for the original electricity bill, they will never provide it and instead send you an Excel sheet that they have prepared themselves. To make matters worse, people from other villas sometimes come and use utilities such as induction stoves and washing machines, which increases the electricity consumption and bill of the villa they are using.nnOverall, there were several instances where what was promised initially did not match what actually happened.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:51.685095', 2, 743, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4500, '[Pugazhenthy Thirugnanam] No transportation to that place. No roads. Room with bed sharing looks less spacious.nnCommon kitchen and washing machine for 4 rooms.nnKitchen appliances are very dirty and not in good condition.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:51.685474', 2, 743, 4),
(4501, U&'[Sk Asif Hossain] \2b50 2/5 \2014 Honest Review After 4 Months StaynnI stayed at Yube1 Sigma League, Siruseri, Chennai from June 23, 2025 to October 22, 2025.nThe villa offers 3-sharing rooms, and I paid \20b98,000 per person, plus around \20b92,000 per person for electricity \2014 which is quite high compared to other PGs or villas nearby. When I moved in, I was not clearly informed about the electricity charges, and later it turned out to be very expensive, which felt a bit unfair.nnAnother issue is the 15-day notice period before checkout and the advance deposit. I paid \20b98,000 as advance, but only received \20b96,200 back. They said the deduction was for electricity, which I feel is not transparent.nnThere is no food service, and Wi-Fi rarely worked even after raising the issue multiple times.nThe villa location is also poor, especially during rainy days \2014 roads are muddy and hard to access.nnOverall, the rooms are okay, but the pricing, management, and location are not worth it compared to other PGs or villas in the area. I would not recommend this place unless they improve their services and pricing transparency.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:51.685807', 2, 743, 4),
(4502, U&'[SAURAV PATIL] Yube1 Sigma League PG is a very good place to stay in Egattur.nThe facilities and cleanliness are well maintained. Rooms are fully furnished with all basic amenities. It is located near the IT park, making it very convenient. I''ll definitely recommend this for everyone \+01f44d\+01f3fb', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:51.686039', 5, 743, 4),
(4503, U&'[Chetan Singh] This PG has a great location and a pleasant ambiance. The caretakers are extremely helpful, and compared to other nearby PGs, the rooms and amenities here stand out in quality. Although the price is a bit higher and food services are not included, it\2019s still a solid choice overall for a comfortable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:51.686164', 4, 743, 4),
(4504, '[Rocky Singh] Everything is good also I can prefer to someone else who is coming to chennai they have their own app where  you can raise  query  if you have any. One more thing there will be no problem in rental facilities (for example you are going to take their pg/facilities on 21 of feb they will charge only for 10 days of rent ) that''s a good thing many of the pg owner charge extra like for half of the month because you are coming in between the month.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:51.686336', 5, 743, 4),
(4505, U&'[Yash Yadav] Pathetic Management I have been struggling from past 15 days to get back my advance and I am facing such a poor response and they are not even updating properly regarding advance I have to literally beg them for my own money for which they are doing so much of drama and it\2019s been 16 days now and I have not yet received my advance', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:51.686712', 1, 743, 4),
(4506, '[Anirudh Vannarath] The pg is well maintained and housekeeping is handled properly. Very peaceful with all kind of facilities. The only thing I felt is the electricity bill is high and the road to the property is a bit bad. Other than that the place is wonderful', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:51.686837', 4, 743, 4),
(4507, U&'[Balaji 123] I have been staying here for a month, food is excellent here, maintenance is good and the owners are really helpful in every way. Best PG Definitely would recommended \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:52.233268', 5, 744, 4),
(4508, U&'[Moneeshvar S] Very much satisfied with the stay, food and rooms are all good. If you are looking for an affordable and comfortable stay near siruseri, I would definitely suggest this PG.\+01f917', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:52.233635', 5, 744, 4),
(4509, U&'[Oruganti Ganesh] Nice place to stay near tcs siruseri, food and rooms are good, price is also reasonable compared to other pgs \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:52.233794', 5, 744, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4510, '[shiva kumar] Goodand best food compared to all others pgs, good and clean maintained rooms.  PG owners are very good and supportive.nI''m staying in chennai for more than 6 years. But this is the best PG i recommend', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:52.233997', 5, 744, 4),
(4511, '[Raja manogar] Best pg for boys in budget n good food and clean new rooms n beds', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:52.234316', 5, 744, 4),
(4512, '[Sreenu Reddy] Very good pg for staying and with good food with all facilities available', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:52.234485', 5, 744, 4),
(4513, U&'[Manoj Kumar] Best pg near siruseri, food is very nice \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:52.234635', 5, 744, 4),
(4514, U&'[B. Jagadish Reddy] Friendly budget and peace full place to stay u0026 good food \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:52.234786', 5, 744, 4),
(4515, U&'[Shaik Sajida] I had a wonderful stay and would highly recommend this place. The food was exceptional\2014delicious, fresh, and prepared with great attention to hygiene. The environment is clean, safe, peaceful, and eco-friendly, making the stay even more pleasant.nnThe staff were courteous, and the overall experience was comfortable and satisfying. The only minor drawback was the frequent power cuts during the night. As days pass on the issue has been solved by the owner, everything was excellent.nnThank you for the warm hospitality and for ensuring a safe and comfortable stay. I truly appreciated the experience and look forward to visiting again.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:52.958725', 5, 745, 4),
(4516, U&'[Kaviya] I had a wonderful and memorable time here. I still can''t believe how quickly these past 2 and a half years have passed. I have made so many beautiful memories here that I will cherish forever.nnI will never forget this place and all the support throughout my stay. Thank you so much, Ma''am, for everything.nnIf I get a job in this area again, I will definitely come back and stay in this PG. I will truly miss this place and everyone here.nnThank you once again for all your support \2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:52.959054', 4, 745, 4),
(4517, '[kanthi pothula] I had a wonderful stay here. The environment is peaceful, clean, and very comfortable, which made me feel at home. The food was consistently delicious, hygienic, and one of the best parts of my stay. The management and staff were friendly, supportive, and always ready to help. Thank you for providing such a pleasant experience. I would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable and welcoming place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:52.959248', 5, 745, 4),
(4518, '[Bhagya Sree] My overall stay at MSR PG was really comfortable. The cleanliness, spacious corridors, maintenance, and facilities were very good, and the warden, food-serving staff, and other people working there were also very nice and helpful. I would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a clean, comfortable, and well-maintained place to stay. Overall, I had a really good experience during my stay here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:52.959395', 5, 745, 4),
(4519, '[Nandha Devi.R] I had a good experience staying at MSR Branch 3. The rooms and common areas were kept clean, and the overall environment was comfortable. The food was decent, though adding a little more variety to the menu would make it even better. The staff and management were helpful and responsive whenever needed. Overall, it''s a good place to stay, and I would recommend it to others looking for a comfortable PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:52.959508', 5, 745, 4),
(4520, '[Bhanu Kambala] I have stayed in MSR PG for 3 years and I was happy to stay for these years. Everything is good, hostel owners, warden and the staff are always acknowledgeable and very helpful every time. Coming to cleanliness, safety and the maintenance was so good that''s the main reason I never had a thought to change to another PG. Jaya warden is good and always humble and helpful.Food is fine always clean and neat but if the taste can be improved a little then everything is perfect. I am moving out of Chennai for that reason I have vacated, Thanks for the stay and happy for the stay at MSR PG Chennai', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:52.959611', 4, 745, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4521, '[Thatti Poojitha] I had a very good experience staying at this PG. The rooms were clean and comfortable.. the environment was safe and peaceful...and the facilities were well maintained...The owner was kind and always ready to help whenever needed... Thank you for making my stay pleasant... I would happily recommend this PG to others.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:52.95978', 5, 745, 4),
(4522, U&'[reviews] I had a very bad experience staying in this PG.nnI would not recommend this place to anyone, even in difficult situations. Please don\2019t trust the positive reviews, as they are mostly paid and not genuine.nnThe owners keep changing rules as they wish, which makes it very uncomfortable to stay. The food quality is extremely poor\2014the worst I have had.nnThe warden\2019s words are not reliable, and when you try to speak to the owners, they behave very aggressively. Even though they are doctors, they show zero common sense and lack basic patience and respect while dealing with people.nnOverall, this is not a good place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:52.959925', 1, 745, 4),
(4523, U&'[Ayush Kumar Sard] One of the best PGs if you\2019re looking for a place near your office, especially inside SIPCOT. The location is very convenient and close to many offices, which makes daily travel much easier. The room cleaning and other required facilities are good, and the overall maintenance is satisfactory. The pricing is also quite affordable compared to other PGs in the area.Overall, a good option for working professionals looking for a convenient, clean, and reasonably priced PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:54.007373', 4, 746, 4),
(4524, '[Ananth Uma] Shifted here after a rough experience at my last PG and it''s been a relief. The power backup runs the full 24 hours, which matters a lot when you''re on work calls till late. Food is simple, homely, and actually hygienic - you can tell the kitchen is clean. Also super affordable for what you get', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:54.007562', 5, 746, 4),
(4525, U&'[Shaik Nabirasool] Overall, a good place to stay. The food is good, the rooms are clean, and the facilities are well maintained. The staff is also helpful and supportive. The only drawback is the power backup, which could be improved. Other than that, it\2019s a comfortable and decent option for staying.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:54.007723', 4, 746, 4),
(4526, U&'[Amit Pandey] This is one of the best pg u can get near siruseri.nThey maintain rooms well with good food as well.nAnd have friendly owner who will resolve all the problems which u face.nWorth staying \+01f525\+01f525', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:54.007869', 5, 746, 4),
(4527, '[BODDEPALLI VYKUNTARAO] Very good PG with tasty and hygienic food.nRooms are clean and well maintained.nOwner responds quickly and is very supportive.nOverall, a comfortable and hassle-free stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:54.008009', 5, 746, 4),
(4528, U&'[kali rag] This PG isn\2019t flashy, but it\2019s reliable. Clean rooms, decent food, strong WiFi, and quick maintenance. The staff actually fixes things when you report them. It\2019s close to Siruseri IT Park, so commuting is easy. No generator, but power cuts are rare and short. If you want a straightforward, well-run PG without drama, this is a good pick.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:54.008207', 5, 746, 4),
(4529, '[Vedant Patil] Well maintained PG for men. The new building is good. Food is better than rest of the PGs. No electricity backup though. Staff is professional, honest and straightforward. Overall nice experience. Decent cost with good amenities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:54.008352', 5, 746, 4),
(4530, '[Rajendran Rajendran] Worst PG ever. I stayed here for 4 months, and the experience was terrible. The food quality is absolutely pathetic rice is frequently undercooked, vegetables are often raw, and the Sunday biriyani is the worst I''ve had.nnThey claim to follow a menu schedule, but in reality, they cook whatever they want with no consistency. If you stay here for more than 3 months, you will definitely start facing serious food-related issues.nnThe hygiene standards are extremely poor and only get worse over time. This place completely neglects basic cleanliness and food safety.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:54.008493', 1, 746, 4);        
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4531, '[Saranraj (SaranMicky)] Best pg for men''s in OMR siruseari.nAffordable price and worth for money, no extra charges.nHome made food with good quality.nFriendly in charge and he made the environment into such a nice place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:55.52072', 5, 747, 4),
(4532, '[KARTHIKEYAN S] The pg location and environment is good.you can have tasty food here.overall it is worthy one for your money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:55.521106', 5, 747, 4),
(4533, '[Suraj Saha] You will love it here, 7500 for ace rooms and 7000 for non ace 2sharing...nice pg rooms with all sort of accomations. Close to Sipcot IT park.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:55.521601', 5, 747, 4),
(4534, '[NELSON WHITE A] GOOD PG FOR ALL AGE CATEGORY PEOPLE. DECENT FOOD , CLEAN AND COMFORTABLE ATMOSPHERE.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:55.521916', 4, 747, 4),
(4535, '[Batman] Good men''s PG in siruseri surrounding area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:55.52207', 5, 747, 4),
(4536, '[SAURAV JHA] This PG doesn''t have power backup. I won''t say that it''s food is healthy. The area is very peaceful with green trees around. It''s decent for the price range though the room is a bit congested.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:55.522284', 3, 747, 4),
(4537, '[Naresh Choudhary] #In a busy and hot city like Chennai, you would always wish to stay in a peaceful and greenery environment.n#After tiring work, you would wish to have a peaceful sleep.n#You would want ur place near ur office work, for better travel convenience.nnAnd I found all this in my Pg. Good peaceful place, nice owner, nice neighbors and roommates.nThe one thing I liked the most is the way the owner behaves with us and resolves our concern . He is a professional and a good friend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:55.52268', 4, 747, 4),
(4538, '[Shanmuga Perumal] I have never been so comfortable before staying in a pg. this one is the best men''s pg in OMR. I recommend this to all those who needs comfort and cleanliness. The food here is also amazing and the care taker Mr.Raju Bhai is really a very kind and amazing person, his quick response for everything is too cool!!! Best pg ever guys, trust me, u can never find a better pg than this 1.... don''t miss it guys.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:55.522835', 5, 747, 4),
(4539, '[vamshi koyyeti] I''ve had a wonderful experience staying here. The rooms are neat, well-maintained, and equipped with all the basic facilities. The food is delicious and feels like home. The management is supportive and responds quickly to any concerns. Great place to stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:57.92851', 5, 750, 4),
(4540, '[Neeraj Jyasta] I had the best stay experience at this PG. The maintenance is excellent, and the rooms are always clean, neat, and hygienic. The food is tasty and one of the best I''ve had in a hostel. Both the owner and his wife are very humble, friendly, and always responsive to any issues or requests. They ensure that everyone has a comfortable stay. I highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a clean, well-maintained, and welcoming place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:57.929157', 5, 750, 4),
(4541, '[Hemant Chaudhari] Best stay experience, spacious rooms , daily cleaning, Great food , on time maintenance, all necessary facilities are available in affordable price', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:57.929389', 5, 750, 4),
(4542, U&'[Anmol Singh] Very Good, reasonable and affordable stay, better than any other PG in the Area. Focus on quality and service, 24\00d77 Electricity available. Best PG for a reason. Really enjoyed the Stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:57.929546', 5, 750, 4),
(4543, '[Ketan Jadhav] Good food and great service! Really enjoyed the experience. The staff was friendly and attentive, and the food was tasty and served fresh. Definitely a nice place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:57.929828', 5, 750, 4),
(4544, '[Ananth Nalagangu] Best PG around here, Been there for one month and the maintenance and rooms were very good, food also very good, comfort stay with affordable pricen4 share - 7500rs / 8000rs (AC)n3 share - 10K (AC)n2 share - 15k (AC)nAmenities were all goodnBest PG for those working in TCS and Cognizant', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:57.929971', 5, 750, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4545, U&'[GOWTHAM REDROWTHU] Excellent PG with a neat, clean, and well-maintained environment. The rooms and common areas are always kept hygienic, making it a comfortable place to stay. The owner is very professional, approachable, and highly responsive\2014any concerns or requests are addressed promptly, which makes the overall experience even better. The management ensures everything is well organized, and the atmosphere is safe and peaceful for working professionals. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a quality and hassle-free stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:57.930118', 5, 750, 4),
(4546, '[Rhushikesh Vinod Khurpade] Rooms are maintained well and location is convenient. Food quality is good . Staff is helpful and responsive. Good option if you are looking for budget-friendly PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:57.930778', 5, 750, 4),
(4547, '[Muni Raja] I have been staying in this PG for the past 9 months, and my overall experience has been very positive.nnThe environment here is clean, comfortable, and well-maintained. The food quality is good compared to many other PG accommodations, and the pricing is very budget-friendly when compared to more expensive options in the area.nnOne of the major advantages is the uninterrupted electricity supply. While there may be rare unforeseen situations, power issues are extremely infrequent and well managed. Wi-Fi service is also reliable, and whenever there is a recharge delay, the owner responds immediately and resolves it without any inconvenience.nnThe management is very responsive and supportive. I personally faced an issue with my bed, and it was replaced with a new one promptly. This shows their commitment to resident comfort.nnA special mention to the owner, who is very understanding and approachable. During a time when I had a financial constraint, he allowed me flexibility in rent payment, which truly reflects his supportive and brotherly nature.nnThe PG is equipped with proper CCTV surveillance and security, so there are no concerns regarding safety or vehicle parking.nnAdditionally, the location is very convenient for me as it is within walking distance from my workplace (TCS).nnOverall, I highly recommend this PG for anyone looking for a safe, budget-friendly, and well-managed accommodation with supportive management.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:59.219147', 5, 751, 4),
(4548, '[Sabareesh kumar] Stayed here for a while. Rooms are clean and well-maintained. Food is decent and the environment is safe. Good option for professionals working near sirusery/Navalur..Balu bro is kind enough to care us.Thank you bro', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:59.219321', 5, 751, 4),
(4549, U&'[Sreejith Sree] Excellent experience staying at Balu Gent''s PG. The owner and staff are friendly and helpful, creating a homely environment. The facilities and food are good, and the rates are affordable. Highly recommend for a comfortable stay.\2763\fe0f\+01f44d\+01f3fb', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:59.219595', 5, 751, 4),
(4550, '[BRAHADISWARAN S] Good pg for fresher employees if you concern about the price, located in sri rampriya apartment so surroundings are good , near to sipcot sometimes rarely lorries may create traffic. Food is better compared to other costly Pgs but need to improve more as healthy food is essential for employees who leaves their home for work. Overall a good pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:59.219861', 5, 751, 4),
(4551, '[Venkat Ram Valluri] It''s a nice pg. Walkable distance from main roads and offices, it''s quiet and it has a park which is great. Food is good compared to other pgs in locality.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:59.219964', 5, 751, 4),
(4552, '[Manjunath K] This PG has been a very comfortable place to stay. The food quality is good, and the rooms are kept neat and clean regularly. The owner is approachable and friendly, always ready to help when needed. Having a park nearby is a big plus for morning walks and exercise. Another major advantage is the prime location, as it is close to many IT companies compared to other PGs, which saves a lot of commute time.nOverall, a great place to stay and I would definitely recommend it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:59.220069', 5, 751, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4553, '[Jude Francis] Good pg good atmosphere and also walkable distance ,every facility are available with heater and security also available 24*7', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:59.220629', 5, 751, 4),
(4554, '[battala venkataramana] It is a pleasant experience in this pg It is very clean and nice south indian food, surrounding atmosphere is good , daily room cleaning service, Management will be available 24 x 7 , if you need any requirements, owner is ready to resolve quickly', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:10:59.220752', 5, 751, 4),
(4555, U&'[Hari Prakash] I''ve visited Geethika Grand Gents PG and was truly impressed! \2728 The rooms are impeccably neat and wonderfully hygienic. Everything was spotless and well-maintained. Highly recommended for a comfortable stay! \+01f44d\+01f9fc\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:00.094616', 5, 752, 4),
(4556, U&'[Naveen Yadav] I recently stayed at Geethika Grand Men\2019s PG Hostel and had a great experience. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and comfortable. The management is friendly and always helpful. The food is decent and feels homely. Overall, it\2019s a good and reliable place for both students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:00.094826', 5, 752, 4),
(4557, '[chandu vathsavayi] The PG is quite affordable compared to others in the area, which makes it a great option for budget-friendly living. The electricity bill is fairly charged based on individual usage, which is transparent and reasonable.nnThe food quality is good and consistent. The management is very friendly, supportive, and available whenever needed, which makes the stay comfortable.nnAdditionally, facilities like a lift and power backup are available, adding to the overall convenience. Overall, a good place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:00.09533', 5, 752, 4),
(4558, '[Mark Ruffalo] This is the worst pg I ever stayed , owner only want money and short tempered he don''t speak he shouts only. He will show his original face when u r leaving. Max to max he will try to take u r deposit he don''t want to return it ,food is also worst max times I eat outside only.nnRooms are good that too 3 sharing and above . U can''t stay in 4 u0026 5. The rent high and he charges more per meter for electricity', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:00.095626', 1, 752, 4),
(4559, '[Paresh S. Shetty] Dear Sir, ( Owner )nnI would like to bring to your kind notice that the overall facilities at Gitika PG, Chennai (Siruseri), are good and well maintained. However, I would like to raise a concern regarding the food menu.nnCurrently, soya bean chunks are being served three times a week. Consuming soya chunks so frequently may not be suitable for everyone and can have health-related concerns. I kindly request you to please review the food menu and consider reducing the frequency of soya chunks to at least once a week instead of three times.nnThis small change would greatly help in ensuring better health and satisfaction for the residents. I sincerely request you to look into this matter and take the necessary action to provide healthy and balanced food.nnThank you very much for your time and understanding. I hope you will consider this request positively.nnYours Sincerely,nParesh', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:00.09574', 2, 752, 4),
(4560, '[PRANEETH REDDY PANDALA] I loved staying here! The PG is very clean, and the food is yummy. The people who run it are very friendly. It felt like my own home. I will tell all my friends to stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:00.095841', 5, 752, 4),
(4561, '[GAMES PURPOSE] I have been staying in this PG for the past 8 months. The rooms are clean, and the management ensures daily cleaning. The food quality is also good. Additionally, it is conveniently located near TCS and CTS. And CCTV facility is also available to ensure security. Having 2 sharing to 5 Sharing, both AC and non AC rooms available.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:00.095944', 5, 752, 4),
(4562, '[Tanala Pavan] The rooms are spotless, the food is decent, and the staff are consistently friendly and professional. It''s also very safe, conveniently close to my office and other companies, and surrounded by solid amenities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:00.096675', 5, 752, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4563, '[Palvai Vinay Kumar] This is easily one of the best paying guests (PGs) in the area. The spacious rooms and secure environment make for a comfortable stay. The staff is professional and polite, and I have been very satisfied with all the services provided. A major highlight is the excellent food and the incredible value for money. Its location near SIPCOT Siruseri is perfect for commuters looking to avoid traffic. Highly recommended', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:00.74646', 5, 753, 4),
(4564, '[raju raju] I had a very pleasant stay at this PG. The rooms are clean and well maintained. The owners are friendly and very supportive. The environment is safe, and all facilities like Wi-Fi, hot water, and regular cleaning are available. Highly recommended for students and working professionals!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:00.747286', 5, 753, 4),
(4565, '[Pavan kalyan] Very clean and well-organized PG. Facilities like housekeeping, Wi-Fi, and food are provided without any issues. The atmosphere is friendly and safe. Best place for working professionals!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:00.747544', 5, 753, 4),
(4566, '[shaik hussainbasha] Amazing stay experience! The PG staff are respectful and responsive. Security measures are proper, so no worries about safety. Comfortable stay overall.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:00.747692', 5, 753, 4),
(4567, '[Sai Gajula] The PG provides a comfortable living experience with well-managed facilities, timely service, and a supportive management team. Highly appreciated and recommended for long-term stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:00.747814', 5, 753, 4),
(4568, U&'[saran kumar] The owner is a good person, but in Room F4, Karthik acts like he owns the place and behaves arrogantly, even when issues are reported to the owner. Surprisingly, the owner himself does not act that way. The food is decent, but overall maintenance is poor. Even after informing the owner, he responds late and seems money-minded. Despite staying in the hostel for two years, there is a lack of trust towards long-term residents. The washing machines are unreliable, and you never know when they will work properly. When I decided to vacate, I informed the owner that I would pay day-wise for the extra week. He agreed, and since he owed me \20b92,000, I asked him to deduct it and let me know the remaining balance. However, he did not trust me and insisted that I pay first and collect the \20b92,000 later. I agreed, but due to a personal emergency, I could not return on time. I informed the owner about my situation and assured him I would pay before leaving. Despite this, Karthik entered my room in my absence, checked my belongings, and insulted me in front of my roommates. This kind of behavior is unacceptable and shows poor management.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:00.747909', 1, 753, 4),
(4569, U&'[Siva S] Three times nice food is served daily. WiFi u0026 Washing machine Is available. PG owner is very friendly. This PG is very near to Siruseri Bus stop. Overall it\2019s a good Pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:00.748342', 4, 753, 4),
(4570, U&'[KiranKumar Pammar] One of the best PG we got... Owner is very friendly and made sure we dint come across any issues... And   most important food..i loved food\2764\fe0f.. As cooks were experienced and used to cook by maintaining taste n hygiene..... Over all Best PG i would suggest', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:00.748515', 5, 753, 4),
(4571, U&'[technical space] I stayed at CNR Gents PG for around 7 months, so I\2019m sharing this review based on my personal experience. I would prefer not to reveal my identity because I don\2019t want to be contacted based on the PG records.nnI had a good experience here initially, especially with the food and maintenance, and that is probably why the older reviews and ratings are quite positive. However, over the past few months, I felt that the food quality and maintenance have gone down compared to earlier.nnI\2019m mentioning this only as constructive feedback because CNR PG has the potential to provide a much better experience. I hope the management will reconsider the current food quality, menu, cleanliness, and maintenance, as these are very important for people staying here for several months.nnAlso, to anyone planning to join: the existing ratings may reflect the experience from an earlier period, so I would suggest visiting the PG personally, checking the current food and facilities, and then making your decision.nnI genuinely hope the management takes this feedback positively and improves things. \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:02.073242', 2, 755, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4572, '[nagendra kumar] I stayed at CNR Gents PG Branch-1 for 5 months, and it was a great experience. The rooms are clean, spacious, and well-maintained. The food is tasty, hygienic, and served on time. The management is friendly and always helpful. I highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable stay in Siruseri.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:02.073481', 5, 755, 4),
(4573, '[Monishkumar A] Very disappointing experience staying in this PG. The internet service is highly unstable and frequently disconnects. Many residents have informed the management about this issue multiple times, but no proper action has been taken so far.nnIt is especially frustrating because internet charges are included in the fees I pay every month. If I am paying for internet service, why should I be forced to use my own mobile data due to the PG''s poor connectivity? This defeats the purpose of paying for the facility in the first place.nnThe food quality is also only average and does not meet expectations. Considering the poor internet connectivity, lack of response from management, and the need to rely on personal mobile data despite paying for internet, I would not recommend this PG to anyone who needs reliable facilities for work or study.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:02.073636', 1, 755, 4),
(4574, '[NITHISHKUMAR S D IT] I had a very good experience staying here. The rooms are clean and well maintained, the food is good, and the overall atmosphere is comfortable and safe. The management is supportive and responds quickly to any issues. I highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:02.073785', 5, 755, 4),
(4575, '[Naveen Vijayakumar] The management is responsive, and the location is convenient for IT professionals working in the Siruseri SIPCOT area. Overall, a reliable and budget-friendly PG with a pleasant living environment. And also clean and comfortable accommodation with good food and essential amenities', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:02.074033', 5, 755, 4),
(4576, '[Rashmika Mandanna] Good pg with good telugu food. 2 times chiken, time biriyani, freeze, washing machine and no sound pollution. Best for studies. There are 3and 4 sharing beds only so have to adjust. But affordable prices like 4 sharing is 8k and 3 is 9.5k with AC. But you have to pay the current bill.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:02.074175', 4, 755, 4),
(4577, '[Krishna Prasad] This PG has wonderful food quality and has a plaus point in food section if compared to other and having a proper room set up with the washroom and toilet and owner is also very polite and humble.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:02.07431', 5, 755, 4),
(4578, '[Dilip kumar] Excellent PG with tasty food, clean rooms, and great maintenance. Takes good care of cleanliness and provides a comfortable living environment. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a good place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:02.074444', 5, 755, 4),
(4579, U&'[Arun AN] I would definitely give this PG a 5-star rating. The food tastes really good, and the cleaning and maintenance services are excellent.nThe PG owner is an honest, straightforward, and genuinely good person. The chef and maintenance staff are also very friendly, helpful, and approachable.nOverall, everyone here is good and supportive. I\2019m really happy with my experience and would definitely recommend this PG to others. \+01f44d\+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:02.739096', 5, 756, 4),
(4580, '[020_Mohammad Raza Khan] Too expensive for the rooms they offer...and the rule of paying full month rent even if you stay till mid of the month is nonsense', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:02.739236', 1, 756, 4),
(4581, '[Kanha Sahu] For daily basis the price is 400 no food not electricity nothing is included.nnWhile for booking food also you have to contact someone who is staying there otherwise it''s same. If you are in a urgent need better look out for other pgs nearby', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:02.739493', 2, 756, 4),
(4582, '[Soumabha Saha] Rooms are old food is great, power cut issue is there', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:02.739599', 3, 756, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4583, '[Harish Bommana] Poor wifi speednTechnician services are poor....takes a lot of time to fix any kind of issuesnnFood is goodnAnd staff services are good as well!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:02.73983', 3, 756, 4),
(4584, '[Vivek R] It''s a good place to stay but the food was not good. Washing machine, wifi, parking area available here. Rent is a bit high in my POV, They broomed rooms daily, The restroom was also maintained clean. Providing a washed pillow cover and bedsheet only if we ask. Only a few non AC rooms are available here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:02.74007', 4, 756, 4),
(4585, '[Sri''s Space] Amenities are good. Unlimited, high speed, free WiFi, good water(No Salt water), geyser(Water heater), washing machine, and even AC.nnNeat and CleannnFood not good, lethargic attitude of PG care taker(Supervisor), food you need to pay separately, even if you stay for 2 or 3 days, You need to pay full month rent.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:02.740668', 2, 756, 4),
(4586, '[Revenant] Rooms are dirty , corridors are dirty , bathroom is not cleaned properly , also they give only two cupboards in 3 sharing rooms , and tells to share one cupboard between two roommates, no personal privacy. No desk - chair in room , if you want to use your laptop you have to sit in your bed ,  beds are also very narrow.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:02.741147', 1, 756, 4),
(4587, '[Aditya Sikarwar] Stayed here for 3 months and had a good experience overall. The rooms were clean, the staff was helpful, and the management was responsive. It''s a good PG for the price.nnThe only downside for me was the mess food. If you''re a North Indian, you might not like the taste as it''s mostly South Indian style. Apart from that, it''s a good place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:03.593897', 5, 757, 4),
(4588, '[Kanishk Sharma] I would like to suggest all the peoples to stay for a budget and clean environment. The PG is clean, comfortable,and well maintained.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:03.594156', 5, 757, 4),
(4589, '[Vinayak J Gowda] The pg is well maintained, safe and comfortable and the staff service really good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:03.594332', 5, 757, 4),
(4590, U&'[Mallik Arjun] Rooms are spacious and the PG is clean and well maintained. Overall it\2019s a safe and peaceful place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:03.594485', 5, 757, 4),
(4591, '[Ravi] Good infrastructure and Very Good facilities like Wifi, Geyser, induction,Daily House Keeping, Good Food  And Owner is Very Good Person, rooms are small', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:03.594591', 5, 757, 4),
(4592, '[Manohar] The PG is clean, comfortable,and well_maintained.The staff is friendly and always read to help.Over all it''s safe and peaceful place to stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:03.594688', 5, 757, 4),
(4593, '[GMReddy Gaddam] New building all facilities are good. Food taste also nice', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:03.595024', 5, 757, 4),
(4594, '[Karan Dhankar] Pg is good . Room is clean all facilities is there', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:03.595361', 5, 757, 4),
(4595, '[Abhishek Shelar] Most of the positive reviews you see here appear to be from the owner, manager, or their friends, so don''t rely on the ratings alone.nnI strongly do not recommend staying at this PG. My experience was very disappointing.nnThe facilities are poor and not maintained properly. The water quality is bad, and cleanliness is neglected. Rooms are unhygienic, and there were bed bugs, making it very difficult to sleep comfortably.nnThe food quality is also very poor, with limited variety and unhygienic preparation.nnThe biggest issue was getting my security deposit back. They delayed it for almost two months and kept making excuses, such as unusually high electricity bills and other unexplained deductions. It felt unfair and misleading.nnOverall, because of the poor facilities, bad hygiene, poor food quality, bed bug problem, and the unnecessary hassle of getting my security deposit back, I would not recommend this PG to anyone.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:05.644814', 1, 759, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4596, U&'[RITIK PAL] This PG didn\2019t even deserve 1 star. I stayed here for almost 4 months, and my experience was extremely disappointing. I tried to leave the PG in between, but the management refused to return my security deposit and pressured me to continue staying there.nThe biggest concern is the complete lack of security and no cleanliness in pg, there are no proper security measures in the PG. My brand-new ASICS shoes worth around 4k were stolen from inside my room, I did even placed them outside. There was no proper security system or accountability, they just give fake hopes.nnVery poor management, no proper security, no hygience food and an extremely disappointing experience. I would not recommend this PG to anyone.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:05.645104', 1, 759, 4),
(4597, '[BHALA BE CIVIL] A few words to share about Stay@ease PG. I have been here such a lontg time as a tenant. I have ever  come across any major issues while staying . Even small things are fixed at once with the help of management. Awesome PG to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:05.645531', 5, 759, 4),
(4598, '[masoodh sheriff] I had a wonderful stay in this PG. The rooms are clean, well maintained, and the atmosphere is very peaceful. The PG manager(Farook bhai) and owner are very kind, responsible, and always available to help residents. Their management and support make this place feel like home. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a comfortable PG stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:05.645823', 5, 759, 4),
(4599, U&'[iswar] this 2 star is also only for 7k rent for AC 3sharing and you will get all south indian breakfast which Is somewhat good other than there is nothing good about this PGn*no proper maintenancen*electric bill is too high for month one person has to pay 700-1000\20b9 and also one meter for 2 rooms.because the rooms are like 2bhk . they did not even tell about this when I joined . this is big scam they are doingn* water and bathroom is not at all good. mine is not attached so beside room persons are also using our bathroom. no matter how many times we gave complaint to owner. nothing happens.n*they just act infront of you like good like listening to your problems but nothing has been donen*they provide only little cupboards/almaraas for storage which is not at all sufficient .i forgot to take photos of it otherwise I will put it them alson* washing machines are very dirty only 3-4 are working that too sometimes some are not workingn*there are  so many PG''s near by which are far more better than this PG ofcourse those  PG''s rent starts from 8k to 10kn*if you see those 5 star rating and belive that you will became fool like men*my personal suggestion is take PG which are  on main road not inside sipcot', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:05.64603', 2, 759, 4),
(4600, '[Ajay B] I had a very disappointing experience staying at this PG. The food quality was poor, and the premises were unhygienic. I also faced a bed bug issue, which made the stay extremely uncomfortable. The owner was unresponsive during the vacating process and did not properly address my concerns regarding the advance refund. Overall, the management lacked professionalism and concern for residents. I would not recommend this PG to anyone looking for a clean, comfortable, and trustworthy place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:05.646196', 1, 759, 4),
(4601, '[Yathish K m] Along with three times food ,wifi and AC ,it is  really a wonderful PG Stay ease . Especially management is so cordial to every tenant.deservs for 5 stars', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:05.646576', 5, 759, 4),
(4602, U&'[Darshan Wankhade] Absolutely disappointed with this PG. This is by far the worst place I\2019ve stayed in.nFirstly, there is a serious bedbug issue, which makes living here extremely uncomfortable and unhealthy. Despite raising complaints, no proper action has been taken.nSecondly, there is clear partiality in the way residents are treated. If you are from North India, you may feel neglected or treated with less respect compared to others.nThe manager may speak politely when approached, but unfortunately, there is no real action or resolution from his side. On top of that, the building owner is quite rude and unprofessional in communication.nOverall, the management is poor, hygiene standards are unacceptable, and the behavior of the staff is disappointing. I would strongly not recommend this PG to anyone.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:05.646889', 1, 759, 4);        
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4603, U&'[Prathmesh Varute] I had a great experience staying in this PG. The owner and staff are very friendly, supportive, and always ready to help. Being away from Maharashtra, I was a little concerned initially, but this PG truly feels like home. A big reason for that is my wonderful roommates \2013 Devkumar Bharati, Saurabh Bhairat, and Kunal Kawate. Their friendship and support made my stay comfortable and enjoyable. The environment is positive, safe, and welcoming. I highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a homely place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:06.551483', 5, 760, 4),
(4604, '[Shravan Maram] I have stayed here for almost 5 months the food is very good and the owners are responsive .Highly recommended for people who are looking for PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:06.552106', 5, 760, 4),
(4605, '[Sourabh Mistry] Excellent Stay and Great Experience!nI had a wonderful experience staying at CNR GENTS PG BRANCH-2. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and spacious. The management is extremely helpful and responsive to any concerns. The food is homely (Andhra Food) and hygienic, and all the basic amenities like Wi-Fi, laundry, and housekeeping are well taken care of. The environment is peaceful and safe, which makes it perfect for both students and working professionals. I would highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable and reliable place to stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:06.552719', 5, 760, 4),
(4606, '[Lateesh Kathi | AP20110010342] I stayed in this pg for 3 months I had a good experience the owner is very friendlynnGood Things:n1.Roomn2.Large Dedicated locker for each personn3.South Indian foodn4.Food will be on timen5.Ac are in good conditionnnNeed to be improved:n1.Room Cleaning is done only once per week or two times.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:06.553138', 5, 760, 4),
(4607, U&'[Lakshmikanth R] I had a great 3-month stay at CNR GENTS PG BRANCH-2. The rooms are spacious, clean, and well-maintained. The management is responsive, and the food (Andhra cuisine) is homely and hygienic. With amenities like Wi-Fi, laundry, and housekeeping taken care of, it\2019s a peaceful and safe environment ideal for working professionals. Highly recommend it for a comfortable and reliable stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:06.553282', 5, 760, 4),
(4608, '[Amruth] Food will be fantastic for Telugu guys and rooms also not bad for that price', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:06.553382', 5, 760, 4),
(4609, '[Ravi Vavila] The PG is clean, comfortable, and well-maintained. The staff are supportive, the food is good, and the environment feels safe. Overall, a good place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:06.553569', 5, 760, 4),
(4610, '[BVS PAVAN] Good looking rooms,room are extraordinary and comfortable but food is sometimes good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:06.553721', 5, 760, 4),
(4611, '[remo Harish] what is your pg rent amount?', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:07.132221', 1, 761, 4),
(4612, '[Manikandan J] Nice hostel in navallur', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:07.132514', 5, 761, 4),
(4613, '[Sachin Satheesan] Nice pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:07.13282', 4, 761, 4),
(4614, '[Gunin Saikia] Beautiful pic', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:07.132978', 5, 761, 4),
(4615, '[Umesh Kumar Maurya] Nice location', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:07.133143', 4, 761, 4),
(4616, '[Muthugiritharan Muthugiritharan] Super', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:07.13338', 5, 761, 4),
(4617, '[Sheril S] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:07.133656', 5, 761, 4),
(4618, '[KIRON GHOSH] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:07.133826', 5, 761, 4),
(4619, U&'[Harshith Ammunnaya] I stayed in this PG for around 8 months. The room was decent and comfortable enough for daily stay. The manager is very cooperative and helpful whenever needed. The location is a big advantage as it has easy access to Perungudi railway station and is also close to Grand Square Mall.nI didn\2019t face any major issues during my stay\2014no water shortage and electricity supply was mostly stable. Overall, it was a good and convenient place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:08.382254', 4, 763, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4620, U&'[Aarif Khan] The stay here is really good and comfortable. The rooms are well-maintained, and the overall environment feels safe and peaceful. One of the best things about this PG is the rent. it\2019s very affordable compared to other PGs in the area. You honestly won\2019t find this kind of pricing with such decent facilities elsewhere. Definitely a great option for anyone looking for a budget-friendly and comfortable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:08.382501', 5, 763, 4),
(4621, '[Alamin Khan] This is a really good PG. It offers a lot of amenities, and you get a great deal of freedom.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:08.382676', 5, 763, 4),
(4622, U&'[melferd george] I''ve been staying here for a few months now and overall it has been a really comfortable experience. Definitely one of the best men\2019s PGs in Velachery. The rooms are neat, food is decent, and whenever we raise any issue, maintenance gets it fixed within a day.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:08.382884', 5, 763, 4),
(4623, '[Dabir Ansari] Best PG at a reasonable price. Rooms are spacious u0026 not congested at all.nComfortable stay u0026 Much better than typical cramped PGs.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:08.383116', 5, 763, 4),
(4624, U&'[Era City Stay] This place gives a very homely vibe and is easily among the best PGs in Velachery. I especially like how quickly they handle maintenance requests\2014never had to wait long.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:08.383396', 5, 763, 4),
(4625, '[Kamlesh] very good pg room and owner.nwe stayed in two sharing room for 3 monthes, the surrounding is peaceful and the owner is very helpful.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:08.383597', 5, 763, 4),
(4626, U&'[Siran Shork] Very nice rooms area was discipline finger print lock system in main door access \+01f44d\+01f44d\+01f44d\+01f44d\+01f44d\+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:08.383743', 5, 763, 4),
(4627, U&'[gajendranathan naresh kumar] This PG hostel is good and safest place to stay. It is located at main place as nearest access to Ashok nagar Metro station and Ashok pillar bus stop. They are providing breakfast, lunch (non-veg on Sundays) and dinner for days we stay, free Wi-fi is available, providing washing machine to wash our cloths and there is a wide terrace to make it dry. Western toilets are available and it is common. Daily it is getting cleaned and maintained properly. Individual and sharing rooms are available and the service providing by them (incharge: Prithivi) is really good. The rent is really affordable and can stay here like a home...!nnThank you \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:09.050732', 5, 764, 4),
(4628, '[Hanif Mio] This pg was good and comfortable room very clean manager friendly person', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:09.051051', 5, 764, 4),
(4629, '[RISHI .S] Nice Pg with Hygiene room and washing machine available', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:09.051305', 5, 764, 4),
(4630, '[SANJAY M] This hostel is on 100 feet  Main Road and very very close to Metro station. Very tasty and hygienic food. Immediate response from the Manager for any matter. Clean atmosphere and best infrastructures. Indeed best pg as per the name.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:09.05148', 5, 764, 4),
(4631, '[S.Dhanush] One of the best hostel in Ashok Nagar, Chennai.nnThey keep clean all the rooms daily, they provide RO water, wi-fi, Three Times Home Food and also, food is good and neatness is well maintained. Administration is well cooperative and helpful up to their extent. I feel like home here, I am staying since last 1 months, here all comes from various places, all are very friendly in nature. They had some greenery also.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:09.051641', 5, 764, 4),
(4632, '[Sathasivam Veerabathiran] Comfortable and budget-friendly PG with spacious rooms and reliable Wi-Fi. Ideal for students and working professionals in a peaceful environment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:09.051789', 5, 764, 4),
(4633, '[Vijaya Kesavan] A comfortable living space away from home featuring dependable internet, easy access to both the metro and bus services, GOOD FOOD.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:09.051945', 4, 764, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4634, U&'[Sakthivel.R Sakthivel.R] Sri Chakra Men\2019s PG Hostel offers good value for money, with a balance of comfort, security, and convenience. It\2019s a solid option for those looking for a clean, well-located place to stay, with decent facilities and food. The atmosphere is generally peaceful, making it suitable for both students and professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:09.052091', 5, 764, 4),
(4635, '[OM NAMAH SHIVAYA] One of the worst pgs in chennai.No words to explain the dirty and unhygienic pg. Washrooms are very dirty. Even rooms are too dirty once rain happens total became like hell. Lekages in room. Owner siddarth is a big actor simply acting smart, he only calls or meet us for rent. Remaining washrooms are too worst and not cleaned once in a week sometimes. There is no chance of giving zero start. Pls dont go to this pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:10.165119', 1, 765, 4),
(4636, '[Suhail Akthar] I had a great experience staying at this PG. The rooms are neat and comfortable, and all the facilities work properly. The food is good, homemade, and served on time. The staff is polite and always ready to help.nThe PG is safe, and the environment is peaceful. It is also close to shops and public transport, which makes daily life easy. I felt very comfortable and relaxed during my stay.I would happily recommend this PG to anyone looking for a clean and friendly place to stay.The overall environment of the PG is peaceful and homely. The other residents are friendly, and it is easy to live here without any stress. I had a wonderful experience and never faced any major issues during my stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:10.165832', 5, 765, 4),
(4637, U&'[Tharanya Bujji] Good rooms .nnI recently stayed at this place and I was genuinely impressed. The check-in was smooth and welcoming, with staff going out of their way to make us feel comfortable.nnThe room was spotless \2014 fresh sheets, sparkling bathroom, and all amenities worked perfectly.nnThe bed was very comfortable and I slept soundly throughout the night.nnI loved that the location was quiet yet centrally located, making it easy to reach nearby restaurants and transport.nnThe complimentary breakfast offered good variety and tasted fresh. The common areas were well-maintained and cozy, ideal for relaxing after a long day. Wi-Fi and hot water worked without interruption, which made the stay hassle-free. Overall, the stay exceeded my expectations \2014 great value for money.nnI would happily recommend this accommodation to friends and definitely stay here again!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:10.166018', 5, 765, 4),
(4638, U&'[Manikandan J] Everything here is good. Like cleaning, maintaining, and no Annoyance. They will allow the people who is working in a good  firm or a good coaching center. They''ll never allow someone who will always be Annoying. So no issues here. But parking would have been big. You can''t take your bike out before 10 am. My office time is 11. So 5 star I given. \+01f603 kudos for the team and keep it up the good work.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:10.166355', 5, 765, 4),
(4639, '[Ramanathan Saravanan] Money lotted place dont belive the ownernCheattingnPlace also dirtynPls carefull with eb billnCharging 15rs per unitnAnd no hot waternSome times you will get dirty waternTo clean wash room and your room lady will come weeking once', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:10.16673', 1, 765, 4),
(4640, U&'[prasanna kumar] Safe place, but if you wish to change pg or else if you wish to vacate after staying for two days your half month rent(\20b92000) will be deducted just for two days stay. Consider before choosing this pg and don''t loose your money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:10.166889', 1, 765, 4),
(4641, U&'[Claire Rey] Don''t believe the photos on net and this photos would have been taken ages back when it was first opened.. AC room has 4 sharing, which they will say because of corona pandemic they are getting Rs.2000 as The Advance amount which they will return when we vacate the room ( Nice comedy actually), but what actually they do is completely different. When you first call them, they will exaggerate about their PG as ELITE PG, which is again an LOL, no Elite ones, but it just looks like a crooked placed. They will say that the guests who are staying there are all only Elite people''s, \+01f923. The room rent which they say is Rs.4000 ( without food ) + 2000 advance separately. They won''t talk about the AC EB charge then. When you vacate the room that time they will ask you to check the EB meter and tell them the reading with which they will ask you by 4 sharing splitup charge, which will come around Rs.1300 to 1400 per person, think of the charges they are scamming here, cause all the roomates are officials and they won''t be staying there for the whole day, only at night they will spend time there for that they will charge you that much amount. One of a roomate who took room for not even18 days or so, they charged him the whole Rs.4000 rent as well as the EB charge of 1000+ saying that''s the splitup charge of 4 sharing, such a fradulents they are. And one more thing you have to go interior to find this PG which has transportation difficulties from the main road, and also for food you have to go far from the place. If you have bike, then it''s ok. But over all they won''t return your advance payment of Rs.2000, and they will not be reasonable beings. Things which you keep at your room, you have to be careful and if anything goes missing they won''t respond, beware of your roomates. Strongly suggest NOT TO GO THERE.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:10.166995', 1, 765, 4);     
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4642, '[Bari Basaiawmoit] Stayed there for 2 months. It''s decent and good. For someone who wants to stay there if your work place is nearby this would be the best choice. Rent is reasonable. Neighborhood Is peaceful.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:10.167389', 5, 765, 4),
(4643, '[Sulthan Asfersha] Don''t trust the photos. They have 8 sharing rooms falsely advertised as 3 sharing. Also the conditions of the rooms are beyond terrifying. They advertise with old photos. No maintenance have been done to the rooms and they look horrible and smell horrible as well.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:10.614175', 1, 766, 4),
(4644, '[S. Mohamed Majith] It''s looking photo''s will be better than I reached i did''t expect than pg but not satisfied with me ....', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:10.614634', 1, 766, 4),
(4645, '[Prabagaran T] Neat and clean pg with friendly manager, and also near to the Koyambedu bus stand  it helps easy to access the bus', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:10.614822', 5, 766, 4),
(4646, U&'[Prabhu 5115] This pg is very nicen*Clean roomsn*Windows air facilityn*Anytime Water facilityn*Washing machinen*5G WiFi servicen* Large clothes dryer spacen*Parking facilityn*24\00d77 camera facilitynSo this room are  stay for like our home', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:10.615096', 5, 766, 4),
(4647, '[Azhar] Nice pg to staying and worth for money clean and neat', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:10.615414', 5, 766, 4),
(4648, '[BALAMANICKAM S] I''m living here more than 1 year, good environment. Decent food, regular maintenance cleaning, good parking facility. Good to stay here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:10.615596', 5, 766, 4),
(4649, '[Muruganantham Ganesan] Clean and Spacious Rooms*: The hostel''s rooms have been praised for their cleanliness and spaciousness, making  an excellent choice for those looking for a comfortable stay.nnBudget-Friendly Prices*: The hostel''s prices have been praised for being budget-friendly, making it an excellent choice for students and working professionals looking for affordable accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:10.615752', 5, 766, 4),
(4650, '[SACHIN M] It''s an amazing experience i had in this pg. affordable price and good quality of food.better place for long time staying working professional and students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:10.615901', 5, 766, 4),
(4651, '[naresh babu] Excellent PG for Proffesionals/Students, Even if you have any issues they''ll resolve it immediately', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:11.103492', 5, 767, 4),
(4652, U&'[Saravana Kumar] I recently stayed at MenA PG, and it was truly a delightful experience. The management is top-notch, ensuring a smooth and comfortable stay. The impeccable hygiene standards were evident throughout the premises. The food was not only delicious but also prepared with care. What stood out the most, however, was the warmth of the staff \2013 their friendliness made me feel right at home. Highly recommend this PG for a welcoming and enjoyable stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:11.103672', 5, 767, 4),
(4653, '[Kc Babu] The best PG in all aspect. Super maintenence. Excellent amenities. Very good location and courteous Management and staff. I recommend this PG as my home away from home', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:11.103827', 5, 767, 4),
(4654, '[Thota Naveen] I stayed in this PG for six months   The way they maintain the PG is much appreciable  Amenities provided are brand new  Neat and clean  Reasonable price  Very Very decent  Daily house keeping  I recommend this PG for every one who is looking for good PG in and around Saidapet', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:11.10397', 5, 767, 4),
(4655, '[Elumalai Sadaiyandi] Excellent PG in Saidapet  very very neat and clean  Amenities provided are great  I feel this as my second home. Management and staff are maintaining this PG as an hygienic one.  Suitable for working professional and students', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:11.104125', 5, 767, 4),
(4656, '[senthil sentinel] I am staying in this PG for the past 9 months. I express my sincere thanks to the Management and staff for their outstanding maintenance. The PG is located in the heart of the city where from we can go to any place in Chennai. Nearby Anna University, Olympia Park, Multi speciality hospital in Guindy. Suitable place for every one', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:11.104269', 5, 767, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4657, '[Varadarajulu Senthamarai Kannan] The best PG I have stayed in Chennai. Amenities provided were branded and newly installed. I recommend this PG for working professional and students', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:11.10443', 5, 767, 4),
(4658, '[Manickam Gopu] Great PG in saidapet and guindy.  I stayed more than a year.  I enjoyed in this PG by means of brand new amenities provided. Sheer comfort and excellent maintenance. Suitable for working professional and student', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:11.104575', 5, 767, 4),
(4659, '[Gangster World] This is the worst hostel PG I have ever stayed in. The place is so old, there is no space to keep our clothes and other things, we have to keep everything on our bed, the bed itself is not safe, the place is not clean, they don''t have hygiene. I have shared the recent photos of everything I have mentioned.nnThey don''t even do maintenance. In my room, there are things that were used by others who stayed in that room years back and the hostel owners don''t even have the commitment to clean it.nnThey have provided a locker that is really old and rusty. If you keep anything inside, that thing will get damaged. The food is not at all good. They have a poor menu and that''s not even tasty and clean. These people just want money.nnTHINK TWICE OR MORE BEFORE COMING TO THIS PLACE', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:11.684017', 1, 768, 4),
(4660, '[Jayakumar K] Great place reasonable rent. Food is also available both veg and non veg.nEasy access to both bus and metro', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:11.684345', 5, 768, 4),
(4661, '[Raja Ram] I have stayed here nearly 7 months for my studies.  Good maintains and rooms and restroom weekly three times clean. Food very tasty and feel the home food. Friendly approach from management... it was a nice experience on the whole....', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:11.684588', 5, 768, 4),
(4662, U&'[Thomas Leo] I have stayed here nearly 8 months for my studies.. the place is so comfortable for me , all were so sweet and friendly. They provide lockers, cart and pillow for every individual.. Food was homely , the rooms were neat , bathrooms were clean and they clean it everyday, 24\00d77 water supply...it was a nice experience on the whole.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:11.684761', 5, 768, 4),
(4663, '[Umapathi] Affordable price and nice place to stay all facilities available near by hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:11.684912', 5, 768, 4),
(4664, '[Kumaresan V] Friendly budget and homely food nice place to stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:11.685122', 5, 768, 4),
(4665, '[Rajapandian K] Good maintains and well clean of the Rooms u0026 restrooms, food taste like a home made, I''m very liked for friendly approaches from management. Rent amount is fully worth for this facilities', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:11.685275', 5, 768, 4),
(4666, '[saravanan saran] I have stayed at last 5 months I''m very happy to stay this PG very good maintain and food qualitynEnvironment also very clean on this Covid timesnWater service and power supply and they have backup for water and power supply alsonHappy to share this...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:11.685447', 5, 768, 4),
(4667, '[Pugazhenthi R] Best pg, owner is so friendly, gave my advance immediately while vacating the pg, the only problem is bathroom, you have to share the bathroom with 12 persons, and sometimes water shortages in the morning. But in 6 sharing room, there is no problem. Affordable price. Owner is friendly nature.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:12.399931', 5, 769, 4),
(4668, '[ASHWINSRIDHAR .S] It is best for those who are all searching for budget friendly rooms with friendly environment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:12.400464', 4, 769, 4),
(4669, '[Sakthi shanmugam] Very good pg in North Chennai. Maintenance is so good. For the working professionals, Sumathi illam PG is the good choice. Attach bathroom, cctv camera, good parking and all other facilities are maintaining as well as good.  Kind heart owner to take all the responsibility and care those who stay in the PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:12.400751', 5, 769, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4670, '[Alex K] This is the worst hostel I have ever seen in my life. There is no security for our belongings here. The owner of this hostel does not care much about it (he says these people are beggars, what diamonds are they going to keep).nWashing machine is very poor conditionnWifi is not working properly.The people staying in the hostel are often talked down to and treated badly. The money they are given for this is not worth it. There is no proper maintenance. The toilets are in a very bad condition. If someone leaves the hostel, because they do not like it, after they leave, the owner curses them and talks badly about them. Many people face this here, but it is not visible from the outside.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:12.401009', 1, 769, 4),
(4671, '[CHANDRA PRAKASH] Owner is a good person. Good behaviour. He keeps visiting the place regularly and makes sure the cleanliness. You get bus stand nearby. The only negative thing I found is that Rooms has at least 5-6 sharing. You don''t get private space.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:12.401326', 4, 769, 4),
(4672, '[Subha Mohan Selva Sankar] Very Convenient and Comfortable place to stay near High Court. I had a very good accommodation experience, any complaints will be addressed soon by the owner, there. He really cares for the people who stay there. The Illam has A/C and Non-A/C rooms, with a minimum of 5 people sharing rooms. Though the number of people in a room is high, it is comfortable for all the people in the room. It was my home for the past 8 months. The owner''s care towards the people and house is something, which you''ll find nowhere. Food is not provided in this illam, but there are a couple on the 3rd floor, who''ll cook food if you prefer, Or else there are few options nearby.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:12.401738', 5, 769, 4),
(4673, '[Mahesh Raj] Sumathi Illam in Otteri, Chennai, offers a comfortable and well-maintained stay with friendly owner. The rooms are clean and spacious, providing a homely atmosphere. Conveniently located, it is ideal for students and working professionals, and the overall environment is peaceful and secure.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:12.40192', 5, 769, 4),
(4674, '[Rohith Rana] I stayed in Sumathi Illam for 2 years and 3 months.nIt was very comfortable staying here.nOwner is a very good person who addresses your issues ASAP.nYou can find Good set of friendly people here.nRooms will be cleaned daily.nThis PG is recommended for everyone to stay either for a short span or for longer period.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:12.402072', 5, 769, 4),
(4675, U&'[Seenu 18] \201cWorst hostel experience ever. Room clean illa, washroom romba dirty, food quality worst. Staff response very rude and maintenance proper ah illa. Sleep panna kuda comfortable ah illa because noise and hygiene problems. Money waste totally. Recommend panna maaten. And things ellam thiruturanga hostel la irukura pasanga ella management ye thiruturanga \201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:14.212067', 1, 771, 4),
(4676, U&'[Santhiya Vicky] Amman Men\2019s PG in Ashok Nagar is one of the best places to stay in Chennai! The rooms are very clean, well-maintained, and comfortable for daily living. The environment is peaceful and perfect for both working professionals and students.nThe food provided is tasty, hygienic, and served on time every day, which makes it feel like home. The management is very friendly, supportive, and quick to respond to any needs or issues.nAll basic facilities like WiFi, washing machine, and regular cleaning are available and properly maintained. The location is also very convenient with easy access to transport and nearby shops.nOverall, it\2019s a safe, affordable, and well-managed PG. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a comfortable stay in Ashok Nagar!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:14.212416', 5, 771, 4),
(4677, '[Yaswin Kumar] Nice place to staying for affordable price range neat and clean near to vadapalani then bus stand also Walkable distance from there', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:14.212609', 5, 771, 4);          
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4678, '[Hari Haran] Worst pg in chennai. Water, food and restroom all are problem here. Don''t come and don''t belive any other feedbacks. Owner and managers didn''t take any resposibilities about tenants.....', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:14.212834', 1, 771, 4),
(4679, '[Hanif Mio] Its nice pg i am stay with comfortable and near with playgrounds , government gym , park all available', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:14.213082', 5, 771, 4),
(4680, '[Prakash Prakash] Staying and food is worth for money nice place near t-nagar location,Vadapalani', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:14.213246', 5, 771, 4),
(4681, U&'[chandru ganesan] Worst PG experience ever. The food is below average, rooms are cramped and poorly ventilated, and hygiene is completely neglected. Not worth the money\2014avoid this place at all costs.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:14.213393', 1, 771, 4),
(4682, U&'[KAVIN KUMAR L] Worst pg food quality bad , no ventilation is there don\2019t go there \+01f621\+01f621\+01f621', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:14.213538', 1, 771, 4),
(4683, U&'[Yaswanth Punamalli] Zolo Gleeful Homes - Men''s PGnnI''ve been staying at Zolo Gleeful Homes for a month now, and while there are some positives, there are a few critical areas that need improvement.nnPros:nn\2022 Booking and checking in is convenient through the Zolo app.n\2022 The basic facilities are satisfactory and meet the essential needs of residents.nnCons:nn\2022 The price is relatively high, and there are additional charges that add up, making it less budget-friendly.n\2022 Housekeeping staff are not local and cannot speak the local language, which creates communication barriers.n\2022 The property owner is unresponsive, does not pick up calls, and is rarely available on the property, making it difficult to address any issues or concerns promptly.nnOverall, the stay is okay, but the management needs to address these issues to improve the overall experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:14.858932', 4, 772, 4),
(4684, '[Dichambou Nk] Most premium pg staynHad complaints during my stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:14.859425', 5, 772, 4),
(4685, '[gokul krish] I would rate 0 if there, PG has water scarcity. Water will not come 2 days. Price is also high. No valuable customer service too', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:14.860142', 1, 772, 4),
(4686, '[saratkumardora valluri] Good rates are some++++nPet animals yaaaaaaaaaak', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:14.860402', 4, 772, 4),
(4687, '[tamil maran] Nice play to stay,nMust recommend..', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:14.86058', 5, 772, 4),
(4688, '[Arthur Godson] Everything is nice except water. Manager wont even care about it. Everyday you''ll be late to the office because of this.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:14.860738', 1, 772, 4),
(4689, '[Sakthi Kenny] Nice pg ! Neat and clean place', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:14.860887', 5, 772, 4),
(4690, '[Guru Prasath] You will get drainage water in the pipes, and the manager will switch off his phone if you try to complain.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:14.861123', 1, 772, 4),
(4691, U&'[\0410\0434\0436\0438\0442] Ignore all the positive reviews. Yes, I agree that this PG/hostel is clean and the rooms are decent, but the biggest problem is the food.nnIf you''re planning to stay here with the food package, I would not recommend this place. The food quality is very poor, and the taste is disappointing. If you return after 9:00 PM, there''s a good chance no food will be left. When you ask about it, they simply say the food is finished without offering any alternative.nnBreakfast is even worse than dinner. The cleanliness of the hostel is good, but the food service and quality need major improvement. I would only recommend this place if you plan to arrange your own meals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:15.455152', 1, 773, 4),
(4692, '[john shaju] Top pg in Chennai very well hygienic pg and very testy food  and owner also friendly and straight forward person i highly recommending to everyone so good thank you for the all services', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:15.455468', 5, 773, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4693, '[Barath M] Hello, I have lived this pg for a month. This pg is one of the good pg from my pov , especially they provide 85% of tasty homely foods and also almost 99.5% foods are hygienic and healthy. From my pov per week there are at least 3 to 5 times cleaner cleans the room and bathrooms so it''s the 95% clean pg. My experience is this will satisfy 80% of our own home experiences.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:15.455811', 4, 773, 4),
(4694, '[ROHITHGANESH S] Nice pg I stayed here for past 2years they   maintained neat  and clean .decent food and friendly gesture.safe and secure place for college and working people', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:15.455994', 5, 773, 4),
(4695, '[NISHANTH] The place is excellent to stay.nSo clean, good house keeping, kind ownernnFood is moderate and needs to be adjusted', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:15.456519', 5, 773, 4),
(4696, '[CIBIE CHARAN S] I have stayed about 8 months It''s very good and the places also very clean and food also good there is no queries about the pg it''s best place to stay. And the owner also gentle to everyone.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:15.456903', 4, 773, 4),
(4697, '[Seenivasan K] 1. First of all Good atmosphere and ventilated rooms.n2. Nearby koyambedu, Ambattur estate, Anna Nagar.n3. Quality of home food provide by option.n4. Housekeeping and ambience is well maintained.n5. Interior bike parking available.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:15.457087', 5, 773, 4),
(4698, '[Binith Lal] Convenient rent and well maintained rooms also good behavior from the staf and owner side', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:15.457203', 5, 773, 4),
(4699, U&'[kamal prathap d] 6 months at Royal Comfort and zero regrets. It\2019s one of the best PGs I\2019ve stayed in, but what makes it special is the owner. He doesn\2019t just run a PG \2014 he genuinely cares. Problems don\2019t wait here; he takes initiative and solves them before you even stress about it. Rare, reliable, and really supportive.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:16.325801', 5, 774, 4),
(4700, U&'[Sowndhar Subramanian] I stayed here for the past 7 months and had a really good experience. The PG is very clean and well-maintained, with neat rooms and hygienic surroundings. The rent is reasonable compared to the facilities provided. The owner is super supportive, always approachable, and takes care of any concerns immediately. Even during emergencies, they were very helpful and ensured we felt comfortable and safe. Overall, it\2019s a great place to stay, and I would definitely recommend it to anyone looking for a good PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:16.326635', 5, 774, 4),
(4701, U&'[Vishwanathan R] I\2019ve had a great experience staying at RCPG in Chennai. The rooms are clean, spacious, and well-maintained, with all the basic amenities provided. The management is very friendly and always ready to help with any issues. it\2019s one of the best PG options in Chennai for students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:16.327023', 5, 774, 4),
(4702, U&'[Tharanya Thanju] Very nice hostel .. new one so looks neat and furnished.. owner is friendly and the place is very decent mainly good maintenance.. my brother is staying here ..nnI recently stayed at this place and I was genuinely impressed. The check-in was smooth and welcoming, with staff going out of their way to make us feel comfortable. The room was spotless \2014 fresh sheets, sparkling bathroom, and all amenities worked perfectly. The bed was very comfortable and I slept soundly throughout the night. I loved that the location was quiet yet centrally located, making it easy to reach nearby restaurants and transport. The complimentary breakfast offered good variety and tasted fresh. The common areas were well-maintained and cozy, ideal for relaxing after a long day. Wi-Fi and hot water worked without interruption, which made the stay hassle-free. Overall, the stay exceeded my expectations \2014 great value for money. I would happily recommend this accommodation to friends and definitely stay here again!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:16.327459', 5, 774, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4703, '[Pranesh DK] A fantastic stay! The PG provided a comfortable environment with clean facilities and a friendly atmosphere. The room was well-maintained, offering privacy and peace. The owner was accommodating and attentive, ensuring a hassle-free experience. Overall, it was a pleasant and satisfying stay. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:16.327877', 5, 774, 4),
(4704, '[Selva Kumar] Good and peaceful atmosphere with 24hrs water. Convenient for study or work, and quick access to CMBT bus stand and metro.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:16.328152', 5, 774, 4),
(4705, '[Sabapathy Suresh] One of the best PG in the surrounding area. Food not available. But they have tie up with catering service. They''ll provide parcel food if you want. Also the owner is such a good person.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:16.3285', 5, 774, 4),
(4706, '[Vimal Aditya G V] good and nice atmospheren24hrs water facilityngood place to study or worknQuick access to cmbt bustand and metro', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:16.328694', 5, 774, 4),
(4707, U&'[Guest] This is a true review based on my experience. Staying here was a terrible decision. They charge a very high cost for everything but fail to provide even basic essentials like clean water and proper facilities. The water quality is poor, and hygiene is totally ignored. The management never speaks the truth and keeps making false promises just to attract tenants. Once you pay the advance, they won\2019t refund it. Their only motto is to make money, not to care about the people staying here. One of the most unprofessional and fraudulent PGs I have ever seen.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:17.168486', 1, 775, 4),
(4708, '[VIGNESH BABU T R] Clean and spacious rooms with proper maintenance and good atmosphere.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:17.168887', 5, 775, 4),
(4709, '[K K] My 1st Point of View is Cleanliness.. RSD is Really Doing Great in That. They are Maintaining a Very Clean Room, Bathroom and The whole Atmosphere. The PG Manager Bharathi is Very Responsible Keep On Visiting all Areas Everyday.. Checking and Confirming that all are Ok and Clean. If I have any little queries He will Sort Out that as Soon as Possible. Even I stay at a Non AC Room it''s Absolutely Ventilated and Cool.. I love the Terrace Area.. Which I can Spend the Evening There and Enjoy the Fresh Air. All Facilities are Quite Good. I Strongly Suggest RSD Classic.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:17.169154', 5, 775, 4),
(4710, '[Tapo] Extremely disappointing PG. The management only cares about money, is unprofessional, and does not maintain basic facilities. High cost for poor service. Not recommended at all.This is not a fake review. My experience at your PG was exactly as described. I am sharing the truth so that others can make an informed decision.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:17.16937', 1, 775, 4),
(4711, '[Deepak P M] Best Pg to stay. rooms are nice', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:17.169535', 5, 775, 4),
(4712, '[Melwin Raj] The way of speaking of a working person in the administration is not good im not sure abt his name but dont visit that place', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:17.169693', 1, 775, 4),
(4713, U&'[Khalirayalu Vishnu] This is the worst PG I\2019ve ever been. The rooms and the maintenance are really good but if we raise a query to the management there won''t be a proper response from the team. For more than 3 days I wasn''t able to go to work on time only because of the water problem. I also informed the management about the problem on the previous night immediately when the problem happened but they didn''t send anyone to rectify the issue. In the morning after knowing that the problem was not solved yet one of my roommates messaged the management about the issue they just replied OKAY for the message. When I moved to this PG there was a separate washing machine for our room after a few days they just took off the washing machine without informing the reason nd then we were told to use a washing machine in another room. If they can''t keep it permanently then they should''ve informed us before about the situation. They''ll update everything on the WhatsApp group so why can''t they write it down as a message in WhatsApp so we can also be prepared. The manager Venkatesh was really a well-mannered person he tried his best to fix all the queries we raised. I paid 7850 as advance including the first month''s rent I was supposed to get 3000 as a refund when I leave but I was not able to inform them before as they meant that there is a notice period of one month before leaving but I was not able to inform before one month so they told me that the full amount can''t be refunded they reduced 500 for electricity u0026 500 for bed charges because no one occupied the space on the next day I left even after reducing 1000 they''ve to pay me 2000 but they told me that if someone occupies the space you left well refund the advance you''ve paid after almost a week for the past two days I was receiving random phone calls from the management forcing me to give 5STAR review for their PG after giving the review today they send me 1000 rupees as refund. The place was nice but the management needs some development.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:17.169976', 1, 775, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4714, '[Vishag A] Worst ever maintenance of rooms and bathrooms. Not hygiene. Not a proper response if you ask for a deposit amount refund. Not clear explanation for EB charges. They just collect some amount from you. No proof how much electricity you have consumed. Even the bedsheets are really dirty. They won''t clean the rooms at all. Really worst pg to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:17.170135', 1, 775, 4),
(4715, U&'[VISWANATH R] Staying at PB44 Amman Men\2019s PG Hostel has been a really good experience.nOwner Dhilip sir is very friendly and supportive, he treats everyone well and makes us feel comfortable, just like home \+01f60anThe food is tasty and served on time, which is a big plus for working people.nThey provide purified drinking water, free Wi-Fi, and the rooms are maintained properly.nOverall, a peaceful and safe place to stay with good facilities.nHighly recommended for men looking for a comfortable PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:18.682099', 5, 777, 4),
(4716, '[Ajay Kumar] This hostel is located in a very narrow area where only 2 wheeler can come u0026 go. They have converted marriage hall into hostel. Ideal for college students, not for working professionals. Food is sometimes ok. Sambar u0026 kurma was very spicy and watery.  When I mentioned it to dileep, he told they are preparing food in a central kitchen for all their group of hostels. Cleaning is done regularly. Wifi u0026 washing machines are there. The room is made up of cardboard, not brick and its open. Because of this, lot of mosquito problem. Only 2 persons can stay in that room but they are renting it for 3 people. Pillow, Bed u0026 Locker are provided. For drying the clothes we have to use balcony/verandah but the problem is other persons will push the dress u0026 it will fall down . I chose that hostel because of short commuting distance to my office. They ask rent on 1st of every month but when we ask refund of the advance paid, they pay it late. They are not consistent with their communication', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:18.682508', 2, 777, 4),
(4717, '[Thagsgzhz Bzhzjzjz] Sidish is important for food but here only rice, sambar and pickle (oorugaai)nNo proper responsenWaste of moneynDon''t stay herenWe oombu and eating food', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:18.683357', 1, 777, 4),
(4718, U&'[Kavitha Krishnamoorthi] Good hostel and stay feel like a home \+01f3e0food also very nice.. \+01f60b', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:18.683522', 5, 777, 4),
(4719, '[Gowtham C S] Best pg and worth for money.nFull security with cctv cameras.nNice food and no disturbance from outside.nAll facilities including shops nearby.nClean toilets and room.nOverall Awesome...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:18.683635', 5, 777, 4),
(4720, '[D. Chals Marzal] hygiene foodnClean areanManager is very friendlynNo water problemnRoom are neat and tidynRoomates also friendly', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:18.683735', 5, 777, 4),
(4721, '[jaya surya chintada] In Chennai hostels we are not providing the food as well but they are taking some extra amount for the food but these hostel will be giving with food with the under budget only and very friendly rooms and washrooms are very clean and they are maintaining very hygiene', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:18.683834', 5, 777, 4),
(4722, '[Udhaya Velan] Good pg and affordable price clean area', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:18.683932', 5, 777, 4),
(4723, '[Kamalesh G] This is one of the best and cleanest boys'' PGs in Vadapalani and within a 20 km radius. The management is friendly, flexible, and genuinely helpful rather than being money-minded. During the summer, they provide table fans, and they also provide study tables. If any furniture, such as a study table, gets damaged through normal use, they repair or replace it at no extra cost. The rooms and common areas are cleaned every week, which helps maintain good hygiene. Overall, it''s a well-maintained PG with excellent management and a comfortable living environment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:19.136659', 5, 778, 4),
(4724, U&'[Almaan Ahamed] \200bI was a bit nervous about moving into a PG for the first time, but this place exceeded my expectations. The cleanliness of the rooms and bathrooms is outstanding. More importantly, the management is excellent\2014the owners are down-to-earth and very responsive. Every time I voiced a concern, it was handled immediately. A very safe and pleasant environment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:19.136937', 5, 778, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4725, U&'[bharathi kannan] \201cHad a wonderful stay here. The PG provided a very comfortable, clean, and peaceful environment that truly felt like a second home. The management was friendly and supportive, and everything was well maintained throughout my stay. I\2019m really happy with the experience and would definitely recommend this place to anyone looking for a safe and homely atmosphere.\201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:19.137198', 5, 778, 4),
(4726, '[sriram ck] A clean and well maintained pg. Supportive management providing amenities like wifi, washing machine, Cupboard and locker. The owner is very friendly and is quick to respond to our concerns.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:19.137351', 5, 778, 4),
(4727, '[shashank gowda] Well maintained PG and it''s located in good place. Hygienic and Clean. Amenities are provided.nI recommended this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:19.137604', 5, 778, 4),
(4728, '[Shathik S] This PG is really good in all aspects. Clean rooms, hygienic food, regular maintenance, and a friendly management. Safe and comfortable place to stay. Totally satisfied with the experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:19.137749', 5, 778, 4),
(4729, '[Vaibhav Khandare] There is a reason for this pg to be this highly rated. They are running it compassionately and with kindness. They take care of each of your grivience despite themselves being busy individuals. If you are new in this city, and don''t want to be mislead, wants to be in a secure atmosphere, I will strongly suggest you to go for this one. They are very transparent with every thing and that builds a relation of trust with them. Rent is surprisingly affordable.nIf you are looking for something safe and like home, don''t wander. This is the place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:19.138132', 5, 778, 4),
(4730, U&'[Sanjay R] I stayed at MSV Homestay PG for 4 months and had a great experience.nThe rooms were clean, well-maintained, and comfortable.nThe staff was friendly and always ready to help.nFood quality was good and felt like home-cooked meals.nHighly recommend for anyone looking for a peaceful and safe staynn...........................\+01f90d............................', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:19.138448', 5, 778, 4),
(4731, '[H, Ahmed] Nice pg in arumbakkam near Vadapalani also neat and clean quick response for all problems', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:19.717706', 5, 779, 4),
(4732, '[Vishal Vishal] Nice to stay with food and budget friendly plus good place for students u0026 working people because of nearby institute and metro station available facilities will be there''s', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:19.718045', 5, 779, 4),
(4733, '[Mukeem Ahmad] Nice pg worth for cost staying near and clean near metro station and bus stand also affordable price range here nice mannager friendly type any problem clear solution within a days', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:19.71821', 5, 779, 4),
(4734, '[Suresh Gold.t] Friendly manager and nice to stay worth for money in low budget price near to metro station', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:19.71859', 5, 779, 4),
(4735, '[Ramkumar V] Nice pg for neat and clean near arumbakkam metro station affordable price range', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:19.719039', 5, 779, 4),
(4736, '[Hemanth Kumar] Nice play staying and worth for money neat u0026 clean near metro station so best for working peoples', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:19.719456', 5, 779, 4),
(4737, '[gowtham m] Affordable price range near metro facility and wifi washing machine food included so not bad', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:19.719683', 5, 779, 4),
(4738, '[Gowtham Bs] Nice pg for staying near arumbakkam metro station food is good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:19.720032', 5, 779, 4),
(4739, '[Dhinakaran] Over attitude owner aunty. She can make you to check out any time. She will not answer your queries or issues properly.nHighly Not recommended', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:21.400125', 1, 781, 4),
(4740, '[Shameer] Very kind owner and accomodating even at the last moment. Been stayed here multiple time over last 3 years and i would say this is the only best pg in this area. Only downside may be higher rent compared to other bed spaces but when you look at the amenities and  room spaces its worth arguing and go for, i would say.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:21.400433', 5, 781, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4741, '[dhana sekar] Had a pleasant stay for almost 2 years. Very clean .Food is fine in the beginning. Then it got started boring. So if they provide without food option , it will be good. Quality of furniture and service is good. But if anything gets repaired , they can do something quick.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:21.400699', 5, 781, 4),
(4742, '[nandagopal gopakumar] Had good experiences initially. The PG is really clean and they maintain really good also have good WiFi. I got updates from my frnds here , Food was excellent in the beginning,later on it got worse, the owner keeps on increasing the rent every 6 months and says it''s to improve the food quality and nothing happened to the food. The electricity bill are off the chart, used to pay up to 1200 per month.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:21.400946', 2, 781, 4),
(4743, '[S K] The finest Mens PG in perungudi location. The rooms are clean and they are providing very nice food. The parking lot for car/bike is more sufficient. PG owner is very supportive. If you are looking for a good stay can go for it..', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:21.401117', 5, 781, 4),
(4744, U&'[taj khan] Really awesome place to stay.  I have been stay from 2 years in this p.g. management is very good.  Daily house keeping activities is there Wht ever they r providing  food service to table it''s feel like a home. Food is good.  I felt like family here.  Missing this pg. I am vacating due to marriage. I strongly recommend to stay here.....Mahendra is very nice person you can contact if u have any issues he will resolve it quickly. Security is 24/7 with cameras . Very safe place to stay . That''s all folks \+01f603', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:21.40128', 5, 781, 4),
(4745, '[rajesh g] It''s a great place for stay. I have stayed for around 1month and it was very good experience.nFood is good. Maintenance is too good.nThe owner takes care of the PG very careful.nThe owner acts on the feedback and takes corrective measures.nIn one word, it is unlike other PG''s where atmost care is taken and run on defined guidelines. It is registered legally and as per government standards.nCost is little higher compared to any PG''s or Hostel''s.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:21.401484', 5, 781, 4),
(4746, '[kuldeep meena] The staff is pretty cool and helpful, but the owner? Well, let''s just say she''s all about the money. Every quarter, she jacks up the PG rents and insists on an extra 1000 bucks per month if you need a receipt for HRA claims. Greedy much?', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:21.401662', 1, 781, 4),
(4747, '[Faizal J] New affordable pg in well furnished rooms.nMaintained neat and clean.nThey providing affordable 10/10 home made foods.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:23.215966', 5, 783, 4),
(4748, '[12 Akilan.S] My experience at Sri Mahalakshmi PG . Accommodation has been exceptional. It''s more than just a PG in perungudi. It''s a prime location PG. The food is very good and hygienic', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:23.216308', 5, 783, 4),
(4749, '[balaji mp] I highly recommend Sri Mahalakshmi PG Accommodation to anyone seeking quality living in Perungudi. It''s the best boys hostel offering furnished accommodation near OMR, making it the best PG for working professionals in Perungudi', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:23.216492', 5, 783, 4),
(4750, '[R Sridhar] It was a good experience staying in Sri Mahalakshmi PG. It was affordable and the management family has very good manners and very homely. It was a calm and peaceful stay at Sri Mahalakshmi PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:23.216649', 5, 783, 4),
(4751, U&'[Mani A] Finding a safe and secure mens hostel in Perungudi was crucial for my work commitments. Sri Mahalakshmi PG Accommodation came as a blessing\2014a male hostel near OMR with furnished accommodations and prime amenities, making it the best choice for working mens hostels in Perungudi.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:23.216804', 5, 783, 4),
(4752, '[Tamilselvan S] 24/7 Bussy Area OMR Road Perungudi Near Mahalakshmi Pg Hostel It''s the best boys hostel offering furnished accommodation near OMR, making it the best PG for working professionals in Perungudi... Recommended For IT profession.....', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:23.216955', 5, 783, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4753, '[kiranraaj] Excellent pg. provides tasty food. Well maintained and secured building. Located near to perungudi bus stand. Worth for the money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:23.217115', 5, 783, 4),
(4754, '[S. Indran] This one of the cheap and best PG in this location. There many facilities in this pg. Safe nad secure....nWorth for staying here!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:23.217254', 4, 783, 4),
(4755, U&'[Sandip Chakraborty] Very good PG apartment, neat and clean, having WIFI, AC, Washing Machine and all other amenities. Owner kept the PG  in apt condition. Food also provided daily. Highly recommended \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:24.369702', 5, 784, 4),
(4756, '[Yuvaraj Sivaraj] Neat and clean maintained PG. Homely food. Biriyani is very good. Owners address the issues ASAP. Had good experience. Great PG in this surrounding.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:24.369922', 5, 784, 4),
(4757, '[Ramanathan Jeyaraman] This is the best PG I''ve ever stayed in, As someone who is new to the PG Culture. I was worried about safety, Cleanliness and food. however, Stay Green PG has completely changed my perception. i have mad a lot of friends here and the facilities include covered CCTV, Daily Cleaning, excellent food, Washing machine and fridge available in each Hall. I appreciate the efforts that they put into maintain the PG, they provide the excellent service at a reasonable cost.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:24.370092', 5, 784, 4),
(4758, '[Pradeep Sbiradar] Neat and clean maintained PG. Homely food. Sunday Biriyani is very good. Owners address the issues properly. Stayed here for 6 months. Had good experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:24.370328', 5, 784, 4),
(4759, '[Vishwa Naik] PG is spacious and clean compared to other pg around and near by', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:24.37049', 4, 784, 4),
(4760, '[Rakesh Thakur] Very nice. Excellent service. Food is heigenic and tasty. Neat and clean PG. fine atmosphere. Well treatment. I stayed there and enjoyed.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:24.370686', 5, 784, 4),
(4761, '[logesh kathirvel] Pg is Clean and neat', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:24.370835', 5, 784, 4),
(4762, '[Sahan Alom] Nice', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:24.370979', 5, 784, 4),
(4763, U&'[Jupalli Deepak] Really happy with my stay at Sampoorna Nilayam PG \+01f60anFood is good, water supply is proper, and AC is comfortable.nMaintenance is good and the place is always clean.nNice, peaceful environment \2014 feels like a home away from home!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:25.327383', 5, 785, 4),
(4764, U&'[Arun Gowtham] I stayed at Sampoorna Nilayam PG for 4 months. Due to my temporary transfer, I am moving to another city. Otherwise, I would definitely continue staying here.nnI experienced great comfort in terms of food quality, clean water, good ventilation, and a calm environment. The location is also very convenient \2014 just a 2-minute walk to the bus stand and other transport facilities.nnI highly recommend this PG to anyone who is looking for a place that truly feels like a home away from home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:25.328247', 5, 785, 4),
(4765, '[subash- convict] I have stayed in this PG for 2.5 years the food is good and the rooms are well maintained. It is in close proximity to the WTC and many other IT firms making it an ideal choice for stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:25.328549', 5, 785, 4),
(4766, U&'[Suriya Nathan] \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50nI stayed in this PG for more than 5 years, and it truly felt like a second home. The food is very good, healthy, and hygienic, with proper provisions and fresh vegetables provided regularly, keeping our health as a top priority.nnThe rooms have excellent ventilation, clean and safe drinking water, and a comfortable living environment throughout the year. What really stands out is the management\2014they are caring, responsive, and genuinely concerned about the well-being of the tenants.nnHighly recommended for anyone looking for a safe, healthy, and well-managed PG for long-term stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:25.328854', 5, 785, 4);          
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4767, U&'[muhammed irshad] stayed in this PG for 9 months and had a terrible experience. One of the lowlights was definitely the food \2013 it was neither delicious nor healthy, which made every meal a chore. Management failed to provide variety or nutritious options. Overall, poor accommodation with awful food, very hot rooms, and unpredictable electricity bills!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:25.328968', 1, 785, 4),
(4768, U&'[Ganesh Mc] I stayed at Sampoorna PG for over 5 years, and it was honestly a great experience. The food was always tasty and healthy, just like home. The place is very neat, clean, and well maintained with good ventilation. It\2019s also very close to the bus stand, which makes it super convenient. Overall, a calm and comfortable place to stay \2014 I really felt at home here', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:25.329083', 4, 785, 4),
(4769, U&'[Arunkumar rackan] I stayed in this PG for 7 months and had a fantastic experience.nnThe rooms were spacious, with comfortable beds and storage for my personal belongings. The bathrooms were always clean and hygienic, and I appreciated the attention to detail in ensuring everything was in top condition. The availability of hygienic, home-cooked food was a wonderful bonus. Plus, having bike parking inside the PG was an added convenience.nnThe PG\2019s location was ideal, with easy access to transportation and nearby eateries, making it perfect for both students and working professionals.nnOverall, I highly recommend this Paying Guest hostel to anyone looking for a well-maintained, comfortable, and secure place to stay. It offers great value for money and creates a welcoming atmosphere that makes you feel right at home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:25.329188', 5, 785, 4),
(4770, U&'[Jegadheesh] I had an excellent stay at this PG. The food was consistently healthy and delicious, enhancing my overall experience. The friendly atmosphere and well-maintained facilities made living here a pleasure. However, the lack of a washing machine and the absence of lunch options in the afternoon were slight inconveniences. Overall, it''s still a top choice for anyone who values good food and a comfortable living space. Good owner \+01f603', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:25.329334', 5, 785, 4),
(4771, U&'[Puviyarasan \201c.\201d] Owner very friendly... Room was neat and clean highly recommend', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:26.206143', 3, 786, 4),
(4772, '[Suganth Navis] Don''t fall for this trap. They will take you to another building which is a little far away from this location on the map.nnThe PG rooms do not have proper drainage facilities in restrooms, water doesn''t drain for an hour or so. Old restrooms doesn''t have proper flushing for the toilet, water spills out, taps won''t work. The washing machine doesn''t have switches to operate them. No maintenance whatsoever..nnyou wouldn''t get enough food sometimes you have to go empty stomach. They will ask you to go to the main hostel to have food. Especially on Sundays. No respect for your stays. They treat you like you are their servants.nnFind some better PGs and save your valuable stays there.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:26.206552', 1, 786, 4),
(4773, '[Abhi Bros the sailor] Good pg with all facilities A/C rooms wifi , washing machine,rent is also reasonable', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:26.206908', 4, 786, 4),
(4774, '[Gokul Kumar] Stayed here for close to a month without opting for food.nnPros:n- A supermarket is functioning in the ground floor and lot of shops nearby.n- PG is in walkable distance to the nearest Bus stand.n- Separate Cupboard is allocated for each person in the room with a dedicated key.n- Access to open terrace.n- Reasonable RentnnCons:n- Ventilation might not available on all the rooms.n- An apartment construction is happening next door, so sometimes can expect some loud noise depending on the room we are staying.nnTo conclude, a decent place that I would recommended for staying.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:26.207085', 4, 786, 4),
(4775, U&'[Priyanka Bogam] Hi\26d4\274c\26d4\2622\fe0fDo not fall in the trap of good reviews. All the reviews are 4 years old. This place is no less than dungeon. No maintenance. Mosquitoes. Lizards, Cobwebs.nn1. We need to get out own bedsheet and spread on these dirty beds.n2. We need to get our own plate and wash with dirty hard water.n3. Water is very hard and you may loose hair even on short stay.n4. Do not check-in to the PG. He may say I will move you to my better PG and never do that. You are stuck here.n5. Only pay 500 or 1k advance. As there is high chance you may not like the PG condition and loosing less amount is better than loosing 1 month rent.n6. Lizards are roaming on the floor. IF you keep your door open there is high chance they already are living under your bed.n7. Ask for photos of exact room where you are going to stay. Never believe as he will notice you are in hurry and put you in dungeon. With no option.n8. People who have stayed here have clean their own bathroom. As no worker will ever visit this place.n9. They will just come and keep food on table and leave in hurry as if we are untouchables in dungeon.nnUtter useless PG. Please enter at your own risk!! \+01f6a7\+01f6d1\274c\+01f6ab\+01f6b7\26d4\2622\fe0f\2623\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:26.207274', 1, 786, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4776, '[saloni seigell] I''ve stayed in 3 different PGs around and checked many out, this was the best of all in terms of food, service and location. The owner is sweet, helpful and concerned about girls safety.nIt''s sad they turned the girls PG into boys PG else I''d have a happy life in Chennai.nThe charges were reasonable and per unit charge for electricity too is lowest than all the other PGs I''ve tried.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:26.207663', 5, 786, 4),
(4777, '[Dhritiman Nandi] Horrible PG. The ac is not maintained at all, the food there gave me food poisoning once, and there is always a quarrel about drinking water.nnTowards the end of my horrible stay the bed had bed bugs and when i told the caretaker he says get a new bed cause bed bugs werent there before....', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:26.208', 1, 786, 4),
(4778, '[hariom prakash] I stayed here more than 2 years such a nice PG and owner is very professionaln1. Food quality is excellent moreover you feel like home.n2. Very neatly maintainingn3. Very less gathering compare other pgn4. Very much spacious as well sofa, TV and WiFi vailable in all floorsn5. Overall its excellent specially food is awesome once you join this pg I''m sure you won''t leave until you are stating in this area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:26.208394', 5, 786, 4),
(4779, '[Aayush Tiwari] I was staying in 2 sharing room and overall my experience was good. Owner Aneesh bro is an understanding person and will resolve issues which you face with respect to your stay. Food is mainly south Indian but it was fine. Room was neat and clean as it is cleaned mostly daily. Washroom is also cleaned twice in week. There is no extra charge for washing your clothes using washing machines as i see some old reviews so just clarifying. I have shared room and washroom photos in which i was staying. Minimum notice period is 20 days for refund of security money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:27.051846', 5, 787, 4),
(4780, '[Mohanraj I] One of the better PGs in the area with a supportive owner. The management is responsive, making it a solid choice for anyone looking for reliable accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:27.052069', 5, 787, 4),
(4781, U&'[Vicky V N] I have been staying at this KMPL PG for more than 4 Years u0026 now am leaving due to Office Shifting. It''s been an Amazing Experience\2728nnThe Food\+01f37d\fe0f is Absolutely Superb\+01f60b  Homemade\+01fad5,  Fresh\+01f957, Hygiene\2618\fe0f u0026 Good\+01f44c\+01f3fb.3 times South Indian Food\2668\fe0fnnThe Rooms are Comfortable\+01f6cf\fe0f, Good\2705 Clean\+01fae7 u0026 Well Maintained\+01f9fcnn\+01f4cc If you''re looking for a Good Food with Comfortable Room this is the Perfect Place. Would definitely recommend this PG for a Peaceful Stay.nnOne more thing The PG Owner Aneesh bro is Very Kind, Friendly u0026 Supportive\+01faf1\+01f3fb\200d\+01faf2\+01f3fdnnOverall, a Fantastic Place\+01f31f to stay with Great Surroundings\+01f3d8\fe0f u0026 Excellent Food\+01f9e1', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:27.052377', 5, 787, 4),
(4782, '[Rahul P] Very good experience. Highly recommended one.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:27.052564', 5, 787, 4),
(4783, '[Parth Sarthi] Aneesh, he is a very humble owner. I am staying here,  The rooms are cleaned regularly (every week),  beds are comfortable, The high-speed Wi-Fi, laundry services. I feel like home here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:27.053', 4, 787, 4),
(4784, U&'[parthi] Hi.nI had been there for 25 days and ran away .nRoom : very congestednBathroom : Some rooms don\2019t have light, some with flush problems. Myself faced both.nFood : below average. Mostly to eat outside .nWashing : pay 100 per washnParking : have to pay based on bike/car preference.nRoom cleaning : good . Daily they will.nNit rules: you are allowed any time but with proper information.nElectricity: mostly 0 cost. But if u need ac, have to pay separately.nRent : 7200/head for 3 per roomn9500 /head for 2 per roomnRent may vary.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:27.053154', 2, 787, 4),
(4785, '[DEEPAK DEEPAK] Owner is very friendly. The PG is a nice place to stay, is hygienic and rooms are spacious. The food is great. A good place form security point too, CCTV''s installed on each floor and main gate.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:27.053279', 5, 787, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4786, '[vijay cv] Best place to stay. Nothing we can expect more. Washing machine is charged 100 rs per wash. Food is OK Ok type and not hygienic. I stayed in 2 rooms where fan regulator is not working. It was not serviced for long time eventhough informed. For TV, we need to pay for recharge.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:27.053403', 3, 787, 4),
(4787, '[Deep Kanawade] Overall a very nice experience.. I have recently shifted 7 days back and the cleanliness and rooms too are really maintained.. Quality and tasty food served hot .. really enjoyed the food ..', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:27.896758', 5, 788, 4),
(4788, '[Akhil K] I stayed there for 3 years and found it to be very neat and clean. The food is also homely south indian with good quality. The owner takes care of us very well and resolves any minor issues when reported immediately', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:27.897004', 5, 788, 4),
(4789, U&'[Aravindh S] I have been staying here for two years. I never stayed in a PG this long. The experience with the management, food, room maintenance and the care they are taking for their tenants was never comparable. Such a beautiful experience with this PG. Thank you for the care, food and the way you treat us. Thank you so much \+01f60d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:27.897151', 5, 788, 4),
(4790, U&'[S\00ecv\00e1 G\00e5n\00ebsh] One of the very well maintained and affordable place to stay happily and safely. Home like food, Neat and clean room, Regular room maintenance and also Wifi, Tv, Washing machine like things are available. 24/7 support they caring us like a own family member. Thanks for everything, keep this good things always.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:27.89726', 5, 788, 4),
(4791, '[rohith varma] The rooms are maintained well with daily sweeping and cleaning.The maintainance is good with CCTV coverage and security. It has a washing machine and each room have a 24 inch LCD TV with cots, mattresses and a cupboard. When it comes to food, it is entirely Andhra based food and it''s above average I can say and some people like it and some don''t like it that much. The room sizes are pretty decent.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:27.897437', 4, 788, 4),
(4792, '[Maria Jegan Ajay] Rooms are well maintained and cleaned properly, food is in a good quality, Pg owner extends his support to the maximum', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:27.897558', 5, 788, 4),
(4793, '[Shyam Bishnoi] Whole area stinks in night time. Power cut happens way often. If you are interested in staying this PG then here are few things you should know.nRooms are decent, food is pathetic. Don''t expect any Support from PG owner.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:27.898238', 1, 788, 4),
(4794, '[Dharma Teja Taneti] U may get typical andhra style food in this PG and rooms are little bit compact fit for only beds. And management is friendly only. But cost is more wrt facilities they provide.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:27.898663', 4, 788, 4),
(4795, U&'[Anjali Lakshmi] The worst PG experiences I''ve ever had. The management is highly irresponsible and unresponsive to even basic issues. The PG Lady will just give you false promise to sort the issues.Despite informing them in advance, the lights in my room were not fixed for four days, leaving me in complete darkness. The AC frequently malfunctioned and took over a week to be repaired, with water leaking continuously from it.nnThe hygiene and maintenance are shockingly poor. Rooms are not cleaned properly, and it\2019s common to see rats and mice roaming around at night. I even found larvae in the bathing water.nnThe food quality is extremely poor. I suffered multiple instances of food poisoning, and once they even kept the food near an area where the septic tank had overflowed \2013 with visible fecal matter nearby. This shows a complete lack of basic hygiene and concern for residents\2019 health.They wont even provide the advance amount back we will keeping asking, they wont respond to calls and very irresponsile and worst behaviournnOverall, a very bad experience. I would strongly advise others to avoid this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:28.740524', 1, 789, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4796, '[Logitha G] Worst pg ever, I even got typhoid bcz of this food and water. One day I  saw a cockroach in rasam, when I intimated that to the lady owner she picked up with hand and throws and said we''ll look into it, even after that the food is not good and the current bill is very much high here I don''t know what they are doing but for a three sharing room which consist of a fan, light, ac and a light in bathroom we got 4500 for 2 months.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:28.740994', 1, 789, 4),
(4797, '[Butterfly] The pg is so bad. Especially the lady. If you leave for 2 days to your home. She''ll give room to someone else. The water has worms and till now nothing has been done to clean that. Male come to clean your room. At an unexpected time they come and knock the door to show the room to others. Still charging hefty for the room and extra EB which she will not mention while joining. The room will not have locks so that whoever can come and use it. I don''t know how the EB charges are so high when we are rarely in the room. Do not join here. This has many branches and all are equally worse.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:28.741392', 1, 789, 4),
(4798, U&'[Merdin Jazz] Very worst behaviour of owner, not even responding properly for the complaint, very bad foods are provided , treating very badly after staying in this pg , no water heater provided but charged for that also , very salty water for bath , no hygiene no cleanliness, very very worst pg I''ve ever stayed , please don''t stay here \+01f64f\+01f3fb\+01f64f\+01f3fb\+01f64f\+01f3fb\+01f64f\+01f3fb\+01f64f\+01f3fb too much of charges which is not worth for food and accommodation they provid', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:28.741653', 1, 789, 4),
(4799, '[Aishwarya KrishnMoorthy] This is one of the unhygienic pg that I have ever seen in kandanchavadi. We have to pay 6500+eb but the water quality is not good, even there are live worm in the water, they won''t clean toilet propery, usually say reason for unhygienic behaviour. If insisted for many times only then they will clean. Drinking hot water also not available. Rooms are conjested. They allot 4 people for 3 sharing room. And the most worst thing is food. Can''t able to eat it after 10 days. There are Plenty of hostel available for 5500,6000nPeople pay 6500 for hygiene,but its not achieved in this hostel they have many branches, but my branch is worst', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:28.741815', 1, 789, 4),
(4800, '[Sravani Usthela] One of the best pg hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:28.741919', 5, 789, 4),
(4801, U&'[Natasha Sahoo] Worst PG, with contaminated food, water supply. The lady owner is fully money minded, doesn\2019t listen to concern of the people staying in PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:28.742068', 1, 789, 4),
(4802, '[raja reddy] Very nice pg and homely food. My sister was there in the PG nearly 1year and she said rooms are quite good and Netley.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:28.742232', 5, 789, 4),
(4803, U&'[Senthil Kumar] This pg is honestly a great place to stay safe, The owner is super friendly and approachable, which makes things so much easier. The food here is surprisingly good in these gas unavailability scenarios. The rooms are nice and painting every year, we\2019ve got all the essentials like wifi, RO water,and washing machine. Overall, it\2019s been a smooth experience Since these 3 years and even if the owner\2019s always ready to help. Highly recommend! \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:29.793388', 5, 790, 4),
(4804, '[Aarna Raj] Highly would not recommend this hostel for anyone. The food is very bad and the menu is very boring with repetitive food.I fell ill multiple times eating that food. Only one RO water purifier for a PG hosting more than 50 people. They say they provide hot water as well, but nothing of that sort was given. They have two washing machines with one in a bad condition and almost always in need of a repair. There is a huge issue with rats and cats loitering very frequently in the staircases. Hygiene and cleanliness was never present in the few months I stayed there. The cleaning lady never cleaned the bathrooms properly. Also please be careful with the advance amount since at the end they will always find a reason to loot more money from us. They will give you all sorts of illogical reasons if you ask for the money that you paid. If there was something as a negative star, I would''ve definitely opted for that one since these people don''t even deserve the one star review.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:29.793785', 1, 790, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4805, '[murugan ricemandi] Among the hostels my daughter''s have experienced and heard about, this one is really special and unique. Food, here, is worth mentioning. Quality and taste are commendable. I feel at home. Owner is comfortable and straight forward about their policies This pg is so secure and safe . I would recommend this pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:29.794235', 5, 790, 4),
(4806, U&'[Latchana V] I had a very disappointing experience with this PG. I paid \20b93,000 as an advance to book a room, but due to a change in plans, I cancelled within just 3 days. I never moved in, never kept my luggage there, and didn''t stay even for an hour.nnAt the time of booking, no cancellation policy or cancellation charges were explained to me. When I requested a partial refund of \20b92,000, the owner refused to discuss the matter professionally and suddenly blocked my phone number instead of responding.nnThe owner''s behavior was completely unprofessional and disappointing. Blocking a customer instead of communicating or trying to resolve the issue is not the way to handle customers.nnPeople work hard to earn their money, and this experience felt very unfair. I would advise anyone planning to stay here to get all refund and cancellation policies in writing before paying any advance. Based on my experience, I cannot recommend this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:29.794561', 1, 790, 4),
(4807, '[Ramesh S] Good pg, after six months my sisters stayed, good food with atmospheric', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:29.794886', 5, 790, 4),
(4808, '[Deuzbozkey] Poor water. They will provide bad food. They are not friendly very very toxic its a bad hostel don''t join here. Look for a another good pg for you health', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:29.795061', 1, 790, 4),
(4809, U&'[Sathya Balu] Very very Worst pg daily Morning tifan upma only and night time giving rice no taste is there plss yarum intha pg varathinga \+01f64f\+01f64f nan 8000 pg rent kuduthuttu daily eat only out side food its very  worst experience kudukkura Amount seriously not worth', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:29.795211', 1, 790, 4),
(4810, '[Maaran L] I would recommended this pg is very safety and good food', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:29.795354', 5, 790, 4),
(4811, U&'[Abhishek Sharma] It''s a good and affordable pg in perigundi. You get Ac rooms for 7800(4seater) + 1000 maintenance charge + electricity bill and it includes food as well(3 times a day).nThe food isn''t that great but sometimes they serve really good meals. The most common food is rice and some kind of gravy which I didn''t like and even most of the tamilians didn''t like. Apart from that idli, dosa, chicken, fish, curd rice, lemon rice, pongal, vermicelli are also served which are comparatively better.nTry to take rooms on first floor if you are going in summer(which is almost all the months of the year).nIf your office is in omr side or in Kottivakkam then it''s walkable or you can book uber/rapido for around 40.nThe owner is polite, listens to all the issues and resolves then asap.nYou need to inform 1 month prior to vacating day so that there is no issue in returning the advance money (4000).nOnly issue is electricity bill, you should consider checking the meter on 1st and last day. In my case the bill was approx 7000 for 1 month(~1700 per person) which is way more than the normal. Their per unit charge is \20b914 which again is higher than what government charges but this is something you will find in every city, irrespective of State.nYou can ask me if you have other questions or u need to suggestions regarding pgs.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:30.784705', 4, 791, 4),
(4812, '[Kalaiyarasan Comp p] I had an excellent experience staying at this PG. The property is well daily housekeeping and regular cleaning. The owner is highly responsible, Overall,this PG provides a clean , comfortable, and well maintained living environment. I would highly recommend it to working professional. Thankyoufor your service', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:30.784941', 5, 791, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4813, U&'[mohamed Iliyaz] I stayed at this men\2019s PG for a few years and had a good overall experience. The rooms were clean and well-maintained, with proper ventilation and basic facilities like Wi-Fi, drinking water, and regular housekeeping. The food was decent and homely, which made daily life comfortable.nThe owner/warden was approachable and responsive whenever any issues came up. The location is also convenient, with easy access to shops and transport.nOverall, it\2019s a good option for students or working professionals looking for a safe and affordable place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:30.785127', 5, 791, 4),
(4814, '[keshab raj] Nice and well maintained pg among perungudi, Sharing is little adjustable but spacious rooms with cupboards. Food will be good compared to other cheap PGs in perungudi surrounding. I had been here for past 12 months.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:30.785355', 5, 791, 4),
(4815, U&'[Lokesh G] Good PG with clean and comfortable rooms. Facilities are decent and well-maintained. Location is convenient with easy access to nearby shops and transport. Staff is friendly and helpful. Overall, a good budget stay \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:30.785526', 5, 791, 4),
(4816, U&'[Dipak Rana] I took a 3 sharing room.n#The space for 3 people was really good and enough to move aroundn#The food was too good. The quality of food was good and will be available well ahead of time.n# The place is well maintained with regular cleaning.\+01f60d \+01f4af Percentage genuine PG...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:30.785683', 5, 791, 4),
(4817, '[Rishi Kesh] I had a great experience at sai Mens Hostel. The hostel is very low budget price in price comforable, food is ok . The rooms are clean and comfortable. The staff is friendly and helpful. They make sure I feel welcome', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:30.78583', 5, 791, 4),
(4818, U&'[Rengaraj Muthuswamy] I stayed in this Hostel for a short period. This is Best Boys Hostel in Chennai. Because, building is newly constructed with 2 sharing and 3 sharing excellent Rooms. Best food, best services and best infrastructure and best amenities. As per the name of the Hostel, in total this is really Best Gents Hostel  .. \+01f44c\+01f4af', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:30.785974', 5, 791, 4),
(4819, '[Sravani Dharanikota] Highly recommended to all. As im staying in this hostel from past 5 years I feel more comfortable with good facilities(wifi,washing machine, TV, homely food) and nice atmosphere(good security maintenance).Even at critical situations like flood, cyclone and most during this lockdown hostel was opened all time they have arranged food without any issues. Rooms will be cleaned on daily basis, to maintain more hygiene. Finally feels this is the best hostel in this area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:31.466757', 5, 792, 4),
(4820, '[sravanireddy thippanuri] Nice pg. Very good security for girls. Reasonable rent. Very near to Global info city. Good food, TV and washing machine. Will prefer this if you want to stay in that area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:31.466907', 5, 792, 4),
(4821, U&'[Ashish Sonaniya] It was the best pg and best value for money pg in chennai though owner had to close it because of COVID.nnPros - great tasty and hygienic food, nice rooms, reasonable rent, good wifi, clean rooms and bathroom, very friendly owner, caretaker and chefs \+01f603nnCons - water should be kept on every floor', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:31.467026', 5, 792, 4),
(4822, '[Praveena S] Nice pg. Great security for girls. Reasonable rent. Good food, TV, Washing machine and wifi facilities. If you are looking for pg around Perungudi, Velachery, Thiruvanmiyur or Tharamani then this pg would be a right choice.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:31.467144', 5, 792, 4),
(4823, '[Venkatesh Koliparthi] Nice place. Value for money paid. Was also there at the time of floods in December, but still had sufficient electricity with the help of generator. Just my opinion.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:31.467442', 5, 792, 4),
(4824, '[vidya peddireddy] Very secured and comfortable place to stay.. especially staff treating sooo good.Food and cost of living also comfortable for all classes..nGood accomodation and all facilities like cleanliness and environment feels like home', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:31.467768', 5, 792, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4825, '[susanna vadlamudi] Very good PG, rooms are very privacy comparing with other PGs good water facility rooms are clean and neat,I am staying here past 2yr. I will prefer to stay here', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:31.468061', 5, 792, 4),
(4826, '[Smart Girl Talks] Srinivasa ladies hostel is like home for me, provides tasty and healthy food, maintained hygiene and security level is very high being monitored by cc cameras outside with security guard.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:31.468306', 5, 792, 4),
(4827, U&'[RA Creative Design Studio] Food is good \+01f60a\+01f60a\+01f60a\+01f60a\+01f60anDaily cleaning ,free wifi with 5g and free of surrounding area is super.....n24 hr water facility with drinking also.n2 washing machine available....nSafty and security and full survival cc.....', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:32.345273', 5, 793, 4),
(4828, U&'[Gananadh Chowdary] Great place to stay! \+01f60a Clean rooms, comfy beds, and super helpful owner. Location is convenient, and the amenities are top-notch. Highly recommend \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:32.345691', 5, 793, 4),
(4829, U&'[Dapper_ Dude] Excellent pg in perungudi affordable price and food also nice they are treated like family members...\2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:32.34597', 5, 793, 4),
(4830, '[Rahamathunnisa Shaik] Nice accommodation for gents and owner very friendly,homely food two wheeler parking also available', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:32.346263', 5, 793, 4),
(4831, '[shameer] Good pg in Perungudi food is homly and tasty atmosphere also neat and clean located in nearby Trade centre so easy accacable for any transportation.owner kindly heart person so never disappoint cresent pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:32.346559', 5, 793, 4),
(4832, '[SOURAV KOSTA] Not at all good, if you are north or east indian then you will have food issues only single menu is stuck on a daily basis. Any of the issues will not be solved in the given time. Those food items aren''t liked by the south indian peoples.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:32.346776', 2, 793, 4),
(4833, U&'[\0442\043876 \1b44Boy''s gaming] Food is very teasty and yummy good accommodation and neet and clean rooms. Owner also very friendly', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:32.34695', 5, 793, 4),
(4834, U&'[Sourav Prasanna Venkatesan] Food is too bad and they''ll charge extra if are exceeding the stay for just a day or two. I have stayed there for 1 month and 8 days. The owner asked 4000 for 8 days. And EB bill is separate 10\20b9 per unit', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:32.347064', 1, 793, 4),
(4835, U&'[Harish vallam reddy] I stayed at this PG and had a comfortable experience. The rooms are well-maintained, with proper ventilation and cleanliness. Facilities like Wi-Fi, laundry, RO water, and daily housekeeping were available and consistent. The food quality was decent and hygienic, with both veg and non-veg options provided.nnSecurity is well-managed with CCTV and biometric access, and the management is responsive to any issues. It\2019s a good option for both boys and girls, especially for students and working professionals. The location is convenient with nearby access to public transport, supermarkets, and eateries.nnOverall, a safe and value-for-money PG for both boys and girls', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:33.012337', 5, 794, 4),
(4836, '[Mohamed Junaid] My experience is not good with this pg. Rooms are unhygienic and smell a lot. No water in the night time which is very uncomfortable. I only stayed for a few days and left the pg as I didn''t like the pg food and management''s behaviour is rude. Please don''t fall for the images as it seems they were taken when pg was newly opened. But now the beds and pillows are literally dirty and never seem washed.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:33.012546', 1, 794, 4),
(4837, '[RAM KUMAR] Food is awesome and rooms are well furnished and looks clean..', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:33.012703', 5, 794, 4),
(4838, '[Rasi Mohamed] This Hostel is very nice maintaince, food faciltiy is always good, near epi source company in walkable distance and rooms are very clean and comfortable for wokers.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:33.01285', 5, 794, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4839, '[praveen kumar.D] This Hostel is very nice maintaince, food faciltiy is always good,', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:33.013311', 5, 794, 4),
(4840, '[Aadil] Food is awesome and rooms are well furnished and looks clean..', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:33.013625', 5, 794, 4),
(4841, '[labib irshaad] Very good facilitys,good food,very good service', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:33.013967', 5, 794, 4),
(4842, '[Vetri Vel] This hostel is food is very worst very bad so please Don''t choose the hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:33.014154', 1, 794, 4),
(4843, '[prince tiwari] have been a customer of your company and have stayed at zolo lyca for a period of 7 months, I have initiated the notice period on the 10th of January and was told that the notice period is to be for a period of 30 days, accepting my mistake I have paid an amount of 3786/- for it, and set my exit date as 8th of February 2026, then my plan changed from the initial date to 31st of January, 2026, I have been continuously calling the zolo manager and tried to find him, which was neither available and nor did he picked my call. then I called the zolo customer care and told the same situation he said ki you can do the earlier exit on 31st January although no amount will be refunded to you as you initiated the notice before 30 days, I have been continuously trying to call the manager for the same from 31st to give me the otp se said I will give you by Feb end, due to which you have raised a rental to me for 8 days of Feb and electricity charges for the Jan month amounting to total of 5316/-. I have tried to talk to the caretaker. Even after this even vacating the zolo lyca again they charged me 2950 for early exit charge even after assuring me you only have not to pay this. I was forced to pay 2950 as a penalty and 534 for the electricity bill for the period I was not even staying. The customer care said this is not a rental agreement you should have read the agreement, worst experience even no one even support worst company, even after paying 14k/ month as an rental I was forced to pay and deduction of totalling to 8800/- for the period I was not even staying in the PG. worst experience ever worst company not going to recommend this company. No one talks properly the manager is also not available He is not picking my call; I have called the customer care he said it was your problem I am not going to help no senior is available to resolve the issue worst company. you are such an esteemed organization that''s why I have joined the zolo. but this kind of behaviour i haven''t expected this from such a big organisation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:33.85958', 1, 795, 4),
(4844, '[gangadhar u] Its been very worst staying in zolo vibe and all other properties as well,pls dont stay in any of the zolos in chennai thier property manager sekhar doesnt respond quickly and also their area manager richard also doesnt respond in my 6 months of stay in zolo,so my kindly suggestion to everyone dont stay in zolos in chennai.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:33.85988', 1, 795, 4),
(4845, '[vignesh ravi] Almost 1 year wastage and garbage stored in zolo PG in the ground floor at the place of varanda.nnThey''re not disposing garbage properly at a time,nnAlmost It''s been a year. Today''s 6 feet snake entered into garbage location on the ground floor.nnIt''s terribly uncomfortable to customers.nIts making unnecessary panic to stay.nnClear all the garbage and wastages  asap.nnIt''s worst maintainance', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:33.860127', 1, 795, 4),
(4846, U&'[Dharshan S] The stay was excellent \2014 the rooms were clean, comfortable, and beautifully maintained. The staff were warm and attentive, making the entire experience truly memorable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:33.860436', 5, 795, 4),
(4847, '[Krishanth Barkav] It has been a disappointing experience. Water supply issues are constant, with no water available for residents on many days. Even worse, there''s no clear information or communication about who the caretaker is, so residents are left on their own to resolve these issues. Often, we''ve had to arrange our own water cans just to get by. l''d strongly recommend looking elsewhere if you want a hassle-free place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:33.860704', 1, 795, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4848, '[Vinoth Ravi] Maintenance is very poor, not responding for tickets regarding Ac repair which is created 3 weeks back and escalated through zolo customer service, no response and not proper response from property manager also. Hospitality is very bad and annoying, not support from property manager also.No issue will be fixed as soon as possible.Earlier faced water issue by morning peak hours, manager is not at all taking care and so lethargic always.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:33.860912', 1, 795, 4),
(4849, '[Madhesh Madhesh] The room is spotlessly clean, the room service is excellent, and the staff are incredibly friendly and attentive, making this hotel a wonderful place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:33.861467', 5, 795, 4),
(4850, '[Shubham Verma] Wrost place to stay, price are too much and facilities are nothing, even zolo is failed to provide water. Out of 10, 6 to 7 morning water is not there, customer care is one of the useless support system I have ever seen. Cleaning is not done properly. I wish google provide negative ratings.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:33.861842', 1, 795, 4),
(4851, '[abdul kalam] Positive:1.Dosa , chappathi very good.very appreciated when compared to others.n2.room cleanliness is based on our roomatesnnNegative:1.Repeated weekly food.for example every Tuesday tomato rice,thrice sambar during weekly buisness days,Thursday lemon rice for lunch.n2.half boiled cooked rice  during tomato ricen3.saturday side dish not provide in lunchn4.eb bill around 300 aboven5.non veg also average taste  in Sunday.nyou can decide based on this', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:34.657225', 1, 796, 4),
(4852, '[Elavendan Rajendran] Nice PG within 5 km of Ramanujam IT park and Taramani. Cuisine is Andhra and they provide quality food. Newly built PG premises and it is super cool. Only thing is, it''s almost full for most of the times.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:34.657427', 5, 796, 4),
(4853, U&'[N. Kishore] Worst PG experience ever! Completely overpriced for the terrible facilities and service provided. The rooms are poorly maintained, hygiene is non-existent, and the management is unresponsive to complaints. Basic amenities like clean water, proper ventilation, and working Wi-Fi are either missing or barely functional. For the high rent they charge, you\2019d expect at least decent living conditions, but this place is nothing short of a nightmare. Definitely not worth the money', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:34.657581', 1, 796, 4),
(4854, '[D SADDAM HUSSAIN] These pg food was nise ,it''s located near park ,masjid(palli or mask) and Bus stop', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:34.657729', 5, 796, 4),
(4855, '[haroon rasheed] Bus stop is nearby but No railway stations.  Food is average (Andra style food). Rent is more compared to other pg''s around and they also collect extra money for current bill (non AC room)that is absurd. They only clean the rooms twice a week. Some rooms are so dirty, but it depends on your roommate. Drinking water is very bad. They don''t buy water cans, instead they use RO filter. I think it is corporation water. 24*7 water, electricity and Wi-Fi. Also have individual television for each room. The roommates and the room i stayed were good , so I could manage. I would have given 4 stars if the rent was same as other pg''s nearby.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:34.65814', 3, 796, 4),
(4856, '[Nagi Reddy] Food in this Pg is very good, owner will respond to our problems very soon and get it resolve. Mostly its 4 or 5 sharing only. Both AC and non AC available. Good place to stay for the people who looking for Pg in and around kandanchvdi. It''s near to the main road point, in 5 mins we can reach to bus stand. Weekly twice chicken and night times we can get both south Indian and north Indian food. We get 3 times food a day', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:34.658526', 4, 796, 4),
(4857, '[joseph kranthi] Campare to other hostel its less rentnMaintenance oknParking facility  oknWater quality oknWifi speed averagenVentilation depending on buildingnSurrounding area oknBreakfast oknLunch oknDinner ok', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:34.658714', 4, 796, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4858, '[Malli Arjun] 1.Food is deliciousn2. Comfortable to stay.n3. Facilities are goodn4. Good wifi connectivityn5. Cleanliness is beatn6. Location is also close to main road.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:34.658875', 5, 796, 4),
(4859, '[kanagavel s] Never ever encourage this pg for anyone. They are cheating no hygienic place, no proper food, uncleaned washrooms. Moreover when leaving this pg they are deducting from advance amount for no reasons. You have many alternative good option pg around, don''t trust these pg management is not good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:35.227194', 1, 797, 4),
(4860, U&'[Lalitheaswaran] One of the best men''s PGs in the area with excellent cleanliness and service \+01f44d\+01f44dnnOverall, a hassle-free and comfortable living experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:35.227691', 5, 797, 4),
(4861, '[Anandharaj Anandharaj] I was staying over 8 months in shristi apartments. Staying and food  was decent compare to other PG. recommended, Go for it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:35.228003', 5, 797, 4),
(4862, U&'[Venkatesh Soubbarayalu] Excellent Support u0026 Prompt Service:nnI had a very good experience staying at this PG, mainly because of the amazing support from Meena. Even though she was not physically present at the site, her responsiveness and coordination were excellent.nnOn one occasion, there was an issue with bikes blocking the parking area. I informed Meena, and within 10 minutes, the issue was resolved smoothly. Another time, we reached the PG late and found that chapatis were finished. After informing her, she arranged a complete meal for three people within half an hour, and the quantity was more than sufficient.nnHer quick response, sense of responsibility, and willingness to help at any time made the stay very comfortable and stress-free. I truly appreciate her efforts and support.nHighly recommended PG with reliable management and great service. \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:35.228258', 5, 797, 4),
(4863, U&'[Raja krish] One of the main reason I recommend everyone, it\2019s their working office colleagues , her name Meenakshi. She is very kind and understand person to allocate suitable room sharing. She is the main reason to staying here. AtoZ gave explanation about Nizhal PG rooms and features, infrastructure. Nice staying in nizahl\2026.one of delicious pg I ever stayed\2026recommend for everyone just try once \2026.u people should like it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:35.22844', 5, 797, 4),
(4864, '[Lone ranger] Wouldn''t Recommend ItnSo, Hygiene''s a huge problem. Bathrooms are always dirty, often full of bugs, and it seems like no one ever cleans them. It''s pretty gross, to be honest,and the food? Tiny portions, not great quality, and you never know when it''s coming. Super inconsistent.nThe management just doesn''t get back to you about anything. Plus, there''s no clear agreement or system for folks living there, which is a real pain.nnOverall, it''s just not a reliable or comfy place if you''re looking for somewhere decent to live. You''d definitely find better spots around, trust me!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:35.228595', 1, 797, 4),
(4865, '[Ajith Shekar] Very good PG ! Located in the prime spot that''s very  close to guindy railway station and bus stop.  Price is reasonable  with moderate aminaties  with good daily meals with good house keeping . I preferably  recommend many of my friends who  visits Chennai. PG offers you rooms as per your sharing request and it will be a pleasant stay . I stayed here for few months and if anyone looking for PG in South Chennai  i suggest you NIZHAL ....', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:35.228747', 4, 797, 4),
(4866, '[umesh rathod] Really had a great time stayin here. PG is clean, comfy n well-managed. Staff r very polite n helpful, always there when u need smth. Overall, had an awesome experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:35.228897', 5, 797, 4),
(4867, U&'[Prithivi Raj Velmurugan] \2b50 Providing 5 Stars Only for the Recent Improvements! \2b50nn\+01f33f Staying in this hostel for 2 years now \2014 and it\2019s been a really good experience! \+01f4abnThe food quality has improved a lot \+01f35b, and the place is surrounded by nature \+01f333 with great ventilation. Lockers, racks, and all the essentials are available.nn\+01f697 The roads around are much cleaner than before, and it\2019s super easy to reach both the railway station u0026 bus station. Calm, neat, and perfect for a peaceful stay \+01f60cnn\2705 Facilities:n\2022 Two-wheeler parkingn\2022 Wi-Fin\2022 Washing machinen\2022 RO purified water for cooking u0026 drinkingnnMost of the lunch meals come with tasty gravies u0026 fresh veggies \+01f957nn\+01f4cd Nearby Attractions:nRacecourse \2013 Guindy \+01f40e | Phoenix Mall \2013 Velachery \+01f6cd\fe0f | Urban Square \2013 Kathiparai \2615nnOverall, a comfortable, peaceful u0026 budget-friendly place to stay! \+01f3e0\2728', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:37.129504', 5, 799, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4868, U&'[S.KARTHI KEYAN] Stayed for 6 months, but honestly had a very bad experience. Owners are only focused on collecting rent, with no proper response to residents. Food and management were poor, and even getting the remaining balance was difficult. Called and messaged many times with no proper response. Honestly, \20b96,500 is not worth it. Please ask to check to go any PG Guys', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:37.130031', 1, 799, 4),
(4869, '[vishva vishva] Budget friendly hostel and hygiene food i most preference to this hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:37.130225', 5, 799, 4),
(4870, '[Shailesh] Worst pg , I am seriously concerned about the food and and maintenance. Mainly the foods quality is extremely poor coz of that i started skipping food and got sick. They only clean the pg once in a week and they even skipped that for a week .do not consider this pg coz I had the worst experience,the water they provide there is not clean and I was bedridden for 3 days ,I suspect the water. Pls do not consider this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:37.130418', 1, 799, 4),
(4871, '[VETTIKILIYUM VETAVALIYANUM] I am staying one year this hostel very good food also very good everything is ok weekly todays room cleaning also goodnFood style very good village style I like this food I love this me mens pg', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:37.130558', 5, 799, 4),
(4872, '[S.Murugan] Good food and accommodation good. budget friendly pg And owner approached good and friendly', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:37.131002', 5, 799, 4),
(4873, '[VINAYAGAMOORTHY A METTUKKUNDU] oom service weekly twice cleaned. Washing machine, ro water ,bike parking near available and Food is ok. Near by maduvinkarai bridge.giundy railway station and metro near arround walking 15 min and alandur metro also same distance.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:37.131628', 4, 799, 4),
(4874, '[Sakthi Sakthi] Budget friendly and friendly management hostel food also good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:37.131988', 3, 799, 4),
(4875, '[Arun Kumar] Excellent PG for Women with newly renovated rooms and state of the art facilities in a prime location at an affordable price. Kudos to the management for setting high standards on cleanliness, safety, and security.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:37.922983', 5, 800, 4),
(4876, '[Manikandan Annadurai] Very worst PG they have got the advance but not returned. They are telling if another person comes I will return. Even after perior information of one month they have not given the advance. Taking bad words. Very worst experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:37.92331', 1, 800, 4),
(4877, '[Srini Rao] Could you please provide the owner''s contact number? How can I reach them?', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:37.923711', 5, 800, 4),
(4878, '[krishna relangi] I stayed here for more than 4 months and really liked the services provided. The rooms are hygienic and safe. Each room had fridge, washing machine, cooking utensils, and daily housekeeping was done. Ac and Non-Ac rooms are also available.Will recommend others to stay here if you are looking for PG in saidapet Chennai.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:37.924092', 5, 800, 4),
(4879, '[Ayush Jha] I stayed here for 3 months and really liked the services provided. It was hygienic and safe. Each room had fridge, washing machine, cooking utensils, and daily housekeeping was done. Will surely recommend others to stay here if you are looking for PG in Chennai.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:37.924496', 5, 800, 4),
(4880, '[Vivek Agnihotri] The owner is a gentle u0026 genuine person. The PG was well-cleaned, hygienic and had the facilities of RO, Washing machine, Refrigerator and Electric stove. The fellows on my floor were also nice people.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:37.924726', 5, 800, 4),
(4881, '[Sundar Chaitanya] This place is very good in many aspects including safety, cleanliness, nearby markets and quickly reachable to public transportation. I have stayed many times with great joyous and peaceful experience. I recommend all good people to get the benefit of this excellent facility.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:37.924837', 5, 800, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4882, '[Riya Ria] I recently had the pleasure of staying at Ambika Paying Guest in Saidapet, Chennai, and I must say, it exceeded all my expectations. From the moment I walked in, I was impressed by the cleanliness and welcoming atmosphere of the place.nnThe rooms are well-maintained and spacious, providing a comfortable living space. The attention to detail in the decor and amenities truly made me feel at home. The staff at Ambika Paying Guest are incredibly friendly and attentive, always ready to assist with any needs or queries I had during my stay.nnThe location of the paying guest is also a major plus point. Situated in the heart of Saidapet, it''s conveniently close to public transportation, shopping centers, and local attractions. This made exploring the city a breeze.nnFurthermore, the security measures in place gave me peace of mind throughout my stay. The premises are well-secured, and the safety of the residents is clearly a top priority for the management.nnOverall, my experience at Ambika Paying Guest was exceptional. It''s a perfect blend of comfort, convenience, and hospitality. If you''re looking for a fantastic place to stay in Saidapet, Chennai, I wholeheartedly recommend Ambika Paying Guest. It''s a true gem that offers a top-notch living experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:37.924936', 5, 800, 4),
(4883, U&'[ramesh rohi] I stayed in that hostel, and I really liked it a lot. They kept that hostel very clean\2014they would clean it weekly. The infrastructure in that hostel was really good. They treated us very kindly. They didn\2019t treat us just like students\2014they took care of us like parents. Whatever we asked for, they provided. I really, really liked the experience of staying there.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:38.813781', 5, 802, 4),
(4884, U&'[Dhanush ezhil] Stayed here for 4 months and completely regret it. Rent was \20b97,000 for a 5-sharing room, plus an insane \20b94,000 per month electricity bill charged at \20b912/unit \2014 clearly a scam.nThey took \20b97,000 as deposit and the owner tried multiple times to cheat me while returning it. Parking is not allowed in front of the PG, and the owner is rude and looks down on tenants.nThey sweet-talk you at first, but once you move in, the hidden charges and bad behavior start.nNot recommended. Avoid this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:38.814107', 1, 802, 4),
(4885, '[AJITH KUMAR] Good place for pg with AC and without AC also available.price was little high compared to others. Atleast they should give morning food for price.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:38.814313', 4, 802, 4),
(4886, '[Saikat Nandi] Good room, good service staff', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:38.814446', 4, 802, 4),
(4887, '[shyam sundhar] Gud', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:38.814591', 5, 802, 4),
(4888, '[Keerthi Raj K R] Good stay, good people and good food', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:38.814908', 5, 802, 4),
(4889, '[abu] Good PG , clean and comfortable stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:38.81529', 5, 802, 4),
(4890, '[Suderson Raaju] I stayed at CV PG for 3 months in a 2-sharing room and had a great experience. The rooms were kept clean and well maintained, and the owner was very reasonable and easy to talk to. Whenever I raised a concern, it was sorted out quickly without any hassle. The atmosphere was friendly and comfortable, which made it feel like a home away from home. Good value for money and a convenient location in Guindy. I''d recommend it to anyone looking for a decent, well-run PG in the area', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:38.815547', 4, 802, 4),
(4891, '[VASANTHAKUMAR.A] I stayed in this PG for around 2.5 years, and my experience was excellent. The place is always neat, clean, and very comfortable to stay in. The management is supportive, and the environment feels safe and homely. It is one of the best places to stay in Chennai, and I would highly recommend it to anyone looking for good accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:39.660168', 5, 803, 4),
(4892, '[Prabu Prabu] I have stayed more than five PG in chennai. But this is one of the best pg near Ekkatuthangal area. Food - weekly once egg, chicken and fish provided for non veg.nRoom are neat and clean.nAttached toilet with locker and geyser. Ample parking space.nnear to Olympia tech park which my office located,nterrace space is good to use at night time. Some time night food delay they have to improve on that.  Overall nice stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:39.660968', 5, 803, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4893, '[venkatraj m] One Of the bst hostel in ekkathuthangal, chennainnThey keep cleaning all the rooms weekly 2 , they provide wifi, 3 time food 2 time non veg foods and also food is good and neatness is well maintenance administration is well cooperative and helpful up to their extent. I feel like home here,', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:39.661455', 5, 803, 4),
(4894, U&'[ABINESH R] I have stayed here for almost two years. Overall, the rooms are quite satisfactory, and I appreciate that the hostel provides a good ambience and has separate rooms \2014 something that\2019s not common in many other PGs. There are no unnecessary restrictions, which is another good aspect.nHowever, there are several concerns that need serious attention from the management:nLack of response from management: Whenever we face food-related issues or shortages, the management and manager hardly respond to calls or messages.nPoor maintenance: Rooms are not cleaned regularly, and the bathrooms are in very poor condition. Even after raising multiple complaints, they only do temporary fixes instead of solving the issue permanently.nFood quality and menu: The food menu has been the same for a long time. Even after giving suggestions, they don\2019t make any changes. While other PGs offer more variety at a lower cost, this PG seems more focused on opening new branches rather than maintaining quality at existing ones.nAttitude towards feedback: The management only expects positive reviews. When residents raise negative feedback, they often respond rudely or suggest that we can leave the hostel \2014 which is not the right way to handle genuine concerns.nIn summary, the hostel is good in terms of space, ambience, and freedom, but the management seriously needs to improve their responsiveness, cleanliness, and food quality.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:39.661628', 1, 803, 4),
(4895, '[Priyabrata Panda] A good PG in Chennai. The food is good, they serve special meals during festivals. The caretaker keeps the washrooms clean every week and rooms twice a week. They also maintain the stairs and terrace regularly. Overall, a nice and well-maintained place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:39.661907', 5, 803, 4),
(4896, '[Syed Afrith] It was a awesome experience I stayed in ekkatuthangal branch.. moreover The food is worth the pay.. hygeine they clean your room twice a week.. for working men I prefer it..', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:39.662193', 5, 803, 4),
(4897, '[PAVITHRAN AYYANAR] Rooms are good but food is really bad . There is no option without food . And the parking worst . Im not a guy who waste food but here daily i wasted food.nPosted this a month ago', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:39.66235', 1, 803, 4),
(4898, '[Sylvester A.R] One of the best PG hostel in Chennai. They take care of the tenants and food was too good. Every room are with attached bathrooms and they were more spacious too. Reasonable price and management is so friendly and they will rectify tenants need asap. The only drawback is parking facilities, it is not spacious. It is the only hostel in chennai that provides washing machine for free and we can use it at anytime. Wifi connectivity was good and water facilities also good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:39.662496', 5, 803, 4),
(4899, '[BHUSHAN Bhushan] One of the best PGs in Ekkatuthangal. The rent is very reasonable, cleanliness and hygiene are excellent. If you''re looking for a PG, I highly recommend considering the 2-sharing option.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:40.351793', 5, 804, 4),
(4900, '[Harish M S] Had a really good stay at this PG in a triple-sharing AC room. The rooms and restrooms were maintained well and cleaned regularly, which made the stay comfortable and hygienic.nnOne thing I really liked was that the management responded quickly whenever there was any issue. Facilities like WiFi, washing machine, AC, and kitchen access were all properly available as mentioned.nnThe environment was peaceful and overall the stay was smooth and hassle-free. Definitely a good option for students or working professionals looking for a decent PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:40.352039', 5, 804, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4901, U&'[Kiran siva sai Tatipaka] I stayed here for almost 11 months in a twin-sharing AC room and had a very comfortable experience. The maintenance was excellent, rooms and washrooms were cleaned on alternate days, and the consistency was impressive. They also had a dedicated WhatsApp group where issues were taken seriously and resolved quickly.nnAll amenities like WiFi, washing machine, and other facilities were provided exactly as promised and well maintained. Overall, it was a hassle-free and pleasant stay. Definitely recommended! \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:40.352201', 5, 804, 4),
(4902, '[Rohit Tanwar] I am staying in a 2-sharing accommodation here for a year, and my experience has been excellent. The rooms are neat, clean, and well-maintained. The management is supportive, and all the basic facilities are available. The environment is comfortable, safe, and suitable for working professionals. In my opinion, this is one of the best PG accommodations near Ekkatuthangal. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:40.352453', 5, 804, 4),
(4903, '[Thomas Clefin] My stay at Vetrivel Residency PG was a very happy experience for me. They have all the facilities required at their PG. Drinking water, Washing Machine, Clean Bathrooms, Iron Box, TV, Fast Wi-Fi, AC, etc. The rooms and bathrooms are cleaned every alternate days. To top it, it''s a very well maintained PG in that area also situated in a very good location.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:40.352709', 5, 804, 4),
(4904, U&'[Gandhi Rajan] PG is worth every single penny you spend.nI stayed in their second property for 7 months (twin-sharing AC room), and here\2019s what really impressed me:nRestroom: This was my biggest concern while searching for a PG. Most places I visited had just one restroom for the entire floor. Here, our room had a dedicated, clean restroom , which made a huge difference.nMaintenance: Rooms and washrooms were cleaned on alternate days without any extra charges. Consistency was really good.nWhatsApp Grievance Group: There was a separate WhatsApp group for addressing complaints. Every issue was taken seriously and resolved promptly.nFully Furnished Kitchen: Though there\2019s no attached mess facility, the property has a wellequipped kitchen where you can cook your own meals comfortably.nOther Amenities: WiFi, washing machine, and other facilities were provided exactly as mentioned.nOverall, a very comfortable and hassle free stay. Definitely recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:40.352884', 5, 804, 4),
(4905, '[Vimal Athithya] Good Facilities like AC / water dispensers/ kitchen/ Fridge and service like regular cleaning of Room  , Restrooms and WIFi service .Been staying here over 6 months one of the best PG in the neighborhood', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:40.353048', 5, 804, 4),
(4906, '[Syam Mohan M] My stay at Vetrivel Residency PG was a very happy experience for me. They have all the facilities required at their PG. Drinking water, Washing Machine, Clean Bathrooms, Iron Box, TV, Fast Wi-Fi, AC, etc. The rooms and bathrooms are cleaned every alternate days. To top it all off the kind and friendly treatment of the Vetrivel Residency owners really made it the best PG experience for me.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:40.353455', 5, 804, 4),
(4907, U&'[VIMAL K] Sky men''s hostel is good place to stay. A friendly incharge Venkatesh,he is very kind person and they will resolve your queries . In this hostel rooms are so clean and food are good. I am High recommended this hostel for easily access transport facilities and office. Thanks\2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:41.003106', 5, 805, 4),
(4908, U&'[Venkatesh K] Sky Men\2019s Hostel in Guindy is a great place to stay. The rooms are clean and well maintained, with a peaceful and friendly atmosphere. Food quality is good, and the staff are helpful and responsive. Convenient location with easy access to transport and nearby facilities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:41.003349', 5, 805, 4),
(4909, '[Ragul Sa] I live in an AC room that costs 6,500, and the electricity bill is separate. The price is affordable for me. Room cleaning is done once a week. However, I have faced bed bugs in my bed. If we inform the warden, they clean the room and change the bed.nnAnother thing is that the food is average, but not the worst. However, the serving area is not good. There is no problem with washing clothes since there are two washing machines available. Overall, room maintenance is okay, and the warden is responsible and helpful.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:41.003502', 4, 805, 4);          
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4910, '[Thirumal Vijay S] It''s most affordable Men''s PG in Guindy area,with free unlimited wifi, washing machinennPrice - 5/5nFood - 3/5nIncharge - 4/5nAtmosphere - 3/5', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:41.003656', 4, 805, 4),
(4911, '[Ajith Narayanan] From my experience, it was a good hostel compared to others. The rooms were neat and clean, and the WiFi was 5G. Special mention to Warden Venkatesh, who is a very kind person. I highly recommend this PG to those looking for accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:41.00389', 4, 805, 4),
(4912, U&'[Abdul Bashith] A good hostel with a supportive warden. The food is average, and the room hygiene isn\2019t great since it\2019s an older building.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:41.004095', 4, 805, 4),
(4913, '[Madeshwaran M] Good food friendly incharge cleaning rooms no issues very nearby bus stop', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:41.00427', 5, 805, 4),
(4914, '[YO YO] Worst place to livennFood very poor quality', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:41.004423', 1, 805, 4),
(4915, '[Pavan] I had a very disappointing stay at this hotel. The management was extremely poor and unresponsive. The room maintenance was terrible, and hygiene standards were not maintained at all. There were bed bugs, which made the stay completely uncomfortable and unacceptable. Additionally, the staff behavior was not professional or courteous.nI would strongly not recommend this hotel to anyone.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:42.020042', 1, 806, 4),
(4916, U&'[Santosh shine] \2b50 1 Star \2013 Very Poor ExperiencenExtremely disappointing stay. The management is unprofessional and charged more than the amount initially agreed, which is unacceptable. The room was poorly maintained, hygiene was very bad, and there were bed bugs. On top of that, the staff behavior was rude and not at all customer-friendly.nWould not recommend this hotel to anyone.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:42.020307', 1, 806, 4),
(4917, '[Jayesh Cheedathil] Good one for short and long stay for single Male working professionals or students. Food not available. Rooms are average but ok.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:42.020512', 4, 806, 4),
(4918, U&'[Avnsh] Located in Ekkatuthangal, SR guesthouse is an ideal location if you want to get ditched and carry away really bad memories of stay in Chennai. ||I was here for a month long stay (charges on a monthly basis) for Rs. 8000/ month||Mugesh, the manager put me up in a room for a day, then asked me to shift the next day into another room. While billing he charged me Rs. 350 more for the first day of stay over and above Rs 8000/- just because I was in a different room on the first day of stay. ||When I said that it is none of my concern as I will be paying for a month\2019s stay only no matter where I stay in the Guest house and it was he who asked me to shift. ||||He asked me to leave and refused to pay back the amount I had paid as advance. When I threatened him of legal action, he mellowed down.||Extraordinarily greedy man and tries to loot you in every way possible.||||Also, the place feels a bit fishy coz of some of the activities, again its a personal opinion only. ||AVOID!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:42.020677', 0, 806, 4),
(4919, U&'[bharathy karthick] Good service. Good for long stay as well as for short stays. Affordable and calm. Don''t expect any views from rooms,\+01f609', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:42.020835', 4, 806, 4),
(4920, U&'[Saran J] I\2019ve been staying here over two weeks. The Service is Superb and responsive.nSeparate room without attached bath is little small. But, not too much to worry.nBest room for the introverts like myself.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:42.020982', 5, 806, 4),
(4921, '[BHARATH VIEW] Rooms... All okay.. Main thing having parkingnnAnd the reception guy ( Prasad ) good person, very humble...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:42.02114', 4, 806, 4),
(4922, '[JRC INDIA Utube] Nice rooms,bathrooms. Very clean. toilate little bit small but good service over here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:42.021283', 5, 806, 4),
(4923, U&'[Arul bright] Waste of money and waste of living here.....nThey never return your advance 2000nIt''s a waste land of the year (21st century)n\+01f628\+01f922\+01f92esmall room for 3 share and 5 share \+01f614 some of the room mates drink and the terrace was worst not clean. ..nWorst experience .... Food was limited..\+01f620\+01f92c If it have 0 star I choose that .....n\+01f614', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:42.827869', 1, 807, 4);             
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4924, '[Pranav] I''ve stayed here in a 3 sharing from 8th of march 2024 to 29th march 2024. Informed them early that I''m vacating my room. Still they didn''t give back my advance 2000 .They''re not picking up my phone calls. Literally i paid 6500+2000 for just 21 days.nnAbout the facilitiesnHygiene is averagenFood is also averagenNo ventilation in the room that i stayed.(attached photos)nFeels hot even when the climate outside is cold.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:42.828526', 1, 807, 4),
(4925, '[Sparjan Samuvel] I felt very comfortable in that hostel. I gave only three stars;because, you never get your Advance amount. I asked owner Akka she told that she would give upcoming month. She didn''t give and she is not picking up my call and messages in WhatsApp.nI felt very bad ( I''m not an alcoholic, never damage anything in that hostel).nIf you are trying for affordable price,you can try this hostel. But, don''t expect your Advance amount.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:42.829149', 3, 807, 4),
(4926, U&'[\00dd\00c0\015eW\00c1\00d1TH \00d1\0104I\0110\00dc] Worst hostel i ever seen. There is no ventilation, drinking water and food on time. That food also not good. After vacating they don''t even return advance money also. Waste i have ever seen chi plz don''t stay in this hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:42.829342', 1, 807, 4),
(4927, U&'[Howard Potts] 100% Fraud Scam. All positive reviews are given by the owner guy from different Google accounts. If anyone gives negative review he will accuse them as drinkers. This is his full time job.nEdit: Reply to the owner. For your kind information I have called you multiple times to refund my advance amount and you didn''t even attend it. But thanks for replying, now people know, from your reply that what kind of attitude scammer guy you are. And instead of replying to every true review, you can concentrate on improving your hostel facilities and start returning people their money. Oh sorry scammers don''t do that \+01f642', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:42.829917', 1, 807, 4),
(4928, U&'[J A N A Sri] This is a worst hostel will advance not refund the money before paying please no one stay here be careful. \+01f4afnFood will not be good in this PG hostel and the rent will be wasted...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:42.830241', 1, 807, 4),
(4929, '[SANDHA SHORUBI] The place is good to start, we can feel comfortable here, the food is average. There could be some heat in the summer season. Nice eco system.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:42.830555', 3, 807, 4),
(4930, '[Bruno Boii] This is the worst pg ever ,me with my three friends gave an advance of 12000nBut they didn''t give us what they offered us to provide so we stayed one night there but they didn''t give the full advance back he said that he will minus 2000 and give the advance back for just one night but after for months some amount is pending if we call him he said here after i will never pick your calls don''t lose your money in this type of pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:42.83068', 1, 807, 4),
(4931, U&'[Rai Star] I stayed in that PG for more than six months. One night, a robbery occurred due to the management''s negligence\2014they didn\2019t close the main door, and at the time, my room had no lock. We lost more than six phones, money, purses, and a laptop. The robbers were caught on CCTV footage with clear faces, and we provided the video to the police and filed an FIR. However, the police have not responded or resolved the issue so far. I asked about the case more than twice, but they kept giving false answers. I also asked  the pg owner about case he also tells sweet lies,what a life ,Even though the food in the PG wasn\2019t good, I didn\2019t complain to the management. I heard the PG owner has political influence, but I don\2019t understand why the robbers haven\2019t been caught. Maybe that\2019s just how the city is. I was really disappointed at that moment, and it still lingers in my mind like a nightmare.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:43.400372', 1, 808, 4),
(4932, '[Sureshkumar C] At the beginning everything was okay but now its getting worse. There''s no cleaning the rooms since one month. Food also getting worse. We''ve told them to clean the rooms but no response from the management. So if u want a clean and hygiene environment for staying don''t choose this pg. Every room in this pg is 6 sharing only but they won''t maintain properly.nFood - 3/5nRooms - 3/5nCleaning - 1/5nWater - 4.5/5nWiFi - 5/5', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:43.400704', 2, 808, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4933, '[Sakthi Saravanan K] What is the price of 1 month', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:43.401077', 3, 808, 4),
(4934, '[N Yogesh] What is the rent for one month without food', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:43.401262', 5, 808, 4),
(4935, U&'[Abhi Sandy] What\2019s the price monthly', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:43.401421', 3, 808, 4),
(4936, '[Jerome Michael] Nice place to live', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:43.401583', 5, 808, 4),
(4937, '[Riyaz] Simply hate it', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:43.401729', 1, 808, 4),
(4938, '[Ramanatha sethupathi] Neat and clean', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:43.402009', 5, 808, 4),
(4939, '[Krishna Prashanth] Great atmosphere to stay. Accessible location. Good maintenance. Property manager vijay is very responsive. Suitable for Working professionals. Spacious bike parking. Charges are slightly expensive.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:44.307849', 5, 809, 4),
(4940, '[Vishwanathan Regupathi] People say this PG accommodation offers clean, well-maintained rooms with top-notch facilities and amenities like Wi-Fi and laundry. Guests mention feeling safe and secure due to proper security measures and responsive management. They also highlight the peaceful environment and courteous staff, making it a comfortable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:44.308082', 5, 809, 4),
(4941, '[Thirumurugan A] The PG is so comfort .Enough parking space too. Property manager is really great who is always a call away and sorts out problem really quick. Would recommend for studying and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:44.308301', 5, 809, 4),
(4942, '[Sujan Sivakumar] Had a good ,safe and comfortable for working professionals.great option for who ever comes to Chennai for first time.Respectable Manager and Management Also.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:44.308509', 5, 809, 4),
(4943, '[Music Lover Creation] Nice Accommodation and Good PG For Students and Working People''s.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:44.308825', 5, 809, 4),
(4944, '[Selva Balaji] The PG is so comfort n peaceful! Has all amenities for a fully furnished flat. Enough parking space too. Property manager Vimal is really great who is always a call away and sorts out problem really quick. Would recommend for studying and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:44.309063', 5, 809, 4),
(4945, '[Shunmuganathan] Excellent accommodation facility for working professionals. Accommodation available for both men and women. Fully furnished. A/c, fridge, washing machine, wifi, smart tv, microwave oven, induction stove, RO water, inverter power backup etc available. A great option. Option of Single / twin bed sharing / triple bed sharing available. Very near to Alandur Metro Station. Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:44.309282', 5, 809, 4),
(4946, '[saikoushal Gunnam] really good place to stay, peaceful neighborhood, close to guindy metro and alandur metro stations and many other good restaurants, the rooms are cleaned regularly, I would say it''s the best pg in Guindy area and alandur , the facility manager vimal is a great person he''s really helpful.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:44.309428', 5, 809, 4),
(4947, U&'[Karthikeya] Worst hostel in this area, no proper maintenance, weekly once cleaning the bath rooms , full rats are running, workers behaviour very harsh , owners also money minded he speaks with only money , please don''t join here \+01f64f\+01f64f power bill also very looty they taking each person 600 rupees for Non AC ... Example in one room 5 members they collecting 600x5=3000 power bill  for 5 members sharing room 2 fans one light. Bathrooms very worst, full bed bugs here , drinking water place beside drainage every time bad smell there and if rats died also they are not clear it after smell only they removing died rats ... Worst worst hostel in Chennai', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:45.033787', 1, 810, 4),
(4948, U&'[Dharmeshwar M] New Building ..nFood Provided is good and healthy...\+01f44d\+01f44cnBetter Place to live with ease to connectivity...\+01f44dnEkkatuthangal Metro Station Within 300m,nOlympia Tech Park Within 100m.nOwners Mr.Giri and Mr.Ravi are Good CareTakers...\+01f44d\+01f44d\+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:45.034157', 4, 810, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4949, U&'[abishek] One of the worst PGs in Chennai. Don\2019t stay here! Initially, the owner will say the rent is \20b98,000 with food for a 3-sharing AC room. Later, they will add an electricity bill of \20b92,200 per person in a 3-sharing room, making the total \20b910,200 per month.nnHow can a 3-sharing room have a current bill of 3 \00d7 \20b92,200 = \20b96,600 per month? They are total cheaters. They also don\2019t return the advance when you vacate.nnThe food is terrible as well. They either add too much spice or too much salt so that no one can eat properly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:45.034413', 1, 810, 4),
(4950, U&'[KAVIN KUMAR K] So bad and worst pg in Chennai and food is \+01f92e.if u give advance amount just forget about it and the EB bill is so expensive then government offers. if u want PG just go to other PG and it''s a honest review. The owner is so arrogant and just money minded fellow.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:45.034588', 1, 810, 4),
(4951, '[Fowsul Ameen] Worst Pg in Chennai . Really Please no one come here. They are charging for current like they are producing it. Food is very average. And the receptionist is not replying properly and try', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:45.034753', 1, 810, 4),
(4952, '[Vijey Mathavan] Room seems to be good but there is no shelves to keep your belongings. You have to keep everything inside your luggage bags. Congested rooms no free space.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:45.035035', 1, 810, 4),
(4953, '[TADDI SAI] One of the best pg in Chennai. Rent was reasonable. Homely food provided. The best stay for Andhra and telangana people.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:45.035334', 5, 810, 4),
(4954, '[Giri Ravipati1979] Nice rooms, 3times gud food, clan rooms every room led tv, all are attached toilets free wifi, 24 hours water, washing machine available, regan bul price ,nic place to stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:45.035489', 5, 810, 4),
(4955, '[Star man magic] Please don''t choose this pg ,nBecause at the end of vacating room you will not get your deposit amount fully ,the owner will take huge amount from the deposit money which you paid from the beginning by making fake calculations and also he will charge extra 500,1000rs for maintenance per month beware about that,  its my experience and others experience also', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:48.29895', 1, 814, 4),
(4956, '[Aditya roy] Worst experience,nI am telling about the deposit amountnAt the end of vacating room the owner is not gonna give you the deposit amount which you paid from the beginning fully he will take morethan 5000 rupees from that by making fake maintenance bill and monthly he will ask 500 extra charge for fake maintenancenHe will ask AC MAINTENANCE-3000nWATER HEATER MAINTENANCE -1500nBEDSHEET AND PILLOW WASHING -500nROOM CLEANING -500nELECTRIC BILL -500nthe main thing is he will not mention about this from the beginning and he will not inform anything about this', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:48.299529', 1, 814, 4),
(4957, '[Sundar B] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:48.30018', 5, 814, 4),
(4958, U&'[Sandip Das] Worst Experience: Money Taken, No Service u0026 No Daily FoodnAbsolutely pathetic service. Once you pay the full amount/rent, they completely stop caring about the residents. There is zero customer support or accountability after the payment is made.nThe worst part is the food\2014despite charging for it, meals are not provided on a regular daily basis. Basic promised services are completely ignored. It feels like a complete waste of money and peace of mind. Highly recommend everyone to avoid Stanza Living.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.173948', 1, 815, 4),
(4959, U&'[Ganesh Munagala] I\2019ve been staying at Stanza Living in Alandur, Chennai, and overall it\2019s been a comfortable and convenient experience. The location is a big advantage\2014very close to the metro and well-connected to key areas, which makes daily commute much easier.nThe rooms are well-maintained, with decent furnishings and regular housekeeping. The staff are generally helpful and responsive, especially when it comes to maintenance requests. Food quality is okay\2014some days are better than others\2014but it\2019s manageable for a working professional.nSecurity and safety are well taken care of, which gives peace of mind. The common areas are clean, and the overall environment is quite friendly andsuitablef for workingpprofessionals.nThat said, there is still some room for improvement in terms of consistency in food and house keeping.nOverall, I would recommend Stanza Living in Alandur for anyone looking for a hassle-free, semi-managed stay in Chennai.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.174173', 4, 815, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4960, '[Balaji Shanmugam] I had a great experience staying in this PG. Rooms are neat and well-maintained, food quality is good, and the staff are very supportive. The location is convenient and safe. Overall, a very comfortable place to stay...nnSpecial thanks to Dinesh bro..', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.174292', 5, 815, 4),
(4961, '[Dinesh Kumar] It is best option to choose a pg. Regular room check and rc visits makes safety assure. Food is a bit not ok, otherwise this place is safe and good to go.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.174392', 5, 815, 4),
(4962, '[Venkat Venkat] Excellent PG! Clean rooms, hygienic food, good security, and cooperative staff. Feels like home. Strongly recommend for working professionals and students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.174884', 5, 815, 4),
(4963, '[Ilango] Good place to stay, convenient location, regular cleaning,good food and friendly staff to immediately solve any complaint and requirements.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.17507', 5, 815, 4),
(4964, U&'[Ammu] Safest place\+01f44d,nfood is average though.\+01f642,nRegular cleaning and well maintained \+01f44d,nFriendly rc\+01f642. Good to choose .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.175188', 5, 815, 4),
(4965, U&'[Aditya Sharma] Serious Service Deficiencies and Management Accountability IssuesnnI am compelled to share my experience regarding persistent, unresolved security concerns that have been escalated for over two weeks without any tangible action or response.nnDespite multiple follow-ups, the situation remains unchanged:n- RC consistently deflects concerns, citing workload as a reason for inaction rather than prioritizing critical security mattersn- RC acknowledges the issues but provides no concrete progress updates or resolution timelinesn- This represents a fundamental failure in management''s duty of care toward resident safetynnThe gap between initial commitments and actual service delivery is unacceptable. During onboarding, management presents a professional, responsive image. Post-occupancy, however, the reality is starkly different.nnThe mobile application compounds these issues by creating a closed-loop system with no escalation mechanism, effectively trapping residents without recourse to senior management.nnMost concerning is the inequitable approach to accountability: residents face immediate penalties for payment delays of even one day, while management delays critical resolutions by weeks with complete impunity. No timelines are provided, no accountability measures exist.nnThis is not merely poor customer service\2014it represents systemic negligence in security protocols and a broken complaint resolution framework. Management must implement immediate corrective measures and establish transparent accountability standards.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.175284', 1, 815, 4),
(4966, '[Jerome] I had a peaceful stay at this PG for around 1 year. The rooms were clean and environment were safe and comfortable. Bus Stand (Bharati nagar) u0026 Railway Station (Kodambakkam) are in walking distance from the PG. Highly recommended for students u0026 working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.411522', 5, 816, 4),
(4967, '[Ganesh Raja] I would like to thank the owner for maintaining the PG so clean and well maintaining.nnI moved in June 2023 and stayed for three years, and during this time, I never once considered changing my PG. The atmosphere here is truly peaceful and gives a comforting, home like feeling.nnThe owners treat us like family and take care of every little detail. Because of this warmth and care, it truly feels like a home away from home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.412104', 5, 816, 4),
(4968, '[Barani Batsy] I have never come across a PG hostel as clean and nice as this one. It''s incredibly calm as well. The owner is also genuine.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.412802', 5, 816, 4),
(4969, '[Kifi Entertainment] The owner lady is to mean u0026 arrogant ,there is no wifi , no washing machine ,no food ,no parking as you said your Google my business does not said you are all not included all amenity , pg means all basic facilities should include', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.413018', 1, 816, 4);    
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4970, '[Nishanth R] Worst PG ever. The management is extremely strict,Room was very heat, they only focused on money. They do not refund the money even if you leave within one day. I would not recommend this place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.413398', 1, 816, 4),
(4971, '[Sibi] No concrete building, it is cement sheet. So much of heat will be there. They will not return advance back. Very bad behaviour.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.413694', 1, 816, 4),
(4972, '[Sidharth Sugathan] I had been staying her since August 2022 ie for 2 years. PG is nice and owners are good. PG is clean, since hygiene is main concern here. Rooms are cleaned regularly.nWhile vacating, I have received my Advance back.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.413989', 5, 816, 4),
(4973, U&'[harsha kakathiya] One word if I want to say that it is like my home.\+01f60d\+01f60d\+01f60d\+01f60d\+01f60dnnI joined last year in August, from that day still I never think about change the pg ( one year 1 month).nInside you have very good atmosphere which takes you to a piece of mind with home like environment.nnThe owners are simply own as their family''s and takes care every thing about us.with all this good satisfaction we forget the all stress once reach this place.nnIf i say like this there is lot more....if you want to stay in t nagar especially in pg this is the best place you can opt for.....', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.414204', 5, 816, 4),
(4974, '[Vigneshraja M] I''ve had a really good experience staying at this PG. The place is cleaned every day, so it''s always neat and hygienic. Although there''s no food service, there''s a kitchen where you can cook your own meals without any extra charges, which is very convenient.nnThe PG provides all the essential amenities like Wi-Fi, a washing machine, an iron box, a kettle, and a heater. The owner is approachable and resolves any issues or complaints as quickly as possible. The roommates are also friendly and cooperative, which makes the overall atmosphere pleasant.nnThe only minor downside is that there aren''t many extra facilities beyond the essentials, and the kitchen can get a bit busy during peak cooking hours.(if Cook together then no issue)Other than that, it''s a clean, comfortable, and well-managed PG. I''d definitely recommend it to anyone looking for a hassle-free place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.952404', 5, 817, 4),
(4975, U&'[Raj] One of the best places to stay, whether it\2019s for a short visit or a longer stay. The place is clean, comfortable, and has a very welcoming atmosphere.nnThe host, Praveen, is extremely friendly, helpful, and down to earth. He genuinely makes sure guests feel comfortable and settled in, which makes a big difference, especially if you\2019re new to the city.nnI would definitely recommend this place to anyone visiting Chennai for the first time or looking for a peaceful and reliable place to stay. It feels less like a rental and more like staying with someone who truly cares about the guest experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.952586', 5, 817, 4),
(4976, U&'[Anto] Even though I didn''t stay here, I want to highlight Mr. Praveen\2019s honesty. He spent time understanding my needs but told me their current rooms weren\2019t a fit. Instead of a quick sale, he guided me to other options in Chennai where he had no personal benefit. A rare example of putting people before profit!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.952808', 5, 817, 4),
(4977, '[Yeshwanth Ram] I spent a few months here and had a fantastic stay. The house is in a great location, quiet, and equipped with everything needed for a long-term stay. Management was always prompt and professional.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.952957', 5, 817, 4),
(4978, '[Akshay S] It was a wonderful experience in overall!!nThe PG wasn''t like a PG, it felt like home and the overall freedom and luxury you get is really amazing!!nThe Owner is so friendly and kind. I would recommend this to anybody who is willing to stay in a comfort place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.953098', 5, 817, 4);     
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4979, U&'[Kishore Kesan] I would have gave 100/100 for the stay and 1000/1000 for praveen anna. more than a business he''s doing this for a sake of service .to everyone who is looking for a budget friendly and good ecosystem, stay confident would be the best place that I would suggest you.nMore than a owner he has always been like a big brother. I''ve always amazed by his work the amount of hardwork that he puts into this is incredible \+01f90d\+01f90d\+01f90d\+01f90d more Power to Praveen anna! And this has always been like a home and family and he treats everyone as his own brother.i wish him all the best and let this service continue to touch all the lives who''s looking for a worthy stay!!\+01f90d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.95343', 5, 817, 4),
(4980, '[Mahalakshmi Pagadala] I called them to enquire for my brother. After so much of search in and around of ekkatuthangal, Ashok nagar, saidapet and Guindy area, I honestly felt this place is worth for the facility they offer. This is not any fancy place but definitely a simple honest homes. I have to mention about the patience of them in explain the difference between the pg hostel and pg homes and giving us the option to decide without forcing to take their place, which is very unique attitude Nd they are also very courteous to reffer us to other hostal near by my brothers work place, which I feel is the real customer service. I am taking so much time to write this as business like this needs to be noticed.nWishing them all the best.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.953672', 5, 817, 4),
(4981, '[Sakthinathan S] I stayed in the hostel for few months and they provide excellent services and it make me feel that I was at my home. A PG with affordable price and excellent services.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:49.953843', 5, 817, 4),
(4982, U&'[Ranjan Roy] White HousenStudy place are very usefulnVery nice place to stay for working people and students and Rooms and foods are awesome.. very near to metro station and bus stop.. moreover if any body vacate also  and inform before timeline.. deposits will Returned promptly ..nnegative points is they never alow smoking and drinking inside premises \+01f490\+01f490', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:50.494605', 5, 818, 4),
(4983, '[Atiq Basha] Negatives:nFirst related to advance money you pay. Forget about advance u pay. They are not going to return. They say u cannot vacate in-between the month, so anyhow u are going to loose advance if u have to leave in between. I lost whole advance amount.nSecond if u are staying in AC room u have to pay for electricity bill apart from room rent. Hence they are charging 15 rupees per unit. That for 4 members stay, in a single room electricity bill is more than 10,000. This amount is shared on each head. That is u have to pay 2000 to 2500 each month electricity bill. 10000 electricith bill is for one AC room. They don''t share electricity bill. They just say ur month reading and they say they are charging 15 rupees per unit.  But in chennai per unit cost for electricity is 5 to 10 rupees only depends on area.nThird related to food, u only get idly, Dosa, sometimes noodles and any one day rice for dinner. Everything is limited. According to me food is average.nFourth internet is not at all good. And network signal is soo weak that u have walk outside to call without any issues.nnPositives:nStay is peaceful, Particularly area is good, u get everything u need. So as food is below average u can have good food outside if u can afford.nThat''s it nothing much related to positives.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:50.495161', 1, 818, 4),
(4984, '[Tony Kishore] The White House Men''s Hostel, my experience was average. The rooms were adequate, with comfortable beds and basic furnishings that served their purpose. However, the lack of natural light and limited ventilation made the atmosphere feel stuffy and cramped at times.nnThe bathroom facilities were clean and well-maintained, with ample hot water and basic amenities such as soap and towels provided. However, the shower areas were quite small, which made it difficult to move around comfortably.nnThe staff members were friendly and helpful, responding promptly to our requests for assistance and providing us with information about the local area. However, their presence was somewhat limited, and we often found ourselves having to wait for their attention.nnThe location of the hostel was convenient, situated in a bustling and lively neighborhood with plenty of shops and restaurants nearby. However, the noise levels outside could be quite loud at times, which made it difficult to sleep at night.nnOverall, my experience at The White House Men''s Hostel was satisfactory. While there were some drawbacks, such as the cramped rooms and limited staff presence, the clean bathroom facilities and convenient location made up for these shortcomings.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:50.495377', 3, 818, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4985, U&'[R Gangadharan] I have been living here for 3 months now. Probably one of the best PGs in Chennai. Very friendly owner and immediately solves issues if any. Also the PG is clean, rooms are well maintained with good homely good. CCTV surveillance is 24\00d77, along with safety is guaranteed. I''ll definitely recommend it to everyone', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:50.495615', 5, 818, 4),
(4986, U&'[XeeV] One of the best PG to stay at while I was in Chennai. After staying at a lot of disgusting PG I can definitely say that the service they provide is way above par. The rooms are a little bit small but they are clean and well maintained and you also get your own cupboard to keep your belongings. Not to mention the PG is under CCTV surveillance. Grab the rooms when they are available. You won\2019t be dissatisfied or disappointed.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:50.495949', 4, 818, 4),
(4987, '[Martin Amirtharaj] I''m hating this because they are not professional, they don''t encourage only staying as they provide food through their own kitchen they force people to take food from them... for washing they are charging 100 per wash... that''s too costly... and that mess person is soo annoying...!! They raised rent it seems... and, they don''t even clean the rest room daily , even for 8 sharing they don''t even clean the rest room on a daily basis... they clean once in a week...!!nnThey are just unprofessional...!!nnBut in this area they are providing something .. because others here (other pg) are the worst...!! They are worse', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:50.496157', 2, 818, 4),
(4988, U&'[akash Balakrishnan] The rooms in the PG are decent enough and they have done a good job maintaining it and they clean the washroom weekly once.nThe food provided there is okay nothing so great about it and on some days ,they are\00a0 bad and lunch is between 1 and 2 pm , somedays if you go after 1.30 , there will be no lunch. So you''ll have to be okay with it. Nothing much you can do about it.nnThe WIFI in this hostel is very poor. It will work well for 7-10 days in a month and then it will suck big time. You will be unable to browse simple things let alone stream any videos.nI don''t know whether it''s because they subscribe for limited data packs.nI have been in few PG\2019s before ,there used to be minimum 2 washing machines .Here there\2019s only one for whole PG (for more than 70 members approx)and on top of that they charge Rs.80 every time you use it. Never have I heard anyone charging money for using washing machine\2019s in PG/hostel.Its not ideal.nnthe above facilities like WFI(great speed and connection), washing machines (free) are commonly provided in all other PG\2019s . Everyone in this PG will agree with me on the above issues I mentioned. Kindly address those issues', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:50.496392', 2, 818, 4),
(4989, '[Ilanchezhian Thangaraj] Very good hostel... Trust worthy and safe place.nGood rooms, neatly maintained and good management team.nVery caring team.nIdeal place for preparing for IAS coaching and other competitive exams.nEnabling environment for studying.nBest place for preparing for future carriers and advance our professional development.nThanks to the management.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:50.496878', 5, 818, 4),
(4990, '[JITHIN P V] Nice pg clean and with cctv and 24/7 security system. Very near to Egmore and Central Railway and metro station.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:50.680813', 5, 819, 4),
(4991, '[Dr. Mahima S S] The place is clean, hygienic, and well-maintained, with all required facilities. It felt comfortable and safe throughout my stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:50.680995', 5, 819, 4),
(4992, U&'[Anusree Sivan] SK PG Hostel provided a generally positive experience during my one-year stay in a Two Sharing AC room.n\200bThe Wi-Fi was excellent, which was a significant plus. The security and housekeeping staff were friendly and accommodating.n\200bI would recommend this PG primarily for its clean rooms. There is a common kitchen available for residents to cook their own food, which is necessary as you should be prepared to manage your own food arrangements.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:50.68115', 5, 819, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4993, '[Sundaram V] It''s very nice experience, all facilities are available in this PG , 24/7 security persons are available, daily housekeeping, wifi, ro water, washing machine, induction stove for cooking, ac available and maintenance is very good, around this area temple, egmore railway station, bus facility, hotels are available..you look for present stay choose this PG at Egmore High road Chennai', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:50.681304', 5, 819, 4),
(4994, '[CHERAN G] I usually don''t post review much, When I''m vacating I had train 9.00pm, i asked the manager to come at 7.30 pm to get the deposit back to avoid last minute hassle he was very furious, when have to vacate as soon as we get the deposit, why ?? Paying 11 thousand for a pg premium price that the market staying a bit is what itches them??. as a individual One of the very worst experiences  I had in this pg see cost is very high 11k for 3 sharing, no food but that isn''t an issue. Kitchen is at all the utensils are peeled no worth of usage. At this price you get pgs with food.nnDon''t recommend this one. Pg is not as shown in the pictures.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:50.681463', 1, 819, 4),
(4995, '[shuwasthick pravin] I stayed here for 3 Months. This PG is Very Good For people who are looking neat and Good Pg in and around Egmore. This Pg has security, Fridge, Tv, Washing Machine, Parking. But the Biggest problem is U wont Get Food and they charge 12,000 per month. But if u are looking to stay for a short period of time. Then it''s truely a Good option. Even feom Deposit they charged only for electricity bill and that too with exact Unit. Not extra. THE ONLY BIG PROBLEM IS FOOD AND THEIR RENT PRICE.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:50.681613', 4, 819, 4),
(4996, '[supriya jamatia] Good pg. Clean and hygienic. Cooking facilities are there. Manageable. Utensils we have to use ours. Power backup and wifi is there. Feel safe. Washing machine is there. Roof is there walking can be done. Fridge in floor so good. Overall good experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:50.681835', 4, 819, 4),
(4997, '[Gagandeep Bishnoi] The place is very hygienic and comfortable. All the necessities are duly provided. The location of the place (nearby egmore railway) is of prime importance. Grocery stores are at walking distance. The owner is very cordial and addresses any concerns with top priority.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:50.681982', 5, 819, 4),
(4998, '[Gokul Samraj] I stayed here for more than a year and I would like to say that its a best PG compared to other PGs my colleagues mentioned and I stayed beforennThe surroundings of the PG is great in terms of availability of various shops and the PG was well maintained.nnThere are various sharing of rooms in the PG including single sharing and the manager Gopi is a humble and helpful guy , will do the necessary as soon as possible.nThere won''t be any major issues , except one time the water stopped during a day time and I call to Gopi, he just fixed it within 10 minutes. This issue occurred only 1 time in my 1 year journey which shows how well the PG is maintained without any issues.nnThe PG also have a good security system and good basic needs like water , wifi , parking, AC , TV , CCTV, etc. Even though without locking my room, my things were safe in this PG.nnIn terms of food , even though its seperated from room rent , im glad that the food availability here is much better that eating in shops. The variety of menu here and the price we pay is literally unmatched . I never went to sleep in a empty stomach after taking meals here. Its very much affordable and healthy compared to hotels. self cooking is not allowed for safety reasons but there won''t be any necessrity for self cooking since the cooks wont allow us to leave the mess with a empty stomach . They say the food is limited but actually its sufficient for a well eater too. Even in the gas cylinder situation the food service pushed to its best to feed the guest in the PG which is a great one.nwhile serving the food ,people in the mess kind enough to serve food in a well mind mannered which will make us to eat food in peaceful manner.nnThe only issue with this place is bus facility, its usually too rush in peak hour since there is only 1 bus (No.91). Except travel this place is best to stay.nnI''m glad i chose this place ,over all the services, food , manager and mess peoples were great , thanks to Mani Sir for doing all the necessrity for me and made my stay best.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:51.660581', 5, 820, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(4999, U&'[B. Arunachlam] Had a wonderful stay here for the past 5 years. The PG provides a comfortable, safe, and friendly environment with good facilities and a positive atmosphere. The care and hospitality made it feel like a home away from home. The farewell cake and sweets made the experience even more memorable. Highly recommended! \+01f60a\2728', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:51.660884', 5, 820, 4),
(5000, U&'[MARVELOUS STUDIOS] I was reached this PG by 2024 New Year. Now I am leaving this PG by 2026. In this two years This PG Is feel like my 2nd home in chennai. By the way Owner is reachable in any timing and he is very genuine character. He is caring about his guests. You can see the development from 2024 to now. So if anyone watching my review you can go with this PG. You won''t regret about it\+01f44d\+01f3fb', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:51.661098', 5, 820, 4),
(5001, U&'[Imue Wha] Thanks a lot for all ur support really ur pg was amazing it\2019s safe and hygienic. definitely I will refer to my friends.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:51.661226', 5, 820, 4),
(5002, U&'[Bharath R] I had a wonderful experience staying in this PG for two years, from October 2023 to October 2025. The rooms are always clean, well-maintained, and comfortable, making it feel just like home. I am especially thankful to the owner \2014 he\2019s not just an owner, but more like a friendly brother who is always supportive and caring toward everyone. Gopi also deserves special mention for managing everything smoothly and ensuring all the residents are comfortable. The food here is really tasty and homely, which made my stay even better. Overall, it\2019s one of the best PGs I have stayed in, and I would highly recommend it to anyone looking for a safe and friendly place to live.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:51.66183', 5, 820, 4),
(5003, '[Harvey Douglas] I stayed four months here very neat and comfortable rooms. The food is also very goodnHighly Recommended', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:51.6621', 5, 820, 4),
(5004, '[Tarun Jaikishan] Great experience. Though it was a shorter stay, I had a great time staying there comfortable. Thanks to the team!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:51.662389', 5, 820, 4),
(5005, '[Santhosh .M] The PG was very good and comfortable with availability of food and wifi and bike parking facilities. And there are friendly employees.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:51.662507', 5, 820, 4),
(5006, '[Uday Kumar] I''m stayed here 1 month, location is good because its very near to T Nagar bus stop. Come to room, they told 2 u0026 4 sharing rooms are available, once I see the room, they are two sub rooms in one room, each room 4beds, total one 4 sharing room strength was 8 members, only one restroom for 8 members this is very unfair. 2 sharing also same, 2+2=4 members in one room, only one restroom for them. That restroom is very very worest, even they didn''t clean once in a week. Come to food, every day morning breakfast is available like idly, pongal, upma this kind of breakfast available, taste is not too good it''s below average. Then afternoon food is very worest, they providing very cheap quality rice, if we eat very low quantity, our stomach will be very tight and uneasy. Evening also they provide tiffin like dosa, idlyy this kind of tiffin available. That dosa was not dosa it''s like stone. Weekly once they provide nonveg, white rice + chicken curry, that curry very very very worest, curry full on water and chicken uneatable peaces. I''ll upload all the pics like room, restroom and food also. Finally what I''m telling is if want to stay here please read my comment and see total pics it''s my best suggestion.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:52.842521', 2, 821, 4),
(5007, U&'[Mowli M] Stayed at Sri Venkateshwara PG Hostel, Mambalam. Rooms are neat, well-maintained, and the atmosphere feels safe and comfortable. Management is friendly and supportive.nFood quality is good, homely taste, hygienic, and served on time. Overall, a very good PG in Mambalam for a peaceful stay. \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:52.843075', 5, 821, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5008, '[Elavarasan] Honest review with my promisesnVery worst character of the warden its no hygine i sleept with that bed after morning ill having itching problem its my honest and toilet very very worst no air in the room its too sweat in night opened locker and then rat also came its full my honest review and then ill missed my purse The warden no negotiable its total 2/100 its my honest opinion and then in outer place fully hons gutka 12 number people have only one toilet itss tooo much cost of that i changed my room in guindy 6700 its too much cost', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:52.843791', 1, 821, 4),
(5009, '[Ajay Jabhastein] Good tasty food for 3 times , very good accommodation, cleaning room weekly 2 times...near to T nagar bustand..', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:52.844592', 4, 821, 4),
(5010, U&'[Pugal .m] Budget friendly accommodation and food. Esepcialy variety rices so good \+01f44d.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:52.844909', 5, 821, 4),
(5011, '[Dhina Dhina] This hostel provides a stay affordable price and Food is satisfactory. Hostel management provided free Wi-Fi. Worth for money', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:52.845078', 4, 821, 4),
(5012, U&'[Rana Vaii] Affordable food and accommodation.nnice environment \+01f917', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:52.84521', 4, 821, 4),
(5013, '[Jeshan Syed] Very worst, water issue *****, per day 2 hours only water come, if you want fill the buckets , weekly 3 or 4 time idly dosa morning and dinner sambar and pongal not good below average quality, rest room very worst un hygiene', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:52.84535', 1, 821, 4),
(5014, '[Muthuselva] Really enjoyed staying here. The rooms are clean and comfortable, the management is helpful, and the roommates are friendly and easy to get along with. Overall, it''s a nice and peaceful place to stay. Definitely recommend it!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:53.430753', 5, 822, 4),
(5015, '[Tendulkar Dhanusu] I have stayed in this hostel for 5 years,nIt like a My home place and good environment,Hostel owner is  a help minded person and friendly owner.nBest PG in Chennai .nFood system is very good and nice also Lunch available herenNo water issues..nLuxurious RoomsnWorth for MoneynThankyou!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:53.431133', 5, 822, 4),
(5016, '[Aki Ak] I had a great stay at this pg. The rooms were clean and well maintained, the food was tasty u0026 hygienic and the overall environment was safe and comfortable. The owner and staff were friendly, helpful, and always responsive. I would definitely recommend this pg to anyone looking for a comfortable and peaceful place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:53.431422', 5, 822, 4),
(5017, '[Kannan Subramaniam] No parking space, toilets are shabby, fit only for small functions or party', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:53.431814', 2, 822, 4),
(5018, '[Ilango] Food is Worst and owner behavior is so rude if we complain anything', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:53.432041', 1, 822, 4),
(5019, U&'[THOFIK THOFIK] I  dont except for this pg it''s very awesome and like this pg,Food is home food \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:53.432215', 5, 822, 4),
(5020, '[Sathiya Moorthi] Good accommodation and Good quality of foods', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:53.433261', 5, 822, 4),
(5021, '[Santhosh Kumar] First they talk very nicely then the owner will show his real face.my frnd paid 1k advance for one month but the owner didn''t gave back.food become worst day by day.washing machine doesn''t run properly.so it''s not preferable.dont join guys', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:53.433485', 1, 822, 4),
(5022, '[Hari haran] it''s amazing place to stay and study and house owner as very very friendly person. so guys if you went to chennai for work or study you can go to this pg(if you wish). and rent also very less than other pg in anna nagarnnthis PG was very comfortable and satisfying for me.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:54.234958', 5, 823, 4),
(5023, '[Prithivi Raj R] one of the best hostel in anna nagar west.hostel located at calm street. in that hostel, studying area provision will be very useful to aspirants. within 100m radius, many affordable hotels, medical, stationary, fruit shop,...owner was very friendly type', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:54.235323', 5, 823, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5024, '[Jotheswaran P] Good place to stay for working people and for Students. Owner is so kind and Friendly. Cost of living in this pg is Low compared to other pg''s in chennai.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:54.235693', 5, 823, 4),
(5025, '[Vinoth Rathinam] Good place to stay in anna nagar, chennai. Cost wise, it is one of the good PG in anna nagar, owner is so kindly and friendly type. Preferable for students, and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:54.235961', 4, 823, 4),
(5026, '[Mags #] Affordable,friendly environment to prepare for UPSC,TNPSC exams. Owner supports for preparing aspirants at all level.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:54.236172', 5, 823, 4),
(5027, '[Dvk Prabhu] Very good place for TNPSC, UPSC students. Highlight is the Owner''s Great support for students. Safe and secured place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:54.236329', 5, 823, 4),
(5028, '[JEYANDIESEL42 Chelian] Best pg for Aspirants, Students and Working Employees. Peaceful place, Affordable price u0026 Good Maintenance, Owner is friendly and Genuine.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:54.236799', 5, 823, 4),
(5029, '[Kaveen Raj] A lovely and good atmosphere in pg and the owner Rajkumar Anna is friendly and good manner and also great welfare taker for students with great guides....:)', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:54.237021', 5, 823, 4),
(5030, '[VasanthaSaravanaSankar Subramani] I stayed here for 6 months from the opening of this PG here. Rooms are cleaned regularly. Good and responsive owner. Affordable rent. Only thing to improve is food varieties has to be increased, other than that everything is fine.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:54.969533', 4, 824, 4),
(5031, '[Sundhara Murthy Srinivasan] I''m staying here for the past two months. Faced no issues. Rooms and restrooms are cleaned on a regular basis.Good wifi connection.Good environment to stay in. Food is also good but only recommendation is kindly alter with menu.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:54.969702', 4, 824, 4),
(5032, '[Alone_BOTYt] The worst owner ever in Chennai PGs.nHe literally tortured us in returning advance and dint even gave us single rupee. And made us to vacate before 5 days of notice time. He will blackmail us to pay, I suggest you to not chose this Yalini at any conditions. People who are staying, try to vacate to avoid his cunning nature.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:54.969851', 1, 824, 4),
(5033, U&'[Chirag Ojha] Rooms are decent sized.nFor 3 sharing room with attached bathroom and AC each person has to given\20b96200 + AC billnIf daily food is required then \20b93000 extra per month.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:54.970024', 5, 824, 4),
(5034, '[Ganesh Keshaboina] Instead of staying in this pg better stay at office area or public area''s..waste of money...no proper communication, no proper house cleaning, no electricity and WiFi on time ,if you want to stay in this pg better be prepare for bad experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:54.970178', 1, 824, 4),
(5035, '[RAJESH K] Good atmosphere and peasefull PG stay.... Owner is very good and genuine responsive person...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:54.970321', 5, 824, 4),
(5036, '[bala murugan] Good place to stay..only concern here is food.other than everything is OK at affordable cost', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:54.970464', 4, 824, 4),
(5037, '[Dinesh Kumar Karri] Very good PG to stay....peace ful street...food need to be improved.....', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:54.970601', 4, 824, 4),
(5038, '[Dhino Williams.D] Very Good PG. Very neat and Tidy. Every money you spend for the rent is worthy..Such spacious rooms..Daily maintanence is top notch. Food is really delicious. Highly recommending to the people working in SIPCOT.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:56.513766', 5, 826, 4),
(5039, '[Praveen Palla] Good communication and good health food and good received', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:56.514286', 5, 826, 4),
(5040, '[Piyush Battkir] The food is good. Best AC budget friendly PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:56.514543', 5, 826, 4),
(5041, '[Yamini Gupta] Very bad i just called for some information the Anna who was on call was very rude very very rude . Nor at all recommended', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:56.514777', 1, 826, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5042, '[Ajay Kumar Diwakar] Cleanliness,  well maintained,  good food on time thrice a day.nnOwner is a good guy with polite attitude. Even the cook is aeesome guy and very friendly.nnEach flat has its own wifi so you will get speed upto 100mbps , while download it will show 6 - 8 mbps .nnNo worries for laundry as fully automatic washing machine is there , put your clthes and forget for 1 hr.nnLift is there in building and you can use it. Location is beautiful as easy accessible to tea shop , market , malls and other like hospitals and pharmacy.nnIn terms of food breakfast is good for all days. 2 days ie tuesday and Thursdays chaipatti and a good sabji is served.nnEither your veg or nonveg , sunday is special chicken  and smoked pulao with mushroom /paneer dish with a fried gobi as side dish.nnDosa /idly ,Utappam, vada and pongal tastes great with chutney he cooks. Served on 3 days on different time.nnPower rarely goes and water problem was never occured.nnAt night time you can stay on terrace as the city looks cool. During rainy season feel the rain and its sound on terrace.nnEnough parking space allowed only for 2 wheelers. Security using CCTV is there.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:56.514936', 5, 826, 4),
(5043, '[Aakash Clinton] Good pg with friendly owner. Food quality was good when compared with other pg''s i have stayed . Different types of rooms are available, choose by your comfort. Have very good washing machines and high speed wifi and large terrace .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:56.515124', 5, 826, 4),
(5044, '[venket dilip] Food is too spicy .they will not repay the advance when vacating . From Jan 2021 Jan 6 th to Jan 30 but while vacating pg management is not returning my advance amount even I am telling you can return my advance after 1 month or 2 month but pg owner is not accepting and they are not returning my amount . finally i decided waste of time to talk with pg owner then I moved that place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:56.5155', 1, 826, 4),
(5045, '[Yuvaneshkumar] It is an affordable pg for working and studying persons, food is good compare with other pg''s, rooms with personal lockers and spacious for members.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:56.515694', 5, 826, 4),
(5046, U&'[Rino Rasheed] I\2019ve stayed at this PG from January to July 2026, and it has been a great experience. It offers an affordable luxury stay with excellent amenities, including AC 2-sharing rooms, TV, refrigerator, washing machine, geyser, Wi-Fi, induction cooker, and a fully equipped kitchen with utensils provided. Each room has an attached bathroom, a private balcony with cloth hangers, and spacious individual shelves for every resident. The PG also provides 24/7 power backup, security, lift access, water purifiers on every floor, and separate parking spaces for both bikes and cars. One of its biggest strengths is the cleanliness, with weekly room cleaning and additional housekeeping available on request. Every floor has a common area, and the entire building maintains a peaceful and calm atmosphere. Although food is not provided, all essential kitchen utensils\2014from knives to plates\2014are available, making it very convenient for self-cooking. Overall, I highly recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable, well-maintained, and value-for-money place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:57.991443', 5, 828, 4),
(5047, U&'[Satish Sankoju] One of the best PG experiences in Chennai!nn\200bHad a really good experience staying at Mudra Stays Men\2019s PG in Velachery.nn\200bFacilities: The infrastructure is fairly new, well-maintained, and the location is easily accessible.nn\200bManagement: Suresh, the property manager, is genuinely helpful, straightforward, and no-nonsense.nn\200bDeposit u0026 Transparency: Unlike many PGs (or big co-living setups like Zolo and Stanza Living) that find excuses to deduct deposit money, Suresh is transparent with no hidden charges. While processing the deposit refund takes a few days after moving out, you get every single promised penny back.nn\200bOverall, a hassle-free and honest PG stay. Highly recommended for working professionals and students in the area!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:57.991583', 5, 828, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5048, '[Divyam Sareen] Really Nice place with all the amenities. The location is also really nice (near Phoenix Mall)', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:57.9917', 5, 828, 4),
(5049, '[Sankalp Kothari] Really good place to stay, clean and well maintained. Is in a commercial location (near Phoenix mall) so all facilities and different types of necessitiies available within walking distance.nnHighly recommend for anyone looking to stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:57.991819', 5, 828, 4),
(5050, U&'[Srinivasan Srinivasan] Such a great place to stay and feel like home.facilities are fantastic like car parking, 24 hours power supply, excellent maintenance with kind working people. I am very glad that i found this. Very excellent\+01f4af', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:57.991934', 5, 828, 4),
(5051, '[Manideep Miriyal] Stayed for short time but the hospitality from the management was so good. Best PG near Velachery, I was impressed by the PG due to its cleanliness and it''s peaceful neighbourhood.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:57.992047', 5, 828, 4),
(5052, '[kill bill] I had a very good experience staying at this PG. The rooms are clean, well maintained, and comfortable. The owner and staff are very friendly and helpful. They have an induction stove and TV, which is very convenient. The location is also excellent, with easy access to transport and all essential facilities nearby. It is a safe and peaceful place to stay. Highly recommended.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:57.992245', 5, 828, 4),
(5053, '[Akarsh Sinha] The most amazing pg you will ever find . Definitely recommend the place to anyone who wants a peaceful stay with all amenities', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:57.992358', 5, 828, 4),
(5054, '[S Aswin] Zolo Bingo has extremely poor maintenance. The cupboard in my room is broken, and the bed and pillow provided are in such bad condition that they are not even usable. The 3-sharing rooms are very congested, making it uncomfortable to stay. On top of that, the bed has bed bugs, which is a serious hygiene issue.nnMost of the positive reviews online seem fake because the actual condition of the place is nowhere close to what is shown. Really disappointed with the overall upkeep and quality.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:58.75144', 1, 829, 4),
(5055, U&'[Intruder Saji] Good stay experience. Rooms clean ah maintain panranga and staff response quick ah iruku. Location also convenient for working people. Overall comfortable stay.\201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:58.751607', 5, 829, 4),
(5056, '[Rajaram B] Rooms were okay and they do House keeping on daily basis. Facilities like RO water, Refrigerator, Microwave, Washing machine, Power Backup, Wifi, CCTV and Biometric entry security system all were good. But the building is little old and you can see some visible wall damages here and there which is little scary.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:58.751762', 3, 829, 4),
(5057, U&'[Jatin narula] Horrible First Day Experience at Zolo \2013 Avoid at All Costs!nnI am absolutely appalled by my first day at Zolo. This place is a nightmare!nnFirst off, the lock on my cupboard is broken, leaving my personal belongings at my own risk.nnThe walls are covered in disgusting efflorescence. How can they expect anyone to live in such unhygienic conditions?nnAnd don''t get me started on the mosquitoes. The room is infested! I am seriously worried about getting dengue.nnThere are no switchboards near the bed. Are we supposed to charge our phones from across the room?nnAvoid Zolo if you value your health, safety, and sanity. This place is a total disaster!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:58.751915', 1, 829, 4),
(5058, '[Gokulkumaar V K] Maintenance issues are rampant, with complaints about malfunctioning appliances, leaky faucets, worst furnitures going unresolved for extended periods. The management''s response to these concerns is lackluster at best, showing a blatant disregard for the well-being and satisfaction of residents.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:58.75206', 1, 829, 4),
(5059, '[Raj Kumar] Super comfortable and safe stays recommended any one new to city', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:58.752215', 5, 829, 4);          
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5060, '[Alwin George] The place is poorly maintained. It needs a lot of maintenance. It''s way too expensive for the way it''s in right now.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:58.752357', 2, 829, 4),
(5061, U&'[J.Dinesh kumar] ZERO RESPONSE FROM ZOLO BINGO MANAGEMENTnnOverall, the management is the worst I\2019ve experienced. No accountability, no proper facilities despite charging high rent+ additional charges. Strongly NOT recommended for anyone looking for a decent stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:58.752494', 1, 829, 4),
(5062, U&'[Arun Sabariraja S] The PG owner collects rent properly every month but does not maintain the property well, and they did not return the advance amount. They said that since we were leaving on short notice, they would deduct \20b9200 per day, almost 15 day''s he collected that money did not return my advance.nThey also stopped serving some food items like idly, dosa, and chapati, saying there was a gas shortage. However, we were still paying the full rent, so the owner seems very money-minded.nWhen we enquired, the owner said there would be one bathroom for four members, but in reality it is a common bathroom. It is very dirty, and the flushes are not working. The food is also below average and i pay 10,000 per month without current bill if it''s+eb bill i have been almost pay 11.5 k per month and ac will run but colling didn''t came if i informed for service he didn''t responsed for that if you want peaceful sleep and good place please don''t choose this pgnThis is anna street,near perumal temple,taramani', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:59.20636', 1, 830, 4),
(5063, '[Vetri S] Room is very good , Owner also Good. Master behaviour is very very  worst try to change the master bcoz no neatness allowing pets inside cooking area and all gravy or sambar contains 90 % only water . To Improve this PG name Kindly change the Master', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:59.206704', 3, 830, 4),
(5064, '[Ram Kumar] Rooms are very small. Keeping more people in  small rooms. Washroom will be used by many people and those will be cleaned once in a week. Food taste is be worst and it is providing only 2 times a day. Water problem is high. I won''t recommend any one to join here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:59.206881', 1, 830, 4),
(5065, '[Kumar Kannan] One of the best PG in chennai with good amenities(washing machine, tv, seperate wifi, purified water, parking, water heater)..am stayed more than a year,  we 5 people are frends shared one room, room u0026 bathroom always cleaned like home. Pleasent environment and friendly owner.. Positive Vibes', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:59.207107', 5, 830, 4),
(5066, '[Sathish Kumar] This hostel is absolutely superb. The facilities are cleaned daily, rooms are spacious and air conditioned also, large lockers for the bigger backpacks, free wireless internet in the room with a LED screen TV and Lift also available. Security cameras are available in all areas including bike parking also.nnBreakfast and dinner is good. Even if late night also they will cook for us if food is not sufficient unfortunately. I used to go office by train and it''s an easy walk to railway station perungudi  and Velachery bus stop also.nnOwner is friendly type and good hearted to hear us problem and find solution for the problem', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:59.207243', 5, 830, 4),
(5067, '[Bala Vishnu Guptha] Am staying this PG from 2018 Jan 26th. Till now I felt comfortable and good stay. Whenever I have an issue with Food or WiFi or something, if we ask owner to check that, they are doing perfectly. I have vacated hostel 2 times. And then after one month''s of gap again I had joined here. No worries about parking, and theft. Worth place in velacherry to stay comfortable.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:59.207399', 5, 830, 4),
(5068, '[abhi r] The hostel was good and hygenic place of stay previously when they started year before but the state of the hostel is deteriorated to a worst level. The food they provide is not good at all and worst situation is that the cook keeps changing every 2 months, and it takes a few days to get adjusted to the new style and the quality of the food is very low nowadays since they want to cut the cost there too. Earlier a single flat would be shared by 11 members but that also they Increased to 15/16 members. They do not have a proper rent system and they tend to change the rent as and when they feel. They have just 2 washing machines which is been shared by around 80 to 90 people in the appartment, hence you would have to wait in queues to use this facility. And WiFi is one per flat, which is shared by more than 16 members.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:59.207563', 1, 830, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5069, '[Abhi raman] U get a unlimited food,with neatly maintained bathroom with unlimited wifi also hot water for both drinking and bathing owner also responded well in time he paid back my advance very early after vacating immediately.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:11:59.207723', 4, 830, 4),
(5070, U&'[Jothi arasu] 1 Star \2013 Extremely disappointing experiencennMy sister stayed at Easvari Grand PG for Women from June 15th in a 4-sharing room. At the time of joining, we were told the rent was around \20b96,800 per month and paid \20b95,000 as advance. We also paid \20b93,850 for the initial 17 days, which worked out to \20b9226 per day.nnUnfortunately, the experience was extremely poor. From the day she joined until now, the room was not properly cleaned. Food was not provided properly, the heater was not working, and the toilet flush also had issues. Despite repeatedly informing the management, there was no proper action.nnThere was also an electricity disconnection for a full day because the EB bill had apparently not been paid for several months. During that time, there was no electricity and no proper food arrangement. I personally called the owner and supervisor more than 10 times, but there was no proper response.nnWhen my sister decided to vacate, we tried to inform the management at the beginning of the month, but again, our calls were not answered. Since \20b95,000 advance was already with them, we assumed it could be adjusted against the rent, and we were prepared to pay any legitimate additional charges.nnInstead, the lock of my sister''s room was broken and we were told to vacate immediately. We were then asked to pay the remaining rent at \20b9550 per day, even though the initial payment had been calculated at \20b9226 per day. This sudden change in the daily rate was never clearly communicated to us.nnThe behaviour of the owner and staff was also very rude and unprofessional, including speaking aggressively to the girls when they raised their concerns.nnOverall, this has been a very frustrating experience. Basic cleanliness, functioning facilities, food, electricity, communication and respectful treatment should not be treated as optional in a women''s PG. Based on our experience, I would strongly advise prospective tenants to clarify all rent, notice-period and advance-adjustment terms in writing before joining.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:00.035523', 1, 831, 4),
(5071, '[KD Balaji] Very worst money minded hostel owner. My sister stayed here she had paid 5000 as advance amount and now she vacated from there it has been 2 months still now they have returned the balance advance amount. Calling and texting to them no response from them. Very worst hostel please don''t go there and don''t waste ur money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:00.035679', 1, 831, 4),
(5072, U&'[Aarthy Muthu] This is not a good hostel at all. They don\2019t even know how to keep the bathrooms clean. If you compare the bathrooms here with a nearby public toilet, the public toilet would be better. The rooms are never mopped. There is no proper place to wash tiffin boxes or even to brush your teeth. Each floor has only two dustbins, and they are always full.It would be better to stay on the roadside than to live in this hostel. No other hostel asks for a 60-day notice period for the advance amount, but here they keep creating new rules. At the time of collecting the advance, they take it immediately, but when it comes to returning it, they won\2019t answer calls or reply to messages. Finally, they return the money only after making unfair deductions, as if you are begging for it.The warden\2019s presence or absence makes no difference at all. Nobody even knows why she is here.Last time, I deleted my review because of him, but this time I will not.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:00.035798', 1, 831, 4),
(5073, '[K Archana] I am currently staying at this women''s PG and it is nice. The rooms are clean and has basic facilities like Wi-Fi and laundry. The food is simple and tasty, and the staffs are helpful. Overall, it''s a good option for working women looking for a safe place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:00.036002', 5, 831, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5074, '[Anwesha Banerjee] Stayed in this PG, very clean and well maintained PG. The PG owner is really helpful and nice. I have stayed in different PGs in Chennai where I have faced a lot of issues and scams. Here they are really professional and perfect management. I would recommend this PG over any PG in velachary near IIT gate.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:00.036115', 5, 831, 4),
(5075, '[Lakshmi R] Easvari grand  pg is to good ...I spent  my one of tge best time  of life  here.. I stayed for short time but still and properly manager she is too hardworking hoest,loving and managing everything very very  well.nnSecond time I also prefer this pg only because I got best accommodation ever in my life  here.feels like hone...i,ll definitely miss', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:00.036228', 5, 831, 4),
(5076, '[P. Harini] the worst experience for me the incharge was very rude , I won''t give even one. After i vacat i face so much problem while for getting the deposit amount back. Especially water scarcity was their. we have to pay extra money for washing clothes.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:00.03634', 1, 831, 4),
(5077, '[Dhivya Mariyammal] Good experience, excellent food, room, service. I''m happy to the stay in Easvari grand PG for women''s hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:00.036451', 5, 831, 4),
(5078, U&'[PRAVEEN KUMAR S] \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50nnI had a very good experience staying at Urban Nest Living Spaces Men''s PG. The rooms are clean, well-maintained, and comfortable. The management is friendly, supportive, and always responds quickly whenever help is needed. The food is hygienic and tasty, and the overall atmosphere is safe and peaceful. The location is convenient, with easy access to public transport and nearby shops.nnA special thanks to Praveen Bro for his kindness, support, and prompt assistance throughout my stay. He is always approachable and ensures that residents are comfortable.nnI highly recommend this PG to students and working professionals looking for a comfortable, affordable, and well-managed place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:00.575889', 5, 832, 4),
(5079, '[PRAVEEN C K] Best PG in Velachery', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:00.576512', 5, 832, 4),
(5080, '[Ashok G T] One of the best PG for Men in Velachery. Clean and well maintained with better amenities like Bike parking, Lift, Wi-Fi, Washing machine and RO water. Good food is the main reason I chose this PG. Easy to reach bus and train stations. PG owner Mr. Praveen is friendly and approachable anytime, made sure any concerns are taken care immediately. I highly recommend this PG for comfortable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:00.576848', 5, 832, 4),
(5081, '[sanoop bebo] The maintenance is good, and the food is really, really good. The only minor issue is that the cleaning staff sometimes come only once every two or three days. However, the PG is generally clean and well-maintained.nnOverall, I''m very satisfied with my stay here. I would rate it 9 out of 10.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:00.577041', 5, 832, 4),
(5082, '[Aathy] It''s one of best PG to live comfort', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:00.577211', 5, 832, 4),
(5083, U&'[Harshith Ammunnaya] The owner is very friendly and welcoming. The food feels homely and tastes really good. The place is neat and clean, and the location is very convenient\2014very close to the bus stand and local railway station. Overall, a comfortable and pleasant stay. Would definitely recommend it!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:00.577368', 5, 832, 4),
(5084, U&'[A\1d05\043d\03b9\0442\043d\028f\1d00 M] My overall experience in this PG was excellent\2026 friendly owner.. proper homely food .. clean and Neat environment.. it was an unforgettable experience.. overall it is the best place to stay. Especially the masters who cook food they are very kind and friendly.nI will miss this placenI will highly recommend this place\2026 for those who need a proper homely and tasty food with clean environment \+01f4af.. such a nice experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:00.577703', 5, 832, 4);          
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5085, '[Baskaran GT] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:00.577983', 5, 832, 4),
(5086, '[shan subbaiah] Lots of cockroach and bed bugs. They asking 2 months rent as advance. At any cost you will not get refund. Fraudlant team. Be careful. Better to go some good PG''s.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:00.950451', 1, 833, 4),
(5087, '[Vishnu] The hostel facilities were okay, but the food quality was very poor', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:00.95061', 1, 833, 4),
(5088, '[Lakshman kumar R] Very very very very Worst Food....', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:00.950729', 1, 833, 4),
(5089, '[Michael William] Affordable Price', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:00.951049', 5, 833, 4),
