(5093, '[michael william] ', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:00.951956', 5, 833, 4),
(5094, U&'[Karthi Keyan] Stayed 1 year. Absolutely pathetic experience.nnFood is always undercooked, rice is half-boiled most days. Fan doesn''t work, blades are broken, but they still charge full EB bill. Take maintenance fees every month but do ZERO repairs. Area is unsafe. Not suitablennWorst part: Owner is extremely rude. Complains =not using proper language and mentally not illnessnn*DO NOT JOIN THIS PG.* You\2019ll regret every rupee. Find somewhere else. The location feels very unsafe', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:01.566673', 1, 834, 4),
(5095, '[Vaishnav S N] As a Keralite who joined a job in Chennai, I searched many PGs in Velachery before finding one that is actually well maintained. They clean the floors and bathrooms every day. The rooms has good ventilation, decent food, a friendly owner and cook, washing machines, a spacious terrace for drying clothes, bike parking, and it is located in a peaceful area compared to the rush of Chennai city. I recommend it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:01.566947', 5, 834, 4);          
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5096, '[Maha Dharshan] Nice environment around there and the pg is also well maintained and hygienic, Foods are available every meal time, it''s a good pg among other.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:01.567127', 5, 834, 4),
(5097, U&'[Dinesh] I have been staying in this PG for more than 14 months, and my experience has been really good. The rooms are clean and comfortable, and the food tastes homely. The owner was very friendly and helpful. Location is also convenient with all facilities nearby. It\2019s a safe and peaceful place \2014 perfect for students and working professionals. Really happy staying here!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:01.567364', 5, 834, 4),
(5098, U&'[rajiv pondy] Stayed here for 3 years and had a great experience. Excellent hospitality, a very kind and supportive owner, and a comfortable place to stay. Highly recommended! \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:01.567604', 5, 834, 4),
(5099, U&'[Vignesh R] Sri Dheekshitha Gents PG is one of the best PGs for men near the Dhandeeswaram area. I stayed here for 6 months (from May 2025 to October 2025) in Room No. S2-18. The owner (anna) is very friendly and approachable. The rooms are well-maintained, and both rooms and bathrooms are cleaned daily. The food provided here tastes great and feels homely \2014 it\2019s one of the few PGs where the food never disappoints. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a clean, comfortable, and homely stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:01.567781', 5, 834, 4),
(5100, '[Antony Raja.A] Staying here for the last two years and it has been a great experience. Very clean rooms, good maintenance, and a calm atmosphere. The owner is polite and helpful. Definitely a best-in-class PG accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:01.567983', 5, 834, 4),
(5101, U&'[Siva Prasad] Good environment, Owner friendly type, Food is super\+01f44c\+01f3fb, Parking Facilitynand my experience has been really good. The rooms are clean and comfortable. Location is also convenient with all facilities nearby. It\2019s a safe and peaceful place \2014 perfect for students and working professionals. Really happy staying here!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:01.568104', 5, 834, 4),
(5102, '[Srima Srima] We were staying in a hostel where many issues kept occurring. There was no proper maintenance staff. Even though there were restrooms, they were not cleaned regularly. The kitchen was also not kept clean. The wardens (aunty and uncle) were very strict. Even when our parents came to visit us, they questioned why they came and sometimes assumed they were our lovers. Overall, the hostel environment was not comfortable to stay in.my request for girls 1st visit the hostel then choose it . If they don''t like Even from you one think they will said to vaccate immediately.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:02.30823', 1, 835, 4),
(5103, '[Govind Samy] Spacious rooms. She was check in regularly,feels like family.nCleanliness is top-notch, with daily housekeeping keeping everything fresh.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:02.308365', 5, 835, 4),
(5104, U&'[ILAKIYA] I stayed here for 1+ year. A comfortable home-like environment. I really love to stay there. Everything was fine there. I had my Great days there. Thank you for the wonderful home stay part of my life...\2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:02.308479', 5, 835, 4),
(5105, U&'[Lisha K] Very business minded people and not even offered me little lock\+01f512 though I asked many times. I lost my phone and many things got missed and they don\2019t really care about it. The way they speak is not respectful at all. However, rooms have good ventilation and space than compared to other hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:02.308596', 1, 835, 4),
(5106, '[sangeetha abbai] Nice place to stay.... Its like home environment. .. Caring people... Safe and comfortable to live... Since it is in heart of velachery every facilities are near by.. It s awesome place and i recommend for all', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:02.308714', 5, 835, 4),
(5107, '[Muni Vijay] Very Good PG. Good Place for Girls', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:02.308822', 5, 835, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5108, '[hindi songs Siva] Not bad', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:02.308931', 4, 835, 4),
(5109, U&'[Game Zone] One of the worst PG I have seen, not at all clean, please don''t  go with by seeing ratings, its all fake, horrible PG, PG owners are vary worst, they use bad words.nMy request to everyone please \+01f64f  don''t stay in this PG', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:02.309039', 1, 835, 4),
(5110, U&'[Hasan Abbas] I had a great experience staying at Stayfix PG, Velachery. It is not just a PG; it truly feels like a home away from home.nnThe place is very clean and well-maintained, with cleanliness taken care of 24/7. They provide good-quality, homely food with plenty of varieties, including non-vegetarian meals twice a week.nnThe owners reside on the ground floor and are genuinely kind-hearted, humble, and caring people. Their hospitality and supportive nature made my stay very comfortable and memorable.nnOverall, my experience at Stayfix PG was like staying with a family rather than in a PG. I would highly recommend Stayfix PG to anyone looking for a safe, clean, comfortable, and homely place to stay in Velachery.nnThank you, Stayfix PG, for making my stay so pleasant and memorable! \+01f490\+01f389', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:04.084564', 5, 837, 4),
(5111, '[Charan Nallode] Stayed here for about 4 months. They provide delicious, hygienic food and the owners are cooperative and respond to issues immediately. I''d recommend this place to anybody looking to stay for long durations.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:04.084702', 5, 837, 4),
(5112, '[Sid dpc] Nice pg and good accomodation for working professionals and college students. Cleaning staffs have the rooms cleaned regularly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:04.084818', 5, 837, 4),
(5113, '[Vignesh Ravikumar] Nice PG to stay, they are handling PG in a very professional way and we can stay safely. Food is really good and sufficient, which are cooked in a way of home style..Rooms are very neet and clean... Room cleaning will be done on daily basis....I request admin and team to maintain this pg in a good way as they always wanted to do.... I''m really satisfied by staying in this PG and highly recommend it to anyone who wants to stay in Velachery...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:04.085002', 5, 837, 4),
(5114, U&'[VIGNESHWARA V] I was one of the first to stay at Stayflix PG and had a great experience. The food felt like home, huge thanks to Amma! In other hostels, I used to feel bloated after meals, but never had that issue here. Before when I was in PG they weren\2019t even on Google now happy to see them growing. It\2019s a great place for men and totally worth the money', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:04.085224', 5, 837, 4),
(5115, '[George Antony] Such a wonderful pg which actually feels like home, a wonderful place to stay safe. I''ve been there for a year, the food is also Delicious especially on Sunday which feels like food we took in our home, the house keeping is really good that they use to clean on a daily basis except Sundays. Am glad that I found this pg.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:04.085374', 5, 837, 4),
(5116, '[Sam Benin] This PG offers excellent food, which is the most essential for mens PG , rooms are also better compared to other PGs in that area. I would highly recommend this PG to men looking to stay near Velachery. The only downside is the lack of proper parking, but apart from that, it''s definitely worth the money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:04.08577', 5, 837, 4),
(5117, '[Salai Yogesh] I stayed in this PG for six months. The privacy was well-maintained, and the food was delicious. Clean rooms and a peaceful environment made it feel like home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:04.085897', 5, 837, 4),
(5118, '[Ramachandran M] The rooms are neat and well-maintained compared to many nearby PGs. The environment is quiet and peaceful, which is good for students and working professionals.nnHowever, the food quality is very poor. They provide food only twice a day (morning and night) on weekdays, and three times a day only on weekends. Even the food they provide is often not healthy and is not enjoyable to eat.nnIf you are looking for a clean room and a silent environment, this PG may be a suitable choice. However, if good food is important to you, I would not recommend this place.nnThis is my honest opinion based on my experience. If you have any doubts, feel free to ask the boys who are currently staying in the PG.nnThank you.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:04.770533', 2, 838, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5119, '[Aditya Bhowmik] Very close to IITM Velachery gate and 100 Ft Road. Very clean rooms, and cleaning of rooms and bathrooms is done almost every day. Food is also good ( Non veg twice per week). Extremely budget friendly. Highly recommended for the price.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:04.770677', 5, 838, 4),
(5120, '[E K Star] I stayed there before 7 months. Really good. But now i want to go again, is single room available with attached bathroom and price and food.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:04.770795', 4, 838, 4),
(5121, '[Ramesh Ravi] I stayed here for 6 months. Compared to other rooms, this place feels more calm and relaxing. Also, it is located in the main location.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:04.770914', 5, 838, 4),
(5122, U&'[Devaprasad M] I stayed at this PG for two months and had a good experience. The place is very neat and clean, with regular housekeeping. The building is spacious, well-ventilated, and has ample open areas both inside and outside. There''s a large terrace for drying clothes, dedicated parking space, and a separate dining area.nnThe food is also quite good\2014especially the chicken curry served on Wednesdays. The owner is calm, approachable, and helpful.nnThe only drawback is that there is no AC.nnHighly recommended to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:04.771026', 5, 838, 4),
(5123, '[Balaji] Good place to stay, there is a separate locker for every one , neat and clean place , bike parking is also there . Overall good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:04.771144', 4, 838, 4),
(5124, '[Somanth akhil P] Have been staying here for nearly 10 months, cleaning would be done daily, rent is also reasonable for single room Rs.8500 per month 3 meals during holidays and 2 meals during working days, size of the single room is also reasonable but bathroom is shared. Food menu needs some improvement as it is the same menu every week but food itself is good. Parking space is available for cycle and bikes. Has CCTV cameras and wifi .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:04.771255', 5, 838, 4),
(5125, U&'[Deepankumar G] I stayed at this PG for 4 months and had a nice experience. They provide facilities like Wi-Fi, regular housekeeping, and a washing machine, all of which were good. The only thing is the food \2014 it was good, but needs improvement. Overall, it''s a good PG to stay in.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:04.771363', 4, 838, 4),
(5126, '[Swetha Perumal] Staying here has genuinely felt like being at home. The rooms are clean, the food is hygienic and tasty, and everything is maintained really well. It''s rare to find a PG where you don''t have to worry about cleanliness or comfort.nThe biggest highlight is owner and his family. They treat everyone with so much kindness and care that it never feels like you''re staying away from home. They''re always approachable and make sure everyone is comfortable.nIf you''re looking for a safe, clean, and welcoming place to stay, I wholeheartedly recommend this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:05.678212', 5, 839, 4),
(5127, U&'[Subitsha R] I had an amazing experience staying here. The PG is extremely clean and well-maintained, and hygiene is clearly a top priority. The food is homely and feels like it\2019s made with care. What I loved the most is how the staff treats every resident like family. Easily one of the best PGs I\2019ve ever stayed at. Highly recommend', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:05.678364', 5, 839, 4),
(5128, '[Marcilla Angel] If you are searching for a pg with homely vibe , then you should choose Urban House stay. Because the food provide here is too good . The rooms are cleaned every day . And it is equipped with all the facilities like wi-fi, refrigerator, washing machine.... The owner anna and his family treats every one with care, which make you to stay comfortably.nnSo, if your looking for neat hygiene and a homely pg , this is the best one.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:05.678483', 5, 839, 4),
(5129, '[Theertha Sekhar] I had a very comfortable stay at this hostel. The maintenance and cleanliness are consistently good, and the management is very approachable and supportive. The food quality is also really good. The atmosphere are suitable for working women. The location is excellent with nearby shops and transport access. Definitely worth recommending.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:05.678599', 5, 839, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5130, U&'[EK Harshini] It is really good!! For anyone who prefers a stay that feels just like home... this place is honestly perfect!! The overall atmosphere feels very safe, peaceful and comfortable... especially for students and working professionals staying away from home.nnIn terms of comfort, everything is really well maintained... the beds are super comfortable, the rooms are clean and the amenities provided are genuinely useful for daily living... good WiFi, AC, kettle, fridge, heater, induction stove and all the basic essentials are available and in good condition. The food is homemade food...nnOne of the best things is that the PG is maintained by the same family itself... so the environment feels caring, respectful and secure rather than commercial. You can actually feel comfortable staying there.nnThe location is also a major advantage... it is very close to the Velachery Bus Stand, DMart and other important shops and facilities, so everything is easily accessible and convenient for daily needs and travel. Overall, it\2019s a really comfortable and reliable place to stay!!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:05.678721', 5, 839, 4),
(5131, '[Vikashini Lakshmanan] I had a really great experience staying at this PG. The rooms and common areas were always clean and well-maintained. The home-cooked food was delicious and felt just like eating at home. The atmosphere is peaceful, comfortable and The management is friendly and responsive. I would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a clean, comfortable, and homely place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:05.678834', 5, 839, 4),
(5132, U&'[Anu] Must-recommended PG for anyone looking for a homely place to stay. It truly stands out in every aspect\2014food, hygiene, safety, and overall facilities. One thoughtful touch is that they even store non-veg food when provided for those who miss lunch, though nobody''s going to question them,which shows how much they care.nThe place is run by a single family who are genuinely concerned about everyone\2019s comfort, health, and safety. Aunty cooks everything herself and still manages to provide a great variety of food every day, which is really impressive.nRooms and baths are cleaned almost everyday and neatly maintained.nYou can choose this place without a second thought. Thank you, Karthick and aunty, for giving me such a wonderful stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:05.678954', 5, 839, 4),
(5133, '[Keerthana Suresh] This PG offers a very comfortable and pleasant living experience. The food is good, hygienic, and consistently maintained in quality. The rooms and common areas are clean and well-kept, showing proper attention to maintenance. The overall atmosphere is calm and positive, making it a great place to stay. I would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a clean and comfortable environment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:05.679064', 5, 839, 4),
(5134, '[Megha Ravichandran] Very worst behaviour from the owner sidenWhen we ask our advance backnToo un fair behaviournWorst don''t stay therenOnly money minded', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:06.397665', 1, 840, 4),
(5135, '[Pavithra Priyadharshini] I''ve been staying in this PG for like one and half months. These are apartment kind of allocations. Maintained really well and cleaned regularly. The food is decent and the staffs ( cooks, watchman and helpers) are all quite good. Visitors are allowed but men (including father ) not allowed into the flats which I would say is a good factor. Safe and neat environment. The One who is managing the PG is also genuine and decent in a way. Doesn''t unnecessarily come up with rules or contacts us for any reason.nnAt this Cost per month this can be one best PG (service apartment kind) with Good food (not too great not too bad) despite the distance from the Velachery Railway station (900 mts ) and Bust stop (750 mts) .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:06.397989', 5, 840, 4),
(5136, U&'[Gayathri D S] Quality of food was very poor and the complaints were not taken seriously by the owner. I stayed for almost a year during which I had issues with internet and washing machine all the time and it was not fixed till I left the PG. Maintenance staffs were rude and they\2019ll wake you up every morning as they\2019ll be shouting at each other. There were times when the garbage bags were not removed for days and the waste used to overflow the dustbin. The PG\2019s bed rooms and living rooms are spacious and maintained clean. The location of the PG is good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:06.398212', 1, 840, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5137, '[Manya Maneel] I stayed here with my college friends and had the best time. The rooms are in excellent condition, it is at a prime location, food provided is healthy and tasty, all my needs and requirements were taken care off. The Akkas'' and Anna took care of me like I was their own child. If you''re thinking of renting this place do not hesitate at all.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:06.398374', 5, 840, 4),
(5138, U&'[Editor KS] The rooms are nice , but the management is totally in wrong hands which we realised so later , highly bitter experience. Make sure you get receipts from them right from advance till the final month rent because they would question you back in the end that do u have receipt to give back ur advance, where they don''t know even the spelling of giving the receipt.Get a written agreement that they should return back the advance at the time of vacating .(If we(Tenent) are willing to vaccate , any tenant should definitely give a 30 day notice period for the owners for them to seek a next person , which is a basic thing anybody will know , but in their rules , they will ask u to vaccate on their convience even without arranging any alternate room also , telling that the owners are coming to occupy and they will end up telling they will deduct the advance considering as last month rent even without ur concern in a tricky termed way, if you question , their way of speaking will change ,when i asked is there any agreement we had put for you to deduct our advance as rent ? They play games telling it''s all mutual understanding and unethical stories \+01f61b ,they will make you forcefully stay till maximum possible grace days selfishly tricking you with words like notice period and bla bla and play dramas for not giving back the advance.nThey never stand by their words ,when i said i will move legally ,one of the partner person named santhosh even threatened telling that he wantedly give will give damage bills and backfired on us ,we got alert there and just for our side of safety we took a ultra clear video proof before leaving the room of its condition that there was no damage made by us.his way if speaking would be so atrocious,we just felt of not getting down to his lower level and waste our time with them . We have left this issue for now ,we also vacated the hostel without even getting our advance, they also don''t have any bothering in njoying others money .nHence the reason for posting this is no other people should get fooled by them like us .Dont get trapped .nThey only wish to receive payments and they dont like making payments at all , where you should be so careful in dealing with them .nHighly money motive people and they play nice games .nThey have few more flats unnamed with very same.management  , name of the flat is  Sabari foundations located in 2nd extension of Venus Colony which is not a complete PG nor a residential property, 2 floors are PG and Middle floor is a residential flats where familes live. It''s not purely a commercial PG Hostel .On the other side despite multiple time of request regarding a watch man for security, no action was taken by the owner also,they have always problems with every early watchman people and they send them back .nSwiggy , Zomato and all delivery people can enter the premises at anytime .They never bothered the safety aspect at all.nAll the electronic products like AC,Washing machine are damaged old ones, even u beg 100 times to them to change they never mind also .nnWe had adjusted  all these minus factors and we have been so dignified of not giving them any trouble though they be lethargic which is our magnanimity , but everything has a limit and they have crossed it .nBut now when i came to know their true colors , i thought y do i not let know all the truth ,which we experienced.nAll these thing told are proofed which they know well too and no one from their end can deny all these .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:06.398732', 1, 840, 4),
(5139, '[shanthi murugesan] This is my own review.I had a very pleasant stay at balamurugan enclave. Chandru is very prompt in addressing the need, room was spacious. Looking forward to visit again.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:06.398955', 5, 840, 4);        
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5140, '[Mangalam] The place is located at a very central location. Office, shops, malls, everything is at an accessible distance. Rooms are clean, spacious and has all facilities required. A good place to stay, at reasonable rent.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:06.399069', 5, 840, 4),
(5141, '[Nalina Munusamy] One of the comfortable place to stay,nNo matter of distance from my work place, i always stay in just stay whenever i come to chennai.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:06.399189', 5, 840, 4),
(5142, '[Abishek Vilvan] Well established new PG and owner is really doing great and impotantly listening to us and clearing the issues promptly. Cleaning is very perfect and happens daily...best to stay and though rent is little high but its reasonable at their services', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:06.79417', 5, 841, 4),
(5143, '[Sivaganesh C] I would like to mention pros and consnprosn1.good ambience and environment around PG (outside area or inside room)n2.good house keeping everydaynnConsn1.room living area is quiet small , it will be fine if room space is quiet expandednn2.there is no food providing is there any arrangement made for foodwith reasonable amount  it will be fine', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:06.794552', 4, 841, 4),
(5144, '[Vijay Raghav] Till now the best PG in Chennai I experienced, Cleanliness was very well maintained, cooking option was given, friendly staff, refrigerator, dining table, sofa provided and situated at a prime location.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:06.794823', 5, 841, 4),
(5145, '[Prem Kumar] Nice and neatly maintained. All facilities are available. Highly recommendable...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:06.794961', 5, 841, 4),
(5146, '[SAIKAT BISHAL] Flat turned into a pg. The best part is its cleanliness and security. Fingerprint sensors on the door to stop unauthorised people from entering. Has a parking area. Has all basic amenities. Kitchen is available. No mess facility. Cook your own. Also cooking is very tough as there is no kitchen and the owner does not encourage cooking even though an induction oven is provided. Clothes hanger, fridge, washing machine table and chair and sofa in the dining area. All AC rooms.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:06.795178', 5, 841, 4),
(5147, '[ajith ak] Found a luxurious PG at an affordable price. Located near the Velachery railway station@ walkable distance. All rooms are being cleaned daily and maintaining a good atmosphere to stay peacefully.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:06.795721', 5, 841, 4),
(5148, '[praveen srikanta] Very nice PG and friendly staff at very nice locality.nAvailable with all services like wifi, drinking water, washing machine, refrigerator,etc...nPublic transport is easily accessible from this PG.nFar better as compared to all other PG''S in this locality', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:06.796206', 5, 841, 4),
(5149, '[Ravi Asari] Great PG in Chennai: Super clean, awesome facilities, perfect location. Cozy rooms, 24/7 security, feels just like home.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:06.796368', 5, 841, 4),
(5150, '[Harsha Jonnalagadda] pg absolutely good responsable maintains, food is good peaceful area ,no disturbance, upstair good atmosphere morning and night', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:07.799153', 5, 843, 4),
(5151, U&'[Harshith] Just cleaning is good... they cleaning dailynButnNo Good foodnNo TVnNo fridgenBut in advertisement poster they mention this every thing you may see on streets.nNot secure place for bikes...nIn rainy season PG is almost full of water...nReally food is too waste... No taste in it..nTry to avoid this PGnHlo Owner Try to accept this drawbacks and don''t act too good person \+01f642', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:07.799384', 1, 843, 4),
(5152, '[yadla brahmaiah] This hostel is absolutely superb, the staff are friendly, helpful, full of local knowledge and go the extra mile. The facilities are cleaned daily, rooms are spacious, air conditioned, large lockers for the bigger backpacks, free wireless internet in the lounge with some computers also connected to the internet, with a large screen TV (which was popular most evenings)nnThe hostel is everyday for cleaning but the owners are very flexible on that rule,nIt''s location is in the heart of Chennai and it''s an easy walk to get anywhere but it''s on a side street,nAt night and weekends, they''res secured doors at the entrance, it just gives any traveller the feeling of more security, I only had to wait a couple of seconds for the door to be buzzed.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:07.799543', 5, 843, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5153, '[karTkn 22] Worst ever pg in ChennainHe will attract you with small advance 3k and rent 6knFood doesn''t contain any taste or nutritionnWi-Fi doesn''t work at night timesnMosquito problems at eveningnnIf u r working, and u need place just to refresh, stay at night u can prefer it that too at last resort choice..nIf u r  studying, just don''t consider this place even for freenMy friends and myself became patients after staying for just 3 monthsnnNo guarantee on the return of advance 3knDon''t believe on the 5 star ratings without comments - it''s all fake', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:07.7997', 1, 843, 4),
(5154, '[Nagaraj raj] I have been here for the last few months .. I feel like a stay at home .... wellnmaintainence... owner are friendly bond .. and food quality and facilities are good... worth for staying here...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:07.799856', 5, 843, 4),
(5155, '[Vivekanand] I have just been in this hostel for 2 days. But the maintenance and food are really good. Food is unlimited here which is good. The price is also affordable for working peoples:)', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:07.800023', 5, 843, 4),
(5156, U&'[Kumar Ayyakutti] Hii......this pg is very comfortable to me...good ventilation ....food also good ....cooking brother Vinoth he is very friendly bonding....all good in here....room also cleaning daily....owner also is gd character .....thank u...\+01f60d\+01f60d\+01f60d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:07.800308', 5, 843, 4),
(5157, '[Vhedhanth A.c] badass  owner , even worse velakaranuga and the food was a nightmare, Totally wastenthey will treat you differently when you leave the hostel and charge extra amount .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:07.80088', 1, 843, 4),
(5158, U&'[Shashwanth Balachandar] \200bI have been staying at Brights PG in Anna Nagar, and my overall experience has been genuinely positive and comfortable. The rooms and common areas are well-kept and cleaned regularly, which makes for a peaceful and healthy living environment.The essential amenities\2014like Wi-Fi, laundry facilities, drinking water, and air conditioning\2014are reliable and well-maintained.The staff/management is approachable and receptive whenever minor repairs or queries arise.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:09.204296', 5, 845, 4),
(5159, '[Surya Manoharan] I had a really good experience staying here. The service was excellent, the food was tasty and well maintained, and the accommodation was clean and comfortable. The management handled everything professionally and responded to any concerns in a mature and respectful manner. Overall, it was a pleasant stay, and I would definitely recommend this PG to anyone looking for a comfortable and well-managed place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:09.204437', 5, 845, 4),
(5160, '[Sakthi Vel] stayed here for 14 months. They were best at their services in responding to the complaints. cleanly maintained . food provided  despite no LPG . overall a Best PG in Anna Nagar for UPSC/TNPSC students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:09.204559', 5, 845, 4),
(5161, '[Sangu Raja Jeyaraman] Hi guys, One of the finest PG, I had accomodate and good caring which I had in my career.nBrights PG have good infrastructure with good meal and best adminstration in my real experience in my career.nNice owner with good heart which helped me all the time I need.nI stayed for three years one of the finest place for aspirants and working peoples also.  It will feel like to us staying in our own home.nnThanks for everything anna.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:09.204674', 5, 845, 4),
(5162, '[Aravind Ajayan] This is actually a very good hostel in Anna Nagar. The staffs are friendly and provide services whenever we need. Maintenance and water supply everything is top notch. Also the rooms and spaces are comfortable for a stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:09.204789', 5, 845, 4),
(5163, '[Dhilip Civil] Brights pg Hostels Anna nagar chennai exceeded my expectations! From the moment I arrived, I was impressed by the cleanliness, comfort, and attentive staff. A/C facilities , hygienic food, making my stay truly enjoyable. The location was convenient, with easy access to nearby Academies like Shankar , Aram,Rams study circle etc. I highly recommend brights pg Hostels to anyone looking for a top-notch accommodation experience in Anna nagar.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:09.204914', 5, 845, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5164, '[Prasanth Nani] Great PG Stay!nI had stayed in  8 months for this PG. I had a comfortable and hassle-free stay here. The rooms were clean, the staff was helpful, Especially Pg Owner is so supportive and helpful is very Helpful to give Good Facilities and the environment was safe and peaceful. Overall, a good experience and I would recommend this PG to others.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:09.205028', 5, 845, 4),
(5165, '[Gowtham S] I have been staying at Brights hostel for 3 year for my exam preparation and i cleared TNPSC group2 by preparing from this hostel.nHostel facilitates Neat and clean room with quality food, wifi, washing machine, drinking water and cleaning services. Good support from staffs and immediate grievance redressal from the owner Mr. Arasu sir.nHighly recommended for serious aspirants preparing for UPSC/TNPSC and other competitive exams', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:09.205141', 5, 845, 4),
(5166, U&'[Vish] Avoid this place at all costs. I stayed here and it has been a nightmare. The owner, Raghu, is a complete fraud. He has refused to return my security deposit for over a year and a half, and he completely ignores my calls now.n\200bBe warned that the rent here is arbitrary; he charges different amounts to different people for no reason, and he will constantly find ways to squeeze more money out of you. The facility itself is subpar, and the management is dishonest. If you value your hard-earned money and your peace of mind, stay away from this hostel. Truly a terrible experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:10.847226', 1, 847, 4),
(5167, '[Pawan Singh] Ahiva boys hostel good for everything for food for study. No noise. You can study with peace.Near by Thirumanglum metro station 5 minutes walking distance', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:10.847365', 5, 847, 4),
(5168, U&'[SAM MILTON] It\2019s been a four months since I joined this hostel the environment of this hostel is peaceful  especially for the students and the food is delicious and hygiene.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:10.847489', 5, 847, 4),
(5169, '[Vijay Kumar] I stay hear for a month, Nice experience, location is accessible for public transport, friendly owner.. Good Atmosphere', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:10.847609', 4, 847, 4),
(5170, '[Debashis Sarkar] I stayed here for two months. Well maintained pg and good quality food. Highly recommended for students preparing for UPSC or Government exams.nThe PG owner is friendly and helpful too.nLocation is also peaceful, connectivity is good with public transport like metro, bus and autos are within 200-300m distance.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:10.847727', 5, 847, 4),
(5171, U&'[raja ramSIP] I stayed at this boys hostel for a few months and had a good experience. The location is convenient, close to public transport and local shops. The rooms are clean. The staff is friendly and always ready to help with any issues. The atmosphere is generally relaxed and quiet, making it a good place to study and live. Overall, it\2019s a comfortable and affordable option for students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:10.847836', 5, 847, 4),
(5172, U&'[mahesh sri] I stayed at this boys hostel and had a good experience. The rooms are clean. The staff is friendly and always ready to help with any issues. The atmosphere is generally relaxed and quiet, making it a good place to study and live. As ther are many education institute for prepare government job Overall, it\2019s a comfortable and affordable for both working and student.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:10.847946', 5, 847, 4),
(5173, '[Aravind Raja] I recently stayed at a boys'' PG, and it exceeded my expectations in every way. The rooms were clean, spacious. The PG also offered high-speed Wi-Fi, air conditioning, and 24/7 security, ensuring both comfort and safety.nnMeals were a standout feature, with healthy and delicious home-cooked food served daily.nnOverall, this PG provided an excellent balance of amenities, affordability, and convenience, making it a top choice for students and professionals alike.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:10.848054', 5, 847, 4); 
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5174, '[King of Darkness] I stayed at JK Men''s and Students PG, Anna Nagar, and my experience was not satisfactory.nnThe food quality was disappointing because the menu almost never changed, and the same meals were served repeatedly. I also felt that the management''s attitude changed after receiving the payment. Whenever I had any issues, it was difficult to get a proper response.nnThe security deposit is quite high, and when I moved out, a significant amount was deducted for maintenance and electricity charges, which I personally found unreasonable.nnOverall, I was not happy with my stay and don''t think it offers good value for the money. Based on my experience, I would suggest looking for another PG before deciding to stay here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:11.483638', 1, 848, 4),
(5175, '[Aham Prod] I had a very disappointing experience with JK Men''s PG. These guys they did not return my advance deposit after I vacated the room. Despite multiple follow-ups and repeated requests, they kept delaying the payment with different excuses and never refunded the money.nnFrom my experience, this feels like a scam targeting students. Many students depend on their deposit money when moving out, and withholding it without a valid reason is completely unfair and unprofessional.I would strongly advise students to be cautious before choosing this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:11.484093', 1, 848, 4),
(5176, '[Karthikeyan Sundararaj] Best hostel I ever stayed. The facilities are awesome. I strongly recommend JK men''s and students hostel for a pleasant stay. Very nominal rent and best quality service assured.nnMost importantly, even the washrooms are pretty neat and clean. In this pandemic, they maintain the hygiene at the top level.nnManagement takes care of the services like their own house.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:11.484278', 5, 848, 4),
(5177, '[Bharanitharan R] Worst PG I''ve ever seen. The food is very poor, and the owner''s attitude is disappointing. She seems to care only about money rather than the residents. I would not recommend this PG. Please think carefully before joining this place, guys.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:11.484438', 1, 848, 4),
(5178, U&'[Sarvodhaya Priyan] I had a very disappointing experience at this hostel. The owners are completely money-minded and don\2019t care about the comfort of the guests. The food quality is very poor.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:11.484605', 1, 848, 4),
(5179, '[Prasanna PS] The stay is awesome, well equipped hostel with all facilities. The rooms and hall are spacious to study. I had peaceful stay  and completed my NEET  coaching u0026 Exams. Thanks Aunty for the great food. Definitely I would recommend all students to stay here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:11.484856', 5, 848, 4),
(5180, U&'[NITHISH PATHALAMUTHU] I had a very disappointing experience at this hostel. The owners are completely money-minded and don\2019t care about the comfort of the guests. The food quality is very poor. In my room, there was only one fan and one light for four people to share, yet they charge \20b9350 per person every month for electricity. I\2019m paying \20b98,500 per month, but we have to share a single bathroom with eight people \2014 which is very inconvenient.nnIf the management really wants to attract more tenants, they should focus on improving the facilities and treating the guests better instead of just focusing on money. Definitely not worth the price.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:11.48515', 1, 848, 4),
(5181, U&'[Darwin Dayanandan] To be honest, this is one of the best PGs I\2019ve stayed in. I\2019ve been here for over a year now, and I\2019ve personally really liked the food and the parking facilities. The owner is kind and honest, which adds to the comfort of staying here. Overall, it\2019s a great PG for both students and working professionals.nnNote: From my point of view, if you have good roommates, this can be one of the best hostels you\2019ll find.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:11.485307', 5, 848, 4),
(5182, U&'[Pavithran A.S.P] I stayed at Rainbow PG for 4 months, and it is one of the best PGs in the Ramapuram area. It is especially suitable for college students. 2- and 3-sharing rooms are available, which ensures good privacy and a peaceful environment for reading and studying.nRoom cleaning was done daily, which helped maintain good hygiene. The overall stay experience was excellent. There is no compromise on security\2014private keys are provided, which made me feel safe throughout my stay. Overall, it was a very comfortable and satisfying experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:13.569442', 4, 851, 4);     
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5183, U&'[Ranjith SP] \2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f\2b50\fe0f Absolutely fantastic! This PG is incredibly clean and well-maintained, making it feel like a safe and secure place to live. The cupboards are spacious and convenient, providing plenty of storage. The dedicated study area is a huge plus for anyone working from home \2013 it\2019s comfortable and helps you stay productive. Highly recommend for anyone looking for a comfortable, hassle-free stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:13.569845', 5, 851, 4),
(5184, '[Nikhil T] One of the best PG in Ramapuram. I have stayed for 6 month. They will clean room on the daily basis and they themself will change the bedsheets and pillow cover which makes it a very comfortable and pleasant place to live.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:13.570143', 5, 851, 4),
(5185, '[DEENU P. N] I stayed in this pg for two months the pg was so clean and good they will clean the room in daily basis if you looking for good pg in ramapuram  try this', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:13.570488', 5, 851, 4),
(5186, '[Muthuselvam] I was in this pg for 4 months. I feel the pg is always Neat and clean. Daily cleaning and frequent restroom washing would be done by them.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:13.570852', 5, 851, 4),
(5187, '[Kishore Reddy''s] One of the best PG in Ramapuram close to DLF suitable for both students and working professionals. Water facilities and maintenance are good. Owner and warden are responsive in addressing the problem incase of anything', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:13.57108', 5, 851, 4),
(5188, '[Victor Bhattacharya] The best in class that I have come across so far. Incredible ambience. Well secured.. Feel at home experience. All services available.nRooms are clean and well maintained.. Owner very friendly.. Hospitable and helpful.. Great experience..', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:13.571233', 5, 851, 4),
(5189, '[sai kiran] The worst hostel I''ve ever seen like this no proper facilities and no proper attached bathroom no the plugs are not working properly no facilities are provided as they said and tortureing to delete the review from owners side calling 40-50 times a day to delete the comment i have never seen such a fake hostel with fake reviews..and giving discount on fake reviews to so please note this.. Thank you', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:13.571348', 1, 851, 4),
(5190, U&'[Harshavardhan B] Very bad PG experience. I lived here for 1 year. The food is poor and often unhygienic. Service is worse\2014management is unresponsive and ignores complaints. PG rent is inconsistent and varies for different people. Not recommended at all.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:14.412092', 1, 853, 4),
(5191, '[Ameer Abbas S] Unhygienic and poor maintenance u0026 not worth for money', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:14.412481', 2, 853, 4),
(5192, U&'[Mohammed Jalal] Pathetic Hostel. \+01f92cnGarbage and thrash everywhere\+01f92enUpon reaching they ask for extra money.nnYou will get much better hostel cheaper around this area.nnNot recommended at all.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:14.412703', 1, 853, 4),
(5193, '[Aditya Patra] We are visit for accommodation, location is good, but it''s smell very bad and unhygienic looks.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:14.412973', 2, 853, 4),
(5194, '[Sk Shahid] One of very cheapest hostel in Chennai These people do not understand anyone''s feelings', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:14.41328', 1, 853, 4),
(5195, '[GOKUL NATH M] I had a fantastic stay and would definitely return.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:14.413589', 5, 853, 4),
(5196, '[Parthiban Geetham] Worst hostel. Looks like public toilet. Don''t waste your money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:14.41376', 1, 853, 4),
(5197, '[Sathya K] Good service food also good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:14.413927', 5, 853, 4),
(5198, '[ABHISHEK R.S] Best Pg in that area , The pg is clean and well maintained stayed there for 4 months. Full security with cctv  and parking space also available . Good wifi connection. It would be a nice choice to choose this PG to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:14.84787', 5, 854, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5199, '[arun jose] This is hands down the best men''s PG near the DLF area. The cleanliness and security are both superb. Whether you''re looking for a daily or monthly rental, this is definitely the place to stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:14.848007', 5, 854, 4),
(5200, '[Sakthivel venkat] The best, neat and clean PG around DLF. I have visited many PGs before getting here. None of the other PGs are maintaining neat and hygiene as this PG. Highly recommended and easy to access DLF since it is located nearby the back gate.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:14.848126', 5, 854, 4),
(5201, '[Manikanta JAGATI] Dec 2025nThe below review in Nov24 is forced one, I given 3 star and given detailed review but later I have to change, as demanded by owner, otherwise they asked me to remove the review. Giving the original review now, as I am not going there.nNegative points.n1. Rest rooms will cleaned once in a month. Someone have to call the owner if it got worst, then they may come and it is a doubt too.n2. ACs are old once, they will not work properly. They won''t repair them.n3. Power bill, keep an eye on your meter when you join there. It is huge.n4. Room cleaning - hahhaha. When I have joined for 1st time, that only month it got cleaned properly, next time on I didn''t seen them cleaning on daily basis.n5. Water - it is a greecy water. Beware it will itchy. Unless you won''t have a choice then bath there. Even drinking water is also from same tank but filtered then how come it will be cleaned. The purifiers are like 25liters wala, if someone is drinking also, the water storage is for lind time so that also is mostly like sticky.n6. You have to pay in advance, for the stay period. But the refund is fast too, after deducting heavy power bill.n7. Previously they used to give free of parking for bikes, but later they started charging for that too.nnNov 2024nWell maintained pg for men.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:14.848247', 2, 854, 4),
(5202, '[Prabaharan Kannan] One of the best hostel for men. Well maintained neat, clean rooms and toilets. Owner is very friendly. Easy to book. Caretakers are also good. It is very nearby dlf back gate. I have been frequently staying for almost the last 3 years. Budget friendly stay. 100% we shall book', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:14.848397', 5, 854, 4),
(5203, '[Gunasekaran Raju] Good PG to stay near back gate of DLF, the rooms are clean and well maintained. PG owner is good person, provide the accommodation in his any of the near PGs in short notice.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:14.848538', 5, 854, 4),
(5204, '[koushik patra] Awesome place for long/short stay. Well maintained. Clean sharing rooms with attached washroom. Very close to DLF cybercity Backgate. Seperate dining place and free wifi with good bandwidth.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:14.848678', 5, 854, 4),
(5205, '[Kiruba Chozha] Stayed here from dec 22 to aug 24. Clean PG and maintenance is good. Food is not good.nnBut everything comes with a price, I parked my bike here with a monthly charge of 300. They said that they are giving parking space by sacrificing few rooms that can be built there and rented.nnDaily rent for AC room is rupees 600.nnDuring my August month stay,  i stayed in a room, where another guy was not there for half a month, They gave that bed to daily sharing people which means that in a single bed they are renting for two people, this irritated me that''s why I''m giving 2 stars.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:14.848815', 4, 854, 4),
(5206, '[Sankar dass010] Loyola hostel seems to be plesent and clam here and also have a good culture among students who stay here. Here they grow more trees to improve our ozone heal,oxygen,and eco-friendly and fresh air too .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:15.619238', 5, 855, 4),
(5207, '[GLADWIN JOSHUA P] In Night, it looks like a mini resort.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:15.619628', 5, 855, 4),
(5208, '[Joe Ignacius M] I am first year at staying at Loyola men''s hostel the social is very good but assistant director and hostel directors are very strict because I was suspended for 1 week because of not attending the holy mass on hostel day on the day I was offered from dysentery and I was submitting the bill copy of my medicines and my  medical bill to the assistant director and hostel director and their spoken to me very rudely many of the students has not attend the holy mass assistant directors left them for name shack catch some of the students was suspension to show the contour the hostel director this is not the proper reason for the suspension attending the holy mass this up to our  personal they are saying if I have any health is also I should attend the holy mass how can I attend the holy mass ????....  this is the worst experience for me at Chennai at Loyola  hostel I recommend you to stay at any other hostels not to stay in Loyola hostel and fees of the  Loyola hostel is comparatively is very high do other hostels and there is no proper facilities and has many political u0026 ego issues at Loyola hostel I had never heard on suspension regarding not  attending the holy mass.....', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:15.619784', 1, 855, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5209, U&'[Patric Pat] Really  good  and we''ll place thank u \+01f64f father''s', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:15.620095', 5, 855, 4),
(5210, '[Sushil Kujur] No Liberty to speak infront of authorities, if any complaint is raised, threat is given of to be thrown out of hostel.nNo transparency in hostel fees, specially in the Hostel bill of commen block students(Middle class). Unusual charges are added in bills without any proper information.counter Staff are rude too. Mess is somehow good but some of the mess servant are of stingy and rude behaviour.nOtherwise Hostel campus and environment is very good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:15.620487', 1, 855, 4),
(5211, '[navneet jalan] THE WORST ONE YEAR OF MY LIFE. SANITATION IS THE WORST. STAFF IS THE RUDEST. COMMON BLOCK ROOMS ARE SMALLER THAN TOILETS. A BLOCK AND LICET ARE 5 SHARING ROOMS FOR ABNORMALLY HIGH PRICE ESPECIALLY, A BLOCK. VERY RESTRICTIVE PLACE. NO HELP FOR STUDENTS.nLOOKS DECENT ON THE OUTSIDE BUT IS HELL ON THE INSIDE.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:15.62076', 1, 855, 4),
(5212, '[Siddartha Muthusamy] Ok good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:15.621107', 5, 855, 4),
(5213, '[rising dragon] Very natural place to stay . Greeny place . Feel chill when you are here and vey spacious place . Rooms are smaller but good and a cheap place to stay ...,..........................................mmmmm mm.......... .     .    N .......... Good administration and water supply is available. There is a new hostel here', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:15.621273', 3, 855, 4),
(5214, '[Silambu G] I stayed there for more than a year. The food is average, and the rooms are not hygienic at all. She is also very rude. Whenever room maintenance is needed, we have to keep insisting for more than a month before anything gets done. Yet, they charge a maintenance fee of 1000 for six months and then 100 per month afterwards. The rent is also too high. On top of that, they charge high electricity bill without providing a proper payslip. When asked, she only shows the overall electricity bill instead of the specific room bill.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:16.112008', 1, 856, 4),
(5215, '[Balakumar] Hostel food and hygiene is decent but other than that everything is below average.specifically if you vacate don''t expect  even 25% of your advance money they show every fee to not return your  money ,even for the 25% money you need to call them 2weeks daily to remind them your advance is not received. I never expected them to behave like this. Better you stay ( if you have a cash tree).', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:16.112202', 3, 856, 4),
(5216, U&'[S.MURALI KRISHNAN NADAR] This Hostel is Very Nice and Neat. For Mens Very Comfort and in Room Super Infrastructure. If you Come that Room the Rent is Very low and they provide for Food also....nIn the room daily Clean.nThe Owner Mam is a nice Person\+01fac2', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:16.112501', 5, 856, 4),
(5217, '[G.P. Tarun] After a 2 weeks of searching I found this as best hostel. Very clean, unlimited home food, quick wifi,good accommodation, peaceful, nice place for those who are going for coaching institutes nearby preparing for competitive exams and working men. Overall a best selection among hostels nearby.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:16.112737', 5, 856, 4),
(5218, '[Mr Jakkuboy] Good place to stay with safe two wheeler parking..! And the main thing is they are providing home food.. That''s the great thing. Good place and atmosphere with affordable price..!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:16.112993', 5, 856, 4),
(5219, '[Mahesh Ekula] Boys hostel newly opened branch near R V nagar opposite EB Office. Hostel is neat and clean well maintained with good homely food.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:16.113208', 5, 856, 4),
(5220, '[Shanu Mathew] Hostel  is clean and tidy. Owner mam is too friendly, good accomodation is maintained', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:16.113496', 5, 856, 4),
(5221, '[Kishore Kumar] Good hostel for both working men and studying students.Clean and well maintained with nice food.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:16.113663', 5, 856, 4);     
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5222, U&'[Ragunath Ragu] \26a0\fe0f HOSTEL EXPERIENCE \2013 PLEASE BE CAREFUL \26a0\fe0fnnI had a very disappointing experience staying at this hostel.nn\2022 Food quality was not satisfactory. Several complaints were made, but I felt there was no proper response.n\2022 They initially said eggs and snacks would be provided daily, but this was later changed.n\2022 Chicken was sometimes not cooked properly, and the food was often too salty.n\2022 I personally felt that staying here for a longer period could be difficult because of the food quality.n\2022 I had difficulties getting proper responses from the manager regarding complaints.n\2022 When I asked for the owner''s contact number, it was not provided to me.n\2022 Washing machine problems were not resolved properly.n\2022 Bathing water supply was also not consistent.n\2022 Overall, the facilities and maintenance did not meet my expectations.nnIf you are an UPSC aspirant looking for a peaceful and well-maintained place to stay, I recommend visiting the hostel personally, checking the facilities and food, and speaking with existing residents before making a decision.nnThis review is based on my personal experience.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:17.130282', 1, 857, 4),
(5223, U&'[Pandian 18ME026] one of best hostel in the anna nagar and good management.nResponsible manager and kind hearted . Compare to other hostel in anna nagar food are quite good \+01f4af and budget friendly. Preferable hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:17.130674', 5, 857, 4),
(5224, '[Aravind Sreedharan] This is the best hostel in Anna Nagar with clean rooms and at a very affordable cost. With food included, definitely the best. Best suited for all UPSC aspirants in the area. Thanks to the team.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:17.131089', 5, 857, 4),
(5225, '[rajasekar k] I had a good experience staying at BE Infinity men''s hostel Anna Nagar Chennai. The rooms were clean and comfortable, and the common areas were well maintained.The hostel has a pleasant atmosphere and is located in a convenient area.I would recommend it to others.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:17.131324', 5, 857, 4),
(5226, U&'[Nandish Bijinelly] Best hostel in Anna Nagar with all necessary Amenities. Affordable cost with quality food.nResponsive team and Manager on property. Thanks to Team Be-Infinity for Quality Service. \+01f64f\+01f3fb\+01f64f\+01f3fb', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:17.131604', 5, 857, 4),
(5227, U&'[Ram Nithish] Good and decent best for boys accommodation very well and good humble manager kind heart fellow and best in Anna Nagar and also very friendly food seem to be good \+01f60a\2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:17.131765', 5, 857, 4),
(5228, '[Vishwaveer Singh Samandsar] I had a very good experience staying at this hostel. It is an excellant place to stay here. I would highly recommend this hostel to anyone who looking for pleasant experience', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:17.131913', 5, 857, 4),
(5229, '[Khagendra Saud] Hi i am khaja. This hostel provides a comfortable stay and friendly atmosphere. I would give 5 star.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:17.13206', 5, 857, 4),
(5230, U&'[Parth Kapse] I had a really great experience staying at this PG. It was always neat, clean, and well-maintained. One of the best things was the freedom\2014there were hardly any unnecessary restrictions, which made it feel much more comfortable than most PGs.nnThe owner, Ashwin, is very friendly and approachable. He genuinely listens to everyone\2019s concerns and tries his best to resolve any issues quickly, which made the stay even better.nnThe location is another huge advantage. It\2019s in a prime area with excellent connectivity, and the metro station is just a short walk away. Overall, it offers great value for money and, compared to many other PGs in Chennai, I would definitely recommend it. It was truly worth staying here!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:17.582345', 5, 858, 4),
(5231, U&'[Angel Patrisha] My brother stayed here for 2 days and had a great experience. The room was clean, staff were polite, and check-in was smooth. I would definitely recommend this hotel.\201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:17.582496', 5, 858, 4);            
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5232, U&'[John Son] Just came from London to Chennai, and I stayed here for a week\2014honestly, it was an amazing experience! The ambiance was absolutely perfect, with a cozy and vibrant vibe that made it easy to relax and enjoy every moment.nThe staff were incredibly friendly, welcoming, and always ready to help, which made the stay feel even more comfortable and personal. Their hospitality really stood out and made a big difference.nThe place was clean, well-maintained, and had a great atmosphere throughout. Whether it was chilling in the common areas or just enjoying the peaceful surroundings, everything felt just right.nIt\2019s one of those places where you instantly feel at home. Definitely one of the best stays I\2019ve had\2014highly recommend it to anyone visiting Chennai. Would love to come back again!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:17.582615', 5, 858, 4),
(5233, '[Midon Titus] One of the best memories in Chennai was Aostel. Really loved the stay and ambience of the hostel. Highly recommending this stay for men who are looking for a cleanly stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:17.58272', 5, 858, 4),
(5234, '[harish kumar] Stayed here for a few days and it felt like home. Good food, clean rooms, and a nice vibe. Management is very supportive. Totally worth it', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:17.582827', 5, 858, 4),
(5235, '[Abhiram uppula] Had a really good stay. The place was comfortable, clean, and felt very homely. The overall experience was smooth and pleasant.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:17.583162', 5, 858, 4),
(5236, '[SIVA] This is the cleanest and most hygienic PG in Chennai. The rooms and bathrooms are always spotless and perfectly maintained.You always make us feel safe and welcome.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:17.583578', 5, 858, 4),
(5237, '[aravind jai] I recently stayed at Aostel Room in Chennai and had a very pleasant experience. The room was clean, well-maintained, and comfortable, making it a great choice for both short and extended stays. The ambiance was calm and relaxing, which helped me unwind after a busy day.nThe staff were friendly, supportive, and always ready to assist with any requirements. The location is also convenient, with easy access to key areas in the city.nOverall, Aostel Room offers good value for money with decent amenities and a comfortable stay. I would definitely recommend it to anyone looking for a budget-friendly and hassle-free accommodation in Chennai.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:17.583713', 5, 858, 4),
(5238, U&'[Tathagat Kp] This adroitly planned accomodation having Single, Double, Triple, Others room types, and are available for males on a monthly charges of price of Rs. 4500.\00a0lessnnDeposit Amountnn\20b95,000nnMaintenancenn\20b90nnNotice Periodnn1 MonthnnElectricity Chargesnn\20b910nnFood AvailabilitynnBoth Veg and Non-VegnnAC RoomsnnAvailablennParkingnnAvailablennAvailable fornnBoysnnPreferred TenantsnnAllnnTotal Number of Bedsnn32', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:18.778702', 5, 860, 4),
(5239, '[Abbas Abu] The atmosphere is really friendly and the owners are awesome personalities and make everyone feel welcome.....Great surfing, great weather, great beaches, great dinner, great people and an overall great feeling!....The hostel with the best atmosphere i''ve ever been! Great staff and guests, nice building and a amazing landscape!...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:18.778858', 5, 860, 4),
(5240, '[Jaya Prakash. E] I stayed in a RB PG branch 2 that was clean, comfortable, and well-maintained.nThe peaceful environment made it feel almost like home', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:18.778987', 5, 860, 4),
(5241, '[Sanjay S] Very good hostel for boys and good atmosphere to stay budget friendly. Owner also so kind . If any quires they short it immediately.good for stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:18.779235', 5, 860, 4),
(5242, U&'[Mydeen Afath] I''m staying in this PG and it''s been a really good experience. The place is well-maintained with all the necessary amenities like fridge, TV, and more. Whenever we raise any complaint, they resolve it as soon as possible. The owner is friendly and always checks if we\2019re comfortable. Overall, a great place to stay!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:18.779447', 5, 860, 4);       
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5243, '[abbas abu] This hostel was an absolute Gem....Such a great place to stay!....Good Feeling is not just a name, it''s a concept!.....Best surf hostel ever, the atmosphere is awesome, very friendly and chilled out......', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:18.779588', 5, 860, 4),
(5244, '[Maneesh Kadimi] This hostel so good when compare to other hostels, In this hostel they provide only rooms without food. But they provide good furniture as like fridge , washing machine, TV, inventor as well as AC.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:18.779919', 5, 860, 4),
(5245, '[HAREESWAR NAGALAPURAM] Good furnished room with hygienic bathroom in affordable prices.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:18.780054', 5, 860, 4),
(5246, '[Antony Chacko] I Stayed here for 2 years. Better than many nearby PGs in terms of facilities and overall experience. The food was good, and the stay was comfortable. Definitely worth staying here for students and working professionals', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:20.169582', 5, 862, 4),
(5247, U&'[Saipavan Veeravalli] Beware of fake reviews!nnLet me share the true colors of this PG:nnThe owner appears welcoming when you are about to join, but that changes afterward. Avoid this place strictly, as the owner\2019s behavior is the worst I have seen\2014constantly arguing with someone about money. The rules are unreasonable and senseless.nnPricing:n- 3-sharing: \20b98,000 + \20b9250 (Electricity) + \20b92,000 (Advance) + \20b9200 (Booking Fee)n- They won\2019t refund the advance amount when you vacate, citing maintenance charges.nnFood:n- The same sambar every day, with no taste and poor hygiene. Portions are also limited.nnRooms u0026 Facilities:n- They claim to clean every two days, but in reality, it happens once every 10 days.n- The washing machine is filthy, making clothes worse after washing.n- No parking available.nnFinal Verdict: Do not consider this PG under any circumstances. Many better options are available nearby.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:20.169866', 1, 862, 4),
(5248, '[RAM DHEV RS] The pg was very comfortable and affordable,nEven the food is also so comfortable, Rajesh anna ( owner ) is expressing more hospitality towards the people and else.It has been More  than 2 months for me here, I''m feeling so comfortable.I believe that most of the people''s can afford this pg, because in and around here I think there is no pg''s with those affordable rates.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:20.170159', 5, 862, 4),
(5249, '[Shriraam M] I FEEL VERY COMFERTABLE WITH THIS PG,nLIKE FOOD , ROOM WHICH ARE GOOD AND IT IS WORTH FOR THE MONEY WHICH I PAID.nAND STAFFS THOSE ARE IN THIS PG ALSO BEING FREINFDLY. AND LAST, THE OWNER OF THE PG IS KIND TO ALL ,WITHOUT SHOWING ANY PARTIALITY WITH ANYONE .nAND ASKING THE NEEDS OFTEN WHICH WE FEEL ANYTHING DISCOMFORT AND SORT IT .nOVER ALL ITS WORTH FOR MONEY ANF SAFE.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:20.170411', 5, 862, 4),
(5250, '[sathish] Worst attitude behavior of owner, he didn''t give back the advance, and food is very below average. Room size is like a tiffin box. Please, no one stay here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:20.170608', 1, 862, 4),
(5251, U&'[SOMASUNDARAM RAJA] Worst PG in Aminjikarai / Nungambakkam. Advance amount is not refunded.nnIf you give them an advance, do not expect it to be returned\2014it feels completely wasted. The food quality is poor, and overall staying in this PG is a bad experience.nnI sincerely request others not to choose this PG. Please read all reviews carefully before deciding to stay here.nnThere are many good PGs available within 100 meters nearby. Please explore those options and avoid this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:20.170767', 1, 862, 4),
(5252, '[Alagiri V] I love the location of Veera''s! Everything I need is nearby. The PG also has great facilities like good Wi-Fi and safe security.with nice rooms and tasty food and nice behaviour staff''s are here', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:20.170911', 5, 862, 4),
(5253, U&'[Navaneeth reddy Kommera] It''s is worst pg I never see this like hostels, it''s don''t human being hostel, it''s dog hostel a dog is sleeping in bed (I never see this kinded responsible people in this world) owner are so responsible people worst food, worst maintenance, taking penalty, taking advance, owner is drunker very time very very worst pg no cleaning maintenance, master is so responsible guy this people mentally money minded people hostel fee also too heavy very very bad thing is agreement in hostel minimum 3 months very bad agreement  so please guys don''t waste your''s money and recently I vacated hostel he don''t given my advance (2000) fee (8250) hostel fee and finally it''s not for bachelor''s, it''s for married dogs or bachelor''s dog, for family friends dognIt''s worst pg I never see in my life \0bb2\0b9e\0bcd\0b9a\0bbe \0b95\0bca\0b9f\0bc1\0b95\0bcd\0b95\0bc1 so guys don''t go to this pg hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:20.171108', 1, 862, 4);               
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5254, '[Prasanthini A] Phoenix Ladies Hostel is a great place to stay. The food is good and homely, the rooms are clean, and the hostel is safe and well-maintained. The management is friendly and helpful. Its location is very convenient, especially for students of SRM and  Easwari Engineering College and nearby colleges. Overall, it''s a comfortable and reliable hostel, and I would definitely recommend it.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:21.189602', 5, 863, 4),
(5255, '[Monisha] I had a great experience staying at Phoenix Women''s Hostel. The hostel is clean, well-maintained, and provides a comfortable environment for students and working women.nnOne of the best aspects is the food. The menu is varied, and the meals are served fresh with good taste. They provide a balanced menu with different dishes throughout the week, so it doesn''t become repetitive.nnThe safety measures are also excellent. The hostel has secure entry, CCTV surveillance, and supportive management, making it a safe place to stay. They are friendly, responsive, and always ready to help.nnOverall, I highly recommend Phoenix Women''s Hostel to anyone looking for a safe, hygienic, and comfortable place with good food and a peaceful atmosphere.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:21.189737', 5, 863, 4),
(5256, U&'[Elambirai S] As they say, \201cFirst impressions are the best,\201d and for me, my first hostel experience at Phoenix Hostel has truly been the best. I don\2019t know whether I would have had the same kind of experience in any other hostel, but I\2019m really happy that I got it here.nnCompared to many other hostels, the food here is definitely worth the money we pay. They don\2019t stick to the same menu every day; instead, they keep changing and improving it, which shows how much effort they put into satisfying the hostellers. The care and dedication of the hostel owner can clearly be seen through all these thoughtful efforts.nnAfter home, Phoenix Hostel is the place in Chennai that made me feel most comfortable and at home. Thank you so much for that, ma\2019am. Keep rocking! \+01f525', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:21.189859', 5, 863, 4),
(5257, U&'[Yogavathi Rajkumar] Such a perfect example of how a good hostel should be! The common room was incredibly cozy, making it so easy to meet other solo travelers. The staff even organized a family-style dinner, and the vibe was super welcoming without being a loud party hostel.\201dnnAs a solo female traveler, I felt completely safe here. The 24/7 front desk, secure in-room lockers, and keycard access to the dorms gave me peace of mind. Great value for the price if you don''t mind sharing a room.\201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:21.189974', 5, 863, 4),
(5258, '[Muthu sneka] I stayed at this hotel for about a month and had a very comfortable experience. The food was excellent and consistently delicious. One of the best things was the availability of 24/7 hot water, which made the stay very convenient.nThe rooms were cleaned daily and maintained very neatly. The environment is very safe and secure, which made me feel comfortable throughout my stay.nSuganya ma''am was extremely supportive and kind. She even helped during emergencies when I wasn''t feeling well, which I truly appreciate. I would definitely recommend this place to anyone looking for a safe, clean, and comfortable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:21.190099', 5, 863, 4),
(5259, '[sanya Malhotra] Absolutely worst hostel ever... I''d give negative reviews if possible me and my friend stayed in this pg cz it was close to college but that is the only good thing rest everything is very bad. I was always so frustrated because of this.The owner Suganya is the most rude person ever she doesn''t care about anyone but herself and if you tell her there is a problem she''ll only blame you and won''t even listen to you very worse behaviour and she always behaves like the students r animals and she says whatever she wants..nNow coming to food ..Very average food and there''s no change in menu  at all and even then if ur hungry after college or work and want some extra food again the staff and owner will disrespect you behave badly with you very bad attitude.. and Pongal time 4 to 5 days hostel closed and they won''t let you stay in the hostel at all if you can''t go to ur hometown.nIt is not worth it at all better stay at some other pg peacefully than tolerate this shitty behaviour', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:21.190217', 1, 863, 4);          
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5260, U&'[Shakthisri Packianathan] My 3 years at Phoenix PG have been an incredible journey. From tough times to pure joy, this place has been so comfortable and sophisticated.nnThe food quality and taste are honestly the best\2014huge thanks to the cooks! Special thanks to Suganya Mam and to the wardens for keeping the environment so clean.nnI\2019m leaving with a heart full of great memories. Highly recommended! \+01f3e0\2728', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:21.190329', 5, 863, 4),
(5261, '[Avanthika B M] Stayed in this PG for about 3 years and had a very comfortable experience. The location is very convenient, with all essential amenities nearby, which made daily life easy. The cleanliness was consistently well maintained, and the food was also good and homely. Overall, it was a safe, pleasant, and comfortable place to stay. Highly recommended!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:21.190441', 5, 863, 4),
(5262, '[Angala parameshwari] I stayed here for about 8 months and it felt like home. The rent is affordable, the food is good, and the place is very clean. The owner aunty is easy to contact and always ready to help.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:21.826682', 5, 864, 4),
(5263, '[Shri Sarathi] Best hostel with good food,very secured place. They will really take care about health and hygiene of students.Nice location with good environment', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:21.826819', 5, 864, 4),
(5264, '[Karunya Kannadasan] Food is good. Rooms are okay. Rent is fine. Friendly people. Problem is the common toilets. Inmates complained of candidal infection and urinary tract infections which is more very common with the use of one common toilet for almost 10 to 12 inmates. Honest opinion, this place would be a better hostel with extra toilets and sanitation check.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:21.82701', 2, 864, 4),
(5265, '[Sravya Akula] Me and my friend stayed here for 6 days. The food was tasty, quality is good, quantity is also ample, lunch is ready in the morning so PPL can pack their lunch as well. Overall food department is excellent.nnBUT,nnThere is absolutely no ventilation in the house or rooms. It is next to impossible to breathe and sleep in suffocation and sweat.nnThere are all sorts of insects, rodents and others- mosquitos, bed bugs, lizards, rats. Seems like the residents are habituated to this.nnThe beds are mostly bunker beds. The upper is too high and the fan is too close. One might hurt themselves if they stretch their body on the bed. The lower is tucked below and there is no air flow at all.nnHIGHLIGHT: My friend suddenly started getting pain and inflammation in the ear. Since the pain wasn''t bearable, we visited the ENT and they found 2 bed bugs. Luckily for her, they were dead and so no damage was done to the eardrum.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:21.827128', 3, 864, 4),
(5266, '[Viji Lakshmi] Safe and hygienic place. Best hostel I ever stayed. Food is prepared in front of us. Surrounded by beautiful environment. Equiped with 24/7 surveillance cameras and security guard always guards hostel. Water and power supply are also provided 24/7. Overall a home like place for working and college going women.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:21.827246', 5, 864, 4),
(5267, U&'[StallaSaraGeorge] Students please read this\+01f440\+01f64cnI''ve been in this naalanda hostel for 2years. Now finally I got the courage to vacate. Food is not even good. I got food poison many times and even admitted in hospitals many times. And I lost many of my costly things.. Somebody stolen\+01f611When you compliant they don''t even care. They''ll say they''ll check in cctv but they wont. \+01f612 And especially if you are a student they''ll take advantage. And also you won''t get a peaceful atmosphere to study.. I was struggling for a long. And never trust these positive reviews. Because that owner lady will ask every inmates to put 5 star and positive review.. She even asked me also and  i too gave 5 star at the first.. But I''m reducing it into 1 now because of my bad experience \+01f64c this is a genuine review from my side\+01f4af', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:21.827553', 1, 864, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5268, U&'[breena Aruldhas] Thank you for a very relaxed stay, I felt very comfortable at the hostel and felt very secure. The room was clean and warm, the facilities were kept to a high cleanliness standard. I\2019ve had a good time there! Nothing bad to say about this hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:21.82774', 5, 864, 4),
(5269, '[Geethanjali Karthikeyan] Completely a home away from home ambience. Stayed for 2 years and felt very safe during the stay. Clean rooms/restrooms and tasty food. Definitely the best hostel I stayed in.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:21.827937', 5, 864, 4),
(5270, '[Kokila Arulselvam] Clean and hygienic well maintained rooms .Healthy veg and nonveg foods.good wifi and washing machine facilities. Very near to metro and easy accessibility of public transportation And Naan mudhalvan study hall.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:22.350696', 5, 865, 4),
(5271, U&'[Praveena Sivakumar] Good safety with biometric.and secured privacy cots and providing individual fan .Cost efficient and affordable.Friedly warden ,manager,owner Anna''s \2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:22.350882', 5, 865, 4),
(5272, '[Neha R] Good and Neat rooms.Good environment to study.i like it very much .Compared to other hostels it''s  better .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:22.351124', 5, 865, 4),
(5273, '[Nowfi Parve] My friends staying right now in rich hut hostel. They are suffering a lot through bed bugs . And still hostel owners didn''t take any action. Worst hostel to stay in anna nagar', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:22.35136', 1, 865, 4),
(5274, '[Harini Sankar] If possible i will give 0 start, Worst hostel in Anna Nagar East. Never Go to this hostel. Owner is Rude. Owners are money minded and running behind money only. They will give the Cot to others when one person leaves two days for hometown. They will share vacancy and ask the person who is staying to leave without the month or rent paid ends.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:22.351572', 1, 865, 4),
(5275, '[SmileBuilds AnEmpire] This girls'' hostel is a game-changer! Clean rooms, tasty food, and staff who genuinely care. I feel right at home here. Perfect blend of independence and support. Highly recommend for students or working girls!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:22.351768', 5, 865, 4),
(5276, '[Kathir 1999] Im posting this from another ID fearing that they may force me to vacate.nThey act cheap, they save money by providing you less nutrient food... Their food is all carbohydrates and fats, you''ll get only very less amount of nutrition from their food...nI was literally shocked to see the size of the food they provide, the Pinky finger sized fish piece, paper thin omlette, gravy without vegetables...nMany girls became anemic and nutrient deficient including me, now I''m consuming Iron and multivitamin tablets to regain my health, each and every girl is facing hair loss caused by nutrient deficiency...nWe have complained multiple times, the owner and manager, both being grown men doesn''t understand how nutrition is important especially for young Girls and they can easily become Anemic if not provided...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:22.352031', 1, 865, 4),
(5277, '[Aparna 0113] Rich hut girls hostel is a safe,  and comfortable stay.Staffs were very friendly and kind .Seriously it is a best hostel for working women and students, peaceful atmosphere.Hygynic and homemade food is providing. To be simple, you will feel like staying in your home not hostel .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:22.352167', 5, 865, 4),
(5278, '[Iswarya] I have stayed in thaai women''s hostel for only a short period but the foods are very good. They clean every rooms and bathrooms everyday.the service is very good. They also provide wifi with good strength. The safety is also very good. It is very near to bus stop and the railway station is also in walkable distance only. You won''t get any traffic noices here, the area is very peaceful. There is also a park nearby where you can go for walking daily. There are plenty of shops nearby to where you can buy groceries you want. All the staffs working here are very friendly', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:23.291379', 5, 866, 4);        
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5279, '[Nivedhitha Karthikeyan] I stayed here for two years. Everything was good here! The food was good, Cleaning will be done everyday. The area is safe and maintained good. There is good wifi facility. All staff are so good and friendly, everything is well maintained and no issues. There is even a study area which is accessible 24*7. There is bus stop in walkable distance.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:23.291594', 5, 866, 4),
(5280, '[Gheny Sheerah] I''ve stayed here for one months. I really liked the hostel very much. The food they provided and the maintanence of the hostel was really good and they will clean the rooms daily without failure. The staffs in the hostel was really approachable and friendly. I highly recommend this hostel to everyone who wants to stay in a decent hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:23.291872', 5, 866, 4),
(5281, '[Divya Thirupathi] I have stayed here for 6 months . Everyday cleaning. the food is very good and food feels like a home. The safety is also very good. Wifi connection is available for 24/7. Washing machine is also here .Overall good for this pg for working women''s and students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:23.292087', 5, 866, 4),
(5282, '[Susi Srinivasan] I have stayed here for 2 years and it was awesome place for stay.nnFood was also good.nnThey maintain the hostel very well, daily cleaning bathroom and rooms.nnAll amenities are maintained well,24/7 wifi facility.Its safe in and outside the hostel.nnStaffs are very friendly.nnSave for women who work/study, they even have study area.nnAny problem raised are addressed immediately..', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:23.292221', 5, 866, 4),
(5283, '[NEELA NATARAJAN] I stayed at Thaai Hostel and had a very good experience. The food is good, and the bathrooms and rooms are cleaned daily. The dining area is well-maintained and clean. The hostel feels safe and secure, and it also has a dedicated study hall, which is very useful. The maintenance is excellent, and the staff are friendly and approachable. The location is convenient, with a bus stop nearby. The Wi-Fi connection is also good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:23.292346', 5, 866, 4),
(5284, '[Amsavalli Ramakrishnan] Had a good experience staying at this PG. The rooms are comfortable and the place is well maintained. The food and basic facilities are good, and the atmosphere is peaceful.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:23.292512', 5, 866, 4),
(5285, '[Subiksha Mylsamy] I stayed here for almost four years and this place was one of the best of other hostels and PGs out there in the city. Rooms and toilets were cleaned everyday and the food was good too. We had WiFi facilities for each floor and the staff here were also very friendly.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:23.292623', 5, 866, 4),
(5286, '[BLESSY DAVID] In my personal experience this pg is good for food and accomodation. The maintenance is also good. The food is feel like homely food. Surroundings is neat and clean. I feel like my home. The warden and the people were working here is friendly. This is the best hostel for staying. Thank you for warden and all people working here.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:24.513084', 5, 868, 4),
(5287, '[Rajeswari] Today Tamil new year''s special Dinner in our hostel menu they gave us idly l,sambar,vada and payasam.It remember''s our home food.The taste of all the dishes very nice to eat.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:24.513241', 5, 868, 4),
(5288, '[Gokila Alagarsamy] I stayed here for one year.nHostel room and toilet Cleanness good .nFood feel like home food.nI feel like my second Home.nFor me its not hostel its my second home in Chennai.nThanks owner  Shalini akka u0026 anna.nThanks to all hostel watchman , master and all entire team.nThanks once again .', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:24.513366', 5, 868, 4),
(5289, '[Mani Guruvaiya] Good food good room services best room clean safety and security  stafs are like family members', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:24.513485', 5, 868, 4),
(5290, U&'[Srimathi S] Today our hostel celebrated Women\2019s Day. We had cake cutting and the decorations were very nice. They also prepared a special dinner. It is the best hostel. \+01f60a', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:24.513606', 5, 868, 4);  
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5291, U&'[___mumu. ______] The PG''s name is only the best inside, but the food is very overpriced and not good. They do not clean properly, and everyone thinks the food is better than it actually is. They charge a lot of money, and it is not worth it. Please don\2019t trust this PG.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:24.513718', 1, 868, 4),
(5292, '[PRIYA SAKTHIVEL] One of the best hostel in Velachery really food is very good management is very good', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:24.513831', 5, 868, 4),
(5293, U&'[Joshe Snegha] I had a wonderful experience in staying at this PG for the Past 6 Months. The rooms are clean and spacious providing a comfortable and homely environment. The food is hygienic and tasty, making it feel me like home. The management is friendly and always ready to assist with any concerns. Overall, this PG offers a safe and peaceful stay, making it a great choice for students and working professionals. Highly recommended...\263a\fe0f\263a\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:24.513938', 5, 868, 4),
(5294, U&'[Gunasheela] I had stayed here for 3.5 years.Good hostel room with all the facilities. The room was clean and comfortable, and the management is helpful. Suitable for students u0026 working women . Worth the price \+01f44d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:29.73127', 5, 874, 4),
(5295, U&'[Ambika Rajendran] The place which felt like home \+01f3e1. Food is very much good and tasty in this hostel. Owner auntie will resolve issues as soon as possible. once compain raised. And all the amenities and facilities provided in this hostel very much useful. Very best hostel to stay for working professionals as well as students. \+01f917\2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:29.731459', 5, 874, 4),
(5296, '[Sriabirami Lk] Home away from home is what athithi has been to me. This Feb 2026 will mark my 4th year here. The food here has been very nice and they ensure that the hostel is kept clean and tidy. They resolve all our problems and issues. The management and the cook aunties have been kind and welcoming to me from day one. From my college days to my office life , athithi has been nothing short of a special place to me.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:29.731607', 5, 874, 4),
(5297, '[Deepshika Chettri] I stayed here for 9 months and never faced any problems. It truly felt like home. The rooms and kitchen are clean, the food is good and hygienic, and the people here are very helpful and supportive. Overall, it was a comfortable and pleasant stay, and I would definitely recommend this hostel.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:29.731963', 5, 874, 4),
(5298, '[Monisha Shambhavi Ramachandran] Dear Mam,nnI hope this message finds you well. I wanted to take a moment to express my feedback regarding my two-year stay at this hostel. Overall, my experience has been largely positive, and I am grateful for the opportunity to have lived in your facility.nnHere are some highlights of my feedback:nn1.  The accommodation provided was comfortable and well-maintained throughout my stay. The facilities, including laundry, common areas were always clean and accessible, contributing significantly to a pleasant living environment.nn2. I always felt safe and secure. The security measures in place were reassuring and effective.nn3. The management team and staff were consistently courteous, professional, and responsive to any issues or queries that arose. Their prompt assistance and friendly demeanor were greatly appreciated.n4.  The atmosphere fostered a friendly and inclusive environment, making it easy to socialize and interact with fellow residents.nn5. The hostel''s location was convenient, with easy access to metro and bus stand, which was advantageous for both daily activities and commuting.nnWhile my overall experience was positive, there were occasional minor issues such as Gate timings and sudden Power cuts. Addressing these could further enhance the experience for future residents.nnThank you once again for providing such a welcoming environment.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:29.732232', 5, 874, 4);           
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5299, '[Krithika Rayar] Being 3 years in this hostel over all experience is good, food and ambience is also good... Easy access to both cmbt and anna nagar area also u can find metro by walk....', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:29.732418', 5, 874, 4),
(5300, '[Varsha Kanuga] I stayed here for the past two years. Great hostel experience! Friendly staff, clean rooms, and convenient location. Enjoyed the vibrant atmosphere. Delicious hostel food. Fresh ingredients and flavorful dishes served with care. Highly recommend for a comfortable and memorable stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:29.732575', 5, 874, 4),
(5301, '[Sumoinirj sd] It is the best hostel in Chennai for girls. Everything is well maintained. Food is served with the absolute care and taste. I would recommend this hostel to everyone who wants to be in a good place.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:29.732734', 5, 874, 4),
(5302, '[ganesh raina] Very good and neat hostel... It''s very safe and comfortable for girls to stay. Since I was in the same street for many years I never heard bad review about this hostel...so if you are working near anna nagar or studying this is the best place for you to stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:30.272243', 5, 875, 4),
(5303, '[N.Yogibhuvan] My Sister in the hostel the place was very safe and roomsnFood is really fabulous specially Sunday non veg gave here a home food experience.nGood  place for ladies how work  away from and even for students.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:30.27239', 5, 875, 4),
(5304, '[Santhosh Kumar] Way of approach from the hostel is very good and caring. Good comparing to other hoster in aminjikarai', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:30.272514', 5, 875, 4),
(5305, '[M. Pradeep] Good food.safe and secure place for working women''s with add on aminities.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:30.272626', 5, 875, 4),
(5306, '[Kalaiyarasi P] I was staying at sathya ladies hostel. Really a good experience at affordable low budget with hygienic rooms with good food.wifi  and parking facilities near anna arch with all mode of transport. I felt like being at home. Good place for office goers.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:30.272799', 5, 875, 4),
(5307, '[Allirani AP] Our stay at Satya ladies hostal was really fantastic they are maintaing a cleaning environment and homely food at lowest price', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:30.272985', 5, 875, 4),
(5308, '[Anandhi S] Very hygienic place with home food  with added facilities.Free wifi parking and washing machine at a cheap cost.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:30.273235', 5, 875, 4),
(5309, '[Perarasu Appu] This Hostel Is very Good Food Is Okay Room is Very Nice', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:30.273357', 5, 875, 4),
(5310, '[DIVYA A,Msc2023 Vel Tech, Chennai] I stayed at Classic Ladies Hostel, Vadapalani, for 8 months. It was a good experience. The food was tasty, and the aunty who prepared and served the food was very kind and caring. The hostel owner was also friendly and supportive. I would recommend this hostel to others.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:30.577895', 3, 876, 4),
(5311, '[HARINI. I] I stayed at Classik Ladies Hostel in Vadapalani for 4 yearsnand my experience was generally good. The hostel is located in a convenient area near bus stops, shops, and hospitals, which makes traveling easy. The rooms are simple and fairly clean, and the hostel provides basic facilities like food, Wi-Fi, and security for women. It is a suitable place for students and working women who need affordable accommodation in Chennai. Overall, it is a decent and safe place to stay in the Vadapalani area.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:30.578152', 5, 876, 4),
(5312, '[Pavatharini Nagaraj] I felt comfortable and safe environment. Rooms are clean, and the management is supportive. Overall, a good place to stay and focus on studies.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:30.578325', 4, 876, 4),
(5313, '[Swa Lakshmi] Spending 3 years here was a beautiful journey. This hostel gave me comfort, safety, and unforgettable memories. Grateful for the care and support throughout my stay', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:30.578577', 5, 876, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5314, '[Mamatha Mamarha] I stayed here for 18 months I feel more safe in this hostel and food is very good and tasty. Daily cleaning will done and the hostel is very budget friendly', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:30.57901', 4, 876, 4),
(5315, U&'[Dhanashree] I had a very good experience staying at Classic Ladies Hostel in Vadapalani. The rooms were clean and well-maintained, and the environment felt safe and comfortable. The staff were friendly and helpful, and the location was convenient for daily travel. Overall, it\2019s a great place for students looking for a peaceful and secure stay. Highly recommended! I didn''t even informed her 1 month prior about vacating the hostel but they even gave me the advance payment return. Thank you....', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:30.579242', 5, 876, 4),
(5316, '[Narmatha S] I stayed in the hostel for two years, and my experience has been very good. The food provided was always good, and the hostel environment felt very safe throughout my stay.nnFor vacating, I informed to the warden before  one day and she processed and refunded my advance amount without any issues.nnI sincerely appreciate her support and cooperation.nnThank you for providing a comfortable and secure place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:30.579596', 5, 876, 4),
(5317, '[Sharulatha Renganathan] I m stay in hostel one month.peacefull area and comfortable staying.safety u0026 food is good . Clean and secure maintenance in hostel', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:30.579757', 5, 876, 4),
(5318, '[gayu Kalai] While I stayed 2 months in this hostel I felt that this is one of the worst hostel I stayed... Here that incharge Pavithra very rude person she behaves like she owns that building and behave very rude... If she doesn''t like somebody in that hostel she will target them and manipulate to vacate... Not only she talk rude with tenants also with parents/siblings also...While I joined that hostel, one month stay Koda complete agala but that Pavithra asked to pay the rent... 30 days mudiyalanu qns panathuku her ego clashes and target me... Seriously... Neriya per more than 4 to 5 days pay panama irukanga avangala target panama regular ah pay panravangalayum antha lady purpose ah target pani vacate pana vachiruvanga... Also to say About that hostel inner presence hostel kula rat tholla, ac la fire varuthu, 14 sharing ac room la 2 ac irundhum one ac damaged no ceiling fan but they insist us to pay eb also... Food very worst, pordrathu veg food athum rice vegama irukathu morning ay food ketu porathu... Bathroom cleaning aunty Ilana bathroom clean pana koda all ila... That incharge Pavithra won''t take care of anything we complaint... She just act like she cares but never... So girls if you''re looking for a hostel to stay peacefully then this hostel is not yours... Don''t ever come to this hostel... Inga potruka positive reviews elame avanga academy students vachu potrukathu all fake hostel fake management and hostel tenants kula no transparency..Inga iruka yarukum owner yarunu Koda theriyathu... Please be aware... That scum girl Pavithra''s words will ruin your mental peace,she doesn''t deserve to be a incharge may be if they change that incharge Pavithra that hostel will be good...they also prefer only their academy students outsider irundha they don''t give a shit...', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:31.274265', 1, 877, 4),
(5319, U&'[Santhiya Ramesh] Very disappointing experience. The rooms were not clean, the bathrooms were poorly maintained, and the food quality was below average. The staff were unhelpful and slow to respond to complaints. Basic facilities like Wi-Fi and water supply were unreliable. Overall, the hostel did not meet expectations, and I would not recommend stayingnDo you want depression and health issues? Then go buy from Lucky Hostel.nnIt\2019s only ''Lucky'' by name \2014 for us it\2019s completely unlucky. Total waste of money.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:31.274576', 1, 877, 4),
(5320, U&'[Jala devi] Worst hostel. The management is the worst. No accountability on issues to be solved . The food is the worst thing ever! Atleast 1 out of three meals get spoiled and unfit to eat. Sometimes there is worms. So unhygienic. Rooms are unhygienic too.Wi-fi doesn\2019t work after 20th date of every month but they will ask your rent money in the middle(before) the month. They don\2019t use money they receive for betterment of the issues and the girls living there but they use it for commercialisation of the place. They will ask you to vacate if you complain anything about management . They will target people who will complain.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:31.274982', 1, 877, 4);      
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5321, U&'[Sathish Mike] Very disappointing experience at this women\2019s PG hostel. There is no proper Wi-Fi, which makes it difficult for students and working professionals to study or work. The food quality and facilities are also not up to the standard expected for the amount paid. Overall, the management needs to improve the basic amenities and provide better service. I would not recommend this PG unless these issues are addressed.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:31.275291', 1, 877, 4),
(5322, U&'[keerthana .M] The hostel is not good. The rent is very high \20b97,500 per month for a 10-sharing room They reduced only \20b91,000, without food. which is not a significant difference. There is also no privacy.nThe restrooms are not cleaned properly, and instead of solving the issues, the management keeps blaming the roommates. The Wi-Fi works only for about 15\201320 days each month, and for the remaining days, it is unavailable. Overall, the cleaning and maintenance are poor.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:31.275624', 1, 877, 4),
(5323, '[Karthikeyan Mechanical] Very, very worst PG in Ashok Nagar. My sister stayed in this PG for 3 months. The rooms were not clean, the bathrooms were very unhygienic, and the food quality was very poor. I would not recommend this PG to any girls.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:31.275981', 1, 877, 4),
(5324, '[KALAIMOZHI Kuppuraj] I had a really good experience staying at this hostel. The rooms were clean, well-maintained, and comfortable, making it easy to focus on studies and rest properly. The staff was friendly, supportive, and always ready to help with any issues. The hostel also felt safe and secure, which gave me peace of mind.nThe food provided was hygienic and tasty, with a good variety every day. The common areas were well-kept, and facilities like Wi-Fi, study spaces, and laundry services were convenient and reliable. I also appreciated the disciplined yet homely environment, which balanced freedom and responsibility perfectly.nOverall, the hostel provided a positive atmosphere for both study and relaxation, and I would highly recommend it to anyone looking for a comfortable and safe place to stay.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:31.276289', 5, 877, 4),
(5325, '[Sabarish Velu] My cousin stayed at lucky girls hostel . Good food taste like home food. Good ambience. Bathroom and room everyday cleaning. CCTV cameras there, safety around the hostel . Would definitely recommend anyone to stay here. Overall experience is good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:31.276476', 5, 877, 4),
(5326, U&'[priyatharshini shanmuganandam] \2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50\2b50nnHad a really good experience staying here! The hostel is clean, safe and well-maintained. The rooms are comfortable,nnThe atmosphere is peaceful and comfortable, which makes it a great choice for working women and students. Overall, I felt safe and comfortable throughout my stay.\2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:33.234279', 5, 879, 4),
(5327, U&'[Meghana Ganesh] I stayed at this ladies'' hostel in Chennai for a short period, and I must say it was one of the best PG accommodations I\2019ve experienced. The place was exceptionally clean, well-maintained, and felt very safe throughout my stay.nnThe management follows strict rules, which I personally appreciated as they contribute to the overall safety and discipline of the hostel. It gave me a lot of peace of mind.nnAlthough it is a bit on the expensive side, the quality of stay, cleanliness, and security make it completely worth it. I had a very comfortable, safe, and happy stay here, and I would definitely recommend it to others looking for a reliable place in Chennai.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:33.234421', 5, 879, 4),
(5328, U&'[Ranjitha] I had a truly comfortable experience at Pleasant Stay! The location is in a prime spot, making everything easily accessible. What I loved the most was the peaceful environment fewer people, which meant more care and personal attention from the lovely aunty and uncle who manage the place. The rooms are spacious and clean, offering a homely vibe. The food was also a big plus, provided through Karaikudi mess and other catering . tasty and satisfying! Definitely a great choice for anyone looking for a calm, caring, and cozy place to stay. Good ventilation at rooms with AC and surrounded with trees gives the feel good stay . Any queries raised to caretakers will be acknowledged immediately. Hospital emergency protocol is maintained which is a plus for individuals who wants medical help though they are away from home .  IAS academy like shankar , aram , etc are near to the hostel which is walkable and thirumangalam metro is just 850 m away from hostel . Sundaram foundation hospital is 950m away from the hostel . Being the residential area there is no unwanted moment of people which ensures security. There is also cooking facility available to cook on our own with induction also so this avoid compulsory buying of mess food . Everything here is curated according to our flexibility at affordable cost for the prime area in chennai. People who stay here are friendly I have really got good roommates \2764\fe0f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:33.234549', 5, 879, 4);         
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5329, U&'[Sangeetha Satheesh] This is hands down the best ladies'' hostel I''ve stayed in! The owners are incredibly kind and professional, making the environment feel safe and welcoming. The hygiene is top-notch; every room and common area is kept impressively neat and tidy. It\2019s a comfortable, well-managed place I highly recommend.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:33.234666', 5, 879, 4),
(5330, U&'[Sathya M] The pleasant stay hostel is like home away from home and the management is incredibly warm and welcoming and the facilities which are provided by them are excellent  and my stay was almost 2years which was very comfortable and safe which has a security measures like cctv .I highly recommend this place for working women and students. They have laundry facilities and common kitchen and also a speedy wifi connection .I thank aunty and uncle for being more kind and responsive all the time. And the management follows a medical emergency protocals which will very useful for the people who are away from their home .Been in this pg is a good choice of mine and I didn''t face problem as much.overall it''s an excellent choice for the women who are seeking a safe and homely accomodation \+01f90d\2728', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:33.234781', 5, 879, 4),
(5331, U&'[Hari Deepika] I\2019ve had a wonderful experience staying at this women\2019s PG. The PG is located in a peaceful, clean, and beautiful area, making it ideal for students and working professionals who want a calm environment.nnThe management maintains excellent security and discipline, which is very reassuring since this is a women\2019s PG. There is 24/7 security, CCTV surveillance, and strict entry protocols, ensuring complete safety.nnThe rooms are well-maintained, spacious, and hygienic. Housekeeping is regular, and all basic facilities like Wi-Fi, hot water, washing machines, and drinking water are provided. The common areas are clean and comfortable, perfect for studying or relaxing.nnThe staff is friendly and cooperative, and any issues are resolved quickly.nnOverall, this PG offers a perfect combination of comfort, safety, cleanliness, and a peaceful atmosphere. Highly recommended for anyone looking for a secure and homely women\2019s PG in this area!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:33.234904', 5, 879, 4),
(5332, U&'[lathika lingesan] \201cThe hostel provides a very peaceful and comfortable environment. The rooms are clean and well-maintained, and the overall atmosphere is calm and safe. The  facilities are good for both studying and relaxing. It feels like a homely place to stay. Overall, I had a good experience here.\201d', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:33.235017', 5, 879, 4),
(5333, '[Brainy Abraham] The PG is extremely good in every way. They take care of each and every aspect of the PG, ensuring that people staying there are comfortable and safe. After a lot of searching, I found this PG to be completely safe and good.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:33.235129', 5, 879, 4),
(5334, '[Midhunaa] The worst pg that i have ever come across, extremely bad management, they had the audacity to rent my bed to another person when i was in my native for just a week and say that this is normal and that it happens in all the PGs.nVery bad food too. They ring a bell when it''s time for food, and the food they bring is never enough (it is basic common sense to cook enough for everyone in the hostel when someone collects money for the same and promises to feed them 3 times a day). Treating people like criminals in jail. Stayed there just for 5 days and had only 3 meals( not 3 days only 3 meals) that too had to call them and asked them to bring food again where they made me wait for more than a hour and then brought food. Promised that we can use the washing machine anyday but once we got it, they said it can be used only on Wednesday, Friday and Sunday. No proper warden, 0 safety.nWarden if present uses a lot of bad and uncultured words to address the people staying there.nNo sufficient water, even if the motor is turned on, it takes more than 1.5 hrs to get any water flow in the taps. Since there is no proper warden, turning the motor on itself takes half an hour to 45 minutes.nExtremely bad experience. A time that i or my family will never forget!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:33.833463', 1, 880, 4);
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5335, U&'[K.Chandra Lakshmi] \201cA good PG for students. The rooms are neat and the atmosphere is calm which is helpful for studying. Food and basic facilities are good. The management is responsive and maintains the place well. Overall a comfortable and safe place to stay.\201dKamatchi warden is friendly and approachable and she takes good care of us. She makes sure the hostel environment is safe and comfortable for everyone.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:33.833852', 5, 880, 4),
(5336, U&'[Leena] NOT AT ALL RECOMMENDED!!!!! \+01f6d1\+01f6d1\+01f6d1 Worst worsttttt Hostel!!! The wardens here are very irresponsible and rude! There are sooo many issues with food, water, electricity and so much more.. The warden would even give our bed to another person when we go to our hometown.. But when we complain about those to the wardens, the wardens would call us arrogant and has the audacity to call our parents WHEN they haven\2019t provided us anyyyy basic necessity properly!! The entire management is filled with irresponsible people.. Sometimes in certain switches, we get shock because there is some problem with the electric connection in this hostel!! When we go to restroom, most times we won\2019t get water there! Both the femina hostels are like this! Everything is problematic here and nobody would pay heed to our problems! Yaarumey indha hostel varadhinga \+01f64f', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:33.834245', 1, 880, 4),
(5337, U&'[Disha V] WORST hostel ever!!! There are issues with water, food, electricity, laundry and every other basic thing!! People fight to get food here because they don\2019t bring enough food for all the residents here! The warden and the management is completely IRRESPONSIBLE, they would take hours to sort out one minor issue, and most times they wouldn\2019t even be available to state the issues we have! Absolutely not recommended! Both the femina hostels are bad like this!', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:33.834466', 1, 880, 4),
(5338, '[Chitra Chitra] I have stayed in several PGs for the past 4 years in Chennai. This is the PG I like the most. Cleanliness is their top priority. Good location and nice environment is the added advantage.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:33.834577', 4, 880, 4),
(5339, '[Ashok Vishali] Highly recommended. This hostel offers a very safe and comfortable environment for women the atmosphere is very homely and the management is extremely approachable. A great choice for both students and working professionals.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:33.834682', 4, 880, 4),
(5340, U&'[harshini vijayakumar] The food served in our hostel is hygienic, tasty, and well-balanced. The kitchen staff maintains good cleanliness, and the dining area is neat and comfortable. Meals are prepared on time every day, which helps students follow a regular routine.nnBreakfast usually includes healthy items like idli, dosa, bread, eggs, and fruits. Lunch and dinner consist of rice, chapati, vegetables, dal, curd, and sometimes special dishes. The menu is well-planned and provides proper nutrition for students.nnThe taste of the food is consistently good, and the use of fresh ingredients makes it enjoyable. Special care is taken during festivals and special occasions by serving variety dishes and sweets, which makes dining more exciting.nnThe staff members are polite and responsive to students\2019 feedback. They are always ready to improve the quality of food based on suggestions. The portion size is sufficient, and students rarely feel unsatisfied after meals.nnOverall, the hostel food is healthy, affordable, and satisfying. It plays an important role in maintaining students\2019 health and energy. I am very happy with the quality and service provided.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:33.834968', 5, 880, 4),
(5341, U&'[\043c\03b9\0438\03b9\03c3\0438 \043c\03b9\0438\03b9\03c3\0438] The best ladies hostel I have ever seen.My friend was staying here for  the past few month ago.The hostel food was very taste\+01f924 and super. i Strongly recommend this hostel for new comers.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:33.835083', 4, 880, 4);              
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5342, '[trupti palaskar] Safe and clean ladies hostel in Anna Nagar. Good food, well-maintained rooms, friendly staff, and just 550 meters from Anna Nagar Tower Metro Station. Highly recommended for students and working women.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:35.471458', 5, 881, 4),
(5343, '[Jenifer] Warden lady is very rude. Even trying to contact them about the hostel facility they will talk like they are giving free service to you. It''s giving govt hospital vibe. And the restroom are shared between lot of people. Food is average on a good day. Don''t fall for it guys.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:35.471666', 2, 881, 4),
(5344, '[Anu Ashli] I had a terrible experience at this hostel. The warden was extremely unprofessional and used abusive language toward the students. Furthermore, the room I was given looked nothing like the photos she has sent; it was filthy and unhygienic. Because I arrived late at night, I had no choice but to stay, but I felt completely misled and disrespected. Avoid this place if you value your peace of mind and safety', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:35.471823', 1, 881, 4),
(5345, '[Vinitha B] Felt very bad talking to the contact person..who was rude in responding as if they are providing Free accommodation.. management please understand that your survival is because of good clients', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:35.472094', 2, 881, 4),
(5346, U&'[Azra Rishi] I stayed here for 1 month. The hostel is kept clean and they do provide homemade food, which is a plus. However, there are several drawbacks: frequent Wi-Fi issues, RO water filter that was in poor condition when I moved in, and chlorine water for drinking. Bathrooms are shared with hall residents, which means around 6 people end up using one washroom. The warden is ill-mannered\2014often shouting, entering rooms without knocking, and showing no regard for residents\2019 rest after a long day. The 2-sharing AC room also had a constant drainage smell. Overall, not a comfortable stay despite the cleanliness and food.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:35.472443', 2, 881, 4),
(5347, '[ROSE MARY JAMES] Me and my friend stayed ath this hostel for about 1and 1/2 months. It was a terrible experience. The food is absolutely the worst part. It''s repetitive, tasteless and often spoiled. We had to rely on outside food despite giving high rent. We had given 15k rent per head for a four sharing AC room and the bathroom was common for hall and room. Bathroom was shared by atleast 6 people sometimes 8. There are no amenities provided only a bed and a small shelf for four people which cannot be used by even 3.nnThe place is good and clean and the area is nice. But for this rent and no amenities this is not recommended. They charge electricity bill separately which makes the cost even more unreasonable.nnThe warden is biased. It is better to get your deposit before you leave the hostel.nnWe couldn''t possibly communicate because of obvious language barriers. We were aware of the price I was instructing future residents that for the price you pay there are clearly better hostels available . Freshly cooked meals were not properly cooked. Idlis and dosa were frequently given and it was always undercooked. Sometimes the food were spoiled. If you check with the current residents more than half are ordering from mess.  If you check the cctv camera in the downstairs mess you can clearly see both of us not taking breakfast and lunch multiple days. The issue of shared bathroom, people always used it when we went for work , wether they admit it or not is not our issue.  We only spoke of the truth and  we will adhere to that.nAs I said earlier this is for the awareness of future residents. Please stop calling and messaging me regarding this review. This is the absolute truth.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:35.472741', 1, 881, 4),
(5348, U&'[Visha] Hi this is Visha. I''m from Pondicherry. I had stayed there for four months during my preparation for NET exam preparation and attended classes during weekends... Really it''s a safe place for girls. Food and water facility is considered to be mandatory. Offcourse Yes!!! I got it there. Heathy food like home food and Hygienic water for drinking. Spacious rooms are there. I like the single cot system there. I stayed in a two sharing room. It''s an good experience being there. Indeed it''s good to search few PG''s and come here to see the vast difference which will help you for the better understanding. Choose wise guyzzz... \+01f607and finally thank u for S. S. Ladies Hostel and for the people behind this.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:35.47292', 5, 881, 4);   
INSERT INTO "PUBLIC"."REVIEWS" VALUES
(5349, '[Yasmine sheeba] S.S ladies'' hostel offers a secure and welcoming environment, perfect for students and professionals. The rooms are clean and well-maintained, providing a comfortable living space. The hostel staff is friendly and responsive, ensuring all needs are promptly met. Additional amenities like Wi-Fi, laundry, and a common kitchen add to the convenience. Overall, it''s an excellent choice for women seeking a safe and homely accommodation.', TIMESTAMP '2026-10-03 23:12:35.473075', 5, 881, 4);      
